values
  ('269252597033484057', 'Tell It to the Bees', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Annabel Jankel, Steph Bryant, Jamie Hetherington', 'Jessica Ashworth, Henrietta Ashworth', 'Anna Paquin, Holliday Grainger, Emun Elliott, Steven Robertson, Lauren Lyle, Gregor Selkirk, Kate Dickie, Billy Boyd', 'NR', 'Dr. Jean Markham returns to the town she left as a teenager to take over her late father''s medical practice. When a school-yard scuffle lands Charlie in her surgery, she invites him to visit the hives in her garden and tell his secrets to the bees, as she once did. The new friendship between the boy and the bee keeper brings his mother Lydia into Jean''s world.', 'Dr. Jean Markham returns to the town she left as a teenager to take over her late father''s medical practice. When a school-yard scuffle lands Charlie in her surgery, she invites him to visit the hives in her garden and tell his secrets to the bees, as she once did. The new friendship between the boy and the bee keeper brings his mother Lydia into Jean''s world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Rj6zpHhMU1zFW3v28U4PSRSRgP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475888'),
  ('1090266896735524595', 'Tell It to the Marines', 1926, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'George W. Hill, Ira H. Morgan', 'Richard Schayer', 'Lon Chaney, William Haines, Eleanor Boardman, Eddie Gribbon, Carmel Myers, Warner Oland, Mitchell Lewis, Frank Currier', null, 'U.S. Marine Sergeant O''Hara has his hands full training raw recruits, one of whom, ''Skeets'' Burns, is a particular thorn in his side. If Burns''s lackadaisical approach to the military were not bad enough, he also makes advances on nurse Nora Dale, whom Sergeant O''Hara secretly loves. Nora is oblivious to O''Hara''s feelings and is attracted to the handsome ''Skeet.'' But an indiscretion turns her against him, and it takes an expedition to China and a battle with a warlord''s bandit brigade to sort things out among the nurse and her two Marines.', 'U.S. Marine Sergeant O''Hara has his hands full training raw recruits, one of whom, ''Skeets'' Burns, is a particular thorn in his side. If Burns''s lackadaisical approach to the military were not bad enough, he also makes advances on nurse Nora Dale, whom Sergeant O''Hara secretly loves. Nora is oblivious to O''Hara''s feelings and is attracted to the handsome ''Skeet.'' But an indiscretion turns her against him, and it takes an expedition to China and a battle with a warlord''s bandit brigade to sort things out among the nurse and her two Marines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX8Q8otMiIHGRDETwFLMqZaGVCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111305'),
  ('161741393955268136', 'Tell Me About Love', 2008, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Silvio Muccino, Arnaldo Catinari, Roy Bava', 'Carla Vangelista, Silvio Muccino', 'Silvio Muccino, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Carolina Crescentini, Andrea Renzi, Max Mazzotta, Flavio Parenti, Giorgio Colangeli, Geraldine Chaplin', null, 'Sasha is a 25-year-old orphan who asks Nicole, a married Frenchwoman in her forties, for advice to seduce Benedetta, his long-unrequited love. The two eventually bond over their shared past traumas and pains of love, until...', 'Sasha is a 25-year-old orphan who asks Nicole, a married Frenchwoman in her forties, for advice to seduce Benedetta, his long-unrequited love. The two eventually bond over their shared past traumas and pains of love, until...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3I47Gbll1NSfeAvR4aoLsQU6ue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53955'),
  ('251999474428424279', 'Tell Me About Yourself', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jose Eduardo Cortes Moreno, Julio Llorente', 'Jose Eduardo Cortes Moreno', 'Germán Bracco, Martín Saracho, Arcelia Ramírez, Isidora Vives, Renata Vaca, Julio Bracho, Isabella Argudín, Victor Hugo Villanueva', null, 'Chava, a 17-year-old boy who has a secret admirer, feels more attracted to boys. When leaving his school in a rainy day, Carlos offers him a ride, and so their adventure begins.', 'Chava, a 17-year-old boy who has a secret admirer, feels more attracted to boys. When leaving his school in a rainy day, Carlos offers him a ride, and so their adventure begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BNLHd8oKsy76FzvR9s3E5v8KO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895078'),
  ('1071991734724459099', 'Tell Me How I Die', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'D.J. Viola, David McGrory', 'Rob Warren Thomas, James Hibberd, D.J. Viola', 'Virginia Gardner, Nathan Kress, Kirby Bliss Blanton, Mark Furze, Ryan Higa, Ethan Peck, William Mapother, Mark Rolston', null, 'When a group of college students take part in a clinical drug trial, an unexpected side effect of the experimental medicine gives them terrifying visions of their own deaths...which begin to come true. As they scramble to escape their fate, they discover that the killer is among them and shares their ability to see the future - only he seems to be one step ahead of their efforts to survive.', 'When a group of college students take part in a clinical drug trial, an unexpected side effect of the experimental medicine gives them terrifying visions of their own deaths...which begin to come true. As they scramble to escape their fate, they discover that the killer is among them and shares their ability to see the future - only he seems to be one step ahead of their efforts to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edfgo6pyT1QFjbThLR1HfbNYl3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410876'),
  ('249566050627935998', 'Tell Me Lies', 1968, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Peter Brook, Ian Wilson', 'Michael Kustow, Peter Brook, Dennis Cannan', 'Mark Jones, Robert Langdon Llyod, Pauline Munro, Ursula Mohan, Hugh Armstrong, Peggy Ashcroft, Patrick Wymark, Paul Scofield', null, 'Adapted and directed by Peter Brook from the Royal Shakespeare Company’s ‘production-in-progress US’, this long-unseen agitprop drama-doc – shot in London in 1967 and released only briefly in the UK and New York at the height of the Vietnam War – remains both thought-provoking and disturbing. A theatrical and cinematic social comment on US intervention in Vietnam, Brook’s film also reveals a 1960s London where art, theatre and political protest actively collude and where a young Glenda Jackson and RSC icons such as Peggy Ashcroft and Paul Scofield feature prominently on the front line. Multi-layered scenarios staged by Brook combine with newsreel footage, demonstrations, satirical songs and skits to illustrate the intensity of anti-war opinion within London’s artistic and intellectual community.', 'Adapted and directed by Peter Brook from the Royal Shakespeare Company’s ‘production-in-progress US’, this long-unseen agitprop drama-doc – shot in London in 1967 and released only briefly in the UK and New York at the height of the Vietnam War – remains both thought-provoking and disturbing. A theatrical and cinematic social comment on US intervention in Vietnam, Brook’s film also reveals a 1960s London where art, theatre and political protest actively collude and where a young Glenda Jackson and RSC icons such as Peggy Ashcroft and Paul Scofield feature prominently on the front line. Multi-layered scenarios staged by Brook combine with newsreel footage, demonstrations, satirical songs and skits to illustrate the intensity of anti-war opinion within London’s artistic and intellectual community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txMXsfTgx1lJKRacbkAWHgpxQCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229146'),
  ('991302526112206324', 'Tell Me Softly', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Denis Rovira van Boekholt, Imanol Nabea, Alejandro Gil', 'Jaime Vaca', 'Alícia Falcó, Fernando Lindez, Diego Vidales, Jan Buxaderas, Eve Ryan, Fernando Nagore, Patricia Vico, Celia Freijeiro', null, 'Kamila has everything under control: studies, social life, her image... Everything except the unexpected return of her neighbors, the Di Bianco brothers, after seven years of absence. Thiago stole her first kiss, and Taylor was her best friend, but now their return will turn Kami''s world upside down. Can the three overcome the past that binds them? Or will everything explode into pieces once again?', 'Kamila has everything under control: studies, social life, her image... Everything except the unexpected return of her neighbors, the Di Bianco brothers, after seven years of absence. Thiago stole her first kiss, and Taylor was her best friend, but now their return will turn Kami''s world upside down. Can the three overcome the past that binds them? Or will everything explode into pieces once again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Z37lW0JfLdeFcgH9yaTyg6B9A6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1379963'),
  ('1064282874797836036', 'Tell Me Something', 1999, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Horror', 'Chang Youn-hyun, Kim Sung-bok', null, 'Han Suk-kyu, Shim Eun-ha, Jang Hang-seon, Yu Jun-sang, Yum Jung-ah, Ahn Suk-hwan, Kim Jung-hak, Gil Eun-hye', null, 'Detective Cho, a cop on the edge, is mourning his mother''s recent death while under investigation for graft; on top of that he is suddenly put in charge of a seemingly-impenetrable mystery.', 'Detective Cho, a cop on the edge, is mourning his mother''s recent death while under investigation for graft; on top of that he is suddenly put in charge of a seemingly-impenetrable mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRyGUU4WiK8EOQqeIUvhutITFlr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16371'),
  ('369377239427669909', 'Tell Me That You Love Me, Junie Moon', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Otto Preminger, Boris Kaufman', 'Marjorie Kellogg', 'Liza Minnelli, Robert Moore, Ken Howard, James Coco, Kay Thompson, Fred Williamson, Ben Piazza, Emily Yancy', 'PG', 'The story of three wildly neurotic characters: a facially disfigured girl, a homosexual paraplegic, and an introvert epileptic who, after leaving the hospital, set up housekeeping together in a cottage where they support each other.', 'The story of three wildly neurotic characters: a facially disfigured girl, a homosexual paraplegic, and an introvert epileptic who, after leaving the hospital, set up housekeeping together in a cottage where they support each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8gntXfzQGZtjnAc7cixC2khiw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78355'),
  ('613766863954116354', 'Tell Me What You Want', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lucía Alemany', 'Ivy Hesh, Vivien Dakota, Marina Martín Laguna', 'Gabriela Andrada, Mario Ermito, Celia Freijeiro, David Solans, Alba Ribas, Joel Bosqued, Alicia Bercan, Anna Karinvinge', 'NR', 'After his father''s death, Eric Zimmerman travels to Spain to oversee his company''s branches. In Madrid, he falls for Judith and engage in an intense, erotic relationship full of exploration. However, Eric fears his secret may end their affair.', 'After his father''s death, Eric Zimmerman travels to Spain to oversee his company''s branches. In Madrid, he falls for Judith and engage in an intense, erotic relationship full of exploration. However, Eric fears his secret may end their affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZXYCiZQPB7Ui6D5206W1zDKv8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1252309'),
  ('674009790196904503', 'Tell Me When', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gerardo Gatica', 'Gerardo Gatica', 'Ximena Romo, Jesús Zavala, Verónica Castro, Gabriel Nuncio, Héctor Bonilla, José Carlos Ruiz, Rosa María Bianchi, Juca Viapri', 'NR', 'After his grandfather''s death, a young man decides to fulfill his elder''s last wish with the help of his new friends. The problem starts when he falls in love with a female friend who may not feel the same.', 'After his grandfather''s death, a young man decides to fulfill his elder''s last wish with the help of his new friends. The problem starts when he falls in love with a female friend who may not feel the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XVcNvXQoa0z1QPQOr1Dd0ZHPAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676859'),
  ('278612437716415951', 'Tell Me Who I Am', 2019, 'Documentary, Drama, Mystery', 'Ed Perkins, Erik Wilson, Patrick Smith', null, 'Alex Lewis, Marcus Lewis, Andrew Caley, Kathleen Rainey, Thomas Mulhurn, Luke Mulhurn, Evan Milton, Laura Obiols', null, 'In this documentary, Alex trusts his twin, Marcus, to tell him about his past after he loses his memory. But Marcus is hiding a dark family secret.', 'In this documentary, Alex trusts his twin, Marcus, to tell him about his past after he loses his memory. But Marcus is hiding a dark family secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMfiD7wjdwRxPSdZ7gz7iNO3Z0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627070'),
  ('769943044973635798', 'Tell Me Yes...', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alexandre Arcady', 'Alexandre Arcady, Olivier Dazat, Antoine Lacomblez', 'Jean-Hugues Anglade, Julia Maraval, Patrick Braoudé, Nadia Farès, Valérie Kaprisky, Claude Rich', null, 'Handsome pediatric doctor feels unfulfilled, until his affection for a 12-year-old opens him to a romantic view of the world. When she falls ill, he must get closer to her, and a conflict of interests and ethics arise. His medical reputation is at stake.', 'Handsome pediatric doctor feels unfulfilled, until his affection for a 12-year-old opens him to a romantic view of the world. When she falls ill, he must get closer to her, and a conflict of interests and ethics arise. His medical reputation is at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrnGPW4bDOEbJLIZcphAfHYYQtZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74606'),
  ('1088309413393137483', 'Tell No One', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Guillaume Canet, Christophe Offenstein, Ludovic Bernard', 'Guillaume Canet, Philippe Lefebvre', 'François Cluzet, Marie-Josée Croze, André Dussollier, Kristin Scott Thomas, François Berléand, Nathalie Baye, Jean Rochefort, Guillaume Canet', 'NR', 'A man receives a mysterious email appearing to be from his wife, who was murdered years earlier. As he frantically tries to find out whether she''s alive, he finds himself being implicated in her death.', 'A man receives a mysterious email appearing to be from his wife, who was murdered years earlier. As he frantically tries to find out whether she''s alive, he finds himself being implicated in her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fr2wEeO1H8dzx6EDfzYTRBIvZaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10795'),
  ('691285809016903036', 'Tell No One', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Ivan Silvestrini', 'Roberto Proia', 'Josafat Vagni, Valeria Bilello, Francesco Montanari, Monica Guerritore, Antonino Bruschetta, Jose Dammert, Valentina Correani, Lucia Guzzardi', null, 'Mattia is about to move to Madrid by his boyfriend Eduard. When the day before leaving for Spain, Eduard announces his arrival in Rome to know the "laws", Mattia must choose whether to finally come clean with his companion, or confess to being a formidable liar.', 'Mattia is about to move to Madrid by his boyfriend Eduard. When the day before leaving for Spain, Eduard announces his arrival in Rome to know the "laws", Mattia must choose whether to finally come clean with his companion, or confess to being a formidable liar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4TFpkkfJMDOA5PuWDJ2vFjnS1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157123'),
  ('31604924920857169', 'Tell Them Willie Boy Is Here', 1969, 'Western, Drama', 'Joseph E. Kenney, Ted Swanson, Abraham Polonsky', 'Abraham Polonsky', 'Robert Redford, Katharine Ross, Robert Blake, Susan Clark, Barry Sullivan, John Vernon, Charles Aidman, Charles McGraw', 'PG', 'While confronting the disapproving father of his girlfriend Lola, Native American man Willie Boy kills the man in self-defense, triggering a massive manhunt, led by Deputy Sheriff Christopher Cooper.', 'While confronting the disapproving father of his girlfriend Lola, Native American man Willie Boy kills the man in self-defense, triggering a massive manhunt, led by Deputy Sheriff Christopher Cooper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHgVrkklycUdjKtzGiKgGzwCEnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42619'),
  ('957764213674540776', 'Tell Your Children', 1938, 'Drama', 'Louis J. Gasnier, Jack Greenhalgh', 'Arthur Hoerl', 'Dorothy Short, Kenneth Craig, Lillian Miles, Dave O''Brien, Thelma White, Carleton Young, Warren McCollum, Patricia Royale', 'NR', 'High-school principal Dr. Alfred Carroll relates to an audience of parents that marijuana can have devastating effects on teens: a drug supplier entices several restless teens, Mary and Jimmy Lane, sister and brother, and Bill, Mary''s boyfriend, into frequenting a reefer house. Gradually, Bill and Jimmy are drawn into smoking dope, which affects their family lives.', 'High-school principal Dr. Alfred Carroll relates to an audience of parents that marijuana can have devastating effects on teens: a drug supplier entices several restless teens, Mary and Jimmy Lane, sister and brother, and Bill, Mary''s boyfriend, into frequenting a reefer house. Gradually, Bill and Jimmy are drawn into smoking dope, which affects their family lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LSqwjw6UsrGWPKsJUNxG3VA25a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37833'),
  ('965108816088828506', 'Tell-Tale', 2009, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Cuesta, Ivan J. Fonseca, Adam Weisinger', 'David Callaham', 'Josh Lucas, Lena Headey, Brian Cox, Bea Miller, Dallas Roberts, Ulrich Thomsen, Pablo Schreiber, Jamie Harrold', null, 'A man''s recently transplanted heart leads him on a frantic search to find the donor''s killer before a similar fate befalls him.', 'A man''s recently transplanted heart leads him on a frantic search to find the donor''s killer before a similar fate befalls him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGixr7tkt6Uqj0oRDBqJ6I3RH5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27135'),
  ('232074389909069719', 'Telling Lies in America', 1997, 'Drama', 'Regan Forman, Cynthia Slavens, Dennis Benatar', 'Joe Eszterhas', 'Kevin Bacon, Brad Renfro, Maximilian Schell, Calista Flockhart, Tony Devon, Paul Dooley, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Luke Wilson', null, 'A 17-year-old boy becomes friends with Billy Magic, the radio DJ he idolizes, and eventually slips into the payola and corruption of the entertainment world.', 'A 17-year-old boy becomes friends with Billy Magic, the radio DJ he idolizes, and eventually slips into the payola and corruption of the entertainment world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNKGhbqUgFp7gDG4btnJdLIUzSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63437'),
  ('568247901804339518', 'Telling Tales', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Burak Aksak', 'Burak Aksak', 'Hande Doğandemir, Fatih Artman, Cengiz Bozkurt, Sadi Celil Cengiz, Tarık Ünlüoğlu, Gürkan Uygun, Devrim Yakut, Erdal Tosun', null, 'The story of a minibus driver and a fairytale princesss nestling under the wing of timeless friendship in an ordinary neighborhood.', 'The story of a minibus driver and a fairytale princesss nestling under the wing of timeless friendship in an ordinary neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BQsiWKFhaeLRUeOEpVZsYPQjDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332534'),
  ('578952526480008654', 'Telling You', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Robert DeFranco, Mark Doering-Powell', 'Robert DeFranco, Marc Palmieri', 'Peter Facinelli, Andy Berman, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Gina Philips, Matthew Lillard, Gary Wolf, Dash Mihok, Richard Libertini', 'R', 'Instead of moving on to bigger and better things after college graduation, two best buddies are embarrassed to find themselves working at a pizza parlor and avoiding old classmates who come in for a slice.', 'Instead of moving on to bigger and better things after college graduation, two best buddies are embarrassed to find themselves working at a pizza parlor and avoiding old classmates who come in for a slice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1LfjNSgWLgsdluM8dsMrx19PN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53685'),
  ('605376069068477336', 'Telstar: The Joe Meek Story', 2008, 'Drama, Music', 'Nick Moran, Peter Wignall, Louise Woodham', 'James Hicks, Nick Moran', 'Con O''Neill, Kevin Spacey, Pam Ferris, JJ Feild, James Corden, Tom Burke, Mathew Baynton, Shaun Evans', 'R', 'Set against a backdrop of early ''60s London, Telstar is the story of the world''s first independent record producer, Joe Meek. A maverick genius who enjoyed phenomenal success with Telstar – the biggest selling record of it''s time – before bad luck, depression, heartbreak and paranoia led to his downfall.', 'Set against a backdrop of early ''60s London, Telstar is the story of the world''s first independent record producer, Joe Meek. A maverick genius who enjoyed phenomenal success with Telstar – the biggest selling record of it''s time – before bad luck, depression, heartbreak and paranoia led to his downfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykswGEkVWYDMVFMuG1lANyPG54s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26796'),
  ('133579442719324295', 'Temmink: The Ultimate Fight', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Boris Paval Conen', 'Arend Steenbergen', 'Jack Wouterse, Jacob Derwig, Ingrid Desmet, Herman Gilis, Joe Montana, Martin Schwab, Victor Löw, Hans Veerman', null, 'Somewhere in the near future, exists The Arena. Here men with an ''agression gene'' with which they want to live no longer, are being admitted to fulfil their wish to die. Through fights to the death, televised by the commercial sportschannel, lives are being ended before one''s time. Temmink, one of the gladiators, wins his first fight, finds a friend in a colleague and falls in love with one of the prostitutes. He becomes a national hero and loses his will to die. But, once admitted to the The Arena, there is no return...', 'Somewhere in the near future, exists The Arena. Here men with an ''agression gene'' with which they want to live no longer, are being admitted to fulfil their wish to die. Through fights to the death, televised by the commercial sportschannel, lives are being ended before one''s time. Temmink, one of the gladiators, wins his first fight, finds a friend in a colleague and falls in love with one of the prostitutes. He becomes a national hero and loses his will to die. But, once admitted to the The Arena, there is no return...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukZMM9bsBSuG1eP0jg85pRPQL5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75756'),
  ('798135280378602239', 'Tempbot', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Neill Blomkamp, Trent Opaloch', 'Mark Fitzloff', 'Lauren K. Robek, Patricia Idlette, Balinder Johal, Trevor Cawood, Kirk Karasin, Lynda Carter, Hal Myshrall, Genevieve Desjardins', null, 'The film follows a ''tempbot'', a robot assigned for a short period of time at an ordinary office, and his romantic endeavours with the Human Resources manager.', 'The film follows a ''tempbot'', a robot assigned for a short period of time at an ordinary office, and his romantic endeavours with the Human Resources manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ66FrXTbuw40wf1pnTF3Rhqc23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47621'),
  ('979668410079208829', 'Tempest', 1928, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sam Taylor, Charles Rosher', 'C. Gardner Sullivan', 'John Barrymore, Camilla Horn, Louis Wolheim, Boris de Fast, George Fawcett, Ullrich Haupt, Michael Visaroff', null, 'In the final days of Czarist Russia, a peasant is raised from the ranks to Lieutenant. The other officers, aristocrats all, resent him, and make his life difficult. He falls in love with a princess, who spurns him. When he is caught in her room, he is stripped of his rank and thrown into prison. Then comes the Red Terror, and the tables are turned.', 'In the final days of Czarist Russia, a peasant is raised from the ranks to Lieutenant. The other officers, aristocrats all, resent him, and make his life difficult. He falls in love with a princess, who spurns him. When he is caught in her room, he is stripped of his rank and thrown into prison. Then comes the Red Terror, and the tables are turned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s834nVwmJQGRwC0yogvq3KECnMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79757'),
  ('947856641609108949', 'Tempest', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Mazursky, Bran Ferren, Donald McAlpine', 'Leon Capetanos, Paul Mazursky', 'John Cassavetes, Gena Rowlands, Susan Sarandon, Vittorio Gassman, Raúl Juliá, Molly Ringwald, Sam Robards, Paul Stewart', 'PG', 'A sobering mid-life crisis fuels dissatisfaction in Philip Dimitrius, to the extent where the successful architect trades his marriage and career in for a spiritual exile on a remote Greek island where he hopes to conjure meaning into his life - trying the patience of his new girlfriend and angst-ridden teenage daughter.', 'A sobering mid-life crisis fuels dissatisfaction in Philip Dimitrius, to the extent where the successful architect trades his marriage and career in for a spiritual exile on a remote Greek island where he hopes to conjure meaning into his life - trying the patience of his new girlfriend and angst-ridden teenage daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGhnc6SAOMH3p8wzFihLtHIKsyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48249'),
  ('284101194834785462', 'Tempestad', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Tatiana Huezo, Ernesto Pardo, Analeine Cal y Mayor', 'Tatiana Huezo', 'Miriam Carbajal, Adela Alvarado', null, 'A woman is recruited to a prison controlled by organized crime while another woman searches for her missing daughter. Through images that submerges us in a journey from north to south Mexico, both testimonies collide and take us to the center of a storm: a country where violence has taken control of our lives, our desires and our dreams.', 'A woman is recruited to a prison controlled by organized crime while another woman searches for her missing daughter. Through images that submerges us in a journey from north to south Mexico, both testimonies collide and take us to the center of a storm: a country where violence has taken control of our lives, our desires and our dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uU14lGYBtY4FnsorF08JSlzDneU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292109'),
  ('354201945987649243', 'Tempi supplementari', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Ago Panini', null, 'Giuseppe Zeno, Clotilde Sabatino, Alex Cendron', null, 'It follows a man who has lost everything, because of his character and his obsession with victory. And through a team of desperate people, the underdogs par excellence, who regains balance and with it affection and love.', 'It follows a man who has lost everything, because of his character and his obsession with victory. And through a team of desperate people, the underdogs par excellence, who regains balance and with it affection and love.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FepxdQEEPe70ew9THfheqrVOEPPe.jpg', 'plex:movie:tempi-supplementari-2026'),
  ('952473307428273917', 'Temple', 2017, 'History, Horror', 'Cory Geryak, Michael Barrett, Daryl Cole', 'Simon Barrett', 'Logan Huffman, Brandon Sklenar, Natalia Warner, Asahi Uchida, Naoto Takenaka, Mei Kurokawa, Hisashi Miyazawa, Miho Tamaki', null, 'Three American tourists follow a mysterious map deep into the jungles of Japan searching for an ancient temple. When spirits entrap them, their adventure quickly becomes a horrific nightmare.', 'Three American tourists follow a mysterious map deep into the jungles of Japan searching for an ancient temple. When spirits entrap them, their adventure quickly becomes a horrific nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjG0N5uWAWfF4HlYT2feb7tnFHo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467239'),
  ('734776117298828600', 'Temple of Film: 100 Years of the Egyptian Theatre', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Angus Wall, John W. Rutland, Alan Torres', null, 'Guillermo del Toro, Autumn Durald Arkapaw, Rian Johnson, Lynette Howell Taylor, Pete Hammond, Leonard Maltin, Rene Lagler, Peyton Hall', 'PG', 'Guillermo del Toro, Rian Johnson and other film luminaries look back at LA''s historic Egyptian Theatre as it returns to its former movie palace glory.', 'Guillermo del Toro, Rian Johnson and other film luminaries look back at LA''s historic Egyptian Theatre as it returns to its former movie palace glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlaLCfH8w4VNmbRK56UobLN6j7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193033'),
  ('260818208240407392', 'Temple of the Red Lotus', 1965, 'Action', 'Hsu Tseng-Hung, Wong Wing-Lung', 'Shen Chiang', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Chin Ping, Ivy Ling Po, Lo Lieh, Tien Feng, Ku Feng, Li Min, Lin Jing', null, 'Jimmy Wang Yu plays a young kid who heads off to Dragon Valley to meet the childhood friend who was promised as his bride. When he gets there, he finds that the family of the bride might not be an entirely honest bunch of people though. What is the story behind their feud with the monks at the Temple Of The Red Lotus, for a start?', 'Jimmy Wang Yu plays a young kid who heads off to Dragon Valley to meet the childhood friend who was promised as his bride. When he gets there, he finds that the family of the bride might not be an entirely honest bunch of people though. What is the story behind their feud with the monks at the Temple Of The Red Lotus, for a start?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otKuNY2ZtP1bYFI8lbAiZsJjbJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147404'),
  ('126200628628636670', 'Temptation', 1946, 'Thriller', 'Lucien Ballard, Irving Pichel, Frank Shaw', 'Robert Thoeren', 'Merle Oberon, George Brent, Charles Korvin, Paul Lukas, Lenore Ulric, Arnold Moss, Robert Capa, Aubrey Mather', 'NR', 'After marrying an archaeologist, a Victorian-era woman with a sordid past realizes that she is not ready to settle down with one man.', 'After marrying an archaeologist, a Victorian-era woman with a sordid past realizes that she is not ready to settle down with one man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNStIB3GFoErl3lFLYMrjyYh13V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44099'),
  ('615364560914809571', 'Temptation of a Monk', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Clara Law, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Andrew Lesnie', 'Eddie Fong Ling-Ching, Lilian Lee Bik-Wah', 'Wu Hsing-Guo, Joan Chen, Michael Lee Ming-Yeung, Lisa Lu, Zhang Fengyi, Lee Wai-Ming, Teddy Robin', 'NR', 'Near the beginning of the Tang dynasty, in 7th century China, General Shi Yan-sheng is tricked into leaving the crown prince unguarded. The crown prince is murdered by one of his brothers who then becomes emperor. Shi retreats to a monastery, perhaps to hide, perhaps to plan a coup. When his loyal troops as well as the princess he desires are slain, he seeks refuge in a remote, abandoned monastery where an aged abbot schools him with practical, earthy teachings. The emperor''s forces pursue Shi: first a woman, then a general seek to overpower him with lust and might. Over the course of the film, the reds of battle give way to blues of meditation.', 'Near the beginning of the Tang dynasty, in 7th century China, General Shi Yan-sheng is tricked into leaving the crown prince unguarded. The crown prince is murdered by one of his brothers who then becomes emperor. Shi retreats to a monastery, perhaps to hide, perhaps to plan a coup. When his loyal troops as well as the princess he desires are slain, he seeks refuge in a remote, abandoned monastery where an aged abbot schools him with practical, earthy teachings. The emperor''s forces pursue Shi: first a woman, then a general seek to overpower him with lust and might. Over the course of the film, the reds of battle give way to blues of meditation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWFeMROISLfwI0zrHwEqI0EcVFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68981'),
  ('869569055840536368', 'Temptation of B.', 1990, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Arkadiy Sirenko, Semyon Pozdnyakov, Evgeniy Guslinskiy', 'Arkadiy Strugatskiy, Boris Strugatskiy', 'Lembit Ulfsak, Natalya Gundareva, Oleg Borisov, Vladimir Zeldin, Stanislav Sadalskiy, Aleksandr Pashutin, Anna Ovsyannikova, Valentin Bryleev', null, 'The story of a writer who accidentally stumbles across the elixir of immortality and in doing so encounters the small group of immortals who have jealously guarded this secret for centuries. Once the writer has knowledge of this elixir, called ''Mafussalin'', the group of five immortals give him a stark choice: either join them, with the price of admission, being a duel to the death between the immortal who accidentally gave the secret away or death at the hands of the group. As the writer makes up his mind, sometimes aided and at other times opposed by the ever shifting alliances from within the group, we discover how the other immortals became this way, their true ages and what they have done with this ''gift''.', 'The story of a writer who accidentally stumbles across the elixir of immortality and in doing so encounters the small group of immortals who have jealously guarded this secret for centuries. Once the writer has knowledge of this elixir, called ''Mafussalin'', the group of five immortals give him a stark choice: either join them, with the price of admission, being a duel to the death between the immortal who accidentally gave the secret away or death at the hands of the group. As the writer makes up his mind, sometimes aided and at other times opposed by the ever shifting alliances from within the group, we discover how the other immortals became this way, their true ages and what they have done with this ''gift''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qL8kIHLaYFfynl7gnJ8GUiYZ11X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284713'),
  ('1122564490815233430', 'Temptation: Confessions of a Marriage Counselor', 2013, 'Drama', 'Tyler Perry, Alexander Gruszynski', 'Tyler Perry', 'Jurnee Smollett, Lance Gross, Robbie Jones, Brandy Norwood, Kim Kardashian, Vanessa Williams, Renée Taylor, Ella Joyce', 'PG-13', 'Judith has known her husband Brice since they were children, but now their marriage is growing stale. Having just completed her graduate work in psychotherapy, she''s eager to begin a career as a marriage counselor. She takes an internship at a matchmaking firm for millionaires and meets Harley, a charismatic billionaire investor who makes no effort to hide his attraction to Judith. Although quite resistant at first, eventually Judith succumbs to his charms, placing her marriage in jeopardy and forever altering the course of her life.', 'Judith has known her husband Brice since they were children, but now their marriage is growing stale. Having just completed her graduate work in psychotherapy, she''s eager to begin a career as a marriage counselor. She takes an internship at a matchmaking firm for millionaires and meets Harley, a charismatic billionaire investor who makes no effort to hide his attraction to Judith. Although quite resistant at first, eventually Judith succumbs to his charms, placing her marriage in jeopardy and forever altering the course of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22hclz5NzRKyWb81TjO1yx1Wn4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97006'),
  ('307092417883907237', 'Tempting Devils', 2018, 'Drama', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau, David Grinberg', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau', 'Fabienne Babe, Isabelle Prim, Anna Sigalevitch, Fabrice Deville, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Anna Zaverihua, Marie-Thérèse Eychard, François Eychart', null, 'A woman discovers curious erotic messages on a lost cell phone in the train. When she meets the owner of the phone, a liberated young woman, the two of them embark on an erotic journey.', 'A woman discovers curious erotic messages on a lost cell phone in the train. When she meets the owner of the phone, a liberated young woman, the two of them embark on an erotic journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yur7kYFn5nxXtrSqudmg4Rk5ug6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474937'),
  ('214492497480793826', 'Tempting Heart', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sylvia Chang, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Cat Kwan Ho-Ming, Sylvia Chang', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, Karen Mok Man-Wai, William So Wing-Hong, Sylvia Chang, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Leon Dai, Cher Yeung Suet-Yee', null, 'A female director decides to make a autobiographical film on her love life and we see it through the use of flashbacks and brilliant intercutting.', 'A female director decides to make a autobiographical film on her love life and we see it through the use of flashbacks and brilliant intercutting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFdczbjSjEGkqmeFFwgOu7DvW5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45472'),
  ('458003063787990994', 'Temptress', 1995, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Anthony G. Nakonechnyj, Lawrence Lanoff, Christopher Landry', 'Melissa Mitchell', 'Kim Delaney, Chris Sarandon, Corbin Bernsen, Dee Wallace, Ben Cross, Jessica Walter, Roger Lodge, Gregory Wallace', null, 'Karin brings a statue home from her travels to Asia and it soon begins to have a strange effect on her. She has an insatiable sexual appetite and develops strange fetishes such as pain and death. Soon, she gets out of control and only her boyfriend Matt has the power in his love to exorcise the demon spirits from Karin''s body.', 'Karin brings a statue home from her travels to Asia and it soon begins to have a strange effect on her. She has an insatiable sexual appetite and develops strange fetishes such as pain and death. Soon, she gets out of control and only her boyfriend Matt has the power in his love to exorcise the demon spirits from Karin''s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvq8DekghiFfiPEsf9v4qkDfttN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218514'),
  ('273688836507425231', 'Temptress Moon', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chen Kaige, Christopher Doyle', 'Shu Kei', 'Leslie Cheung, Gong Li, Kevin Lin, He Saifei, Chang Shih, Liankun Lin, Ko Hsiang-Ting, Jie Zhou', null, 'Set in the decadent 1920s, Temptress Moon tells the very complicated story of a wealthy family living on the outskirts of Shanghai. Their youngest daughter, Ruyi, is brought up as a servant to her opium-addicted father and brother. Meanwhile, her brother-in-law Zhongliang has a successful, if illegal, career seducing and blackmailing married women in the city. When he comes to Ruyi''s home the two fall in love, and trouble ensues.', 'Set in the decadent 1920s, Temptress Moon tells the very complicated story of a wealthy family living on the outskirts of Shanghai. Their youngest daughter, Ruyi, is brought up as a servant to her opium-addicted father and brother. Meanwhile, her brother-in-law Zhongliang has a successful, if illegal, career seducing and blackmailing married women in the city. When he comes to Ruyi''s home the two fall in love, and trouble ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpuVUxfLKlzQDqzMY4oTR1RCQNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47694'),
  ('287244993478857658', 'Temptress of a Thousand Faces', 1969, 'Adventure, Action, Crime', 'Jeong Chang-hwa, Yoshio Mamiya', 'Chin Sung', 'Tina Chin Fei, Chan Leung, Pat Ting Hung, Liu Liang-Hua, Yang Chi-Ching, Lau Kwan, Fan Mei-Sheng, Ou-Yang Sha-Fei', null, 'A mystery caper of devilish fun, Temptress Of A Thousand Faces proves a femme fatale can match any man in wickedness. A mysterious thief has been committing crimes across the city. Always disguised and ever elusive, woman detective Chi Ying cannot find any clues for a good lead. But her reporter boyfriend Yu Ta is always supportive and understanding. Reversing the standard role stereotypes, it is the man here who then becomes the damsel (or dude as the case may be) in distress. Constantly frustrating her police woman foil, the temptress manages to make a game of outwitting her nemesis.', 'A mystery caper of devilish fun, Temptress Of A Thousand Faces proves a femme fatale can match any man in wickedness. A mysterious thief has been committing crimes across the city. Always disguised and ever elusive, woman detective Chi Ying cannot find any clues for a good lead. But her reporter boyfriend Yu Ta is always supportive and understanding. Reversing the standard role stereotypes, it is the man here who then becomes the damsel (or dude as the case may be) in distress. Constantly frustrating her police woman foil, the temptress manages to make a game of outwitting her nemesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VzLVBKade9bJUE4PkDgE4YoId8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93569'),
  ('137439081856773988', 'Temurun', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Inarah Syarafina, Tri Adi Prasetyo, Putri Ng', 'Vontian Suwandi', 'Yasamin Jasem, Bryan Domani, Karina Suwandi, Kiki Narendra, Jajang C. Noer, Mian Tiara, Banyu Bening, Nagra Kautsar Pakusadewo', 'R', 'After their mother dies during a violent break-in, two siblings move in with their estranged father discover their family''s sinister heritage.', 'After their mother dies during a violent break-in, two siblings move in with their estranged father discover their family''s sinister heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IeYZ2iYHEbTQUwRyWxYnM3KDsp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1264429'),
  ('147541823237535181', 'Ten', 1971, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama, Romance, Family', 'Nadezhda Kosheverova, Konstantin Ryzhov', 'Valeri Frid, Yuli Dunsky', 'Oleg Dal, Anastasiya Vertinskaya, Marina Neyolova, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Vladimir Etush, Andrey Mironov, Sergei Filippov, Zinoviy Gerdt', null, 'The good-natured scholar Christian-Theodore arrives in a small country where miracles occur. He falls in love with the beautiful Princess, whose marriage is a matter of national importance, because her husband will become the new king. But unlike many “suitors”, selfish thoughts are alien to Christian-Theodore. He is sincerely fascinated by her beauty and releases his Shadow, hoping to get a faithful helper in his quest to marry the Princess. But the Shadow is the embodiment of egoism, greed and meanness. Quickly betraying the scholar, he marries the Princess himself and takes the royal throne.', 'The good-natured scholar Christian-Theodore arrives in a small country where miracles occur. He falls in love with the beautiful Princess, whose marriage is a matter of national importance, because her husband will become the new king. But unlike many “suitors”, selfish thoughts are alien to Christian-Theodore. He is sincerely fascinated by her beauty and releases his Shadow, hoping to get a faithful helper in his quest to marry the Princess. But the Shadow is the embodiment of egoism, greed and meanness. Quickly betraying the scholar, he marries the Princess himself and takes the royal throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mkeJYGcslswNf1B6eWphRsTu1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65131'),
  ('878420900563870683', 'Ten', 2002, 'Drama', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Abbas Kiarostami', null, 'Mania Akbari, Amina Maher, Kamran Adl, Roya Arabshahi, Mandana Sharbaf, Amene Moradi, Katayoun Taleizadeh', 'NR', 'A visual social examination in the form of ten conversations between a driving woman and her various pick-ups and hitchhikers.', 'A visual social examination in the form of ten conversations between a driving woman and her various pick-ups and hitchhikers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qOJ6COcbJ3X8JmZI6A7VroGsn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14633'),
  ('469895639384079554', 'Ten Brothers', 1995, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lee Lik-Chi', 'Ivy Lee Mo-King, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Lee Lik-Chi', 'Sharla Cheung, Kenny Bee, Law Kar-Ying, Ashton Chen, Steven Hao, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Sung Boon-Chung, Gam Ji-Jing', null, 'A silly fantasy/adventure film about a man and wife who inherit a magical bracelet that bestows ten sons unto them. It soon becomes apparent that there are ill-intentioned others who want to use the ten brothers to their own advantage.', 'A silly fantasy/adventure film about a man and wife who inherit a magical bracelet that bestows ten sons unto them. It soon becomes apparent that there are ill-intentioned others who want to use the ten brothers to their own advantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AFCgSn9MF4bPvOPCqvWT5PhH4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66754'),
  ('928301863496734049', 'Ten Canoes', 2006, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Djigirr, Rolf de Heer, Ian Jones', 'Rolf de Heer', 'Crusoe Kurddal, Jamie Gulpilil, Richard Birrinbirrin, David Gulpilil, Peter Minygululu , Frances Djulibing, Sonia Djarrabalminym, Cassandra Malangarri Baker', null, 'A story within a story within a story. In Australia''s Northern Territory, an Aboriginal narrator tells a story about his ancestors on a goose hunt. A youngster on the hunt is being tempted to adultery with his elder brother''s wife, so an elder tells him a story from the mythical past about how evil can slip in and cause havoc unless prevented by virtue according to customary tribal law.', 'A story within a story within a story. In Australia''s Northern Territory, an Aboriginal narrator tells a story about his ancestors on a goose hunt. A youngster on the hunt is being tempted to adultery with his elder brother''s wife, so an elder tells him a story from the mythical past about how evil can slip in and cause havoc unless prevented by virtue according to customary tribal law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uF9xjL2IJ6Wa9F8FQ1Is6Htu0Ka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14064'),
  ('506020367096274774', 'Ten Cents a Dance', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lionel Barrymore, Gilbert Warrenton, Ernest Haller', 'Jo Swerling, Dorothy Howell', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Ricardo Cortez, Monroe Owsley, Sally Blane, Blanche Friderici, Phyllis Crane, Olive Tell, Victor Potel', 'NR', 'A taxi dancer with a jealous husband finds herself falling for a wealthy client.', 'A taxi dancer with a jealous husband finds herself falling for a wealthy client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1oWSFU9YpgLbXU8EjftHoEBQFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121018'),
  ('612762930018376142', 'Ten Dark Women', 1961, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kon Ichikawa, Setsuo Kobayashi', 'Natto Wada', 'Fujiko Yamamoto, Mariko Miyagi, Tamao Nakamura, Kyôko Kishida, Eiji Funakoshi, Keiko Kishi, Tomo''o Nagai, Shirō Ōtsuji', null, 'Kaze is a philandering TV producer. His wife and nine of his mistresses conspire to kill him. However each woman would rather keep him alive, as long as she was the only woman in his life.', 'Kaze is a philandering TV producer. His wife and nine of his mistresses conspire to kill him. However each woman would rather keep him alive, as long as she was the only woman in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ95CeAkWiegEvEZgJsADZBpBar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125368'),
  ('784495048994727664', 'Ten Days'' Wonder', 1971, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier', 'Frederic Dannay, Manfred Lee, Paul Gégauff', 'Anthony Perkins, Michel Piccoli, Marlène Jobert, Orson Welles, Guido Alberti, Ermanno Casanova, Mathilde Ceccarelli, Eric Frisdal', 'PG', 'Charles Van Horn, son of rich and powerful Théo Van Horn, calls upon his former teacher Paul Régis to help him solve the mystery of his recurring bouts of amnesia.', 'Charles Van Horn, son of rich and powerful Théo Van Horn, calls upon his former teacher Paul Régis to help him solve the mystery of his recurring bouts of amnesia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYfDcCgPAbUD2GJrgFCVWqVJMCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91496'),
