  ('497717395424342873', 'Ten Ladies in an Umbrella', 1903, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'The scene is similar to that seen at Coney Island, where a number of shows are constantly going on.', 'The scene is similar to that seen at Coney Island, where a number of shows are constantly going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iju1j3UewkXjGRb234DyOtHZiXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190694'),
  ('611489767495695812', 'Ten Little Indians', 1965, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Ernest Steward, George Pollock', 'Dudley Nichols, Harry Alan Towers', 'Hugh O''Brian, Shirley Eaton, Fabian, Leo Genn, Stanley Holloway, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Daliah Lavi, Dennis Price', null, 'Ten strangers are invited as weekend guests to a remote mountain mansion. When the host doesn''t show up, the guests start dying, one by one.', 'Ten strangers are invited as weekend guests to a remote mountain mansion. When the host doesn''t show up, the guests start dying, one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qf7b2qlIQD779yjIjn5cSly68r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4879'),
  ('760731767263110053', 'Ten Little Indians', 1987, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Stanislav Govorukhin, Valentina Stepovskaya, I. Velikanova', 'Stanislav Govorukhin', 'Vladimir Zeldin, Tatyana Drubich, Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Aleksei Zharkov, Anatoliy Romashin, Lyudmila Maksakova, Mikhail Gluzskiy, Aleksey Zolotnitskiy', null, 'Ten strangers are forced to come face-to-face with their dark pasts after receiving an anonymous invitation to an isolated island off the coast of England.', 'Ten strangers are forced to come face-to-face with their dark pasts after receiving an anonymous invitation to an isolated island off the coast of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eLoGaival4wpXvnJYmNHZcWmUP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4885'),
  ('1004429123275292510', 'Ten Little Indians', 1989, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Arthur Lavis, Alan Birkinshaw', 'Jackson Hunsicker, Gerry O''Hara', 'Donald Pleasence, Brenda Vaccaro, Frank Stallone Jr., Herbert Lom, Sarah Maur Thorp, Warren Berlinger, Yehuda Efroni, Moira Lister', 'PG', 'Ten people are invited to go on an African safari, only to find that an unseen person is killing them one by one. Could one of them be the killer?', 'Ten people are invited to go on an African safari, only to find that an unseen person is killing them one by one. Could one of them be the killer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkh9NY3PMYqpCVQqo9yJFe8u0eq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103761'),
  ('201025740817406063', 'Ten Minutes', 2024, 'Drama', 'Maria Sole Tognazzi, Luigi Martinucci', 'Francesca Archibugi, Maria Sole Tognazzi', 'Barbara Ronchi, Fotinì Peluso, Margherita Buy, Alessandro Tedeschi, Anna Ferruzzo, Marcello Mazzarella, Mattia Garaci, Matteo Cecchi', null, 'Ten minutes a day can change the course of your day. Ten minutes doing something completely new can change the course of a life. This is what Bianca will discover in the midst of an existential crisis. New meetings, the discovery of special bonds and listening to those who have always loved us. Sometimes it doesn''t take much to start over and this film teaches us this, through a warm and passionate story of rebirth.', 'Ten minutes a day can change the course of your day. Ten minutes doing something completely new can change the course of a life. This is what Bianca will discover in the midst of an existential crisis. New meetings, the discovery of special bonds and listening to those who have always loved us. Sometimes it doesn''t take much to start over and this film teaches us this, through a warm and passionate story of rebirth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swRSFUjrHBTAdpy9DKFzk0NtC7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083103'),
  ('117795891709886038', 'Ten Minutes from Naturists', 2012, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Clavier, Jean-Claude Larrieu, Jean-Pierre Garrabos', 'Jean-Luc Goossens', 'Lionel Abelanski, Christine Citti, Bruno Ricci, Maëva Pasquali, Macha Méril, Marie Pape, Jean-Baptiste Fonck, Catherine Jacob', null, 'A family of Brussels concierges, whose employers have left for the summer, decide to swap their home for a magnificent villa in the south of France for the holidays. However, upon arriving on the island, they discover that all the surrounding beaches are exclusively for naturists.', 'A family of Brussels concierges, whose employers have left for the summer, decide to swap their home for a magnificent villa in the south of France for the holidays. However, upon arriving on the island, they discover that all the surrounding beaches are exclusively for naturists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/117fEH8oJNnpKAbCL6c15vKfBkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117325'),
  ('267218352901570094', 'Ten Minutes Older', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Herz Frank, Juris Podnieks', 'Herz Frank', null, null, 'In this ten-minute documentary experiment, director Herz Frank films a group of children watching a puppet show, keeping the camera fixed on their faces in a single continuous shot. The performance itself remains unseen, while the children’s shifting expressions—fear, laughter, curiosity, and suspense—suggest the story unfolding before them as ten minutes of their lives quietly pass.', 'In this ten-minute documentary experiment, director Herz Frank films a group of children watching a puppet show, keeping the camera fixed on their faces in a single continuous shot. The performance itself remains unseen, while the children’s shifting expressions—fear, laughter, curiosity, and suspense—suggest the story unfolding before them as ten minutes of their lives quietly pass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLRXYGexSPr0zHsOSpHEH5fEtPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200547'),
  ('627550880168074077', 'Ten Minutes Older: The Cello', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Romance', 'Bernardo Bertolucci, Mike Figgis, Claire Denis', 'Mike Figgis, Michael Radford, Claire Denis', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Amit Arroz, Tarun Bedi, Maria Ludovica Bernardi, Chiara Mastalli, Dominic West, Alexandra Staden, Ildikó Bánsági', null, 'Collection of short films the summaries of which include; a foreign man moving to Italy, getting married and having a child; a four split scene short involving plot-less images of old people with television sets for heads, a beautiful woman having sex, and overall confusion; and an old man reminiscing over his youth.', 'Collection of short films the summaries of which include; a foreign man moving to Italy, getting married and having a child; a four split scene short involving plot-less images of old people with television sets for heads, a beautiful woman having sex, and overall confusion; and an old man reminiscing over his youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOdg45o54m4n0pTqbGCgTHhCu0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79591'),
  ('995808715742148997', 'Ten Minutes Older: The Trumpet', 2002, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Chen Kaige, Víctor Erice, Werner Herzog', 'Víctor Erice, Werner Herzog, Jim Jarmusch', 'Markku Peltola, Kati Outinen, Marko Haavisto, Ana Sofia Liaño, Chloë Sevigny, Charles Esten, Amber Tamblyn, Feng Yuanzheng', null, 'Ten Minutes Older is a 2002 film project consisting of two compilation feature films entitled The Trumpet and The Cello. The project was conceived by the producer Nicolas McClintock as a reflection on the theme of time at the turn of the Millennium. Fifteen celebrated film-makers were invited to create their own vision of what time means in ten minutes of film.', 'Ten Minutes Older is a 2002 film project consisting of two compilation feature films entitled The Trumpet and The Cello. The project was conceived by the producer Nicolas McClintock as a reflection on the theme of time at the turn of the Millennium. Fifteen celebrated film-makers were invited to create their own vision of what time means in ten minutes of film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxIKQ2MeZAYiZ5lbJyYrNmXf7Dy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23676'),
  ('273965545520209466', 'Ten Minutes to Midnight', 2020, 'Horror', 'Thomson Nguyen, Erik Bloomquist', 'Erik Bloomquist, Carson Bloomquist', 'Caroline Williams, Nicole Kang, Nicholas Tucci, William Youmans, Adam Weppler, Alice Kremelberg, Greg Balla, Martín Solá', null, 'A late night radio host is trapped inside the station by a violent storm after being bitten by a rabid bat.', 'A late night radio host is trapped inside the station by a violent storm after being bitten by a rabid bat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8xmHHVnkb2c52lDVautBEi23jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:691100'),
  ('576490296134549578', 'Ten Months', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jung Yonghyun, Namkoong Sun', 'Namkoong Sun', 'Choi Sung-eun, Seo Young-joo, You E-den, Bek Hyun-jin, Son Seong-chan, Kim Geun-young, Oh Tae-eun, Son Ji-young', null, 'A promising program developer braves adulthood with a new perspective when an unplanned pregnancy fills her reality with questions, chaos and courage', 'A promising program developer braves adulthood with a new perspective when an unplanned pregnancy fills her reality with questions, chaos and courage', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrblxNR8hQ28dufx19Gzb34dHda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:707157'),
  ('66436765625505025', 'Ten Nights of Dreams', 2007, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Atsushi Shimizu, Kon Ichikawa, Takashi Shimizu', 'Keisuke Toyoshima, Miwa Nishikawa, Junya Kato', 'Kyoko Koizumi, Suzuki Matsuo, Tsuyoshi Ujiki, Umenosuke Nakamura, Keisuke Horibe, Yuu Kashii, Koji Yamamoto, Rio Kanno', null, 'Based on renowned Japanese writer Natsume Soseki''s same-titled short story collection, Ten Nights of Dreams brings ten fantastical dream sequences to film with great visual and psychological panache. Representing the combined efforts of eleven directors, this outstanding anthology delves into the surreal subconscious with ten madly imaginative, reality-subverting visions that range from wonderfully wacky to nightmarishly unsettling.', 'Based on renowned Japanese writer Natsume Soseki''s same-titled short story collection, Ten Nights of Dreams brings ten fantastical dream sequences to film with great visual and psychological panache. Representing the combined efforts of eleven directors, this outstanding anthology delves into the surreal subconscious with ten madly imaginative, reality-subverting visions that range from wonderfully wacky to nightmarishly unsettling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NhM3pDnumDWIaTMo1eGujZfTUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78386'),
  ('391003086949513005', 'Ten North Frederick', 1958, 'Romance, Drama', 'Philip Dunne, Joseph MacDonald', 'Philip Dunne', 'Gary Cooper, Diane Varsi, Suzy Parker, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Tom Tully, Ray Stricklyn, Philip Ober, John Emery', 'NR', 'After her father''s funeral, Ann Chapin thinks back over the last five years of his life, years of apparent political and personal failure dominated by a selfish and dissatisfied wife, eased only by alcohol. But it starts to emerge that he had in fact one brief and unsuspected period of happiness and love.', 'After her father''s funeral, Ann Chapin thinks back over the last five years of his life, years of apparent political and personal failure dominated by a selfish and dissatisfied wife, eased only by alcohol. But it starts to emerge that he had in fact one brief and unsuspected period of happiness and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXF6zoOlqR4YsrOGBvAC3tTrZ61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101288'),
  ('452096995853094761', 'Ten Seconds to Hell', 1959, 'Drama, War, Action', 'Robert Aldrich, Ernest Laszlo', 'Teddi Sherman, Robert Aldrich', 'Jack Palance, Jeff Chandler, Martine Carol, Robert Cornthwaite, Dave Willock, Wesley Addy, Virginia Baker, Richard Wattis', 'NR', 'Two rivals from a German bomb squad are left to deactivate duds in postwar Berlin.', 'Two rivals from a German bomb squad are left to deactivate duds in postwar Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q46iDVM4WZl4ZLGEf7tSjLHiUL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32070'),
  ('796555816685846617', 'Ten Tall Men', 1951, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Willis Goldbeck, William E. Snyder', 'Roland Kibbee, Frank Davis', 'Burt Lancaster, Jody Lawrance, Gilbert Roland, Kieron Moore, George Tobias, Michael Pate, Robert Clary, John Dehner', 'NR', 'Sgt. Mike Kincaid of the French Foreign Legion learns, from a Riff prisoner, that an attack will soon be made by the villainous Hussin on the Legion''s outpost of Tarfa. Kincaid volunteers to lead nine other Legionnaires on a mission to delay Hussin''s attack till reinforcements arrive. When he discovers that Hussin plans to marry Mahla, a girl from a rival tribe, in order to build a coalition against the French, Kincaid kidnaps Mahla. Hussin forcefully takes her back, but by now his planned attack on Tarfa is crumbling and Mahla has begun to fall in love with Kincaid.', 'Sgt. Mike Kincaid of the French Foreign Legion learns, from a Riff prisoner, that an attack will soon be made by the villainous Hussin on the Legion''s outpost of Tarfa. Kincaid volunteers to lead nine other Legionnaires on a mission to delay Hussin''s attack till reinforcements arrive. When he discovers that Hussin plans to marry Mahla, a girl from a rival tribe, in order to build a coalition against the French, Kincaid kidnaps Mahla. Hussin forcefully takes her back, but by now his planned attack on Tarfa is crumbling and Mahla has begun to fall in love with Kincaid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6ZdVuBvdzR9fbK343uwPmocWtq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115834'),
  ('693446701117414779', 'Ten Tigers of Kwangtung', 1979, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Chiang Sheng, Chan Yau-Man', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Wong Lik, Lung Tien-hsiang, Chin Siu-Ho, Ti Lung, Alexander Fu Sheng, Wai Pak, Sun Chien, Lu Feng', 'R', 'Ming partisan Chu who is on the run from Manchu forces. Local merchant and kung fu enthusiast Li Chen-chau gives the fugitive shelter in his pawnshop and quietly recruits some of his fellow martial master associates to help protect the lad. When Li''s professional rival rats him out, Manchu official Liang not only orchestras his army but fools a couple other kung fu masters including Beggar Su into helping his cause. After a heated battle, Li manages to convince Su to joining his cause, thus forming the Ten Tigers.', 'Ming partisan Chu who is on the run from Manchu forces. Local merchant and kung fu enthusiast Li Chen-chau gives the fugitive shelter in his pawnshop and quietly recruits some of his fellow martial master associates to help protect the lad. When Li''s professional rival rats him out, Manchu official Liang not only orchestras his army but fools a couple other kung fu masters including Beggar Su into helping his cause. After a heated battle, Li manages to convince Su to joining his cause, thus forming the Ten Tigers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuvyuf2eIhGVhQGkqt9y69NoRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59405'),
  ('7309946388871386', 'Ten Violent Women', 1982, 'Action, Drama', 'Ted V. Mikels, Yuval Shousterman', 'James Gordon White, Ted V. Mikels', 'Sherri Vernon, Dixie Lauren, Sally Alice Gamble, Georgia Joan Hannan, Jane Farnsworth, Melodie Bell, Christina de Cattani, Paula Ian', 'R', 'Eight women miners get fed up with their lifestyle and decide to try crime. After successfully pulling off a jewelry store robbery, they are busted by narcs when they try to buy cocaine. The eight get sent to a prison where a butch head guard uses the prisoners for her own deviant pleasures. Two of the women manage to escape and then get mixed up with a shah who had a scarab ring stolen in their jewelry heist.', 'Eight women miners get fed up with their lifestyle and decide to try crime. After successfully pulling off a jewelry store robbery, they are busted by narcs when they try to buy cocaine. The eight get sent to a prison where a butch head guard uses the prisoners for her own deviant pleasures. Two of the women manage to escape and then get mixed up with a shah who had a scarab ring stolen in their jewelry heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXdWliUY5Ng9LsBb4Y9yyYFBjPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141643'),
  ('1055918259258405786', 'Ten Wanted Men', 1955, 'Western', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Kenneth Gamet', 'Randolph Scott, Jocelyn Brando, Richard Boone, Alfonso Bedoya, Donna Martell, Skip Homeier, Clem Bevans, Leo Gordon', 'NR', 'When his ward seeks protection with rival cattleman John Stewart, embittered, jealous rancher Wick Campbell hires ten outlaws to help him seize power in the territory.', 'When his ward seeks protection with rival cattleman John Stewart, embittered, jealous rancher Wick Campbell hires ten outlaws to help him seize power in the territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgWmvpH0z8ceqhsSyz8NhKfb1Sg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64368'),
  ('352366671640086317', 'Ten Winters', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Valerio Mieli, Marco Onorato, Uliana Kovaleva', 'Davide Lantieri, Isabella Aguilar, Federica Pontremoli', 'Isabella Ragonese, Michele Riondino, Glen Blackhall, Sergey Zhigunov, Sergey Nikonenko, Liuba Zaizeva, Alice Torriani, Sara Lazzaro', null, 'Born of a chance meeting in Venice, Silvestro and Camilla''s rocky romance unfolds over 10 winters as new lovers come and go but they are eternally thrust back into one another''s arms.', 'Born of a chance meeting in Venice, Silvestro and Camilla''s rocky romance unfolds over 10 winters as new lovers come and go but they are eternally thrust back into one another''s arms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFezIfHEW70cZHjlsiFsrkaXNLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40827'),
  ('1046744603056303924', 'Ten Years', 2015, 'Drama', 'Zune Kwok, Wong Fei-Pang, Jevons Au Man-Kit', 'Kiwi Chow Kwun-Wai, Ng Ka-Leung, Jevons Au Man-Kit', 'Catherine Chau, Wang Hongwei, Sam Leung Kin-Ping, Courtney Wu, Liu Kai-Chi, Ng Siu-Hin, Neo Yau, Kenneth Cheung Moon-Yuen', null, 'Five shorts reveal a fictional Hong Kong in 2025, depicting a dystopian city where residents and activists face crackdowns under iron-fisted rule.', 'Five shorts reveal a fictional Hong Kong in 2025, depicting a dystopian city where residents and activists face crackdowns under iron-fisted rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpZbxJEiOktio70MknB0PgRH9jf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376916'),
  ('762234600284823247', 'Ten Years Thailand', 2018, 'Drama', 'Soifa Saenkhumkon, Tippawan Narintorn, Chantana Tiprachart', 'Aditya Assarat, Chulayarnnon Siriphol, Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Boonyarit Wiangnon, Waranyaa Punamsap, Angkrit Ajchariyasophon, Pairin Kornvong, Kunpaphop Rukkaew, Thanakrit Pramejindakamon, Wanchai Pomsamut, Pattarasuda Anumanrajadhon', null, 'A collection of short films by five Thai directors imagining their country ten years into the future.', 'A collection of short films by five Thai directors imagining their country ten years into the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNbsLAjziuS1v6Gdwsnem0i7DQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500900'),
  ('358619905114807209', 'Tenacious D in The Pick of Destiny', 2006, 'Comedy, Music, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Liam Lynch, Heather Grierson, Velvet Andrews-Smith', 'Kyle Gass, Jack Black, Liam Lynch', 'Jack Black, Kyle Gass, JR Reed, Ronnie James Dio, Paul F. Tompkins, Troy Gentile, Ned Bellamy, Fred Armisen', 'R', 'In Venice Beach, naive Midwesterner JB bonds with local slacker KG and they form the rock band Tenacious D. Setting out to become the world''s greatest band is no easy feat, so they set out to steal what could be the answer to their prayers... a magical guitar pick housed in a rock-and-roll museum some 300 miles away.', 'In Venice Beach, naive Midwesterner JB bonds with local slacker KG and they form the rock band Tenacious D. Setting out to become the world''s greatest band is no easy feat, so they set out to steal what could be the answer to their prayers... a magical guitar pick housed in a rock-and-roll museum some 300 miles away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NmDIj5I1OFOZfYFnS3uWtM7WMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2179'),
  ('912680096504627507', 'Tenaliraman', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yuvaraj Dhayalan, Ramnath Shetty', 'Yuvaraj Dhayalan', 'Vadivelu, Meenakshi Dixit, Manobala, Radha Ravi, G. M. Kumar, Bala Singh, Mansoor Ali Khan, Santhana Bharathi', null, 'In the fictional princely state of Vigada Nagar, the king''s corrupt ministers strike a deal with the Chinese, giving them unrestricted access to trade in the kingdom. When the king makes a witty and intelligent fellow, Tenaliraman, as a minister, they are worried about their secret. Meanwhile, Tenaliraman seems to have a plan of his own...', 'In the fictional princely state of Vigada Nagar, the king''s corrupt ministers strike a deal with the Chinese, giving them unrestricted access to trade in the kingdom. When the king makes a witty and intelligent fellow, Tenaliraman, as a minister, they are worried about their secret. Meanwhile, Tenaliraman seems to have a plan of his own...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzEx7fJ0mwBYlslhVFiCYjP2YKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262691'),
  ('623484260640668969', 'Tenants', 2018, 'Horror', 'Chava Cartas', 'Juan Carlos Garzón, Angélica Gudiño', 'Zuria Vega, Erick Elías, Luis Arrieta, Camila Selser, Danny Perea, Violeta Silva, Noé Hernández, Evangelina Martínez', null, 'A couple arrives to an apartment complex where santeria and witchcraft are common practice.', 'A couple arrives to an apartment complex where santeria and witchcraft are common practice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKRrdZXXsQD2v7jKTeea5GJG7ml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375791'),
  ('505210921530943404', 'Tenchi Forever!', 1999, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Hiroshi Negishi, Yasuyoshi Toyonaga, Masakuni Kaneko', 'Masaharu Ayano', 'Masami Kikuchi, Ai Orikasa, Yumi Takada, Chisa Yokoyama, Kikuko Inoue, Etsuko Kozakura, Takehito Koyasu, Takeshi Aono', null, 'One day, Tenchi disappears in the forest near his house. Six months later, Ayeka and Ryoko locate Tenchi living in a city, but with a mysterious woman. What''s more, Tenchi appears to have aged several years. Whenever Ayeka and Ryoko catch up to him, he disappears into thin air, apparently existing in a fabricated alternate dimension where he has no knowledge of his past.', 'One day, Tenchi disappears in the forest near his house. Six months later, Ayeka and Ryoko locate Tenchi living in a city, but with a mysterious woman. What''s more, Tenchi appears to have aged several years. Whenever Ayeka and Ryoko catch up to him, he disappears into thin air, apparently existing in a fabricated alternate dimension where he has no knowledge of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNSZN0ngvxn75FTRe1JpM2g5BqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14829'),
  ('630933234736789570', 'Tenchi Muyo! In Love', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hiroshi Negishi, Takahiro Kishida, Hiroyuki Horiuchi', 'Ryoe Tsukimura, Hiroshi Negishi', 'Masami Kikuchi, Ai Orikasa, Chisa Yokoyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Yumi Takada, Etsuko Kozakura, Toshiyuki Morikawa', null, 'The demonic space criminal Kain has escaped from prison and destroyed the Galaxy Police headquarters. To ensure that the Jurai will not stop him, Kain travels back to 1970 to eliminate Tenchi''s mother before he is even born. Now, Tenchi and the gang must travel to the past to stop him before he ceases to exist.', 'The demonic space criminal Kain has escaped from prison and destroyed the Galaxy Police headquarters. To ensure that the Jurai will not stop him, Kain travels back to 1970 to eliminate Tenchi''s mother before he is even born. Now, Tenchi and the gang must travel to the past to stop him before he ceases to exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YR0MeIbbinhc0qLr2vg3Zmqbw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34935'),
  ('500540377540070087', 'Tenchi the Movie 2: The Daughter of Darkness', 1997, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 'Tetsu Kimura, Nobuaki Nagano', null, 'Masami Kikuchi, Junko Iwao, Ai Orikasa, Yumi Takada, Chisa Yokoyama, Yuko Mizutani, Yuri Amano, Etsuko Kozakura', null, 'Mayuka is a girl who appears one day and claims to be Tenchi''s daughter. As the initial shock wears off, everyone in the Masaki household gets used to Mayuka''s presence. However, things only become more interesting as Washu tries to discover Mayuka''s background. What Washu found involves demon, the Prince of Jurai, and unrequited emotions.', 'Mayuka is a girl who appears one day and claims to be Tenchi''s daughter. As the initial shock wears off, everyone in the Masaki household gets used to Mayuka''s presence. However, things only become more interesting as Washu tries to discover Mayuka''s background. What Washu found involves demon, the Prince of Jurai, and unrequited emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WXAZ1CAXb3RXOtzjWHkuoBT6mB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34194'),
  ('645851336064035781', 'Tenchu!', 1969, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Hideo Gosha, Fujio Morita, Shigeru Doi', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Shintarō Katsu, Tatsuya Nakadai, Yukio Mishima, Yūjirō Ishihara, Mitsuko Baisho, Takumi Shinjo, Noboru Nakaya, Ryūtarō Tatsumi', null, 'A ronin desperately seeks a way out of financial straits; he allies with the Tosa clan under the ruthless leader Takechi, who quickly takes advantage.', 'A ronin desperately seeks a way out of financial straits; he allies with the Tosa clan under the ruthless leader Takechi, who quickly takes advantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4Wk9GV8m1eva53THh6Qpk2coH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37053'),
  ('326296763176661606', 'Tender and Perverse Emmanuelle', 1973, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Jesús Franco, Alain Hardy', 'Jesús Franco', 'Norma Kastel, Jack Taylor, Lina Romay, Alice Arno, Pierre Taylou, Monique Van Linden, Roger Germanes, Richard Kennedy', null, 'After his wife, a concert pianist, is found murdered a wealthy man is suspected of her murder. But as more suspects begin to pile up this mystery might take its toll on more than one participant.', 'After his wife, a concert pianist, is found murdered a wealthy man is suspected of her murder. But as more suspects begin to pile up this mystery might take its toll on more than one participant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exQmnYothunMRQHeWJVyCbZkDXO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199539'),
