  ('525391670307748942', 'Tender Dracula', 1974, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Pierre Grunstein, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Justin Lenoir', 'Peter Cushing, Alida Valli, Bernard Ménez, Miou-Miou, Nathalie Courval, Stéphane Shandor, Julien Guiomar, Percival Russel', null, 'Two writers and their girlfriends visit the castle of an actor who specializes in playing vampire roles. As the night progresses, they begin to wonder if the man is an actor playing a vampire, or a vampire playing an actor.', 'Two writers and their girlfriends visit the castle of an actor who specializes in playing vampire roles. As the night progresses, they begin to wonder if the man is an actor playing a vampire, or a vampire playing an actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zunS4lInXMoE5oxZbRNTyER9YHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153281'),
  ('878335980498050666', 'Tender Flesh', 1997, 'Horror', 'Pedro Temboury, Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco', 'Lina Romay, Monique Parent, Amber Newman, Alain Petit, Analía Ivars, Aldo Sambrell, Mikel Cronen', null, 'An exotic dancer is hired to perform for a wealthy couple on an island. And this takes for a turn for the worse when she is hunted by the couple on the island as the prey and dinner!', 'An exotic dancer is hired to perform for a wealthy couple on an island. And this takes for a turn for the worse when she is hunted by the couple on the island as the prey and dinner!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b38BCiwhv4SN0xKm17f8XuUTwcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29930'),
  ('809737416798696997', 'Tender Is the Night', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Henry King, Eli Dunn, Leon Shamroy', 'Ivan Moffat', 'Jennifer Jones, Jason Robards, Jill St. John, Joan Fontaine, Tom Ewell, Cesare Danova, Paul Lukas, Bea Benaderet', null, '1920s, the French Riviera: wealthy expatriate Nicole Warren''s mental illness strains her marriage to psychiatrist Dick. A young American actress named Rosemary Hoyt arrives and is drawn into their circle, becoming romantically involved with the older, married Dick and disrupting the fragile balance of the group. The thought of Dick possibly being attracted to another sends Nicole on an emotional downward spiral that threatens to consume them all.', '1920s, the French Riviera: wealthy expatriate Nicole Warren''s mental illness strains her marriage to psychiatrist Dick. A young American actress named Rosemary Hoyt arrives and is drawn into their circle, becoming romantically involved with the older, married Dick and disrupting the fragile balance of the group. The thought of Dick possibly being attracted to another sends Nicole on an emotional downward spiral that threatens to consume them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynB4bWyu8NPbukWAiH2y6VM9ZmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121903'),
  ('1113083490406759850', 'Tender Mercies', 1983, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Bruce Beresford, Russell Boyd, Richard Luke Rothschild', 'Horton Foote', 'Robert Duvall, Tess Harper, Betty Buckley, Wilford Brimley, Ellen Barkin, Allan Hubbard, Lenny Von Dohlen, Paul Gleason', 'PG', 'Alcoholic former country singer Mac Sledge makes friends with a young widow and her son. The friendship enables him to find inspiration to resume his career.', 'Alcoholic former country singer Mac Sledge makes friends with a young widow and her son. The friendship enables him to find inspiration to resume his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBP6uK0K4EnV8dtt4SJQrMdX0wb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42121'),
  ('862333983689886088', 'Tender Scoundrel', 1966, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jean Becker', 'Michel Audiard, Daniel Boulanger, Albert Simonin', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Philippe Noiret, Robert Morley, Geneviève Page, Nadja Tiller, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Mylène Demongeot, Stefania Sandrelli', 'NR', 'Tony Maréchal is a professional seducer. Having conquered countless women, proclaims that there is none that can resist his charm. To prove this makes a difficult challenge: to seduce baroness Minna von Strasshofer.', 'Tony Maréchal is a professional seducer. Having conquered countless women, proclaims that there is none that can resist his charm. To prove this makes a difficult challenge: to seduce baroness Minna von Strasshofer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYdnhQwOokQsCAwcHYsHlRwyHCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79877'),
  ('1130197768754955091', 'Tenderness', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Polson, Tom Stern, Eric Henriquez', 'Emil Stern', 'Russell Crowe, Jon Foster, Sophie Traub, Laura Dern, Alicia Harding, Michael Kelly, Alexis Dziena, Arija Bareikis', 'R', 'A hardened cop tries to unravel the past to discover whether a violent teenager was responsible for the murder of his family. A confused fifteen-year-old runaway becomes enthralled with the young man.', 'A hardened cop tries to unravel the past to discover whether a violent teenager was responsible for the murder of his family. A confused fifteen-year-old runaway becomes enthralled with the young man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80nXswqLylZHzU1XmWvSxSzAf9Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22398'),
  ('562425422744398770', 'Tenderness', 2017, 'Drama', 'Gianni Amelio, Luca Bigazzi', 'Gianni Amelio, Alberto Taraglio', 'Renato Carpentieri, Elio Germano, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Micaela Ramazzotti, Greta Scacchi, Arturo Muselli, Giuseppe Zeno, Maria Nazionale', null, 'Back from the hospital where he has been treated after a heart attack, Lorenzo is on his way upstairs to his top-floor apartment in Naples when he meets Michela. The charming young woman, who has just moved to the facing apartment, has forgotten her keys and finds herself locked out. Cynical and grumpy, the retired lawyer who has been living estranged from the rest of the world, should normally leave her to her fate but he mellows under her spontaneous charm. He helps her, becomes friends not only with her but with her husband Fabio and their two children. For once, the self-declared misanthropist seems to be experiencing the long forgotten feeling of empathy.', 'Back from the hospital where he has been treated after a heart attack, Lorenzo is on his way upstairs to his top-floor apartment in Naples when he meets Michela. The charming young woman, who has just moved to the facing apartment, has forgotten her keys and finds herself locked out. Cynical and grumpy, the retired lawyer who has been living estranged from the rest of the world, should normally leave her to her fate but he mellows under her spontaneous charm. He helps her, becomes friends not only with her but with her husband Fabio and their two children. For once, the self-declared misanthropist seems to be experiencing the long forgotten feeling of empathy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PMIXj8jHgeNKulzsJIo2HnvHi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439552'),
  ('632624544906319901', 'Tenderness of the Wolves', 1973, 'Horror, Crime, Drama', 'Ulli Lommel, Jürgen Jürges', 'Kurt Raab', 'Kurt Raab, Jeff Roden, Margit Carstensen, Ingrid Caven, Wolfgang Schenck, Brigitte Mira, Rainer Hauer, Barbara Bertram', null, 'A German serial killer preys on boys and young men during the so-called years of crisis between the wars. Based on the true story of Fritz Haarmann, aka the Butcher of Hanover and the Vampire of Hanover.', 'A German serial killer preys on boys and young men during the so-called years of crisis between the wars. Based on the true story of Fritz Haarmann, aka the Butcher of Hanover and the Vampire of Hanover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hArRqqGnyoHERNzKnbrOJGLKoKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127946'),
  ('1122262028040828167', 'Tenebre', 1982, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Michele Soavi, Luciano Tovoli, Dario Argento', 'Dario Argento', 'Anthony Franciosa, John Saxon, Daria Nicolodi, Giuliano Gemma, Christian Borromeo, Mirella D''Angelo, Veronica Lario, Ania Pieroni', 'NR', 'A razor-wielding serial killer is on the loose, murdering those around Peter Neal, an American mystery author in Italy to promote his newest novel.', 'A razor-wielding serial killer is on the loose, murdering those around Peter Neal, an American mystery author in Italy to promote his newest novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWNCyUX9sjtnhleqyw2W5ECijlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29702'),
  ('1147166140832439309', 'Tenement', 2024, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Sokyou Chea, Inrasothythep Neth, Jeremiah Overman', 'Sokyou Chea, Inrasothythep Neth', 'Thanet Thorn, Yoshihiko Hosoda, Sveng Socheata, Rous Mony, Katsuya Maiguma, Touch Narady, Sahrah Pich Manika, Sao Vandalis', null, 'Following her mother’s death, manga artist Soriya travels to her ancestral home in Phnom Penh, with hopes of reconnecting with her distant family and using the visit as inspiration for her work. All goes well initially. Renting an apartment in Metta, a rundown Khmer Rouge-era housing complex, her visit to her maternal relatives finds her welcomed with open arms. But Soriya’s waking hours in the apartment and its surroundings are punctuated by terrifying, bloody visions, almost as though she were a conduit for horrors of the past wanting to seep into the present.', 'Following her mother’s death, manga artist Soriya travels to her ancestral home in Phnom Penh, with hopes of reconnecting with her distant family and using the visit as inspiration for her work. All goes well initially. Renting an apartment in Metta, a rundown Khmer Rouge-era housing complex, her visit to her maternal relatives finds her welcomed with open arms. But Soriya’s waking hours in the apartment and its surroundings are punctuated by terrifying, bloody visions, almost as though she were a conduit for horrors of the past wanting to seep into the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVjZAx51QtHGtzvsbzvUZSWwHIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219522'),
  ('642122003789771503', 'Tenet', 2020, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Ilona Faustova, Emeri Abel, Matilde Matvere', 'Christopher Nolan', 'John David Washington, Robert Pattinson, Elizabeth Debicki, Kenneth Branagh, Dimple Kapadia, Michael Caine, Martin Donovan, Fiona Dourif', 'PG-13', 'Armed with only one word - Tenet - and fighting for the survival of the entire world, the Protagonist journeys through a twilight world of international espionage on a mission that will unfold in something beyond real time.', 'Armed with only one word - Tenet - and fighting for the survival of the entire world, the Protagonist journeys through a twilight world of international espionage on a mission that will unfold in something beyond real time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCIFMriQh8rvhxpN1IWGgvH0Tlg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577922'),
  ('692888411712308310', 'Tengo 17 años', 1964, 'Romance, Family, Drama, Comedy', 'José María Forqué, Mario Pacheco, Sinesio Isla', 'Jaime de Armiñán, Enrique Llovet, José María Forqué', 'Rocío Dúrcal, Pedro Osinaga, Roberto Font, Luis Peña, Luz Márquez, Luis Morris, Ricardo Ferrante, José Morales', null, 'A young girl decide to escape from home because her stepmother doesn´t like her. She finds a modest family that welcomes her as a family member. She learns how to live in lowliness and fall in love with David.', 'A young girl decide to escape from home because her stepmother doesn´t like her. She finds a modest family that welcomes her as a family member. She learns how to live in lowliness and fall in love with David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjPAHCVthRYcewyMJTnFzPUYsZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96019'),
  ('215287253343905187', 'Tennessee''s Partner', 1955, 'Western', 'Allan Dwan, John Alton', 'Milton Krims, D.D. Beauchamp, C. Graham Baker', 'John Payne, Ronald Reagan, Rhonda Fleming, Coleen Gray, Anthony Caruso, Morris Ankrum, Leo Gordon, Chubby Johnson', 'NR', 'A tough, womanizing high-stakes gambler known only as Tennessee has an uneasy relationship with Duchess, madam of a thinly-disguised bordello, and no other friends at all. But he''s saved from murder by a lonesome cowpoke (''My friends call me Cowpoke''), in town to meet his fiancée Goldie on the steamboat. When she arrives, there''s a mysterious undercurrent between Goldie and Tennessee, whose newfound friendship with Cowpoke is destined to be severely tried...', 'A tough, womanizing high-stakes gambler known only as Tennessee has an uneasy relationship with Duchess, madam of a thinly-disguised bordello, and no other friends at all. But he''s saved from murder by a lonesome cowpoke (''My friends call me Cowpoke''), in town to meet his fiancée Goldie on the steamboat. When she arrives, there''s a mysterious undercurrent between Goldie and Tennessee, whose newfound friendship with Cowpoke is destined to be severely tried...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRE9mahZWZVK3ELcLwXse0PE3wl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43325'),
