  ('257129010424344764', 'Tennis Racquet', 1949, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Doodles Weaver', 'NR', 'Two Goofys play a tennis match in typical Goofy style. The announcer sometimes has trouble following the action. The groundskeeper seems to always be present, trimming the grass, filling in holes (in one case with a tree), and delivering the oversized trophy.', 'Two Goofys play a tennis match in typical Goofy style. The announcer sometimes has trouble following the action. The groundskeeper seems to always be present, trimming the grass, filling in holes (in one case with a tree), and delivering the oversized trophy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wOjsdNXe3jHOJuOHo8LwPlTWZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67505'),
  ('14476936216822035', 'Tenor', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Claude Zidi Jr.', 'Claude Zidi Jr., Cyrille Droux, Raphaël Benoliel', 'MB14, Michèle Laroque, Guillaume Duhesme, Marie Oppert, Maéva El Aroussi, Louis de Lavignère, Roberto Alagna, Samir Decazza', null, 'While working part-time as a food deliveryman, Antoine, an aspiring young rapper from the suburbs of Paris, meets Mrs. Loiseau, an eminent teacher at the Paris Opéra. Stunned by the young man''s raw talent, she introduces him to the world of opera. As Antoine becomes one of Mrs. Loiseau''s students, he hides his new dream from his friends and family, fearing that they won’t understand – this double life burdens him... Somewhere in between the gilded and uptight Parisian upper-class, and the harsh yet free-spirited and familiar suburbs he grew up in, Antoine will have to find his own voice.', 'While working part-time as a food deliveryman, Antoine, an aspiring young rapper from the suburbs of Paris, meets Mrs. Loiseau, an eminent teacher at the Paris Opéra. Stunned by the young man''s raw talent, she introduces him to the world of opera. As Antoine becomes one of Mrs. Loiseau''s students, he hides his new dream from his friends and family, fearing that they won’t understand – this double life burdens him... Somewhere in between the gilded and uptight Parisian upper-class, and the harsh yet free-spirited and familiar suburbs he grew up in, Antoine will have to find his own voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14195Sv9rUHXJAuWbjFDtRQMUCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936074'),
  ('1017595620877078176', 'Tension', 1949, 'Thriller, Crime', 'John Berry, Harry Stradling Sr., George Rhein', 'Allen Rivkin', 'Richard Basehart, Audrey Totter, Cyd Charisse, Barry Sullivan, Lloyd Gough, Tom D''Andrea, William Conrad, Tito Renaldo', 'NR', 'Warren Quimby manages a drugstore while trying to keep his volatile wife, Claire, happy. However, when Claire leaves him for a liquor store salesman, Warren can no longer bear it. He decides to assume a new identity in order to murder his wife''s lover without leaving a trace. Along the way, his plans are complicated by an attractive neighbor, as well as a shocking discovery that opens up a new world of doubts and accusations.', 'Warren Quimby manages a drugstore while trying to keep his volatile wife, Claire, happy. However, when Claire leaves him for a liquor store salesman, Warren can no longer bear it. He decides to assume a new identity in order to murder his wife''s lover without leaving a trace. Along the way, his plans are complicated by an attractive neighbor, as well as a shocking discovery that opens up a new world of doubts and accusations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xhArxwGLDQyEccn7vmBT5BJc0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25900'),
  ('662195778483244419', 'Tension at Table Rock', 1956, 'Western, Drama', 'Charles Marquis Warren, James E. Casey, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Winston Miller', 'Richard Egan, Dorothy Malone, Cameron Mitchell, Billy Chapin, Royal Dano, Edward Andrews, John Dehner, DeForest Kelley', null, 'When the owner of a stagecoach station is killed, a gunman takes his place.', 'When the owner of a stagecoach station is killed, a gunman takes his place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3PEW2Ag8WC5ExnnlG0Y2i3YIDJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74527'),
  ('73981881514987504', 'Tensione superficiale', 2019, 'Drama', 'Giovanni Aloi', 'Giovanni Aloi', 'Cristiana Dell''Anna, Francesca Sanapo, Benno Steinegger, Leo Gapp, Philipp Peter Heidegger, Katja Lechthaler, Hannes Perkmann, Katia Fellin', null, 'A young Italian mother is living a life of part-time prostitution in Austria, unbeknownst to her friends and family. Everything seems to be going well until her secret is discovered.', 'A young Italian mother is living a life of part-time prostitution in Austria, unbeknownst to her friends and family. Everything seems to be going well until her secret is discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TZiJLO6XlWvGDE4bqAEDnkgtIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661235'),
  ('377645793284137719', 'Tentação na Cama', 1984, null, 'Ody Fraga', null, 'David Cardoso, Alvamar Taddei, Marli Mendes, Simone Magalhães, Roque Rodrigues, Evelize Oliver, Dannys Fraga, Tallyta Cardoso', null, 'Roberto is a successful businessman. Persecuted by the police, he will have a dilemma: give a secret or keep on running.', 'Roberto is a successful businessman. Persecuted by the police, he will have a dilemma: give a secret or keep on running.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pf40LPuIEVx0KrH0dOcSaHGc8uK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238697'),
  ('185226050049287861', 'Tentacles', 1977, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Ovidio G. Assonitis, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli, Peter Shepherd', 'Steven W. Carabatsos, Jerome Max, Tito Carpi', 'John Huston, Shelley Winters, Bo Hopkins, Henry Fonda, Delia Boccardo, Cesare Danova, Alan Boyd, Sherry Buchanan', 'PG', 'Several people disappear from and at the sea. Their bodies are found gnawed to the skeleton, even the marrow is missing. The scientists have no idea which animal could do such things. Dr. Turner begins to suspect that the company which builds a tunnel beneath the bay might have poisoned the environment and caused an octopus to mutate to giant dimensions...', 'Several people disappear from and at the sea. Their bodies are found gnawed to the skeleton, even the marrow is missing. The scientists have no idea which animal could do such things. Dr. Turner begins to suspect that the company which builds a tunnel beneath the bay might have poisoned the environment and caused an octopus to mutate to giant dimensions...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VFEXcv6yp4BgEFRgBIcDJ5V0TI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49158'),
  ('515342739458819480', 'Tentacles', 2021, 'Horror, Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Sing Howe Yam, Clara Aranovich', null, 'Dana Drori, Casey Deidrick, Kasey Elise, Evan Williams, Dan Aid, Johnny Ramey, Cathy Vu, Larry Fields', 'NR', 'A young Los Angeles couple Tara and Sam fall head over heels into a new romance, entwining their lives—until their intimacy transforms into something terrifying.', 'A young Los Angeles couple Tara and Sam fall head over heels into a new romance, entwining their lives—until their intimacy transforms into something terrifying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRfcH0jg9X8czKJhXCnny45NSWt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786300'),
  ('789730932528374582', 'Tenth Avenue Angel', 1948, 'Drama', 'Roy Rowland, Robert Surtees', 'Eleanore Griffin, Harry Ruskin, Craig Rice', 'Margaret O''Brien, Angela Lansbury, George Murphy, Phyllis Thaxter, Warner Anderson, Rhys Williams, Barry Nelson, Connie Gilchrist', 'NR', 'Flavia''s been told that her Aunt Susan''s fiancé, Steve, has been on a trip around the world, but in truth he''s finished his prison term. Steve wonders how he can make some money and is approached by his old associates. When Flavia discovers the truth about Steve, she loses all faith in her family and in God, and it will take a miracle to restore Flavia''s belief and keep Steve out of trouble.', 'Flavia''s been told that her Aunt Susan''s fiancé, Steve, has been on a trip around the world, but in truth he''s finished his prison term. Steve wonders how he can make some money and is approached by his old associates. When Flavia discovers the truth about Steve, she loses all faith in her family and in God, and it will take a miracle to restore Flavia''s belief and keep Steve out of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMP7SHVJuxEUBBbMTbb408VbEpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151211'),
  ('668384518681555963', 'Tenure', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Mike Million, Steve Yedlin', 'Mike Million', 'Luke Wilson, Gretchen Mol, David Koechner, Sasha Alexander, Bob Gunton, Rosemarie DeWitt, Michael Cudlitz, Andy Daly', 'R', 'Despite his outstanding intellect, associate professor Charlie Thurber is a chronic underachiever and has never received university tenure. Aided by his nutty best friend, Charlie launches a final effort to make the grade at Gray College. But a beautiful new teacher whose ascending star threatens to eclipse him shakes up Charlie''s plans.', 'Despite his outstanding intellect, associate professor Charlie Thurber is a chronic underachiever and has never received university tenure. Aided by his nutty best friend, Charlie launches a final effort to make the grade at Gray College. But a beautiful new teacher whose ascending star threatens to eclipse him shakes up Charlie''s plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yntsMAC3bMpncw5n6fsYNJRHTEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33215'),
  ('6951911961480457', 'Teo''s Journey', 2008, null, 'Walter Doehner', 'Walter Doehner, Leo Eduardo Mendoza, Silvana Zuanetti', 'Andrés Márquez, Erick Cañete, Damián Alcázar, Silverio Palacios, Dolores Heredia, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Dagoberto Gama, Raúl Méndez', null, 'Separated from his father after illegally crossing the Mexico-U.S. border, young Teo and his new friend, Chuy, set off on a dangerous quest across the desert to find his dad in this touching tale of courage, adventure and friendship.', 'Separated from his father after illegally crossing the Mexico-U.S. border, young Teo and his new friend, Chuy, set off on a dangerous quest across the desert to find his dad in this touching tale of courage, adventure and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXoZCwgFYjMCHt41nzpTiL6KkNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318522'),
  ('992302348153002422', 'Tepepa', 1969, 'Western', 'Giulio Petroni, Francisco Marín', 'Ivan Della Mea, Franco Solinas', 'Tomas Milian, Orson Welles, John Steiner, Ángel Ortiz, José Torres, Luciano Casamonica, Annamaria Lanciaprima, Paloma Cela', null, 'The Mexican guerilla leader Tepepa and his gang fight against the chief of police, Cascorro.', 'The Mexican guerilla leader Tepepa and his gang fight against the chief of police, Cascorro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGhH5hd0wqfWLw1P5Xr7ozKoZZ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81270'),
  ('524333958437809068', 'Teppanyaki', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Siu Yuen-Chi, Michael Hui Koon-Man', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Sally Yeh, Frances Yip, Lo Hoi-Pang, Paul Che Biu-Law, Chow Mei-Yee, Hui Ying-Sau, Yue Tau-Wan', null, 'Mr. Wong (Michael Hui) is the chief chef in a Teppanyaki restaurant. His overbearing wife and sadistic father-in-law make his home life a misery, so he spends all day dreaming about his dream girl, Sissy (Sally Yeh). When she comes into the restaurant, Wong seizes the opportunity and arranges to take her on a tour of the Paradise Island. Unfortunately, his wife and her friend go with him.', 'Mr. Wong (Michael Hui) is the chief chef in a Teppanyaki restaurant. His overbearing wife and sadistic father-in-law make his home life a misery, so he spends all day dreaming about his dream girl, Sissy (Sally Yeh). When she comes into the restaurant, Wong seizes the opportunity and arranges to take her on a tour of the Paradise Island. Unfortunately, his wife and her friend go with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKVdjwiSiHRNSaXvcdgc7qSYSDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198548'),
  ('439946031473536069', 'Tequila Body Shots', 1999, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Tony Shyu, Nicole Burke', 'Tony Shyu', 'Joey Lawrence, Dru Mouser, Jennifer Lyons, Nathan Anderson, Josh Marchette, Rob Benedict, Henry Darrow, Senta Moses', 'R', 'Things take a strange turn for Johnny and his two buddies when he gets mind reading powers from a medicine man''s tequila while on a road trip in Mexico. Johnny must race to save them from the clutches of evil forces... at a deadly party in hell!', 'Things take a strange turn for Johnny and his two buddies when he gets mind reading powers from a medicine man''s tequila while on a road trip in Mexico. Johnny must race to save them from the clutches of evil forces... at a deadly party in hell!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QUrrz7gEGfHkuB9VteQ7OTUW9q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71925'),
  ('267813246059975392', 'Tequila Re-Pasado', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Gabriela Tagliavini, Isi Sarfati', 'Ricardo Avilés, Joan Vives, Gerald B. Fillmore', 'Sebastián Zurita, Paulina Gaitán, Ludwika Paleta, Miguel Rodarte, Héctor Jiménez, Adal Ramones, Mauricio “El Diablito” Barrientos', null, 'A workaholic must outwit his multiplying clones after a magical tequila travels him back in time – again and again – in order to make things right with his family.', 'A workaholic must outwit his multiplying clones after a magical tequila travels him back in time – again and again – in order to make things right with his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7onQmk5ZzUjx6SEAiqILWQFTaYC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736554'),
  ('102809818920062818', 'Tequila Sunrise', 1988, 'Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Robert Towne, Conrad Hall, John Toll', 'Robert Towne', 'Mel Gibson, Michelle Pfeiffer, Kurt Russell, Raúl Juliá, J.T. Walsh, Arliss Howard, Arye Gross, Gabriel Damon', 'R', 'In a seaside California town, best friends Mac and Nick are on opposite sides of the law. Mac is a former drug dealer trying to clean up his act, while Nick is a high-profile detective trying to take down a Mexican drug lord named Carlos. Soon Nick''s loyalties are put to the test when he begins an affair with restaurateur Jo Ann -- a love interest of Mac''s -- unwittingly leading his friend into a police-orchestrated trap.', 'In a seaside California town, best friends Mac and Nick are on opposite sides of the law. Mac is a former drug dealer trying to clean up his act, while Nick is a high-profile detective trying to take down a Mexican drug lord named Carlos. Soon Nick''s loyalties are put to the test when he begins an affair with restaurateur Jo Ann -- a love interest of Mac''s -- unwittingly leading his friend into a police-orchestrated trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LoG0GL5N5e7zvvXezwwGnUfRHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10396'),
  ('760070499840593534', 'Ter', 2020, null, 'Maria Luisa Santos', null, null, null, 'A live-in house maid struggles to make a difficult decision while trying to hide her distress from the girl she loves and cares for.', 'A live-in house maid struggles to make a difficult decision while trying to hide her distress from the girl she loves and cares for.', null, 'tmdb:movie:688404'),
  ('1128573317757097574', 'Tér', 1971, 'Documentary', 'István Szabó', null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1221906'),
  ('341346099644045420', 'Tercer grado', 2015, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Geoffrey Cowper', 'Jesús Lloveras, Geoffrey Cowper', 'Jesús Lloveras, Sara Casasnovas, Javier Beltrán, Frank Feys, Miko Jarry, Ferran Lahoz, Johnny Melville, Jordi Llovet', null, 'On his first weekend parole alfer five years in prison, Mark Rodriguez witnesses the armed robbery of a security van. His brothers critical situation and his own feelings of remorse will lead him to take desperate measures. His only help will be a young and attractive stripper he met the night before.', 'On his first weekend parole alfer five years in prison, Mark Rodriguez witnesses the armed robbery of a security van. His brothers critical situation and his own feelings of remorse will lead him to take desperate measures. His only help will be a young and attractive stripper he met the night before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwElFU07oDdeVdhbOQfK1Pkee1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321557'),
  ('148089599142468872', 'Tere Bin Laden', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Abhishek Sharma', null, 'Ali Zafar, Pradhuman Singh, Sugandha Garg, Nikhil Ratnaparkhi, Piyush Mishra, Rajendra Sethi', null, 'Ali Hassan (Ali Zafar), a reporter with a downmarket TV channel in Karachi, is keen to go to USA for a better life, but his visa has been refused six times in seven years. In desperation, he gets hold of an Osama Bin Laden look alike and makes a fake Osama tape which he sells to the owner of his channel to raise money for a false identity, a new passport and better luck with US visa. As one can expect, it is far from smooth sailing for him and his friends, as they get into a series of comic situations.', 'Ali Hassan (Ali Zafar), a reporter with a downmarket TV channel in Karachi, is keen to go to USA for a better life, but his visa has been refused six times in seven years. In desperation, he gets hold of an Osama Bin Laden look alike and makes a fake Osama tape which he sells to the owner of his channel to raise money for a false identity, a new passport and better luck with US visa. As one can expect, it is far from smooth sailing for him and his friends, as they get into a series of comic situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9L1SPbw0UCvEQ36qYote2lVfTm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42323'),
  ('443053260723548280', 'Tere Bin Laden Dead or Alive', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Abhishek Sharma', 'Abhishek Sharma, Pradhuman Singh, Neha Sharma', 'Maniesh Paul, Pradhuman Singh, Mia Uyeda, Piyush Mishra, Iman Crosson, Ali Zafar, Sugandha Garg, Sikandar Kher', null, 'A Bollywood director''s plan to use an Osama Bin Laden look-alike in an upcoming film runs afoul of a Taliban arms dealer''s desire to show that the terrorist is still alive.', 'A Bollywood director''s plan to use an Osama Bin Laden look-alike in an upcoming film runs afoul of a Taliban arms dealer''s desire to show that the terrorist is still alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgph2hdk5kyWUWzd5TCEDKrsE1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384344'),
  ('185135191096420734', 'Tere Ghar Ke Samne', 1963, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Vijay Anand, V Ratra, Prabhu Dayal', 'Vijay Anand', 'Dev Anand, Nutan, Harindranath Chattopadhyay, Om Prakash, Rashid Khan, Pratima Devi, Zareen Katrak, Praveen Chowdhury', null, 'Rakesh, a successful architect, falls in love with a girl: Sujata whose father happens to be his own father''s business rival. Sujata''s father unwittingly assigns Rakesh the contract for building his house. This sets the stage for an entertaining story about the love between two individuals and their efforts to reconcile their families.', 'Rakesh, a successful architect, falls in love with a girl: Sujata whose father happens to be his own father''s business rival. Sujata''s father unwittingly assigns Rakesh the contract for building his house. This sets the stage for an entertaining story about the love between two individuals and their efforts to reconcile their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9f3owGrinCLsUHGlCdtDO7Merm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82903'),
  ('943617047297727108', 'Tere Ishk Mein', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Aanand L. Rai, Tushar Kanti Ray, Rahul Shanklya', 'Neeraj Yadav, Himanshu Sharma', 'Dhanush, Kriti Sanon, Prakash Raj, Tota Roy Chowdhury, Priyanshu Painyuli, Paramvir Singh Cheema, Vineet Kumar Singh, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub', null, 'A psychology student attempts to rehabilitate a volatile young man, before evolving into a doomed romance.', 'A psychology student attempts to rehabilitate a volatile young man, before evolving into a doomed romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FsHlW9z7gDhDE4EXAE2WcXUVQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142921'),
  ('909435195248706730', 'Tere Naal Love Ho Gaya', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Mandeep Kumar', 'Abhijeet Sandhu', 'Riteish Deshmukh, Genelia D''Souza, Om Puri, Diljit Dosanjh, Smita Jaykar, Tinnu Anand, Veena Malik', null, 'In a quaint village of Haryana lives Miny, a free-spirited tomboy who instantly wins your heart with her bubbly personality. Her father, Bhatti, runs an auto-rickshaw business and is adamant to marry her off against her liking to Sunny. The male protagonist Viren, is a humble and ambitious rickshaw driver working for Miny''s father. Bhatti, insecure about Viren''s success, sells of all the rickshaws where Viren had carefully stashed his life savings. In an attempt to recover his money from Bhatti, Viren storms into Miny''s engagement with fury. This gives Miny the perfect opportunity to escape her marriage and so she stages a kidnap. However, the kidnap goes all wrong and she and Viren land up in Viren''s family mansion. Eventually, Miny''s father arrives with the ransom that she had asked for and takes her back home. Back in Punjab, while she is being married off to Sunny...', 'In a quaint village of Haryana lives Miny, a free-spirited tomboy who instantly wins your heart with her bubbly personality. Her father, Bhatti, runs an auto-rickshaw business and is adamant to marry her off against her liking to Sunny. The male protagonist Viren, is a humble and ambitious rickshaw driver working for Miny''s father. Bhatti, insecure about Viren''s success, sells of all the rickshaws where Viren had carefully stashed his life savings. In an attempt to recover his money from Bhatti, Viren storms into Miny''s engagement with fury. This gives Miny the perfect opportunity to escape her marriage and so she stages a kidnap. However, the kidnap goes all wrong and she and Viren land up in Viren''s family mansion. Eventually, Miny''s father arrives with the ransom that she had asked for and takes her back home. Back in Punjab, while she is being married off to Sunny...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Xk8g7AyNrG6kbamqoyDW9kB8n3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85043'),
