  ('990752619365067538', 'Teresa', 2023, 'Drama', 'Paula Ortiz, Rafa García', 'Paula Ortiz, Javier García Arredondo', 'Blanca Portillo, Asier Etxeandia, Greta Fernández, Luis Bermejo, Consuelo Trujillo, Claudia Traisac, Julia de Castro, Urko Olazábal', null, 'Teresa, a Carmelite nun, reformer, and mystic of the Roman Catholic Church, has been ostracized for her beliefs. She will meet with the Inquisitor. All kinds of decisions regarding her are possible.', 'Teresa, a Carmelite nun, reformer, and mystic of the Roman Catholic Church, has been ostracized for her beliefs. She will meet with the Inquisitor. All kinds of decisions regarding her are possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYQSgvb9ep1YT8ae3b3HIKk3QxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:710157'),
  ('323944027965618070', 'Teresa the Thief', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Di Palma, Gerard Dreyfus, Gabriele Polverosi', 'Furio Scarpelli, Dacia Maraini, Agenore Incrocci', 'Monica Vitti, Stefano Satta Flores, Isa Danieli, Carlo Delle Piane, Michele Placido, Valeriano Vallone, Luciana Turina, Anna Bonaiuto', null, 'Teresa gets her first taste of crime -- and its consequences -- when, during World War II, she is nabbed for robbing an apartment. But being poor and perpetually starving, the pretty petty thief doesn''t give up her quest for ill-gotten gains and soon turns to pick-pocketing. Despite her questionable thieving skills, the bumbling crook tries scheme after scheme, pilfering from strangers and dodging the law as she searches for a way to fund an adequate meal.', 'Teresa gets her first taste of crime -- and its consequences -- when, during World War II, she is nabbed for robbing an apartment. But being poor and perpetually starving, the pretty petty thief doesn''t give up her quest for ill-gotten gains and soon turns to pick-pocketing. Despite her questionable thieving skills, the bumbling crook tries scheme after scheme, pilfering from strangers and dodging the law as she searches for a way to fund an adequate meal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Arh7rJGnRXVET2bNrrFoZ2eiuX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210368'),
  ('951695288536851664', 'Teresa Venerdì', 1941, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Vittorio De Sica, Paolo Moffa, Vincenzo Seratrice', 'Gherardo Gherardi, Margherita Maglione, Vittorio De Sica', 'Vittorio De Sica, Adriana Benetti, Irasema Dilián, Anna Magnani, Clara Auteri Pepe, Zaira La Fratta, Olga Vittoria Gentilli, Elvira Betrone', null, 'A comedy of errors where floundering pediatrician Pietro takes a job as an orphanage health inspector to pay for the debts of his high-spending girlfriend Loletta, only to end up mistakenly engaged with Lilli, the daughter of a wealthy businessman, and pursued by lovestruck 18-year-old orphan Teresa Venerdì.', 'A comedy of errors where floundering pediatrician Pietro takes a job as an orphanage health inspector to pay for the debts of his high-spending girlfriend Loletta, only to end up mistakenly engaged with Lilli, the daughter of a wealthy businessman, and pursued by lovestruck 18-year-old orphan Teresa Venerdì.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onUFh5eVd4aOpUAkdQfZjrMNynA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60116'),
  ('782177065222949485', 'Teresa''s Tattoo', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Julie Cypher, Sven Kirsten', 'Georgie Huntington', 'Adrienne Shelly, C. Thomas Howell, Nancy McKeon, Casey Siemaszko, Jonathan Silverman, Lou Diamond Phillips, Anthony Clark, Diedrich Bader', 'R', 'Mathematician Teresa just wanted to study during the College spring break. But her friends, who want her to live a little, drag her out to parties. The next thing she knows, she has been drugged, kidnapped, made a redhead, tattooed, and wearing leather?!? Her captors seem to be the most inept crooks ever. They seem to have a plan, if only she could figure out why it involves her.', 'Mathematician Teresa just wanted to study during the College spring break. But her friends, who want her to live a little, drag her out to parties. The next thing she knows, she has been drugged, kidnapped, made a redhead, tattooed, and wearing leather?!? Her captors seem to be the most inept crooks ever. They seem to have a plan, if only she could figure out why it involves her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWLqpPPVBb8QI2jZzzCr4uXSqvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166221'),
  ('610991810790224924', 'Teresa''s Trip', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Patricia Cardoso, Sergio Iván Castaño, Ricardo Trujillo', 'Dago García', 'César Mora, Tatiana Rentería, Ella Becerra, Margalida Castro, Javier Ramírez, Daniela García, David Ojalvo, Jason Chad Roth', null, 'Teresa is an artificial intelligence device that comes from the United States to Colombia to be tested in a real world and with a very particular family: Los Rico. Teresa arrives just at Christmas time, where between novenas, fritters and custard, she will discover deep connections with her new family.', 'Teresa is an artificial intelligence device that comes from the United States to Colombia to be tested in a real world and with a very particular family: Los Rico. Teresa arrives just at Christmas time, where between novenas, fritters and custard, she will discover deep connections with her new family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuX6mIaaEt20mXoXYX5WtF4LJTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489701'),
