  ('410515668316417298', 'Teri Baaton Mein Aisa Uljha Jiya', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Laxman Utekar, Vaibhav Vishant, Aradhana Sah', 'Aradhana Sah, Amit Joshi', 'Shahid Kapoor, Kriti Sanon, Dimple Kapadia, Dharmendra, Ashish Verma, Anubha Fatehpuria, Rakesh Bedi, Rajesh Kumar', null, 'A robotics engineer searching for his perfect partner finds himself falling in love with a human-like android.', 'A robotics engineer searching for his perfect partner finds himself falling in love with a human-like android.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwsBpnwmMO0xtIgxvCrViJgZhVj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1110390'),
  ('726340631953517774', 'Teri Meri Kahaani', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kunal Kohli, Venetia Suchdev, Sunil Patel', 'Robin Bhatt, Kunal Kohli', 'Shahid Kapoor, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Omar Khan, Prachi Desai, Neha Sharma, Vrajesh Hirjee, Shankar Sachdev, Surendra Pal', null, 'A couple lives though three different lives over different eras as destiny conspires to make them fall in love with each other, against all odds.', 'A couple lives though three different lives over different eras as destiny conspires to make them fall in love with each other, against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUo1qX8RklC3FfKnkYAXffSAQ1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120942'),
  ('884706787517064471', 'Terkel in Trouble', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Stefan Fjeldmark, Thorbjørn Christoffersen, Kresten Vestbjerg Andersen', 'Mette Heeno', 'Anders Matthesen, Kim Matthesen', 'NR', '6th-grader Terkel begins experiencing a streak of bad luck after sitting on a black spider. His teacher dies and is replaced by the strange Justin. At home, Terkel''s Uncle Stewart erupts in sporadic fits of rage, and at school Terkel is bullied by two boys after they learn that fat Doris likes him. On a school camping trip, Terkel begins receiving death threats and must figure out who wants to kill him.', '6th-grader Terkel begins experiencing a streak of bad luck after sitting on a black spider. His teacher dies and is replaced by the strange Justin. At home, Terkel''s Uncle Stewart erupts in sporadic fits of rage, and at school Terkel is bullied by two boys after they learn that fat Doris likes him. On a school camping trip, Terkel begins receiving death threats and must figure out who wants to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewylxRYsBcqjYvbeAKryNr1JiBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10797'),
  ('607101684206687723', 'Term Life', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Action, Mystery', 'Peter Billingsley, Darrin Prescott, Roberto Schaefer', 'Andy Lieberman', 'Vince Vaughn, Hailee Steinfeld, Bill Paxton, Jonathan Banks, Mike Epps, Jordi Mollà, Shea Whigham, Jon Favreau', 'R', 'If Nick Barrow can stay alive for 21 days, he''ll die happy. Everyone Nick knows wants him dead; Mob bosses, contract killers, and dirty cops. Performing the last act of a desperate man, Nick takes out a million dollar insurance policy on himself, payable to his estranged daughter. The problem? The policy doesn''t take effect for 21 days. Nick knows they''ll be lucky to be alive for twenty-one hours.', 'If Nick Barrow can stay alive for 21 days, he''ll die happy. Everyone Nick knows wants him dead; Mob bosses, contract killers, and dirty cops. Performing the last act of a desperate man, Nick takes out a million dollar insurance policy on himself, payable to his estranged daughter. The problem? The policy doesn''t take effect for 21 days. Nick knows they''ll be lucky to be alive for twenty-one hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oAVYDh7RHW3wzQWbGsRB7RFE6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257440'),
  ('49694782403634804', 'Term of Trial', 1962, 'Drama', 'Peter Glenville, Oswald Morris, Gerry O''Hara', 'Peter Glenville', 'Laurence Olivier, Simone Signoret, Sarah Miles, Terence Stamp, Hugh Griffith, Roland Culver, Dudley Foster, Frank Pettingell', null, 'A schoolteacher plagued by alcoholism and his refusal to serve in World War II, Graham Weir inspires contempt in almost everyone around him, including his bitter wife, Anna. When the lovely young Shirley Taylor, one of Weir''s students, falls for her unfortunate instructor, he is tempted and flattered but turns down her advances. Taylor''s subsequent actions make Weir''s life even more complicated.', 'A schoolteacher plagued by alcoholism and his refusal to serve in World War II, Graham Weir inspires contempt in almost everyone around him, including his bitter wife, Anna. When the lovely young Shirley Taylor, one of Weir''s students, falls for her unfortunate instructor, he is tempted and flattered but turns down her advances. Taylor''s subsequent actions make Weir''s life even more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5b4vXeIzUqEPbUz92los8qUNmsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84164'),
  ('668731671013513507', 'Terminal', 2015, 'Drama', 'Tetsuo Shinohara', 'Shino Sakuragi', 'Koichi Sato, Tsubasa Honda, Shido Nakamura, Masato Wada, Takuma Otoo, Shigeru Izumiya, Machiko Ono', null, 'The masterpiece of Shino Sakuragi, who won the 149th Naoki Prize for "HOTEL ROYAL" in 2013, is now a motion picture. A lawyer burdened with an inexpiable sin, and an accused woman who seals her past and keeps it a secret. In Kushiro, Hokkaido, the pair who chose a faraway town as the terminal station of their lives encounters and develops a moving drama by starting new lives. Koichi Sato enters new territory his performance, while Tsubasa Honda plays a serious character which creates a new image for herself. Machiko Ono, Shidou Nakamura, Shigeru Izumiya and other talented cast members join in the film.', 'The masterpiece of Shino Sakuragi, who won the 149th Naoki Prize for "HOTEL ROYAL" in 2013, is now a motion picture. A lawyer burdened with an inexpiable sin, and an accused woman who seals her past and keeps it a secret. In Kushiro, Hokkaido, the pair who chose a faraway town as the terminal station of their lives encounters and develops a moving drama by starting new lives. Koichi Sato enters new territory his performance, while Tsubasa Honda plays a serious character which creates a new image for herself. Machiko Ono, Shidou Nakamura, Shigeru Izumiya and other talented cast members join in the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npugP6BrxNWAKT0oZQKu8okOjgA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365949'),
  ('1147550430290840527', 'Terminal', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'Vaughn Stein, Christopher Ross, Riemer Szandra', 'Vaughn Stein', 'Margot Robbie, Simon Pegg, Dexter Fletcher, Max Irons, Mike Myers, Katarina Čas, Nick Moran, Les Loveday', 'NR', 'In the dark heart of a sprawling, anonymous city, two assassins carry out a sinister mission, a teacher battles a fatal illness, and an enigmatic janitor and a curious waitress lead dangerous double lives. Murderous consequences unravel in the dead of night, as their lives intertwine at the hands of a mysterious criminal mastermind who is hell-bent on revenge.', 'In the dark heart of a sprawling, anonymous city, two assassins carry out a sinister mission, a teacher battles a fatal illness, and an enigmatic janitor and a curious waitress lead dangerous double lives. Murderous consequences unravel in the dead of night, as their lives intertwine at the hands of a mysterious criminal mastermind who is hell-bent on revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi7pA3lL6Wb78p6Y6PgWoHDMjrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385332'),
  ('823143638926710233', 'Terminal Exposure', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Nico Mastorakis, Cliff Ralke', 'Kirk Ellis, Nico Mastorakis, Roger Tweten', 'Mark Hennessy, Scott King, Hope Marie Carlton, Steve Donmyer, John Vernon, Ted Lange, Joe Estevez, Patrick St. Esprit', 'R', 'Two beach combing-shutterbugs accidentally capture a murder on film. Now detectives, the boys set out to capture a murderess shot only from behind, with a rose tattoo on her behind. Fun in the sun turns dangerous when they end up shooting bullets instead of film.', 'Two beach combing-shutterbugs accidentally capture a murder on film. Now detectives, the boys set out to capture a murderess shot only from behind, with a rose tattoo on her behind. Fun in the sun turns dangerous when they end up shooting bullets instead of film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MUIvguwtzTEBbKtmrdvmlwNcFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226731'),
  ('803282010233015419', 'Terminal Invasion', 2002, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Sean S. Cunningham, Rudolf Blaháček', 'Lewis Abernathy', 'Bruce Campbell, Chase Masterson, Jason Jones, C. David Johnson, Kedar Brown, Andrew Tarbet, Sarah Lafleur, Marcia Bennett', 'R', 'Aliens in human disguise commandeer a rural airport during a snowstorm. To survive, the people trapped inside must determine which of their own is not of this Earth.', 'Aliens in human disguise commandeer a rural airport during a snowstorm. To survive, the people trapped inside must determine which of their own is not of this Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxJByxfFFSqAsWQeTPL6e0UduB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40217'),
  ('927805407049022458', 'Terminal Island', 1973, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Stephanie Rothman, John Broderick, Daniel Lacambre', 'Stephanie Rothman, Charles S. Swartz, James Barnett', 'Don Marshall, Phyllis Davis, Ena Hartman, Marta Kristen, Barbara Leigh, Randy Boone, Sean Kenney, Tom Selleck', 'R', 'After the U.S. Supreme Court banishes the death penalty, California decides to exile all convicted murderers to the remote island of San Bruno, overseen by a tyrannical camp leader who forces all female inmates into sex slavery.', 'After the U.S. Supreme Court banishes the death penalty, California decides to exile all convicted murderers to the remote island of San Bruno, overseen by a tyrannical camp leader who forces all female inmates into sex slavery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOn8fA4w2K6MKkRD4fZ6sJOQGJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91618'),
  ('26642365810463259', 'Terminal Justice', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Rick King', 'Frederick Bailey, Wynne McLaughlin', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Chris Sarandon, Peter Coyote, Kari Wührer, Barry Flatman, Tod Thawley, Barry Yourgrau, Catherine Blythe', 'R', 'In 2008 cybersex can only be surpassed by one thing: Cloned women, especially created for their clients. This puts Pamela Travis, a famous and much sought-after cybersex star in great danger - Dr. Vivyan, scientist and genius in the field of biotechnology wants her DNA to clone her for his many customers. Sergeant Bobby Chase is assigned to protect her, but can''t prevent her from being kidnapped. In order to free Pamela, Chase has to risk his life in a deadly virtual reality game called "Hellraiser"', 'In 2008 cybersex can only be surpassed by one thing: Cloned women, especially created for their clients. This puts Pamela Travis, a famous and much sought-after cybersex star in great danger - Dr. Vivyan, scientist and genius in the field of biotechnology wants her DNA to clone her for his many customers. Sergeant Bobby Chase is assigned to protect her, but can''t prevent her from being kidnapped. In order to free Pamela, Chase has to risk his life in a deadly virtual reality game called "Hellraiser"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OMWKkCeqpge2wGbdAqPFJOb7i1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68115'),
  ('975020166724497891', 'Terminal USA', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jon Moritsugu, Todd Verow', 'Jon Moritsugu', 'Jon Moritsugu, Amy Davis, Jenny Woo, Victor of Aquitaine, Sharon Omi, Ken Narasaki, Lenny Lang, Gregg Turkington', null, 'In a Japanese-American family, the mother is stealing the terminally ill grandpa''s morphine, the airhead sister is having sex with the family lawyer, one brother gets perfect grades but is hiding a secret gay love of skinheads, and the other brother is a junkie. Over the course of one evening, the family falls apart due to their bizarre behaviour.', 'In a Japanese-American family, the mother is stealing the terminally ill grandpa''s morphine, the airhead sister is having sex with the family lawyer, one brother gets perfect grades but is hiding a secret gay love of skinheads, and the other brother is a junkie. Over the course of one evening, the family falls apart due to their bizarre behaviour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgiqckYBxuM4fOQQwZy4nKMnTum.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183386'),
  ('34489873369312920', 'Terminal Voyage', 1994, 'Science Fiction', 'Rick Jacobson, John B. Aronson', 'Mark Evan Schwartz', 'Steven Bauer, Emma Samms, Brenda Bakke, Cliff DeYoung, Ming-Na Wen, Alan Rachins, Gregory McKinney, Lisa Boyle', 'R', 'It is 2035 A.D. and the final countdown has begun for a voyage that will reach across the vastness of outer space - to explore the nearest Earth-Like planet. An international crew has been placed in cryogenic suspended animation for the journey. But a century later, they awake to find that things have gone horribly wrong.', 'It is 2035 A.D. and the final countdown has begun for a voyage that will reach across the vastness of outer space - to explore the nearest Earth-Like planet. An international crew has been placed in cryogenic suspended animation for the journey. But a century later, they awake to find that things have gone horribly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oOwjJOrjKtef2ArrYkqQ7OJxta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183013'),
  ('933433957189580859', 'Termination Point', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jason Bourque, C. Kim Miles', 'Peter Sullivan', 'Jason Priestley, Lou Diamond Phillips, Garwin Sanford, Gary Hudson, Stefanie von Pfetten, Erin Karpluk, Michael Eklund, Bradley Stryker', 'PG-13', 'Top secret government experiments with time travel have been shut down and declared as too dangerous to continue. The lead scientist has disappeared with the technology and a government manhunt is underway. When his name appears on an airline manifest after the flight has departed, the government orders the plane to turn back. But the plane drops from the radar, disappearing into thin air! As special agents try to locate the plane, scientists must deal with the repercussions from the time ripples that threaten to destroy the Earth.', 'Top secret government experiments with time travel have been shut down and declared as too dangerous to continue. The lead scientist has disappeared with the technology and a government manhunt is underway. When his name appears on an airline manifest after the flight has departed, the government orders the plane to turn back. But the plane drops from the radar, disappearing into thin air! As special agents try to locate the plane, scientists must deal with the repercussions from the time ripples that threaten to destroy the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTuui1fN2FkfD9p9gyEn8C6v1xS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55914'),
  ('311677480278993292', 'Terminator 2: Judgment Day', 1991, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Adam Greenberg, James Cameron, Mike Benson', 'James Cameron, William Wisher', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Linda Hamilton, Edward Furlong, Robert Patrick, Earl Boen, Joe Morton, S. Epatha Merkerson, Castulo Guerra', 'R', 'Ten years after the events of the original, a reprogrammed T-800 is sent back in time to protect young John Connor from the shape-shifting T-1000. Together with his mother Sarah, he fights to stop Skynet from triggering a nuclear apocalypse.', 'Ten years after the events of the original, a reprogrammed T-800 is sent back in time to protect young John Connor from the shape-shifting T-1000. Together with his mother Sarah, he fights to stop Skynet from triggering a nuclear apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFTVD4XoWQTcg7wdyJKa8PEds5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280'),
  ('228863865008641189', 'Terminator 3: Rise of the Machines', 2003, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jonathan Mostow, Don Burgess, Ben Seresin', 'John Brancato, Michael Ferris', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Nick Stahl, Claire Danes, Kristanna Loken, Earl Boen, David Andrews, Carolyn Hennesy, Jay Acovone', 'R', 'It''s been 10 years since John Connor saved Earth from Judgment Day, and he''s now living under the radar, steering clear of using anything Skynet can trace. That is, until he encounters T-X, a robotic assassin ordered to finish what T-1000 started. Good thing Connor''s former nemesis, the Terminator, is back to aid the now-adult Connor … just like he promised.', 'It''s been 10 years since John Connor saved Earth from Judgment Day, and he''s now living under the radar, steering clear of using anything Skynet can trace. That is, until he encounters T-X, a robotic assassin ordered to finish what T-1000 started. Good thing Connor''s former nemesis, the Terminator, is back to aid the now-adult Connor … just like he promised.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvsoLAclNfpyJSp73TiGKwZoqJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296'),
  ('637196575707920679', 'Terminator 5: The Death of Hollywood', 2004, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Ilja Bozhko, Crazy Dimon', 'Ilja Bozhko', 'Ilja Bozhko, Sergey Lyudchik', null, 'An unofficial sequel to Kefir-Profit''s unofficial Terminator sequel... This time featuring Superman, Rambo, Neo from the Matrix, Harry Potter and the evil Agent 007.', 'An unofficial sequel to Kefir-Profit''s unofficial Terminator sequel... This time featuring Superman, Rambo, Neo from the Matrix, Harry Potter and the evil Agent 007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7K84p0Tgo9wnR7ReBwnOoVfmXTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717823'),
  ('759920890532944515', 'Terminator Genisys', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Alan Taylor, David Sardi, Philip A. Patterson', 'Patrick Lussier, Laeta Kalogridis', 'Emilia Clarke, Jai Courtney, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Jason Clarke, Matt Smith, J.K. Simmons, Lee Byung-hun, Dayo Okeniyi', 'PG-13', 'The year is 2029. John Connor, leader of the resistance continues the war against the machines. At the Los Angeles offensive, John''s fears of the unknown future begin to emerge when TECOM spies reveal a new plot by SkyNet that will attack him from both fronts; past and future, and will ultimately change warfare forever.', 'The year is 2029. John Connor, leader of the resistance continues the war against the machines. At the Los Angeles offensive, John''s fears of the unknown future begin to emerge when TECOM spies reveal a new plot by SkyNet that will attack him from both fronts; past and future, and will ultimately change warfare forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZRVDpNtmHk8M1VYy1aeOWUXgbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87101'),
  ('252772824587657355', 'Terminator Salvation', 2009, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'McG, Shane Hurlbut, Patrick Loungway', 'John Brancato, Michael Ferris', 'Christian Bale, Sam Worthington, Moon Bloodgood, Helena Bonham Carter, Anton Yelchin, Common, Zach McGowan, Bryce Dallas Howard', 'PG-13', 'All grown up in post-apocalyptic 2018, John Connor must lead the resistance of humans against the increasingly dominating militaristic robots. But when Marcus Wright appears, his existence confuses the mission as Connor tries to determine whether Wright has come from the future or the past -- and whether he''s friend or foe.', 'All grown up in post-apocalyptic 2018, John Connor must lead the resistance of humans against the increasingly dominating militaristic robots. But when Marcus Wright appears, his existence confuses the mission as Connor tries to determine whether Wright has come from the future or the past -- and whether he''s friend or foe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw6JhlekZgtKUFlDTezq3j5JEPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534'),
  ('225288268520903071', 'Terminator Salvation: The Machinima Series', 2009, 'Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Tor Helmstein, Ian Kirby', null, 'Moon Bloodgood, Cam Clarke, Heather Halley, Dee Bradley Baker, Jim Meskimen', null, 'In the Year 2016, Resistance fighter Blair Williams embarks on a deadly mission to search for a threat that is weakening humanity''s defense against the self-aware artificial intelligence called Skynet and it''s lethal Terminators.', 'In the Year 2016, Resistance fighter Blair Williams embarks on a deadly mission to search for a threat that is weakening humanity''s defense against the self-aware artificial intelligence called Skynet and it''s lethal Terminators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yBe7QnXbsEFLEsjxa3fYcxxbZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222148'),
  ('81532773142415222', 'Terminator Zan Kill', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Jirō Ishikawa', null, 'Asami, Mutsuo Yoshioka, Hiroyuki Kaneko, Horiken, Makoto Tanaka', null, 'In 2050, a nuclear war broke out all over the world. With the help of a military industry family, Tanahashi, Japanese Imperial Army plans to conquer the world and sets up new government NEO YAMATO. In order to against the tyranny of the new government, a rebellious army of the government fights for peace.', 'In 2050, a nuclear war broke out all over the world. With the help of a military industry family, Tanahashi, Japanese Imperial Army plans to conquer the world and sets up new government NEO YAMATO. In order to against the tyranny of the new government, a rebellious army of the government fights for peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkB5Fu0V4O1iRcOUmjbDVrZIFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911529'),
  ('828349920247964978', 'Terminator: Dark Fate', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Tim Miller, Ken Seng, Adam Dale', 'Amanda Boyd', 'Linda Hamilton, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Mackenzie Davis, Natalia Reyes, Gabriel Luna, Diego Boneta, Ferran Fernández, Tristán Ulloa', 'R', 'Decades after Sarah Connor prevented Judgment Day, a lethal new Terminator is sent to eliminate the future leader of the resistance. In a fight to save mankind, battle-hardened Sarah Connor teams up with an unexpected ally and an enhanced super soldier to stop the deadliest Terminator yet.', 'Decades after Sarah Connor prevented Judgment Day, a lethal new Terminator is sent to eliminate the future leader of the resistance. In a fight to save mankind, battle-hardened Sarah Connor teams up with an unexpected ally and an enhanced super soldier to stop the deadliest Terminator yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqzNJRH4YyquRiWxCCOH0aXggHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290859'),
  ('733254598871519791', 'Terminatrix', 1995, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Mikio Hirota', 'Mikio Hirota', 'Kei Mizutani, Syoko Kudo, Yuuki Fujisawa, Saeko Ichijou, Naofumi Matsuda, Yasunori Matsuda, Yumi Hayakawa, Ichihiro Nagata', null, 'In the future, the corrupt government is losing to a rebel force. They send a T69 Terminatrix to the past to make Sera Koto, the father of the woman who leads the resistance in their time, impotent. The resistance sends a woman back to stop her and the race is on.', 'In the future, the corrupt government is losing to a rebel force. They send a T69 Terminatrix to the past to make Sera Koto, the father of the woman who leads the resistance in their time, impotent. The resistance sends a woman back to stop her and the race is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uq3PpdfnjSnx4LY0C3RqG8PqXTG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34793'),
  ('333520114094845498', 'Terminus', 1961, 'Documentary', 'John Schlesinger, Nicholas Hale, Kenneth Higgins', 'John Schlesinger', 'Peggy Ashcroft, Gertrude Dickin, Margaret Lacey, Matthew Perry, John Schlesinger', null, 'This fly on the wall-style documentary from 1961 won an Oscar for best documentary, and shows the changing patterns of human emotions during 24 hours in the life of Waterloo Station.', 'This fly on the wall-style documentary from 1961 won an Oscar for best documentary, and shows the changing patterns of human emotions during 24 hours in the life of Waterloo Station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHp3MfipqK9xg71rVuG5aGHxKBk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45946'),
  ('63463782998268667', 'Terminus', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Pierre-William Glenn, Patrick Halpine, Jean-Claude Vicquery', 'Alain Gillot', 'Johnny Hallyday, Karen Allen, Jürgen Prochnow, Gabriel Damon, Julie Glenn, Dieter Schidor, János Kulka, Dominique Valera', 'PG', 'An established dystopian sport has drivers of a computerized truck driving cross-country to a terminus. The lead truck, created by a boy genius, is driven by a woman. When the computer guidance system fails, she ends up in uncharted territories and encounters leather-clad hoods who torture her. Meanwhile, a mysterious doctor seems to have another plan in mind.', 'An established dystopian sport has drivers of a computerized truck driving cross-country to a terminus. The lead truck, created by a boy genius, is driven by a woman. When the computer guidance system fails, she ends up in uncharted territories and encounters leather-clad hoods who torture her. Meanwhile, a mysterious doctor seems to have another plan in mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBDAGp8GyT6P0Z2FWt0IoHr1RzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76289'),
  ('471228923334947516', 'Terminus', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Marc Furmie, Kieran Fowler', 'Marc Furmie, Gabriel Dowrick, Shiyan Zheng', 'Jai Koutrae, Kendra Appleton, Todd Lasance, Bren Foster, Brendan Clearkin, William Emmons, Steve Le Marquand, John Manning', 'R', 'Following a near-fatal accident, David Chamberlain makes an unprecedented discovery that will not only determine the fate of his family, but of mankind.', 'Following a near-fatal accident, David Chamberlain makes an unprecedented discovery that will not only determine the fate of his family, but of mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5c3ZPc4alC1Z7jK95Of8bkAjbu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301729'),
  ('104883587943117921', 'Termites from Mars', 1952, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Don Patterson', null, 'Dal McKennon, Grace Stafford', null, 'Woody''s home is beset by an invasion of voracious alien termites.', 'Woody''s home is beset by an invasion of voracious alien termites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khVHMDi074J44jOxRgyKUUoKa56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235935'),
  ('734705413538830775', 'Termites of 1938', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Al Giebler, Elwood Ullman', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Bess Flowers, Bud Jamison, Etta McDaniel', 'NR', 'The stooges are pest exterminators, mistakenly hired by a rich lady looking for an escort to a fancy society party. The stooges wreck the fancy mansion where the party is taking place and befuddle the guest of honor, an English Lord.', 'The stooges are pest exterminators, mistakenly hired by a rich lady looking for an escort to a fancy society party. The stooges wreck the fancy mansion where the party is taking place and befuddle the guest of honor, an English Lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAGvMrlzRRxuV7WezFv35sCUIwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115914'),
  ('203404430438017444', 'Terms and Conditions May Apply', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Cullen Hoback, Ben Wolf', 'Cullen Hoback', 'Mark Zuckerberg, Moby, Leigh Bryan, Raymond Kurzweil, Joe Lipari, Max Schrem, Christopher Shin, Julian Assange', 'NR', 'Have you ever read the Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policies connected to every website you visit, phone call you make, or app you use? Of course you haven’t. But those agreements allow corporations to do things with your personal information you could never even imagine. This film explores the intent hidden within these ridiculous agreements, and reveals what corporations and governments are legally taking from you and the outrageous consequences that result from clicking “I accept.”', 'Have you ever read the Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policies connected to every website you visit, phone call you make, or app you use? Of course you haven’t. But those agreements allow corporations to do things with your personal information you could never even imagine. This film explores the intent hidden within these ridiculous agreements, and reveals what corporations and governments are legally taking from you and the outrageous consequences that result from clicking “I accept.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiXXUS7LVqALDNugz5kRvS0Xkx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159622'),
  ('712769937745894651', 'Terms of Endearment', 1983, 'Drama, Comedy', 'James L. Brooks, Andrzej Bartkowiak, Albert M. Shapiro', 'James L. Brooks', 'Shirley MacLaine, Debra Winger, Jack Nicholson, Danny DeVito, Jeff Daniels, John Lithgow, Lisa Hart Carroll, Betty King', 'PG', 'Aurora, a finicky woman, is in search of true love while her daughter faces marital issues. Together, they help each other deal with problems and find reasons to live a joyful life.', 'Aurora, a finicky woman, is in search of true love while her daughter faces marital issues. Together, they help each other deal with problems and find reasons to live a joyful life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l77DRjJuykqKMtD9GTK4YT7qKHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11050'),
  ('104337049188289148', 'Terra', 2015, 'Documentary, Drama, Family', 'Yann Arthus-Bertrand, Michael Pitiot', 'Michael Pitiot', 'Vanessa Paradis', null, 'A visually stunning documentary that reflects human''s relationship to other species on Earth as humanity becomes more and more isolated from Nature.', 'A visually stunning documentary that reflects human''s relationship to other species on Earth as humanity becomes more and more isolated from Nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ECabmYbogtN4im7JujKNIhUcdc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395985'),
  ('97360196723171856', 'Terra Formars', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Hideo Yamamoto, Takashi Miike', 'Kazuki Nakashima', 'Hideaki Ito, Emi Takei, Tomohisa Yamashita, Takayuki Yamada, Shun Oguri, Kane Kosugi, Rinko Kikuchi, Masaya Katō', null, 'With the space program attempting to travel to Mars, 21st century scientists were tasked with warming up the planet so that humans could survive on its surface. They came up with an efficient and cost effective plan of sending cockroaches and mold to the surface so that the mold would absorb the sunlight and the insect corpses would serve as a food source for the mold. It is now the year 2577 and the first manned ship to Mars has landed on the planet and the six crew members are ready for their mission. But what they find are giant mutated humanoid cockroaches with incredible physical strength. The crew members are easily wiped out, but not before sending a transmission back to Earth. Now, humanity will send elite warriors to exterminate the mutated bugs and claim back Mars.', 'With the space program attempting to travel to Mars, 21st century scientists were tasked with warming up the planet so that humans could survive on its surface. They came up with an efficient and cost effective plan of sending cockroaches and mold to the surface so that the mold would absorb the sunlight and the insect corpses would serve as a food source for the mold. It is now the year 2577 and the first manned ship to Mars has landed on the planet and the six crew members are ready for their mission. But what they find are giant mutated humanoid cockroaches with incredible physical strength. The crew members are easily wiped out, but not before sending a transmission back to Earth. Now, humanity will send elite warriors to exterminate the mutated bugs and claim back Mars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1A7bajfwadBi5eAgXiWDMpY5i9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330070'),
  ('782367131837594986', 'Terra Nova', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Aleksandr Melnik, Maxim Malinin, Dmitriy Nazarov', 'Arif Aliev', 'Konstantin Lavronenko, Marat Basharov, Andrey Feskov, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Sergey Zhigunov, Sergey Koltakov, Vladislav Abashin, Pavel Sborshchikov', null, 'A story, which takes place in 2013, describes the world overflowing with "dangerous" criminals due to the official termination of death penalty. The UN "blue helmets" under the directive from the central authority (i.e., One World Government) decided to conduct a social "experiment" by forcibly dumping the outlaws on the deserted island...', 'A story, which takes place in 2013, describes the world overflowing with "dangerous" criminals due to the official termination of death penalty. The UN "blue helmets" under the directive from the central authority (i.e., One World Government) decided to conduct a social "experiment" by forcibly dumping the outlaws on the deserted island...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YopFtvwt2hJ8h3pwbl3XzXX3iE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30858'),
  ('534073548634657109', 'Terra Vil', 2026, 'Drama', 'Luís Campos, Pedro Patrocínio, Jailson Mattos', 'Luís Campos', 'William Cesnek, Rúben Gomes, Lúcia Moniz, Francisca Sobrinho, Beatriz Relvas', null, 'A 12-year-old boy and his alcoholic father live by the Douro River, next to a woman and her teenage daughters. They survive on fishing, but climate change and the father''s erratic behavior threaten their livelihood.', 'A 12-year-old boy and his alcoholic father live by the Douro River, next to a woman and her teenage daughters. They survive on fishing, but climate change and the father''s erratic behavior threaten their livelihood.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkKIbChNBhPaClVp1OtK7bIzwdBz.jpg', 'plex:movie:terra-vil'),
  ('73768537669287958', 'Terra Warrior Ψ BOY', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Akinobu Ishiyama, Yoshihiro Yamazaki', 'Masato Harada', 'Momoko Kikuchi, Ai Saotome, Toru Masuoka, Naoto Takenaka, Yukiji Asaoka, Hidenori Iura, Aki Takejo, Tsunehiko Kamijô', null, 'Six year old Momoko and Motoharu are turned suddenly into High school students. And more than that they have now psychic powers.', 'Six year old Momoko and Motoharu are turned suddenly into High school students. And more than that they have now psychic powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/O60JbJ5YrWiATPOduppV0QaKLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652348'),
  ('1056685948224087099', 'Terraferma', 2011, 'Drama', 'Emanuele Crialese, Fabio Cianchetti', 'Emanuele Crialese, Vittorio Moroni', 'Filippo Pucillo, Donatella Finocchiaro, Giuseppe Fiorello, Mimmo Cuticchio, Tiziana Lodato, Claudio Santamaria, Martina Codecasa, Filippo Scarafia', 'R', 'A Sicilian family deals with the arrival of a group of immigrants on their island.', 'A Sicilian family deals with the arrival of a group of immigrants on their island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1J6pfxzkxhyQSHdtHWS4WgIPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73872'),
  ('152882639516729824', 'Terrestrial', 2024, 'Horror', 'Alex Farnham', null, 'Dane-randall bacon, Deena Bacon, Randall J. Bacon, Rayden Bacon, Derek Bega, Matt Corboy, Alex Farnham, Kassem Gharaibeh', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4PBZlyVm2cWgL4jAy7WKEblB4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1646142'),
  ('233080183703298432', 'Terrestrial Verses', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Iman Tavakoli, Alireza Khatami, Ali Asgari', 'Alireza Khatami, Ali Asgari', 'Majid Salehi, Gohar Kheyrandish, Farzin Mohades, Sadaf Asgari, Hossein Soleimani, Faezeh Rad, Bahram Ark, Sarvin Zabetian', null, 'A satirical take on the mundane absurdities of life in modern-day Iran, these nine vignettes illuminate the lighter side of enduring under authoritarian rule. Whether choosing a name for a newborn, graduating from grade school, getting a driver’s license, applying for a job, or seeking approval for a film script, if you live in Iran, you best come fluent in Orwellian discourse.', 'A satirical take on the mundane absurdities of life in modern-day Iran, these nine vignettes illuminate the lighter side of enduring under authoritarian rule. Whether choosing a name for a newborn, graduating from grade school, getting a driver’s license, applying for a job, or seeking approval for a film script, if you live in Iran, you best come fluent in Orwellian discourse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfQkqoPXUrWLxDmt71LYWp5A2uZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1112545'),
  ('302460596223919874', 'Terri', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Azazel Jacobs, Tobias Datum', 'Patrick DeWitt', 'Jacob Wysocki, John C. Reilly, Creed Bratton, Olivia Crocicchia, Bridger Zadina, Mary Anne McGarry, Justin Prentice, Jenna Gavigan', 'R', 'Terri, a pajama-clad, disaffected high school student learns how to engage the world with the help of Mr. Fitzgerald, his assistant principal.', 'Terri, a pajama-clad, disaffected high school student learns how to engage the world with the help of Mr. Fitzgerald, his assistant principal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ng3K9EeuBFn82kN4XgpOKQgx6Fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51993'),
  ('66106909219045834', 'Terri Joe: Missionary in Miami', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Dale S. Lewis, Peter Ebanks', 'Kelon Campbell, Yolanda Morgan', 'Andrew Romano, Chase Garland, Katie Keene, Rolin Alexis, Dylan Bougis', 'TV-MA', 'Southern Belle Terri Joe flees to Miami, dodging quirky criminals while searching for a church to seek redemption.', 'Southern Belle Terri Joe flees to Miami, dodging quirky criminals while searching for a church to seek redemption.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fgracenote%2F45609715ced59fb288d5d1523f55af16.jpg', 'plex:movie:terri-joe-missionary-in-miami'),
  ('434202995578367425', 'Terrible Jungle', 2020, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Yann Maritaud, Hugo Benamozig, David Caviglioli', 'David Caviglioli, Hugo Benamozig', 'Vincent Dedienne, Catherine Deneuve, Alice Belaïdi, Jonathan Cohen, Stéphan Beauregard, Jonas Dinal, Guillaume Duhesme, François-Xavier Phan', null, 'French Guyana, not so long ago. Eliott, a young and naive anthropology researcher, goes on an expedition to study the Otopis, a mysterious tribe from the Amazon rainforest. It is also an opportunity for him to get away from the grip of his possessive mother, Chantal de Bellabre, an ethnologist hated by the profession for her biased and cold-hearted practices. Arriving in the forest Elliot realizes the Otopis are not the “good savages” he had imagined. Alcoholic, violent, crooked: they will turn his expedition into real hell in the jungle. Fortunately, Chantal, consumed by remorse and worried about her son, decides to abandon her own expedition and goes looking for him in the jungle, with the help of the not so helpful Lieutenant-Commander Raspailles and his men.', 'French Guyana, not so long ago. Eliott, a young and naive anthropology researcher, goes on an expedition to study the Otopis, a mysterious tribe from the Amazon rainforest. It is also an opportunity for him to get away from the grip of his possessive mother, Chantal de Bellabre, an ethnologist hated by the profession for her biased and cold-hearted practices. Arriving in the forest Elliot realizes the Otopis are not the “good savages” he had imagined. Alcoholic, violent, crooked: they will turn his expedition into real hell in the jungle. Fortunately, Chantal, consumed by remorse and worried about her son, decides to abandon her own expedition and goes looking for him in the jungle, with the help of the not so helpful Lieutenant-Commander Raspailles and his men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3FOSv0Ngg7rsYpy1FUeIVKryYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720272'),
  ('425322955445151781', 'Terribly Happy', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Henrik Ruben Genz', 'Dunja Gry Jensen, Henrik Ruben Genz', 'Jakob Cedergren, Lene Maria Christensen, Kim Bodnia, Lars Brygmann, Anders Hove, Mathilde Maack, Anh Le, Jens Jørn Spottag', null, 'Robert Hansen, 34, a young police officer from Copenhagen, is transferred against his will to the small town of Skarrild in Southern Jutland as a substitute Marshall. The transfer is Robert’s chance to start over. Whether he is allowed to return to his job in Copenhagen, all depends on how well he performs in this frontier town.', 'Robert Hansen, 34, a young police officer from Copenhagen, is transferred against his will to the small town of Skarrild in Southern Jutland as a substitute Marshall. The transfer is Robert’s chance to start over. Whether he is allowed to return to his job in Copenhagen, all depends on how well he performs in this frontier town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQNXTutWu7Jyau5hIvufPxrqTlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15952'),
  ('1132401951613583877', 'Terrified', 1995, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Greg Littlewood, James Merendino, Carla Bowen', 'James Merendino, Megan Heath', 'Heather Graham, Lisa Zane, Rustam Branaman, Paul Herman, Max Perlich, Jason Cairns, Jason Oliver, Tom Bresnahan', 'R', 'Traumatized after witnessing her jealous husband kill her adulterous lover and then himself, an unbalanced, nymphomaniac young woman finds herself stalked by an unknown assailant, but she cannot make anyone believe her desperate situation.', 'Traumatized after witnessing her jealous husband kill her adulterous lover and then himself, an unbalanced, nymphomaniac young woman finds herself stalked by an unknown assailant, but she cannot make anyone believe her desperate situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZAn2vr8ErK8zVff3ubuxjACqTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301233'),
  ('207021985421415257', 'Terrified', 2018, 'Horror', 'Fabián Forte, Andrea Kluger, Demián Rugna', 'Demián Rugna', 'Maxi Ghione, Norberto Gonzalo, Elvira Onetto, George L. Lewis, Julieta Vallina, Demián Salomón, Agustín Rittano, Natalia Señorales', 'NR', 'Police commissioner Funes and three researchers of supernatural phenomena investigate inexplicable events that are occurring in the suburbs of Buenos Aires.', 'Police commissioner Funes and three researchers of supernatural phenomena investigate inexplicable events that are occurring in the suburbs of Buenos Aires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMP4F0POBgrB4icn6XgYeLLIrld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489430'),
  ('1141762868357693493', 'Terrifier', 2011, 'Horror', 'Damien Leone, Christopher Cafaro, Channing McKindra', 'Damien Leone', 'Marie Maser, Mike Giannelli, Michael Chmiel, Daniel Rodas, Jennifer Castellano, Gary LoSavio', null, 'After witnessing a brutal murder on Halloween night, a young woman becomes the next target of a maniacal entity.', 'After witnessing a brutal murder on Halloween night, a young woman becomes the next target of a maniacal entity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uP5k78WkCVrxrFp4AJflHbC61Ao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86328'),
  ('161440376776803306', 'Terrifier', 2018, 'Horror', 'Damien Leone, George Steuber, Gino Cafarelli', 'Damien Leone', 'David Howard Thornton, Jenna Kanell, Samantha Scaffidi, Catherine Corcoran, Pooya Mohseni, Matt McAllister, Katie Maguire, Gino Cafarelli', 'NR', 'A maniacal clown named Art terrorizes three young women on Halloween night and everyone else who stands in his way.', 'A maniacal clown named Art terrorizes three young women on Halloween night and everyone else who stands in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjXqhGmaeQpB73WerhrYU6HlyV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420634'),
  ('703946310047666581', 'Terrifier 2', 2022, 'Horror', 'George Steuber, Damien Leone, Phil Falcone', 'Damien Leone', 'David Howard Thornton, Lauren LaVera, Elliott Fullam, Sarah Voigt, Kailey Hyman, Casey Hartnett, Charlie McElveen, Amelie McLain', 'NR', 'A year after the Miles County massacre, Art the Clown is resurrected by a sinister entity. Art returns home, where he must hunt down and destroy teenage Sienna and her younger brother Jonathan on Halloween. As the body count rises, the siblings fight to stay alive while uncovering the true nature of Art''s evil intent.', 'A year after the Miles County massacre, Art the Clown is resurrected by a sinister entity. Art returns home, where he must hunt down and destroy teenage Sienna and her younger brother Jonathan on Halloween. As the body count rises, the siblings fight to stay alive while uncovering the true nature of Art''s evil intent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEAlwXbYk6IHA4ztoS2XFFaa7Xo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663712'),
  ('951783509592582634', 'Terrifier 3', 2024, 'Horror', 'Damien Leone, George Steuber, Michael Leavy', 'Damien Leone', 'Lauren LaVera, David Howard Thornton, Samantha Scaffidi, Elliott Fullam, Margaret Anne Florence, Bryce Johnson, Alexa Blair Robertson, Antonella Rose', 'NR', 'Five years after surviving Art the Clown''s Halloween massacre, Sienna and Jonathan are still struggling to rebuild their shattered lives. As the holiday season approaches, they try to embrace the Christmas spirit and leave the horrors of the past behind. But just when they think they''re safe, Art returns, determined to turn their holiday cheer into a new nightmare. The festive season quickly unravels as Art unleashes his twisted brand of terror, proving that no holiday is safe.', 'Five years after surviving Art the Clown''s Halloween massacre, Sienna and Jonathan are still struggling to rebuild their shattered lives. As the holiday season approaches, they try to embrace the Christmas spirit and leave the horrors of the past behind. But just when they think they''re safe, Art returns, determined to turn their holiday cheer into a new nightmare. The festive season quickly unravels as Art unleashes his twisted brand of terror, proving that no holiday is safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ju10W5gl3PPK3b7TjEmVOZap51I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034541'),
  ('714798731440575387', 'Terrifier 4', null, 'Horror', 'Damien Leone', 'Damien Leone', 'Lauren LaVera, David Howard Thornton, Antonella Rose, Elliott Fullam', null, 'The fourth installment in the Terrifier franchise. Plot TBA; Art the Clown''s origins will be explored.', 'The fourth installment in the Terrifier franchise. Plot TBA; Art the Clown''s origins will be explored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNS93EjnVPIVuPtGkW7Jgndy7xA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320786'),
  ('391939025455224053', 'Terrifying Girls'' High School: Lynch Law Classroom', 1973, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Norifumi Suzuki, Jūhei Suzuki', 'Tatsuhiko Kamoi', 'Miki Sugimoto, Reiko Ike, Seiko Saburi, Misuzu Ôta, Rie Saotome, Yuuko Mizusawa, Yukiko Asano, Ryōko Ema', null, 'Three new students at a super-strict girl''s school must face off with a repressive school administration, the sadistic, murderous student discipline brigade and corrupt politicians over the murder/suicide of one of their friends. They''re approached by a blackmailer (Tsunehiko Watase) who promises to help them exact vengeance in exchange for setting up a corrupt local politician, and aided by a independent Yakuza biker chick (Reiko Ike).', 'Three new students at a super-strict girl''s school must face off with a repressive school administration, the sadistic, murderous student discipline brigade and corrupt politicians over the murder/suicide of one of their friends. They''re approached by a blackmailer (Tsunehiko Watase) who promises to help them exact vengeance in exchange for setting up a corrupt local politician, and aided by a independent Yakuza biker chick (Reiko Ike).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaQZoDQqGluQTiACCJqaD8mvCRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55781'),
  ('150739063667726750', 'Territories', 2010, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Olivier Abbou, Joseph Gagné, Karim Hussain', 'Olivier Abbou, Thibault Lang-Willar', 'Cristina Rosato, Roc LaFortune, Sean Devine, Nicole Leroux, Michael Mando, Alex Weiner, Stephen Shellen, Vlasta Vrana', null, 'Five friends return home from a marriage in Canada to the United States. Not far from the border, two customs officers stop them to check their identity.', 'Five friends return home from a marriage in Canada to the United States. Not far from the border, two customs officers stop them to check their identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uZNehV2fAAHx1Rgabkj944odAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74518'),
  ('166782085124563440', 'Territory of Love', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Romain Cogitore, Thomas Ozoux', 'Romain Cogitore', 'Déborah François, Paul Hamy, Daniel Martin, Christiane Millet, Vincent Perez, Nanou Garcia, Aviis Zhong', null, 'Maria, 30, is impatient, restless and speaks 5 languages. In Taipei she meets Olivier. He is shy, slow and can speak 14 languages. They fall in love. Then suddenly the news explodes. It''s their story, a true story.', 'Maria, 30, is impatient, restless and speaks 5 languages. In Taipei she meets Olivier. He is shy, slow and can speak 14 languages. They fall in love. Then suddenly the news explodes. It''s their story, a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywNh8vPnGXeHdyNiGNikl8JiHiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458244'),
  ('511769269540644277', 'Terror', 1979, 'Horror', 'Les Young, Norman J. Warren', 'David McGillivray', 'John Nolan, Carolyn Courage, James Aubrey, Sarah Keller, Tricia Walsh, Michael Craze, Rose Collins, Chuck Julian', 'R', 'The descendants of a witch-hunting family and their close friends are stalked and killed by a mysterious entity.', 'The descendants of a witch-hunting family and their close friends are stalked and killed by a mysterious entity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFuSsrIKEzd2HZ0vfC6S64xa9wE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38826'),
  ('400872476089584445', 'Terror 2000', 1993, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Christoph Schlingensief, Reinhard Köcher, Ali Gözkaya', 'Oskar Roehler, Christoph Schlingensief, Uli Hanisch', 'Margit Carstensen, Peter Kern, Udo Kier, Susanne Bredehöft, Alfred Edel, Artur Albrecht, Kalle Mews, Brigitte Kausch', null, 'Germany, right after the re-unification. The people are out of control, blind hatred towards immigrants is common sense. In this time, a social-worker, with the mission to bring a Polish family to their destination (an immigration camp in a little provincial town called Rassau), gets kidnapped just as the family. Chief inspector Koern and his girl-friend start to investigate in this matter in Rassau, exploring a world of obsessive sex, mislead lust and an over-whelming irrational love to the German nation, infiltrating anyone''s mind. Rascism doesn''t start with shaved hair and boots but rather in the middle of society itself...', 'Germany, right after the re-unification. The people are out of control, blind hatred towards immigrants is common sense. In this time, a social-worker, with the mission to bring a Polish family to their destination (an immigration camp in a little provincial town called Rassau), gets kidnapped just as the family. Chief inspector Koern and his girl-friend start to investigate in this matter in Rassau, exploring a world of obsessive sex, mislead lust and an over-whelming irrational love to the German nation, infiltrating anyone''s mind. Rascism doesn''t start with shaved hair and boots but rather in the middle of society itself...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4cOcXzR69ZZySkfzOy49NbxpKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115227'),
  ('331671338451644447', 'Terror 5', 2016, 'Horror', 'Federico Rotstein, Sebastián Rotstein, Martín Armoya', 'Sebastián Rotstein', 'Luciana Grasso, Augusto Alvarez, Airas Alban, Emilio Guzzo, Rocío López, Daniel de la Vega, Clarisa Hernández, Edgardo Castro', 'R', 'During a terrifying night in Buenos Aires, five urban legends unfold in the most surprising way possible. While a politician is accused of being responsible for an urban tragedy in which fifteen people died, in Buenos Aires various stories based on urban legends intersect.', 'During a terrifying night in Buenos Aires, five urban legends unfold in the most surprising way possible. While a politician is accused of being responsible for an urban tragedy in which fifteen people died, in Buenos Aires various stories based on urban legends intersect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tpZjHEwqfbyRy3jUHXsxJWoMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417030'),
  ('668696741457618505', 'Terror and Black Laces', 1985, 'Horror', 'Luis Alcoriza, Xavier Cruz', 'Luis Alcoriza', 'Gonzalo Vega, Maribel Guardia, Claudio Obregón, Claudia Guzmán, Jaime Moreno, Olivia Collins, Martha Ortiz, Gabriela Goldsmith', null, 'A psycho with a hair fetish is caught in the act of disposing of a body and the lonely housewife that witnesses it must fight for her life.', 'A psycho with a hair fetish is caught in the act of disposing of a body and the lonely housewife that witnesses it must fight for her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VEjdjf1jTYzfpuIM13bdl60Ey.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182779'),
  ('104535565812056889', 'Terror at London Bridge', 1985, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'E.W. Swackhamer, Gil Hubbs', 'William F. Nolan', 'David Hasselhoff, Stepfanie Kramer, Randolph Mantooth, Adrienne Barbeau, Clu Gulager, Lindsay Bloom, Ken Swofford, Rose Marie', null, 'London Bridge, London, England, 1888: Jack the Ripper dies in the Thames river. London Bridge, Lake Havasu, Arizona, 1985: the last original stone used to rebuild London Bridge is laid and all the city is happy...but then some strange murders start happening. Policeman Don Gregory has some suspects, but when he develops a theory that Jack the Ripper has been resurrected, no one believes him.', 'London Bridge, London, England, 1888: Jack the Ripper dies in the Thames river. London Bridge, Lake Havasu, Arizona, 1985: the last original stone used to rebuild London Bridge is laid and all the city is happy...but then some strange murders start happening. Policeman Don Gregory has some suspects, but when he develops a theory that Jack the Ripper has been resurrected, no one believes him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6QOlTvRnroys6DiKj1HHSUgicy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135940'),
  ('319232081349843412', 'Terror at Orgy Castle', 1972, 'Horror', 'Zoltan G. Spencer', null, 'Bambi Allen, William Howard, Jane Tsentas, Ron Darby, Jacqueline Lissette, Tricia Opal, John Dullaghan, Linda Marie', null, 'Not the smartest couple in the world, Bill and Lisa spend the last night of their "swinging European vacation" at the haunted castle of spooky Countess Dominova, just in time for Bill to make love to a succubus, Lisa to become the "Bride of the Devil" and everyone to wallow in some serious Terror at Orgy Castle.', 'Not the smartest couple in the world, Bill and Lisa spend the last night of their "swinging European vacation" at the haunted castle of spooky Countess Dominova, just in time for Bill to make love to a succubus, Lisa to become the "Bride of the Devil" and everyone to wallow in some serious Terror at Orgy Castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puXr6tEwplo9pdeFzaDiwZfP3t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156542'),
  ('623702265475197294', 'Terror at Red Wolf Inn', 1972, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Bud Townsend, John McNichol', 'Allen J. Actor', 'Linda Gillen, John Neilson, Arthur Space, Janet Wood, Mary Jackson, Margaret Avery, Michael Macready, Earl Parker', 'R', 'College student Regina comes back to her room from class one day to discover she''s won a getaway vacation at the quiet Red Wolf Inn. Before she can even call her parents to let them know where she''ll be, the lodge owners arrange her transport and she soon finds herself with two other young women as guests of a kindly old couple. The place is beautiful and the food is fantastic, but something just doesn''t seem right. One of the guests has suddenly vanished, and the hosts are certainly reluctant to have anyone poking around the meat locker. Still, the barbecued ribs are delicious, so what''s there to complain about?', 'College student Regina comes back to her room from class one day to discover she''s won a getaway vacation at the quiet Red Wolf Inn. Before she can even call her parents to let them know where she''ll be, the lodge owners arrange her transport and she soon finds herself with two other young women as guests of a kindly old couple. The place is beautiful and the food is fantastic, but something just doesn''t seem right. One of the guests has suddenly vanished, and the hosts are certainly reluctant to have anyone poking around the meat locker. Still, the barbecued ribs are delicious, so what''s there to complain about?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hgLXROOwGem7rHxn9kV7gWUqO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108743'),
  ('311941596203334671', 'Terror at Tenkiller', 1986, 'Horror', 'Steven Wacks, Kevin Meyer, Ken Meyer', 'Claudia Meyer', 'Michael Shamus Wiles, Stacey Logan, Michele Merchant, Dale Buckmaster, Kevin Meyer, Dean Lewis, Debbie Killian, Jill Holmes', 'R', 'Leslie and Janna are a couple of attractive young ladies who decide to go on vacation at a remote cabin in the woods. However, things go nightmarishly awry after a dangerous maniac shows up in the area and starts bumping folks off. Will anyone survive the terror at Tenkiller?', 'Leslie and Janna are a couple of attractive young ladies who decide to go on vacation at a remote cabin in the woods. However, things go nightmarishly awry after a dangerous maniac shows up in the area and starts bumping folks off. Will anyone survive the terror at Tenkiller?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVJAgKytdSZW2AytWvCP8saGsVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85148'),
  ('644364596505033418', 'Terror Beneath the Sea', 1966, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Kazuo Shimomura, Hajime Sato, Goro Hanawa', 'Kôichi Ôtsu', 'Sonny Chiba, Peggy Neal, Franz Gruber, Andrew Hughes, Erik Neilson, Mike Daneen, Beverly Keller, Gunther Braun', null, 'While covering a test of guided torpedoes, two reporters believe they see what appears to be a strange-looking swimming creature. They investigate the matter further and discover that there is a race of fish-men living under the sea. The fish-men capture the pair and keep them prisoner in their underwater city.', 'While covering a test of guided torpedoes, two reporters believe they see what appears to be a strange-looking swimming creature. They investigate the matter further and discover that there is a race of fish-men living under the sea. The fish-men capture the pair and keep them prisoner in their underwater city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHBQ3MX4nILuhtRbxaqne0Hw833.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74241'),
  ('18434599029647942', 'Terror by Night', 1946, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Roy William Neill, Bernard B. Brown, Maury Gertsman', 'Frank Gruber', 'Basil Rathbone, Nigel Bruce, Alan Mowbray, Dennis Hoey, Renee Godfrey, Frederick Worlock, Mary Forbes, Skelton Knaggs', null, 'Holmes and Watson board a passenger train bound from London to Edinburgh, to guard the Star of Rhodesia, an enormous diamond worth a fortune belonging to an elderly woman of wealth; but within the first hour of the trip, the woman''s son is murdered and the diamond stolen and any of the passengers in their car could be the killer thief.', 'Holmes and Watson board a passenger train bound from London to Edinburgh, to guard the Star of Rhodesia, an enormous diamond worth a fortune belonging to an elderly woman of wealth; but within the first hour of the trip, the woman''s son is murdered and the diamond stolen and any of the passengers in their car could be the killer thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjGgLJ2GViKy0bla8OfaAhOBAJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20408'),
  ('561995276552244773', 'Terror Express', 1980, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Giuseppe Aquari, Giampiero Mele', 'George Eastman', 'Silvia Dionisio, Werner Pochath, Zora Kerova, Gianluigi Chirizzi, Carlo De Mejo, Giancarlo Maestri, Fausto Lombardi, Fiammetta Flamini', null, 'Three thugs commandeer a couple of cars on a moving train and spread terror among the passengers.', 'Three thugs commandeer a couple of cars on a moving train and spread terror among the passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPGoSs0n9hkoYN9ZLU9rsPfZGbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89315'),
  ('105156444600316333', 'Terror Eyes', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Michael Rissi, Eric Parkinson, Stephen Sommers', 'Eric Parkinson, Vivian Schilling', 'Vivian Schilling, Daniel Roebuck, Lance August, Dan Bell, Gina Hightower, Rebecca McGovern, David Donham, Diana James', 'NR', 'A frustrated advertising executive is confused to receive a job assignment from her boss to write the screenplay to a horror film. Recruiting the help of her friends, a weekend camping expedition becomes the forum for each to share their scariest stories, which become frightfully real.', 'A frustrated advertising executive is confused to receive a job assignment from her boss to write the screenplay to a horror film. Recruiting the help of her friends, a weekend camping expedition becomes the forum for each to share their scariest stories, which become frightfully real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uEfw9mNmoOUqvM8wPLbqVPd9cn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117216'),
  ('1132187719498514437', 'Terror Eyes', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Delaney Bishop', 'Delaney Bishop', 'Jennifer Blanc, Lisseth Chavez, Ayla Kell, Robert Romanus, Riker Lynch, Arlene Santana, Matt Perfetuo, Matthew Holcomb', null, 'Three friends head out to Joshua Tree to hike, check out Palm Springs and attend a music festival. But they realize that something is following them in the shadows, harassing them and their trip quickly turns to terror. Trying to figure out what to do, the group learns that everything comes from a dark website called “Terror Eyes” and that someone will die…', 'Three friends head out to Joshua Tree to hike, check out Palm Springs and attend a music festival. But they realize that something is following them in the shadows, harassing them and their trip quickly turns to terror. Trying to figure out what to do, the group learns that everything comes from a dark website called “Terror Eyes” and that someone will die…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVYer2tuoKsnzJxfJPLnloBp1th.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500974'),
  ('67787695471232065', 'Terror Firmer', 1999, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Lloyd Kaufman', 'Douglas Buck, Lloyd Kaufman, Patrick Cassidy', 'Trent Haaga, Alyce LaTourelle, Will Keenan, Lloyd Kaufman, Debbie Rochon, Joe Fleishaker, Sheri Wenden, Yaniv Sharon', 'R', 'A low-budget film crew working in New York City find themselves being preyed upon by a sexually conflicted serial killer.', 'A low-budget film crew working in New York City find themselves being preyed upon by a sexually conflicted serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnASuHPWrVwpQdKeyaMspgGCePC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14005'),
  ('1002189902182150614', 'Terror from the Year 5000', 1958, 'Science Fiction', 'Robert J. Gurney Jr., Arthur Florman, Jack Dimond', 'Robert J. Gurney Jr.', 'Ward Costello, Joyce Holden, Frederic Downs, John Stratton, Salome Jens, Fred Herrick, Beatrice Furdeaux', null, 'Prof. Erling and his financial backer Victor build a prototype time machine to snatch objects from the past. Latest find, a statuette, radiometrically dates to 5200 AD! When this draws colleague Richard Hedges to the island lab, Erling reveals that 20th-century objects put in the machine seem to be "traded" for analogous future objects by intelligent life. And on the sly, Victor''s been trying to get a living visitor. Does the future need help, or is the present in danger?', 'Prof. Erling and his financial backer Victor build a prototype time machine to snatch objects from the past. Latest find, a statuette, radiometrically dates to 5200 AD! When this draws colleague Richard Hedges to the island lab, Erling reveals that 20th-century objects put in the machine seem to be "traded" for analogous future objects by intelligent life. And on the sly, Victor''s been trying to get a living visitor. Does the future need help, or is the present in danger?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSWMAF7Sf2yda53AyuRbXSvPIIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49379'),
  ('535709608670003883', 'Terror in a Texas Town', 1958, 'Western', 'Ray Rennahan, Joseph H. Lewis, Richard Dixon', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Sterling Hayden, Sebastian Cabot, Carol Kelly, Eugene Mazzola, Nedrick Young, Victor Millan, Frank Ferguson, Marilee Earle', 'NR', 'Armed with a harpoon, a Swedish whaler is out for revenge after the death of his father. A greedy oil man trying to buy up the Swede''s land might be the guilty party.', 'Armed with a harpoon, a Swedish whaler is out for revenge after the death of his father. A greedy oil man trying to buy up the Swede''s land might be the guilty party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibRCvORgozhzRb0X4uPDkaA89fG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46681'),
  ('754188121712693261', 'Terror in Beverly Hills', 1989, 'Action', 'John Myhers, Peter Wolf', 'John Myhers', 'Frank Stallone Jr., Behrouz Vossoughi, Cameron Mitchell, William Smith, Joe Davis, Muneer Katchi, Bonita Money, Sam Sako', null, 'When the President''s daughter is kidnapped, it''s up to an ex-marine to save her. The problem is that the terrorist leader has a lingering hatred for him, as he has been wrongfully blamed for the death of his wife and children. The action heats up, as the two mortal enemies confront each other with extreme violence.', 'When the President''s daughter is kidnapped, it''s up to an ex-marine to save her. The problem is that the terrorist leader has a lingering hatred for him, as he has been wrongfully blamed for the death of his wife and children. The action heats up, as the two mortal enemies confront each other with extreme violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wQ9gcYOjnIH0VTrQExLmqr4hTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111867'),
  ('652052969455131041', 'Terror in the Aisles', 1984, 'Horror, Documentary', 'Andrew J. Kuehn, John A. Alonzo', 'Margery Doppelt', 'Donald Pleasence, Nancy Allen, Fred Asparagus, Lainie Cook, Joel S. Rice, Ángel Salazar, Diane Stilwell, Alfred Hitchcock', 'R', 'A non-stop roller coaster ride through the scariest moments of the greatest terror films of all time.', 'A non-stop roller coaster ride through the scariest moments of the greatest terror films of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFmaJ7mAwFJpx5gv6vUMvRKCeFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47894'),
  ('847515372786352099', 'Terror in the Family', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Gregory Goodell, Steve Yaconelli', 'Gregory Goodell', 'Hilary Swank, Joanna Kerns, Dan Lauria, Adam Hendershott, Nan Martin, Andrew Kavovit, Kathleen Wilhoite, Beau Billingslea', null, 'Fifteen-year-old Deena Marten wants the same freedom every teenager craves. But when she can''t have her way, her rebellious temperament erupts in violence. Her parents, Cynthia and Todd, fear her new boyfriend, Garret, 17, is the cause. Distraught, Stephanie turns to alcohol, and Todd escapes in his work. They''re unaware their Boy Scout son Adam, 13, sips from a vodka bottle hidden in his bedroom. And the problems in this dysfunctional family continue to worsen.', 'Fifteen-year-old Deena Marten wants the same freedom every teenager craves. But when she can''t have her way, her rebellious temperament erupts in violence. Her parents, Cynthia and Todd, fear her new boyfriend, Garret, 17, is the cause. Distraught, Stephanie turns to alcohol, and Todd escapes in his work. They''re unaware their Boy Scout son Adam, 13, sips from a vodka bottle hidden in his bedroom. And the problems in this dysfunctional family continue to worsen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Mz8CqsHyIGuKDQlB39O9OnfcjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130088'),
