  ('595413116792554963', 'Terror Island', 1920, 'Adventure, Mystery', 'James Cruze, William Marshall', null, 'Harry Houdini, Jack Brammall, Lila Lee, Wilton Taylor, Eugene Pallette, Ed Brady, Taylor N. Duncan, F.A. Turner', 'NR', 'Inventor Harry Harper travels to the South Seas, where there is buried treasure belonging to a girl, Beverly West. Naturally, others are after the loot, and Beverly''s father is being held captive by cannibals until she returns to them with a pearl that belongs to one of their idols. The climax consists of Harper saving Beverly from a safe which has been lowered into the sea.', 'Inventor Harry Harper travels to the South Seas, where there is buried treasure belonging to a girl, Beverly West. Naturally, others are after the loot, and Beverly''s father is being held captive by cannibals until she returns to them with a pearl that belongs to one of their idols. The climax consists of Harper saving Beverly from a safe which has been lowered into the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cW9xKunDuZko1bXUwFka1G50L81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175223'),
