  ('510257272659480901', 'Terror on Tour', 1980, 'Comedy, Crime, Horror, Music', 'Don Edmonds, James W. Roberson', 'Alex Rebar', 'Rick Styles, Chip Greenman, Rich Pemberton, Dave Galluzzo, Larry Thomas, Sylvia Wright, John Wintergate, Kalassu', 'R', 'A rock band called "The Clowns" comes under suspicion of murder when several prostitutes are killed by individuals made up like members of the band.', 'A rock band called "The Clowns" comes under suspicion of murder when several prostitutes are killed by individuals made up like members of the band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rmlDdFyfihVVVEtDr8dMpch18t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85182'),
  ('210110120088321603', 'Terror Out of the Sky', 1978, 'Horror, Drama, TV Movie', 'Lee H. Katzin, Michel Hugo', 'Peter Nelson, Doris Silverton, Guerdon Trueblood', 'Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Dan Haggerty, Tovah Feldshuh, Lonny Chapman, Ike Eisenmann, Joe E. Tata, Richard Herd, Charles Hallahan', null, 'TV sequel to "The Savage Bees" featuring more rampaging insects. This time a marching band and a school bus get in the path of the bees.', 'TV sequel to "The Savage Bees" featuring more rampaging insects. This time a marching band and a school bus get in the path of the bees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPdiIXV0AmVnCiGkkR1WvmWOKGA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80577'),
  ('23557085941420759', 'Terror Squad', 1988, 'Action, Thriller', 'Peter Maris, Jeff Johnson, Peter Jensen', 'Chuck Rose', 'Chuck Connors, Brodie Greer, Bill Calvert, Kerry Wall, Kavi Raz, Joseph Nasser, Budge Threlkeld, Dennis Moynahan', null, 'A squad of Libyan terrorists infiltrate the city of Kokomo, Indiana, with the goal of car bombing a nuclear power plant. While attempting to escape local law enforcement, a massive car chase ensues, terrorizing the entire town before the terrorists end up at the local high school and take the detention class hostage. Will they escape? Will the crafty delinquents foil their plans? Will Chuck Connors step more than two feet away from his car? Watch and find out!', 'A squad of Libyan terrorists infiltrate the city of Kokomo, Indiana, with the goal of car bombing a nuclear power plant. While attempting to escape local law enforcement, a massive car chase ensues, terrorizing the entire town before the terrorists end up at the local high school and take the detention class hostage. Will they escape? Will the crafty delinquents foil their plans? Will Chuck Connors step more than two feet away from his car? Watch and find out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZmvMkMYkAnBJR9YsplXj9E8F8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100193'),
