  ('735253792697389896', 'Terror Train', 1980, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Roger Spottiswoode, John Alcott', 'T.Y. Drake', 'Ben Johnson, Jamie Lee Curtis, Hart Bochner, Sandee Currie, Timothy Webber, Derek McKinnon, Anthony Sherwood, Joy Boushel', 'R', 'A masked killer targets six college kids responsible for a prank gone wrong three years earlier and who are currently throwing a large New Year''s Eve costume party aboard a moving train.', 'A masked killer targets six college kids responsible for a prank gone wrong three years earlier and who are currently throwing a large New Year''s Eve costume party aboard a moving train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeDVKkeCk9U75a0TZ4mezylXy3j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40969'),
  ('373784242683234239', 'Terror Train', 2022, 'Horror', 'Philippe Gagnon, Daniel Villeneuve', 'Ian Carpenter, Aaron Martin', 'Robyn Alomar, Mary Walsh, Nadine Bhabha, Matias Lucas, Corteon Moore, Emma Elle Paterson, Tori Barban, Dakota Jamal Wellman', null, 'Alana and a group of college seniors board a party train for a Halloween-themed bash, but their fun spirals into fear when a mysterious assailant begins killing the passengers one-by-one.', 'Alana and a group of college seniors board a party train for a Halloween-themed bash, but their fun spirals into fear when a mysterious assailant begins killing the passengers one-by-one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9qnyrife64GGFXu6ZHMegshPeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974604'),
  ('511921730230450619', 'Terror Trap', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dan Garcia, John Lands', 'Dan Garcia', 'David James Elliott, Heather Marie Marsden, Jeff Fahey, Michael Madsen, Andrew Sensenig, Lacey Minchew, Richard Zeringue, Lawrence Turner', null, 'While driving, an estranged couple''s car is hit twice. A sheriff takes them to a motel where they hear disturbing noises from a room, realizing they''re part of a deadly game.', 'While driving, an estranged couple''s car is hit twice. A sheriff takes them to a motel where they hear disturbing noises from a room, realizing they''re part of a deadly game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gab9aBrD8fxP2NveitSzOEP4rfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48669'),
  ('446330201511497815', 'Terror-Creatures from the Grave', 1965, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Massimo Pupillo, Carlo Di Palma', 'Romano Migliorini, Roberto Natale', 'Barbara Steele, Walter Brandi, Mirella Maravidi, Alfredo Rizzo, Riccardo Garrone, Luciano Pigozzi, Ennio Balbo, Renato Lupi', 'NR', 'An attorney arrives at a castle to settle the estate of its recently deceased owner. The owner''s wife and daughter reveal that he was someone who was able to summon the souls of ancient plague victims and, in fact, his spirit was roaming the castle at that very moment. Soon occupants of the castle begin to die off in gruesome, violent ways.', 'An attorney arrives at a castle to settle the estate of its recently deceased owner. The owner''s wife and daughter reveal that he was someone who was able to summon the souls of ancient plague victims and, in fact, his spirit was roaming the castle at that very moment. Soon occupants of the castle begin to die off in gruesome, violent ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDPvbzIURDmkCE4b2NXrJDk4C9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63507'),
  ('1044412560745018504', 'Terror, Sisters!', 2019, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Bruce, Margaux Remaury, Michaël Capron', 'Alexis Langlois, Hania Ourabah', 'Nana Benamer, Naëlle Dariya, Félix Maritaud, Raya Martigny, Dustin Muchuvitz, Justine Langlois', null, 'Today is a day like any other for Kalthoum and her girlfriends. They sip cocktails, look for sex on the Internet, impatiently wait for love and once again, endure the transphobic insults of strangers. But today it’s not going to be like that: the four transgender friends will imagine their revenge.', 'Today is a day like any other for Kalthoum and her girlfriends. They sip cocktails, look for sex on the Internet, impatiently wait for love and once again, endure the transphobic insults of strangers. But today it’s not going to be like that: the four transgender friends will imagine their revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnveQL5fCvZQM9pNz5t1LinXeD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651510'),
  ('747581316372528604', 'Terror''s Advocate', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Barbet Schroeder, Eugénie Grandval, Caroline Champetier', 'Barbet Schroeder', 'Jacques Vergès, Ilich Ramírez Sánchez, Yacef Saâdi, Magdalena Kopp, Abderrahmane Benhamida, Djamila Bouhared, Isabelle Coutant-Peyre, Jean-Paul Dollé', null, 'A documentary on Jacques Vergès, the controversial lawyer and former Free French Forces guerrilla, exploring how Vergès assisted, from the 1960s onwards, anti-imperialist terrorist cells operating in Africa, Europe, and the Middle East. Participants interviewed include Algerian nationalists Yacef Saadi, Zohra Drif, Djamila Bouhired and Abderrahmane Benhamida, Khmer Rouge members Nuon Chea and Khieu Samphan, once far-left activists Hans-Joachim Klein and Magdalena Kopp, terrorist Carlos the Jackal, lawyer Isabelle Coutant-Peyre, neo-Nazi Ahmed Huber, Palestinian politician Bassam Abu Sharif, Lebanese politician Karim Pakradouni, political cartoonist Siné, former spy Claude Moniquet, novelist and ghostwriter Lionel Duroy, and investigative journalist Oliver Schröm.', 'A documentary on Jacques Vergès, the controversial lawyer and former Free French Forces guerrilla, exploring how Vergès assisted, from the 1960s onwards, anti-imperialist terrorist cells operating in Africa, Europe, and the Middle East. Participants interviewed include Algerian nationalists Yacef Saadi, Zohra Drif, Djamila Bouhired and Abderrahmane Benhamida, Khmer Rouge members Nuon Chea and Khieu Samphan, once far-left activists Hans-Joachim Klein and Magdalena Kopp, terrorist Carlos the Jackal, lawyer Isabelle Coutant-Peyre, neo-Nazi Ahmed Huber, Palestinian politician Bassam Abu Sharif, Lebanese politician Karim Pakradouni, political cartoonist Siné, former spy Claude Moniquet, novelist and ghostwriter Lionel Duroy, and investigative journalist Oliver Schröm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10HlzNT0pqblQKgfo8fe7vPNxvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22521'),
  ('454584900688482329', 'Terrorism and Kebab', 1992, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Mohsen Nasr, Mohamed Yassin, Sherif Arafa', 'Wahid Hamid', 'Adel Emam, Kamal Al-Shenawy, Yousra, Ahmad Rateb, Ashraf Abdel Baky, Alaa Wali El Din, Ahmed Akl, Inam Salusah', null, 'Ahmed heads to Tahrir compound to extract papers to move his son to another school. There he clashes with the administrative obstacles. He suddenly finds himself involved in carrying a weapon and taking hostages at the government building and becomes a terrorist in the process.', 'Ahmed heads to Tahrir compound to extract papers to move his son to another school. There he clashes with the administrative obstacles. He suddenly finds himself involved in carrying a weapon and taking hostages at the government building and becomes a terrorist in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bfkwrkHGfXGOCHHAeFKqFD6Snv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63729'),
  ('361048222979177892', 'Terrorizers', 1986, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Edward Yang, Chang Chan, Yen Hung-ya', 'Edward Yang, Hsiao Yeh', 'Cora Miao, Lee Li-Chun, King Shih-chieh, Ku Pao-Ming, Liu Ming, Wang An, Shao-Chun Ma, Yu An-shun', null, 'An uncompromising look into urban life from the eyes of a voyeuristic photographer, a rebellious teenager, and a married couple teetering on the edge of adultery.', 'An uncompromising look into urban life from the eyes of a voyeuristic photographer, a rebellious teenager, and a married couple teetering on the edge of adultery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uX1PVn9Tob81hqwdzAjqPeaXZO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78450'),
  ('1017431100891032577', 'TerrorVision', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Romano Albani, Ted Nicolaou', 'Ted Nicolaou', 'Diane Franklin, Gerrit Graham, Mary Woronov, Chad Allen, Jon Gries, Bert Remsen, Alejandro Rey, Randi Brooks', 'R', 'Stanley Putterman installs a state-of-the-art satellite dish in his backyard, soon unleashing a strange monster that leaps off the screen and needs to feed on humans for survival.', 'Stanley Putterman installs a state-of-the-art satellite dish in his backyard, soon unleashing a strange monster that leaps off the screen and needs to feed on humans for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9s9s2VchHi4gAiVGfFkrQyQLTzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24194'),
  ('448702761381764755', 'Terry McMillan Presents: Tempted 2 Love', 2026, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Roger M. Bobb', 'Tamara T. Gregory', 'Lela Rochon, Mara Huf, Lennart Betzgen, Madalena Alberto, Ashley L. Osborne', 'Not Rated', 'A star chef heads to Portugal for a major culinary event with her new love, only to find her much-younger ex there too. As they work side by side with their current partners, old feelings resurface, challenging their hearts and careers.', 'A star chef heads to Portugal for a major culinary event with her new love, only to find her much-younger ex there too. As they work side by side with their current partners, old feelings resurface, challenging their hearts and careers.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8LKOePX94Nc7HdPTP3ukCbUVyrT.jpg', 'plex:movie:terry-mcmillan-presents-tempted-2-love'),
  ('72584055079170218', 'Tesla', 2020, 'History, Drama', 'Michael Almereyda, Sean Price Williams, Joan G. Bostwick', 'Michael Almereyda', 'Ethan Hawke, Eve Hewson, Jim Gaffigan, Kyle MacLachlan, Donnie Keshawarz, Josh Hamilton, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Lucy Walters', 'PG-13', 'The story of the Promethean struggles of Nikola Tesla, as he attempts to transcend entrenched technology—including his own previous work—by pioneering a system of wireless energy that would change the world.', 'The story of the Promethean struggles of Nikola Tesla, as he attempts to transcend entrenched technology—including his own previous work—by pioneering a system of wireless energy that would change the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0guO0krvyz8IfKGxEje04LVM9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517412'),
  ('871302809760822256', 'Tesla: Master of Lightning', 2000, 'Documentary, History', 'Robert Uth', 'Robert Uth, Phylis Geller', 'Stacy Keach, Elisabeth Noone, Nikola Tesla', 'PG', 'This program recounts the life of scientist, inventor, and visionary Nikola Tesla, often remembered as more of an eccentric cult figure than an electrical engineering genius. Many of his achievements are still attributed to contemporaries Thomas Edison and Guglielmo Marconi. Tesla''s surprising inventions are revealed in his autobiographical and scientific writings, supplemented by rare photographs and re-creations.', 'This program recounts the life of scientist, inventor, and visionary Nikola Tesla, often remembered as more of an eccentric cult figure than an electrical engineering genius. Many of his achievements are still attributed to contemporaries Thomas Edison and Guglielmo Marconi. Tesla''s surprising inventions are revealed in his autobiographical and scientific writings, supplemented by rare photographs and re-creations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qZ6mdzdutQmz289KB4dBZLz2W2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56419'),
  ('178952054585228507', 'Tesoros', 2017, 'Family, Adventure', 'Gerardo Barroso, Lisa Tillinger, María Novaro', 'María Novaro', 'Andrea Sutton Chávez, Dylan Sutton Chávez, Jacinta Chávez de León, Aranza Bañuelos, Michelle Organiz, Julieta Bárcenas', null, 'Siblings Dylan and Andrea set off with their new friends on a marvelous journey of discovery in search of long lost pirate loot.', 'Siblings Dylan and Andrea set off with their new friends on a marvelous journey of discovery in search of long lost pirate loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHDkhLGs2TTiy3P00lqbcqs9aSh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436452'),
  ('172024177738179930', 'Tess', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roman Polanski, Geoffrey Unsworth, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Roman Polanski, Gérard Brach, John Brownjohn', 'Nastassja Kinski, Peter Firth, Leigh Lawson, John Collin, Rosemary Martin, Carolyn Pickles, Richard Pearson, David Markham', 'PG', 'A strong-willed peasant girl is sent by her father to the estate of some local aristocrats to capitalize on a rumour that their families are from the same line. This fateful visit commences an epic narrative of sex, class, betrayal, and revenge.', 'A strong-willed peasant girl is sent by her father to the estate of some local aristocrats to capitalize on a rumour that their families are from the same line. This fateful visit commences an epic narrative of sex, class, betrayal, and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xejUFnoAVxzvU95o2jlzG2USmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11121'),
  ('711722844040252506', 'Tess of the D''Urbervilles', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Ian Sharp, Cliff Lanning, Richard Greatrex', 'Ted Whitehead', 'Justine Waddell, Jason Flemyng, Oliver Milburn, John McEnery, Lesley Dunlop, Rosalind Knight, Anthony O''Donnell, Christine Moore', null, 'Thomas Hardy''s classic epic remains one of the most popular novels, this TV adaptation vividly depicts the powerful tale of a peasant girl whose life is torn apart by the love and jealousy of two men. Justine Waddell stars as the hapless Child of Nature who is tossed around by the dark forces of fate. Jason Flemyng is the dark and sinister Alec D''Urberville whose relentless pursuit of Tess triggers the heroine''s downfall. Oliver Milburn plays the handsome young Angel Clare, the caring rebel who falls deeply in love with Tess.', 'Thomas Hardy''s classic epic remains one of the most popular novels, this TV adaptation vividly depicts the powerful tale of a peasant girl whose life is torn apart by the love and jealousy of two men. Justine Waddell stars as the hapless Child of Nature who is tossed around by the dark forces of fate. Jason Flemyng is the dark and sinister Alec D''Urberville whose relentless pursuit of Tess triggers the heroine''s downfall. Oliver Milburn plays the handsome young Angel Clare, the caring rebel who falls deeply in love with Tess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecNHSAhWkZnHJ3dOXwmq1llWkhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128714'),
  ('570338793936137966', 'Tess of the Storm Country', 1922, 'Romance, Drama', 'John S. Robertson, Charles Rosher, Shaw Lovett', 'E. Lloyd Sheldon, Josephine Lovett, Elmer Harris', 'Mary Pickford, Lloyd Hughes, Gloria Hope, David Torrence, Forrest Robinson, Jean Hersholt, Danny Hoy, Robert Russell', 'NR', 'Wealthy Elias Graves builds his home on the top of a hill, where a group of squatters have taken up residence at the bottom. Many of the men in the squatters'' village have their eyes on young Tess, and one of them, Ben Letts, frames Tess''s father for murder. While maintaining her father''s innocence, Tess must keep her love for Graves'' son a secret, while caring for Elias'' daughter''s illegitamate child.', 'Wealthy Elias Graves builds his home on the top of a hill, where a group of squatters have taken up residence at the bottom. Many of the men in the squatters'' village have their eyes on young Tess, and one of them, Ben Letts, frames Tess''s father for murder. While maintaining her father''s innocence, Tess must keep her love for Graves'' son a secret, while caring for Elias'' daughter''s illegitamate child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xSjRGRIlgxR5bVKo6WWdiBboT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71067'),
