  ('118314726681123173', 'Test Tube Babies', 1948, 'Drama', 'W. Merle Connell, Irving Akers, Gustave Field', 'Richard S. McMahan', 'Dorothy Duke, William Thomason, Timothy Farrell, Peggy Roach', null, 'A happily married couple has been trying to have a baby with no luck. They discover that the husband is sterile. Their family doctor suggests that they think about artificial insemination, which at the time was considered a scandalous choice.', 'A happily married couple has been trying to have a baby with no luck. They discover that the husband is sterile. Their family doctor suggests that they think about artificial insemination, which at the time was considered a scandalous choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cW2SX5h4RxFpACDACxmLWKui7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94259'),
  ('122483431485117054', 'Test Tube Teens from the Year 2000', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'David DeCoteau, James Lawrence Spencer, Jerry Gibson', 'Kenneth J. Hall', 'Morgan Fairchild, Ian Abercrombie, Brian Bremer, Christopher Wolf, Sara Suzanne Brown, Michele Matheson, Don Dowe, Tamara Tohill', 'R', 'In the future, corporations have taken over the world and banned sex. A group of rebellious high school students devise a way to go back in time to the present day and try change history to prevent that from happening.', 'In the future, corporations have taken over the world and banned sex. A group of rebellious high school students devise a way to go back in time to the present day and try change history to prevent that from happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lm7N8jrhE2yFozgNApzp8Ys0Oi0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30783'),
  ('593952130504704227', 'Testament', 1983, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Lynne Littman, Ralph S. Singleton, Peter Bogart', 'John Sacret Young', 'Jane Alexander, William Devane, Rossie Harris, Roxana Zal, Lukas Haas, Philip Anglim, Lilia Skala, Leon Ames', 'PG', 'It is just another day in the small town of Hamlin until something disastrous happens. Suddenly, news breaks that a series of nuclear warheads has been dropped along the Eastern Seaboard and, more locally, in California. As people begin coping with the devastating aftermath of the attacks — many suffer radiation poisoning — the Wetherly family tries to survive.', 'It is just another day in the small town of Hamlin until something disastrous happens. Suddenly, news breaks that a series of nuclear warheads has been dropped along the Eastern Seaboard and, more locally, in California. As people begin coping with the devastating aftermath of the attacks — many suffer radiation poisoning — the Wetherly family tries to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIc7cgiGi1p4YK4zFEiObCUztXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21259'),
  ('562892506806209092', 'Testament', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Denys Arcand, Claudine Sauvé', 'Denys Arcand', 'Rémy Girard, Sophie Lorain, Marie-Mai Bouchard, Guylaine Tremblay, Caroline Néron, Alexandra McDonald, Katia Gorshkova, Alex Rice', null, 'A retired archivist is annoyed and confused by a group of protestors who are angered by a mural inside the retirement home where he resides that glorifies colonialism.', 'A retired archivist is annoyed and confused by a group of protestors who are angered by a mural inside the retirement home where he resides that glorifies colonialism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LApt8YBzKlQpAnHnKFpVjEpphx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058155'),
  ('456102973271556815', 'Testament of Orpheus', 1960, 'Fantasy', 'Jean Cocteau, Roland Pontoizeau, Francis Caillaud', 'Jean Cocteau', 'Jean Cocteau, Edouard Dermithe, Henri Crémieux, François Périer, Claudine Auger, Françoise Arnoul, Lucia Bosè, Charles Aznavour', null, 'An 18th century poet travels through time in search of divine wisdom. In a mysterious wasteland, he has a series of enigmatic encounters with symbolic phantoms with whom he muses about the nature of art and his own career. Ultimately, the poet strives to achieve his rebirth as a celestial being.', 'An 18th century poet travels through time in search of divine wisdom. In a mysterious wasteland, he has a series of enigmatic encounters with symbolic phantoms with whom he muses about the nature of art and his own career. Ultimately, the poet strives to achieve his rebirth as a celestial being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21ccswsdwgoLVUDsaxp0bVUsE1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36878'),
  ('1006976015021761295', 'Testament of Youth', 2015, 'History, Drama, War', 'James Kent, Rob Hardy', 'Juliette Towhidi', 'Alicia Vikander, Kit Harington, Taron Egerton, Colin Morgan, Dominic West, Emily Watson, Hayley Atwell, Anna Chancellor', 'PG-13', 'Testament of Youth is a powerful story of love, war and remembrance, based on the First World War memoir by Vera Brittain, which has become the classic testimony of that war from a woman’s point of view. A searing journey from youthful hopes and dreams to the edge of despair and back again, it’s a film about young love, the futility of war and how to make sense of the darkest times.', 'Testament of Youth is a powerful story of love, war and remembrance, based on the First World War memoir by Vera Brittain, which has become the classic testimony of that war from a woman’s point of view. A searing journey from youthful hopes and dreams to the edge of despair and back again, it’s a film about young love, the futility of war and how to make sense of the darkest times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6kFsaDCulCLfYHmKLDKTYaddM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284689'),
  ('860011580731484415', 'Teste di cocco', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Ugo Fabrizio Giordani', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Alfredo Arciero', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Manuela Arcuri, Marisa Merlini, Marco Messeri, Philippe Leroy, Lucianna De Falco, Valentina Persia', null, 'Tommaso and Pietro are two brothers who, shortly after their father''s funeral, discover that the coffin is actually empty. To find out more they leave for Malaysia, where the man died, but a series of misunderstandings and false clues will take them around the world to discover other empty coffins and a father yet to be found and perhaps to know.', 'Tommaso and Pietro are two brothers who, shortly after their father''s funeral, discover that the coffin is actually empty. To find out more they leave for Malaysia, where the man died, but a series of misunderstandings and false clues will take them around the world to discover other empty coffins and a father yet to be found and perhaps to know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tRfefWKBSy5vEms2tJRHVStUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201265'),
  ('227831500853557307', 'Testimony of the Witness', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'J.R. Reyes, Roni S. Benaid', 'Tolits San Jose, Dick Gatchalian', 'Nico Locco, Divine Villareal, Mark Dionisio, Reina Castillo, Mitoy Yonting, Neil Tolentino, Rhea Montemayor, Audrey Avila', null, 'A groom desperate to fix his performance problem just days before his wedding.', 'A groom desperate to fix his performance problem just days before his wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLEc4CJgyRYk30tn9XIMvS2FbWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1588835'),
  ('417003888191739820', 'Testing the Limits', 1998, 'Drama', 'Brigitte Berman, A. Brooks Medoff, Ben Kufrin', 'Paul Sinor', 'Scott Carson, Marc Robinson, Brandy Davis, Lorissa McComas, Karl Preston, Gaelle Comparat', null, 'Mike and Toni are on their way to the mountains for a romantic weekend, when their car breaks down. The couple take shelter in an empty cabin, unaware that it is being used by bisexual photographer Jan who is on an erotic shoot with model Kristin. Things get more complicated when Glen, a fashion editor, arrives. Soon inhibitions (and underwear) are being freely cast aside. But the lovers'' reverie is broken when Kristin''s psychotic boyfriend breaks in, seeking vengeance.', 'Mike and Toni are on their way to the mountains for a romantic weekend, when their car breaks down. The couple take shelter in an empty cabin, unaware that it is being used by bisexual photographer Jan who is on an erotic shoot with model Kristin. Things get more complicated when Glen, a fashion editor, arrives. Soon inhibitions (and underwear) are being freely cast aside. But the lovers'' reverie is broken when Kristin''s psychotic boyfriend breaks in, seeking vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnK24nc7EuYEmozCeIGXfKZdMIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161905'),
  ('519949463469624230', 'Testosteron', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Andrzej Saramonowicz, Tomasz Konecki, Maria Bulanda', 'Andrzej Saramonowicz', 'Piotr Adamczyk, Borys Szyc, Maciej Stuhr, Krzysztof Stelmaszyk, Cezary Kosiński, Tomasz Karolak, Tomasz Kot, Magdalena Boczarska', null, 'The wedding of Kornel, a young, well known TV scientist, to the famous singer, Alicja, is to be the social event of the year. In the suburban reception hall, the final preperations are being made. The waiter, Tytus, who is somewhat touchy having just found out he is to become a father, lays out the cutlery on the tables.', 'The wedding of Kornel, a young, well known TV scientist, to the famous singer, Alicja, is to be the social event of the year. In the suburban reception hall, the final preperations are being made. The waiter, Tytus, who is somewhat touchy having just found out he is to become a father, lays out the cutlery on the tables.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBJdulDRXSG9etoYLfspsAyoHDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39561'),
  ('183726970967442941', 'Testosterone', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'David Moreton, Ken Kelsch, Nicolás Lidijover', 'David Moreton', 'David Sutcliffe, Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Celina Font, Leonardo Brzezicki, Dario Dukah, Jennifer Coolidge, Sonia Braga, Ezequiel Abeijón', 'R', 'Dean has been stumped for some time in his attempt to produce a follow-up to "I was a Teenage Speed Freak," his incredibly successful graphic novel. His fans expect great things from him and his editor, Louise, is hounding him. Instead of working, however, Dean spends his time searching for his Argentine lover Pablo, who went out one night for cigarettes and never came back.', 'Dean has been stumped for some time in his attempt to produce a follow-up to "I was a Teenage Speed Freak," his incredibly successful graphic novel. His fans expect great things from him and his editor, Louise, is hounding him. Instead of working, however, Dean spends his time searching for his Argentine lover Pablo, who went out one night for cigarettes and never came back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Fghk6IMzQLEfrxBU86JDEhj2UH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5591'),
  ('699859829735156261', 'Tête à claques', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Francis Perrin', null, 'Francis Perrin, Fanny Cottençon, Jacques François, Maurice Baquet, Michèle Bernier, Geneviève Fontanel, Marc Dudicourt, Antoine Bessis', null, 'Alex Berthier would love to be a famous songwriter. Meanwhile, he has to cope with unemployment, a witty 12 years old son and a rich and cute heiress who tries to help Alex as much as he tries to escape her: she brings nothing but trouble ! Fortunately, luck will strike again.', 'Alex Berthier would love to be a famous songwriter. Meanwhile, he has to cope with unemployment, a witty 12 years old son and a rich and cute heiress who tries to help Alex as much as he tries to escape her: she brings nothing but trouble ! Fortunately, luck will strike again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbcRt1hto8QJRDPZ3eYcphUSiwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178297'),
  ('329561856643635937', 'Tethered', 2022, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Aaron Sorgius, Cooper Thornton, Kayla Stuhr', 'Aaron Sorgius', 'Alexandra Paul, Kareem Ferguson, Jared Laufree, Brody Bett, Chris Demm', null, 'Miles from civilization, a blind teenager and the hunter he befriends are tormented by a mysterious creature lurking in the woods.', 'Miles from civilization, a blind teenager and the hunter he befriends are tormented by a mysterious creature lurking in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjGvA0VpGDOLsRvztJHQXpK8iNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833200'),
  ('595259389253122560', 'Tethered Wings', 2024, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Thierry Binisti', 'Alexis Bayet, Alain Layrac', 'Max Libert, Alexis Rosenstiehl, Émilie Caen, Roby Schinasi, Jérémy Kapone, Julien Tortora, Pauline Bression, Constance Dollé', null, 'On his wedding day, Paul is confronted by the sudden return of Joseph, a boy he lost touch with twenty years ago. The burning memories of that summer of 1983 resurface, overwhelming him with doubts about a lifetime of choices and the emotions of a forbidden love. As teenagers, their dazzling romance sparked relentless, violent homophobic harassment—until one tragic night changed their lives forever. Now, twenty years later, the past comes crashing into the present.', 'On his wedding day, Paul is confronted by the sudden return of Joseph, a boy he lost touch with twenty years ago. The burning memories of that summer of 1983 resurface, overwhelming him with doubts about a lifetime of choices and the emotions of a forbidden love. As teenagers, their dazzling romance sparked relentless, violent homophobic harassment—until one tragic night changed their lives forever. Now, twenty years later, the past comes crashing into the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBVcwihnLUIukd5rpYoDpnf98AA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1313219'),
  ('415277446528296270', 'Tetra Vaal', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Neill Blomkamp', 'Neill Blomkamp', null, null, 'A faux advertisement for a third-world robotic police that established Neill Blomkamp''s signature style of mixing lo-fi production with seamless CGI.', 'A faux advertisement for a third-world robotic police that established Neill Blomkamp''s signature style of mixing lo-fi production with seamless CGI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbeTzP6aLeOK54QeF6kyS8ctwtc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210306'),
  ('103474699761460778', 'Tetro', 2009, 'Drama', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Roman Coppola, Mihai Malaimare Jr.', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Vincent Gallo, Alden Ehrenreich, Maribel Verdú, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Silvia Pérez, Rodrigo de la Serna, Érica Rivas, Mike Amigorena', 'R', 'In Buenos Aires, 17-year-old Bennie seeks out his estranged brother Tetro, a once-promising writer haunted by their family’s past. As Bennie uncovers Tetro’s hidden manuscript, old secrets and rivalries resurface, forcing both men to confront the truth about their father and the tangled legacy that tore their family apart.', 'In Buenos Aires, 17-year-old Bennie seeks out his estranged brother Tetro, a once-promising writer haunted by their family’s past. As Bennie uncovers Tetro’s hidden manuscript, old secrets and rivalries resurface, forcing both men to confront the truth about their father and the tangled legacy that tore their family apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2FKTAf9aQoRgU0Z5KTJJwBfDCF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11928'),
  ('484995380690082994', 'Tetsuo II: Body Hammer', 1992, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Drama', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto, Katsunori Yokoyama', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Tomorowo Taguchi, Shinya Tsukamoto, Nobu Kanaoka, Kim Soo-jin, Hideaki Tezuka, Tomoo Asada, Iwata, Keinosuke Tomioka', null, 'A Japanese salaryman finds his body transforming into a weapon through sheer rage after his son is kidnapped by a gang of violent thugs.', 'A Japanese salaryman finds his body transforming into a weapon through sheer rage after his son is kidnapped by a gang of violent thugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2We4S0SmRP72BKpvtOfyu9cF6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17991'),
  ('213855848298371626', 'Tetsuo: The Bullet Man', 2010, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Satoshi Hayashi, Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Hisakatsu Kuroki', 'Eric Bossick, Akiko Monou, Yuko Nakamura, Stephen Sarrasin, Tiger Charlie Gerhardt, Prakhar Jain, Shinya Tsukamoto, Mike Duncan', null, 'When the son of an American man and a Japanese women is killed in a car crash, the man transforms into a rageful metallic being thirsty of blood and vengance.', 'When the son of an American man and a Japanese women is killed in a car crash, the man transforms into a rageful metallic being thirsty of blood and vengance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYcYjZ65YEEelekUgJcUp4HkRmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52034'),
  ('259617404354926634', 'Tetsuo: The Iron Man', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto, Shozin Fukui', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Tomorowo Taguchi, Shinya Tsukamoto, Kei Fujiwara, Nobu Kanaoka, Naomasa Musaka, Renji Ishibashi', 'NR', 'A "metal fetishist", driven mad by the maggots wriggling in the wound he''s made to embed metal into his flesh, runs out into the night and is accidentally run down by a Japanese businessman and his girlfriend. The pair dispose of the corpse in hopes of quietly moving on with their lives. However, the businessman soon finds that he is now plagued by a vicious curse that transforms his flesh into iron.', 'A "metal fetishist", driven mad by the maggots wriggling in the wound he''s made to embed metal into his flesh, runs out into the night and is accidentally run down by a Japanese businessman and his girlfriend. The pair dispose of the corpse in hopes of quietly moving on with their lives. However, the businessman soon finds that he is now plagued by a vicious curse that transforms his flesh into iron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skAxIP1DgnVIXaUaPFozWXtsbhs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41428'),
  ('354824190457760771', 'Tevar', 2015, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Amit Sharma, Manish Shahi, Laxman Utekar', null, 'Arjun Kapoor, Sonakshi Sinha, Manoj Bajpayee, Subrat Dutta, Gunjan Malhotra, Rajesh Sharma, Raj Babbar, Deepti Naval', null, 'A Kabaddi player rescues a young woman from an unwanted marriage and hides her in his home.', 'A Kabaddi player rescues a young woman from an unwanted marriage and hides her in his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcFHdnmAAwx4kzg6DkNn5lLGDeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312809'),
  ('353987449322580362', 'Tex', 1982, 'Drama', 'Tim Hunter, Ric Waite, Tom Connors', 'Charles S. Haas, Tim Hunter', 'Matt Dillon, Jim Metzler, Meg Tilly, Bill McKinney, Frances Lee McCain, Ben Johnson, Emilio Estevez, Jack Thibeau', 'PG', 'After their mother dies and their father leaves them, teenage brothers Tex and Mason McCormick struggle to make it on their own.', 'After their mother dies and their father leaves them, teenage brothers Tex and Mason McCormick struggle to make it on their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9p9IHzjRNoswTPqWpUiOisHuEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27332'),
  ('895581784516519074', 'Tex and the Lord of the Deep', 1985, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Western', 'Duccio Tessari, Pietro Morbidelli', 'Gianfranco Clerici, Duccio Tessari, Marcello Coscia', 'Giuliano Gemma, William Berger, Carlo Mucari, Peter Berling, Riccardo Petrazzi, Isabel Russinova, Flavio Bucci, Aldo Sambrell', null, 'Based on the adventures of the hero Tex from the comic strip by Bonelli. An interesting spaghetti-western/fantasy movie that blends magic and mythology with six-guns and stagecoaches.', 'Based on the adventures of the hero Tex from the comic strip by Bonelli. An interesting spaghetti-western/fantasy movie that blends magic and mythology with six-guns and stagecoaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jTpYTaEQc5UpAeGK5Dzyh5ybGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54310'),
  ('724150399864434749', 'Tex Avery: King of Cartoons', 1988, 'Documentary', 'John Needham', 'Joseph Adamson', 'Chuck Jones, June Foray, Joseph Adamson, Ed Love, Heck Allen, Mark Kausler, Michael Lah', null, 'A documentary about the life and career of legendary cartoon director Fred "Tex" Avery.', 'A documentary about the life and career of legendary cartoon director Fred "Tex" Avery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MjRLCvbVIA0WEpgzfOwpaW4Ehc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430270'),
  ('1116462682815437591', 'Texas', 1941, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'George Marshall, George Meehan', 'Horace McCoy, Lewis Meltzer, Michael Blankfort', 'William Holden, Glenn Ford, Claire Trevor, George Bancroft, Edgar Buchanan, Don Beddoe, Andrew Tombes, Addison Richards', 'NR', 'Two Virginians are heading for a new life in Texas when they witness a stagecoach being held up. They decide to rob the robbers and make off with the loot. To escape a posse, they split up and don''t see each other again for a long time. When they do meet up again, they find themselves on different sides of the law. This leads to the increasing estrangement of the two men, who once thought of themselves as brothers.', 'Two Virginians are heading for a new life in Texas when they witness a stagecoach being held up. They decide to rob the robbers and make off with the loot. To escape a posse, they split up and don''t see each other again for a long time. When they do meet up again, they find themselves on different sides of the law. This leads to the increasing estrangement of the two men, who once thought of themselves as brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9X8XBAswQx1tIsFADtKYsyds6yO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75315'),
  ('1068798655036158403', 'Texas', 2005, 'Action', 'Fausto Paravidino, Gherardo Gossi, Alberto Mangiante', 'Fausto Paravidino, Iris Fusetti, Carlo Orlando', 'Fausto Paravidino, Riccardo Scamarcio, Valeria Golino, Valerio Binasco, Carlo Orlando, Iris Fusetti, Alessia Bellotto, Teco Celio', null, 'Enrico, Carlo, Davide, Cinzia, Elisa. Three Saturdays in the life of a group of friends in a quiet town in Piedmont. One night in November, one in December close to Christmas, the third in February. A look at their lives and their daily problems, more or less important, which will lead someone to make even an extreme gesture.', 'Enrico, Carlo, Davide, Cinzia, Elisa. Three Saturdays in the life of a group of friends in a quiet town in Piedmont. One night in November, one in December close to Christmas, the third in February. A look at their lives and their daily problems, more or less important, which will lead someone to make even an extreme gesture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WX2f3t8jNOwQoc2jdrkX53P8Hg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82824'),
  ('868773831744640838', 'Texas - Doc Snyder hält die Welt in Atem', 1993, 'Comedy, Western', 'Helge Schneider, Ralf Huettner, Diethard Prengel', 'Schringo van den Berg, Helge Schneider', 'Helge Schneider, Peter Berling, Andreas Kunze, Peter Thoms, Werner Abrolat, Helmut Kleinmann, Buddy Casino, Charlie Weiss', null, 'The dreaded Doc Snyder returns home after 30 years. After his long ride through the prairies of the wild west, his laundry is extremely dirty, and who could wash it better than his unshaven mommy? But first she sends him to the prison, from which he is to free his brother Hank, because otherwise he will be hanged. When that''s done, they both spontaneously decide to rob a bank, which goes completely wrong. Before Doc Snyder''s eyes, his beloved brother is shot by his intimate enemy, the Nose Man. Snyder initially manages to escape, but the Nose Man takes up the pursuit, and from then on many innocent people have to die - including Snyder''s mother...', 'The dreaded Doc Snyder returns home after 30 years. After his long ride through the prairies of the wild west, his laundry is extremely dirty, and who could wash it better than his unshaven mommy? But first she sends him to the prison, from which he is to free his brother Hank, because otherwise he will be hanged. When that''s done, they both spontaneously decide to rob a bank, which goes completely wrong. Before Doc Snyder''s eyes, his beloved brother is shot by his intimate enemy, the Nose Man. Snyder initially manages to escape, but the Nose Man takes up the pursuit, and from then on many innocent people have to die - including Snyder''s mother...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybD59vpUjk5xjW0rRBRxcLwdjms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1659'),
  ('256160758547976436', 'Texas Across the River', 1966, 'Comedy, Western', 'Michael Gordon, Russell Metty, Terry Morse Jr.', 'Wells Root, Ben Starr, Harold Greene', 'Dean Martin, Alain Delon, Rosemary Forsyth, Joey Bishop, Tina Aumont, Peter Graves, Michael Ansara, Linden Chiles', 'NR', 'The Louisiana wedding of debutante Phoebe Ann Naylor to Don Andrea de Baldasar, El Duce de la Casala is stopped by the Cavalry over a matter of honor. Don Andrea flees across the river to Texas, where he meets up with Sam Hollis and his Indian sidekick, Kronk, who are carrying rifles to the town of Moccasin Flats. Don Andrea rescues an Indian maiden, Lonetta, tames some longhorns, competes with Sam for Phoebe''s affections, eludes a Comanche war party and the cavalry and ultimately saves the town and gets his girl.', 'The Louisiana wedding of debutante Phoebe Ann Naylor to Don Andrea de Baldasar, El Duce de la Casala is stopped by the Cavalry over a matter of honor. Don Andrea flees across the river to Texas, where he meets up with Sam Hollis and his Indian sidekick, Kronk, who are carrying rifles to the town of Moccasin Flats. Don Andrea rescues an Indian maiden, Lonetta, tames some longhorns, competes with Sam for Phoebe''s affections, eludes a Comanche war party and the cavalry and ultimately saves the town and gets his girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpZMy0X9b9Kpm9sH32PXuUXiC0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52480'),
  ('613082717124249051', 'Texas Chain Saw Massacre: The Shocking Truth', 2000, 'Documentary', 'David Gregory', 'David Gregory', 'Gunnar Hansen, Tobe Hooper, Marilyn Burns, Dorothy J. Pearl, Robert A. Burns, Kim Henkel, Allen Danziger, Ted Nicolaou', 'NR', 'A documentary primarily focusing on the filming and release of the original Texas Chainsaw Massacre.', 'A documentary primarily focusing on the filming and release of the original Texas Chainsaw Massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUgY6jF6yWkKEmXpyEepD6Xpuec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76177'),
  ('1109201263262352778', 'Texas Chainsaw 3D', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Luessenhop, Brad Arnold, Anastas N. Michos', 'Kirsten Elms, Debra Sullivan, Adam Marcus', 'Alexandra Daddario, Dan Yeager, Trey Songz, Tania Raymonde, Paul Rae, Thom Barry, Scott Eastwood, Shaun Sipos', 'R', 'A young woman learns that she has inherited a Texas estate from her deceased grandmother. After embarking on a road trip with friends to uncover her roots, she finds she is the sole owner of a lavish, isolated Victorian mansion. But her newfound wealth comes at a price as she stumbles upon a horror that awaits her in the mansion’s dank cellars.', 'A young woman learns that she has inherited a Texas estate from her deceased grandmother. After embarking on a road trip with friends to uncover her roots, she finds she is the sole owner of a lavish, isolated Victorian mansion. But her newfound wealth comes at a price as she stumbles upon a horror that awaits her in the mansion’s dank cellars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaPvvHP1kKlQaUAXQZQAWitqBOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76617'),
  ('220742835626057943', 'Texas Chainsaw Massacre', 2022, 'Horror, Crime, Drama', 'Kess Bonnet, Margarita Aneva, Monika Hristova', 'Chris Thomas Devlin', 'Sarah Yarkin, Elsie Fisher, Mark Burnham, Jacob Latimore, Moe Dunford, Olwen Fouéré, Jessica Allain, Nell Hudson', 'R', 'After nearly 50 years of hiding, Leatherface returns to terrorize a group of idealistic influencers who accidentally disrupt his carefully shielded world in a remote Texas town.', 'After nearly 50 years of hiding, Leatherface returns to terrorize a group of idealistic influencers who accidentally disrupt his carefully shielded world in a remote Texas town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sKiGNWFM15WNyY7LYd5vmb3brO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632727'),
  ('745270428498583056', 'Texas Cyclone', 1932, 'Action, Western', 'D. Ross Lederman, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Randall Faye', 'Tim McCoy, Shirley Grey, Wheeler Oakman, Walter Brennan, John Wayne, Wallace MacDonald, Vernon Dent, Mary Gordon', 'NR', 'When Texas Grant rides into town people think the supposedly dead Jim Rawlins has returned. After a confrontation with Utah Becker, Grant learns Jim''s wife, Helen, is about to lose her ranch to Becker, so he decides to stay and pose as Rawlins in an effort to help her.', 'When Texas Grant rides into town people think the supposedly dead Jim Rawlins has returned. After a confrontation with Utah Becker, Grant learns Jim''s wife, Helen, is about to lose her ranch to Becker, so he decides to stay and pose as Rawlins in an effort to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gg70VOaVdHTC1DBiFCW0yCcIM0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84900'),
  ('95764352387345508', 'Texas Justice', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry, Steven Fierberg', null, 'Peter Strauss, Heather Locklear, Dennis Franz, Lewis Smith, Susan Walters, Chris Mulkey, Linda Hart, Ned Vaughn', null, 'When a Texas millionaire marries his mistress, a bitter divorce battle, two deaths, an FBI sting operation, and criminal trials ensue.', 'When a Texas millionaire marries his mistress, a bitter divorce battle, two deaths, an FBI sting operation, and criminal trials ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aum7vvUZFCuQZUDfjwzJ2YDLDZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297605'),
  ('852979817779950291', 'Texas Killing Fields', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Ami Canaan Mann, Stuart Dryburgh, Darrin Prescott', 'Don Ferrarone, Don Ferrarone', 'Sam Worthington, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Jessica Chastain, Chloë Grace Moretz, Jason Clarke, Annabeth Gish, Sheryl Lee, Stephen Graham', 'R', 'In the Texas bayous, a local homicide detective teams up with a cop from New York City to investigate a series of unsolved murders.', 'In the Texas bayous, a local homicide detective teams up with a cop from New York City to investigate a series of unsolved murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWGCz9txia8hJsQDNe6Lj91qr7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72477'),
  ('675004067189687352', 'Texas Rangers', 2001, 'Western, Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Steve Miner, Dan Bradley, Daryn Okada', 'Scott Busby, Martin Copeland', 'James Van Der Beek, Rachael Leigh Cook, Ashton Kutcher, Dylan McDermott, Usher, Tom Skerritt, Randy Travis, Leonor Varela', 'PG-13', 'Ten years after the Civil War has ended, the Governor of Texas asks Leander McNelly to form a company of Rangers to help uphold the law along the Mexican border. With a few veterans of the war, most of the recruits are young men who have little or no experience with guns or policing crime.', 'Ten years after the Civil War has ended, the Governor of Texas asks Leander McNelly to form a company of Rangers to help uphold the law along the Mexican border. With a few veterans of the war, most of the recruits are young men who have little or no experience with guns or policing crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69tMHlxiCYlYKGZm1aPH1u7hY88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13503'),
  ('777894848538307370', 'Texas Terror', 1935, 'Action, Adventure, Western', 'Robert N. Bradbury, William Hyer, Archie Stout', 'Robert N. Bradbury', 'John Wayne, Lucile Browne, LeRoy Mason, Fern Emmett, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Jay Wilsey, John Ince, Henry Roquemore', 'NR', 'Sheriff John Higgins quits and goes into prospecting after he thinks he has killed his best friend in shooting it out with robbers. He encounters his dead buddy''s sister and helps her run her ranch. Then she finds out about his past.', 'Sheriff John Higgins quits and goes into prospecting after he thinks he has killed his best friend in shooting it out with robbers. He encounters his dead buddy''s sister and helps her run her ranch. Then she finds out about his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpjXvk37TOPaiy92cpamZHExPC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22606'),
  ('459411661548807479', 'Texas Tom', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Phil Harris', 'NR', 'Tom is a cowboy boot-wearing cat at a Texas dude ranch. When a beautiful female cat comes for a visit, Tom takes time from his regular torturing of Jerry to use the mouse as a way to impress the dame. Naturally, Jerry gives Tom his comeuppance.', 'Tom is a cowboy boot-wearing cat at a Texas dude ranch. When a beautiful female cat comes for a visit, Tom takes time from his regular torturing of Jerry to use the mouse as a way to impress the dame. Naturally, Jerry gives Tom his comeuppance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u03zseZNYAvGKcVZgKGVOnILh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90912'),
  ('553697368553713948', 'Texas, Adios', 1966, 'Western, Action', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Enzo Barboni', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Franco Rossetti', 'Franco Nero, Alberto Dell''Acqua, Elisa Montés, José Guardiola, Livio Lorenzon, Hugo Blanco, Luigi Pistilli, Antonella Murgia', null, 'A Texan sheriff and his younger brother travel across the border into Mexico to confront the man who killed their father.', 'A Texan sheriff and his younger brother travel across the border into Mexico to confront the man who killed their father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7LfMBSjReDfsgskvzwCn1AobHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23076'),
  ('293871099460055216', 'Texasville', 1990, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Bogdanovich, Gary Chason, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'Peter Bogdanovich', 'Jeff Bridges, Cybill Shepherd, Annie Potts, Randy Quaid, Cloris Leachman, Timothy Bottoms, William McNamara, Eileen Brennan', 'R', 'Summer, 1984: 30 years after Duane captained the high school football team and Jacy was homecoming queen, this Texas town near Wichita Falls prepares for its centennial. Oil prices are down, banks are failing, and Duane''s $12 million in debt. His wife Karla drinks too much, his children are always in trouble, and he tom-cats around with the wives of friends. Jacy''s back in town, after a mildly successful acting career, life in Italy, and the death of her son. Folks assume Duane and Jacy will resume their high school romance. And Sonny is "tired in his mind," causing worries for his safety. Can these friends find equilibrium in middle age?', 'Summer, 1984: 30 years after Duane captained the high school football team and Jacy was homecoming queen, this Texas town near Wichita Falls prepares for its centennial. Oil prices are down, banks are failing, and Duane''s $12 million in debt. His wife Karla drinks too much, his children are always in trouble, and he tom-cats around with the wives of friends. Jacy''s back in town, after a mildly successful acting career, life in Italy, and the death of her son. Folks assume Duane and Jacy will resume their high school romance. And Sonny is "tired in his mind," causing worries for his safety. Can these friends find equilibrium in middle age?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Tj55FkIsZWQbGxIkMuLFsMH7fj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82545'),
  ('1069911791362557849', 'Text', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brian McCulley', 'Ken Maskrey', 'Hanna Hall, Lane Compton, Michael Kaiser, Kaytlin Borgen, Katrina Miller, Joel Geist, Kevin Derkash, Jonathon Trent', 'NR', 'Four friends search for the answers to a series of deadly text messages killing students at their high school.', 'Four friends search for the answers to a series of deadly text messages killing students at their high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jLDp7fmQz6TkOjdHJtQMXvMR0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544023'),
  ('551386602164663337', 'Text', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Boris Voyt, Yekaterina Dyukova, Klim Shipenko', 'Dmitry Glukhovsky', 'Alexander Petrov, Kristina Asmus, Ivan Yankovsky, Sofya Ozerova, Maksim Vinogradov, Elena Finogeeva, Kirill Nagiev, Vladimir Kapustin', null, 'Ilya Goryunov has spent seven years in prison on false charges of drug trafficking. When Ilya is free he realizes that the old life that he yearned for is no more. Although he did not intend to take revenge on the man who sent him to prison, now there is no other way out.', 'Ilya Goryunov has spent seven years in prison on false charges of drug trafficking. When Ilya is free he realizes that the old life that he yearned for is no more. Although he did not intend to take revenge on the man who sent him to prison, now there is no other way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wubLM0woW4rUcGRDRhNO1e9IdM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581561'),
  ('569950284069171198', 'Text for You', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Andreas Berger, Karoline Herfurth', 'Andrea Willson, Malte Welding, Sophie Kluge', 'Karoline Herfurth, Katja Riemann, Frederick Lau, Nora Tschirner, Tom Beck, Friederike Kempter, Friedrich Mücke, Uwe Preuss', null, 'Sports writer Mark is baffled when he receives romantic text messages on his cell phone. What he does not know: His new number once belonged to the deceased boyfriend of Clara, who continues to send text messages in order to cope with the loss. When Mark''s girlfriend discovers the texts, she is understandably upset. Along with his best friend David, Mark sets out to find the mysterious writer.', 'Sports writer Mark is baffled when he receives romantic text messages on his cell phone. What he does not know: His new number once belonged to the deceased boyfriend of Clara, who continues to send text messages in order to cope with the loss. When Mark''s girlfriend discovers the texts, she is understandably upset. Along with his best friend David, Mark sets out to find the mysterious writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qc3TfSh1TWRPY9rGKsoiQMbWAR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393569'),
  ('124990477694311810', 'Textiles', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Franck Landron, Franck Landron', 'Christian Vincent, Gilles Cahoreau, Franck Landron', 'Barbara Schulz, Alexandre Brasseur, Magali Muxart, Jackie Berroyer, Sonia Vollereaux, Simon Bakhouche, Angélique Thomas, Sissi Duparc', null, 'Sophie and Olivier are a couple leading a straightforward life. They’re bakers in Paris and their lives are regulated by the constraints of their job. Sophie gets the feeling that her husband is no longer really interested in her. They then read a personal ad pinned to their bakery’s notice board and get in touch with Paul and Colette, a rather strange couple who want to sell their holiday home. They buy the house – without even taking a look at it first – little knowing that it’s located in a nudist colony.', 'Sophie and Olivier are a couple leading a straightforward life. They’re bakers in Paris and their lives are regulated by the constraints of their job. Sophie gets the feeling that her husband is no longer really interested in her. They then read a personal ad pinned to their bakery’s notice board and get in touch with Paul and Colette, a rather strange couple who want to sell their holiday home. They buy the house – without even taking a look at it first – little knowing that it’s located in a nudist colony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrrdIOKFV4uTam29m3Ak5DZDA5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75016'),
  ('968038376641801291', 'Texture of Skin', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Sung-gang', 'Lee Sung-gang', 'Kim Yun-tae, Kim Joo-ryoung, Bo-Yeong Choi, Yoon Ki-won, Lee Dae-yeon, Choi Moo-seong, Kwang-min Kim, Dong Bang-woo', null, 'This atmospheric drama follows photographer Min-woo, who enters into a torrid affair with a now-married ex-girlfriend, although he is distracted by a building obsession with the tormented ghost of the young woman who used to live in his apartment.', 'This atmospheric drama follows photographer Min-woo, who enters into a torrid affair with a now-married ex-girlfriend, although he is distracted by a building obsession with the tormented ghost of the young woman who used to live in his apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jmRF3ImelXsuvrMCgIFKFPEO9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193278'),
  ('441523620393036885', 'Teza', 2008, 'Drama', 'Haile Gerima', 'Haile Gerima', 'Aaron Arefe, Abiye Tedla, Takelech Beyene, Teje Tesfahun, Nebiyu Baye, Wuhib Bayu, Araba E. Johnston Arthur, Veronika Avraham', null, 'The Ethiopian intellectual Anberber returns to his native country during the repressive totalitarian regime of Haile Mariam Mengistu and the recognition of his own displacement and powerlessness at the dissolution of his people''s humanity and social values. After several years spent studying medicine in Germany, he finds the country of his youth replaced by turmoil. His dream of using his craft to improve the health of Ethiopians is squashed by a military junta that uses scientists for its own political ends. Seeking the comfort of his countryside home, Anberber finds no refuge from violence. The solace that the memories of his youth provide is quickly replaced by the competing forces of military and rebelling factions. Anberber needs to decide whether he wants to bear the strain or piece together a life from the fragments that lie around him.', 'The Ethiopian intellectual Anberber returns to his native country during the repressive totalitarian regime of Haile Mariam Mengistu and the recognition of his own displacement and powerlessness at the dissolution of his people''s humanity and social values. After several years spent studying medicine in Germany, he finds the country of his youth replaced by turmoil. His dream of using his craft to improve the health of Ethiopians is squashed by a military junta that uses scientists for its own political ends. Seeking the comfort of his countryside home, Anberber finds no refuge from violence. The solace that the memories of his youth provide is quickly replaced by the competing forces of military and rebelling factions. Anberber needs to decide whether he wants to bear the strain or piece together a life from the fragments that lie around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qttcUNmmi7S9FFim3dt3YPqAhd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12427'),
  ('615803769671648455', 'Tezaab', 1988, 'Drama', 'N. Chandra, Baba Azmi', 'N. Chandra, Kamlesh Pandey', 'Anil Kapoor, Madhuri Dixit, Chunky Panday, Anupam Kher, Kiran Kumar, Suparna Anand, Mandakini, Suhas Joshi', null, 'Mahesh Deshmukh has joined the nation''s armed forces as that he can honestly and patriotically serve the country. During his college days he has a run-in with fellow-collegian Mohini. A bet between his friends and himself ends up with him falling in love with Mohini, who subsequently realizes that he indeed has fallen in love with her, and she too reciprocates. Mohini''s dad is an alcoholic and wishes that Mohini takes up dancing and prostitution so that he can get his daily dose of alchol. Mohini attempts to take refuge with Mahesh, however, cirumstances tangle Mahesh to such an extent that he is arrested, charged, and sentenced to stay away from Bombay city limits. When Mahesh returns, it is no longer the honest, and patriotic Mahesh, but a gangster named Munna, who has many old scores to settle.', 'Mahesh Deshmukh has joined the nation''s armed forces as that he can honestly and patriotically serve the country. During his college days he has a run-in with fellow-collegian Mohini. A bet between his friends and himself ends up with him falling in love with Mohini, who subsequently realizes that he indeed has fallen in love with her, and she too reciprocates. Mohini''s dad is an alcoholic and wishes that Mohini takes up dancing and prostitution so that he can get his daily dose of alchol. Mohini attempts to take refuge with Mahesh, however, cirumstances tangle Mahesh to such an extent that he is arrested, charged, and sentenced to stay away from Bombay city limits. When Mahesh returns, it is no longer the honest, and patriotic Mahesh, but a gangster named Munna, who has many old scores to settle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwXVAAxuyDNfUSxYPS6YqRm80Cm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61271'),
  ('778697914591239334', 'Tezuka''s Barbara', 2020, 'Mystery, Fantasy', 'Satoshi Yoshida, Makoto Tezuka, Kubbie Tsoi', 'Hisako Kurosawa', 'Goro Inagaki, Fumi Nikaido, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Shizuka Ishibashi, Minami, Moemi Katayama, Eri Watanabe, Ryosuke Otani', null, 'Barbara is an adult-orientated fantasy tale filled with love and the occult from Osamu Tezuka''s reimagining of "The Tales of Hoffmann". Its story deals with the erotic and bizarre experiences of a famous novelist called Yosuke Mikura whose life is tossed upside down by a mysterious girl named "Barbara".', 'Barbara is an adult-orientated fantasy tale filled with love and the occult from Osamu Tezuka''s reimagining of "The Tales of Hoffmann". Its story deals with the erotic and bizarre experiences of a famous novelist called Yosuke Mikura whose life is tossed upside down by a mysterious girl named "Barbara".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sc2OgbmljHgrHRh3pwu6mdiR62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566135'),
  ('96181335597184653', 'Tezz', 2012, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Priyadarshan, S. Thirunavukkarasu, Riki Butland', 'Robin Bhatt', 'Ajay Devgn, Kangana Ranaut, Anil Kapoor, Zayed Khan, Sameera Reddy, Boman Irani, Mohanlal, Danny Sapani', null, 'To avenge his past, Aakash Rana plants bomb in a train endangering lives of 500 passengers.', 'To avenge his past, Aakash Rana plants bomb in a train endangering lives of 500 passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iokEa7lggQqReHkj9rs27m07Jt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85992'),
  ('604589064338259419', 'TFW No GF', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Alex Lee Moyer, Michael Reich', 'Alex Lee Moyer', 'kantbot, Viddy, Charels, Eggy', null, 'Born from the internet, the phrase "TFW No GF" was originally used online to describe a lack of romantic companionship. Since then, it has evolved to symbolize a greater state of existence defined by isolation, rejection and alienation. The meme''s protagonist, "WOJAK," has become the mascot to a vast online community consisting of self-described "hyper-anonymous twenty somethings" and "guys who slipped between the cracks." TFW No GF asks: How has the zeitgeist come to bear down on a generation alienated by the ''real world''? Meet the lost boys who came of age on the internet- places like 4chan and Twitter, where they find camaraderie in despair.', 'Born from the internet, the phrase "TFW No GF" was originally used online to describe a lack of romantic companionship. Since then, it has evolved to symbolize a greater state of existence defined by isolation, rejection and alienation. The meme''s protagonist, "WOJAK," has become the mascot to a vast online community consisting of self-described "hyper-anonymous twenty somethings" and "guys who slipped between the cracks." TFW No GF asks: How has the zeitgeist come to bear down on a generation alienated by the ''real world''? Meet the lost boys who came of age on the internet- places like 4chan and Twitter, where they find camaraderie in despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8uVeIF58QQJy4XChEXhcexvuoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664302'),
  ('1054649669414411211', 'Thaai Kizhavi', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sivakumar Murugesan, Vivek Vijayakumar', 'Sivakumar Murugesan', 'Radikaa Sarathkumar, Singampuli, Aruldoss, Balasaravanan, Munishkanth, Muthukumar, Raichal Rabecca Philip, Ilavarasu', null, 'Pavunuthaayi is a fiercely independent, intimidating elderly woman in a rural village, known for being tough, ruthless, and blunt-especially as a moneylender whose strict enforcement of dues makes her feared by locals.', 'Pavunuthaayi is a fiercely independent, intimidating elderly woman in a rural village, known for being tough, ruthless, and blunt-especially as a moneylender whose strict enforcement of dues makes her feared by locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbqRzqitfwAReJ3q2v9iMmpoh7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1602783'),
  ('12429726542916190', 'Thabo and the Rhino Case', 2023, 'Family, Adventure, Mystery', 'Mara Eibl-Eibesfeldt', 'Martin Gypkens, Ursula Gruber', 'Andrea Sawatzki, Litlhohonolofatso Litlhakayane, Ava Skuratowski, Claudio Caiolo, Joel Olano', 'PG', 'Eleven-year-old Thabo wants to become a private detective like in the movies. If only his home, the small African village of Hlatikulu, was not the most peaceful savannah paradise. But things take a sudden turn when a rhino is murdered in the neighboring safari park because of its precious horn.', 'Eleven-year-old Thabo wants to become a private detective like in the movies. If only his home, the small African village of Hlatikulu, was not the most peaceful savannah paradise. But things take a sudden turn when a rhino is murdered in the neighboring safari park because of its precious horn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Lpo6gAclJ2ruZP3xaZbJjVt9Zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1131751'),
  ('558531407461403186', 'Thackeray', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Abhijit Panse, Alankar Arvind, Sudeep Chatterjee', 'Abhijit Panse', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Amrita Rao, Sudhir Mishra, Rajesh Khera, Laxman Singh Rajput, Vineet Sharma, Chittaranjan Giri, Sanjay Narvekar', null, 'Based on the life of Keshav Thackeray, an Indian politician who is also known as Balasaheb Thackeray.', 'Based on the life of Keshav Thackeray, an Indian politician who is also known as Balasaheb Thackeray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfjEuYlASO9xoT8nLp8pVqKCtZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570910'),
  ('114173317191515325', 'Thai Massage', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mangesh Hadawale, G Srinivas Reddy', 'Mangesh Hadawale', 'Gajraj Rao, Divyendu Sharma, Sunny Hinduja, Anil Charanjeett, Vibha Chibber, Rajpal Yadav, Chandan Anand, Anurita Jha', null, 'A typical middle-class 70-year-old widower, Atmaram Dubey, who has been celibate for decades, realises he will probably never have sex. This awakening catapults him into an outrageous journey of self-discovery defying societal norms.', 'A typical middle-class 70-year-old widower, Atmaram Dubey, who has been celibate for decades, realises he will probably never have sex. This awakening catapults him into an outrageous journey of self-discovery defying societal norms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYPis1a03mHIIUXDScAKLHvEfBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977673'),
  ('219376705411828144', 'Thaïs', 1917, 'Drama', 'Luigi Dell''Otti, Riccardo Cassano, Anton Giulio Bragaglia', 'Anton Giulio Bragaglia, Riccardo Cassano', 'Thaïs Galitzky, Ileana Leonidoff, Augusto Bandini, Mario Parpagnoli, Dante Paletti, Alberto Casanova', null, 'The beautiful Thaïs Galitzy plays Vera, a Slavic countess, a seductress who drags married men to the brink of ruin. When she seduces the husband of her best friend, all involved meet a nasty fate.', 'The beautiful Thaïs Galitzy plays Vera, a Slavic countess, a seductress who drags married men to the brink of ruin. When she seduces the husband of her best friend, all involved meet a nasty fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYx4L0cm0SlCXLmJcjnvQgLIAl2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174707'),
  ('620012513656037466', 'Thalaivaa', 2013, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'A. L. Vijay, Deepak Sundarrajan, Gokula Krishnan', 'A. L. Vijay', 'Vijay, Amala Paul, Sathyaraj, Ponvannan, Nassar, Santhanam, Suresh, Y. G. Mahendran', null, 'A mafia don sends his son out of the country because he doesn''t want even a shadow of his life falling on him. Destiny wills otherwise. The son makes an innocuous trip to Mumbai to visit his dad. And ends up filling his father''s large shoes.', 'A mafia don sends his son out of the country because he doesn''t want even a shadow of his life falling on him. Destiny wills otherwise. The son makes an innocuous trip to Mumbai to visit his dad. And ends up filling his father''s large shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5h2SfwKTbbp0T21kjrOPU3QMaHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202616'),
  ('334732431041798701', 'Thalaivar Thambi Thalaimaiyil', 2026, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Nithish Sahadev, Bablu Aju, Rithwik lima Ramadas, Prabhu Jacky, Praveen Subramanian, Thulasi Sundar', 'Anuraj OB, Nithish Sahadev, Sanjo Joesph', 'Prathana Nathan, Ilavarasu, Thambi Ramaiah, Jensan Diwakar, V.G. Jaiwanth', null, 'A village official attending a wedding becomes entangled in an escalating family dispute over power and old resentments, testing his leadership as he tries to contain the situation.', 'A village official attending a wedding becomes entangled in an escalating family dispute over power and old resentments, testing his leadership as he tries to contain the situation.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fb%2Fgracenote%2Fb01eea7ff3d8563056e77628749dcb4a.jpg', 'plex:movie:ttt-thalaivar-thambi-thalaimaiyil'),
  ('385120156860782416', 'Thalapathi', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Mani Ratnam, Santosh Sivan', 'Mani Ratnam', 'Rajinikanth, Mammootty, Arvind Swamy, Srividya, Jaishankar, Amrish Puri, Shobana, Geetha', 'PG-13', 'Surya, a courageous man who was raised in the slums, fights for the rights of the poor and befriends Deva, who hires him as his commander and changes his life completely.', 'Surya, a courageous man who was raised in the slums, fights for the rights of the poor and befriends Deva, who hires him as his commander and changes his life completely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpF1Ck1UvpW0ItT1EoX0xNYEhS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29811'),
  ('601799911286751774', 'Thalassa, Thalassa', 1994, 'Drama', 'Bogdan Dumitrescu, Doru Mitran', 'Bogdan Dumitrescu', 'Danut Podzo, Constantin Tanase, Viorel Patrut, Cristian Paulica, Alexandru Anghel, Alexandru Cirstea, Silvia Gheorghe', null, 'A group of young boys, and one girl, find and steal a Jaguar convertible, and decide to drive to the sea. What starts out as a lark deteriorates into a rather grueling journey.', 'A group of young boys, and one girl, find and steal a Jaguar convertible, and decide to drive to the sea. What starts out as a lark deteriorates into a rather grueling journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfu9KkCbM0E6EcF2vqmwjniQpFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213028'),
  ('175551744077133616', 'Thalasso', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Christophe Offenstein', 'Daria Panchenko', 'Gérard Depardieu, Michel Houellebecq, Luc Schwarz, Maxime Lefrançois, Mathieu Nicourt, Daria Panchenko, Qianyum Lysis, Norbert Hamelin', null, 'Provocative French writer Michel Houellebecq meets Gérard Depardieu at a sea water therapy centre in Cabourg. Together, they try to survive the health regime to which they are subjected by the establishment. But events quickly derail their routine… Just Great is a joyful comedy elevated by two extraordinary performances.', 'Provocative French writer Michel Houellebecq meets Gérard Depardieu at a sea water therapy centre in Cabourg. Together, they try to survive the health regime to which they are subjected by the establishment. But events quickly derail their routine… Just Great is a joyful comedy elevated by two extraordinary performances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iajo5oWfwyUr0i4EjU86VOdhwnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582874'),
  ('351806068729300222', 'Thalavan', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Sharan Velayudhan Nair, Jis Joy', 'Sarath, Anand', 'Biju Menon, Asif Ali, Miya George, Anusree Nair, Dileesh Pothan, Shankar Ramakrishnan, Ranjith, Kottayam Nazeer', null, 'The intense rivalry between two police officers—CI Jayashankar and SI Karthik takes a dark turn when a body is found in Jayashankar’s house, and he becomes the prime suspect in a murder investigation, which is led by Karthik, adding a layer of tension to their already strained relationship.', 'The intense rivalry between two police officers—CI Jayashankar and SI Karthik takes a dark turn when a body is found in Jayashankar’s house, and he becomes the prime suspect in a murder investigation, which is led by Karthik, adding a layer of tension to their already strained relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/142iirjj2365WQTaXgMrmjC0tng.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1112108'),
  ('1115552321011245646', 'Thalavattam', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Priyadarshan', 'Priyadarshan', 'Mohanlal, Lissy, Nedumudi Venu, M G Soman, Karthika, Mukesh, Jagathy Sreekumar, Sukumari', null, 'Vinod/Vinu (played by Mohanlal) is mentally ill and is hospitalized in the institution run by Dr. Ravindran ( M G Soman). Story progresses as Vinod recovers with the help of Dr. Savithri, Dr. Ravindran''s daughter (Karthika) and Dr. Unnikrishnan (Nedumudi Venu) who finds that Vinu fell ill after the accidental death of his fiancée Anitha (Lizy). Later Vinu and Savithri fall in love but Savithri is already engaged to be married to her cousin, Hari(Mukesh). Plot progresses as Dr. Ravindran opposes the romance between the doctor and the recovered patient.', 'Vinod/Vinu (played by Mohanlal) is mentally ill and is hospitalized in the institution run by Dr. Ravindran ( M G Soman). Story progresses as Vinod recovers with the help of Dr. Savithri, Dr. Ravindran''s daughter (Karthika) and Dr. Unnikrishnan (Nedumudi Venu) who finds that Vinu fell ill after the accidental death of his fiancée Anitha (Lizy). Later Vinu and Savithri fall in love but Savithri is already engaged to be married to her cousin, Hari(Mukesh). Plot progresses as Dr. Ravindran opposes the romance between the doctor and the recovered patient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyRstPSfxtdEy0ppMFlkWISNdkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256372'),
  ('812304525490089089', 'Thalayana Manthram', 1990, 'Family', 'Sathyan Anthikad', 'Sreenivasan', 'Sreenivasan, Urvashi, Jayaram, Philomina, KPAC Lalitha, Innocent, Sankaradi, Mamukkoya', null, 'A struggling husband falls prey to his wife''s insatiable desire for luxury, leading them down a path of deception, debt, and betrayal.', 'A struggling husband falls prey to his wife''s insatiable desire for luxury, leading them down a path of deception, debt, and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkMQv88jTohntTHipYi63WdbNwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152607'),
  ('355493117299577254', 'Thale', 2012, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Aleksander Nordaas, Aleksander Nordaas', 'Aleksander Nordaas', 'Silje Reinamo, Erlend Nervold, Jon Sigve Skard, Sunniva Lien, Morten Andresen', 'NR', 'Norwegian folklore turns out to be real when Leo and Elvis encounter a girl called Thale in a basement. A regular cleaning job turns into a struggle for survival, while they''re trying to figure out what or who Thale is. Could Thale be a huldra? A seductive forest spirit who appears from the front to be a beautiful young woman, but who also has a cow''s tale and whose back appears to be like a hollowed out tree. The huldra has been known to offer rewards to those who satisfy them sexually, while death to those who fail to do so and are also prone to stealing human babies.', 'Norwegian folklore turns out to be real when Leo and Elvis encounter a girl called Thale in a basement. A regular cleaning job turns into a struggle for survival, while they''re trying to figure out what or who Thale is. Could Thale be a huldra? A seductive forest spirit who appears from the front to be a beautiful young woman, but who also has a cow''s tale and whose back appears to be like a hollowed out tree. The huldra has been known to offer rewards to those who satisfy them sexually, while death to those who fail to do so and are also prone to stealing human babies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzHeVg5U0G83Lkq5o86c2KiWgGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53567'),
  ('1140366809372280763', 'Thalía Unplugged', 2009, 'Music', null, null, 'Thalia, Joan Sebastian, Pedro Capó', 'G', 'Primera Fila is the first live CD/DVD album by the Mexican singer-songwriter Thalía. This album was recorded in Miami, Florida at the BankUnited Center on July 29 and 30, 2009, with a selected audience to attend the concert. Primera Fila is her first project under her new label Sony Music. The album was released on December 1, 2009. It includes duets with five-time Latin Grammy Award winning-Mexican singer and songwriter Joan Sebastian and the new Puerto Rican musician Pedro Capó. It also contains new songs and a medley with some of her hit songs.', 'Primera Fila is the first live CD/DVD album by the Mexican singer-songwriter Thalía. This album was recorded in Miami, Florida at the BankUnited Center on July 29 and 30, 2009, with a selected audience to attend the concert. Primera Fila is her first project under her new label Sony Music. The album was released on December 1, 2009. It includes duets with five-time Latin Grammy Award winning-Mexican singer and songwriter Joan Sebastian and the new Puerto Rican musician Pedro Capó. It also contains new songs and a medley with some of her hit songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5W2RVVpoAm9aWYuDCVZGkCpKBlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38029'),
  ('919050075699322952', 'Thallumaala', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Action', 'Khalid Rahman, Jimshi Khalid', 'Muhsin Parari, Ashraf Hamsa', 'Tovino Thomas, Lukman Avaran, Swathi Das Prabhu, Adhri Joe, Austin Dan, Shine Tom Chacko, Kalyani Priyadarshan, Binu Pappu', null, 'Wazim is young, carefree and often drawn to fights. But when love blooms with a star vlogger, the impact of his fists could have disastrous effects.', 'Wazim is young, carefree and often drawn to fights. But when love blooms with a star vlogger, the impact of his fists could have disastrous effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Y1tcQqAiUkAbc6SUJgoP73sE5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:863530'),
  ('703991596740402771', 'Thamma', 2025, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Aditya Sarpotdar, Saurabh Goswami, Shekar Sunil', 'Niren Bhatt, Suresh Mathew, Arun Fulara', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Rashmika Mandanna, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Paresh Rawal, Faisal Malik, Geeta Agrawal Sharma, Rachit Singh, Raj Premi', null, 'Two destined lovers battle supernatural forces, family ties, and nature itself to defend their forbidden romance in a mystical world where ancient powers and prophecies threaten to keep them apart.', 'Two destined lovers battle supernatural forces, family ties, and nature itself to defend their forbidden romance in a mystical world where ancient powers and prophecies threaten to keep them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udkbDwBbysCGEydt0FHnl9dVO2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196364'),
  ('856104717554186789', 'Thammudu', 1999, 'Drama, Action', 'P.A. Arun Prasad', null, 'Pawan Kalyan, Achyuth, Preeti Jhangiani, Aditi Gowitrikar, Ali Basha, Kitty, Brahmanandam, Tanikella Bharani', null, 'Subrahmanyam (Pawan Kalyan), the youngest son of the family wastes away his life. His father always scolds him but his brother Chakri (Achyuth) who is a boxer, and friend Jaanu (Preeti Jhangiani) dote him. Meanwhile he falls in love with Lovely (Aditi) and for this he keeps on telling lies to her that he is very rich. Jaanu in the middle truly loves Subrahmanyam and gives him everything he asks her for thinking that he is doing these for her but he does it for lovely. Will Subrahmanyam realize what true love is?', 'Subrahmanyam (Pawan Kalyan), the youngest son of the family wastes away his life. His father always scolds him but his brother Chakri (Achyuth) who is a boxer, and friend Jaanu (Preeti Jhangiani) dote him. Meanwhile he falls in love with Lovely (Aditi) and for this he keeps on telling lies to her that he is very rich. Jaanu in the middle truly loves Subrahmanyam and gives him everything he asks her for thinking that he is doing these for her but he does it for lovely. Will Subrahmanyam realize what true love is?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNW91EcYqlhgHccmbEIjmaPL7h1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199808'),
  ('958671192619812603', 'Thanatomorphose', 2012, 'Horror', 'Éric Falardeau, Fauve Paradis, Benoît Lemire', 'Éric Falardeau', 'Kayden Rose, David Tousignant, Émile Beaudry, Eryka Cantieri, Roch-Denis Gagnon, Karine Picard, Simon Laperrière, Pat Lemaire', null, 'Bruised from a night of rough sex, a young woman is shocked to find that her body, rather than healing itself, has inexplicably begun to rot. Swept up in the strange sensual experiences brought on by her slowly decaying form, she tries desperately to cling to her new existence — even as the putrid meat sack that was once her young body begins to literally fall off her bones...', 'Bruised from a night of rough sex, a young woman is shocked to find that her body, rather than healing itself, has inexplicably begun to rot. Swept up in the strange sensual experiences brought on by her slowly decaying form, she tries desperately to cling to her new existence — even as the putrid meat sack that was once her young body begins to literally fall off her bones...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EBH4OrpJrPWROoPqcURbtaUdRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144204'),
  ('5628118848958094', 'Thanatopsis', 1963, 'Horror', 'Ed Emshwiller', null, 'Becky Arnold, Mac Emshwiller, Carol Emshwiller', null, 'Power saws and a heartbeat score this experimental light-and-color shot by Ed Emshwiller.', 'Power saws and a heartbeat score this experimental light-and-color shot by Ed Emshwiller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBesnA8YEC6ytEieHOFFf9i6NoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109377'),
  ('1100678198272128890', 'Thanatos, Drunk', 2015, 'Drama', 'Chang Tso-chi, Chang Chih-teng, Hsu Chih-chun', 'Chang Tso-chi', 'Lee Hong-chi, Rexen Cheng, Huang Shang-ho, Chang Ning, Lü Hsueh-feng, Ching-Ting Wang, Chin-Yu Lin', null, 'In a crumbling house on the edge of Taipei, two brothers drift through odd jobs, messy love, and quiet yearning for a life that feels like their own.', 'In a crumbling house on the edge of Taipei, two brothers drift through odd jobs, messy love, and quiet yearning for a life that feels like their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5NhRK8qfTeCaUTJ9MkBPab8eKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325344'),
  ('1066889824559799285', 'Thani Oruvan', 2015, 'Thriller, Action', 'Mohan Raja, Ramji, Rajdeep', 'Mohan Raja, D Suresh, A.N. Balakrishnan', 'Ravi Mohan, Arvind Swamy, Nayanthara, Vamsi Krishna, Ganesh Venkatraman, Nassar, Thambi Ramaiah, Harish Uthaman', null, 'An idealistic cop and an ambitious scientist-businessman indulge in a high-stake battle of wits.', 'An idealistic cop and an ambitious scientist-businessman indulge in a high-stake battle of wits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90ZpZw1qZlt0RUVByJATFVUEeEm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280165'),
  ('590979079783027727', 'Thaniyavarthanam', 1987, 'Drama', 'Sibi Malayil, Saloo George', 'A K Lohithadas', 'Mammootty, Mukesh, Kaviyoor Ponnamma, Thilakan, Kothuku Nanappan, Saritha, Asha Jayaram, Philomina', null, 'Balan, a teacher, has a mentally unstable uncle. There is a belief that the family is cursed to have a lunatic at all times. When the uncle passes away, people believe that Balan will be the next.', 'Balan, a teacher, has a mentally unstable uncle. There is a belief that the family is cursed to have a lunatic at all times. When the uncle passes away, people believe that Balan will be the next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5G7EUfeCWMIR0z1eZEx2lrqhMlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307252'),
  ('488374773365475154', 'Thank God', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Indra Kumar, Aseem Bajaj', 'Aakash Kaushik, Madhur Sharma', 'Sidharth Malhotra, Ajay Devgn, Rakul Preet Singh, Seema Pahwa, Kanwaljit Singh, Mahesh Balraj, Vikram Kochhar, Sumit Gulati', null, 'An egoistic real estate broker in huge debts, meets with an accident. As he gains consciousness, he realizes that he is in heaven. God appears before him and informs him that he must play a ''Game of Life''. If he manages to win, he will be sent back to earth; if he loses, he will be sent to hell.', 'An egoistic real estate broker in huge debts, meets with an accident. As he gains consciousness, he realizes that he is in heaven. God appears before him and informs him that he must play a ''Game of Life''. If he manages to win, he will be sent back to earth; if he loses, he will be sent to hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxKtwP2Q4n3jfqMIqxoShX08UkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783723'),
