  ('82438679750633766', 'Thank God It''s Friday', 1978, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Robert Klane, William Lasky, James Crabe', 'Armyan Bernstein', 'Jeff Goldblum, Raymond Vitte, Debra Winger, Valerie Landsburg, Terri Nunn, Chick Vennera, Donna Summer, Mark Lonow', 'PG', 'It''s Friday and everyone is going to the hottest new disco in Los Angeles. The Commodores are scheduled to play if Floyd shows up with the instruments and Nicole dreams of becoming a disco star. Other characters are there to win the dance contest, or to put a little excitement into a fifth anniversary.', 'It''s Friday and everyone is going to the hottest new disco in Los Angeles. The Commodores are scheduled to play if Floyd shows up with the instruments and Nicole dreams of becoming a disco star. Other characters are there to win the dance contest, or to put a little excitement into a fifth anniversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZQsCjoenn7IqoIKBDMMd202huH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42212'),
  ('607891437564093764', 'Thank God We Have Each Other', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Anne Giafferi, Stéphane Cami', 'Anne Giafferi', 'Oscar Pauleau, Eliott Furic, Nina De Tonquedec, Fred Testot, Zinedine Soualem, Milo Machado-Graner, Shirel Nataf, Agnès Ramy', null, 'Vincent is 13 years old and has a boundless admiration for his father. His father is unemployed and is mainly involved in football, pretending to become a professional trainer soon, and does not take care of his family. Vincent''s mother manages everything, until one day, at the end of her tether, she attempts suicide.', 'Vincent is 13 years old and has a boundless admiration for his father. His father is unemployed and is mainly involved in football, pretending to become a professional trainer soon, and does not take care of his family. Vincent''s mother manages everything, until one day, at the end of her tether, she attempts suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wB9xWXTgcZY1Z66SszZJpuxrnFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058549'),
  ('564597495220042780', 'Thank Heaven for Small Favors', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Luc Andrieux, Léonce-Henri Burel', 'Michel Servin, Alain Moury', 'Bourvil, Francis Blanche, Jean Poiret, Jean Yonnel, Jean Tissier, Véronique Nordey, Bernard Lavalette, Marcel Pérès', null, 'Bad financial conditions compel an aristocratic family to do strange work.', 'Bad financial conditions compel an aristocratic family to do strange work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2qHZG6J5Ar6GBu1qkjZD9WEGku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62848'),
  ('102909434156122170', 'Thank You', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Anees Bazmee, Ravi Yadav', 'Nisar Akhtar, Kumaar, Amitabh Bhattacharya', 'Akshay Kumar, Bobby Deol, Irrfan Khan, Suniel Shetty, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Rimi Sen, Celina Jaitly, Mukesh Tiwari', null, 'Three married womanisers cheat on their wives. In order to catch them red-handed, their sceptic wives enlist a detective who specialises in investigating extramarital relationships.', 'Three married womanisers cheat on their wives. In order to catch them red-handed, their sceptic wives enlist a detective who specialises in investigating extramarital relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jz15NthZjMHG8sKajS6D6QJkeb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61400'),
  ('65027273605421751', 'Thank You for Calling', 2015, 'Thriller, Comedy, Drama', 'Pascal Elbé, Romain Lacourbas', 'Pascal Elbé', 'Vincent Elbaz, Julie Gayet, Zabou Breitman, Ludovik, Anne Charrier, Lionel Abelanski, Dan Herzberg, Nicole Calfan', null, 'Biography based on the life of conman Gilbert Chikli who invented the "CEO scam" and was able to persuade bank and company officers to transfer money by simply ringing them and impersonating their CEO. He is now living in luxury in Israel.', 'Biography based on the life of conman Gilbert Chikli who invented the "CEO scam" and was able to persuade bank and company officers to transfer money by simply ringing them and impersonating their CEO. He is now living in luxury in Israel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sHZEkXki4iHXsAguOZa2fL2UsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369772'),
  ('387393766595022848', 'Thank You For Coming', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Karan Boolani, Anil Mehta, Abhimanyu Ray', 'Radhika Anand', 'Bhumi Pednekar, Dolly Singh, Shibani Bedi, Natasha Rastogi, Dolly Ahluwalia, Pradhuman Singh, Shehnaaz Gill, Kusha Kapila', null, 'Opting for a stable fiancé over genuine romance, a food blogger experiences sexual satisfaction for the first time at her engagement party. However, she must find out who her mysterious lover is.', 'Opting for a stable fiancé over genuine romance, a food blogger experiences sexual satisfaction for the first time at her engagement party. However, she must find out who her mysterious lover is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6XB8v38Y49ts4bklaHuCHuJKCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957999'),
  ('859794475438861274', 'Thank You for Smoking', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Casey Mako, Jason Reitman, James Whitaker', 'Jason Reitman', 'Aaron Eckhart, Maria Bello, Cameron Bright, Adam Brody, Sam Elliott, Katie Holmes, Rob Lowe, William H. Macy', 'R', 'Nick Naylor is a charismatic spin-doctor for Big Tobacco who''ll fight to protect America''s right to smoke -- even if it kills him -- while still remaining a role model for his 12-year old son. When he incurs the wrath of a senator bent on snuffing out cigarettes, Nick''s powers of "filtering the truth" will be put to the test.', 'Nick Naylor is a charismatic spin-doctor for Big Tobacco who''ll fight to protect America''s right to smoke -- even if it kills him -- while still remaining a role model for his 12-year old son. When he incurs the wrath of a senator bent on snuffing out cigarettes, Nick''s powers of "filtering the truth" will be put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41bMmglWT72OaRXrMROEyksOf3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9388'),
  ('311863272916751865', 'Thank You for Your Service', 2017, 'Drama, War', 'Jason Hall, Roman Vasyanov', 'Jason Hall', 'Miles Teller, Haley Bennett, Joe Cole, Amy Schumer, Beulah Koale, Scott Haze, Keisha Castle-Hughes, Brad Beyer', 'R', 'A group of U.S. soldiers returning from Iraq struggle to integrate back into family and civilian life, while living with the memory of a war that threatens to destroy them long after they''ve left the battlefield.', 'A group of U.S. soldiers returning from Iraq struggle to integrate back into family and civilian life, while living with the memory of a war that threatens to destroy them long after they''ve left the battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8OKWw6DAZAOyz8F421euawr3Hs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347629'),
  ('916955379973974234', 'Thank You Guys', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vanessa Pozzi, Francesca Gasperini, Riccardo Milani', 'Riccardo Milani, Michele Astori, Emmanuel Courcol', 'Antonio Albanese, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Sonia Bergamasco, Vinicio Marchioni, Giacomo Ferrara, Giorgio Montanini, Andrea Lattanzi, Nicola Rignanese', null, 'An actor past his prime gives drama lessons to prisoners in an attempt to stage "Waiting for Godot."', 'An actor past his prime gives drama lessons to prisoners in an attempt to stage "Waiting for Godot."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vykcxsJeVVEcrrmFORF519Di1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919950'),
  ('1046140002249033189', 'Thank You Jesus for the Eternal Present', 1973, null, 'Owen Land', null, null, null, 'A rapturous audio-visual mix that “deliberately seeks a hidden order in randomness.” The film combines the face of a woman in ecstatic, contemplative prayer with shots of an animal rights activist, and a scantily clad model advertising Russian cars at the International Auto Show, New York. - Harvard Film Archive', 'A rapturous audio-visual mix that “deliberately seeks a hidden order in randomness.” The film combines the face of a woman in ecstatic, contemplative prayer with shots of an animal rights activist, and a scantily clad model advertising Russian cars at the International Auto Show, New York. - Harvard Film Archive', null, 'tmdb:movie:293161'),
  ('69953010642004006', 'Thank You Mask Man', 1971, 'Western, Animation, Comedy', 'John Magnuson, Lenny Bruce', 'Lenny Bruce', 'Lenny Bruce', null, 'This short animation set to Lenny Bruce''s live monologue tells how the Lone Ranger hooks up with Tonto. With Bruce doing all the voices, this animation begins with local folks upset at the Lone Ranger because he won''t stay around to be thanked after a good deed. So, he stays and finds he likes hearing "Thank you mask man." When their attention starts to shift elsewhere, he shocks and disgusts the townspeople with a final request. According to the cartoon’s producer John Magnuson, at early showings of this, gay audiences were upset by its apparent “fag-bashing”. And it’s true, part of the fun of the piece is just crying out “Masked man’s a fag”, scandalising and defacing the image of this all-American hero. But it’s within the larger context of Bruce’s analysis of heroism, and that the towns people reject the Masked Man is because of their prejudices, not because Bruce is asking us to endorse them. (from: http://ukjarry.blogspot.de/2010/01/352-lenny-bruce-thank-you-mask-man.html)', 'This short animation set to Lenny Bruce''s live monologue tells how the Lone Ranger hooks up with Tonto. With Bruce doing all the voices, this animation begins with local folks upset at the Lone Ranger because he won''t stay around to be thanked after a good deed. So, he stays and finds he likes hearing "Thank you mask man." When their attention starts to shift elsewhere, he shocks and disgusts the townspeople with a final request. According to the cartoon’s producer John Magnuson, at early showings of this, gay audiences were upset by its apparent “fag-bashing”. And it’s true, part of the fun of the piece is just crying out “Masked man’s a fag”, scandalising and defacing the image of this all-American hero. But it’s within the larger context of Bruce’s analysis of heroism, and that the towns people reject the Masked Man is because of their prejudices, not because Bruce is asking us to endorse them. (from: http://ukjarry.blogspot.de/2010/01/352-lenny-bruce-thank-you-mask-man.html)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8QJpvddWuDVGwMtif3005yxmjZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101477'),
  ('1128725481050516883', 'Thank You, I''m Sorry', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lisa Aschan', 'Lisa Aschan, Marie Østerbye', 'Sanna Sundqvist, Charlotta Björck, Ia Langhammer, Ville Virtanen, Jonatan Rodriguez, Michael Segerström, Juan Rodríguez', 'PG-13', 'Suddenly alone during the late stages of her pregnancy, Sara receives an unexpected lifeline when Linda, her estranged older sister, arrives.', 'Suddenly alone during the late stages of her pregnancy, Sara receives an unexpected lifeline when Linda, her estranged older sister, arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGnFNjzi1hXZ7CiywbOERUh1KAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211199'),
  ('1115276687588640187', 'Thank You, Life', 1991, 'Drama', 'Bertrand Blier, Philippe Rousselot', 'Bertrand Blier', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Anouk Grinberg, Michel Blanc, Jean Carmet, Annie Girardot, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Catherine Jacob, Gérard Depardieu', null, 'Camille, a naïve schoolgirl, meets an intriguing influence in Joelle, a slightly older and much more experienced spirit. Camille follows her new friend through the discovery of sex and the darker side of life. As the film progresses, Camille discovers AIDS and the fear that she may have picked up the disease in her early encounters.', 'Camille, a naïve schoolgirl, meets an intriguing influence in Joelle, a slightly older and much more experienced spirit. Camille follows her new friend through the discovery of sex and the darker side of life. As the film progresses, Camille discovers AIDS and the fear that she may have picked up the disease in her early encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HiCNCihpEyhoztinxU7Xn3vPUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32853'),
  ('330240611915425838', 'Thank You, Mr. Moto', 1937, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Norman Foster, Virgil Miller', 'Norman Foster, Wyllis Cooper', 'Peter Lorre, Thomas Beck, Pauline Frederick, Jayne Regan, Sidney Blackmer, Sig Ruman, John Carradine, Wilhelm von Brincken', 'NR', 'Mr. Moto Heads to China on a quest for seven ancient scrolls that reveal the location of Genghis Khan''s tomb—a crypt filled with fabulous treasure! But Moto isn''t the only one stalking the scrolls—so is a shadowy band of thieves. But when his ruthless rivals go too far, the mild-mannered detective''s quest for antiquities becomes a passion for vengeance—because if he can''t bring these villains to justice... he''ll bring them to their knees.', 'Mr. Moto Heads to China on a quest for seven ancient scrolls that reveal the location of Genghis Khan''s tomb—a crypt filled with fabulous treasure! But Moto isn''t the only one stalking the scrolls—so is a shadowy band of thieves. But when his ruthless rivals go too far, the mild-mannered detective''s quest for antiquities becomes a passion for vengeance—because if he can''t bring these villains to justice... he''ll bring them to their knees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nz2gDyJdkcNPJ37YrnU3LQteZd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59581'),
  ('732554596593206375', 'Thank You, Padre Pio!', 2001, 'Drama', 'Amedeo Gianfrotta', 'Mariano Di Martino', 'Gigione, Jo Donatello, Antonio Allocca, Mariano Di Martino, Fabio Carbone, Cinzia Profita', null, 'Gigione goes on tour and Jo Donatello, who would like to go with his father, is forced to stay at home. Walking through the city he meets a friend with two young girls, one of whom obviously has to go to Donatello, who enchants her with the most boring and rhetorical saccharine love song. However, the girl is worried about "all those people who fight for freedom", so Donatello offers to be a driver in a series of clandestine races that we do not have the pleasure of seeing. Overseeing the entire operation is Don Franco, a sinister man with a Camorra streak who takes the young lover under his wing. Returning from the triumphant series of concerts Gigione discovers that Donatello is involved in a bad circle, and after an inconclusive confrontation with Don Franco, he thinks it would be a good idea to go on a pilgrimage to San Giovanni Rotondo to ask for mercy from Padre Pio.', 'Gigione goes on tour and Jo Donatello, who would like to go with his father, is forced to stay at home. Walking through the city he meets a friend with two young girls, one of whom obviously has to go to Donatello, who enchants her with the most boring and rhetorical saccharine love song. However, the girl is worried about "all those people who fight for freedom", so Donatello offers to be a driver in a series of clandestine races that we do not have the pleasure of seeing. Overseeing the entire operation is Don Franco, a sinister man with a Camorra streak who takes the young lover under his wing. Returning from the triumphant series of concerts Gigione discovers that Donatello is involved in a bad circle, and after an inconclusive confrontation with Don Franco, he thinks it would be a good idea to go on a pilgrimage to San Giovanni Rotondo to ask for mercy from Padre Pio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZFCAxqmyOj7CMjyFwyP6QTb8Py.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192430'),
