  ('32126063675479675', 'Thanos and Despina', 1967, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jean Boffety, Christian Guillouet, Nikos Papatakis', 'Nikos Papatakis', 'Olga Karlatos, George Dialegmenos, Lambros Tsangas, Elli Xanthaki, Tzavalas Karousos, Dimos Starenios, Nikiforos Naneris, Maria Konstadarou', null, 'Katina, an impoverished Greek woman, tries to arrange the marriage of her shepherd son, Thanos, to Despina, the daughter of a wealthy landowner. But Despina’s father, Vlahopoulos refuses to give his blessings.', 'Katina, an impoverished Greek woman, tries to arrange the marriage of her shepherd son, Thanos, to Despina, the daughter of a wealthy landowner. But Despina’s father, Vlahopoulos refuses to give his blessings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyj3MF6G9JXhS6ZjtxJuNn5USvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47010'),
  ('356772900326535187', 'Thappad', 2020, 'Drama', 'Anubhav Sinha, Vikhyaat Sareen, Pratik Visapurkar', null, 'Taapsee Pannu, Pavail Gulati, Dia Mirza, Maya Sarao, Geetika Vidya, Kumud Mishra, Ratna Pathak Shah, Tanvi Azmi', null, 'A young woman''s life is shattered into pieces when her husband slaps her at a party, causing her to question what this relationship stands for.', 'A young woman''s life is shattered into pieces when her husband slaps her at a party, causing her to question what this relationship stands for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSOgDTClgfbIOBgv4Itf3GSEkWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668435'),
  ('755330167590311800', 'Thar', 2022, 'Western, Action, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Shreya Dev Dube, Gautam Kishanchandani, Raj Singh Chaudhary', 'Raj Singh Chaudhary', 'Anil Kapoor, Harshvardhan Kapoor, Fatima Sana Shaikh, Satish Kaushik, Jitendra Joshi, Mukti Mohan, Akshay Oberoi, Nivedita Bhattacharya', null, 'A mysterious stranger arrives in a village situated in the Thar desert and crosses paths with a veteran cop investigating a case of brutal killings.', 'A mysterious stranger arrives in a village situated in the Thar desert and crosses paths with a veteran cop investigating a case of brutal killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PK1WRr8dOF7FG5G4VCal4GcnPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:941596'),
  ('311471470238084854', 'That Awkward Moment', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tom Gormican, Brandon Trost', 'Tom Gormican', 'Zac Efron, Miles Teller, Michael B. Jordan, Imogen Poots, Mackenzie Davis, Jessica Lucas, Addison Timlin, Josh Pais', 'R', 'Best pals Jason and Daniel indulge in casual flings and revel in their carefree, unattached lives. After learning that the marriage of their friend Mikey is over, they gladly welcome him back into their circle. The three young men make a pact to have fun and avoid commitment. However, when all three find themselves involved in serious relationships, they must keep their romances secret from one another.', 'Best pals Jason and Daniel indulge in casual flings and revel in their carefree, unattached lives. After learning that the marriage of their friend Mikey is over, they gladly welcome him back into their circle. The three young men make a pact to have fun and avoid commitment. However, when all three find themselves involved in serious relationships, they must keep their romances secret from one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjDAdesZNYFyRNnZvLT0osc7S2t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225565'),
  ('268835009594322488', 'That Brennan Girl', 1946, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alfred Santell, Russell Kimball, Cy Feuer', 'Doris Anderson', 'James Dunn, Mona Freeman, William Marshall, June Duprez, Frank Jenks, Dorothy Vaughan, Charles Arnt, Rosalind Ivan', 'NR', 'Raised by Natalie Brennan, a flamboyant and irresponsible mother, Ziggy Brennan gets involved in hustling men at a young age. She hangs around with a wild crowd and learns gets her "street smarts" first from her mother, who wants everyone to think they are sisters, and then from Denny Reagan, an older man. He starts teaching her his tricks of the trade and she falls right in line with his crooked ways. Then one night she meets Martin J. ''Mart'' Neilson, a tall, handsome, honest farmer boy who''s a sailor and they fall in love. While he''s away fighting the war, she discovers she''s pregnant.', 'Raised by Natalie Brennan, a flamboyant and irresponsible mother, Ziggy Brennan gets involved in hustling men at a young age. She hangs around with a wild crowd and learns gets her "street smarts" first from her mother, who wants everyone to think they are sisters, and then from Denny Reagan, an older man. He starts teaching her his tricks of the trade and she falls right in line with his crooked ways. Then one night she meets Martin J. ''Mart'' Neilson, a tall, handsome, honest farmer boy who''s a sailor and they fall in love. While he''s away fighting the war, she discovers she''s pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRe65DK23jTj52vkYMlSRKv0x7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242778'),
  ('457065054834684123', 'That Can''t Shake Our Willi!', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Rolf Olsen, Franz Xaver Lederle', 'Rolf Olsen', 'Heinz Erhardt, Ruth Stephan, Günther Jerschke, Käte Jaenicke, Hans Terofal, Irina von Bentheim, Nicolai von Bentheim, Angelika Baumgart', null, 'Summer in Germany, anno 1970. Italy is the number one destination. As every year, swarms of Teutonic tourists make their way to the Adriatic Sea. Only Willi Hirsekorn from Castrop-Rauxel has so far no plans to break south. That changes, however, as the bitchy neighbor Mizzi Buntje proudly tells of their upcoming holiday in Italy. Willi can not afford this boasting. Shortly determined, the bags are packed, and already rushes Willi in the car with his wife Sieglinde, daughter Lotti and son Kuno the sun.', 'Summer in Germany, anno 1970. Italy is the number one destination. As every year, swarms of Teutonic tourists make their way to the Adriatic Sea. Only Willi Hirsekorn from Castrop-Rauxel has so far no plans to break south. That changes, however, as the bitchy neighbor Mizzi Buntje proudly tells of their upcoming holiday in Italy. Willi can not afford this boasting. Shortly determined, the bags are packed, and already rushes Willi in the car with his wife Sieglinde, daughter Lotti and son Kuno the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNECjYWQGKqu3XRVgYC4LD0h2Tn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5992'),
  ('340679618598911016', 'That Certain Summer', 1972, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Lamont Johnson', 'Richard Levinson, William Link', 'Hal Holbrook, Martin Sheen, Joe Don Baker, Marlyn Mason, Scott Jacoby, Hope Lange, James McEachin, Clarke Gordon', null, 'The first US teleplay to deal sympathetically with homosexuality. Divorced San Francisco contractor Doug Salter is looking forward to a summer visit from his fourteen-year-old son Nick, who lives in Los Angeles with his mother Janet. The boy does not know that his father is gay and committed to Gary McClain, his life partner of several years.', 'The first US teleplay to deal sympathetically with homosexuality. Divorced San Francisco contractor Doug Salter is looking forward to a summer visit from his fourteen-year-old son Nick, who lives in Los Angeles with his mother Janet. The boy does not know that his father is gay and committed to Gary McClain, his life partner of several years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o85ye7wrufOh2OSB3BpDns8ZvE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142585'),
  ('1085297737878727909', 'That Certain Thing', 1928, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Frank Capra, Eugene De Rue, Joseph Walker', 'Elmer Harris, Frank Capra', 'Viola Dana, Ralph Graves, Burr McIntosh, Aggie Herring, Carl Gerard, Syd Crossley, Rosalind Byrne, Jack Chefe', null, 'Gold-digger Molly marries the heir to a fortune, but things go badly when he is disinherited and starts working as a ditch digger.', 'Gold-digger Molly marries the heir to a fortune, but things go badly when he is disinherited and starts working as a ditch digger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sU4E0tMQtY6PXZ0qAVamIC9m56w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144284'),
