  ('429542035648565452', 'That Christmas', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Simon Otto, Kapil Sharma', 'Richard Curtis, Peter Souter', 'Brian Cox, Bill Nighy, Fiona Shaw, Jack Wisniewski, Jodie Whittaker, India Brown, Guz Khan, Lolly Adefope', 'PG', 'It''s an unforgettable Christmas for the townsfolk of Wellington-on-Sea when the worst snowstorm in history alters everyone''s plans — including Santa''s.', 'It''s an unforgettable Christmas for the townsfolk of Wellington-on-Sea when the worst snowstorm in history alters everyone''s plans — including Santa''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uR3uhztTAxGGK7Co0yyxVy4Gc7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645757'),
  ('526009827782112232', 'That Cold Day in the Park', 1969, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Altman, Graeme Clifford, Chuck Wasserman', 'Gillian Freeman', 'Sandy Dennis, Michael Burns, Susanne Benton, David Garfield, Luana Anders, Edward Greenhalgh, Doris Buckinham, Frank Wade', 'R', 'Frances Austen, a young, wealthy spinster, invites a mute teenager into her apartment after finding him freezing in the park next to where she lives. Despite her best efforts, their lack of communication only increases her sense of loneliness, as her possessiveness spirals into frightening new realms.', 'Frances Austen, a young, wealthy spinster, invites a mute teenager into her apartment after finding him freezing in the park next to where she lives. Despite her best efforts, their lack of communication only increases her sense of loneliness, as her possessiveness spirals into frightening new realms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUcTRSXeU6mzlPqQ6i8vfWY3MhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66488'),
  ('541681537300734323', 'That Damned Meat', 1985, 'Comedy', 'André Klotzel, Pedro Farkas', 'André Klotzel, Carlos Alberto Sofredini', 'Adilson Barros, Fernanda Torres, Dionísio Azevedo, Geny Prado, Lucélia Machiavelli, Regina Casé, Chiquinho Brandão, Tio Celso', null, 'Nhô Quim has only one dream in his life: to eat red meat. He meets Carula, a young woman anxious to get married, who promises him that in their wedding her father will kill him an ox. But, before that, Nhô Quim must pass a series of tests.', 'Nhô Quim has only one dream in his life: to eat red meat. He meets Carula, a young woman anxious to get married, who promises him that in their wedding her father will kill him an ox. But, before that, Nhô Quim must pass a series of tests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdRIErtsWV0QgbI3U4fRQ4eLg8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129709'),
  ('1060414100072814900', 'That Darn Cat', 1997, 'Family, Comedy', 'Bob Spiers, Steve Boyum', 'Scott Alexander, Larry Karaszewski', 'Christina Ricci, Doug E. Doug, Dean Jones, Peter Boyle, Michael McKean, Dyan Cannon, George Dzundza, Bess Armstrong', 'PG', 'While making his nightly rounds in the neighborhood, Patti''s pet cat D.C. finds himself the carrier of a call for help from a kidnap victim. Patti enlists skeptical law enforcement help to find the victim before it''s too late.', 'While making his nightly rounds in the neighborhood, Patti''s pet cat D.C. finds himself the carrier of a call for help from a kidnap victim. Patti enlists skeptical law enforcement help to find the victim before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bH2EWFR9FOKp9fAjNgYf9eanivk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20735'),
