  ('43292139338205984', 'That Day', 2003, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Raúl Ruiz, Acácio de Almeida, Gilles Sionnet', 'Raúl Ruiz', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Elsa Zylberstein, Jean-Luc Bideau, Jean-François Balmer, Christian Vadim, Laurent Malet, Rufus, Féodor Atkine', null, 'A father is scheming to have his slightly mental daughter from an earlier marriage killed by allowing a murderous psychopath to be released from the asylum and led to his house. However, the psychopath and the daughter fall for each other.', 'A father is scheming to have his slightly mental daughter from an earlier marriage killed by allowing a murderous psychopath to be released from the asylum and led to his house. However, the psychopath and the daughter fall for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvNV2LsASheILAIja1YmDvijkw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48778'),
  ('703432190206011581', 'That Day, on the Beach', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edward Yang, Christopher Doyle, Wang Pin', 'Wu Nien-jen, Edward Yang', 'Sylvia Chang, Terry Hu, Hsu Ming, David Mao, Hsiao Hou Tao, Lee Lieh, Lee Suk-Ching, Lin Ruiyang', null, 'Two friends who haven''t seen each other for thirteen years reunite. One is a successful concert pianist just back from a European tour and the other has just started a new business.', 'Two friends who haven''t seen each other for thirteen years reunite. One is a successful concert pianist just back from a European tour and the other has just started a new business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83GRYRWEXWkfGbDBIpEhXdEhONA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106373'),
  ('401792222260672068', 'That Demon Within', 2014, 'Action, Horror', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Kenny Tse Chung-To, Jay Cheung', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Jack Ng Wai-Lun', 'Daniel Wu, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Andy On Chi-Kit, Liu Kai-Chi, Christie Chen, Dominic Lam Ka-Wah, Chi Kuan-Chun, Astrid Chan Chi-Ching', null, 'By a strange twist of fate, dutiful Hong Kong policeman Dan saves the life of the leader of a violent gang of armed robbers. When they commit another crime, Dan is determined to put an end to their activities. He works with the leader, whom the gang had betrayed, to engineer a plan to wreak havoc within the gang and let the gangsters kill one another. But it becomes increasingly obvious to Dan and to his colleagues that Dan is suffering from a severe mental disorder, and Dan finds that instead of upholding the law as a righteous police officer, he has now become a fugitive wanted for murder.', 'By a strange twist of fate, dutiful Hong Kong policeman Dan saves the life of the leader of a violent gang of armed robbers. When they commit another crime, Dan is determined to put an end to their activities. He works with the leader, whom the gang had betrayed, to engineer a plan to wreak havoc within the gang and let the gangsters kill one another. But it becomes increasingly obvious to Dan and to his colleagues that Dan is suffering from a severe mental disorder, and Dan finds that instead of upholding the law as a righteous police officer, he has now become a fugitive wanted for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUdcfBb2HLtXqnE8Sngk38bSuKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253622'),
  ('501502383874388437', 'That Evening Sun', 2009, 'Drama', 'Scott Teems, Rodney Taylor', 'Scott Teems', 'Hal Holbrook, Ray McKinnon, Mia Wasikowska, Carrie Preston, Walton Goggins, Barry Corbin, Dixie Carter', 'PG-13', 'An aging Tennessee farmer returns to his homestead and must confront a family betrayal, the reappearance of an old enemy, and the loss of his farm.', 'An aging Tennessee farmer returns to his homestead and must confront a family betrayal, the reappearance of an old enemy, and the loss of his farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3QI2URUbrFfoUnNnORyCpY4y0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40856'),
  ('275738547874617037', 'That Forsyte Woman', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'Compton Bennett, Joseph Ruttenberg, Robert E. Barnes', 'Jan Lustig, James B. Williams, Ivan Tors', 'Errol Flynn, Greer Garson, Walter Pidgeon, Robert Young, Janet Leigh, Harry Davenport, Aubrey Mather, Gerald Oliver Smith', 'NR', 'Soames and Irene Forsyte have a marriage of convenience. Young Jolyon Forsyte is a black sheep who ran away with the maid after his wife''s death. Teenager June Forsyte has found love with an artist, Phillip Bosinny. The interactions between the Forsytes and the people and society around them is the truss for this love story set in the rigid and strict times of the Victorian age.', 'Soames and Irene Forsyte have a marriage of convenience. Young Jolyon Forsyte is a black sheep who ran away with the maid after his wife''s death. Teenager June Forsyte has found love with an artist, Phillip Bosinny. The interactions between the Forsytes and the people and society around them is the truss for this love story set in the rigid and strict times of the Victorian age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxRMcHHS5pYxEHmcDnEZxu9rI2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43187'),
  ('1143702928295597400', 'That Funny Feeling', 1965, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Clifford Stine, Joseph E. Kenney, Richard Thorpe', 'David R. Schwartz', 'Sandra Dee, Bobby Darin, Donald O''Connor, Nita Talbot, Larry Storch, Leo G. Carroll, James Westerfield, Robert Strauss', null, 'Joan Howell, a young and pretty maid-for-hire, meets and begins dating wealthy New York City businessman Tom Milford. Embarrassed about bringing him back to her tiny apartment that she shares with her roommate Audrey, Joan brings Tom over to a fancy apartment that she cleans on a daily basis not knowing that it''s his place. Tom plays along with the charade despite not knowing who Joan really is, while she tries to tidy up Tom''s place not knowing who he really is.', 'Joan Howell, a young and pretty maid-for-hire, meets and begins dating wealthy New York City businessman Tom Milford. Embarrassed about bringing him back to her tiny apartment that she shares with her roommate Audrey, Joan brings Tom over to a fancy apartment that she cleans on a daily basis not knowing that it''s his place. Tom plays along with the charade despite not knowing who Joan really is, while she tries to tidy up Tom''s place not knowing who he really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2Wt8tpk9o9KHhZM1QBXvMbaqgT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43745'),
  ('292499274067048020', 'That Gang of Mine', 1940, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joseph H. Lewis, Robert E. Cline, Harvey Gould', 'William Lively', 'Bobby Jordan, Leo Gorcey, Clarence Muse, Dave O''Brien, Joyce Bryant, Sunshine Sammy Morrison, Milton Kibbee, David Gorcey', 'NR', 'A street kid has dreams of becoming a jockey. He gets his chance when he and his gang discover a poor old man who has a championship race horse. The man agrees to let the boy ride his horse in a race, but first the gang must get enough money to pay for the race''s entry fees.', 'A street kid has dreams of becoming a jockey. He gets his chance when he and his gang discover a poor old man who has a championship race horse. The man agrees to let the boy ride his horse in a race, but first the gang must get enough money to pay for the race''s entry fees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CCrNu1kGw5DP41xq5CMfD6LtlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87892'),
  ('343892752983419904', 'That Girl in Yellow Boots', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Anurag Kashyap, Rajeev Ravi', null, 'Kalki Koechlin, Naseeruddin Shah, Gulshan Devaiah, Ronit Roy, Makrand Deshpande, Kumud Mishra, Prashant Prakash', null, 'An Anglo-Indian woman works in a seedy Mumbai massage parlor while trying to find her long-lost father.', 'An Anglo-Indian woman works in a seedy Mumbai massage parlor while trying to find her long-lost father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Kgg5SU0mW77ZmQf58knmadzWvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77864'),
  ('297760953590695888', 'That Girl''s Captives of Love', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ryo Miyawaki', 'Taeko Asano', 'Ryo Yoshizawa, Yuko Araki, Yosuke Sugino, Rio Uchida, Daimaou Kosaka, Reiko Takashima, Goro Kishitani, Kensei Mikami', null, 'Centers on three childhood friends in a love triangle. Yori moved back to the countryside, and started wearing glasses and not being noticed by girls. Meanwhile, Shizuku entered the entertainment industry alongside Subaru, and both began working as a model and actor, respectively. But when Yori turns 16, he re-enters their lives.', 'Centers on three childhood friends in a love triangle. Yori moved back to the countryside, and started wearing glasses and not being noticed by girls. Meanwhile, Shizuku entered the entertainment industry alongside Subaru, and both began working as a model and actor, respectively. But when Yori turns 16, he re-enters their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkECP4uy91M7DsDQntoXd7ywlvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544810'),
  ('1150278090954403995', 'That Hamilton Woman', 1941, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Alexander Korda, Rudolph Maté, Walter Mayo', 'Walter Reisch, R.C. Sherriff', 'Vivien Leigh, Laurence Olivier, Alan Mowbray, Sara Allgood, Gladys Cooper, Henry Wilcoxon, Heather Angel, Halliwell Hobbes', 'NR', 'The story of courtesan and dance-hall girl Emma Hamilton, including her relationships with Sir William Hamilton and Admiral Horatio Nelson and her rise and fall, set during the Napoleonic Wars.', 'The story of courtesan and dance-hall girl Emma Hamilton, including her relationships with Sir William Hamilton and Admiral Horatio Nelson and her rise and fall, set during the Napoleonic Wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDXsdF9Eqk9hs9KyxakRYYijKxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43798'),
  ('255568546693118205', 'That Happy Couple', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Juan Antonio Bardem, Luis García Berlanga, Willy Goldberger', 'Juan Antonio Bardem, Luis García Berlanga', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Elvira Quintillá, Félix Fernández, José Luis Ozores, Fernando Aguirre, Manuel Arbó, Matilde Muñoz Sampedro, Antonio García Quijada', null, 'Juan and Carmen are a humble couple living in Madrid. She does the housework and he works as an electrician in a film studio. Their dreams of wellness come true when they win a contest sponsored by a soap brand.', 'Juan and Carmen are a humble couple living in Madrid. She does the housework and he works as an electrician in a film studio. Their dreams of wellness come true when they win a contest sponsored by a soap brand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEQTHJAxQDJKAB2YGeR8sPek3td.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111471'),
  ('573520693242325805', 'That Is the Dawn', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luis Buñuel, Jacques Saulnier, Jacques Deray', 'Luis Buñuel, Jean Ferry', 'Georges Marchal, Lucia Bosè, Julien Bertheau, Jean-Jacques Delbo, Simone Paris, Robert Le Fort, Brigitte Elloy, Pascal Mazzotti', null, 'A generous doctor is aghast that the population of a small island is being oppressed and mistreated, but is seemingly unable to do anything about it, until the arrival of a young woman and the death of one of his friends prompts him into action.', 'A generous doctor is aghast that the population of a small island is being oppressed and mistreated, but is seemingly unable to do anything about it, until the arrival of a young woman and the death of one of his friends prompts him into action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gl0DRiQX3r5h3qL5uHgob5JXMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114358'),
  ('836846494370736651', 'That Kind of Summer', 2022, 'Drama', 'Denis Côté, François Messier-Rheault', 'Denis Côté', 'Larissa Corriveau, Laure Giappiconi, Aude Mathieu, Anne Ratte-Polle, Samir Guesmi, Josée Deschênes, Marie-Claude Guérin, Anissa Lahyane', null, 'In a countryside house where they are meant to explore the troubles in their sexuality, three women spend days and nights apprehending their inner demons. A serene German therapist and a kind-hearted social worker supervise them, help them and try to maintain the fragile balance of the group. During 26 days, in the midst of summer, Geisha, Léonie and Eugénie will have to refrain from breaking down, tame the whispers from present times and consider the future.', 'In a countryside house where they are meant to explore the troubles in their sexuality, three women spend days and nights apprehending their inner demons. A serene German therapist and a kind-hearted social worker supervise them, help them and try to maintain the fragile balance of the group. During 26 days, in the midst of summer, Geisha, Léonie and Eugénie will have to refrain from breaking down, tame the whispers from present times and consider the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45eDLQdcs4x08pUP33xP4ekktND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925181'),
  ('849606202527537065', 'That Kind of Woman', 1959, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Sidney Lumet, Boris Kaufman', 'Walter Bernstein', 'Sophia Loren, Tab Hunter, Jack Warden, Barbara Nichols, Keenan Wynn, George Sanders, Bea Arthur, Attilio Barbato', null, 'A young G.I. falls in love with a kept woman on a train to New York.', 'A young G.I. falls in love with a kept woman on a train to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzN3qMZ98lFRNTtXcnsRwb1YCfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177474'),
  ('719008523478491583', 'That Lady in Ermine', 1948, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Music', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Leon Shamroy, Otto Preminger', 'Samson Raphaelson', 'Betty Grable, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Cesar Romero, Walter Abel, Reginald Gardiner, Harry Davenport, Virginia Campbell, Whit Bissell', 'NR', 'Circa 1861, Angelina, ruling countess of an Italian principality, is at a loss when invaded by a Hungarian army. Her lookalike ancestress Francesca, who saved a similar situation 300 years before, comes to life from a portrait to help her descendant. Complicating factor: the newlywed countess feels strangely drawn to the handsome invader...', 'Circa 1861, Angelina, ruling countess of an Italian principality, is at a loss when invaded by a Hungarian army. Her lookalike ancestress Francesca, who saved a similar situation 300 years before, comes to life from a portrait to help her descendant. Complicating factor: the newlywed countess feels strangely drawn to the handsome invader...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64dV400PRPPXh6bLjPQkdO8BMjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52278'),
  ('370071368169089572', 'That Malicious Age', 1975, 'Drama, Romance', 'Silvio Amadio, Antonio Maccoppi, Roberto Silvestrini', 'Piero Regnoli, Silvio Amadio', 'Gloria Guida, Nino Castelnuovo, Anita Sanders, Mimmo Palmara, Andrea Aureli, Mario Garriba', null, 'Gardener Napoleone takes a job in a southern-Italian villa and quickly finds himself embroiled in a menage-a-trois with Paola and her mother, which soon leads to sex, death and mayhem.', 'Gardener Napoleone takes a job in a southern-Italian villa and quickly finds himself embroiled in a menage-a-trois with Paola and her mother, which soon leads to sex, death and mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jClfWhb0D199i02JlIIWy7Fbu9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288987'),
  ('395644209149514149', 'That Man Bolt', 1973, 'Action, Drama', 'Henry Levin, David Lowell Rich, Albert Shepard', 'Charles Eric Johnson, Ranald MacDougall', 'Fred Williamson, Byron Webster, Miko Mayama, Teresa Graves, John Orchard, Jack Ging, Ken Kazama, Vassili Lambrinos', 'R', 'Fred Williamson chop-sockeys his way through this popular blaxploitation adventure as Jefferson Bolt, a Kung Fu expert assigned to deliver a cool $1 million to Mexico City from Hong Kong with a stop in Los Angeles. When Bolt discovers the cash is dirty mob money and his gal has been killed, he heads back to the Far East to get even.', 'Fred Williamson chop-sockeys his way through this popular blaxploitation adventure as Jefferson Bolt, a Kung Fu expert assigned to deliver a cool $1 million to Mexico City from Hong Kong with a stop in Los Angeles. When Bolt discovers the cash is dirty mob money and his gal has been killed, he heads back to the Far East to get even.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOhAfB61HJud4sOXGRuilYpCVjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22058'),
  ('253752683127399', 'That Man from Rio', 1964, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Philippe de Broca, Edmond Séchan', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Daniel Boulanger, Philippe de Broca', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Françoise Dorléac, Jean Servais, Simone Renant, Adolfo Celi, Roger Dumas, Daniel Ceccaldi, Ubiracy De Oliveira', null, 'French military man Adrien Dufourquet gets an eight-day furlough to visit his fiancée, Agnès. But when he arrives in Paris, he learns that her late father''s partner, museum curator Professor Catalan, has just been kidnapped by a group of Amazon tribesmen who have also stolen a priceless statue from the museum. Adrien and Agnès pursue the kidnappers to Brazil, where they learn that the statue is the key to a hidden Amazon treasure.', 'French military man Adrien Dufourquet gets an eight-day furlough to visit his fiancée, Agnès. But when he arrives in Paris, he learns that her late father''s partner, museum curator Professor Catalan, has just been kidnapped by a group of Amazon tribesmen who have also stolen a priceless statue from the museum. Adrien and Agnès pursue the kidnappers to Brazil, where they learn that the statue is the key to a hidden Amazon treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhaUqqHTIMSXG6WOMRCreitQ1ZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4034'),
  ('117964597579732451', 'That Man in Istanbul', 1965, 'Action, Adventure', 'Antonio Isasi-Isasmendi, Juan Gelpí', 'Antonio Isasi-Isasmendi, Jorge Illa, Lluís Josep Comerón', 'Horst Buchholz, Sylva Koscina, Perrette Pradier, Mario Adorf, Ángel Picazo, Klaus Kinski, Gérard Tichy, Christiane Maybach', 'NR', 'An American adventurer who has a gambling den in Istanbul, who is suspected to be involved in the kidnapping of a nuclear scientist, but ultimately becomes self on the search for the disappeared and gets a striving for world domination secret organization.', 'An American adventurer who has a gambling den in Istanbul, who is suspected to be involved in the kidnapping of a nuclear scientist, but ultimately becomes self on the search for the disappeared and gets a striving for world domination secret organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qouf8Fgi8nWtoMys9BgdDkVcwpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5068'),
  ('1147004998252827461', 'That March', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Iura Luncașu', 'Iura Luncașu, Olivia Odaianu', 'Mădălina Bellariu Ion, Esther Acebo, Costas Mandylor, Eduard Trica, Luke Roberts', null, 'A Romanian intelligence agent follows a brilliant scientist to Spain, where conspiracies and Russian agents collide. Torn between her mission and her feelings, Anabel faces choices that could change everything.', 'A Romanian intelligence agent follows a brilliant scientist to Spain, where conspiracies and Russian agents collide. Torn between her mission and her feelings, Anabel faces choices that could change everything.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fij3zVhua0q01gXLcOajcNYyAn1k.jpg', 'plex:movie:that-march-2026'),
  ('607421558069823909', 'That Most Important Thing: Love', 1975, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Ricardo Aronovich, Laurent Ferrier', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Christopher Frank', 'Romy Schneider, Fabio Testi, Jacques Dutronc, Claude Dauphin, Roger Blin, Nicoletta Machiavelli, Klaus Kinski, Gabrielle Doulcet', 'R', 'Servais Mont, a freelance photographer who works taking compromising photos, gets fascinated by Nadine Chevalier, a tormented low-budget movie actress married to an eccentric film photo collector.', 'Servais Mont, a freelance photographer who works taking compromising photos, gets fascinated by Nadine Chevalier, a tormented low-budget movie actress married to an eccentric film photo collector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMLrx6bRtLCrKiMPPfmGwGChBNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3476'),
  ('592791734222193337', 'That Mothers Might Live', 1938, 'Drama', 'Fred Zinnemann, Harold Rosson', 'Herman Boxer', 'John Nesbitt, Shepperd Strudwick, Rudolph Anders, King Baggot, William Bailey, Barbara Bedford, Ralph Brooks, Mary Howard', null, 'That Mothers Might Live is a 1938 American short drama film directed by Fred Zinnemann. The short is a brief account of Hungarian physician Ignaz Semmelweis and his discovery of the need for cleanliness in 19th-century maternity wards, thereby significantly decreasing maternal mortality, and of his struggle to gain acceptance of his idea. Although Semmelweis ultimately failed in his lifetime, later scientific luminaries advanced his work in spirit like microbiologist Louis Pasteur, who provided a scientific theoretical explanation of Semmelweis'' observations by helping develop the germ theory of disease and the British surgeon, Dr. Joseph Lister who revolutionized medicine putting Pasteur''s research to practical use. In 1939, at the 11th Academy Awards, the film won an Oscar for Best Short Subject (One-Reel).', 'That Mothers Might Live is a 1938 American short drama film directed by Fred Zinnemann. The short is a brief account of Hungarian physician Ignaz Semmelweis and his discovery of the need for cleanliness in 19th-century maternity wards, thereby significantly decreasing maternal mortality, and of his struggle to gain acceptance of his idea. Although Semmelweis ultimately failed in his lifetime, later scientific luminaries advanced his work in spirit like microbiologist Louis Pasteur, who provided a scientific theoretical explanation of Semmelweis'' observations by helping develop the germ theory of disease and the British surgeon, Dr. Joseph Lister who revolutionized medicine putting Pasteur''s research to practical use. In 1939, at the 11th Academy Awards, the film won an Oscar for Best Short Subject (One-Reel).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihiMJSmcrgYsHlv4k5VkdLPkNqP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235647'),
  ('700530743218868320', 'That Naughty Girl', 1956, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michel Boisrond, Joseph C. Brun', 'Roger Vadim, Michel Boisrond', 'Brigitte Bardot, Jean Bretonnière, Françoise Fabian, Mischa Auer, Michel Serrault, Jean Poiret, Raymond Bussières, Bernard Lancret', null, 'Nightclub entertainer Jean Clery has just become engaged to Lili, his attractive psychoanalyst. Meanwhile, the nightclub where he works is being used by a counterfeit ring, and Paris police suspect owner Paul Latour of being the ringleader. Finding it expedient to leave town, Paul leaves his "baby" daughter with Jean...who discovers too late that she''s a wild, carefree, shapely sex-kitten with a talent for getting Jean into amusing scrapes.', 'Nightclub entertainer Jean Clery has just become engaged to Lili, his attractive psychoanalyst. Meanwhile, the nightclub where he works is being used by a counterfeit ring, and Paris police suspect owner Paul Latour of being the ringleader. Finding it expedient to leave town, Paul leaves his "baby" daughter with Jean...who discovers too late that she''s a wild, carefree, shapely sex-kitten with a talent for getting Jean into amusing scrapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2nc4JXfb1jI3LUy3tWwY0GaJrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66969'),
  ('157144854933990063', 'That Night', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Craig Bolotin, Christine Larson-Nitzsche, Randy Suhr', 'Craig Bolotin', 'C. Thomas Howell, Juliette Lewis, Helen Shaver, Eliza Dushku, J. Smith-Cameron, John Dossett, Katherine Heigl, Sarah Joy Stevenson', 'PG-13', 'A coming-of-age story about an eleven-year-old girl who idolizes her troubled sixteen-year-old neighbor.', 'A coming-of-age story about an eleven-year-old girl who idolizes her troubled sixteen-year-old neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tky1NpcXYsgtc1KtrePLYbQTBM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34334'),
