  ('712905372790311992', 'That Sugar Film', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Damon Gameau, Judd Overton', 'Damon Gameau', 'Damon Gameau, Stephen Fry, Brenton Thwaites, Isabel Lucas, Jessica Marais, John Leary, Nick Batzias, Katie Batzias', 'PG', 'One man''s journey to discover the bitter truth about sugar. Damon Gameau embarks on a unique experiment to document the effects of a high sugar diet on a healthy body, consuming only foods that are commonly perceived as ''healthy''. Through this entertaining and informative journey, Damon highlights some of the issues that plague the sugar industry, and where sugar lurks on supermarket shelves.', 'One man''s journey to discover the bitter truth about sugar. Damon Gameau embarks on a unique experiment to document the effects of a high sugar diet on a healthy body, consuming only foods that are commonly perceived as ''healthy''. Through this entertaining and informative journey, Damon highlights some of the issues that plague the sugar industry, and where sugar lurks on supermarket shelves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qF1fDtJ1vU3hrLDNJCgRoQekFmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305091'),
  ('147448050845694289', 'That Summer in Paris', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Valentine Cadic, Naomi Amarger, Laure Cochener', 'Valentine Cadic, Mariette Désert', 'Blandine Madec, India Hair, Arcadi Radeff, Matthias Jacquin, Lou Deleuze, Béryl Gastaldello, Pierre Cévaër, Aurélia Petit', null, 'Paris, the 2024 Olympic Games. Blandine (30) arrives from Normandy to watch the swimming competitions. Disorientated by the hustle and bustle of the city where nothing seems to go her way, she navigates the chaos of Paris and an unexpected reunion.', 'Paris, the 2024 Olympic Games. Blandine (30) arrives from Normandy to watch the swimming competitions. Disorientated by the hustle and bustle of the city where nothing seems to go her way, she navigates the chaos of Paris and an unexpected reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1z3jgsuyyudTPNvZMftK7FeHSDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1294706'),
  ('306762856776671811', 'That Tender Age', 1964, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gilles Grangier, Robert Lefebvre, Roger de Broin', 'Claude Sautet, Pascal Jardin', 'Jean Gabin, Fernandel, Marie Dubois, Paulette Dubost, Claude Mann, Madeleine Sylvain, Christine Simon, Rellys', null, 'Antoine and Marie decided to introduce their parents before the wedding. Summer vacation looks like a good time, so the Lartigue family prepares to host Malhouin family. But it turns out that the harsh Emil Malhouin is not too happy to get acquainted with his future relatives...', 'Antoine and Marie decided to introduce their parents before the wedding. Summer vacation looks like a good time, so the Lartigue family prepares to host Malhouin family. But it turns out that the harsh Emil Malhouin is not too happy to get acquainted with his future relatives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWF20IXssk6dPC3kEvLxFICFeab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76648'),
  ('147431526294453164', 'That Tender Touch', 1969, 'Drama', 'Russel Vincent', 'Russel Vincent', 'Sue Bernard, Bee Tompkins, Rick Cooper, Phae Dera, Dolly Read, Tanya Lemani George', null, 'When Terri marries and moves to the suburbs, her lesbian lover, Marsha, doesn''t take kindly to Terri''s desire for a "normal" life. Determined to win her love back, Marsha worms her way into the newlyweds'' happy heterosexual home. Meanwhile, Marsha''s seductive beauty converts several other women in the neighborhood.', 'When Terri marries and moves to the suburbs, her lesbian lover, Marsha, doesn''t take kindly to Terri''s desire for a "normal" life. Determined to win her love back, Marsha worms her way into the newlyweds'' happy heterosexual home. Meanwhile, Marsha''s seductive beauty converts several other women in the neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RRK8x1JGmBnYn1n8bUjTc4oRUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165625'),
  ('880227190714832775', 'That Thing You Do!', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Music', 'Tak Fujimoto, Tom Hanks, Lisa C. Satriano', 'Tom Hanks', 'Tom Hanks, Tom Everett Scott, Liv Tyler, Johnathon Schaech, Steve Zahn, Ethan Embry, Charlize Theron, Obba Babatundé', 'PG', 'A Pennsylvania band scores a hit in 1964 and rides the star-making machinery as long as it can, with lots of help from its manager. But behind the scenes, the group’s sudden fame tests their strength, their maturity and responsibility, and their ability to resist the temptations that money and notoriety always make possible.', 'A Pennsylvania band scores a hit in 1964 and rides the star-making machinery as long as it can, with lots of help from its manager. But behind the scenes, the group’s sudden fame tests their strength, their maturity and responsibility, and their ability to resist the temptations that money and notoriety always make possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RmZu33qHdyZFGLfhEOmkTjdNEu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9591'),
  ('1149733918693541642', 'That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime the Movie: Scarlet Bond', 2022, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Yasuhito Kikuchi, Hiroshi Satou, Yuichi Tanaka', 'Junichiro Okumura, Otoe Yoka', 'Miho Okasaki, Makoto Furukawa, Megumi Toyoguchi, Tomoaki Maeno, Sayaka Senbongi, Mao Ichimichi, Takuya Eguchi, Hochu Otsuka', 'PG-13', 'A long-running conspiracy is swirling over a mysterious power wielded by the Queen in Raja, a small country west of Tempest. When a slime who evolved into a Demon Lord named Rimuru Tempest crosses paths with Hiiro, a survivor of the Ogre race, an incredible adventure packed with new characters begins. The power of bonds will be put to the test!', 'A long-running conspiracy is swirling over a mysterious power wielded by the Queen in Raja, a small country west of Tempest. When a slime who evolved into a Demon Lord named Rimuru Tempest crosses paths with Hiiro, a survivor of the Ogre race, an incredible adventure packed with new characters begins. The power of bonds will be put to the test!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xITip9n9uMAUA0TU6niMXU2tbh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876792'),
  ('519576957455477059', 'That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime the Movie: Tears of the Azure Sea', 2026, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Yasuhito Kikuchi, Hiroshi Satou', 'Yasuhito Kikuchi, Toshizo Nemoto, Fuse', 'Miho Okasaki, Mao Ichimichi, Tomoaki Maeno, Makoto Furukawa, Sayaka Senbongi', null, 'Rimuru and friends visit Celestial Emperor Hermesia''s resort island after the Jura-Tempest Federations opening ceremony. During their vacation, they encounter a mysterious woman, leading to a new incident by the azure sea.', 'Rimuru and friends visit Celestial Emperor Hermesia''s resort island after the Jura-Tempest Federations opening ceremony. During their vacation, they encounter a mysterious woman, leading to a new incident by the azure sea.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FoblkRIWuKTF46CsnLhBiE7Otn3z.jpg', 'plex:movie:that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime-the-movie-tears-of-the-azure-sea'),
  ('1102545359175450348', 'That Touch of Mink', 1962, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Delbert Mann, Russell Metty', 'Stanley Shapiro, Nate Monaster', 'Cary Grant, Doris Day, Gig Young, Audrey Meadows, Alan Hewitt, John Astin, Dick Sargent, Jan Burrell', 'NR', 'Cathy Timberlake is en route to a job interview when a car transporting businessman Philip Shayne covers her in mud. He sends his assistant, Roger, to apologize, but upon meeting Cathy, Roger knows that she would be a suitable match for his boss. Despite their mutual attraction, Cathy and Philip want different things. Philip wants a fling, while Cathy wants a marriage. As they travel to exotic locales, their differing motivations are put to the test.', 'Cathy Timberlake is en route to a job interview when a car transporting businessman Philip Shayne covers her in mud. He sends his assistant, Roger, to apologize, but upon meeting Cathy, Roger knows that she would be a suitable match for his boss. Despite their mutual attraction, Cathy and Philip want different things. Philip wants a fling, while Cathy wants a marriage. As they travel to exotic locales, their differing motivations are put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEG29x9cljGKL2GPmRK9IByyL9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12708'),
  ('762534573265689561', 'That Trip We Took with Dad', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Anca Miruna Lazarescu, Christian Stangassinger', 'Anca Miruna Lazarescu', 'Ovidiu Schumacher, Tom Pilath, Susanne Bormann, Ana Ularu, Jan Andreesen, Alexandru Mărgineanu, Manuel Klein, Razvan Enciu', null, 'Romania, 1968. Two very different brothers. Mihai is a secret police informant, Emil is a dedicated dissident. When they have the opportunity to have their ailing father’s eyes operated on in East Germany, the three set out on a moving odyssey.', 'Romania, 1968. Two very different brothers. Mihai is a secret police informant, Emil is a dedicated dissident. When they have the opportunity to have their ailing father’s eyes operated on in East Germany, the three set out on a moving odyssey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVqelerARWpvjAhHX0EPAgkyw5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402925'),
  ('1093357005202918304', 'That Uncertain Feeling', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, George Barnes', 'Emile DeNajac, Victorien Sardou', 'Merle Oberon, Melvyn Douglas, Burgess Meredith, Alan Mowbray, Olive Blakeney, Harry Davenport, Sig Ruman, Eve Arden', null, 'A happily married woman sees a psychoanalyst and develops doubts about her husband.', 'A happily married woman sees a psychoanalyst and develops doubts about her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkasJPQy4DtYCtllr68AZjDrJLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43799'),
  ('674191198375223910', 'That Was Life', 2020, 'Drama', 'Santiago Racaj, David Martín de los Santos, Julen Robles', 'David Martín de los Santos', 'Petra Martínez, Anna Castillo, Florin Piersic Jr., Ramón Barea, Daniel Morilla, Jordi Gimeno, Alina Nastase, Pilar Gómez', null, 'Two Spanish women from different generations find themselves sharing a hospital room in Belgium. María has been living there for decades after emigrating when she was young and Verónica is a young girl recently arrived in search of opportunities she never found in Spain. A strange friendship is forged between them and this leads María to set out on a return journey to the south of Spain with an unusual mission. What begins as a search for Verónica''s roots will become an opportunity to open herself up to the world and question certain principles on which she had based her life.', 'Two Spanish women from different generations find themselves sharing a hospital room in Belgium. María has been living there for decades after emigrating when she was young and Verónica is a young girl recently arrived in search of opportunities she never found in Spain. A strange friendship is forged between them and this leads María to set out on a return journey to the south of Spain with an unusual mission. What begins as a search for Verónica''s roots will become an opportunity to open herself up to the world and question certain principles on which she had based her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PK4ajsmuLCVCFnaine0Z08bH4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753431'),
  ('844027519922892932', 'That Was Then... This Is Now', 1985, 'Drama', 'Christopher Cain, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Emilio Estevez', 'Emilio Estevez, Craig Sheffer, Larry B. Scott, Jill Schoelen, Kim Delaney, Barbara Babcock, Morgan Freeman, Francis X. McCarthy', 'R', 'A delinquent teenager''s only link to society is the attachment he feels towards an older brother-figure. When the older boy starts spending time with a new girlfriend, the teenager begins to feel even more alienated, and gets involved with drugs and the police.', 'A delinquent teenager''s only link to society is the attachment he feels towards an older brother-figure. When the older boy starts spending time with a new girlfriend, the teenager begins to feel even more alienated, and gets involved with drugs and the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uXl1EtvGo9qBPdtsJqwEcuckAZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64945'),
  ('667657202163491584', 'That Wonderful Urge', 1948, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Robert B. Sinclair, Charles G. Clarke', 'Jay Dratler', 'Tyrone Power, Gene Tierney, Reginald Gardiner, Arleen Whelan, Lucile Watson, Gene Lockhart, Lloyd Gough, Porter Hall', 'NR', 'When an heiress finds out that the friendly young man she''s met at Sun Valley is really an investigative reporter, she ruins his career by falsely claiming they''re married.', 'When an heiress finds out that the friendly young man she''s met at Sun Valley is really an investigative reporter, she ruins his career by falsely claiming they''re married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7cK0kMXvCem3kwS9rWGpKIAKlI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143170'),
  ('948451194730562006', 'That''ll Be The Day', 1973, 'Music, Drama', 'Claude Whatham, Peter Suschitzky', 'Ray Connolly', 'David Essex, Ringo Starr, James Booth, Rosemary Leach, Billy Fury, Rosalind Ayres, Robert Lindsay, Keith Moon', null, 'Britain, 1958. Restless at school and bored with his life, Jim leaves home to take a series of low-level jobs at a seaside amusement park, where he discovers a world of cheap sex and petty crime. But when that world comes to a shockingly brutal end, Jim returns home. As the local music scene explodes, Jim must decide between a life of adult responsibility or a new phenomenon called rock & roll.', 'Britain, 1958. Restless at school and bored with his life, Jim leaves home to take a series of low-level jobs at a seaside amusement park, where he discovers a world of cheap sex and petty crime. But when that world comes to a shockingly brutal end, Jim returns home. As the local music scene explodes, Jim must decide between a life of adult responsibility or a new phenomenon called rock & roll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyaHClO0Wt016hWF9I7O6Eui0Lc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26831'),
  ('496513196687961736', 'That''s Amor', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Shaun Paul Piccinino, Brad Rushing', 'John Ducey', 'Riley Dandy, Isaac Gonzalez Rossi, Daniel Edward Mora, Bryan Craig, Arlene Tur, Kimberley Drummond, Christina Moore, Rose Portillo', 'PG-13', 'After her job and relationship implode on the same day, Sofia starts from scratch — and meets a dashing Spanish chef who might be her missing ingredient.', 'After her job and relationship implode on the same day, Sofia starts from scratch — and meets a dashing Spanish chef who might be her missing ingredient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyYibVfi8q0zwsX1evl7mxTZJp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005835'),
  ('352811403279168121', 'That''s Carry On!', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Tony Imi, Gregory Dark', null, 'Kenneth Williams, Barbara Windsor, Eric Barker, Amanda Barrie, John Bluthal, Bernard Bresslaw, Peter Butterworth, Esma Cannon', null, 'Celebrating twenty years of classic Carry On films, two of the films’ best-loved stars, Kenneth Williams and Barbara Windsor return to Pinewood film studios to unwrap some rib-tickling moments from the series. From the original, military mayhem of Carry On Sergeant, through to the really ancient archaeological gags of Carry On Behind, our saucy hosts get their titters out for this laugh-a-second gallop through the most successful series of British comedy films ever made.', 'Celebrating twenty years of classic Carry On films, two of the films’ best-loved stars, Kenneth Williams and Barbara Windsor return to Pinewood film studios to unwrap some rib-tickling moments from the series. From the original, military mayhem of Carry On Sergeant, through to the really ancient archaeological gags of Carry On Behind, our saucy hosts get their titters out for this laugh-a-second gallop through the most successful series of British comedy films ever made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvkjy9qN6p3CEtJnDZyUpTjB5az.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36481'),
  ('854930868122227251', 'That''s Cheating! The Biggest Plan in History?', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Hiroshi Sugawara', 'Hiroshi Saito', 'Tatsuya Yamaguchi, Namie Amuro, Taro Yamamoto, Naohito Fujiki, Takeshi Masu, Masaaki Takarai, Tōru Yuri, Sadatora Araki', null, 'The setting is the prestigious, traditional Japan University of Science. Mitsugu Kimura, a top-achieving student, is a resident of Sigma House, a student dormitory. Mitsugu is joined by a group of unique, problematic students with the lowest grades, but Sigma House is in danger of being demolished. Professor Migita, who is conspiring to build a hotel on campus, has plotted to close the dormitory unless all the students get straight A''s on their next exams. In Campus Academic Wars, students wage a cheating war against a corrupt university professor, with the survival of Sigma House at stake. Will glory or ruin await them at the end of this righteous(?) cheating that brings together all their intelligence and physical strength? Namie Amuro, the top J-pop music sensation, plays one of the students. Screening alongside the film In Tomoko''s Case (starring Rie Tomosaka, directed by Katsuyuki Motohiro) as a double feature theatrical release.', 'The setting is the prestigious, traditional Japan University of Science. Mitsugu Kimura, a top-achieving student, is a resident of Sigma House, a student dormitory. Mitsugu is joined by a group of unique, problematic students with the lowest grades, but Sigma House is in danger of being demolished. Professor Migita, who is conspiring to build a hotel on campus, has plotted to close the dormitory unless all the students get straight A''s on their next exams. In Campus Academic Wars, students wage a cheating war against a corrupt university professor, with the survival of Sigma House at stake. Will glory or ruin await them at the end of this righteous(?) cheating that brings together all their intelligence and physical strength? Namie Amuro, the top J-pop music sensation, plays one of the students. Screening alongside the film In Tomoko''s Case (starring Rie Tomosaka, directed by Katsuyuki Motohiro) as a double feature theatrical release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srw6r0cHcIABLVM9kVkNAdYrDeF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80303'),
