  ('233683538263224112', 'That''s Fine', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Francesco Marioni', 'Francesco Marioni', 'Hippolyte Girardot, Matilde Gioli, Silvia D''Amico, Francesco Marioni, Fausto Maria Sciarappa, Fabrice Scott, Manuela Morabito, Elisa Di Eusanio', null, 'In Faenza, Italy, a dysfunctional family gathers for occasional dinners, and as untold truths are revealed, things gradually become rocky.', 'In Faenza, Italy, a dysfunctional family gathers for occasional dinners, and as untold truths are revealed, things gradually become rocky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auNnSPqFo0jNq82NtWdcgsp3pV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809039'),
  ('223353757535443654', 'That''s How We Women Are', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Di Palma, Dino Risi', 'Ettore Scola, Rodolfo Sonego, Agenore Incrocci', 'Monica Vitti, Carlo Giuffrè, Enrico Maria Salerno, Ettore Manni, Jean Rougeul, Michele Cimarosa, Jacques Stany, Michel Bardinet', null, 'The film consists of twelve episodes, all with Monica Vitti as the protagonist.', 'The film consists of twelve episodes, all with Monica Vitti as the protagonist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etbxXHgB9fFGD3tQnKz7ebPVzZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279845'),
  ('689473915051346158', 'That''s It', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Matheus Souza, Julio Secchin', 'Matheus Souza', 'Gregório Duvivier, Érika Mader, Álamo Facó, Nathalia Dill, Ana Sophia Folch, Marcelo Adnet, Julia Gorman', null, 'Girl is decided to leave her boyfriend and to runaway to an unknown place. Before she leaves, she decides to meet up with him, but they have only one hour to make a very funny balance of their lives.', 'Girl is decided to leave her boyfriend and to runaway to an unknown place. Before she leaves, she decides to meet up with him, but they have only one hour to make a very funny balance of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OfIcYcLYjGxRXjbgMcS47NKhZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35652'),
  ('561619636850574480', 'That''s It', 2015, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Katsuhito Motegi, Yoshiyuki Matsumoto', 'Kiyotaka Inagaki', 'Shota Sometani, Erina Mizuno, Go Ayano, Jun Murakami, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Yohei Matsukado, Eishin, Yu Futami', null, 'Samao Daikoku seeks a way out of the underground life that he has led. He is tortured by a gang boss after stealing a hard disk containing personal information on runaways, homeless people and prostitutes, and the mystery behind his past is revealed.', 'Samao Daikoku seeks a way out of the underground life that he has led. He is tortured by a gang boss after stealing a hard disk containing personal information on runaways, homeless people and prostitutes, and the mystery behind his past is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OUzgJWpjAkeFFgp9MY6SEYvAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335564'),
  ('740163961914765686', 'That''s Life', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Venier, Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti', 'Graziano Ferrari, Giorgio Gherarducci, Massimo Venier', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti, Marina Massironi, Antonio Catania, Francesco Pannofino, Giovanni Cacioppo, Elena Giusti', null, 'While on the run from the police, an unlikely companionship blossoms between a funny con man who just broke out of jail, the bumbling cop whose car he seized at gunpoint, and a nitpicking civilian he unwittingly took hostage.', 'While on the run from the police, an unlikely companionship blossoms between a funny con man who just broke out of jail, the bumbling cop whose car he seized at gunpoint, and a nitpicking civilian he unwittingly took hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcZxzcl79S3gaWWDGGHcFkjT9m2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38396'),
  ('166971057784657805', 'That''s Life', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Francesca Mazzoleni, Valerio Azzali, Giulia Dappio', 'Pietro Seghetti, Francesca Mazzoleni, Paola Mammini', 'Giovanni Anzaldo, Luca Elmi, Francesca Inaudi, Giampiero Judica, Margherita Morchio, Diandra Elettra Moscogiuri, Brando Pacitto, Sabrina Paravicini', null, 'Margherita is a 14 year old living in Milano, who shares everything with her friends. They discuss clothes, music, school and that first kiss. A delightful coming-of-age film in which the here and now is all that really matters. Where every little thing is so very important and where feelings sometimes bubble over. In your teens, there’s no room for anything but friendship and love.', 'Margherita is a 14 year old living in Milano, who shares everything with her friends. They discuss clothes, music, school and that first kiss. A delightful coming-of-age film in which the here and now is all that really matters. Where every little thing is so very important and where feelings sometimes bubble over. In your teens, there’s no room for anything but friendship and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsnQGmdK9buffM4nI5Z1rrsLOi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508540'),
  ('182615007768967855', 'That''s Life!', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Blake Edwards, Anthony B. Richmond, Alan Levine', 'Milton Wexler, Blake Edwards', 'Jack Lemmon, Julie Andrews, Sally Kellerman, Robert Loggia, Jennifer Edwards, Robert Knepper, Matt Lattanzi, Chris Lemmon', 'PG-13', 'A wealthy architect struggles with a severe case of male menopause at the approach of his 60th birthday.', 'A wealthy architect struggles with a severe case of male menopause at the approach of his 60th birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opZSLqdoRoAIg6oW99iiNmrSgAp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52961'),
  ('19966807010883303', 'That''s My Boy', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Hal Walker, Lee Garmes, Charles C. Coleman', 'Cy Howard', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Ruth Hussey, Eddie Mayehoff, Marion Marshall, Polly Bergen, Hugh Sanders, John McIntire', null, 'Jack Jackson, the greatest football player in Ridgefield College history, is disappointed that his only son Junior is an uncoordinated, allergy-ridden bookworm. He uses his athletic reputation and standing as #1 alumni contributor to pressure the coach to take Junior onto the team. In addition, he pays the tuition of Junior''s financially needy classmate Bill Baker, a potential all-American, with the understanding that he will room with Junior and mentor him athletically and socially. Junior''s initial efforts as quarterback prove disastrous and further complications arise when the room mates both fall in love with the same co-ed.', 'Jack Jackson, the greatest football player in Ridgefield College history, is disappointed that his only son Junior is an uncoordinated, allergy-ridden bookworm. He uses his athletic reputation and standing as #1 alumni contributor to pressure the coach to take Junior onto the team. In addition, he pays the tuition of Junior''s financially needy classmate Bill Baker, a potential all-American, with the understanding that he will room with Junior and mentor him athletically and socially. Junior''s initial efforts as quarterback prove disastrous and further complications arise when the room mates both fall in love with the same co-ed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pd0q88EMkUMRYubH9adwyzr3DnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53718'),
  ('1121509898302139272', 'That''s My Boy', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Brandon Trost, Sean Anders, Tyler Spindel', 'David Caspe', 'Adam Sandler, Andy Samberg, Leighton Meester, Vanilla Ice, Tony Orlando, Will Forte, Milo Ventimiglia, Susan Sarandon', 'R', 'While in his teens, Donny fathered a son, Todd, and raised him as a single parent up until Todd''s 18th birthday. Now, after not seeing each other for years, Todd''s world comes crashing down when Donny resurfaces just before Todd''s wedding.', 'While in his teens, Donny fathered a son, Todd, and raised him as a single parent up until Todd''s 18th birthday. Now, after not seeing each other for years, Todd''s world comes crashing down when Donny resurfaces just before Todd''s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaLhdRsZ5Mq8VfZtA4Wlvjzzn0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87428'),
  ('376136574988137669', 'That''s My Mommy', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Red Coffey', 'NR', 'When a duck hatches from the egg underneath Tom, the newborn (Little Quacker) is convinced Tom is his mother. Tom would like to eat the duckling; Jerry is determined to keep that from happening.', 'When a duck hatches from the egg underneath Tom, the newborn (Little Quacker) is convinced Tom is his mother. Tom would like to eat the duckling; Jerry is determined to keep that from happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRUataOaoIy2XtbxMHoXaWnUozO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92002'),
  ('800634308319376211', 'That''s My Pup!', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Daws Butler', 'NR', 'Spike explains to his son the rules of being a dog: 1: be man''s best friend (begging, lying at feet); 2: bury bones; 3: chase cats. Just then, Tom (and Jerry) run by, offering the perfect practice subject. Spike lectures Tom to be scared by the pup or else; Jerry overhears, and is soon doing his best dog impersonation, while Tom works on various strategies to neutralize Tyke', 'Spike explains to his son the rules of being a dog: 1: be man''s best friend (begging, lying at feet); 2: bury bones; 3: chase cats. Just then, Tom (and Jerry) run by, offering the perfect practice subject. Spike lectures Tom to be scared by the pup or else; Jerry overhears, and is soon doing his best dog impersonation, while Tom works on various strategies to neutralize Tyke', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gPbepHdTUjXZDknZCtEYx1O5kO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92010'),
  ('1070531455561131695', 'That''s My Wife', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Lloyd French', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, William Courtright, Vivien Oakland, Dorothy Christy, Charlie Hall, Sam Lufkin, Tom Mintz', null, 'Oliver stands to inherit a large fortune from his rich Uncle Bernal, with the condition that he be happily married. But when Mrs. Hardy walks out just before Uncle Bernal is due for a visit, Stanley is pressed into duty (and into drag) to impersonate Oliver''s loving spouse.', 'Oliver stands to inherit a large fortune from his rich Uncle Bernal, with the condition that he be happily married. But when Mrs. Hardy walks out just before Uncle Bernal is due for a visit, Stanley is pressed into duty (and into drag) to impersonate Oliver''s loving spouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5TMDTFWqh6FoInggm2rO82svEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50906'),
  ('1020774891207369670', 'That''s Not Cheating', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ariel Winograd, Fernando Alcalde, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Gabriel Korenfeld, Julian Loyola', 'Lali Espósito, Martín Piroyansky, Benjamín Vicuña, Liz Solari, Pablo Rago, Guillermo Arengo, Maruja Bustamante, Ana Pauls', null, 'Mateo and Camila, a couple that allow each other being unfaithful with a unreachable someone chosen by each.', 'Mateo and Camila, a couple that allow each other being unfaithful with a unreachable someone chosen by each.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fQFfjXJGwCKpdiM33dWdx3TZXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400276'),
  ('832571554550477628', 'That''s Show Business', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Jean Yanne', 'Gérard Sire, Jean Yanne', 'Jean Yanne, Robert Hirsch, Catherine Rouvel, Liliane Montevecchi, Denise Gence, Ginette Leclerc, Hubert Deschamps, Georges Beller', null, 'Clement Mastard is the head of a leading journal dedicated to extravagant vaudeville. An unexpected contract requires him to reconnect with his former headliner Celia Bergson part to try to avant-garde theater. It is through this that he met Johann Sebastian Bloch, misunderstood musician who cause the loss but the side which Mastard, the man without scruples, to humanize and eventually produce a real masterpiece, the Missa Solemnis', 'Clement Mastard is the head of a leading journal dedicated to extravagant vaudeville. An unexpected contract requires him to reconnect with his former headliner Celia Bergson part to try to avant-garde theater. It is through this that he met Johann Sebastian Bloch, misunderstood musician who cause the loss but the side which Mastard, the man without scruples, to humanize and eventually produce a real masterpiece, the Missa Solemnis', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QAi2VaAio1y3dyvFo8ewkifg7D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126036'),
  ('611255689616186466', 'That''s So Suite Life of Hannah Montana', 2006, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy', 'Rich Correll', null, 'Dylan Sprouse, Cole Sprouse, Brenda Song, Ashley French, Raven-Symoné, Anneliese Van Der Pol, Rondell Sheridan, Miley Cyrus', 'G', 'The exciting crossover event begins when Raven Baxter checks into the swanky Tipton Hotel while on a business trip with her designer boss. Zack and Cody get into the action when the models for Raven''s photo shoot take a detour and Raven has a spooky premonition about the twins'' fate. Meanwhile, Maddie comes up with a plan to get London to wear one of Raven’s new dresses. It almost backfires until London finds out that super pop star Hannah Montana wants a Raven original to wear on her new tour.', 'The exciting crossover event begins when Raven Baxter checks into the swanky Tipton Hotel while on a business trip with her designer boss. Zack and Cody get into the action when the models for Raven''s photo shoot take a detour and Raven has a spooky premonition about the twins'' fate. Meanwhile, Maddie comes up with a plan to get London to wear one of Raven’s new dresses. It almost backfires until London finds out that super pop star Hannah Montana wants a Raven original to wear on her new tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eDire0T4bPDSgqt4Y28xdslKuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205567'),
  ('673179439766786795', 'That''s What I Am', 2011, 'Drama, Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Pavone, Kenneth Zunder', 'Michael Pavone', 'Chase Ellison, Ed Harris, Molly Parker, Mia Rose Frampton, Amy Madigan, Renwick D. Scott II, Randy Orton, Yvette Rachelle', 'PG', 'A coming-of-age story that follows 12-year-old Andy Nichol, a bright student who, like most kids his age, will do anything to avoid conflict for fear of suffering overwhelming ridicule and punishment from his junior high school peers.', 'A coming-of-age story that follows 12-year-old Andy Nichol, a bright student who, like most kids his age, will do anything to avoid conflict for fear of suffering overwhelming ridicule and punishment from his junior high school peers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEVN6PW7cBW4JytulTtQNtRV1T8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57118'),
  ('565357752602238244', 'Thawing Out', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Julien Chervier, Pierre Stoeber, Mohamed Elarche', 'Jean-Julien Chervier', 'Marc Beffa, Géraldine Martineau, Zazon Castro, Laurent Roth, Lauren Chini, Natanaël Sylard, Laura Luna, Philippe Caulier', null, 'Léo is dragged to a nudist camping resort by his mother. Like most boys at the age of 12 or 13, being nude in public holds little appeal for Léo, who protests by wearing extra layers. Until he meets a certain special girl, who captures his heart and releases his inhibitions.', 'Léo is dragged to a nudist camping resort by his mother. Like most boys at the age of 12 or 13, being nude in public holds little appeal for Léo, who protests by wearing extra layers. Until he meets a certain special girl, who captures his heart and releases his inhibitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yu2lpgsWZg3u8LrYkM23S0VRHk6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73881'),
  ('933407543145779185', 'The ''?'' Motorist', 1906, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Walter R. Booth', null, null, null, 'A magical glowing white motorcar ignores policemen, drives up buildings, flies through outer space, and can transform into a horse and carriage.', 'A magical glowing white motorcar ignores policemen, drives up buildings, flies through outer space, and can transform into a horse and carriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhIjrcbd097wCNIn4oFjzqJeNQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132379'),
  ('504860283540361220', 'The ''Burbs', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Joe Dante, Robert M. Stevens, Carla McCloskey', 'Dana Olsen', 'Tom Hanks, Bruce Dern, Carrie Fisher, Rick Ducommun, Wendy Schaal, Corey Feldman, Courtney Gains, Henry Gibson', 'PG', 'When secretive new neighbors move in next door, suburbanite Ray Peterson and his friends let their paranoia get the best of them as they start to suspect the newcomers of evildoings and commence an investigation. But it''s hardly how Ray, who much prefers drinking beer, reading his newspaper and watching a ball game on the tube expected to spend his vacation.', 'When secretive new neighbors move in next door, suburbanite Ray Peterson and his friends let their paranoia get the best of them as they start to suspect the newcomers of evildoings and commence an investigation. But it''s hardly how Ray, who much prefers drinking beer, reading his newspaper and watching a ball game on the tube expected to spend his vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwYKzJS0C3A711hmg1G4ptI0InF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11974'),
  ('875751120729820000', 'The ''Frankenstein'' Files: How Hollywood Made a Monster', 1999, 'Documentary', 'David J. Skal, David J. Skal', 'David J. Skal', 'David J. Skal, Rudy Behlmer, Sara Karloff, Bob Madison, Rick Baker, Donald F. Glut, Ivan Butler, Jan-Christopher Horak', null, 'The history of Frankenstein''s journey from novel to stage to screen to icon.', 'The history of Frankenstein''s journey from novel to stage to screen to icon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHt8qrf8rHh6NY27l0qqFGg134y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3147'),
  ('688818608993062782', 'The ''Maggie''', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Alexander Mackendrick, Gordon Dines, Franklin Gollings', 'William Rose', 'Paul Douglas, Alex Mackenzie, James Copeland, Abe Barker, Tommy Kearins, Hubert Gregg, Geoffrey Keen, Dorothy Alison', null, 'The poor, elderly—and the wily, when it comes to parting those who can afford it from their money—Scottish skipper of a broken-down old ''puffer'' boat tricks an American tycoon into paying him to transport his personal cargo. When the tycoon learns of the trick, he attempts to track down the boat and remove his possessions.', 'The poor, elderly—and the wily, when it comes to parting those who can afford it from their money—Scottish skipper of a broken-down old ''puffer'' boat tricks an American tycoon into paying him to transport his personal cargo. When the tycoon learns of the trick, he attempts to track down the boat and remove his possessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNOaqMf1k2mvLHvCIpCAi7W78wf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48954'),
  ('285610761890715184', 'The (Almost) Legends', 2023, 'Comedy, Music', 'Ricardo Castro Velázquez, Angello Faccini', 'Enrique Vázquez, Ricardo Castro Velázquez, María Torres', 'Benny Emmanuel, Harold Azuara, Nora Velázquez, Ana Celeste, Guillermo Quintanilla, Esmeralda Soto, Diego Sandoval, Dagoberto Gama', null, 'A colorful Mexican town. Two half brothers. Romeo and Preciado meet again to honor their dad''s memory in a car rally full of adrenaline and banda music.', 'A colorful Mexican town. Two half brothers. Romeo and Preciado meet again to honor their dad''s memory in a car rally full of adrenaline and banda music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aBjSNnl1eIsR8RVNlczc1beL6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148969'),
  ('794947089654317112', 'The (Ex)perience of Love', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Raphaël Balboni, Jorge Piquer Rodríguez, Ann Sirot', 'Ann Sirot, Raphaël Balboni', 'Lucie Debay, Lazare Gousseau, Nora Hamzawi, Florence Loiret Caille, Florence Janas, Vincent Lecuyer, Ninon Borsei, Audrey Muller', null, 'Remy and Sandra can''t have children because they suffer from the "Past Loves Syndrome". To heal, there is only one solution, they must sleep with all their exes once.', 'Remy and Sandra can''t have children because they suffer from the "Past Loves Syndrome". To heal, there is only one solution, they must sleep with all their exes once.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWiEsOT3ND1k4nzeTq0Xg4dMN7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989232'),
  ('707624750460387349', 'The (Silent) War', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Alfonso Cortés-Cavanillas, Adolpho Cañadas, Aníbal Ruiz-Villar', 'Alfonso Cortés-Cavanillas, Juan Carlos Díaz', 'Asier Etxeandia, Marian Álvarez, Hugo Silva, Aitor Luna, Olimpia Melinte, Imanol Arias, Ruth Díaz, Stephanie Gil', 'NR', 'Northern Spain, October 1944. Several groups of guerrilla fighters, former Republican soldiers exiled in France after the end of the Spanish Civil War, infiltrate the country in order to provoke a popular uprising against General Franco''s dictatorship.', 'Northern Spain, October 1944. Several groups of guerrilla fighters, former Republican soldiers exiled in France after the end of the Spanish Civil War, infiltrate the country in order to provoke a popular uprising against General Franco''s dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bj6ZuH8xf7VVt6ekbbWCuCZeqqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542444'),
  ('202034353703846789', 'The 10 Year Plan', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'J.C. Calciano, Pawel Pogorzelski', 'J.C. Calciano', 'Jack Turner, Michael Adam Hamilton, Moronai Kanekoa, Adam Bucci, Teri Reeves, Michael Rothhaar, Debra Wilson, Ben Palacios', null, 'Myles and Brody are best friends with two very different ways of finding love. Displeased with their current love lives, they make a pact to be together if neither finds love in ten year’s time. Now two months shy of their deadline, both friends set off to do whatever it takes to avoid ending up as each other’s last resort.', 'Myles and Brody are best friends with two very different ways of finding love. Displeased with their current love lives, they make a pact to be together if neither finds love in ten year’s time. Now two months shy of their deadline, both friends set off to do whatever it takes to avoid ending up as each other’s last resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2oJPcyydaL997oaDQhcCt4xGgD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267463'),
  ('912672614451619320', 'The 100 Candles Game', 2020, 'Horror', 'Nicolás Onetti, Nicholas Peterson, Kadri Nikopensius', 'Daniel Rübesam', 'Magui Bravi, Clara Kovacic, James Wright, Agustin Olcese, Luz Champané, Amparo Espinola, Ayla López, Zoé Arnao', null, 'A group of friends must confront their fears in a terrifying game. They must sit by the other players in a circle made of a hundred candles, take one of them and tell a horror story. As stories are told and candles blown out, strange events will start to happen. They will feel strange presences around them, lurking in the shadows. But they MUST NOT leave the game or else a terrible curse will fall upon them...', 'A group of friends must confront their fears in a terrifying game. They must sit by the other players in a circle made of a hundred candles, take one of them and tell a horror story. As stories are told and candles blown out, strange events will start to happen. They will feel strange presences around them, lurking in the shadows. But they MUST NOT leave the game or else a terrible curse will fall upon them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVcKV76XSxxJCsqdxjMql7yVJq5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751394'),
  ('1039946585067577294', 'The 100 Year-Old Man Who Climbed Out the Window and Disappeared', 2013, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Felix Herngren, Ulf Lundgren, Göran Hallberg', 'Hans Ingemansson, Felix Herngren', 'Robert Gustafsson, Iwar Wiklander, David Wiberg, Mia Skäringer, Jens Hultén, Sven Lönn, Bianca Cruzeiro, Alan Ford', 'PG', 'After living a long and colorful life, Allan Karlsson finds himself stuck in a nursing home. On his 100th birthday, he leaps out a window and begins an unexpected journey.', 'After living a long and colorful life, Allan Karlsson finds himself stuck in a nursing home. On his 100th birthday, he leaps out a window and begins an unexpected journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eexokDJNgyfpdTH30s102lSuc9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145247'),
  ('433864696677607053', 'The 100th Love with You', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sho Tsukikawa', 'Satomi Oshima', 'Kentaro Sakaguchi, miwa, Ryo Ryusei, Yuki Izumisawa, Erina Mano, Seiichi Tanabe, Rina Ohta, Keiko Horiuchi', null, 'On July 27th, university student Aoi Hinata has an accident. When she wakes up, Aoi Hinata finds herself in a classroom from one week before the accident.', 'On July 27th, university student Aoi Hinata has an accident. When she wakes up, Aoi Hinata finds herself in a classroom from one week before the accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qTXPBoiQiCLm1f8M04Ghimw8rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428125'),
  ('214322229612326804', 'The 101-Year-Old Man Who Skipped Out on the Bill and Disappeared', 2016, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Göran Hallberg, Carl-Petter Montell, Måns Herngren', 'Felix Herngren, Hans Ingemansson', 'Robert Gustafsson, Iwar Wiklander, David Wiberg, Shima Niavarani, Jens Hultén, Cory Peterson, Ralph Carlsson, Colin McFarlane', null, 'Drinking the tasty Folk Soda puts a spring in the 101 Year Old Man’s step and his next adventure takes him around the World and back to Sweden, during which time he is chased by the CIA, a Balinese debt collector and becomes an executive at a soft drink company.', 'Drinking the tasty Folk Soda puts a spring in the 101 Year Old Man’s step and his next adventure takes him around the World and back to Sweden, during which time he is chased by the CIA, a Balinese debt collector and becomes an executive at a soft drink company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIDOtXucNE2F1mwTyw6JB8m74wU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404791'),
  ('237097611006961743', 'The 10th District Court: Moments of Trial', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Depardon', null, 'Michèle Bernard-Requin', null, 'The proceedings of a Paris courtroom are the grist for this documentary. Drawn from over 200 appearances before the same female judge, the director chooses a dozen or so varied misdemeanor and civil hearings to highlight the subtle details of human behavior. In the process he draws attention to issues of guilt, innocence, policing and ethnicity in France.', 'The proceedings of a Paris courtroom are the grist for this documentary. Drawn from over 200 appearances before the same female judge, the director chooses a dozen or so varied misdemeanor and civil hearings to highlight the subtle details of human behavior. In the process he draws attention to issues of guilt, innocence, policing and ethnicity in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kykPNLRCxlM23EnVOpWLwUdAbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125742'),
  ('1107287087878503588', 'The 10th Victim', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Elio Petri, Berto Pelosso, Gianni Di Venanzo', 'Tonino Guerra, Giorgio Salvioni, Ennio Flaiano', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Ursula Andress, Elsa Martinelli, Salvo Randone, Massimo Serato, Milo Quesada, Luce Bonifassy, George Wang', null, 'In the near future, big wars are avoided by giving individuals with violent tendencies a chance to kill in the Big Hunt. The Hunt is the most popular form of entertainment in the world and also attracts participants who are looking for fame and fortune. It includes ten rounds for each competitor, five as the hunter and five as the victim.', 'In the near future, big wars are avoided by giving individuals with violent tendencies a chance to kill in the Big Hunt. The Hunt is the most popular form of entertainment in the world and also attracts participants who are looking for fame and fortune. It includes ten rounds for each competitor, five as the hunter and five as the victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwXXxwnN1yj5XiZBUrdazBRMqw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65632'),
  ('1140920744252947382', 'The 11 Commandments', 2004, 'Comedy', 'François Desagnat, Thomas Sorriaux', 'Vincent Desagnat, Benjamin Morgaine, Romain Lévy', 'Michaël Youn, Vincent Desagnat, Benjamin Morgaine, Dieudonné, Jurij Prette, Patrick Timsit, Carla Collado, Juliette Arnaud', null, 'After an evening of drinking, six men find themselves in front of The God of the Joke. Distressed to find that people aren''t laughing anymore, He gives the six friends a mission: to save the world with the Eleven Commandments of the Joke. The men enthusiastically take on their task. They undertake various tests aimed at pushing the limits of stupidity.', 'After an evening of drinking, six men find themselves in front of The God of the Joke. Distressed to find that people aren''t laughing anymore, He gives the six friends a mission: to save the world with the Eleven Commandments of the Joke. The men enthusiastically take on their task. They undertake various tests aimed at pushing the limits of stupidity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TPmWdZ74vUvF2yNfOU3iWrye3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17825'),
  ('505755157079400695', 'The 11th Commandment', 1986, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Paul Leder, Francis Grumman, Richard Hernandez', 'Paul Leder', 'Bernard White, Marilyn Hassett, Dick Sargent, Greg Mullavey, Thomas Ryan, Haunani Minn, Steven Ford, Lauren Woodland', 'R', 'Fashioning himself as a priestly avenger, Robert escapes from the insane asylum and begins slashing his way through anyone who stands between him avenging the actions of his greedy uncle.', 'Fashioning himself as a priestly avenger, Robert escapes from the insane asylum and begins slashing his way through anyone who stands between him avenging the actions of his greedy uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbJ8fYPoi7QatExsR5CfbYb8Uw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85152'),
  ('911759462771712492', 'The 11th Hour', 2007, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime', 'Nadia Conners, Leila Conners, Andrew Rowlands', 'Nadia Conners, Leila Conners, Leonardo DiCaprio', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Kenny Ausubel, Sylvia Earle, John Trudell, Wangari Maathai, Oren R. Lyons, David Suzuki, Stephen Hawking', 'PG', 'A look at the state of the global environment including visionary and practical solutions for restoring the planet''s ecosystems. Featuring ongoing dialogues of experts from all over the world, including former Soviet Prime Minister Mikhail Gorbachev, renowned scientist Stephen Hawking, former head of the CIA R. James Woolse', 'A look at the state of the global environment including visionary and practical solutions for restoring the planet''s ecosystems. Featuring ongoing dialogues of experts from all over the world, including former Soviet Prime Minister Mikhail Gorbachev, renowned scientist Stephen Hawking, former head of the CIA R. James Woolse', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZQyqJhoqSXYhu27oRDqz3Tzl10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4832'),
  ('500161535443481814', 'The 12 Days of Christmas Eve', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Dustin Rikert, Branden James Maxham', 'Eirene Donohue', 'Kelsey Grammer, Spencer Grammer, Mitch Poulos, Uschi Umscheid, Mark Jacobson, Diana Toshiko, Stewart Scott, Daym Drops', 'G', 'When Brian Conway, a successful businessman whose family relationships have suffered, gets in a car accident on Christmas Eve, Santa gives him twelve chances to redo the day and repair the relationships in his life, including with his daughter Michelle.', 'When Brian Conway, a successful businessman whose family relationships have suffered, gets in a car accident on Christmas Eve, Santa gives him twelve chances to redo the day and repair the relationships in his life, including with his daughter Michelle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozGEBpK6BtLoQhEM4WkGnqBmT0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034168'),
  ('411016171233456242', 'The 12 Disasters of Christmas', 2012, 'TV Movie, Action, Science Fiction', 'Steven R. Monroe, Anthony C. Metchie, Greg Rousseaux', 'Sydney Roper, Rudy Thauberger', 'Ed Quinn, Magda Apanowicz, Holly Dignard, Roark Critchlow, Greg Kean, Brenna O''Brien, Christine Willes, Ryan Grantham', 'R', 'Just in time for the joyous holiday season, this film connects the ancient Mayan prophecy of worldwide destruction at the end of 2012, and the iconic holiday song, The 12 Days of Christmas. But there is hope: a father learns that his daughter is really the "Chosen One" who, alone, can stop further catastrophe - if he can stave off the lunatic townspeople blaming her for the community''s destruction.', 'Just in time for the joyous holiday season, this film connects the ancient Mayan prophecy of worldwide destruction at the end of 2012, and the iconic holiday song, The 12 Days of Christmas. But there is hope: a father learns that his daughter is really the "Chosen One" who, alone, can stop further catastrophe - if he can stave off the lunatic townspeople blaming her for the community''s destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixqVj4O0n2FtlDgBTjMFFcOJ2EJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149722'),
  ('69218833070839546', 'The 12 Dogs of Christmas', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Kieth Merrill, Michael Fimognari', 'Kieth Merrill', 'Jordan-Claire Green, Tom Kemp, Susan Wood, Adam Hicks, Cathy Worthington, Jim Jackman, Richard Riehle, Roland Pelletier', 'G', 'This holiday tale has all the elements of a classic heartwarmer--cuddly dogs, small town spirit, and even a full-fledged Christmas pageant. Set during the meager years of the Great Depression, 12 DOGS OF CHRISTMAS follows the story of Emma, a 12-year-old who is sent to live in Doverville, a rural town, with her aunt. The town has, like the rest of the nation, fallen on lean times and seem to have lost all interest in celebrating. However, Emma manages to enlist the town''s dogs into a colorful holiday pageant that reminds the inhabitants that even the Great Depression cannot ruin the spirit of Christmas.', 'This holiday tale has all the elements of a classic heartwarmer--cuddly dogs, small town spirit, and even a full-fledged Christmas pageant. Set during the meager years of the Great Depression, 12 DOGS OF CHRISTMAS follows the story of Emma, a 12-year-old who is sent to live in Doverville, a rural town, with her aunt. The town has, like the rest of the nation, fallen on lean times and seem to have lost all interest in celebrating. However, Emma manages to enlist the town''s dogs into a colorful holiday pageant that reminds the inhabitants that even the Great Depression cannot ruin the spirit of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eFNLBmRL8hcHGFBPxcUejq3Pfl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26985'),
  ('395318225739764729', 'The 120 Days of Bottrop', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Christoph Schlingensief, Clemens Schönborn, Ralph Remstedt', 'Oskar Roehler, Christoph Schlingensief', 'Margit Carstensen, Irm Hermann, Volker Spengler, Udo Kier, Helmut Berger, Mario Gazaner, Sophie Rois, Ilse Garzaner', null, 'An eccentric homage to the Rainer Werner Fassbinder days of German filmmaking.', 'An eccentric homage to the Rainer Werner Fassbinder days of German filmmaking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9IAnIoFQVoNPkPm2xSeiaxEQ1s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61081'),
  ('738692453881413902', 'The 12th Man', 2017, 'War, Drama', 'Harald Zwart, Michael Dignum, Petter Skafle Henriksen', 'Petter Skavlan', 'Thomas Gullestad, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Marie Blokhus, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Martin Kiefer, Vegar Hoel, Håkon Thorstensen Nielsen, Eirik Risholm Velle', 'NR', 'After a failed anti-Nazi sabotage mission leaves his eleven comrades dead, a Norwegian resistance fighter finds himself fleeing the Gestapo through the snowbound reaches of Scandinavia.', 'After a failed anti-Nazi sabotage mission leaves his eleven comrades dead, a Norwegian resistance fighter finds himself fleeing the Gestapo through the snowbound reaches of Scandinavia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxZ8iGf5jQoLcNqBJL6uzNTivp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435577'),
  ('498812393176489465', 'The 12th Suspect', 2019, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Park Jong-cheol, Ko Myoung-sung, O Seok-pil', 'Ko Myoung-sung', 'Kim Sang-kyung, Park Sun-young, Heo Sung-tae, Kim Ji-hoon, Kim Dong-young, Jeong Ji-sun, Han Ji-an, Nam Sung-jin', null, 'Set in a teahouse in Myeong-dong, Seoul right after the end of the Korean War, The 12th Suspect follows the suffocating psychological showdown that takes place between a detective and the 11 suspects who find themselves caught up in a murder case.', 'Set in a teahouse in Myeong-dong, Seoul right after the end of the Korean War, The 12th Suspect follows the suffocating psychological showdown that takes place between a detective and the 11 suspects who find themselves caught up in a murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPJbewbzNjceEMYHHKzp0DflJMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605767'),
  ('1017456206988868279', 'The 13 Roses', 2007, 'Drama', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro, José Luis Alcaine, Martín Cabañas', 'Ignacio Martínez de Pisón', 'Pilar López de Ayala, Verónica Sánchez, Gabriella Pession, Marta Etura, Nadia de Santiago, Teresa Hurtado de Ory, Bárbara Lennie, Alba Alonso', null, 'True story of thirteen totally normal young women that suffered harsh questioning and were put in prison under made up charges of helping the rebellion against Franco back in the 1940s. Despite of their innocence, the thirteen were soon executed without even a trace of evidence of any wrong doing.', 'True story of thirteen totally normal young women that suffered harsh questioning and were put in prison under made up charges of helping the rebellion against Franco back in the 1940s. Despite of their innocence, the thirteen were soon executed without even a trace of evidence of any wrong doing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsU48KgwfXuygvY92plG5NSqalw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27605'),
