  ('337718536480873174', 'The 13th Letter', 1951, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Otto Preminger, Joseph LaShelle, Richard Maybery', 'Howard Koch', 'Linda Darnell, Charles Boyer, Michael Rennie, Constance Smith, Françoise Rosay, Judith Evelyn, Guy Sorel, June Hedin', 'NR', 'A new doctor in a quiet Quebec town sparks rumors and accusations when anonymous letters allege an affair with a married woman.', 'A new doctor in a quiet Quebec town sparks rumors and accusations when anonymous letters allege an affair with a married woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPzUgfoHHGx5XK3fpsYdt92Zurl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39306'),
  ('1047269332854785274', 'The 13th Warrior', 1999, 'Adventure, History, Action', 'John McTiernan, Peter Menzies Jr.', 'Warren Lewis, William Wisher', 'Antonio Banderas, Diane Venora, Dennis Storhøi, Vladimir Kulich, Omar Sharif, Anders T. Andersen, Richard Bremmer, Tony Curran', 'R', 'A Muslim ambassador exiled from his homeland joins a group of Vikings, initially offended by their behavior but growing to respect them. As they travel together, they learn of a legendary evil closing in and must unite to confront this formidable force.', 'A Muslim ambassador exiled from his homeland joins a group of Vikings, initially offended by their behavior but growing to respect them. As they travel together, they learn of a legendary evil closing in and must unite to confront this formidable force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pj1IQQ7ajwaOrjjTCxyM1L4mSnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1911'),
  ('56252105082767592', 'The 14', 1973, 'Drama', 'David Hemmings, Ousama Rawi, Terence Churcher', 'Roland Starke', 'Jack Wild, June Brown, Cheryl Hall, Alun Armstrong, Liz Edmiston, John Bailey, Diana Reevers, Keith Buckley', null, 'Set in London’s East End, The 14 (aka The Wild Little Bunch aka Existence) is based on the true story of fourteen children who struggle against overwhelming pressures to stay together after the death of their single mother.', 'Set in London’s East End, The 14 (aka The Wild Little Bunch aka Existence) is based on the true story of fourteen children who struggle against overwhelming pressures to stay together after the death of their single mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lL5015jIryZazMUnYCXYWWuHkww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142616'),
  ('29310387894818892', 'The 14 Amazons', 1972, 'Action, Adventure, War', 'Cheng Kang, Chen Kuan-Tai, John Chu Ka-Yan', 'Cheng Kang', 'Lisa Lu, Ivy Ling Po, Lily Ho, Elliot Ngok Wah, Shu Pei-Pei, Wang Ping, Liu Wu-Chi, Karen Yeh', null, 'The Yang family, men and women, have served their country loyally for generations. During the war General Yang is ambushed and killed. His widow and the entire family set out to avenge his death and defend the country.', 'The Yang family, men and women, have served their country loyally for generations. During the war General Yang is ambushed and killed. His widow and the entire family set out to avenge his death and defend the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPhlwsnQFxnNpbc0z9u8uCCCp1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21621'),
  ('1147899803145933155', 'The 15 Year Old Girl', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Doillon, Jane Birkin, Caroline Champetier', 'Jean-François Goyet, Jacques Doillon, Arlette Langmann', 'Judith Godrèche, Melvil Poupaud, Jacques Doillon, Tina Sportolaro', null, 'Willy, a middle-aged divorcee, decides to take his 15 year-old son, Thomas, on holiday to Ibiza, staying at an isolated villa on the unspoilt part of the coast. Thomas insists on bringing his friend Juliette, a girl of his own age with whom he enjoys a close platonic relationship. When it comes to physical love, Juliette is wise beyond her years. She will only sleep with men older than herself and has no intention of committing herself to a long-term relationship.', 'Willy, a middle-aged divorcee, decides to take his 15 year-old son, Thomas, on holiday to Ibiza, staying at an isolated villa on the unspoilt part of the coast. Thomas insists on bringing his friend Juliette, a girl of his own age with whom he enjoys a close platonic relationship. When it comes to physical love, Juliette is wise beyond her years. She will only sleep with men older than herself and has no intention of committing herself to a long-term relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teV0yyLxskRwXzR4WEVsKdbEsiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102783'),
  ('672982630868565542', 'The 15:17 to Paris', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Clint Eastwood, Tom Stern, Julien Pougnier', 'Dorothy Blyskal', 'Ray Corasani, Spencer Stone, Anthony Sadler, Alek Skarlatos, Judy Greer, Jenna Fischer, William Jennings, Paul-Mikél Williams', 'PG-13', 'On Aug. 21, 2015, the world watches in stunned silence as the media reports a thwarted terrorist attack on a train that''s bound for Paris -- an attempt prevented by three young Americans traveling together through Europe. The heroic and courageous actions of Anthony Sadler, Alek Skarlatos and Spencer Stone help to save the lives of more than 500 passengers on board.', 'On Aug. 21, 2015, the world watches in stunned silence as the media reports a thwarted terrorist attack on a train that''s bound for Paris -- an attempt prevented by three young Americans traveling together through Europe. The heroic and courageous actions of Anthony Sadler, Alek Skarlatos and Spencer Stone help to save the lives of more than 500 passengers on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NtkRNmvMrQIOtyWTaOKVNJyP1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453201'),
  ('83980251177870997', 'The 18 Bronzemen', 1976, 'Action', 'Joseph Kuo', 'Chang Hsin-Yi, Yen Chung, Joseph Kuo', 'Carter Huang Chia-Ta, Tien Peng, Chang Yi, Chiang Nan, Yee Yuen, Su Chen-Ping, Chen Bao-Liang, Grace Chen', 'PG', 'During the Manchurian invasion of China, the son of the Ming Dynasty General takes refuge in the Shaolin Temple to learn martial arts, so that he may seek revenge for his dead father. But he must first endure the rigorous test of the temple''s legendary 18 Bronzemen.', 'During the Manchurian invasion of China, the son of the Ming Dynasty General takes refuge in the Shaolin Temple to learn martial arts, so that he may seek revenge for his dead father. But he must first endure the rigorous test of the temple''s legendary 18 Bronzemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e96ju7fjhxrRDeEbW2B4ihfpZZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60402'),
