  ('82087947566850929', 'The 1st 13th Annual Fancy Anvil Awards Show Program Special: Live in Stereo', 2002, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', null, 'Stuart Hill, Steve Patrick, Matt Peccini', 'Casey Kasem, Sandy Duncan, Davy Jones, Tim Conway, Phyllis Diller, Jonathan Lipnicki, Tom Kenny, Jeff Bennett', null, 'Cartoon Network holds an awards show awarding cartoon excellence.', 'Cartoon Network holds an awards show awarding cartoon excellence.', null, 'tmdb:movie:609737'),
  ('481038256474405565', 'The 2 Lives of Mattia Pascal', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Giorgio Gobbi, Camillo Bazzoni', 'Mario Monicelli, Ennio De Concini, Amanzio Todini', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Senta Berger, Flavio Bucci, Laura Morante, Laura del Sol, Andréa Ferréol, Bernard Blier, Caroline Berg', null, 'Based on ''Il fu Mattia Pascal'', one of Pirandello''s many stories concerning the transitory nature of the intangibles "truth" and "identity". Mattia Pascal is a downtrodden average man, treated like trash by his fiancée, scorned by his associates, and cheated out of his inheritance by contemptuous relatives. The dispirited Pascal heads to Monte Carlo, accruing a fortune and also assuming the identity of a less fortunate gambler who killed himself. The "new" Pascal is treated with a dignity and respect that overwhelms him--and nearly kills him.', 'Based on ''Il fu Mattia Pascal'', one of Pirandello''s many stories concerning the transitory nature of the intangibles "truth" and "identity". Mattia Pascal is a downtrodden average man, treated like trash by his fiancée, scorned by his associates, and cheated out of his inheritance by contemptuous relatives. The dispirited Pascal heads to Monte Carlo, accruing a fortune and also assuming the identity of a less fortunate gambler who killed himself. The "new" Pascal is treated with a dignity and respect that overwhelms him--and nearly kills him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QuLt0Y7BDdS6ljz0NzVHf33Yxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198474'),
  ('207331001220903186', 'The 2 Sides of the Bed', 2005, 'Music, Comedy', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro, Julián Núñez Sánchez, Pablo Ramírez', 'David Serrano', 'Ernesto Alterio, Guillermo Toledo, Alberto San Juan, María Esteve, Pilar Castro, Lucía Jiménez, Secun de la Rosa, Verónica Sánchez', null, 'Three years have passed and the boys seem to have matured. Javier is going to marry Marta and Pedro is very much in love with his new girlfriend Raquel. Rafa has also found happiness with Pilar, who loves him too and treats him in a very particular way. It can seem that everything is perfect in their lives. But what do the girls think? Marta and Raquel have different plans that will put their relationship with their boyfriends in danger. Even Pilar has got a lover and is being unfaithful to Rafa. But that''s not all: a new woman, Carlota, appears in Javier and Pedro''s lives', 'Three years have passed and the boys seem to have matured. Javier is going to marry Marta and Pedro is very much in love with his new girlfriend Raquel. Rafa has also found happiness with Pilar, who loves him too and treats him in a very particular way. It can seem that everything is perfect in their lives. But what do the girls think? Marta and Raquel have different plans that will put their relationship with their boyfriends in danger. Even Pilar has got a lover and is being unfaithful to Rafa. But that''s not all: a new woman, Carlota, appears in Javier and Pedro''s lives', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGoKnxgE8wrbJwfPnolup4bk3hX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89764'),
  ('1044905824881304479', 'The 2 Usual Idiots', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Lando, Massimo Schiavon', 'Fabrizio Biggio, Francesco Mandelli, Mizio Curcio', 'Francesco Mandelli, Fabrizio Biggio, Miriam Giovanelli, Teo Teocoli, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Silvia Cohen, Rosita Celentano, Cristina Del Basso', null, 'The sequel to 2011 film "I soliti idioti".', 'The sequel to 2011 film "I soliti idioti".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOlEHknc0TiF3at5dciasaW51ZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152100'),
  ('80769556400037394', 'The 2000 Year Old Man', 1975, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dale Case, Leo Salkin', 'Mel Brooks, Carl Reiner', 'Mel Brooks, Carl Reiner', null, 'When Carl Reiner and Mel Brooks stepped onstage for the first time to perform their now-legendary skit "The 2000 Year Old Man," they turned live comedy on its head with their irreverent, cutting-edge humor. Done in animated style, catch the dynamic duo riffing on everything from Robin Hood to Saran Wrap in this crowd-pleasing performance as straight-man Reiner interviews a centuries-old Brooks, who shares his wickedly funny musings and opinions with the usual aplomb.', 'When Carl Reiner and Mel Brooks stepped onstage for the first time to perform their now-legendary skit "The 2000 Year Old Man," they turned live comedy on its head with their irreverent, cutting-edge humor. Done in animated style, catch the dynamic duo riffing on everything from Robin Hood to Saran Wrap in this crowd-pleasing performance as straight-man Reiner interviews a centuries-old Brooks, who shares his wickedly funny musings and opinions with the usual aplomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDRIVh79fYFlGv75o2QOP98T6BM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67844'),
  ('1108446317930232339', 'The 24 Hour War', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Nate Adams, Derek Bauer, Adam Carolla', null, 'Mario Andretti, Bob Bondurant, Ralph Nader, David Hobbs, John Surtees, Dan Gurney, Charlie Agapiou, A.J. Baime', null, 'In the early 1960s, Henry Ford II and Enzo Ferrari went to war on the battlefield of Le Mans. This epic battle saw drivers lose their lives, family dynasties nearly collapse, and the development of a new car that changed racing.', 'In the early 1960s, Henry Ford II and Enzo Ferrari went to war on the battlefield of Le Mans. This epic battle saw drivers lose their lives, family dynasties nearly collapse, and the development of a new car that changed racing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCoTRoYI7HlUlGIUwMh3yl6Uhrl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359093'),
  ('695238870145605784', 'The 24th Day', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Tony Piccirillo, J. Alan Hostetter', 'Tony Piccirillo', 'James Marsden, Scott Speedman, Sofía Vergara, Barry Papick, Charles J. Corrado Jr., Jarvis W. George, Scott Roman, Jeffrey Frost', null, 'Tom and Dan''s one-night stand turns into an intense power-play between captor and captive.', 'Tom and Dan''s one-night stand turns into an intense power-play between captor and captive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocNjvdbiStUk987OemlMfhtnI2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18165'),
  ('661307202056737295', 'The 25th Hour', 1967, 'Drama, War', 'Henri Verneuil, Andréas Winding', 'François Boyer, Wolf Mankowitz, Henri Verneuil', 'Anthony Quinn, Virna Lisi, Grégoire Aslan, Michael Redgrave, Marcel Dalio, Marius Goring, Jan Werich, Serge Reggiani', null, 'A Romanian peasant fights to get back to his family after he''s imprisoned by the Nazis.The picture is based on real events. It includes Hungary''s government in collaboration with the Nazis, the encroachment of Romania by Stalin''s troopers, and other happenings.', 'A Romanian peasant fights to get back to his family after he''s imprisoned by the Nazis.The picture is based on real events. It includes Hungary''s government in collaboration with the Nazis, the encroachment of Romania by Stalin''s troopers, and other happenings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dn74C4XXSU4bAigMdUEDjjM57T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66568'),
  ('571869213794908001', 'The 27-Hour Day', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'David Winning, Shawn Seifert, Bill Mizel', 'Audrey Shulman, Rama Diallo, Deborah Jones', 'Autumn Reeser, Andrew W. Walker, Rhiannon Fish, Colleen Wheeler, Garrett Black, Karen Holness, Geoff Gustafson, Lillian Doucet-Roche', 'G', 'An entrepreneur takes a necessary break from developing her wellness brand empire and discovers that the work-life balance she needs won’t be easy. Will a new romance and relaxing retreat change her life forever?', 'An entrepreneur takes a necessary break from developing her wellness brand empire and discovers that the work-life balance she needs won’t be easy. Will a new romance and relaxing retreat change her life forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3K5Tztc7ERzYkZ3hC25x9ekx17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:847353'),
  ('904182669560809509', 'The 27th Day', 1957, 'Science Fiction', 'Henry Freulich, William Asher, Ferrol Redd', 'John Mantley', 'Gene Barry, Valerie French, George Voskovec, Azemat Janti, Stefan Schnabel, Friedrich von Ledebur, Ralph Clanton, Arnold Moss', 'NR', 'Five individuals from five nations, including the USA, USSR, and China, suddenly find themselves on an alien saucer, where an alien gives each a container holding three capsules. The alien explains that no power on earth can open a given container except a mental command from the person to whom it is given, then anyone may take a capsule and, by speaking a latitude and longitude at it, cause instant death to all within a given radius: thus each of the five has been provided with the power of life and death. Then, they are given 27 days to decide whether to use the capsules, and returned to the places from which each one came...', 'Five individuals from five nations, including the USA, USSR, and China, suddenly find themselves on an alien saucer, where an alien gives each a container holding three capsules. The alien explains that no power on earth can open a given container except a mental command from the person to whom it is given, then anyone may take a capsule and, by speaking a latitude and longitude at it, cause instant death to all within a given radius: thus each of the five has been provided with the power of life and death. Then, they are given 27 days to decide whether to use the capsules, and returned to the places from which each one came...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wFZ74dV3xRu7qG48FLbHENz2pa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30299'),
  ('565399825493927215', 'The 2nd', 2020, 'Action', 'Brian Skiba, Adam Biddle', 'Eric Bromberg, Paul Taegel', 'Ryan Phillippe, Casper Van Dien, Jack Griffo, Lexi Simonsen, Richard Burgi, Samaire Armstrong, Jacob Grodnik, Randy Charach', 'NR', 'Secret-service agent Vic Davis is on his way to pick up his estranged son, Sean, from his college campus when he finds himself in the middle of a high-stakes terrorist operation. His son''s friend Erin Walton, the daughter of Supreme Court Justice Walton is the target, and this armed faction will stop at nothing to kidnap her and use her as leverage for a pending landmark legal case.', 'Secret-service agent Vic Davis is on his way to pick up his estranged son, Sean, from his college campus when he finds himself in the middle of a high-stakes terrorist operation. His son''s friend Erin Walton, the daughter of Supreme Court Justice Walton is the target, and this armed faction will stop at nothing to kidnap her and use her as leverage for a pending landmark legal case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1WvNhoackad1QiAGRgjJCQ1Trj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724717'),
  ('292863462109028774', 'The 3 L''il Pigs', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Patrick Huard, Bernard Couture', 'Claude Lalonde, Pierre Lamothe', 'Claude Legault, Guillaume Lemay-Thivierge, Sophie Prégent, Paul Doucet, Julie Perreault, Isabel Richer, Mahée Paiement, France Castel', null, 'At the hospital, three brothers meet at the bedside of their mother in a coma. To pass the time, they discuss the merits and pleasures of marital fidelity and infidelity. The conversations of the two youngest advance as the days go by in increasingly juicy details and fantasies, which will push them to act against the morals and more solid values ​​of the eldest.', 'At the hospital, three brothers meet at the bedside of their mother in a coma. To pass the time, they discuss the merits and pleasures of marital fidelity and infidelity. The conversations of the two youngest advance as the days go by in increasingly juicy details and fantasies, which will push them to act against the morals and more solid values ​​of the eldest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQDU7JCWRZTM8rhPmnNmmQQkBgP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35541'),
  ('1019426199090227117', 'The 3 L''il Pigs 2', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Jean-François Pouliot', 'Claude Lalonde, Pierre Lamothe', 'Paul Doucet, Guillaume Lemay-Thivierge, Patrice Robitaille, Isabel Richer, Sophie Prégent, Xiao Sun, Maxime Lepage, Océane Bergeron', null, 'Five years after the death of their mother, Rémi, Mathieu and Christian have not changed much. Rémi is still as prolific and travels the world, multiplying his conquests, Mathieu leads a relatively peaceful life with his daughters and his wife and Christian lives off his brothers, hoping to find the perfect partner and finally settle down. When Rémi is kicked out of his house by his wife who discovers his infidelity and he suffers a panic attack, his brothers come to his rescue. Despite their different lifestyles, Rémi, Mathieu and Christian will try to help each other in order to form the united family that their mother would have wanted for them.', 'Five years after the death of their mother, Rémi, Mathieu and Christian have not changed much. Rémi is still as prolific and travels the world, multiplying his conquests, Mathieu leads a relatively peaceful life with his daughters and his wife and Christian lives off his brothers, hoping to find the perfect partner and finally settle down. When Rémi is kicked out of his house by his wife who discovers his infidelity and he suffers a panic attack, his brothers come to his rescue. Despite their different lifestyles, Rémi, Mathieu and Christian will try to help each other in order to form the united family that their mother would have wanted for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1YYJVk9AxPZb3iEIYJPPshV8HM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375812'),
  ('50179708071749806', 'The 3 Penny Opera', 1931, 'Music, Crime', 'G.W. Pabst, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Béla Balázs, Ladislaus Vajda, Léo Lania', 'Rudolf Forster, Carola Neher, Reinhold Schünzel, Fritz Rasp, Valeska Gert, Lotte Lenya, Hermann Thimig, Ernst Busch', null, 'In London at the turn of the century, underworld kingpin Mack the Knife marries Polly Peachum without the knowledge of her father, the equally enterprising ''king of the beggars''.', 'In London at the turn of the century, underworld kingpin Mack the Knife marries Polly Peachum without the knowledge of her father, the equally enterprising ''king of the beggars''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w39cIJWmtLRxyqAE2KdhSuUa0wC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42837'),
  ('1004205737445880869', 'The 3 Wise Men', 2003, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Antonio Navarro', 'Juan Ignacio Peña, Juanjo Ibáñez, Javier Aguirreamalloa', 'Juan Echanove, Jose Coronado, Imanol Arias, Ricardo Gómez, José Sancho, David Robles, Javier Gurruchaga, Iñaki Gabilondo', null, 'A brilliantly animated adaptation of the classic Christian story, 3 WISE MEN features the voices of Emilio Estevez, Martin Sheen, and Mexican television star Jaci Velasquez. Created by the same artists who animated FANTASIA 2000, HERCULES, and TARZAN, the family-friendly film artfully brings to life the journey of Melchior, Gaspar, and Balthazar--the Three Kings who traveled to baby Jesus'' birthplace under the guidance of the Star of Bethlehem.', 'A brilliantly animated adaptation of the classic Christian story, 3 WISE MEN features the voices of Emilio Estevez, Martin Sheen, and Mexican television star Jaci Velasquez. Created by the same artists who animated FANTASIA 2000, HERCULES, and TARZAN, the family-friendly film artfully brings to life the journey of Melchior, Gaspar, and Balthazar--the Three Kings who traveled to baby Jesus'' birthplace under the guidance of the Star of Bethlehem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dn3LniVvTYI5TnOfv3PHJMlreHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22503'),
  ('523269123355562594', 'The 3 Worlds of Gulliver', 1960, 'Music, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Jack Sher, Wilkie Cooper', 'Arthur A. Ross, Jack Sher', 'Kerwin Mathews, June Thorburn, Jo Morrow, Lee Patterson, Grégoire Aslan, Basil Sydney, Charles Lloyd Pack, Martin Benson', null, 'Doctor Gulliver is poor, so nothing - not even his charming fiancée Elisabeth - keeps him in the town he lives. He signs on to a ship to India, but in a storm he''s washed off the ship and ends up on an island, which is inhibitated by very tiny people. After he managed to convince them he''s harmless and is accepted as one of their citizens, their king wants to use him in war against a people of giants. Compared to them, even Gulliver is a gnome.', 'Doctor Gulliver is poor, so nothing - not even his charming fiancée Elisabeth - keeps him in the town he lives. He signs on to a ship to India, but in a storm he''s washed off the ship and ends up on an island, which is inhibitated by very tiny people. After he managed to convince them he''s harmless and is accepted as one of their citizens, their king wants to use him in war against a people of giants. Compared to them, even Gulliver is a gnome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Zdbxszx6CL1SyZJwlScPMQbEMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18974'),
  ('756343725965406625', 'The 30 Foot Bride of Candy Rock', 1959, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Sidney Miller, Frank G. Carson', 'Rowland Barber, Arthur A. Ross', 'Lou Costello, Dorothy Provine, Gale Gordon, Jimmy Conlin, Charles Lane, Robert Burton, Will Wright, Lenny Kent', 'NR', 'In one of his rare performances without Bud Abbott, Lou Costello plays a rubbish collector and inventor. When radiation in a nearby cave turns his girlfriend into a giantess, antics ensue as he tries to shrink her using one of his inventions.', 'In one of his rare performances without Bud Abbott, Lou Costello plays a rubbish collector and inventor. When radiation in a nearby cave turns his girlfriend into a giantess, antics ensue as he tries to shrink her using one of his inventions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZjLGnfyM43N0GITmcHg4yYKNoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111561'),
  ('235687474797240902', 'The 300 Spartans', 1962, 'Adventure, History, War', 'Rudolph Maté, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Gian Paolo Callegari, Remigio Del Grosso', 'Richard Egan, Ralph Richardson, Diane Baker, Barry Coe, David Farrar, Anne Wakefield, Donald Houston, Anna Synodinou', 'PG', 'The 300 Spartans is an account of the 480 B.C. Battle of Thermopylae, in which the Greek Spartan King Leonidis, played by Richard Egan, led a remarkably small number of Greek Sparta to victory over an invading Persian army led by evil King Xerxes that was thought to number over 25,000. This spectacular conflict gave the Grecians enough time to organize a force to ultimately repel the Persians, and thus change the course of Western civilization.', 'The 300 Spartans is an account of the 480 B.C. Battle of Thermopylae, in which the Greek Spartan King Leonidis, played by Richard Egan, led a remarkably small number of Greek Sparta to victory over an invading Persian army led by evil King Xerxes that was thought to number over 25,000. This spectacular conflict gave the Grecians enough time to organize a force to ultimately repel the Persians, and thus change the course of Western civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nScPJlqTQAQrSFnvImy7u0JxyzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19972'),
  ('30111916280954056', 'The 317th Platoon', 1965, 'War, History, Drama', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer, Raoul Coutard', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer', 'Jacques Perrin, Bruno Cremer, Pierre Fabre, Manuel Zarzo, Boramy Tioulong, Saksi Sbong', 'PG-13', 'In Laos, 1954, eight days before the french defeat in the Indochina war, the 317th platoon – four french soldiers and 41 laotian combatants – has been ordered to leave its outpost and to retreat for the plains of Diên Biên Phu, where the french army is getting stucked. Led by the inexperienced and idealistic sous-lieutenant Torrens, fresh out of the military academy, and by adjutant Willsdorf, a WWII veteran of the Werhmacht, the group must cross 150 kilometers of jungle. But dripping rainwater, hostile nature, and the Viêt-minh ambushes expose them to constant danger.', 'In Laos, 1954, eight days before the french defeat in the Indochina war, the 317th platoon – four french soldiers and 41 laotian combatants – has been ordered to leave its outpost and to retreat for the plains of Diên Biên Phu, where the french army is getting stucked. Led by the inexperienced and idealistic sous-lieutenant Torrens, fresh out of the military academy, and by adjutant Willsdorf, a WWII veteran of the Werhmacht, the group must cross 150 kilometers of jungle. But dripping rainwater, hostile nature, and the Viêt-minh ambushes expose them to constant danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mQIn1FMnwEyPiMMrYVf0R0HcJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31344'),
  ('128670576579136881', 'The 31st Annual Critics'' Choice Awards', 2026, null, null, null, 'Chelsea Handler, Paul Thomas Anderson, François Arnaud, Ike Barinholtz, Kathy Bates', null, 'Hosted by Chelsea Handler, the 31st Annual Critics'' Choice Awards honors the best in film and television from 2025. In film, Sinners (2025), One Battle After Another (2025) and Marty Supreme (2025) are a few of the nominees contending for awards.', 'Hosted by Chelsea Handler, the 31st Annual Critics'' Choice Awards honors the best in film and television from 2025. In film, Sinners (2025), One Battle After Another (2025) and Marty Supreme (2025) are a few of the nominees contending for awards.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMmZiMmU4NmMtYmJiNC00MTU1LTg3Y2UtYTUxZWNlMmVmZjhmXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-31st-annual-critics-choice-awards'),
  ('754182168605855653', 'The 33', 2015, 'Drama, History', 'Patricia Riggen, Checco Varese, Waldo Salgado', 'Mikko Alanne, Michael Thomas, Craig Borten', 'Antonio Banderas, Rodrigo Santoro, Kate del Castillo, Juliette Binoche, James Brolin, Lou Diamond Phillips, Cote De Pablo, Naomi Scott', 'PG-13', 'Based on the true story of the collapse of a mine in San Jose, Chile—that left 33 miners isolated underground for 69 days.', 'Based on the true story of the collapse of a mine in San Jose, Chile—that left 33 miners isolated underground for 69 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpXkIuAlIlcNYACRE2MssxnHvZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293646'),
  ('483811119021798070', 'The 33D Invader', 2011, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Sean Chan', 'Wu Qing-Qing, Chen Jun-Yan, Akiho Yoshizawa, Taka Katou, Ya-Wen Hsueh, Chen Chih-Ying, Lee Ko-Chu, Monna Lam', null, 'A young woman named Future is sent from the year 2046 to the year 2011 in Hong Kong. Future was sent by the United Nations in order to get pregnant, where she can then extract her genes and repopulate the earth as 99% of males have become infertile in the future due to attacks from Planet Xucker. Two assassins from Xuckler are sent after her to stop her. Future meets three University students: Felix, Dan-san and Sing. The men are obsessed with female students next door: Chin-chin, Chen-chen and Sai-sai. The students agree to help Future find a mate at the university.', 'A young woman named Future is sent from the year 2046 to the year 2011 in Hong Kong. Future was sent by the United Nations in order to get pregnant, where she can then extract her genes and repopulate the earth as 99% of males have become infertile in the future due to attacks from Planet Xucker. Two assassins from Xuckler are sent after her to stop her. Future meets three University students: Felix, Dan-san and Sing. The men are obsessed with female students next door: Chin-chin, Chen-chen and Sai-sai. The students agree to help Future find a mate at the university.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBC1fBHyFBmc6fn4UDedtkOVSaD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85877'),
  ('667447067890375581', 'The 355', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Tim Maurice-Jones, Mary Buri, Declan O''Brien', 'Simon Kinberg, Theresa Rebeck', 'Jessica Chastain, Lupita Nyong''o, Penélope Cruz, Diane Kruger, Fan Bingbing, Sebastian Stan, Edgar Ramírez, Jason Flemyng', 'PG-13', 'A group of top female agents from American, British, Chinese, Colombian, and German government agencies are drawn together to try and stop an organization from acquiring a deadly weapon to send the world into chaos.', 'A group of top female agents from American, British, Chinese, Colombian, and German government agencies are drawn together to try and stop an organization from acquiring a deadly weapon to send the world into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xef9Ht77B2igqZv754HNdW8qZCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522016'),
  ('1011478412589515652', 'The 36 Crazy Fists', 1977, 'Action, Comedy', 'Chen Chi-Hwa, Stephen Poon Tak-Yip, Chris Chen Ching-Chu', 'Szeto On', 'Tony Leung Siu-Hung, Lau Kar-Yung, Yen Shi-Kwan, Ku Feng, Michelle Yim, Paul Chun Pui, Fung Hak-On, San Kuai', 'R', 'When a young man''s village is destroyed by a band of thugs, he seeks help from a great kung-fu master, but his real lessons come from a drunk old man, he basically learns kung fu by accident and seeks his revenge.', 'When a young man''s village is destroyed by a band of thugs, he seeks help from a great kung-fu master, but his real lessons come from a drunk old man, he basically learns kung fu by accident and seeks his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7zAv5Pbt1zJ9Jg90W6iustsB7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46114'),
  ('1080683139860673180', 'The 36th Chamber of Shaolin', 1978, 'Action, Adventure', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Tong Yuen', 'Ni Kuang', 'Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Lo Lieh, John Cheung Ng-Long, Wilson Tong Wai-Shing, Wa Lun, Hon Kwok-Choi, Lau Kar-Wing, Wai Wang', 'R', 'During the Qing Dynasty, a fishmonger is killed by the reigning Manchu government for supporting the anti-government movement; his son manages to escape to Shaolin Temple, where he plans to learn its secretive brand of martial arts to seek revenge.', 'During the Qing Dynasty, a fishmonger is killed by the reigning Manchu government for supporting the anti-government movement; his son manages to escape to Shaolin Temple, where he plans to learn its secretive brand of martial arts to seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvpgQ43acsASfvVQQwb03IJYqX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11841'),
  ('247658062771187571', 'The 39 Steps', 1935, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Bernard Knowles, Alfred Hitchcock, Pen Tennyson', null, 'Robert Donat, Madeleine Carroll, Lucie Mannheim, Godfrey Tearle, Peggy Ashcroft, John Laurie, Helen Haye, Frank Cellier', 'NR', 'Richard Hanney has a rude awakening when a glamorous female spy falls into his bed - with a knife in her back. Having a bit of trouble explaining it all to Scotland Yard, he heads for the hills of Scotland to try to clear his name by locating the spy ring known as The 39 Steps.', 'Richard Hanney has a rude awakening when a glamorous female spy falls into his bed - with a knife in her back. Having a bit of trouble explaining it all to Scotland Yard, he heads for the hills of Scotland to try to clear his name by locating the spy ring known as The 39 Steps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oC81jK6aAug4MA0xzYVngHmjsZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260'),
  ('839337797552929262', 'The 39 Steps', 1959, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Ralph Thomas', 'Frank Harvey', 'Kenneth More, Taina Elg, Brenda De Banzie, Barry Jones, Reginald Beckwith, Faith Brook, Michael Goodliffe, James Hayter', 'NR', 'In London, a diplomat accidentally becomes involved in the death of a British agent who''s after a spy ring that covets British military secrets.', 'In London, a diplomat accidentally becomes involved in the death of a British agent who''s after a spy ring that covets British military secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4W6uCqZK8X2JSmq3iD5sboJO8XP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25386'),
  ('414889003007038085', 'The 39 Steps', 2008, 'Thriller, Mystery, Adventure, TV Movie', 'James Hawes, James Aspinall, Marco Ciglia', 'Lizzie Mickery', 'Rupert Penry-Jones, Lydia Leonard, David Haig, Patrick Malahide, Patrick Kennedy, Eddie Marsan, Alex Jennings, Steven Elder', null, 'Richard Hannay, a mining engineer on holiday from the African colonies, finds London socialite life terribly dull. Yet it''s more than he bargained for when a secret agent bursts into his room and entrusts him with a coded notebook, concerning the impending start of World War I. In no time both German agents and the British law are chasing him, ruthlessly coveting the Roman numerals code, which Hannay believes he must personally crack.', 'Richard Hannay, a mining engineer on holiday from the African colonies, finds London socialite life terribly dull. Yet it''s more than he bargained for when a secret agent bursts into his room and entrusts him with a coded notebook, concerning the impending start of World War I. In no time both German agents and the British law are chasing him, ruthlessly coveting the Roman numerals code, which Hannay believes he must personally crack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8N537ufRENaGUEJR0JTrRoK93rR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16877'),
  ('608452570359283560', 'The 3rd Voice', 1960, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Hubert Cornfield, Willard Kirkham, Ernest Haller', 'Hubert Cornfield', 'Edmond O''Brien, Julie London, Laraine Day, Olga San Juan, George Eldredge, Tom Hernández, Abel Franco, Edward Colmans', null, 'Marian Forbes has been having an affair with her boss and when he drops her for another woman. In an act of jealousy and greed she convinces an acquaintance to murder her former lover and then impersonate him just long enough to get their hands on a large sum of money.', 'Marian Forbes has been having an affair with her boss and when he drops her for another woman. In an act of jealousy and greed she convinces an acquaintance to murder her former lover and then impersonate him just long enough to get their hands on a large sum of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ndsya7eiUgHcLJwzp5eDA7FiPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36760'),
  ('695733513298896540', 'The 4:30 Movie', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kevin Smith, Amey René, Yaron Levy', 'Kevin Smith', 'Siena Agudong, Austin Zajur, Nicholas Cirillo, Reed Northrup, Ken Jeong, Sam Richardson, Genesis Rodriguez, Justin Long', 'R', 'In the summer of 1986, three sixteen year old friends spend their Saturdays sneaking into movies at the local multiplex. But when one of the guys also invites the girl of his dreams to see the latest comedy, each of the teens learn more about life and love.', 'In the summer of 1986, three sixteen year old friends spend their Saturdays sneaking into movies at the local multiplex. But when one of the guys also invites the girl of his dreams to see the latest comedy, each of the teens learn more about life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6VkCZExHhQ55N24exaqXQmsOL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146556'),
  ('742374942566963516', 'The 40 Year Old Virgin', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Judd Apatow, Jack N. Green, Peter Dress', 'Judd Apatow, Steve Carell', 'Steve Carell, Catherine Keener, Paul Rudd, Romany Malco, Seth Rogen, Elizabeth Banks, Leslie Mann, Jane Lynch', 'R', 'Andy Stitzer has a pleasant life with a nice apartment and a job stamping invoices at an electronics store. But at age 40, there''s one thing Andy hasn''t done, and it''s really bothering his sex-obsessed male co-workers: Andy is still a virgin. Determined to help Andy get laid, the guys make it their mission to de-virginize him. But it all seems hopeless until Andy meets small business owner Trish, a single mom.', 'Andy Stitzer has a pleasant life with a nice apartment and a job stamping invoices at an electronics store. But at age 40, there''s one thing Andy hasn''t done, and it''s really bothering his sex-obsessed male co-workers: Andy is still a virgin. Determined to help Andy get laid, the guys make it their mission to de-virginize him. But it all seems hopeless until Andy meets small business owner Trish, a single mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVeoqL37gzhMXQVpONi9DGOQ3tZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6957'),
  ('201425746697325028', 'The 41–Year–Old Virgin Who Knocked Up Sarah Marshall and Felt Superbad About It', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Jason Rodgers, Andrew Strahorn, Bryan Stanis', 'Craig Moss, Brad Kaaya', 'Bryan Callen, Noureen DeWulf, Mircea Monroe, Stephen Kramer Glickman, Austin Michael Scott, Steven Sims, Chris Spencer, Randall Park', 'R', 'Follows Andy, who needs to hook up with a hottie, pronto, because he hasn''t had sex in... well, forever - and his luck isn''t the only thing that''s hard. His equally horny teenage roommates also need it superbad, and with the help of their nerdy pal, McAnalovin'' and his fake I.D., they may tap more than just a keg.', 'Follows Andy, who needs to hook up with a hottie, pronto, because he hasn''t had sex in... well, forever - and his luck isn''t the only thing that''s hard. His equally horny teenage roommates also need it superbad, and with the help of their nerdy pal, McAnalovin'' and his fake I.D., they may tap more than just a keg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqShY7xY6sUEXsr9cglmclryfjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38570'),
  ('830990010323378562', 'The 47', 2024, 'Drama', 'Marcel Barrena, Isaac Vila, Anice Mateu', 'Marcel Barrena, Alberto Marini', 'Eduard Fernández, Clara Segura, Zoe Bonafonte, Salva Reina, Óscar de la Fuente, David Verdaguer, Carlos Cuevas, Betsy Túrnez', null, 'Based on a true story, in late 1970s Barcelona, Manolo Vital, a bus driver, takes bold action to protest the neglect of Torre Baró, an immigrant neighborhood. His act becomes a symbol of resistance against systemic inequality during a pivotal moment in the city’s modern transformation.', 'Based on a true story, in late 1970s Barcelona, Manolo Vital, a bus driver, takes bold action to protest the neglect of Torre Baró, an immigrant neighborhood. His act becomes a symbol of resistance against systemic inequality during a pivotal moment in the city’s modern transformation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPEvUtPn4ohYMWavYRK7kAbQ8Zw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1174481'),
  ('99748839957531801', 'The 47 Ronin', 1941, 'Drama, History', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Taichirô Hanaoka, Tatsuo Sakai', 'Kenichiro Hara', 'Chōjūrō Kawarasaki, Kan''emon Nakamura, Kunitarō Kawarasaki, Chōemon Bandō, Kikunojo Segawa, Utaemon Ichikawa, Yoshizaburo Arashi, Daisuke Katō', null, 'In the early 18th-century, Lord Takuminokami Asano, feuding with Lord Kira, tries to kill his opponent in the corridors of the Shogun''s palace. The Shogun sentences Asano to seppuku and deprives the palace and lands from his clan, but does not punish Kira. Asano''s vassals leave the land and his samurais become ronin and want to seek revenge against the Lord''s dishonour. But their leader Kuranosuke Oishi seeks to restore the Asano clan with his brother Daigaku Asano. One year later, the Shogun refuses, and Oishi and 46 rōnin are out for revenge.', 'In the early 18th-century, Lord Takuminokami Asano, feuding with Lord Kira, tries to kill his opponent in the corridors of the Shogun''s palace. The Shogun sentences Asano to seppuku and deprives the palace and lands from his clan, but does not punish Kira. Asano''s vassals leave the land and his samurais become ronin and want to seek revenge against the Lord''s dishonour. But their leader Kuranosuke Oishi seeks to restore the Asano clan with his brother Daigaku Asano. One year later, the Shogun refuses, and Oishi and 46 rōnin are out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xCbHN8pITzOcJewSIPNxvxLT7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45978'),
  ('1117815832984924918', 'The 4th Company', 2017, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Amir Galván Cervera, Mitzi Vanessa Arreola', 'Mitzi Vanessa Arreola', 'Adrián Ladrón, Andoni Gracia, Manuel Ojeda, Gabino Rodríguez, Juan Carlos Flores, Guillermo Ríos, Erando González, Carlos Valencia', null, 'Zambrano is a young criminal with the only hope of joining the legendary prison American football team known as The Dogs of Santa Martha. His hopes end up involving him with organized crime since The Dogs, who are also known as The 4th Company, a squadron of inmates at the service of the administration that controls the jail, its vice and its privileges. Corruption and crime have no limits; they ravage the city with car thefts, bank robberies and other crimes under the auspices of the authorities, the story takes place during the López Portillo presidency and his men.', 'Zambrano is a young criminal with the only hope of joining the legendary prison American football team known as The Dogs of Santa Martha. His hopes end up involving him with organized crime since The Dogs, who are also known as The 4th Company, a squadron of inmates at the service of the administration that controls the jail, its vice and its privileges. Corruption and crime have no limits; they ravage the city with car thefts, bank robberies and other crimes under the auspices of the authorities, the story takes place during the López Portillo presidency and his men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wykPRhCP2kJ036kH3iiUAGFjDi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264402'),
  ('791339979025535098', 'The 4th Floor', 1999, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Josh Klausner, Michael Slovis', 'Josh Klausner', 'Juliette Lewis, William Hurt, Shelley Duvall, Tobin Bell, Sabrina Grdevich, Artie Lange, Lorna Millican, Todd Green', 'R', 'A woman inherits a rent-controlled apartment and is terrorized by a neighbor.', 'A woman inherits a rent-controlled apartment and is terrorized by a neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oYkJDmcSkXOuxmaBB0YPLHAOEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49745'),
  ('947496630127305824', 'The 4th Floor', 2003, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Antonio Mercero, Raúl Pérez Cubero', 'Ignacio del Moral, Antonio Mercero, Albert Espinosa', 'Gorka Moreno, Luis Ángel Priego, Juan José Ballesta, Monti Castiñeiras, Marco Martinez', null, 'Three friends in wheelchairs welcome a new patient at a children''s hospital. Growing up together. All emotions pass the revue. Friendship and hope survive all.', 'Three friends in wheelchairs welcome a new patient at a children''s hospital. Growing up together. All emotions pass the revue. Friendship and hope survive all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vsQpIDyyMYmUXemOxhmfPLgXIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40432'),
  ('276717590313784161', 'The 4th Man', 1983, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Paul Verhoeven, Jan de Bont', 'Gerard Soeteman', 'Jeroen Krabbé, Renée Soutendijk, Thom Hoffman, Dolf de Vries, Geert de Jong, Hans Veerman, Hero Muller, Caroline de Beus', 'NR', 'Morbid Catholic writer Gerard Reve–bisexual, alcoholic, and experiencing frequent visions of death–is invited to give a lecture at the Vlissingen literature club. While in the Amsterdam railway station, he''s attracted to a handsome man who embarks on another train. Gerard meets club treasurer and beautician Christine Halsslag, and engage in a one-night-stand. The next morning, Gerard sees a picture of Christine''s boyfriend Herman and recognises him as the man at the train station. He urges her to bring Herman to her house to spend a couple of days together, but with ulterior intentions of seduction. During a night on his own, Gerard finds and watches film reels, discovering that Christine had married each; all of whom died in tragic accidents. Believing Christine is a Black Widow, Gerard begins to question whether Herman or he will be her doomed fourth man.', 'Morbid Catholic writer Gerard Reve–bisexual, alcoholic, and experiencing frequent visions of death–is invited to give a lecture at the Vlissingen literature club. While in the Amsterdam railway station, he''s attracted to a handsome man who embarks on another train. Gerard meets club treasurer and beautician Christine Halsslag, and engage in a one-night-stand. The next morning, Gerard sees a picture of Christine''s boyfriend Herman and recognises him as the man at the train station. He urges her to bring Herman to her house to spend a couple of days together, but with ulterior intentions of seduction. During a night on his own, Gerard finds and watches film reels, discovering that Christine had married each; all of whom died in tragic accidents. Believing Christine is a Black Widow, Gerard begins to question whether Herman or he will be her doomed fourth man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iO7pYvGHcxekOqmQKsY4qeSygAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29140'),
  ('575985488663885702', 'The 4th Wall', 2025, 'Drama', 'Leia Hasrouty, Bady Minck, Stéphane Bidault', 'David Oelhoffen', 'Laurent Lafitte, Simon Abkarian, Manal Issa, Tarek Yaacoub, Bernard Bloch, Aude-Laurence Clermont Biver, Joël Delsaut, Véronique Fauconnet', null, 'Lebanon, 1982. To keep a promise made to an old friend, Georges, an idealistic theater director, travels to Beirut for a project as utopian as it is risky: to stage the play Antigone on the front line, in order to steal a moment of peace from the raging civil war. The characters will be played by actors from different political and religious camps. Lost in a city and a conflict he knows nothing about, Georges is guided by Marwan. As fighting resumes, everything is soon called into question, and Georges, who falls in love with Imane, has to face up to the reality of war.', 'Lebanon, 1982. To keep a promise made to an old friend, Georges, an idealistic theater director, travels to Beirut for a project as utopian as it is risky: to stage the play Antigone on the front line, in order to steal a moment of peace from the raging civil war. The characters will be played by actors from different political and religious camps. Lost in a city and a conflict he knows nothing about, Georges is guided by Marwan. As fighting resumes, everything is soon called into question, and Georges, who falls in love with Imane, has to face up to the reality of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFaAQsmX1O3s9M1CPzkAcfnjN0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001141'),
  ('479010998538927887', 'The 5-Man Army', 1969, 'Adventure, Western, Action', 'Don Taylor, Enzo Barboni, Stefano Rolla', 'Dario Argento', 'Peter Graves, Bud Spencer, James Daly, Nino Castelnuovo, Tetsuro Tamba, Claudio Gora, Daniela Giordano, Annabella Andreoli', 'PG', 'At the behest of local revolutionaries, a mercenary enlists four specialists in various combat styles to help him rob a Mexican Army train carrying $500,000 in gold.', 'At the behest of local revolutionaries, a mercenary enlists four specialists in various combat styles to help him rob a Mexican Army train carrying $500,000 in gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NSCCCQn06UfkKap9rIXL5g7GPG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38670'),
  ('918501973762602529', 'The 5,000 Fingers of Dr. T.', 1953, 'Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Roy Rowland, Franz Planer, Morris Stoloff', 'Dr. Seuss, Allan Scott', 'Peter Lind Hayes, Mary Healy, Hans Conried, Tommy Rettig, Noel Cravat, Robert Heasley, Jack Heasley, George Chakiris', 'G', 'Young Bart Collins lives with his widowed mother Heloise. The major blight on Bart''s existence is the hated piano lessons he is forced to endure under the tutelage of the autocratic Dr. Terwilliker. Bart feels that his mother has fallen under Terwilliker''s sinister influence, and gripes to visiting plumber August Zabladowski, without much result. While grimly hammering away at his lessons, Bart dozes off and enters a fantastical musical dream.', 'Young Bart Collins lives with his widowed mother Heloise. The major blight on Bart''s existence is the hated piano lessons he is forced to endure under the tutelage of the autocratic Dr. Terwilliker. Bart feels that his mother has fallen under Terwilliker''s sinister influence, and gripes to visiting plumber August Zabladowski, without much result. While grimly hammering away at his lessons, Bart dozes off and enters a fantastical musical dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sAxThhLhsQSf4mjrIGHqfKlaAy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33743'),
  ('593434106781646725', 'The 50 Worst Movies Ever Made', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Brandon Christopher', 'Brandon Christopher', 'Carlos Larkin', null, 'There are some movies that are so bad they''re good. And there are some movies that are so bad- that they''re just bad...', 'There are some movies that are so bad they''re good. And there are some movies that are so bad- that they''re just bad...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82iP6WCOHgwgxakAFpk1gpkcJQU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93115'),
  ('227689254193545128', 'The 51st State', 2001, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Poon Hang-Sang, Ronny Yu, Philip Robinson', 'Stel Pavlou', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Robert Carlyle, Emily Mortimer, Meat Loaf, Rhys Ifans, Sean Pertwee, Ricky Tomlinson, Michael Starke', 'R', 'An American master chemist plans to score big on a once in a lifetime drug deal. All does not go as planned and he is soon entangled in a web of deceit.', 'An American master chemist plans to score big on a once in a lifetime drug deal. All does not go as planned and he is soon entangled in a web of deceit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYlrGirWrRCTU1PF6Svghn1EMAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1613'),
  ('434075672089601116', 'The 5th Wave', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'J Blakeson, Enrique Chediak, Julian Ashby', 'Susannah Grant, Jeff Pinkner, Akiva Goldsman', 'Chloë Grace Moretz, Nick Robinson, Ron Livingston, Maggie Siff, Alex Roe, Maria Bello, Maika Monroe, Zackary Arthur', 'PG-13', '16-year-old Cassie Sullivan tries to survive in a world devastated by the waves of an alien invasion that has already decimated the population and knocked mankind back to the Stone Age.', '16-year-old Cassie Sullivan tries to survive in a world devastated by the waves of an alien invasion that has already decimated the population and knocked mankind back to the Stone Age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja34BV577dtjWl2S5G1tB93IjYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299687'),
  ('441698519296083179', 'The 68th Annual Grammy Awards', 2026, null, 'Hamish Hamilton, Ellen Jaworski, Gloria Lamb, Kristen Merlino, Keyan Safyari', 'Trevor Noah, David Wild, Ben Winston, Dan Amira, Devin Delliquanti, Zach DiLanzo, Lauren Sarver Means, Randall Otis, Ashton Womack', 'Ray Angry, Jon Batiste, Justin Bieber, Bilal, Leon Bridges', 'TV-14', 'Trevor Noah hosts music''s biggest night live from Los Angeles, with unforgettable performances and honors.', 'Trevor Noah hosts music''s biggest night live from Los Angeles, with unforgettable performances and honors.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:the-68th-annual-grammy-awards'),
  ('775006865038883123', 'The 6th Day', 2000, 'Science Fiction, Action, Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Roger Spottiswoode, M. James Arnett, Ella Kutschera', 'Marianne Wibberley, Cormac Wibberley', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Michael Rapaport, Tony Goldwyn, Michael Rooker, Robert Duvall, Sarah Wynter, Wendy Crewson, Rodney Rowland', 'PG-13', 'A world of the very near future in which cattle, fish, and even the family pet can be cloned. But cloning humans is illegal - that is until family man Adam Gibson comes home from work one day to find a clone has replaced him. Taken from his family and plunged into a sinister world he doesn''t understand, Gibson must not only save himself from the assassins who must destroy him to protect their secret, but uncover who and what is behind the horrible things happening to him.', 'A world of the very near future in which cattle, fish, and even the family pet can be cloned. But cloning humans is illegal - that is until family man Adam Gibson comes home from work one day to find a clone has replaced him. Taken from his family and plunged into a sinister world he doesn''t understand, Gibson must not only save himself from the assassins who must destroy him to protect their secret, but uncover who and what is behind the horrible things happening to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rODFJOFiPk1UVCe4pmBza8T6feO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8452'),
