  ('943919885299637398', 'The 7 Grandmasters', 1977, 'Action', 'Joseph Kuo, James Wu Kuo-Ren, Chiang Nan', 'Yao Ching Kang, Joseph Kuo', 'Li Yi-Min, Jack Long Shi-Chia, Mark Lung, Corey Yuen, Nancy Yen Nan-See, Alan Chui Chung-San, Chin Yuet-Sang, Lee Yan-Wa', 'NR', 'An aged Kung Fu practitioner travels across China, challenging the best Grandmaster from each province to prove his mastery of martial arts. Meanwhile is a plot developing behind his back.', 'An aged Kung Fu practitioner travels across China, challenging the best Grandmaster from each province to prove his mastery of martial arts. Meanwhile is a plot developing behind his back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4eI3KflefXmpboYwEllTRmqiU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26569'),
  ('1095403060719101280', 'The 7th Dawn', 1964, 'Adventure, Drama, War', 'Lewis Gilbert, Freddie Young', 'Karl Tunberg', 'William Holden, Susannah York, Capucine, Tetsuro Tamba, Michael Goodliffe, Allan Cuthbertson, Sydney Tafler, Maurice Denham', null, 'Political and personal intrigues surround a group of characters in Malaya, after the close of the Second World War.', 'Political and personal intrigues surround a group of characters in Malaya, after the close of the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Avci2devSAEGa4PnFyNhE33Sq1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85763'),
  ('730823274993860456', 'The 7th Day', 2004, 'Drama', 'Carlos Saura, François Lartigue, Sergio Francisco', 'Ray Loriga', 'Juan Diego, José Luis Gómez, José Garcia, Victoria Abril, Yohana Cobo, Eulalia Ramón, Ramon Fontserè, Carlos Hipólito', null, 'Isabel Jimenez is a teenager witnessing a horrible feud between her own family and the Fuentes family, a feud involving broken hearts, property disputes and a mysterious fire that destroyed the Fuentes house. Isabel''s uncle is murdered by Jeronimo Fuentes, who later tries to stab her father. After Jeronimo dies in jail, Isabel must look outside of her family for the truth, learning from the village idiot that her father may have set fire to the Fuentes home.', 'Isabel Jimenez is a teenager witnessing a horrible feud between her own family and the Fuentes family, a feud involving broken hearts, property disputes and a mysterious fire that destroyed the Fuentes house. Isabel''s uncle is murdered by Jeronimo Fuentes, who later tries to stab her father. After Jeronimo dies in jail, Isabel must look outside of her family for the truth, learning from the village idiot that her father may have set fire to the Fuentes home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iXtMgvD9TXipIO1z30ysaMXW1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29008'),
  ('531551770564167741', 'The 7th Dwarf', 2014, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Adventure', 'Harald Siepermann, Boris Aljinovic', 'Bernd Eilert, Sven Unterwaldt Jr.', 'Otto Waalkes, Mirco Nontschew, Boris Aljinovic, Ralf Schmitz, Gustav Peter Wöhler, Martin Schneider, Norbert Heisterkamp, Nina Hagen', 'G', 'Seven clumsy dwarfs try to undo the spell they unwillingly unleashed and save the fairy tales world with the help of a tired dragon and a butterfly. The evil witch Dellamorta cursed princess Rose when she was a baby. Before she turns 18, Rose will get stung in the finger by a sharp object and she and the whole castle will fall into a hundred year long sleep unless her true love would kiss her. The night before her birthday she sends her bf Jack to the 7 dwarfs, who live behind the 7 mountains to hide until after Rose has turned 18. Unfortunately he gets lost and captured by Dellamorta''s dragon Burner. So at the party, Rose gets stung in the finger, and everyone falls into deep sleep. Everyone but the 7 dwarfs of course who will go on a journey to save Jack so he can save Rose.', 'Seven clumsy dwarfs try to undo the spell they unwillingly unleashed and save the fairy tales world with the help of a tired dragon and a butterfly. The evil witch Dellamorta cursed princess Rose when she was a baby. Before she turns 18, Rose will get stung in the finger by a sharp object and she and the whole castle will fall into a hundred year long sleep unless her true love would kiss her. The night before her birthday she sends her bf Jack to the 7 dwarfs, who live behind the 7 mountains to hide until after Rose has turned 18. Unfortunately he gets lost and captured by Dellamorta''s dragon Burner. So at the party, Rose gets stung in the finger, and everyone falls into deep sleep. Everyone but the 7 dwarfs of course who will go on a journey to save Jack so he can save Rose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLCAaFHgKUgogHR6OuTOwIPhN8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247788'),
  ('189119733889615279', 'The 7th Voyage of Sinbad', 1958, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Wilkie Cooper, Nathan Juran, Pedro de Juan', 'Ken Kolb', 'Kerwin Mathews, Kathryn Grant, Torin Thatcher, Richard Eyer, Alec Mango, Danny Green, Harold Kasket, Alfred Brown', 'G', 'When a princess is shrunken by an evil wizard, Sinbad must undertake a quest to an island of monsters to cure her and prevent a war.', 'When a princess is shrunken by an evil wizard, Sinbad must undertake a quest to an island of monsters to cure her and prevent a war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZKfMySjut6QxLNTyMkzrCBZyxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15515'),
  ('670452412116431503', 'The 8 Diagram Pole Fighter', 1984, 'Action, Drama', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Wong Kwok-Wai, Cho On-Sun', 'Ni Kuang, Lau Kar-Leung', 'Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Alexander Fu Sheng, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Lily Li, Phillip Ko Fai, King Lee King-Chu, Lam Hak-Ming, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei', null, 'The Yangs are betrayed by a government official conspiring with the Mongols. All of the Yang family males except the 5th and 6th brother are killed. Fu Sheng loses his mind after the death of his family, while the other brother takes refuge in a Buddhist temple.', 'The Yangs are betrayed by a government official conspiring with the Mongols. All of the Yang family males except the 5th and 6th brother are killed. Fu Sheng loses his mind after the death of his family, while the other brother takes refuge in a Buddhist temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lme6eIZ12ar3fsOodNCUuVul9cq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32520'),
  ('157278364771236484', 'The 8-Year Engagement', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Takahisa Zeze, Kōichi Saitō, Atsushi Unno', 'Yoshikazu Okada', 'Takeru Satoh, Tao Tsuchiya, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Tetta Sugimoto, Kazuki Kitamura, Kenta Hamano, Yuri Nakamura, Keisuke Horibe', null, 'Hisashi and Mai are a happy couple in their 20s who are engaged to be married. But three months before their wedding, Mai becomes seriously ill. Her heart stops momentarily, and she falls into a deep coma. Hisashi visits Mai at the hospital every day before work. With no idea if or when she will ever awake, Mai’s parents encourage Hisashi to find someone else, but he refuses to give up and continues to pray for her recovery. As if his prayers are answered, Mai begins to regain consciousness several years later, and even utters a few words. But tragically, she has suffered brain damage and has no memory of Hisashi.', 'Hisashi and Mai are a happy couple in their 20s who are engaged to be married. But three months before their wedding, Mai becomes seriously ill. Her heart stops momentarily, and she falls into a deep coma. Hisashi visits Mai at the hospital every day before work. With no idea if or when she will ever awake, Mai’s parents encourage Hisashi to find someone else, but he refuses to give up and continues to pray for her recovery. As if his prayers are answered, Mai begins to regain consciousness several years later, and even utters a few words. But tragically, she has suffered brain damage and has no memory of Hisashi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8U2bPJMeNYKvQ9RkttiZJ5Jl5D1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456063'),
  ('424507591416346302', 'The 8th Night', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Kim Seung-gyu, Choo Kyoung-yeob, Kim Tae-hyoung', 'Kim Tae-hyoung', 'Lee Sung-min, Nam Da-reum, Park Hae-joon, Kim Yoo-jung, Kim Dong-young, Lee Eol, Choi Jin-ho, Go Seo-hee', null, 'With prayer beads in one hand and an ax in the other, a monk hunts down a millennia-old spirit that''s possessing humans and unleashing hell on Earth.', 'With prayer beads in one hand and an ax in the other, a monk hunts down a millennia-old spirit that''s possessing humans and unleashing hell on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kscflbI5A6KVlMg2foAWnt8CJ5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604360'),
  ('546666988594750971', 'The 9th Circle', 2008, 'Horror', 'Damien Leone, Channing McKindra', 'Damien Leone', 'Mike Giannelli, Kayla Lian, Anna Maliere, Eric Diez, Marc Romano, Andrew Mahler, Steven Mancuso, Lori Anne Lovaglio', null, 'A woman is abducted by a sinister stranger on Halloween night for a fate worse than death.', 'A woman is abducted by a sinister stranger on Halloween night for a fate worse than death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/808g6yySXDJS1FIUsGeaShegzau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137578'),
  ('919250392830515672', 'The 9th Guest', 1934, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Roy William Neill, Benjamin H. Kline, Arthur S. Black Jr.', 'Owen Davis', 'Donald Cook, Genevieve Tobin, Hardie Albright, Edward Ellis, Edwin Maxwell, Vince Barnett, Helen Flint, Samuel S. Hinds', null, 'Eight people are invited by an unsigned telegram to a penthouse apartment, where they find themselves locked in and greeted by their unknown host''s voice via the radio, who explains that before the night is over each one will be die unless they manage to outwit the ninth guest, Death.', 'Eight people are invited by an unsigned telegram to a penthouse apartment, where they find themselves locked in and greeted by their unknown host''s voice via the radio, who explains that before the night is over each one will be die unless they manage to outwit the ninth guest, Death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8kkihcGPK6xdqpCUsQvaiVPhKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179254'),
  ('30476089875311153', 'The 9th Life of Louis Drax', 2016, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Stephen Maier, Alexandre Aja, Maxime Alexandre', 'Max Minghella', 'Jamie Dornan, Sarah Gadon, Aaron Paul, Molly Parker, Aiden Longworth, Oliver Platt, Barbara Hershey, Julian Wadham', 'R', 'A psychologist who begins working with a young boy who has suffered a near-fatal fall finds himself drawn into a mystery that tests the boundaries of fantasy and reality.', 'A psychologist who begins working with a young boy who has suffered a near-fatal fall finds himself drawn into a mystery that tests the boundaries of fantasy and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCM4BpOoCAjs6lKHDCm66kE2XR1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294795'),
  ('228508445666990021', 'The 9th Precinct', 2019, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Crime', 'Stanley Liu, Wang Ding-Lin', null, 'Roy Chiu, Chen-Ling Wen, Eugenie Liu, Peng Chia-chia, Blaire Chang, Heaven Hai, Tiger Wang, Mario Pu', null, 'An idealistic cop joins an underground police unit and battles ghoulish forces threatening the balance between the human and the supernatural realms.', 'An idealistic cop joins an underground police unit and battles ghoulish forces threatening the balance between the human and the supernatural realms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qGPy6ZwcIBx15UIzIjViyRIbVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615137'),
  ('538631778888816070', 'The A-Team', 2010, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Joe Carnahan, Laurel Bergman, Kirsten Franson', 'Skip Woods, Joe Carnahan, Brian Bloom', 'Liam Neeson, Bradley Cooper, Jessica Biel, Quinton ''Rampage'' Jackson, Sharlto Copley, Patrick Wilson, Gerald McRaney, Henry Czerny', 'PG-13', 'A man who loves when a plan comes together, Col. Hannibal Smith leads a close-knit team of elite operatives and Iraq War veterans. Framed for a crime they didn''t commit, Smith and his men, Capt. H.M. ‘Howling Mad’ Murdock , Sgt. Bosco ‘B.A.’ Baracus, and Lt. Templeton ‘Faceman’ Peck, break out and go rogue, using their special talents to clear their names and find the perpetrator. Hot on their trail is Capt. Charissa Sosa, who was once involved with a member of Smith''s team and has sworn to capture them, no matter what it takes.', 'A man who loves when a plan comes together, Col. Hannibal Smith leads a close-knit team of elite operatives and Iraq War veterans. Framed for a crime they didn''t commit, Smith and his men, Capt. H.M. ‘Howling Mad’ Murdock , Sgt. Bosco ‘B.A.’ Baracus, and Lt. Templeton ‘Faceman’ Peck, break out and go rogue, using their special talents to clear their names and find the perpetrator. Hot on their trail is Capt. Charissa Sosa, who was once involved with a member of Smith''s team and has sworn to capture them, no matter what it takes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkAWEx5g5tvRPjtDQyvIZ7LRxQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34544'),
  ('821788148388342704', 'The A-Tom-inable Snowman', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Abe Levitow', null, null, null, 'In the Alps, Tom gets knocked out chasing Jerry, and is revived, revitalized and intoxicated by a St. Bernard with a keg of brandy. After several such episodes, Tom escapes with Jerry to a tropical island, where he is hit with a coconut. Not to worry- the St. Bernard appears and renders his special brand of first aid.', 'In the Alps, Tom gets knocked out chasing Jerry, and is revived, revitalized and intoxicated by a St. Bernard with a keg of brandy. After several such episodes, Tom escapes with Jerry to a tropical island, where he is hit with a coconut. Not to worry- the St. Bernard appears and renders his special brand of first aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NNoVIHka5LzAzWZwUA3OkcPTY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363195'),
  ('859834868822181107', 'The Abandon', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'Jason Satterlund, Ray Huang', 'Dwain Worrell', 'Jonathan Rosenthal, Tamara Perry, Regis Terencio, Dan Kyle, Priscilla Avila', 'R', 'Injured U.S. soldier Miles Willis awakens to discover he is trapped in a mysterious cube armed only with his combat gear. As Miles begins to question his sanity, he finds a lifeline – a voice on the other end of his satellite phone who claims to be a prisoner in a similar space. As the walls close in, these two strangers must put their heads together if they are to outwit their captors and unlock this deadly puzzle.', 'Injured U.S. soldier Miles Willis awakens to discover he is trapped in a mysterious cube armed only with his combat gear. As Miles begins to question his sanity, he finds a lifeline – a voice on the other end of his satellite phone who claims to be a prisoner in a similar space. As the walls close in, these two strangers must put their heads together if they are to outwit their captors and unlock this deadly puzzle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjno0bsWumTvpjQt4D910nUTG3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933088'),
  ('624264555599096470', 'The Abandoned', 1945, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emilio Fernández, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Emilio Fernández, Mauricio Magdaleno', 'Dolores del Río, Pedro Armendáriz, Víctor Junco, Paco Fuentes, Arturo Soto Rangel, Charles Rooner, Lupe Inclán, Fanny Schiller', null, 'A young woman, abandoned by her womanizing fiancé, is forced to provide for the upbringing of her son and combat the difficulties of being an unmarried mother during the strife of early 20-century Mexico.', 'A young woman, abandoned by her womanizing fiancé, is forced to provide for the upbringing of her son and combat the difficulties of being an unmarried mother during the strife of early 20-century Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UxQs2f8kNDiLo8UF4FXRMJSUsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123703'),
  ('963480657064294821', 'The Abandoned', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Nacho Cerdà, Xavi Giménez, Guillermo Escribano', 'Richard Stanley, Karim Hussain, Nacho Cerdà', 'Anastasia Hille, Karel Roden, Valentin Ganev, Paraskeva Djukelova, Carlos Reig-Plaza, Marta Yaneva, Jasmina Marinova, Svetlana Smoleva', 'R', 'Marie, a film producer, returns to her native Russia to find her birth parents. She quickly learns they are dead, and she has inherited their long-empty farmhouse. At the farm, she meets Nicolai, who claims to be her twin brother. Events take a terrifying turn when the two spot a pair of ghastly doppelgangers and the house itself seems to propel them toward a fate they should have met 40 years earlier.', 'Marie, a film producer, returns to her native Russia to find her birth parents. She quickly learns they are dead, and she has inherited their long-empty farmhouse. At the farm, she meets Nicolai, who claims to be her twin brother. Events take a terrifying turn when the two spot a pair of ghastly doppelgangers and the house itself seems to propel them toward a fate they should have met 40 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32DhJlTTmLeaPNQeh2oHuDNRmqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10790'),
  ('1084674919159280046', 'The Abandoned', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Eytan Rockaway, Zachary Galler', 'Ido Fluk', 'Jason Patric, Louisa Krause, Mark Margolis, Carlos Velazquez, Ezra Knight', null, 'A troubled young woman who, in a last-ditch effort at getting her life together, takes a job working nights as a security guard at an abandoned luxury apartment building. Stuck with a brusque rent-a-cop as her partner, she tries to not let her mind play tricks on her while she patrols the empty halls. But as the night progresses strange things begin to happen - and she realizes it may not all be in her head.', 'A troubled young woman who, in a last-ditch effort at getting her life together, takes a job working nights as a security guard at an abandoned luxury apartment building. Stuck with a brusque rent-a-cop as her partner, she tries to not let her mind play tricks on her while she patrols the empty halls. But as the night progresses strange things begin to happen - and she realizes it may not all be in her head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TNmBgcta46j0z7KmKtOMO84pfE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345875'),
  ('167144194643429773', 'The Abandoned', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Ying-Ting Tseng, Stanley Liu, Liu Chen-wei', 'Pin-Jun Lin, Ying-Ting Tseng, Yi-Chien Yang', 'Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Ethan Juan, Yu An-shun, Sajee Apiwong, Chloe Xiang, Chen Wei-min, Simon Hsueh, Brando Huang', null, 'When a mysterious corpse is found in a river, a distressed police officer delves into a string of grisly murders as danger quickly approaches.', 'When a mysterious corpse is found in a river, a distressed police officer delves into a string of grisly murders as danger quickly approaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsECYZeM4Vqm27GJoFC4Kzzy5jH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006763'),
  ('135280046810244750', 'The ABC of Love and Sex: Australia Style', 1978, 'Documentary', 'John D. Lamond, Hal Roth', 'John D. Lamond, Alan Finney', 'Sandy Gore, Michael Cole, Maj-Brith Bergström-Walan, Ian Broadbent, Leon Cosak, John-Michael Howson, Nicholas Kislinsky, Katie Morgan', null, 'A tongue-in-cheek sex education documentary covering a different subject for each letter of the alphabet, e.g. A is for Anatomy, B is for Babies, etc.', 'A tongue-in-cheek sex education documentary covering a different subject for each letter of the alphabet, e.g. A is for Anatomy, B is for Babies, etc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiV3xKwDHd2XC3kiBZqGAjHladT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83878'),
  ('498612297093296268', 'The ABC''s of Sex Education for Trainable Persons', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Max Brecher', null, 'William Block, Beverly Camp, Rick Fullerton, Richard Dix', null, 'This training film is meant for professionals who work with the mentally impaired, and is meant to teach them how to help their patients deal with sexual issues.', 'This training film is meant for professionals who work with the mentally impaired, and is meant to teach them how to help their patients deal with sexual issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfRbjeTWZQfGvA3xhjNVRJmlJJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160417'),
  ('439625737065886634', 'The ABCs of Book Banning', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Filippo Piscopo, Sheila Nevins, Trish Adlesic', null, 'Grace Linn, Maia Kobab, Jonathan Capehart, Nikki Giovanni, Amanda Gorman, Lil Miss Hot Mess, Sarah J. Maas', null, 'In recent years, more than 2,500 books have been removed from school districts around the US, labeled as banned, restricted, or challenged, and made unavailable to millions of students. By no accident, the themes targeted are the usual scapegoats of the American Right—LGBTQ+ issues, Black History, and women’s empowerment—impeding the power of future generations to develop their own thoughts and opinions on critical social issues. By weaving together a lyrical montage of young readers and authors, THE ABCs OF BOOK BANNING reveals the voices of the impacted parties, and inspires hope for the future through the profound insights of inquisitive youthful minds.', 'In recent years, more than 2,500 books have been removed from school districts around the US, labeled as banned, restricted, or challenged, and made unavailable to millions of students. By no accident, the themes targeted are the usual scapegoats of the American Right—LGBTQ+ issues, Black History, and women’s empowerment—impeding the power of future generations to develop their own thoughts and opinions on critical social issues. By weaving together a lyrical montage of young readers and authors, THE ABCs OF BOOK BANNING reveals the voices of the impacted parties, and inspires hope for the future through the profound insights of inquisitive youthful minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcgYS6gv9dA0jBaQQft2eLjPAh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186227'),
  ('525452236218507646', 'The ABCs of Death', 2013, 'Horror', 'Nicolás Ibieta, Cristóbal Braun Mesples, Hélène Cattet', 'Yudai Yamaguchi, Kaare Andrews, Yoshihiro Nishimura', 'Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Erik Audé, Iván González, Kyra Zagorsky, Peter Pedrero, Dallas Malloy, Lee Hardcastle, Lucy Clements', 'NR', 'An ambitious anthology film featuring segments directed by over two dozen of the world''s leading talents in contemporary genre film. Inspired by children''s educational ABC books, the film comprises 26 individual chapters, each helmed by a different director assigned a letter of the alphabet. The directors were then given free reign in choosing a word to create a story involving death.', 'An ambitious anthology film featuring segments directed by over two dozen of the world''s leading talents in contemporary genre film. Inspired by children''s educational ABC books, the film comprises 26 individual chapters, each helmed by a different director assigned a letter of the alphabet. The directors were then given free reign in choosing a word to create a story involving death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3TcTGCgvvvhAiW9pkyWNz9CoNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87436'),
  ('299443469463874759', 'The ABCs of Love', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Noémie Saglio', 'Alice Girard, Marinette Lévy, Mathias Gavarry', 'Vincent Dedienne, Camélia Jordana, Samir Guesmi, Alix Poisson, Anne Charrier, Oscar Pauleau, Héléna Soubeyrand, Maël Rouin Berrandou', null, 'Thirty-year old adulteen Vincent babysits animals and children for a living, and his latest job is 9-year old Bart, who just moved into the building with his overworked and single mom. At his new school, Bart is anxious to develop a cool reputation, so when everyone assumes that laid back, eccentric Vincent is his dad, he begs him to play along, especially when his “dad’s” fun, immature behavior delights all the kids in his class! Initially reluctant, Vincent changes his mind after falling in love with his “son’s” attractive young teacher. And in order to spend as much time with her as possible, he does his best to make sense of the mysterious codes and expectations of his weird new tribe: the Parent-Teacher Association. But Vincent soon faces a bigger issue: How to backtrack on the huge “tiny little lie” he’s gotten himself into.', 'Thirty-year old adulteen Vincent babysits animals and children for a living, and his latest job is 9-year old Bart, who just moved into the building with his overworked and single mom. At his new school, Bart is anxious to develop a cool reputation, so when everyone assumes that laid back, eccentric Vincent is his dad, he begs him to play along, especially when his “dad’s” fun, immature behavior delights all the kids in his class! Initially reluctant, Vincent changes his mind after falling in love with his “son’s” attractive young teacher. And in order to spend as much time with her as possible, he does his best to make sense of the mysterious codes and expectations of his weird new tribe: the Parent-Teacher Association. But Vincent soon faces a bigger issue: How to backtrack on the huge “tiny little lie” he’s gotten himself into.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rD0IPhj6429enPbXWpRBZ2K8537.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:738231'),
  ('134781121507342695', 'The Abdication', 1974, 'Drama, History', 'Anthony Harvey, David Munro, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Ruth Wolff', 'Peter Finch, Liv Ullmann, Cyril Cusack, Paul Rogers, Graham Crowden, Michael Dunn, Kathleen Byron, Lewis Fiander', 'PG', 'Queen Christina of Sweden abdicates and travels to Rome to embrace the Catholic church.', 'Queen Christina of Sweden abdicates and travels to Rome to embrace the Catholic church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vU221xx8arU80AeLlnneblWq2fV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15478'),
  ('1000962916155401935', 'The Abduction Club', 2002, 'Comedy, History', 'Howard Atherton, Stefan Schwartz, MJ Bassett', 'Bill Britten, Richard Crawford', 'Sophia Myles, Matthew Rhys, Daniel Lapaine, Alice Evans, Liam Cunningham, Edward Woodward, Patrick Malahide, Tom Murphy', null, 'A group of Irish noblemen kidnap girls in order to marry into their fortune and avoid becoming priests or soldiers.', 'A group of Irish noblemen kidnap girls in order to marry into their fortune and avoid becoming priests or soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjsQB6FT4ewznTmO4A5G8Rx1NUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21893'),
  ('273215991000195832', 'The Abduction of the Slave Women', 1907, 'Adventure, Crime', 'Johann Schwarzer', null, null, null, 'Four Arab men in white burnouses, two women in grey, and one female cook in striped burnous, are sitting in front of a cave in a forest path.', 'Four Arab men in white burnouses, two women in grey, and one female cook in striped burnous, are sitting in front of a cave in a forest path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66CCQ9gV2HYz4MnbSetsFbuh3Fb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196480'),
  ('745198192682050339', 'The Abductors', 1972, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'R. Kent Evans, Don Schain, David Ross', 'Don Schain', 'Cheri Caffaro, Richard Smedley, Patrick Wright, Laurie Rose, William Grannel, Anthony Barone, Gerie Bronson, Jeramie Rain', 'R', 'Someone is stealing cheerleaders and other pretty girls and selling them to the highest bidder. Female super sexy spy Ginger is soon employed to investigate the disappearances. She does so by going undercover with a fellow agent and doing whatever is necessary to put an end to the operation and take down the leaders.', 'Someone is stealing cheerleaders and other pretty girls and selling them to the highest bidder. Female super sexy spy Ginger is soon employed to investigate the disappearances. She does so by going undercover with a fellow agent and doing whatever is necessary to put an end to the operation and take down the leaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bANTsre99PCHZ8IwGDmWODv2MHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18589'),
  ('463981226361735397', 'The Abnormal Beauty Company', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Aref Mahabadi, Devin Karringten', 'Adrienne Reid', 'Brandon Truaxe', null, 'For the first time, Brandon Truaxe''s inner circle breaks their silence in The Abnormal Beauty Company-an unflinching portrait of The Ordinary''s story, told through raw interviews and explosive archival footage.', 'For the first time, Brandon Truaxe''s inner circle breaks their silence in The Abnormal Beauty Company-an unflinching portrait of The Ordinary''s story, told through raw interviews and explosive archival footage.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Ff%2Fgracenote%2Ffce40e83cc7491d641f7b5f24f6b32d0.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-abnormal-beauty-company'),
  ('882308506022464174', 'The Abominable Dr. Phibes', 1971, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Robert Fuest, Norman Warwick, Chris Burke', 'William Goldstein, James Whiton', 'Vincent Price, Joseph Cotten, Hugh Griffith, Terry-Thomas, Virginia North, Peter Jeffrey, Derek Godfrey, Norman Jones', 'PG', 'After a team of surgeons botches his beloved wife''s operation, the distraught Dr. Phibes unleashes a score of Old-Testament atrocities on his enemies.', 'After a team of surgeons botches his beloved wife''s operation, the distraught Dr. Phibes unleashes a score of Old-Testament atrocities on his enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4853HMKlJl1RozE6OyHBKQemCE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17965'),
