  ('925548266103699052', 'The Abrafaxe – Under the Black Flag', 2001, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Gerhard Hahn, Anthony Power', 'Richard Everett, Thomas Platt, Julius Grützke', 'Ilona Schulz, David Turba, Kim Hasper, Nena, Helmut Krauss, Santiago Ziesmer, Wilfried Herbst, Ulrich Voß', null, 'The Pirates Of Tortuga :Under The Black Flag Set sail with three young boys on an adventure where time travel, gold treasure and battling villainous pirates are all in a day’s work! On a trip to the city museum, three young boys, Alex, Max and Califax discover a golden bowl — part of a legendary Aztec treasure.', 'The Pirates Of Tortuga :Under The Black Flag Set sail with three young boys on an adventure where time travel, gold treasure and battling villainous pirates are all in a day’s work! On a trip to the city museum, three young boys, Alex, Max and Califax discover a golden bowl — part of a legendary Aztec treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xEhFvpmhNrYmiOunUehUTAg656.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50179'),
