  ('877084013023718975', 'The Absent One', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Mikkel Nørgaard, Eric Kress, Peter Hingebjerg', 'Jussi Adler-Olsen', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Fares Fares, Pilou Asbæk, David Dencik, Danica Ćurčić, Sarah-Sofie Boussnina, Johanne Louise Schmidt, Marco Ilsø', 'NR', 'Denmark, 2014. A former police officer asks Carl Mørck, head of Department Q, to find out who brutally killed his young twins in 1994. Although a local inhabitant confessed and was convicted of murder, Carl and his partner Assad soon realize that there is something in the case resolution that is terribly wrong.', 'Denmark, 2014. A former police officer asks Carl Mørck, head of Department Q, to find out who brutally killed his young twins in 1994. Although a local inhabitant confessed and was convicted of murder, Carl and his partner Assad soon realize that there is something in the case resolution that is terribly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnXZXx5rDHfymhB7jCDdBjWgm2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254201'),
  ('523218590788341947', 'The Absent-Minded Professor', 1961, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Robert Stevenson, Edward Colman, Robert G. Shannon', 'Bill Walsh', 'Fred MacMurray, Nancy Olson, Keenan Wynn, Tommy Kirk, Leon Ames, Elliott Reid, Edward Andrews, David Lewis', 'G', 'Bumbling professor Ned Brainard accidentally invents flying rubber, or "Flubber", an incredible material that gains energy every time it strikes a hard surface. It allows for the invention of shoes that can allow jumps of amazing heights and enables a modified Model-T to fly. Unfortunately, no one is interested in the material except for Alonzo Hawk, a corrupt businessman who wants to steal the material for himself.', 'Bumbling professor Ned Brainard accidentally invents flying rubber, or "Flubber", an incredible material that gains energy every time it strikes a hard surface. It allows for the invention of shoes that can allow jumps of amazing heights and enables a modified Model-T to fly. Unfortunately, no one is interested in the material except for Alonzo Hawk, a corrupt businessman who wants to steal the material for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCnuDDqoyaBdeeItQ4BjKtYpzF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17984'),
  ('1073851616770034476', 'The Absent-Minded Waiter', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Carl Gottlieb', 'Steve Martin', 'Steve Martin, Teri Garr, Buck Henry, Naomi Stevens, Ivor Barry, Peter Elbling, Kurt Taylor, Beans Morocco', 'NR', 'Bernie Cates requests the services of the most absent-minded waiter he''s ever seen, who pours water before setting the glasses, endlessly repeats questions, brings wrong orders, and ruins everything- but the bill.', 'Bernie Cates requests the services of the most absent-minded waiter he''s ever seen, who pours water before setting the glasses, endlessly repeats questions, brings wrong orders, and ruins everything- but the bill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIlqAFElbtHskurKhvB4pJKSvn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21102'),
  ('716365810922729967', 'The Abyss', 1988, 'Drama', 'André Delvaux', 'André Delvaux', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Sami Frey, Anna Karina, Philippe Léotard, Jacques Lippe, Jean Bouise, Marie-France Pisier, Mathieu Carrière', null, 'The Inquisition is in full swing in 16th century Flanders. Wanted for his dissident writings, the alchemist doctor Zeno has been wandering Europe under an assumed name for twenty years. But he remains a non-conformist. He returns to his native Bruges, where he thinks he has been forgotten. In this silent labyrinth where the faces of the past resurface, he rediscovers his identity and thus signs his death warrant.', 'The Inquisition is in full swing in 16th century Flanders. Wanted for his dissident writings, the alchemist doctor Zeno has been wandering Europe under an assumed name for twenty years. But he remains a non-conformist. He returns to his native Bruges, where he thinks he has been forgotten. In this silent labyrinth where the faces of the past resurface, he rediscovers his identity and thus signs his death warrant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/im3Z9FInqKsZaMk5fYkW95IrD7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64386'),
  ('268295756776156401', 'The Abyss', 1989, 'Adventure, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'James Cameron, Mikael Salomon, Dan Webster', 'James Cameron', 'Ed Harris, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Michael Biehn, Leo Burmester, Todd Graff, John Bedford Lloyd, Kimberly Scott, Chris Elliott', 'PG-13', 'A civilian oil rig crew is recruited to conduct a search and rescue effort when a nuclear submarine mysteriously sinks. One diver soon finds himself on a spectacular odyssey 25,000 feet below the ocean''s surface where he confronts a mysterious force that has the power to change the world or destroy it.', 'A civilian oil rig crew is recruited to conduct a search and rescue effort when a nuclear submarine mysteriously sinks. One diver soon finds himself on a spectacular odyssey 25,000 feet below the ocean''s surface where he confronts a mysterious force that has the power to change the world or destroy it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dCit3XAtv9KWCJvRKdPkJ0FAkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2756'),
  ('987029444700163707', 'The Abyss', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Anssi Leino, Richard Holm', 'Richard Holm, Robin Sherlock Holm, Nicola Sinclair', 'Tuva Novotny, Peter Franzén, Kardo Razzazi, Felicia Truedsson, Angela Kovács, Tintin Poggats Sarri, Edvin Ryding, Åsa Simma', 'R', 'As the Swedish town of Kiruna sinks, Frigga finds herself torn between her family and her job as security chief at the world''s largest underground mine.', 'As the Swedish town of Kiruna sinks, Frigga finds herself torn between her family and her job as security chief at the world''s largest underground mine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ta1B8QQ3pBRA0TG8wH0CfgG6vlp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053544'),
  ('995691491798100462', 'The Academy of Magic', 2020, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', null, null, 'Laura Megan Stahl, Michael Johnston, Ben Diskin, Michael Orenstein, Grant George, Jamieson Price, Philece Sampler', 'NR', 'Aura is gifted with magical abilities; she and her friends have many exciting adventures at the academy, but soon Aura learns that the school hatches many dark secrets that she must uncover. Will she be able to unveil the truth?', 'Aura is gifted with magical abilities; she and her friends have many exciting adventures at the academy, but soon Aura learns that the school hatches many dark secrets that she must uncover. Will she be able to unveil the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDM55o8QVZLCKQ9WGejXrdeOJzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:708352'),
  ('563307364870054853', 'The Academy of Muses', 2015, 'Drama, Documentary', 'José Luis Guerín', 'José Luis Guerín', 'Raffaele Pinto, Rosa Delor, Mireia Iniesta, Emanuela Forgetta, Patricia Gil, Carolina Llacher', null, 'On returning from class, a teacher is questioned by his wife, who distrusts his pedagogic project: an “Academy of the Muses” inspired by classical references, which is supposed to contribute to regenerating the world through poetry. The controversial project triggers a series of situations dominated by words and desire.', 'On returning from class, a teacher is questioned by his wife, who distrusts his pedagogic project: an “Academy of the Muses” inspired by classical references, which is supposed to contribute to regenerating the world through poetry. The controversial project triggers a series of situations dominated by words and desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQ7I22QomRZ3fb6UPTGDtMiskFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353793'),
  ('979181084044736206', 'The Accidental Detective', 2015, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Kim Joung-hoon, Kim Sung-kwan', 'Kim Joung-hoon, Lee Jung-ho', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Sung Dong-il, Lee Seung-joon, Park Hae-joon, Seo Young-hee, Yoon Kyung-ho, Jo Bok-rae, Lee Hae-yeong', null, 'A cold-case enthusiast blogger and a washed-up veteran detective team up for a joint investigation to rescue their innocent friend who is framed for murder.', 'A cold-case enthusiast blogger and a washed-up veteran detective team up for a joint investigation to rescue their innocent friend who is framed for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnKEUwGxe5vM4XJVElk6wBkX3PC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359460'),
