  ('671274196633499211', 'The Actress, the Dollars and the Transylvanians', 1978, 'Action, Western', 'Mircea Veroiu', 'Titus Popovici', 'Ilarion Ciobanu, Ovidiu Iuliu Moldovan, Mircea Diaconu, Rodica Tapalagă, Mircea Albulescu, Tania Filip, Alöd Kiss, Traian Costea', null, 'The adventures of the three Brad brothers continues when Traian falls in love with Anabelle, a singer. He wants to marry her, not knowing that she is helping someone to rob a bank.', 'The adventures of the three Brad brothers continues when Traian falls in love with Anabelle, a singer. He wants to marry her, not knowing that she is helping someone to rob a bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zPH7Ce4DxTPRguBGsFVMruREcE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144089'),
  ('885240477711965448', 'The Actresses', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'E J-yong, Choi Chul-su, Hong Kyung-pyo', 'Youn Yuh-jung, Choi Ji-woo, Kim Ok-bin', 'Youn Yuh-jung, Lee Mi-sook, Ko Hyun-jung, Choi Ji-woo, Kim Min-hee, Kim Ok-bin, Kim Yong-ho, Oh Je-hyeong', null, 'When six famous Korean actresses gather for a Vogue fashion photo shoot, egos collide in funny and touching ways in this ingenious mockumentary, where all actresses involved play (not so) fictional versions of themselves.', 'When six famous Korean actresses gather for a Vogue fashion photo shoot, egos collide in funny and touching ways in this ingenious mockumentary, where all actresses involved play (not so) fictional versions of themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqy3MKbVR2l4spC2EYXVb40BkRZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57265'),
  ('621350819965217349', 'The Adam Project', 2022, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Tobias A. Schliessler, Nick Dudar, Andrew Lee McConnell', 'Jonathan Tropper', 'Ryan Reynolds, Walker Scobell, Mark Ruffalo, Jennifer Garner, Zoe Saldaña, Catherine Keener, Alex Mallari Jr., Braxton Bjerken', 'PG-13', 'After accidentally crash-landing in 2022, time-traveling fighter pilot Adam Reed teams up with his 12-year-old self on a mission to save the future.', 'After accidentally crash-landing in 2022, time-traveling fighter pilot Adam Reed teams up with his 12-year-old self on a mission to save the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFjboE0aFZNbVOF05fzrka9Fqyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696806'),
  ('869507713164251719', 'The Addams Family', 1991, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Barry Sonnenfeld, Owen Roizman, David Rubin', 'Caroline Thompson, Larry Wilson', 'Raúl Juliá, Anjelica Huston, Christopher Lloyd, Dan Hedaya, Elizabeth Wilson, Judith Malina, Carel Struycken, Dana Ivey', 'PG-13', 'When a man claiming to be long-lost Uncle Fester reappears after 25 years lost, the family plans a celebration to wake the dead. But the kids barely have time to warm up the electric chair before Morticia begins to suspect Fester is fraud when he can''t recall any of the details of Fester''s life.', 'When a man claiming to be long-lost Uncle Fester reappears after 25 years lost, the family plans a celebration to wake the dead. But the kids barely have time to warm up the electric chair before Morticia begins to suspect Fester is fraud when he can''t recall any of the details of Fester''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFf8anju5f2epI0my8RdwwIXFIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2907'),
  ('1137496788181319350', 'The Addams Family', 2019, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Conrad Vernon, Greg Tiernan, Emma Marie DuPell', 'Matt Lieberman, Pamela Pettler', 'Oscar Isaac, Charlize Theron, Chloë Grace Moretz, Finn Wolfhard, Nick Kroll, Snoop Dogg, Bette Midler, Allison Janney', 'PG', 'The Addams family''s lives begin to unravel when they face-off against a treacherous, greedy crafty reality-TV host while also preparing for their extended family to arrive for a major celebration.', 'The Addams family''s lives begin to unravel when they face-off against a treacherous, greedy crafty reality-TV host while also preparing for their extended family to arrive for a major celebration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1epO0eO8DWu8Vo8tPfvVlzW48T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481084'),
  ('509527808175617438', 'The Addams Family 2', 2021, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Conrad Vernon, Greg Tiernan', 'Susanna Fogel, Ben Queen, Dan Hernandez', 'Oscar Isaac, Charlize Theron, Chloë Grace Moretz, Javon Walton, Nick Kroll, Snoop Dogg, Bette Midler, Bill Hader', 'PG', 'The Addams get tangled up in more wacky adventures and find themselves involved in hilarious run-ins with all sorts of unsuspecting characters.', 'The Addams get tangled up in more wacky adventures and find themselves involved in hilarious run-ins with all sorts of unsuspecting characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld7YB9vBRp1GM1DT3KmFWSmtBPB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639721'),
  ('212002124840627445', 'The Adderall Diaries', 2016, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Pamela Romanowsky, Bruce Thierry Cheung', 'Pamela Romanowsky', 'James Franco, Amber Heard, Ed Harris, Christian Slater, Wilmer Valderrama, Jim Parrack, Cynthia Nixon, Michael Cristofer', 'R', 'Writer and Adderall enthusiast Stephen Elliott reaches a low point when his estranged father resurfaces, claiming that Stephen has fabricated much of the dark childhood that that fuels his writing. Adrift in the precarious gray area of memory, Stephen is led by three sources of inspiration: a new romance, the best friend who shares his history, and a murder trial that reminds him more than a little of his own story. Based on the memoir of the same name.', 'Writer and Adderall enthusiast Stephen Elliott reaches a low point when his estranged father resurfaces, claiming that Stephen has fabricated much of the dark childhood that that fuels his writing. Adrift in the precarious gray area of memory, Stephen is led by three sources of inspiration: a new romance, the best friend who shares his history, and a murder trial that reminds him more than a little of his own story. Based on the memoir of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tkGOlNtKyqQO3esZQRlnkSTANY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274504'),
  ('174174874722188492', 'The Addiction', 1995, 'Drama, Horror', 'Abel Ferrara, Ken Kelsch', 'Nicholas St. John', 'Lili Taylor, Christopher Walken, Annabella Sciorra, Edie Falco, Paul Calderon, Fredro Starr, Kathryn Erbe, Michael Imperioli', 'NR', 'A vampiric doctoral student tries to follow the philosophy of a nocturnal comrade and control her thirst for blood.', 'A vampiric doctoral student tries to follow the philosophy of a nocturnal comrade and control her thirst for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Yy8H2tKQ16mffLFRfxcBHKBdyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34996'),
  ('1015849982975429741', 'The Adjuster', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy, David Webb', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Elias Koteas, Arsinée Khanjian, Maury Chaykin, Gabrielle Rose, Jennifer Dale, David Hemblen, Rose Sarkisyan, Armen Kokorian', 'R', 'An uptight insurance man and his film-censor wife become a kinky couple''s landlords.', 'An uptight insurance man and his film-censor wife become a kinky couple''s landlords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwf8eDggGiaUsdgwxyFnLIWLJBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41796'),
  ('443276823881462491', 'The Adjustment Bureau', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Romance', 'George Nolfi, G.A. Aguilar, Justin Ritson', 'George Nolfi', 'Matt Damon, Emily Blunt, John Slattery, Anthony Mackie, Michael Kelly, Terence Stamp, Shane McRae, Lisa Thoreson', 'PG-13', 'A man glimpses the future Fate has planned for him – and chooses to fight for his own destiny. Battling the powerful Adjustment Bureau across, under and through the streets of New York, he risks his destined greatness to be with the only woman he''s ever loved.', 'A man glimpses the future Fate has planned for him – and chooses to fight for his own destiny. Battling the powerful Adjustment Bureau across, under and through the streets of New York, he risks his destined greatness to be with the only woman he''s ever loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZzeR8iz1nEFLp94OBnbakLZawo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38050'),
  ('582897799143841442', 'The Admirable Crichton', 1957, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Lewis Gilbert, Wilkie Cooper', 'Lewis Gilbert', 'Kenneth More, Diane Cilento, Cecil Parker, Sally Ann Howes, Martita Hunt, Jack Watling, Peter Graves, Gerald Harper', 'NR', 'Lord Loam has modern ideas about his household, he believes in treating his servants as his equals - at least sometimes. His butler, Crichton, still believes that members of the serving class should know their place and be happy there. But when the Loam family are shipwrecked on a desert island with the self-reliant Crichton and lady''s maid Tweeny, the class system is put to the test.', 'Lord Loam has modern ideas about his household, he believes in treating his servants as his equals - at least sometimes. His butler, Crichton, still believes that members of the serving class should know their place and be happy there. But when the Loam family are shipwrecked on a desert island with the self-reliant Crichton and lady''s maid Tweeny, the class system is put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ux4nDT0IjJRhlj5Bw9XEirC2bZc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64984'),
  ('843701050746794376', 'The Admiral: Roaring Currents', 2014, 'War, Action, Drama, History', 'Kim Han-min, Kim Tae-sung, Park Yoon-seo', 'Kim Han-min, Jeon Cheol-hong', 'Choi Min-sik, Ryu Seung-ryong, Cho Jin-woong, Jin Goo, Lee Jung-hyun, Kim Myung-gon, Kwon Yul, No Min-woo', null, 'Admiral Yi Sun-sin faces a tough challenge when he is forced to defend his nation with just 13 battleships against 300 Japanese enemy ships in the Battle of Myeongryang.', 'Admiral Yi Sun-sin faces a tough challenge when he is forced to defend his nation with just 13 battleships against 300 Japanese enemy ships in the Battle of Myeongryang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xx701fnV2e4BlQGwgISLYUG0DsG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282631'),
  ('894840403104672923', 'The Adolescent', 1979, 'Drama', 'Rémy Duchemin, John Lvoff, Jean Léon', 'Henriette Jelinek, Jeanne Moreau', 'Simone Signoret, Francis Huster, Laetitia Chauveau, Edith Clever, Jacques Weber, Jean-François Balmer, Hugues Quester, Roger Blin', null, 'In the summer of 1939, 13-year-old Marie goes with her parents to visit her grandparents in a small town near Avignon. Marie discovers her femininity and falls for a young Jewish doctor, but he prefers Eva, Marie''s mother.', 'In the summer of 1939, 13-year-old Marie goes with her parents to visit her grandparents in a small town near Avignon. Marie discovers her femininity and falls for a young Jewish doctor, but he prefers Eva, Marie''s mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7yCEzF9BCF82lbp42X5ZLjIieo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226674'),
  ('794941803070156694', 'The Adopted', 2011, 'Drama', 'Mélanie Laurent, Arnaud Potier', 'Mélanie Laurent, Morgan Perez, Chris Deslandes', 'Mélanie Laurent, Denis Ménochet, Marie Denarnaud, Clémentine Célarié, Audrey Lamy, Theodore Maquet-Foucher, Morgan Perez, Nicolas Medad', null, 'Lisa and Marine live a life of relative companionship together, where the only man permitted into the equation is Lisa’s young son, Leo. However, their simple existence is thrown into disarray when Marie meets and falls in love with Alex, a customer at her bookshop. Lisa is left feeling excluded, and tension develop. But soon an unexpected accident forces all of those involved to reassess the situation and adopt a different position in each other’s lives.', 'Lisa and Marine live a life of relative companionship together, where the only man permitted into the equation is Lisa’s young son, Leo. However, their simple existence is thrown into disarray when Marie meets and falls in love with Alex, a customer at her bookshop. Lisa is left feeling excluded, and tension develop. But soon an unexpected accident forces all of those involved to reassess the situation and adopt a different position in each other’s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4M20reNbCJCnaNSLCKMSDBuc7uX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76532'),
  ('875467492163923829', 'The Adopted Son', 1999, 'Drama', 'Aktan Arym Kubat, Khasan Kydyraliyev', 'Marat Sarulu, Aktan Arym Kubat, Avtandil Adikulov', 'Mirlan Abdykalykov, Adir Abilkassimov, Mirlan Cinkozoev, Bakit Dzhylkychiev, Albina Imasheva, Talai Mederov', null, 'In a remote Kyrgyz village, Beshkempir, an infant foundling, is taken in by five older women and later adopted by a couple unable to bear children of their own. Fast forward to his early teenage years, a pubescent Beshkempir is faced with all the problems of crushing on girls and courtship, reconciling with friends and dealing with death in the family. Above all he questions his place in the world as an adoptee.', 'In a remote Kyrgyz village, Beshkempir, an infant foundling, is taken in by five older women and later adopted by a couple unable to bear children of their own. Fast forward to his early teenage years, a pubescent Beshkempir is faced with all the problems of crushing on girls and courtship, reconciling with friends and dealing with death in the family. Above all he questions his place in the world as an adoptee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNRYBK6L2Hm3itKaOnANKTqahdW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84023'),
  ('559425136260270607', 'The Adult Version of Jekyll & Hide', 1972, 'Horror', 'Lee Raymond', 'Robert Birch', 'Laurie Rose, Rene Bond, Jane Tsentas, Linda York, John Barnum, Norman Fields', null, 'A crazed doctor, who has already murdered a man, finds Dr. Jekyll''s diary and mixes up Jekyll''s formula. He mixes up a batch of the potion, turns into the Jekyll monster and begins to stalk, rape and murder women.', 'A crazed doctor, who has already murdered a man, finds Dr. Jekyll''s diary and mixes up Jekyll''s formula. He mixes up a batch of the potion, turns into the Jekyll monster and begins to stalk, rape and murder women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOTIix6jiHCjIVSTUfQHtp146vw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92776'),
  ('195956715086100467', 'The Adulteen', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Tristan Séguéla, Pierre Aïm', 'Jean-Baptiste Delafon, Éric Benzekri', 'Laurent Lafitte, Victor George, Christophe Malavoy, Judith El Zein, Jonathan Cohen, François Rollin, Anne Canovas, Pablo Pauly', null, 'Arnaud Mustier, lawyer and brilliant philosopher, arouses the annoyance of his younger brother Jules, age sixteen. One day, Arnaud is a victim of a late adolescent crisis. Helped by Jules, he is going to catch up this phase of the life which he did not live.', 'Arnaud Mustier, lawyer and brilliant philosopher, arouses the annoyance of his younger brother Jules, age sixteen. One day, Arnaud is a victim of a late adolescent crisis. Helped by Jules, he is going to catch up this phase of the life which he did not live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffnIzvEGOdQm58akyOaiiPBtBvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242673'),
  ('398838922841376243', 'The Adults', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dustin Guy Defa, Tim Curtin, Andrew Harrington', 'Dustin Guy Defa', 'Michael Cera, Hannah Gross, Sophia Lillis, Wavyy Jonez, Anoop Desai, Kyra Tantao, Kiah McKirnan, Simon Kim', 'R', 'Eric returns home for a short visit and finds himself caught between reuniting with his sisters and chasing a victory with his old poker group. As the trip extends, Eric finds it increasingly difficult to avoid confrontations and revelations as his carefully constructed façade of his adulthood gives way to old childhood conflicts.', 'Eric returns home for a short visit and finds himself caught between reuniting with his sisters and chasing a victory with his old poker group. As the trip extends, Eric finds it increasingly difficult to avoid confrontations and revelations as his carefully constructed façade of his adulthood gives way to old childhood conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4vkr30zcBnVH2XCXUxyuFTX5JR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077661'),
  ('1065778964161969168', 'The Advanced Guard', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Zoltán David, Peter Geiger', 'Richard Kletter, Peter Geiger', 'Isabella Hofmann, Eric Allan Kramer, James Avery, Jeff Kober, Michael Weatherly, John Prosky, Cristi Conaway, Clare Salstrom', 'R', 'A group of aliens arrive on Earth as part of an advance invasion force. Their mission is to kidnap a small sample of humans and run them through a series of rigorous tests to determine if they would make suitable slaves. Harper, one of the alien experimenters, has become frustrated with her planet''s endless cycle of conquest and extermination and begins to feel some sympathy for her human captives. While the prisoners see a glimmer of hope in the compassionate alien, will it be any use in stopping the enormous attack fleet just a few days from Earth?', 'A group of aliens arrive on Earth as part of an advance invasion force. Their mission is to kidnap a small sample of humans and run them through a series of rigorous tests to determine if they would make suitable slaves. Harper, one of the alien experimenters, has become frustrated with her planet''s endless cycle of conquest and extermination and begins to feel some sympathy for her human captives. While the prisoners see a glimmer of hope in the compassionate alien, will it be any use in stopping the enormous attack fleet just a few days from Earth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkVhuUdlQFFgoXNBoZ8JBP0BEef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78371'),
  ('569602994340993682', 'The Advent Calendar', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Patrick Ridremont', 'Patrick Ridremont', 'Eugénie Derouand, Honorine Magnier, Clément Olivieri, Janis Abrikh, Cyril Garnier, Vladimir Perrin, Jérôme Paquatte, Laura Presgurvic', null, 'Eva, an ex-dancer, is now living in a wheelchair, unable to walk. When her friend Sophie gives her an old wooden antique advent calendar before Christmas, she realizes each window contains a surprise that triggers repercussions in real life: some of them good, but most of them bad... Now Eva will have to choose between getting rid of the calendar or walking again… even if it causes death around her.', 'Eva, an ex-dancer, is now living in a wheelchair, unable to walk. When her friend Sophie gives her an old wooden antique advent calendar before Christmas, she realizes each window contains a surprise that triggers repercussions in real life: some of them good, but most of them bad... Now Eva will have to choose between getting rid of the calendar or walking again… even if it causes death around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psaYUHDotafhVNAE1pZN2GkRXJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762079'),
  ('106023000422176951', 'The Adventure of A.R.I.: My Robot Friend', 2022, 'Family, Science Fiction', 'Stephen Shimek, Danny Hulsey, Brian Vilim', 'Michael Baumgarten', 'Greg Lutz, J.R. Brown, Sophia Alongi, Jude Manley, Cait Brasel, Kyle Jacob Henry, Bill Jenkins, Caleb Hennigan', 'PG', 'A teenager summons the courage to help a friendly robot known as A.R.I. kidnapped by a ruthless lab director working for a powerful corporation seeking to turn him into a dangerous weapon in order to rule the world.', 'A teenager summons the courage to help a friendly robot known as A.R.I. kidnapped by a ruthless lab director working for a powerful corporation seeking to turn him into a dangerous weapon in order to rule the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txcjXiyhBvsSFyZtgCHWW7CyIeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682075'),
  ('139331401122834072', 'The Adventure of Denchu-Kozo', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Nariaki Senba, Nobu Kanaoka, Kei Fujiwara, Shinya Tsukamoto, Tomorowo Taguchi, Mitsuru Saga, Kenji Nasa', null, 'A teenager discovers an electric pylon growing out of his back and is soon forced to battle cyborg vampires over the future of humanity.', 'A teenager discovers an electric pylon growing out of his back and is soon forced to battle cyborg vampires over the future of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97px7TqN34QsPh7zKlTGkr3Uoed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69469'),
  ('1016981317301317729', 'The Adventure of Sherlock Holmes'' Smarter Brother', 1975, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Gerry Fisher, Gene Wilder, David Tomblin', 'Gene Wilder', 'Gene Wilder, Madeline Kahn, Marty Feldman, Dom DeLuise, Leo McKern, Roy Kinnear, John Le Mesurier, Douglas Wilmer', 'PG', 'After spending decades living in the shadow of his more famous and successful sibling, Consulting Detective Sigerson Holmes (Wilder) is called upon to help solve a crucial case that leads him on a hilarious trail of false identities, stolen documents, secret codes... and exposed backsides.', 'After spending decades living in the shadow of his more famous and successful sibling, Consulting Detective Sigerson Holmes (Wilder) is called upon to help solve a crucial case that leads him on a hilarious trail of false identities, stolen documents, secret codes... and exposed backsides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJTGLNjhndwX27BXmAs0Jh1Z4Ys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29859'),
  ('170571417886720068', 'The Adventurer', 1917, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Charlie Chaplin, William C. Foster, Roland Totheroh', 'Vincent Bryan, Maverick Terrell, Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Eric Campbell, Henry Bergman, Albert Austin, Marta Golden, Toraichi Kono, Phyllis Allen', null, 'The daring convict no. 23, known as The Eel, escapes from prison and, after mocking his inept persecutors, saves the lives of three people in peril: a beautiful girl, her mother and an annoying suitor, only to get exhausted and almost drowned. Once he regains his strength at Judge Brown''s home, he participates on an upper-class social party where he competes with the suitor for the favors of the charming Miss Brown. But prison guards are still after him…', 'The daring convict no. 23, known as The Eel, escapes from prison and, after mocking his inept persecutors, saves the lives of three people in peril: a beautiful girl, her mother and an annoying suitor, only to get exhausted and almost drowned. Once he regains his strength at Judge Brown''s home, he participates on an upper-class social party where he competes with the suitor for the favors of the charming Miss Brown. But prison guards are still after him…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khSBh0dDnPsWel6P2zyZCQ2UnMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31819'),
  ('40930920272279118', 'The Adventurer', 1983, 'Drama', 'Kaljo Kiisk, Jüri Sillart, Lilia Kleimjonova', 'Juhan Viiding', 'Tõnu Kark, Viire Valdma, Paul Poom, Egon Nuter, Margus Oopkaup, Katrin Kohv, Aire Koop, Vilma Luik', null, 'Toomas Nipernaadi is seen roaming the rural landscape, going from village to village looking for the woman of his dreams. He wears a bedraggled white suit but generously pays for any lodging he needs or in one case, even buys a farm. Nipernaadi has a way with words and enchants those he meets with his wild stories about himself. Women find him appealing and the men are entertained as he moves from one locale to the next.', 'Toomas Nipernaadi is seen roaming the rural landscape, going from village to village looking for the woman of his dreams. He wears a bedraggled white suit but generously pays for any lodging he needs or in one case, even buys a farm. Nipernaadi has a way with words and enchants those he meets with his wild stories about himself. Women find him appealing and the men are entertained as he moves from one locale to the next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0NA9uoSUBZwx0VFMauBe44QQbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76962'),
  ('74245216758702775', 'The Adventurer: The Curse of the Midas Box', 2013, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Jonathan Newman, Unax Mendia, Dominic Roberts', 'Matthew Huffman, Christian Taylor', 'Aneurin Barnard, Michael Sheen, Lena Headey, Sam Neill, Ioan Gruffudd, Keeley Hawes, Tristan Gemmill, Daniel Wilde', 'PG', 'Seventeen-year-old Mariah Mundi''s life is turned upside down when his parents vanish and his younger brother is kidnapped. Following a trail of clues to the darkly majestic Prince Regent Hotel, Mariah discovers a hidden realm of child-stealing monsters, deadly secrets and a long-lost artefact that grants limitless wealth—but also devastating supernatural power. With the fate of his world, and his family at stake, Mariah will risk everything to unravel the Curse of the Midas Box.', 'Seventeen-year-old Mariah Mundi''s life is turned upside down when his parents vanish and his younger brother is kidnapped. Following a trail of clues to the darkly majestic Prince Regent Hotel, Mariah discovers a hidden realm of child-stealing monsters, deadly secrets and a long-lost artefact that grants limitless wealth—but also devastating supernatural power. With the fate of his world, and his family at stake, Mariah will risk everything to unravel the Curse of the Midas Box.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31ykUoOS2RNdARk3B8z3y25gD8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227707'),
  ('691233905326094020', 'The Adventurers', 1970, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Lewis Gilbert, Claude Renoir, Luis Armando Roche', 'Lewis Gilbert, Michael Hastings', 'Charles Aznavour, Alan Badel, Candice Bergen, Thommy Berggren, Delia Boccardo, Ernest Borgnine, Rossano Brazzi, Olivia de Havilland', 'R', 'The wealthy playboy son of an assassinated South American diplomat discovers that his father was murdered on orders of the corrupt president of the country- a man who was his father''s friend and who, in fact, his father had helped put into power. He returns from living a jet-set life in Europe to lead a revolution against the government, only to find out that things aren''t quite as black and white as he''d assumed.', 'The wealthy playboy son of an assassinated South American diplomat discovers that his father was murdered on orders of the corrupt president of the country- a man who was his father''s friend and who, in fact, his father had helped put into power. He returns from living a jet-set life in Europe to lead a revolution against the government, only to find out that things aren''t quite as black and white as he''d assumed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDPD4bXra8cpgweYMMJ6XcGB6Vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106326'),
  ('659566205897502898', 'The Adventurers', 1995, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Yip Gong-Yam, Sandy Shaw Lai-King', 'Andy Lau, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, Paul Chun Pui, David Chiang Da-Wei, Ben Ng Ngai-Cheung, John Ching Tung, Parkman Wong Pak-Man', null, 'After the murder of his parents and sister at the hands of the villianous gun-running billionaire Ray Lui, crack fighter pilot Yan vows revenge.', 'After the murder of his parents and sister at the hands of the villianous gun-running billionaire Ray Lui, crack fighter pilot Yan vows revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Sn7cDtMQXEjlCSrwyrBDEy5MRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45435'),
  ('200686623810186790', 'The Adventurers', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Adventure', 'Stephen Fung, Shane Hurlbut', 'Cheung Chi-Kwong, Stephen Fung, Law Yiu-Fai', 'Andy Lau, Shu Qi, Zhang Jingchu, Tony Yang, Jean Reno, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Sha Yi, You Tianyi', null, 'The world''s top thieves join forces to pull off the heist of a lifetime. But when they find themselves pursued across Europe by a legendary French detective, they''ll have to take their game to the next level.', 'The world''s top thieves join forces to pull off the heist of a lifetime. But when they find themselves pursued across Europe by a legendary French detective, they''ll have to take their game to the next level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVKVucELauvZGsNUd37LgSusQWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452551'),
  ('180236704082485650', 'The Adventures', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Adventure', 'Ittisak Eusunthornwattana', 'Ittisak Eusunthornwattana', 'Sunny Suwanmethanon, Matcha Mosimann, Somchai Kemklad, Pongsatorn Jongwilas, Kongkid Visessiri, Jarnnawut Jarnyaharn, Adisorn Trisirikasem, Peerada Kointarangkul', null, 'Joy, a secretary at a large multinational company, has an online shopping problem, likes to read adventure novels and watch travel and adventure shows. She daydreams about living a life of adventure.', 'Joy, a secretary at a large multinational company, has an online shopping problem, likes to read adventure novels and watch travel and adventure shows. She daydreams about living a life of adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3SeS4wjKQ3TjHSvRidovGJbHYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949429'),
