  ('860412625548549274', 'The Adventures of Enrique and Ana', 1981, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family, Music', 'Hans Burmann, José Ramos Paíno, Ramón Fernández', 'Luis Revenga', 'Enrique del Pozo, Ana Anguita, Amparo Soler Leal, Luis Escobar, Agustín González, José Lifante, Guillermo Montesinos, Emilio Mellado', null, 'Enrique is a gym teacher who along with his sister want to start a musical career with the support of their grandfather, a great scientist who wants to stop an evil despot from getting an artifact that would endanger the entire world.', 'Enrique is a gym teacher who along with his sister want to start a musical career with the support of their grandfather, a great scientist who wants to stop an evil despot from getting an artifact that would endanger the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hFfjzmEarcOm9kutKk1k94HhZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232868'),
