  ('851937538133044099', 'The Adventures of Ford Fairlane', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Renny Harlin, Oliver Wood, Terry Miller', 'James Cappe, Daniel Waters, David Arnott', 'Andrew Dice Clay, Wayne Newton, Priscilla Presley, Morris Day, Lauren Holly, Ed O''Neill, Maddie Corman, Gilbert Gottfried', 'R', 'To the Los Angeles elite, Ford Fairlane is known as "Mr. Rock ''n'' Roll Detective." This loudmouthed ladies'' man serves an exclusive rock star clientele, who depend on his keen eye and smug discretion. So when a heavy-metal musician dies mid-concert, Fairlane is on the case before the lights come up. But things turn shocking when radio personality Johnny Crunch hires Fairlane to find a missing groupie mere hours before he is electrocuted live on air.', 'To the Los Angeles elite, Ford Fairlane is known as "Mr. Rock ''n'' Roll Detective." This loudmouthed ladies'' man serves an exclusive rock star clientele, who depend on his keen eye and smug discretion. So when a heavy-metal musician dies mid-concert, Fairlane is on the case before the lights come up. But things turn shocking when radio personality Johnny Crunch hires Fairlane to find a missing groupie mere hours before he is electrocuted live on air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6accimG7LmroR8WgNklEJS7oFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9548'),
  ('62111044765644323', 'The Adventures of Gigi the Law', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Alessandro Comodin, Tristan Bodmann, Giulio Squarci', 'Alessandro Comodin', 'Pier Luigi Mecchia, Ester Vergolini, Annalisa Ferrari, Tomaso Cecotto, Massimo Piazza, Mario Fontanello, Mario Pizzoltto, Ezio Massarutto', null, 'Gigi is a rural policeman who works in a place where nothing ever happens… until a young woman commits suicide by throwing herself onto the tracks as a train passes.', 'Gigi is a rural policeman who works in a place where nothing ever happens… until a young woman commits suicide by throwing herself onto the tracks as a train passes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kC2l3olfetQq0cItJBc71tPuxjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942811'),
  ('464811997264891173', 'The Adventures of God', 2002, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Eliseo Subiela, Daniel Rodríguez Maseda', 'Eliseo Subiela', 'Sergio Dioguardi, Flor Sabatella, Lorenzo Quinteros, María Concepción César, José María Gutiérrez, Walter Balzarini, Daniel Freire', null, 'A man and a woman find themselves trapped inside what appears to be a dream that takes place in the labyrinthine corridors and mysterious rooms of a large hotel located by the sea.', 'A man and a woman find themselves trapped inside what appears to be a dream that takes place in the labyrinthine corridors and mysterious rooms of a large hotel located by the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWeUnnnjyAWsZPkqXjK6SNeIdaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202532'),
  ('587890857631638030', 'The Adventures of Hajji Baba', 1954, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Don Weis, Edward Morey Jr., Harold Lipstein', 'Richard Collins', 'John Derek, Elaine Stewart, Amanda Blake, Thomas Gomez, Rosemarie Stack, Paul Picerni, Donald Randolph, Laurette Luez', 'R', 'In Ispahan, Persia, Hajji Baba is leaving his father''s shop to seek a greater fortune, while the Princess Fawzia is trying to talk her father, the Caliph into giving her in marriage to Nur-El-Din, a rival prince known far and wide as mean and fickle. Her father intends for Fawzia to marry a friend and ally, and makes plans to send her to him.', 'In Ispahan, Persia, Hajji Baba is leaving his father''s shop to seek a greater fortune, while the Princess Fawzia is trying to talk her father, the Caliph into giving her in marriage to Nur-El-Din, a rival prince known far and wide as mean and fickle. Her father intends for Fawzia to marry a friend and ally, and makes plans to send her to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hIIpvcpgCUwBjflpTP7FbVTlyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108668'),
  ('367132024646477472', 'The Adventures of Hercules', 1985, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Luigi Cozzi, Alberto Spagnoli, Massimo Galiano', 'Luigi Cozzi', 'Lou Ferrigno, Milly Carlucci, Sonia Viviani, William Berger, Carla Ferrigno, Claudio Cassinelli, Maria Rosaria Omaggio, Serena Grandi', 'PG', 'Hercules searches for the Seven Thunderbolts of Zeus, which have been stolen by renegade gods.', 'Hercules searches for the Seven Thunderbolts of Zeus, which have been stolen by renegade gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZNFBf5SRMGxt7NBnORfGEDKozk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30577'),
  ('1064952342612001087', 'The Adventures of Huck Finn', 1993, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Stephen Sommers, Janusz Kamiński', 'Stephen Sommers', 'Elijah Wood, Courtney B. Vance, Robbie Coltrane, Jason Robards, Ron Perlman, Dana Ivey, Anne Heche, James Gammon', 'PG', 'Mischievous Huck Finn is unnerved when his father, reemerging after years away, kidnaps him in an attempt to take away a $600 inheritance from his late mother. Fearing for his life, Huck fakes his own death and escapes. He soon runs into his friend, Jim, a slave fleeing his master. Together, the pair embarks on a raft journey down the Mississippi River, staying ahead of pursuers who blame the slave for Huck''s alleged murder.', 'Mischievous Huck Finn is unnerved when his father, reemerging after years away, kidnaps him in an attempt to take away a $600 inheritance from his late mother. Fearing for his life, Huck fakes his own death and escapes. He soon runs into his friend, Jim, a slave fleeing his master. Together, the pair embarks on a raft journey down the Mississippi River, staying ahead of pursuers who blame the slave for Huck''s alleged murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VpQZ43hdaTUmkMoe2CnED1Y2fS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34723'),
  ('1089346292875534826', 'The Adventures of Huckleberry Finn', 1939, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Richard Thorpe, John F. Seitz', 'Hugo Butler', 'Mickey Rooney, Rex Ingram, Walter Connolly, William Frawley, Lynne Carver, Jo Ann Sayers, Minor Watson, Elisabeth Risdon', 'NR', 'Huckleberry Finn, a rambunctious boy adventurer chafing under the bonds of civilization, escapes his humdrum world and his selfish, plotting father by sailing a raft down the Mississippi River.', 'Huckleberry Finn, a rambunctious boy adventurer chafing under the bonds of civilization, escapes his humdrum world and his selfish, plotting father by sailing a raft down the Mississippi River.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f90tAQ5wWy0oL6FwFYCFCjFCXiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59403'),
  ('609328549372559593', 'The Adventures of Huckleberry Finn', 1960, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Michael Curtiz, Ted D. McCord, L. V. McCardle Jr.', 'James Lee', 'Tony Randall, Archie Moore, Eddie Hodges, Patty McCormack, Neville Brand, Mickey Shaughnessy, Judy Canova, Andy Devine', 'NR', 'From chicken thief to cabin boy, riverboat pilot to circus performer, Huck Finn outsmarts everyone on his way down the muddy Mississippi.', 'From chicken thief to cabin boy, riverboat pilot to circus performer, Huck Finn outsmarts everyone on his way down the muddy Mississippi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2bmntngk2bQyrWT7Z9CxMNE8fO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43041'),
  ('817228854466376663', 'The Adventures of Ichabod and Mr. Toad', 1949, 'Horror, Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'James Algar, Clyde Geronimi, Jack Kinney', 'Erdman Penner, Washington Irving, Kenneth Grahame', 'Bing Crosby, Basil Rathbone, Eric Blore, J. Pat O''Malley, John McLeish, Colin Campbell, Campbell Grant, Claud Allister', 'NR', 'The Wind in the Willows: Concise version of Kenneth Grahame''s story of the same name. J. Thaddeus Toad, owner of Toad Hall, is prone to fads, such as the newfangled motor car. This desire for the very latest lands him in much trouble with the wrong crowd, and it is up to his friends, Mole, Rat and Badger to save him from himself. - The Legend of Sleepy Hollow: Retelling of Washington Irving''s story set in a tiny New England town. Ichabod Crane, the new schoolmaster, falls for the town beauty, Katrina Van Tassel, and the town Bully Brom Bones decides that he is a little too successful and needs "convincing" that Katrina is not for him.', 'The Wind in the Willows: Concise version of Kenneth Grahame''s story of the same name. J. Thaddeus Toad, owner of Toad Hall, is prone to fads, such as the newfangled motor car. This desire for the very latest lands him in much trouble with the wrong crowd, and it is up to his friends, Mole, Rat and Badger to save him from himself. - The Legend of Sleepy Hollow: Retelling of Washington Irving''s story set in a tiny New England town. Ichabod Crane, the new schoolmaster, falls for the town beauty, Katrina Van Tassel, and the town Bully Brom Bones decides that he is a little too successful and needs "convincing" that Katrina is not for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxj5YILmvzXrviQ0mBQs2dwLX09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13465'),
  ('740042048920395428', 'The Adventures of Jurassic Pet', 2019, 'Family, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ryan Bellgardt, Josh McKamie', 'Chris Hoyt, Jerome Reygner-Kalfon, Sebastien Semon', 'Molly Clayton, Brooks Ryan, Jamie Loy, Kyler Charles Beck, Evan Assante, Lisandro Boccacci, Ashtyn Barlow Nguyen', 'PG', 'An adventurous teenager summons the courage to help a friendly dinosaur to escape from the clutches of a mad scientist that wants to use him for experimentations.', 'An adventurous teenager summons the courage to help a friendly dinosaur to escape from the clutches of a mad scientist that wants to use him for experimentations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8vHnMjLPaclzxDWTnGzcwC19tT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593026'),
  ('1096794200478209196', 'The Adventures of Maid Marian', 2022, 'Adventure, Action', 'Bill Thomas, Paul Jenkins', 'Bill Thomas', 'Sophie-Louise Craig, Dominic Andersen, Bob Cryer, Harry Harrold, Jennifer Matter, Lainy Boyle, Alexander Jeremy, James Groom', null, 'Everyone knows the stories of Robin Hood and Maid Marian, but this the story of what happens next. Out of the shadows, a legend returns to save her people from the tyranny of the disgraced Sheriff of Nottingham. Robin Hood remains at war and Marian must put her own combat skills to the test, creating a new tale that will be heralded throughout the ages.', 'Everyone knows the stories of Robin Hood and Maid Marian, but this the story of what happens next. Out of the shadows, a legend returns to save her people from the tyranny of the disgraced Sheriff of Nottingham. Robin Hood remains at war and Marian must put her own combat skills to the test, creating a new tale that will be heralded throughout the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPXzCV01ysDmnmpJOkiVqaZQ5QR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893334'),
  ('702730351823877924', 'The Adventures of Marco Polo', 1938, 'Romance, Adventure', 'Archie Mayo, Lance Baxter, Archie Stout', 'Robert E. Sherwood', 'Gary Cooper, Sigrid Gurie, Basil Rathbone, George Barbier, Binnie Barnes, Ernest Truex, Alan Hale, H.B. Warner', 'NR', 'The Venetian traveler Marco Polo meets Kublai Khan and foils a plotter with fireworks in medieval China.', 'The Venetian traveler Marco Polo meets Kublai Khan and foils a plotter with fireworks in medieval China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXZoxhfhJGByz1zP72PtELPhrLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119645'),
  ('54044542088500151', 'The Adventures of Mark Twain', 1985, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Action', 'Will Vinton', 'Susan Shadburne', 'James Whitmore, Michele Mariana, Gary Krug, Chris Ritchie, John Morrison, Carol Edelman, Dal McKennon, Herb Smith', 'G', 'Based on elements from the stories of Mark Twain, this feature-length Claymation fantasy follows the adventures of Tom Sawyer, Becky Thatcher and Huck Finn as they stowaway aboard the interplanetary balloon of Mark Twain. Twain, disgusted with the human race, is intent upon finding Halley''s Comet and crashing into it, achieving his "destiny." It''s up to Tom, Becky, and Huck to convince him that his judgment is wrong and that he still has much to offer humanity that might make a difference. Their efforts aren''t just charitable; if they fail, they will share Twain''s fate. Along the way, they use a magical time portal to get a detailed overview of the Twain philosophy, observing the "historical" events that inspired his works.', 'Based on elements from the stories of Mark Twain, this feature-length Claymation fantasy follows the adventures of Tom Sawyer, Becky Thatcher and Huck Finn as they stowaway aboard the interplanetary balloon of Mark Twain. Twain, disgusted with the human race, is intent upon finding Halley''s Comet and crashing into it, achieving his "destiny." It''s up to Tom, Becky, and Huck to convince him that his judgment is wrong and that he still has much to offer humanity that might make a difference. Their efforts aren''t just charitable; if they fail, they will share Twain''s fate. Along the way, they use a magical time portal to get a detailed overview of the Twain philosophy, observing the "historical" events that inspired his works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUYyl69qvIZOTuRJnwK07BbYSyy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19947'),
  ('875180562588691012', 'The Adventures of Mary Read', 1961, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Romance', 'Umberto Lenzi, Tersicore Kolosoff, Augusto Tiezzi', 'Ugo Guerra, Luciano Martino', 'Lisa Gastoni, Jerome Courtland, Walter Barnes, Anna Arena, Agostino Salvietti, Germano Longo, Edoardo Toniolo, Loris Gizzi', null, 'Redhead Mary is a girl who dresses like a man to better approach, and rob the jewels worn by the pretty ladies of her time.', 'Redhead Mary is a girl who dresses like a man to better approach, and rob the jewels worn by the pretty ladies of her time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyfns2fZ7mIzhwNpkMytthuGJcW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105862'),
  ('999418316562666530', 'The Adventures of Milo and Otis', 1986, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Kon Ichikawa, Masanori Hata, Takashi Ueno', 'Mark Saltzman', 'Dudley Moore, Kyoko Koizumi, Shigeru Tsuyuki, Chatran, Pû', 'G', 'When Milo the cat and Otis the dog are separated, they each set off on an adventurous and often perilous quest across mountains, plains, and snow-covered lands to reunite with one another.', 'When Milo the cat and Otis the dog are separated, they each set off on an adventurous and often perilous quest across mountains, plains, and snow-covered lands to reunite with one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imHIqEfWRZuJ2vLow0UJ9aqjyEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47951'),
  ('252833579662129308', 'The Adventures of Mowgli', 1973, 'Animation, Family', 'Roman Davydov', 'Leonid Belokurov', 'Stepan Bubnov, Lyudmila Kasatkina, Anatoliy Papanov, Sergei Martinson, Aleksandr Nazarov, Lev Lyubetsky, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova, Yuri Khrzhanovsky', null, 'Adventures of Mowgli is an animated feature-length story originally released as five animated shorts of about 20 minutes each between 1967 and 1971 in the Soviet Union.', 'Adventures of Mowgli is an animated feature-length story originally released as five animated shorts of about 20 minutes each between 1967 and 1971 in the Soviet Union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umKOlYg5Ramxhu74XSn0Zg0FsLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59803'),
  ('358011523604425836', 'The Adventures of Panda Warrior', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Leo Lo Kwok-Shing, Andy Ng Yiu-Kuen', 'Peter Cheung Wing-Yiu, Andy Ng Yiu-Kuen', 'Lam Tze-Chung, Ji Tao, Wang Mijia, Ke Siming, Zheng Yang, Hao Yu Lan, Xiang He, Jack Tu', null, 'A peace-loving soldier from Ancient China is magically transported into a world ruled by an evil nine-headed snake. Transformed into a panda, he joins forces with a flying pig to free the once-peaceful Merryland from tyranny. But first he must train to be the kingdom''s most courageous panda warrior.', 'A peace-loving soldier from Ancient China is magically transported into a world ruled by an evil nine-headed snake. Transformed into a panda, he joins forces with a flying pig to free the once-peaceful Merryland from tyranny. But first he must train to be the kingdom''s most courageous panda warrior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydCoXaYbKNbRHQj5Etrn9eJXAKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407636'),
  ('577932826562341060', 'The Adventures of Philibert, Captain Virgin', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy, Adventure', 'Sylvain Fusée', 'Jean-François Halin, Karine Angeli', 'Jérémie Renier, Alexandre Astier, Manu Payet, Élodie Navarre, Aurélie Montea, Éric Savin, Ludovic Berthillot, Vincent Haquin', null, 'Philibert, a robust lad and eldest son of an artichoke farmer, stands out from the other boys in the village. Idealistic and ingenuous, he foresees for himself a glorious future in artichokes and is saving his virginity for an as-yet-unknown woman chosen for him by God. Before he dies, his father tells him that he isn''t his real parent. Philibert''s real father was a gentleman murdered in the most cowardly way by a man from Burgundy who is recognisable by a rose-shaped strawberry birthmark on his neck. With a pouch full of ideals and artichokes, Philibert leaves his village and gallops towards Burgundy, accompanied by Martin, his rather deceitful manservant. Philibert''s courage, kindness, physical and moral purity will thus be severely tested when faced with the baseness and venality of villains and the temptation of women each more lustful than the last.', 'Philibert, a robust lad and eldest son of an artichoke farmer, stands out from the other boys in the village. Idealistic and ingenuous, he foresees for himself a glorious future in artichokes and is saving his virginity for an as-yet-unknown woman chosen for him by God. Before he dies, his father tells him that he isn''t his real parent. Philibert''s real father was a gentleman murdered in the most cowardly way by a man from Burgundy who is recognisable by a rose-shaped strawberry birthmark on his neck. With a pouch full of ideals and artichokes, Philibert leaves his village and gallops towards Burgundy, accompanied by Martin, his rather deceitful manservant. Philibert''s courage, kindness, physical and moral purity will thus be severely tested when faced with the baseness and venality of villains and the temptation of women each more lustful than the last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uyNPZ0JANsy7PkzDHjs8EvtOJq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71830'),
  ('534592844028496653', 'The Adventures of Picasso', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Tage Danielsson, Roland Sterner, Tony Forsberg', 'Hans Alfredson, Tage Danielsson, Gösta Ekman', 'Gösta Ekman, Hans Alfredson, Margaretha Krook, Lena Olin, Lena Nyman, Toivo Pawlo, Bernard Cribbins, Wilfrid Brambell', null, 'A farcical biopic about Pablo Picasso, from his early years, to his middle years, to the years right before his death, and some of the years before and in-between that.', 'A farcical biopic about Pablo Picasso, from his early years, to his middle years, to the years right before his death, and some of the years before and in-between that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVWYfdhjWHvwndVB0CCBxNVrfKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45691'),
  ('762641150204425870', 'The Adventures of Pinocchio', 1972, 'Fantasy, Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Armando Nannuzzi, Silla Bettini, Luigi Comencini', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Luigi Comencini', 'Andrea Balestri, Nino Manfredi, Gina Lollobrigida, Domenico Santoro, Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Zoe Incrocci, Lionel Stander', null, 'Mastro Geppetto is a poor carpenter with no wife and no children. The man is very lonely, and after trading a piece of wood with his colleague Mastro Ciliegia, decides to build himself a puppet to keep him company.', 'Mastro Geppetto is a poor carpenter with no wife and no children. The man is very lonely, and after trading a piece of wood with his colleague Mastro Ciliegia, decides to build himself a puppet to keep him company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjoYc9umKoZHTVr2B0uBbn3bCXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58451'),
  ('556027967528859380', 'The Adventures of Pinocchio', 1996, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Drama', 'Steve Barron, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Cliff Lanning', 'Sherry Mills, Steve Barron, Tom Benedek', 'Martin Landau, Jonathan Taylor Thomas, Geneviève Bujold, Udo Kier, Bebe Neuwirth, Rob Schneider, Corey Carrier, Marcello Magni', 'G', 'One of puppet-maker Geppetto''s creations comes magically to life. This puppet, Pinocchio, has one major desire and that is to become a real boy someday. In order to accomplish this goal he has to learn to act responsibly. This film shows you the adventures on which he learns valuable lessons.', 'One of puppet-maker Geppetto''s creations comes magically to life. This puppet, Pinocchio, has one major desire and that is to become a real boy someday. In order to accomplish this goal he has to learn to act responsibly. This film shows you the adventures on which he learns valuable lessons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGPFPkUmPam6arT22ey8jWpKzL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18975'),
  ('200803426192472985', 'The Adventures of Pito Pérez', 1957, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Bustillo Oro', null, 'Germán Valdés, Anabel Gutiérrez, Andrés Soler, Marcelo Chávez, Ramón Valdés', null, 'After a long absence, a man returns to his village and recounts all his adventures with a touch of nostalgia.', 'After a long absence, a man returns to his village and recounts all his adventures with a touch of nostalgia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shYWgf9es1QIBxHbLg0fiJoHDE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149186'),
  ('1081294551226911967', 'The Adventures of Pluto Nash', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Ron Underwood, Oliver Wood, Frank Capra III', 'Neil Cuthbert', 'Eddie Murphy, Randy Quaid, Rosario Dawson, Joe Pantoliano, Jay Mohr, Luis Guzmán, James Rebhorn, Peter Boyle', 'PG-13', 'The year is 2087, the setting is the moon. Pluto Nash, the high-flying successful owner of the hottest nightclub in the universe, finds himself in trouble when he refuses to sell his club to lunar gangster Mogan, who just happens to be helping the mysterious Rex Crater mastermind a plan to take over the entire moon.', 'The year is 2087, the setting is the moon. Pluto Nash, the high-flying successful owner of the hottest nightclub in the universe, finds himself in trouble when he refuses to sell his club to lunar gangster Mogan, who just happens to be helping the mysterious Rex Crater mastermind a plan to take over the entire moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96vvhLWWDosS1zRrfQ6XEGAzByL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11692'),
  ('396175785271376374', 'The Adventures of Prince Achmed', 1926, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Carl Koch, Lotte Reiniger, Carl Koch', 'Lotte Reiniger', null, 'NR', 'Taken from The Arabian Nights, a wicked sorcerer and the beautiful prince Achmed battle one against the other during a series of wondrous adventures.', 'Taken from The Arabian Nights, a wicked sorcerer and the beautiful prince Achmed battle one against the other during a series of wondrous adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3OKMlt9QxpPeSfpyViqYkYFvUz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19354'),
  ('1067447060602570628', 'The Adventures of Prince Florisel', 1979, 'Adventure, Comedy, Mystery', 'Yevgeni Tatarsky, Konstantin Ryzhov, Konstantin Lashkov', 'Edgar Dubrovsky', 'Oleg Dal, Donatas Banionis, Igor Dmitriev, Lyubov Polishchuk, Boris Novikov, Yelena Solovey, Mikhail Pugovkin, Elena Tsyplakova', null, 'A mostly comical tale of all-powerful and wealthy Bavarian prince adventures that started when prince was seeking to deal with the boredom. Joining the Club of Suicide society, he uncovered the mastermind criminal behind it, and vowed to get rid of him by any means necessary, following deaths of several servants when dreaded president of club makes dashing escape. During that point, story changes into nearly second movie, as prince has to uncover yet another crime.', 'A mostly comical tale of all-powerful and wealthy Bavarian prince adventures that started when prince was seeking to deal with the boredom. Joining the Club of Suicide society, he uncovered the mastermind criminal behind it, and vowed to get rid of him by any means necessary, following deaths of several servants when dreaded president of club makes dashing escape. During that point, story changes into nearly second movie, as prince has to uncover yet another crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztIFIUT4pw6jayIDDHe3HDo5Pqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42642'),
  ('756464329337429860', 'The Adventures of Priscilla, Queen of the Desert', 1994, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Brian J. Breheny, Stephan Elliott, Stuart Freeman', 'Stephan Elliott', 'Hugo Weaving, Guy Pearce, Terence Stamp, Bill Hunter, Sarah Chadwick, June Marie Bennett, Rebel Penfold-Russell, John Casey', 'R', 'Two drag performers and a transgender woman travel across the desert to perform their unique style of cabaret.', 'Two drag performers and a transgender woman travel across the desert to perform their unique style of cabaret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJ7syYXEJgSBmBfSnF3Can9cK1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2759'),
  ('610477272078572954', 'The Adventures of Robin Hood', 1938, 'Adventure, Romance, History', 'Sol Polito, Tony Gaudio, William Keighley', 'Norman Reilly Raine, Seton I. Miller', 'Errol Flynn, Olivia de Havilland, Basil Rathbone, Claude Rains, Patric Knowles, Eugene Pallette, Alan Hale, Melville Cooper', 'PG', 'Robin Hood fights nobly for justice against the evil Sir Guy of Gisbourne while striving to win the hand of the beautiful Maid Marian.', 'Robin Hood fights nobly for justice against the evil Sir Guy of Gisbourne while striving to win the hand of the beautiful Maid Marian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mazyXEMkmLw5h6076yyNSm9uv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10907'),
  ('560889478061600875', 'The Adventures of Rocky & Bullwinkle', 2000, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Des McAnuff, Thomas E. Ackerman, Dana J. Kuznetzkoff', 'Kenneth Lonergan', 'June Foray, Keith Scott, Rene Russo, Jason Alexander, Piper Perabo, Randy Quaid, Robert De Niro, Jonathan Winters', 'PG', 'Rocky and Bullwinkle have been living off the finances made from the reruns of their cartoon show. Boris and Natasha somehow manage to crossover into reality and team up with Fearless Leader, an evil criminal turned media mogul with some evil plans up his sleeve. Rocky and Bullwinkle must stop the three of them before they wreak havoc.', 'Rocky and Bullwinkle have been living off the finances made from the reruns of their cartoon show. Boris and Natasha somehow manage to crossover into reality and team up with Fearless Leader, an evil criminal turned media mogul with some evil plans up his sleeve. Rocky and Bullwinkle must stop the three of them before they wreak havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCFSsftt2rglC81I6QLWcZSTCBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17711'),
  ('307055935176037585', 'The Adventures of Scamper the Penguin', 1987, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Gennadiy Sokolskiy, Kenjiro Yoshida, Noriyoshi Matsuura', 'Eiichi Taji, Shozo Matsuda, Viktor Merezhko', 'Aleksey Batalov, Svetlana Stepchenko, Lyudmila Gnilova, Vyacheslav Nevinnyy, Rolan Bykov, Yelena Sanayeva, Evgeni Leonov, Natalya Chenchik', null, 'Scamper is a little penguin who loves wandering around the Artic where he lives with his parents. Unfortunately his little adventures tend to get he, and his friend Snowflake into trouble, especially when he disobeys his father and goes exploring with seagulls who want to eat him flying above, and men and dogs on the ground with them. One day the adventure goes too far and they float out to sea, only to be caught by men who want to sell them to the zoo. Scamper, Snowflake and their new friend, a macaroni penguin named Louie, must escape and get back to their families to warn them.', 'Scamper is a little penguin who loves wandering around the Artic where he lives with his parents. Unfortunately his little adventures tend to get he, and his friend Snowflake into trouble, especially when he disobeys his father and goes exploring with seagulls who want to eat him flying above, and men and dogs on the ground with them. One day the adventure goes too far and they float out to sea, only to be caught by men who want to sell them to the zoo. Scamper, Snowflake and their new friend, a macaroni penguin named Louie, must escape and get back to their families to warn them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zr4vrqU2i6ATJ73l9nkZwJl7Gyo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56391'),
  ('660656544490408533', 'The Adventures of Sebastian Cole', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tod Williams, John Foster, Neil Daly', 'Tod Williams', 'Adrian Grenier, Clark Gregg, Aleksa Palladino, Margaret Colin, John Shea, Marni Lustig, Joan Copeland, Tom Lacy', 'R', 'Hank marries the divorced Joan, who''s the mother of teens Sebastian and Jessica. After living with his new family for years, Hank announces that he''s getting a sex change operation. The family deserts Hank, with Jessica going her own way and Sebastian staying with his mom. But Joan becomes an alcoholic, so Sebastian moves back in with Hank — now Henrietta — who turns out to be far more supportive than anyone else.', 'Hank marries the divorced Joan, who''s the mother of teens Sebastian and Jessica. After living with his new family for years, Hank announces that he''s getting a sex change operation. The family deserts Hank, with Jessica going her own way and Sebastian staying with his mom. But Joan becomes an alcoholic, so Sebastian moves back in with Hank — now Henrietta — who turns out to be far more supportive than anyone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isgUjJ9dlDyUJqEWtFrNeQe1wMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67323'),
  ('249813836640960676', 'The Adventures of Sharkboy and Lavagirl', 2005, 'Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Brian Bettwy, Robert Rodriguez, Christopher Stull', 'Marcel Rodriguez, Robert Rodriguez', 'Taylor Lautner, Taylor Dooley, Cayden Boyd, David Arquette, Kristin Davis, Jacob Davich, Sasha Pieterse, George López', 'PG', 'Everyone always knew that Max had a wild imagination, but no one believed that his wildest creations -- a boy raised by watchful great white sharks and a girl with the force of a volcano -- were real. Now, these two pint-sized action masters will show Max that even an ordinary kid has what it takes to be extraordinary.', 'Everyone always knew that Max had a wild imagination, but no one believed that his wildest creations -- a boy raised by watchful great white sharks and a girl with the force of a volcano -- were real. Now, these two pint-sized action masters will show Max that even an ordinary kid has what it takes to be extraordinary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpFbHSkRgOxOoutKqXob9T8iBPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14199'),
  ('399824384020402958', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes', 1939, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alfred L. Werker, Leon Shamroy', 'Edwin Blum, William Absalom Drake', 'Basil Rathbone, Nigel Bruce, Ida Lupino, Alan Marshal, Terry Kilburn, George Zucco, Henry Stephenson, E. E. Clive', 'NR', 'Having once again avoided criminal conviction, Professor Moriarity develops a murderous plan to “finish off” his last major nemesis, Sherlock Holmes, by making him fail to prevent the perfect crime. Does it involve a family curse, the crown jewels of England, or something else…', 'Having once again avoided criminal conviction, Professor Moriarity develops a murderous plan to “finish off” his last major nemesis, Sherlock Holmes, by making him fail to prevent the perfect crime. Does it involve a family curse, the crown jewels of England, or something else…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNE3GyeA9ZUCzI9jYTgNy7vYTfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17481'),
  ('995761026837350189', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: Hunting the Tiger', 1980, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Adventure', 'Igor Maslennikov, Anatoly Lapshov, Yuriy Veksler', 'Vladimir Valutskiy', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Boryslav Brondukov, Igor Dmitriev, Viktor Yevgrafov, Aleksandr Zakharov, Aleksey Kozhevnikov', null, 'Dr. Watson executes Sherlock Holmes'' will, who faced death after exposing Moriarty and his gang in the previous episode.', 'Dr. Watson executes Sherlock Holmes'' will, who faced death after exposing Moriarty and his gang in the previous episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEduiYp2RCIUOhLEUjHp8XChKFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126854'),
  ('284044135241162496', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: King of Blackmailers', 1980, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Adventure', 'Igor Maslennikov, Yuriy Veksler, Anatoly Lapshov', 'Vladimir Valutskiy', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Boryslav Brondukov, Boris Klyuev, Boris Ryzhukhin, Valentina Panina, Anatoliy Podshivalov', null, 'Mycroft Holmes hands Sherlock Holmes the case of the Master Blackmailer.', 'Mycroft Holmes hands Sherlock Holmes the case of the Master Blackmailer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSVz0PDiOpwMN475oVcNz7vB4W0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126846'),
  ('1140278174478385423', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: Mortal Fight', 1980, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Adventure', 'Igor Maslennikov, Anatoly Lapshov, Yuriy Veksler', 'Vladimir Valutskiy', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Boryslav Brondukov, Nikolai Kryukov, Viktor Yevgrafov, Aleksandr Zakharov, Boris Klyuev', null, 'After upsetting the criminal underground in ''the Master Blackmailer'' case, Sherlock Holmes has to face his archenemy: Prof. Moriarty.', 'After upsetting the criminal underground in ''the Master Blackmailer'' case, Sherlock Holmes has to face his archenemy: Prof. Moriarty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHCBBn2asb00aOOfzsThnuCIzun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126850'),
  ('151325632060379536', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: The Hound of the Baskervilles', 1981, 'Crime, Adventure, Mystery, TV Movie', 'N. Yagman, Galina Zaigraeva, B. Beysekova', 'Igor Maslennikov, Yuriy Veksler', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Irina Kupchenko, Nikita Mikhalkov, Svetlana Kryuchkova, Boryslav Brondukov, Alla Demidova', null, 'When Sir Charles Baskerville is found dead in his country house, Dr James Mortimer asks Sherlock Holmes for help to save Sir Henry Baskerville, the only known heir, from the curse that haunts Baskerville family.', 'When Sir Charles Baskerville is found dead in his country house, Dr James Mortimer asks Sherlock Holmes for help to save Sir Henry Baskerville, the only known heir, from the curse that haunts Baskerville family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CJgfcOcuRz8F31nWxddoXi4eeZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925348'),
  ('576433913343713553', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: The Hound of the Baskervilles - Part 1', 1981, 'Mystery, Adventure, Crime, TV Movie', 'Vladimir Ilin, Igor Maslennikov, Dmitriy Dolinin', 'Yuriy Veksler', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Boryslav Brondukov, Evgeniy Steblov, Nikita Mikhalkov, Alexander Adabashyan, Svetlana Kryuchkova', null, 'The Hound of the Baskervilles is a 1981 Soviet film adaptation of Arthur Conan Doyle''s novel The Hound of the Baskervilles. It was the third installment in the TV series about adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Doctor Watson. A potent streak of humour ran through the film as concerns references to traditional British customs and stereotypes, ensuring the film''s popularity with several generations of Russophone viewers. Other features of this best entry in the series include excellent exterior shots which closely match the novel''s setting in the Dartmoor marshland, as well as an all-star cast: in addition to the famous Livanov -Solomin duo as Holmes and Watson, the film stars the internationally acclaimed actor/director Nikita Mikhalkov as Sir Henry Baskerville and the Russian movie legend Oleg Yankovsky as the villain Stapleton.', 'The Hound of the Baskervilles is a 1981 Soviet film adaptation of Arthur Conan Doyle''s novel The Hound of the Baskervilles. It was the third installment in the TV series about adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Doctor Watson. A potent streak of humour ran through the film as concerns references to traditional British customs and stereotypes, ensuring the film''s popularity with several generations of Russophone viewers. Other features of this best entry in the series include excellent exterior shots which closely match the novel''s setting in the Dartmoor marshland, as well as an all-star cast: in addition to the famous Livanov -Solomin duo as Holmes and Watson, the film stars the internationally acclaimed actor/director Nikita Mikhalkov as Sir Henry Baskerville and the Russian movie legend Oleg Yankovsky as the villain Stapleton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5W1OR1Tv7JAbphYNYrUgWvkL24I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84254'),
  ('315522506185659645', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: The Hound of the Baskervilles - Part 2', 1981, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Adventure', 'Igor Maslennikov, Dmitriy Dolinin, Vladimir Ilin', 'Yuriy Veksler', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Boryslav Brondukov, Evgeniy Steblov, Nikita Mikhalkov, Alexander Adabashyan, Svetlana Kryuchkova', null, 'The second part of the Soviet TV adaption.', 'The second part of the Soviet TV adaption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haaRz24WcSslZNVZaxGRupujqLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493844'),
  ('993988581465676961', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: The Treasures of Agra', 1983, 'Crime, Mystery, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Igor Maslennikov, Yuriy Veksler, Viktor Sergeev', 'Igor Maslennikov', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Boryslav Brondukov, Ekaterina Zinchenko, Viktor Proskurin, Pavel Kadochnikov, Sergey Shakurov', null, 'Holmes and Dr. Watson help a young lady who is receiving anonymous letters 10 years after her father passed away under shady circumstances. They find themselves in an enigma involving a treasure, murder and a love interest for Watson.', 'Holmes and Dr. Watson help a young lady who is receiving anonymous letters 10 years after her father passed away under shady circumstances. They find themselves in an enigma involving a treasure, murder and a love interest for Watson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WXKw7sR2ZlBtOAWY2IXdmc2fEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127608'),
  ('288815010194642485', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: The Treasures of Agra - Part 1', 1983, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Adventure', 'Igor Maslennikov, Yuriy Veksler, Viktor Sergeev', 'Igor Maslennikov', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Boryslav Brondukov, Ekaterina Zinchenko, Viktor Proskurin, Pavel Kadochnikov, Sergey Shakurov', null, 'A girl named Mary Morsten comes to Sherlock Holmes, who asks him and the doctor to help solve the annual receipt of one pearl by her parcel and in the search for her father, who disappeared many years ago. Holmes and Watson do not refuse her help and find out that Miss Mary is the heiress of a huge fortune — the treasures of Agra, which are also claimed by the sons of Major Sholto and Jonathan Small — an escaped convict with a wooden prosthesis instead of a leg, whom the elder Morsten and Sholto deceived (while Sholto also deceived Morsten).', 'A girl named Mary Morsten comes to Sherlock Holmes, who asks him and the doctor to help solve the annual receipt of one pearl by her parcel and in the search for her father, who disappeared many years ago. Holmes and Watson do not refuse her help and find out that Miss Mary is the heiress of a huge fortune — the treasures of Agra, which are also claimed by the sons of Major Sholto and Jonathan Small — an escaped convict with a wooden prosthesis instead of a leg, whom the elder Morsten and Sholto deceived (while Sholto also deceived Morsten).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCPEC1WFrhNzPLeUWQ03mZHeSLT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126395'),
  ('277162015493506298', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: The Treasures of Agra - Part 2', 1983, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Adventure', 'Igor Maslennikov, Arkadiy Tigay, Viktor Sergeev', 'Igor Maslennikov', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Boryslav Brondukov, Ekaterina Zinchenko, Larisa Solovyova, Georgi Martirosyan, Pavel Remezov', null, 'During the investigation of the Agra treasure case, Holmes and Watson recall another case that Holmes had investigated earlier. The King of Bohemia comes to Holmes under a false name, who behaves somewhat arrogantly at first, and then plaintively asks for help.', 'During the investigation of the Agra treasure case, Holmes and Watson recall another case that Holmes had investigated earlier. The King of Bohemia comes to Holmes under a false name, who behaves somewhat arrogantly at first, and then plaintively asks for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkk08aJndujZvMBEkPbzfJgMZui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126866'),
  ('702639280732994959', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: The Twentieth Century Begins - Part 1', 1988, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Adventure', 'Igor Maslennikov, Yuriy Veksler, Arkadiy Tigay', 'Igor Maslennikov', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Boryslav Brondukov, Boris Klyuev, Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Aleksandr Romantsov, Elena Safonova, Larisa Guzeeva', null, 'The final film of the television series "The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson." It is based on the late and little-known stories of Arthur Conan Doyle, united by the theme of the approaching world war and the struggle of the legendary detective with foreign spies.', 'The final film of the television series "The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson." It is based on the late and little-known stories of Arthur Conan Doyle, united by the theme of the approaching world war and the struggle of the legendary detective with foreign spies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxQBfysbcMrh4M8m9sTsSt5RL2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126867'),
  ('203254308299427560', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson: The Twentieth Century Begins - Part 2', 1988, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Adventure', 'Igor Maslennikov, Yuriy Veksler, Arkadiy Tigay', 'Igor Maslennikov', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya, Boryslav Brondukov, Boris Klyuev, Leonid Kuravlyov, Svetlana Smirnova, Maris Liepa', null, 'The final film of the television series "The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson." It is based on the late and little-known stories of Arthur Conan Doyle, united by the theme of the approaching world war and the struggle of the legendary detective with foreign spies.', 'The final film of the television series "The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson." It is based on the late and little-known stories of Arthur Conan Doyle, united by the theme of the approaching world war and the struggle of the legendary detective with foreign spies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wedNiWBLOtGVNtJzE64w18AH45U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126868'),
  ('298534124213891913', 'The Adventures of Tartu', 1943, 'Romance, War', 'Harold S. Bucquet, Louis Levy, Jack E. Cox', 'John Lee Mahin, Howard Emmett Rogers', 'Robert Donat, Valerie Hobson, Walter Rilla, Glynis Johns, Phyllis Morris, Martin Miller, Anthony Eustrel, Percy Walsh', null, 'British Captain Terence Stevenson (Robert Donat) accepts an assignment even more dangerous than his everyday job of defusing unexploded bombs. Fluent in Romanian and German and having studied chemical engineering, he is parachuted into Romania to assume the identity of Captain Jan Tartu, a member of the fascist Iron Guard. He makes his way to Czechoslovakia to steal the formula of a new Nazi poison gas and sabotage the factory where it is being manufactured.', 'British Captain Terence Stevenson (Robert Donat) accepts an assignment even more dangerous than his everyday job of defusing unexploded bombs. Fluent in Romanian and German and having studied chemical engineering, he is parachuted into Romania to assume the identity of Captain Jan Tartu, a member of the fascist Iron Guard. He makes his way to Czechoslovakia to steal the formula of a new Nazi poison gas and sabotage the factory where it is being manufactured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PcwkwhGRs1MDN8nuOdQdAX2KsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51791'),
  ('1022805089713982555', 'The Adventures of the American Rabbit', 1986, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Nobutaka Nishizawa, Fred Wolf, John Kafka', 'Norm Lenzer', 'Barry Gordon, Bob Arbogast, Laurie O''Brien, Kenneth Mars, Lorenzo Music, Pat Fraley, Bob Holt, Lew Horn', 'G', 'To fight evil, a young rabbit can transform into a star spangled superhero.', 'To fight evil, a young rabbit can transform into a star spangled superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZV8HC4v8nNHSmx8BEBj5ZbtkUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87864'),
  ('384425731781924349', 'The Adventures of the Electronic', 1980, 'Family, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Konstantin Bromberg', 'Evgeniy Veltistov', 'Yuri Torsuyev, Vladimir Torsuyev, Oksana Alekseyeva, Vasiliy Skromnyy, Vladimir Basov, Nikolai Karachentsov, Mykola Hrynko, Yelizaveta Nikishchikhina', null, 'Professor Gromov constructs a robot called Electronic, which looks exactly like Sergey Syroezhkibn, a 6-grader from one of Odessa (USSR) schools. The robot also acts a lot like a human, and its dream is to become a real man. Electronic escapes from the professor''s lab and accidentally meets Sergey, his prototype. Meanwhile, a gang lead by Stump is trying to kidnap Electronic to make him steal pictures from museums. For this purpose they send their hitman Urrie.', 'Professor Gromov constructs a robot called Electronic, which looks exactly like Sergey Syroezhkibn, a 6-grader from one of Odessa (USSR) schools. The robot also acts a lot like a human, and its dream is to become a real man. Electronic escapes from the professor''s lab and accidentally meets Sergey, his prototype. Meanwhile, a gang lead by Stump is trying to kidnap Electronic to make him steal pictures from museums. For this purpose they send their hitman Urrie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74LlbSEL5RPVAR9V1rlTFMq8x4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38329'),
  ('111828073474608391', 'The Adventures of the Wilderness Family', 1975, 'Drama, Family, Adventure', 'Stewart Raffill', 'Stewart Raffill, Arthur R. Dubs', 'Robert Logan, Susan Damante, Hollye Holmes, Ham Larsen, George Buck Flower, William Cornford, John F. Goff, Herbert F. Nelson', 'G', 'The story of a modern family bored with the hassles of the city life in Los Angeles. They head for the wilderness never to return.', 'The story of a modern family bored with the hassles of the city life in Los Angeles. They head for the wilderness never to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1t5JbM4gxjWyAaq884rbNEqKcRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28994'),
  ('226012888211717257', 'The Adventures of the Yellow Suitcase', 1970, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ilya Frez, Mikhail Kirillov, Vartan Yeramishev', 'Sofiya Prokofyeva, Ilya Frez', 'Andrei Gromov, Natalya Seleznyova, Tatyana Pelttser, Yevgeni Lebedev, Rina Zelyonaya, Yevgeni Vesnik, Zhenya Model, Sergei Rodionov', null, 'Do you know that there are doctors who can prescribe you the medicine to be brave?..', 'Do you know that there are doctors who can prescribe you the medicine to be brave?..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aObr0hE0DERbBdDSSqkcumrTQ5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85355'),
  ('442133546990716827', 'The Adventures of Tintin', 2011, 'Adventure, Animation, Mystery', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Regina Cachuela', 'Edgar Wright, Joe Cornish, Steven Moffat', 'Jamie Bell, Andy Serkis, Daniel Craig, Nick Frost, Simon Pegg, Daniel Mays, Gad Elmaleh, Toby Jones', 'PG', 'Intrepid young reporter, Tintin, and his loyal dog, Snowy, are thrust into a world of high adventure when they discover a ship carrying an explosive secret. As Tintin is drawn into a centuries-old mystery, Ivan Ivanovitch Sakharine suspects him of stealing a priceless treasure. Tintin and Snowy, with the help of salty, cantankerous Captain Haddock and bumbling detectives, Thompson and Thomson, travel half the world, one step ahead of their enemies, as Tintin endeavors to find the Unicorn, a sunken ship that may hold a vast fortune, but also an ancient curse.', 'Intrepid young reporter, Tintin, and his loyal dog, Snowy, are thrust into a world of high adventure when they discover a ship carrying an explosive secret. As Tintin is drawn into a centuries-old mystery, Ivan Ivanovitch Sakharine suspects him of stealing a priceless treasure. Tintin and Snowy, with the help of salty, cantankerous Captain Haddock and bumbling detectives, Thompson and Thomson, travel half the world, one step ahead of their enemies, as Tintin endeavors to find the Unicorn, a sunken ship that may hold a vast fortune, but also an ancient curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQZ3sLR1Fi63NMsNRbjm9q5qODJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17578'),
  ('1037989348209171330', 'The Adventures of Tom Sawyer', 1938, 'Family, Adventure', 'Norman Taurog, James Wong Howe', 'Marshall Neilan', 'Tommy Kelly, May Robson, Walter Brennan, Victor Jory, David Holt, Jackie Moran, Nana Bryant, Olin Howland', 'NR', 'Tom Sawyer and his pal Huckleberry Finn have great adventures on the Mississippi River, pretending to be pirates, attending their own funeral and witnessing a murder.', 'Tom Sawyer and his pal Huckleberry Finn have great adventures on the Mississippi River, pretending to be pirates, attending their own funeral and witnessing a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v91Ft1tHlKHLSfNp4XBL8H6JMOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30977'),
  ('373492445183785792', 'The Adventures of Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn', 1985, 'Adventure, Family, TV Movie', 'Stanislav Govorukhin, Viktor Krutin', 'Stanislav Govorukhin', 'Fyodor Stukov, Vladislav Galkin, Mariya Mironova, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Talgat Nigmatulin, Rolan Bykov, Valentina Shendrikova, Viktor Pavlov', null, 'Without a book about the adventures of Tom and his friends Huckleberry Finn and Becky Thatcher, one can not imagine the childhood of a child! The small but brave heroes Tom and Huck search for the treasure, become "pirates", enter into a dangerous battle with the Indian Joe.', 'Without a book about the adventures of Tom and his friends Huckleberry Finn and Becky Thatcher, one can not imagine the childhood of a child! The small but brave heroes Tom and Huck search for the treasure, become "pirates", enter into a dangerous battle with the Indian Joe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ5Q9aL9ERqJRXCS0elVYAKDR4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74705'),
  ('1079202073407333855', 'The Adventures of Tom Thumb and Thumbelina', 2003, 'Family, Animation', 'Glenn Chaika', 'Willard Carroll', 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Elijah Wood, Peter Gallagher, Alexandra Boyd, Michael Chiklis, Yvette Freeman, Robert Guillaume, Rachel Griffiths', 'G', 'Voiced by Elijah Wood, Jennifer Love Hewitt, and others, this film features Tom Thumb and Thumbelina, the tiny, famed fairy-tale favorites, who are together for the first time in this heartwarming, magical musical story about courage and friendship. After 15 years, the two reunite and remember when their village was destroyed by a giant. Soon, they find out that they have neat powers they can use for good.', 'Voiced by Elijah Wood, Jennifer Love Hewitt, and others, this film features Tom Thumb and Thumbelina, the tiny, famed fairy-tale favorites, who are together for the first time in this heartwarming, magical musical story about courage and friendship. After 15 years, the two reunite and remember when their village was destroyed by a giant. Soon, they find out that they have neat powers they can use for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWycLlTMONiLIy0uF4lk2Ne1kYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62670'),
  ('1086850643703802115', 'The Adventures of Villar', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Joseph Hepp', 'Nikolaos Sfakianos', 'Nikolaos Sfakianos, Nitsa Filosofou', null, 'Originally thought of as the oldest surviving Greek feature film, before it was discovered that it wasn''t released in 1924, but in 1927. Burlesque comedian Sfakianos, who had trained in France, stars as Villar. Villar gets a job at a dry cleaner’s and wanders through Athens. He makes one gaffe after the other and gets involved in various adventures.', 'Originally thought of as the oldest surviving Greek feature film, before it was discovered that it wasn''t released in 1924, but in 1927. Burlesque comedian Sfakianos, who had trained in France, stars as Villar. Villar gets a job at a dry cleaner’s and wanders through Athens. He makes one gaffe after the other and gets involved in various adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9PM2bn8fhu2qU1s9PUmFIBk9XL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278938'),
  ('758503715907536373', 'The Adventures of Werner Holt', 1965, 'Drama, History', 'Rolf Sohre, Joachim Kunert', 'Claus Küchenmeister, Joachim Kunert', 'Klaus-Peter Thiele, Arno Wyzniewski, Günter Junghans, Peter Reusse, Monika Woytowicz, Dietlinde Greiff, Angelica Domröse, Manfred Karge', null, 'Two 17-year-olds, Werner Holt and Gilbert Wolzow, are pulled out of school and into Hitler''s army. Gilbert becomes a fanatical soldier; but at the front, Werner begins to understand the senselessness of war.', 'Two 17-year-olds, Werner Holt and Gilbert Wolzow, are pulled out of school and into Hitler''s army. Gilbert becomes a fanatical soldier; but at the front, Werner begins to understand the senselessness of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOD73qkogEks8xFI1WJs9Gry2H2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2250'),
  ('334146261121806297', 'The Adventures of Young Indiana Jones: Travels with Father', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Schultz, Deepa Mehta, Giles Nuttgens', 'Jonathan Hales, Frank Darabont, Matthew Jacobs', 'Corey Carrier, Lloyd Owen, Ruth de Sosa, Margaret Tyzack, Michael Gough, Milan Riehs, Eva Očenášová, Jana Altmannová', null, 'While visiting Russia on his father’s lecture tour, Indy runs off on his own and meets Leo Tolstoy. Later, on a trip to Athens, Indy and his father are forced together by circumstance when they get into a bind in the monasteries of Meteora, where they share some memorable moments.', 'While visiting Russia on his father’s lecture tour, Indy runs off on his own and meets Leo Tolstoy. Later, on a trip to Athens, Indy and his father are forced together by circumstance when they get into a bind in the monasteries of Meteora, where they share some memorable moments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mn8PQOyUiuFw2BBbVNqsUHk5iuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222041'),
  ('36254555321212288', 'The Adventurous Blonde', 1937, 'Romance, Comedy, Mystery', 'Frank McDonald, Arthur L. Todd, Jesse Hibbs', 'Robertson White, David Diamond', 'Glenda Farrell, Barton MacLane, Anne Nagel, Tom Kennedy, George E. Stone, Natalie Moorhead, William Hopper, Charley Foy', null, 'The third of nine Torchy Blane movies. Angry that police detective Steve McBride (Barton MacLane) is giving preferential treatment to his reporter-fiancée, Torchy Blane (Glenda Farrell), reporters from a rival newspaper plan a fake murder with the idea that Torchy''s paper will print the story and look foolish. The tables are turned when the fake murder turns out to be the genuine article.', 'The third of nine Torchy Blane movies. Angry that police detective Steve McBride (Barton MacLane) is giving preferential treatment to his reporter-fiancée, Torchy Blane (Glenda Farrell), reporters from a rival newspaper plan a fake murder with the idea that Torchy''s paper will print the story and look foolish. The tables are turned when the fake murder turns out to be the genuine article.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqVMz4G1k8gIB6g5Tm2jPXHCvmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171345'),
  ('534739861506488244', 'The Adversary', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tinnu Anand, Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Dhritiman Chatterjee, Krishna Bose, Indira Devi, Kalyan Chatterjee, Jayasree Kabir, Debraj Ray, Soven Lahiri, Pisu Majumdar', null, 'Siddhartho Chowdhury, a brilliant young medical student, is forced to leave his studies after his father''s sudden demise. He is forced to navigate the high unemployment rate and the communist socio-political climate of 1960s Calcutta in search of a job. He lives in a flat with his younger, employed sister, revolutionary brother and widowed mother. The strain of the situation ultimately causes him to hallucinate.', 'Siddhartho Chowdhury, a brilliant young medical student, is forced to leave his studies after his father''s sudden demise. He is forced to navigate the high unemployment rate and the communist socio-political climate of 1960s Calcutta in search of a job. He lives in a flat with his younger, employed sister, revolutionary brother and widowed mother. The strain of the situation ultimately causes him to hallucinate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUGlRTP0DaidYWoE8IfoN9WO1eH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42498'),
  ('635853157001191870', 'The Adversary', 2002, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Nicole Garcia, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Nicole Garcia, Frédéric Bélier-Garcia', 'Daniel Auteuil, Géraldine Pailhas, François Cluzet, François Berléand, Emmanuelle Devos, Alice Fauvet, Martin Jobert, Michel Cassagne', null, 'Based on the 2000 book of the same name by Emmanuel Carrère, it is inspired by the real-life story of Jean-Claude Romand. L''Adversaire''s protagonist Jean-Marc Faure (Auteuil) pursues an imaginary career as a doctor of medicine in a plot more closely based on Romand''s life and Carrère''s book than was Laurent Cantet''s 2001 film L''Emploi du Temps. The film was nominated for a Palme d''Or at the 2002 Cannes Film Festival.', 'Based on the 2000 book of the same name by Emmanuel Carrère, it is inspired by the real-life story of Jean-Claude Romand. L''Adversaire''s protagonist Jean-Marc Faure (Auteuil) pursues an imaginary career as a doctor of medicine in a plot more closely based on Romand''s life and Carrère''s book than was Laurent Cantet''s 2001 film L''Emploi du Temps. The film was nominated for a Palme d''Or at the 2002 Cannes Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aszdSOpOskv1THDeOvLKiQQwdJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52999'),
  ('104325588335614785', 'The Advocate: A Missing Body', 2015, 'Thriller, Action', 'Kim Ji-yong, Huh Jong-ho, Cho Gyu-young', 'Lee Gong-ju, Huh Jong-ho, Choi Kwan-young', 'Lee Sun-kyun, Jang Hyun-sung, Kim Go-eun, Im Won-hee, Kim Yoon-hye, Kwak Min-seok, Choi Jae-woong, Park Ji-young', null, 'When his client suddenly confesses to murder in open court, a hotshot attorney embarks on a search for truth to redeem his ruined reputation.', 'When his client suddenly confesses to murder in open court, a hotshot attorney embarks on a search for truth to redeem his ruined reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvSyI8t5fnbRZpDKrNcdxCE2uyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363790'),
  ('765683686255501269', 'The Aerial', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Esteban Sapir, Alejandro Cinelli, Christian Cottet', 'Esteban Sapir', 'Valeria Bertuccelli, Alejandro Urdapilleta, Julieta Cardinali, Rafael Ferro, Florencia Raggi, Sol Moreno, Jonathan Sandor, Raúl Hochman', null, 'An entire city has lost its voice. Mr. TV, the owner of the city''s only television channel, is carrying out a sinister plan to control all of the city''s inhabitants.', 'An entire city has lost its voice. Mr. TV, the owner of the city''s only television channel, is carrying out a sinister plan to control all of the city''s inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHe7E6zHtSnqa0iI7EO54jrHySE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13317'),
  ('658823380182388862', 'The Aeronauts', 2019, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Adam Lock, Jamie D. Allen, Mary Buri', 'Jack Thorne', 'Eddie Redmayne, Felicity Jones, Tom Courtenay, Phoebe Fox, Himesh Patel, Rebecca Front, Robert Glenister, Vincent Perez', 'PG-13', 'In 1862, daredevil balloon pilot Amelia Wren teams up with pioneering meteorologist James Glaisher to advance human knowledge of the weather and fly higher than anyone in history. While breaking records and advancing scientific discovery, their voyage to the very edge of existence helps the unlikely pair find their place in the world they have left far below them. But they face physical and emotional challenges in the thin air, as the ascent becomes a fight for survival.', 'In 1862, daredevil balloon pilot Amelia Wren teams up with pioneering meteorologist James Glaisher to advance human knowledge of the weather and fly higher than anyone in history. While breaking records and advancing scientific discovery, their voyage to the very edge of existence helps the unlikely pair find their place in the world they have left far below them. But they face physical and emotional challenges in the thin air, as the ascent becomes a fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZHnblqmTBUBgzYBIxWIz9txsEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514921'),
  ('207262084388075967', 'The Affair', 1967, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Mitsuji Kanau, Shigeo Fukasawa', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Tsutomu Tamura', 'Mariko Okada, Yoshie Minami, Tadahiko Sugano, Shigako Shimegi, Isao Kimura, Etsushi Takahashi, Tohru Emori, Katsumi Nezu', null, 'As a young woman, Oriko condemned her widowed mother for openly pursuing relationships with younger men. After her mother passes away, she finds herself in an unhappy, loveless marriage and begins to understand her mother’s actions.', 'As a young woman, Oriko condemned her widowed mother for openly pursuing relationships with younger men. After her mother passes away, she finds herself in an unhappy, loveless marriage and begins to understand her mother’s actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfa9NNDe9sU6zOPfwXvohgVueAB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179868'),
  ('630876220491579168', 'The Affair', 1995, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Seed, Ivan Strasburg', 'Bryan Goluboff', 'Courtney B. Vance, Kerry Fox, Leland Gantt, Ned Beatty, Bill Nunn, Ciarán Hinds, Beatie Edney, Fraser James', null, 'A black soldier in World War II England begins an affair with a white woman whose husband is a soldier currently overseas in battle and in doubts of her relationship with him as she discovered he had been having an affair with his secretary.', 'A black soldier in World War II England begins an affair with a white woman whose husband is a soldier currently overseas in battle and in doubts of her relationship with him as she discovered he had been having an affair with his secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xetJCX2Vr9for03Tsa8fzRtofDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142772'),
  ('359303064110848264', 'The Affair of the Necklace', 2001, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Charles Shyer, Ashley Rowe, Jean-Michel Hugon', 'John Sweet', 'Hilary Swank, Jonathan Pryce, Simon Baker, Adrien Brody, Brian Cox, Joely Richardson, Christopher Walken, Hayden Panettiere', 'R', 'In pre-Revolutionary France, a young aristocratic woman left penniless by the political unrest in the country, must avenge her family''s fall from grace by scheming to steal a priceless necklace.', 'In pre-Revolutionary France, a young aristocratic woman left penniless by the political unrest in the country, must avenge her family''s fall from grace by scheming to steal a priceless necklace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPgXAA5PzMCCWXYA3PsihgNkwht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19076'),
  ('614813823284788842', 'The Affairs of Anatol', 1921, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Cecil B. DeMille', 'Jeanie Macpherson', 'Wallace Reid, Gloria Swanson, Wanda Hawley, Theodore Roberts, Elliott Dexter, Theodore Kosloff, Agnes Ayres, Monte Blue', 'NR', 'Socialite Anatol Spencer, finding his relationship with his wife lackluster, goes in search of excitement. After bumping into old flame Emilie, he lets an apartment for her only to find that she cheats on him. He is subsequently robbed, conned, and booted from pillar to post. He decides to return to his wife and discovers her carousing with his best friend Max.', 'Socialite Anatol Spencer, finding his relationship with his wife lackluster, goes in search of excitement. After bumping into old flame Emilie, he lets an apartment for her only to find that she cheats on him. He is subsequently robbed, conned, and booted from pillar to post. He decides to return to his wife and discovers her carousing with his best friend Max.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBtHJOXtbSm9vfPDaH5JAovCYOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53772'),
  ('570185339338022667', 'The Affairs of Cellini', 1934, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Gregory La Cava, Charles Rosher, Fred Fox', 'Bess Meredyth', 'Constance Bennett, Fredric March, Frank Morgan, Fay Wray, Vince Barnett, Jessie Ralph, Louis Calhern, Jay Eaton', 'NR', 'The 16th-century sculptor woos the Duchess of Florence despite the duke.', 'The 16th-century sculptor woos the Duchess of Florence despite the duke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xY1ilGKLlLkLhtyYjmYAkOtMObw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112951'),
  ('92013807322201690', 'The African', 1983, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean Penzer', 'Philippe de Broca, Gérard Brach', 'Catherine Deneuve, Philippe Noiret, Jean-François Balmer, Jacques François, Jean Benguigui, Joseph Momo, Pierre Michaël, Gordon Heath', null, 'Charlotte flies to East Africa to build a tourist center near Lake Williams where the pygmies live. Here she meets her husband Victor, a devoted conservationist who left her three years ago to live in the jungle. Can you imagine his enthusiasm when she arrives at the conclusion that the ideal place to build this holiday resort is his kitchen garden?', 'Charlotte flies to East Africa to build a tourist center near Lake Williams where the pygmies live. Here she meets her husband Victor, a devoted conservationist who left her three years ago to live in the jungle. Can you imagine his enthusiasm when she arrives at the conclusion that the ideal place to build this holiday resort is his kitchen garden?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRkziEqiJEvaCAqDOlvJjEGbGuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71055'),
  ('802923487067578805', 'The African Desperate', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Martine Syms, Daisy Zhou', 'Rocket Caleshu, Martine Syms', 'Diamond Stingily, Erin Leland, Cammisa Buerhaus, Aaron Bobrow, Ruby McCollister, Erin Meuchner, Brent David Freaney, Rob Franklin', null, 'It’s MFA grad Palace Bryant’s final 24 hours in art school, and she is not going to the graduation party! She needs to get back home to Chicago from Upstate New York, but that means surviving a hazy, hilarious, and hallucinatory odyssey, stumbling from academic critiques to backseat hookups.', 'It’s MFA grad Palace Bryant’s final 24 hours in art school, and she is not going to the graduation party! She needs to get back home to Chicago from Upstate New York, but that means surviving a hazy, hilarious, and hallucinatory odyssey, stumbling from academic critiques to backseat hookups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJnpEwTA1RhnZCP5epnBf8O9vz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921629'),
  ('767994782400584813', 'The African Doctor', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Yannick Ressigeac, Romaric Thomas, Bruno Amestoy', 'Julien Rambaldi, Kamini Zantoko, Benoît Graffin', 'Marc Zinga, Aïssa Maïga, Jonathan Lambert, Rufus, Bayron Lebli, Médina Diarra, Jean-Benoît Ugeux, Stéphane Bissot', null, '1975. When Seyolo Zantoko, a doctor from the Congo who has managed, along with his family, to flee tyranny, is hired by the mayor of a small town in northern France, he begins a struggle to adapt to a new life and gain the trust of the prejudiced villagers.', '1975. When Seyolo Zantoko, a doctor from the Congo who has managed, along with his family, to flee tyranny, is hired by the mayor of a small town in northern France, he begins a struggle to adapt to a new life and gain the trust of the prejudiced villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7I7AxQAlvufEg2aWFd2HbS4f47B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393764'),
  ('551686028201927491', 'The African Lion', 1955, 'Documentary, Family', 'James Algar', null, 'Winston Hibler', 'G', 'Part of Disney''s True-Life Adventures series, this film focuses on the lives of lions in Africa.', 'Part of Disney''s True-Life Adventures series, this film focuses on the lives of lions in Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qjEMpNMd3Cgb6Wj4NZdqTHP1kO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113735'),
  ('176225670419646366', 'The African Queen', 1952, 'Romance, Adventure, Drama', 'John Huston, Jack Cardiff, Bill Herlihy', 'James Agee, John Huston', 'Humphrey Bogart, Katharine Hepburn, Robert Morley, Peter Bull, Theodore Bikel, Walter Gotell, Peter Swanwick, Richard Marner', 'PG', 'At the start of the First World War, in the middle of Africa’s nowhere, a gin soaked riverboat captain is persuaded by a strong-willed missionary to go down river and face-off a German warship.', 'At the start of the First World War, in the middle of Africa’s nowhere, a gin soaked riverboat captain is persuaded by a strong-willed missionary to go down river and face-off a German warship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ypg0KhQfFYWILelvHGtSHHR0dk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488'),
  ('137255423064070827', 'The After', 2024, 'Drama', 'Misan Harriman, Si Bell, Charlotte Miller', 'John Julius Schwabach', 'David Oyelowo, Jessica Kate Plummer, Amelie Dokubo, Ellen Francis, Sule Rimi, Tara-Binta Collins, Izuka Hoyle, Dominique Tipper', null, 'After losing a family member to a violent crime, a shattered rideshare driver picks up a passenger that forces him to confront his grief.', 'After losing a family member to a violent crime, a shattered rideshare driver picks up a passenger that forces him to confront his grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35AwGdQZVGePtkUa1lD2OlRv4UL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1169455'),
  ('931909597777629855', 'The After Party', 2018, 'Comedy, Music', 'Ian Edelman', 'Ian Edelman', 'Kyle Harvey, Harrison Holzer, Shelley Hennig, Jamie Choi, Teyana Taylor, Jordan Rock, Amin Joseph, Andy Buckley', null, 'When an aspiring rapper goes viral for the wrong reasons, he thinks his career is sunk. But a wild party gives him one more chance to make it right.', 'When an aspiring rapper goes viral for the wrong reasons, he thinks his career is sunk. But a wild party gives him one more chance to make it right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFPGheX6X4bt1ZqP1870MPlUvGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538604'),
  ('724419345414038497', 'The After-Dinner Mysteries', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Masato Hijikata, Yosuke Goto', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa', 'Keiko Kitagawa, Sho Sakurai, Kippei Shiina, Masatoshi Nakamura, Hitomi Miyauchi, Jun Kaname, Takeshi Kaga, Tomoka Kurotani', null, 'Kageyama (Sho Sakurai) works as the butler for rich heiress Reiko Hosho (Keiko Kitagawa). Reiko happens to be a novice detective but lacks certain deductive skills needed by detectives. Because of this Reiko relies on Kageyamaa to help her solve cases. Meanwhile, Kageyama isn''t afraid to mince words and often calls out Reiko with his sharp tongue!', 'Kageyama (Sho Sakurai) works as the butler for rich heiress Reiko Hosho (Keiko Kitagawa). Reiko happens to be a novice detective but lacks certain deductive skills needed by detectives. Because of this Reiko relies on Kageyamaa to help her solve cases. Meanwhile, Kageyama isn''t afraid to mince words and often calls out Reiko with his sharp tongue!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGef1VwP43wyEPGOwT71LkBBKtS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257327'),
  ('1048240103791090295', 'The Aftermath', 1982, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Steve Barkett', 'Steve Barkett', 'Steve Barkett, Lynne Margulies, Sid Haig, Christopher Barkett, Alfie Martin, Forrest J. Ackerman, Jim Danforth, Linda Stiegler', 'NR', 'After a lengthy space mission, two astronauts return to an Earth transformed by nuclear war. As renegade gangs and mutants rule Los Angeles, the astronauts join two pretty women and a couple of kids in a growing resistance movement.', 'After a lengthy space mission, two astronauts return to an Earth transformed by nuclear war. As renegade gangs and mutants rule Los Angeles, the astronauts join two pretty women and a couple of kids in a growing resistance movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lR7H61fx5Mn9cUq8oqT1moDBgxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46522'),
  ('171564499662608491', 'The Aftermath', 2019, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Nikki Molloy, Nige Watson, James Kent', 'Joe Shrapnel, Anna Waterhouse', 'Keira Knightley, Alexander Skarsgård, Jason Clarke, Martin Compston, Kate Phillips, Flora Thiemann, Jannik Schümann, Fionn O''Shea', 'R', 'In the aftermath of World War II, a British colonel and his wife are assigned to live in Hamburg during the post-war reconstruction, but tensions arise with the German widower who lives with them.', 'In the aftermath of World War II, a British colonel and his wife are assigned to live in Hamburg during the post-war reconstruction, but tensions arise with the German widower who lives with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofUC6lsZ8it9yEfrJJx50ihURRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433502'),
  ('835937481853181975', 'The Aga''s Testament', 1967, 'History, Adventure', 'Éva Zsurzs', 'István Fekete', 'Ferenc Bessenyei, Péter Benkő, Gyula Benkő, Teréz Várhegyi, Ági Szirtes, Klári Tolnay', null, 'In 1585 the Turks and Vallons are looting the Látrány region.', 'In 1585 the Turks and Vallons are looting the Látrány region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RUTI6SWYBmfuP6DxmsKL8Gp6tx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213513'),
  ('1028866248491071192', 'The Age of Adaline', 2015, 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Lee Toland Krieger, David Lanzenberg', 'Salvador Paskowitz, J. Mills Goodloe', 'Blake Lively, Michiel Huisman, Harrison Ford, Ellen Burstyn, Kathy Baker, Amanda Crew, Lynda Boyd, Hugh Ross', 'PG-13', 'After 29-year-old Adaline recovers from a nearly lethal accident, she inexplicably stops growing older. As the years stretch on and on, Adaline keeps her secret to herself until she meets a man who changes her life.', 'After 29-year-old Adaline recovers from a nearly lethal accident, she inexplicably stops growing older. As the years stretch on and on, Adaline keeps her secret to herself until she meets a man who changes her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MbILysGhjAbnZi1Okae9wYqLMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293863'),
  ('598046855461450460', 'The Age of Blood', 2017, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Kim Hong-sun', 'Kim Hong-sun, Kim Hwang-sung', 'Jung Hae-in, Kim Ji-hoon, Lee Won-jong, Jo Jae-yun, Hong Soo-ah, Ryu Tae-joon, Hong Seung-jin, Kwon Hae-sung', null, 'Ancient Korea, 1728. Swordsman Kim Ho, guard of King Yeong-jo of Joseon, is demoted and sent to work in Uigeumbu prison. When night falls, the prison is assaulted by the master warrior Do Man-cheol and his powerful henchmen for the purpose of freeing Lee In-jwa, who has been condemned to death for rising up in revolt against the king.', 'Ancient Korea, 1728. Swordsman Kim Ho, guard of King Yeong-jo of Joseon, is demoted and sent to work in Uigeumbu prison. When night falls, the prison is assaulted by the master warrior Do Man-cheol and his powerful henchmen for the purpose of freeing Lee In-jwa, who has been condemned to death for rising up in revolt against the king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Uq4CgE88is47CxKy2wYZJtLoWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488372'),
  ('156873330307426512', 'The Age of Disclosure', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Dan Farah, Vincent Wrenn', 'Dan Farah', 'Luis Elizondo, Jay Stratton, Harold E. Puthoff, Chris Mellon, James Clapper, Marco Rubio, Kirsten Gillibrand, André Carson', null, 'Director Dan Farah got 34 senior members of the U.S. Government, military, and intelligence community to come on camera. He says they reveal an 80 year cover-up of the existence of non-human intelligent life and a secret war amongst major nations to reverse engineer technology of non-human origin. The film explores the profound impact the situation has on the future of humanity, while providing a look behind-the-scenes with those at the forefront of the bi-partisan disclosure effort.', 'Director Dan Farah got 34 senior members of the U.S. Government, military, and intelligence community to come on camera. He says they reveal an 80 year cover-up of the existence of non-human intelligent life and a secret war amongst major nations to reverse engineer technology of non-human origin. The film explores the profound impact the situation has on the future of humanity, while providing a look behind-the-scenes with those at the forefront of the bi-partisan disclosure effort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVTGlKuJUeqgmznxhlpKDKClili.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422166'),
  ('537898697775072022', 'The Age of Innocence', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Martin Scorsese, Michael Ballhaus, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Jay Cocks, Martin Scorsese', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Michelle Pfeiffer, Winona Ryder, Alexis Smith, Geraldine Chaplin, Jonathan Pryce, Richard E. Grant, Alec McCowen', 'PG', 'In 19th century New York high society, a young lawyer falls in love with a woman separated from her husband, while he is engaged to the woman''s cousin.', 'In 19th century New York high society, a young lawyer falls in love with a woman separated from her husband, while he is engaged to the woman''s cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Tuyt26v7qNR8Cl3m7ZRx36rduf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10436'),
  ('225349180889738084', 'The Age of Man', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Raphael Fejtö, Mathias Raaflaub', 'Raphael Fejtö', 'Romain Duris, Aïssa Maïga, Clément Sibony, Rachid Djaïdani, Tarubi, Maria Jurado, Irina Solano, Nader Boussandel', null, 'Samuel is 30. Formerly a confirmed bachelor, he has been living with Tina – a photographer – for the past year but he gets scared when it’s time to commit. So he gives himself 24 hours to decide whether or not to break up with the woman he loves, convinced she will leave him sooner or later. By his side, Samuel can count on Jorge and Mounir, his usual confidants.', 'Samuel is 30. Formerly a confirmed bachelor, he has been living with Tina – a photographer – for the past year but he gets scared when it’s time to commit. So he gives himself 24 hours to decide whether or not to break up with the woman he loves, convinced she will leave him sooner or later. By his side, Samuel can count on Jorge and Mounir, his usual confidants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LQvFBacQ6MKitblYDfwUFsmJki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13731'),
  ('386485678287639633', 'The Age of Shadows', 2016, 'Action, Thriller, History', 'Lee Beom-seok, Kim Ji-yong, Kim Jee-woon', 'Lee Ji-min, Park Jong-dae', 'Song Kang-ho, Gong Yoo, Han Ji-min, Shingo Tsurumi, Um Tae-goo, Shin Sung-rok, Lee Byung-hun, Park Hee-soon', null, 'Set in the late 1920s, The Age of Shadows follows the cat-and-mouse game that unfolds between a group of resistance fighters trying to bring in explosives from Shanghai to destroy key Japanese facilities in Seoul, and Japanese agents trying to stop them.', 'Set in the late 1920s, The Age of Shadows follows the cat-and-mouse game that unfolds between a group of resistance fighters trying to bring in explosives from Shanghai to destroy key Japanese facilities in Seoul, and Japanese agents trying to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHiBkgmMY8QJQo2r5yXRhJ7P7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363579'),
  ('549050806023591531', 'The Age of Stupid', 2009, 'War, Documentary, History', 'Franny Armstrong', 'Franny Armstrong', 'Pete Postlethwaite, Babou Ceesay, Toyah Frantzen', null, 'Pete Postlethwaite stars as a man living alone in the devastated future world of 2055, looking at old footage from 2008 and asking: why didn’t we stop climate change when we had the chance?', 'Pete Postlethwaite stars as a man living alone in the devastated future world of 2055, looking at old footage from 2008 and asking: why didn’t we stop climate change when we had the chance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niaE9vnTER9eyklYiLVWpdrqcsi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24458'),
  ('337206145566899965', 'The Age of Swordfish', 1955, 'Documentary', 'Vittorio De Seta, Vera Gherarducci, Vittorio De Seta', 'Vittorio De Seta', null, null, 'A short anthropological documentary from 1954. Director De Seta was fortunate enough to document swordfish fishing; by 1956 it no longer existed.', 'A short anthropological documentary from 1954. Director De Seta was fortunate enough to document swordfish fishing; by 1956 it no longer existed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woHpjAB3IevmtyFEz1y0WcBpI3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148050'),
  ('1105730321025216869', 'The Age of the Earth', 1980, 'Drama, Fantasy, History', 'Glauber Rocha, Tizuka Yamasaki, Walter Schilke', 'Glauber Rocha', 'Maurício do Valle, Jece Valadão, Antônio Pitanga, Tarcísio Meira, Geraldo del Rey, Ana Maria Magalhães, Norma Bengell, Danuza Leão', null, 'Drawing inspiration from a poem penned by Castro Alves, this film vividly captures the political, cultural, and intellectual climate of Brazil during the late 1970s. At its core, the story revolves around four distinctive embodiments of Christ''s image: a black man, a soldier, an Indian, and a guerrilla fighter. These courageous individuals, hailed as the harbingers of doom in the tupiniquim lands, valiantly combat the insatiable avarice and oppressive "civilizing" brutality propagated by the formidable John Brahms—a foreign exploiter devoid of morals.', 'Drawing inspiration from a poem penned by Castro Alves, this film vividly captures the political, cultural, and intellectual climate of Brazil during the late 1970s. At its core, the story revolves around four distinctive embodiments of Christ''s image: a black man, a soldier, an Indian, and a guerrilla fighter. These courageous individuals, hailed as the harbingers of doom in the tupiniquim lands, valiantly combat the insatiable avarice and oppressive "civilizing" brutality propagated by the formidable John Brahms—a foreign exploiter devoid of morals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gwt93w3M5Cmh1l8HOPfoHuxBjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76816'),
  ('641014104874306917', 'The Ages of Lulu', 1990, 'Drama', 'Bigas Luna, Fernando Arribas, Ina Lüders', 'Almudena Grandes, Bigas Luna', 'Francesca Neri, Óscar Ladoire, María Barranco, Fernando Guillén Cuervo, Rosana Pastor, Javier Bardem, Juan Graell, Rodrigo Valverde', null, 'Fifteen-year-old Lulu has never known any affection from her family. But when she goes to a rock concert with Pablo, a friend of the family, he introduces Lulu to her first sexual experience. Years later, Pablo and Lulu have married; Pablo has created a sheltered, private world for Lulu, into which nothing intrudes. However, Lulu tires of her cloistered existence, and begins hanging out in shady bars, looking for vicarious thrills and danger.', 'Fifteen-year-old Lulu has never known any affection from her family. But when she goes to a rock concert with Pablo, a friend of the family, he introduces Lulu to her first sexual experience. Years later, Pablo and Lulu have married; Pablo has created a sheltered, private world for Lulu, into which nothing intrudes. However, Lulu tires of her cloistered existence, and begins hanging out in shady bars, looking for vicarious thrills and danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reyEwMbNZ88RjS9JP9FkY7vptp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53932'),
  ('1050165120550813547', 'The Aggression Scale', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'Steven C. Miller, Jeff Dolen', 'Ben Powell', 'Ryan Hartwig, Fabianne Therese, Ray Wise, Dana Ashbrook, Derek Mears, Jacob Reynolds, Joseph McKelheer, Boyd Kestner', 'R', 'When out-on-bail mob boss Bellavance discovers that $500,000 of his money is missing, he sends four hardcore hit men to send a "loud and messy" message to the suspected thieves'' families. But when the killers invade the Rutledge home, they''ll meet the household''s emotionally disturbed young son Owen. Owen has a history of violent behavior, knows how to make lethal booby-traps and is about to teach these thugs some deadly lessons in extreme vengeance.', 'When out-on-bail mob boss Bellavance discovers that $500,000 of his money is missing, he sends four hardcore hit men to send a "loud and messy" message to the suspected thieves'' families. But when the killers invade the Rutledge home, they''ll meet the household''s emotionally disturbed young son Owen. Owen has a history of violent behavior, knows how to make lethal booby-traps and is about to teach these thugs some deadly lessons in extreme vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcZU1r2NrqU3cuAKs80y4qQ4an3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94818'),
  ('247286718468134938', 'The Agony and the Ecstasy', 1965, 'Drama, History', 'Carol Reed, Leon Shamroy', 'Philip Dunne', 'Charlton Heston, Rex Harrison, Diane Cilento, Harry Andrews, Alberto Lupo, Adolfo Celi, Venantino Venantini, Tomas Milian', null, 'During the Italian Renaissance, Pope Julius II contracts the influential artist Michelangelo to sculpt 40 statues for his tomb. When the pope changes his mind and asks the sculptor to paint a mural in the Sistine Chapel, Michelangelo doubts his painting skills and abandons the project. Divine inspiration returns Michelangelo to the mural, but his artistic vision clashes with the pope''s demanding personality and threatens the success of the historic painting.', 'During the Italian Renaissance, Pope Julius II contracts the influential artist Michelangelo to sculpt 40 statues for his tomb. When the pope changes his mind and asks the sculptor to paint a mural in the Sistine Chapel, Michelangelo doubts his painting skills and abandons the project. Divine inspiration returns Michelangelo to the mural, but his artistic vision clashes with the pope''s demanding personality and threatens the success of the historic painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZiwyXtyxYDmMnNiVemCPgxY8X6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36815'),
  ('1045114648772574664', 'The Agony of Byzantium', 1913, 'Drama, History', 'Louis Feuillade', 'Louis Feuillade', 'Luitz-Morat, Georges Melchior, Albert Reusy, Edmund Breon, Renée Carl', null, 'The fall of Constantinople to the Ottoman Turks, an event that marked the end of the Byzantine Empire.', 'The fall of Constantinople to the Ottoman Turks, an event that marked the end of the Byzantine Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znlEJSjde4rywjm89IZcJBhHEkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192044'),
  ('174618216943636071', 'The AI Doc: Or How I Became an Apocaloptimist', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Daniel Roher, Charlie Tyrell, Jenni Morello', null, 'Daniel Roher, Sam Altman, Daniela Amodei, Dario Amodei, Emily M. Bender, Yoshua Bengio, Liv Boeree, Ajeya Cotra', 'PG-13', 'A father-to-be tries to figure out what is happening with all this AI insanity, and explores the most powerful technology humanity has ever created... and what''s at stake if we get it wrong.', 'A father-to-be tries to figure out what is happening with all this AI insanity, and explores the most powerful technology humanity has ever created... and what''s at stake if we get it wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A610QT1gWjhJ1dJrXP9qMm4JMLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1596335'),
  ('418584934166784700', 'The Air I Breathe', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Jieho Lee, Walt Lloyd, Joaquin Silva', 'Jieho Lee, Bob DeRosa', 'Brendan Fraser, Andy Garcia, Kevin Bacon, Sarah Michelle Gellar, Clark Gregg, Emile Hirsch, Forest Whitaker, Kelly Hu', 'R', 'A gambler’s bet spiraling into chaos, a gangster''s prophetic visions, a pop star’s dark entanglement, a doctor’s desperate race against time to rescue his beloved... Four interconnected stories reveal life unfolding through four emotional pillars — joy, passion, grief, and love.', 'A gambler’s bet spiraling into chaos, a gangster''s prophetic visions, a pop star’s dark entanglement, a doctor’s desperate race against time to rescue his beloved... Four interconnected stories reveal life unfolding through four emotional pillars — joy, passion, grief, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hx89b5sinoXmkMNyK1PUgwjWQX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13641'),
  ('92446178527036720', 'The Air Up There', 1994, 'Family, Comedy', 'Paul Michael Glaser, Dick Pope', 'Max Apple', 'Kevin Bacon, Charles Gitonga Maina, Yolanda Vazquez, Mabutho ''Kid'' Sithole, Sean McCann, Dennis Patrick, Ilo Mutombo, Nigel Miguel', 'PG', 'Jimmy Dolan is a college basketball coach who wants a big promotion. To get it, he needs to make a dramatic find. He ends up deep in Africa, hoping to recruit Saleh, a huge basketball prodigy Jimmy glimpsed in a home movie. But Saleh is the chief''s son and has responsibilities at home, since the tribe''s land is threatened by a mining company with its own hotshot basketball team.', 'Jimmy Dolan is a college basketball coach who wants a big promotion. To get it, he needs to make a dramatic find. He ends up deep in Africa, hoping to recruit Saleh, a huge basketball prodigy Jimmy glimpsed in a home movie. But Saleh is the chief''s son and has responsibilities at home, since the tribe''s land is threatened by a mining company with its own hotshot basketball team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lY1yhtg0DRaMTzclYCXo0sP1kAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46094'),
  ('62624393873995496', 'The Airplane', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cédric Kahn, Michel Amathieu, Etienne Rohde', 'Ismaël Ferroukhi, Cédric Kahn, Gilles Marchand', 'Roméo Botzaris, Isabelle Carré, Vincent Lindon, Nicolas Briançon, Alicia Djemaï, Yves Penay, Sophie Guillemin, Rodolphe Pauly', null, 'Charly wishes a bicycle with all his heart for Christmas. Therefore his disappointment is bigger, when his father presents him a self-built plane...', 'Charly wishes a bicycle with all his heart for Christmas. Therefore his disappointment is bigger, when his father presents him a self-built plane...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9c7cAY4e4ffWJzCK8PV9Hnhgp8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56371'),
