  ('204379750663805132', 'The Alarmist', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Evan Dunsky, Alex Nepomniaschy', 'Evan Dunsky', 'David Arquette, Stanley Tucci, Kate Capshaw, Mary McCormack, Ryan Reynolds, Tricia Vessey, Ruth Miller, Hoke Howell', 'R', 'Young Tommy Hudler decides to become a security systems salesman, and is an instant success. Everything seems to be going great until he discovers there''s more to this business and his boss Heinrich than he previously suspected.', 'Young Tommy Hudler decides to become a security systems salesman, and is an instant success. Everything seems to be going great until he discovers there''s more to this business and his boss Heinrich than he previously suspected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbuzeIoIF7QuALZ6WnmTzaE7HO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108316'),
  ('185324433131200259', 'The Albatross', 1971, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Marcel Weiss', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Raphaël Delpard, Claude Veillot', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Marion Game, Paul Müller, André Le Gall, René-Jean Chauffard, Francis Terzian, Jean-Marie Richier, Robert Berri', null, 'A prisoner escapes and kidnaps a woman with her he falls in love. He''s involved in a bad business where politicians and underworld are leading the dance. He''ll die like the albatross in Baudelaire''s poem.', 'A prisoner escapes and kidnaps a woman with her he falls in love. He''s involved in a bad business where politicians and underworld are leading the dance. He''ll die like the albatross in Baudelaire''s poem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moh6dPWOH7pZXepXQ6ZGg65ZxkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66971'),
  ('81645179278045821', 'The Alchemist', 1983, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Andrew W. Friend, Charles Band, Nora Chavooshian', 'Alan J. Adler', 'Robert Ginty, Lucinda Dooling, John Sanderford, Viola Kates Stimpson, Robert Glaudini, Tony Abatemarco, Billy Scudder', 'R', 'A man seeks revenge on an evil magician who placed a curse on him.', 'A man seeks revenge on an evil magician who placed a curse on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EbwdAZC2AL97JHrEE0ZhpFU5bS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119595'),
  ('519952582444657710', 'The Alchemist Cookbook', 2016, 'Drama, Horror, Comedy', 'Bryan Reisberg, Daniel Falicki, Joel Potrykus', 'Joel Potrykus', 'Ty Hickson, Amari Cheatom, Fiji', null, 'Self-made chemist Sean, a recluse living in an old trailer in the woods, suffers from pill-popping delusions of fortune. When his manic attempts at cracking the ancient secret of alchemy go awry he unleashes something far more sinister and dangerous.', 'Self-made chemist Sean, a recluse living in an old trailer in the woods, suffers from pill-popping delusions of fortune. When his manic attempts at cracking the ancient secret of alchemy go awry he unleashes something far more sinister and dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mD37S35Ewj6gJpJjfeBEX2qlzsR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381063'),
  ('921307490733518326', 'The Alcove', 1985, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato', 'Ugo Moretti', 'Lilli Carati, Annie Belle, Laura Gemser, Al Cliver, Nello Pazzafini, Roberto Caruso, Steven Luotto, Susan Spafford', null, 'In 1936 Italy, Elio returns home from Africa with a present for his wife in the form of Zerbal, the daughter of a tribal king. Unbeknown to him, his neglected wife Alessandra has formed a relationship with Elio’s otherwise frigid secretary Velma who is less than pleased at Elio’s return.', 'In 1936 Italy, Elio returns home from Africa with a present for his wife in the form of Zerbal, the daughter of a tribal king. Unbeknown to him, his neglected wife Alessandra has formed a relationship with Elio’s otherwise frigid secretary Velma who is less than pleased at Elio’s return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipFdgjiF3wsDB8NdoLxloFEeHYl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50433'),
  ('672468692306032757', 'The Alibi', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Matt Checkowski, Kurt Mattila, Enrique Chediak', 'Noah Hawley', 'Steve Coogan, Rebecca Romijn, Selma Blair, James Brolin, Sam Elliott, Jaime King, John Leguizamo, James Marsden', 'R', 'Con man Ray Elliot decides to leave crime behind to start a company that sells fake alibis to clients who have been unfaithful to their significant others. It seems that the streetwise Ray has found his calling, until he unexpectedly becomes a murder suspect in a case involving one of his most influential customers. Now, as the police and an assassin called "The Mormon" track Ray, he and his attractive assistant, Lola, must clear their own names.', 'Con man Ray Elliot decides to leave crime behind to start a company that sells fake alibis to clients who have been unfaithful to their significant others. It seems that the streetwise Ray has found his calling, until he unexpectedly becomes a murder suspect in a case involving one of his most influential customers. Now, as the police and an assassin called "The Mormon" track Ray, he and his attractive assistant, Lola, must clear their own names.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PaZLT7vfCIU6p3nG0QkIvdrTpF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14938'),
  ('1025745538125651401', 'The Alien and Me', 2016, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Jesús Magaña Vázquez', 'Emiliano Flores Burillo, Fernando del Razo, Jesús Magaña Vázquez', 'Inés de Tavira, Juan Pablo Campa, Juan Ugarte, Francisco de la Fuente, Carlos Aragón, Gloria Toba, Jessy Bulbo, Tato Alexander', null, 'A punk band decides to hire a keyboard player in order to change their sound, despite the fact that this talented musician has Down Syndrome.', 'A punk band decides to hire a keyboard player in order to change their sound, despite the fact that this talented musician has Down Syndrome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNLetImXPLSb2Qr4tX7x2bkDPrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413562'),
  ('441217490930845334', 'The Alien Dead', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Fred Olen Ray', 'Fred Olen Ray, Martin Nicholas', 'Buster Crabbe, Ray Roberts, Linda Lewis, George Kelsey, Mike Bonavia, Dennis Underwood', 'R', 'A meteor strikes a houseboat in the swamps near a southern town populated by Yankees with fake accents. The people on the houseboat become zombies who feed on the alligators in the swamp. Once they run out of alligators, they start going for the citizens. A local scientist tries to figure out what''s happening to people once they start disappearing.', 'A meteor strikes a houseboat in the swamps near a southern town populated by Yankees with fake accents. The people on the houseboat become zombies who feed on the alligators in the swamp. Once they run out of alligators, they start going for the citizens. A local scientist tries to figure out what''s happening to people once they start disappearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqXgqVEYBH3msXc5nI01oQk8axD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25712'),
  ('720439340346662182', 'The Alien Factor', 1978, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Don Dohler, Britt McDonough', 'Don Dohler', 'Don Leifert, Tom Griffith, Richard Dyszel, Mary Mertens, Richard Geiwitz, George Stover, Eleanor Herman, Anne Frith', null, 'A spaceship containing specimens for an intergalactic zoo crashes on Earth near a small backwoods town. The specimens escape, and soon town folk start turning up mutilated.', 'A spaceship containing specimens for an intergalactic zoo crashes on Earth near a small backwoods town. The specimens escape, and soon town folk start turning up mutilated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XlKascfkq6CU6uzru8uLkMFZff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86633'),
