  ('635086846149543463', 'The Alienist', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos, Dib Lutfi', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos', 'Nildo Parente, Isabel Ribeiro, Leila Diniz, Arduíno Colassanti, Ana Maria Magalhães, Irene Stefânia, Manfredo Colassanti, Nelson Dantas', null, 'Father Simão Bacamarte arrives in the small town of Serafim to investigate a certain phenomenon of madness.', 'Father Simão Bacamarte arrives in the small town of Serafim to investigate a certain phenomenon of madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebtCIyezFFoNJow33JTWyCCEord.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147874'),
  ('602709637731125087', 'The All-Around Reduced Personality: Redupers', 1978, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Helke Sander, Katia Forbert', 'Helke Sander', 'Helke Sander, Joachim Baumann, Andrea Malkowsky, Ronny Tanner, Gesine Strempel, Gislind Nabakowski, Gisela Zies, Helga Storck', null, 'Edda Chiemnyjewski, a freelance press photographer and single mother living in 1970s West Berlin, is confronted with the fact that "a cook has no time for affairs of state". She also fails to find a market for the project she has been working on with her women′s photography group that seeks to document the city. While from today′s perspective the city, which becomes one of the film′s protagonists, looks like post-war Berlin, little has actually changed as regards the precarious existence of free-lancers. With a heavy dose of self-irony Helke Sander, who also plays the leading role, tells of a divided life in a divided city.', 'Edda Chiemnyjewski, a freelance press photographer and single mother living in 1970s West Berlin, is confronted with the fact that "a cook has no time for affairs of state". She also fails to find a market for the project she has been working on with her women′s photography group that seeks to document the city. While from today′s perspective the city, which becomes one of the film′s protagonists, looks like post-war Berlin, little has actually changed as regards the precarious existence of free-lancers. With a heavy dose of self-irony Helke Sander, who also plays the leading role, tells of a divided life in a divided city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ha8BOayr4iOUIyxIXzKizVwZFeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188165'),
  ('614354102673285424', 'The Alligator People', 1959, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery', 'Roy Del Ruth, Karl Struss, Herbert E. Mendelson', 'Orville H. Hampton', 'Beverly Garland, Bruce Bennett, Lon Chaney Jr., George Macready, Frieda Inescort, Richard Crane, Douglas Kennedy, Bill Bradley', 'NR', 'Under therapeutic hypnosis, a seemingly well-adjusted young woman tells a fantastic story, verified by lie detector, of her forgotten marriage to a man who disappeared on the day of their honeymoon, and of her search for him which takes her to a lonely mansion in a remote section of swampland tenanted by snakes, alligators, a drunken one-armed lout, a mysterious doctor, and a cold-hearted elderly woman who lives alone in a brooding manse.', 'Under therapeutic hypnosis, a seemingly well-adjusted young woman tells a fantastic story, verified by lie detector, of her forgotten marriage to a man who disappeared on the day of their honeymoon, and of her search for him which takes her to a lonely mansion in a remote section of swampland tenanted by snakes, alligators, a drunken one-armed lout, a mysterious doctor, and a cold-hearted elderly woman who lives alone in a brooding manse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YsmJfZvQQG0V640rLlFPpxReWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43105'),
  ('913048703380216137', 'The Allnighter', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tamar Simon Hoffs, Joseph D. Urbanczyk', 'Tamar Simon Hoffs, M.L. Kessler', 'Susanna Hoffs, Dedee Pfeiffer, Joan Cusack, John Terlesky, James Shanta, Michael Ontkean, Pam Grier, Phillip Brock', 'PG-13', 'Molly, Val and Gina are graduating college, but on their final night, frustrations are aired. Molly is still looking for real love and Val is beginning to doubt if that is what she has found. Gina is too busy videotaping everything to really notice. When the final party at Pacifica College kicks off, things do not go exactly as planned.', 'Molly, Val and Gina are graduating college, but on their final night, frustrations are aired. Molly is still looking for real love and Val is beginning to doubt if that is what she has found. Gina is too busy videotaping everything to really notice. When the final party at Pacifica College kicks off, things do not go exactly as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ypV4mw030VxYEIA8jba3A7MMBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37818'),
  ('697345336369161749', 'The Alpha Incident', 1978, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bill Rebane, Barbara J. Rebane, Ernie Santell', 'Ingrid Neumayer', 'Ralph Meeker, Stafford Morgan, John F. Goff, Carol Irene Newell, George Buck Flower, Paul Bentzen, John Alderman, Ray Szmanda', 'PG', 'A microorganism from Mars, brought to Earth by a space probe, terrorizes passengers in a railroad office.', 'A microorganism from Mars, brought to Earth by a space probe, terrorizes passengers in a railroad office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euncYTeMDDFfpe7BSFVNfv0yRov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35664'),
