  ('952388991515059572', 'The Alphabet Murders', 1965, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Frank Tashlin, Desmond Dickinson, David Tomblin', 'David Pursall, Jack Seddon', 'Tony Randall, Anita Ekberg, Robert Morley, Maurice Denham, Guy Rolfe, Sheila Allen, James Villiers, Julian Glover', 'NR', 'The Belgian detective Hercule Poirot investigates a series of murders in London in which the victims are killed according to their initials.', 'The Belgian detective Hercule Poirot investigates a series of murders in London in which the victims are killed according to their initials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiBmQsxpMage7Vbs7NgUZT4EkhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6026'),
  ('320624997820780590', 'The Alpines', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Dante Aubain', 'Mally Corrigan', 'Aaron Latta-Morissette, Mally Corrigan, Katrina Flick, Jessie Mac, Niguel Quinn, Michael Taveira, Daniel Victor', null, 'The Alpines is a psychological thriller that follows seven friends coming together for a weekend getaway after several years of little to no contact. They''ve grown apart. They''ve moved on with their lives. But the secrets of their past have come back to haunt them. This time with a very real threat ready to expose every last one.', 'The Alpines is a psychological thriller that follows seven friends coming together for a weekend getaway after several years of little to no contact. They''ve grown apart. They''ve moved on with their lives. But the secrets of their past have come back to haunt them. This time with a very real threat ready to expose every last one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qED4kIfRAG0rtnjMp7QsWolP6H1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853566'),
  ('860510675267925631', 'The Alpinist', 2021, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'Peter Mortimer, Nick Rosen', null, 'Marc-André Leclerc, Brette Harrington, Alex Honnold, Reinhold Messner, Ueli Steck, Dean Potter, Derek Hersey, Jon Walsh', 'PG-13', 'Marc-André Leclerc, an exceptional climber, has made solo his religion and ice his homeland. When filmmaker Peter Mortimer begins his film, he places his camera at the base of a British Columbia cliff and waits patiently for the star climber to come down to answer his questions. Marc André, a little uncomfortable, prefers to return to the depths of the forest where he lives in a tent with his girlfriend Brette Harrington. In the heart of winter, Peter films vertiginous solos on fragile ice. He tries to make appointments with the climber who is never there and does not seem really concerned by this camera pointed at him "For me, it would not be a solo if there was someone else" . Marc-André is thus, the "pure light" of the mountaineers of his time, which marvel Barry Blanchard, Alex Honnold or Reinhold Messner, interviewed in the film. An event film for an extraordinary character.', 'Marc-André Leclerc, an exceptional climber, has made solo his religion and ice his homeland. When filmmaker Peter Mortimer begins his film, he places his camera at the base of a British Columbia cliff and waits patiently for the star climber to come down to answer his questions. Marc André, a little uncomfortable, prefers to return to the depths of the forest where he lives in a tent with his girlfriend Brette Harrington. In the heart of winter, Peter films vertiginous solos on fragile ice. He tries to make appointments with the climber who is never there and does not seem really concerned by this camera pointed at him "For me, it would not be a solo if there was someone else" . Marc-André is thus, the "pure light" of the mountaineers of his time, which marvel Barry Blanchard, Alex Honnold or Reinhold Messner, interviewed in the film. An event film for an extraordinary character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYbSGAVbyACEExptLu63CxCGm4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682587'),
  ('328965917030242303', 'The Alto Knights', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Barry Levinson, Taura C.C. Rivera, Ryan Robert Howard', 'Nicholas Pileggi', 'Robert De Niro, Debra Messing, Cosmo Jarvis, Kathrine Narducci, Michael Rispoli, Michael Adler, Ed Amatrudo, Joe Bacino', 'R', 'Two of New York''s most notorious organized crime bosses, Frank Costello and Vito Genovese, vie for control of the city''s streets. Once the best of friends, petty jealousies and a series of betrayals place them on a deadly collision course that will reshape the Mafia (and America) forever.', 'Two of New York''s most notorious organized crime bosses, Frank Costello and Vito Genovese, vie for control of the city''s streets. Once the best of friends, petty jealousies and a series of betrayals place them on a deadly collision course that will reshape the Mafia (and America) forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epGF8vv3caKLm6X8PKbD5xirFLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013601'),
  ('22581120079329830', 'The Amateur', 1981, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Charles Jarrott, John Coquillon', 'Diana Maddox', 'John Savage, Christopher Plummer, Marthe Keller, Arthur Hill, Nicholas Campbell, George Coe, John Marley, Jan Rubeš', 'R', 'A researcher for the CIA who convinces his superiors to send him to the eastern bloc in order to avenge the murder of his wife by enemy agents discovers a web of deception underneath his wife''s death.', 'A researcher for the CIA who convinces his superiors to send him to the eastern bloc in order to avenge the murder of his wife by enemy agents discovers a web of deception underneath his wife''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6B3QqpsRraPPQA6SthhOQs4DL1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21294'),
  ('524449106029260054', 'The Amateur', 2025, 'Thriller, Action', 'Martin Ruhe, James Hawes, Kevin Timon Hill', 'Ken Nolan, Gary Spinelli', 'Rami Malek, Holt McCallany, Danny Sapani, Rachel Brosnahan, Michael Stuhlbarg, Laurence Fishburne, Julianne Nicholson, Caitríona Balfe', 'PG-13', 'After his life is turned upside down when his wife is killed in a London terrorist attack, a brilliant but introverted CIA decoder takes matters into his own hands when his supervisors refuse to take action.', 'After his life is turned upside down when his wife is killed in a London terrorist attack, a brilliant but introverted CIA decoder takes matters into his own hands when his supervisors refuse to take action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SNEoUInCa5fAgwuEBMIMBGvkkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1087891'),
  ('737794199402380192', 'The Amateurs', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Michael Traeger, Denis Maloney', 'Michael Traeger', 'Jeff Bridges, Lauren Graham, Ted Danson, Tim Blake Nelson, Joe Pantoliano, Patrick Fugit, William Fichtner, John Hawkes', 'R', 'Sex sells in America and these guys know it. The Amateurs follows a small town band of loveable losers who hit upon an idea that can make their dreams and fantasies come true. Thinking they''ve found the road to riches and fame they decide to make the world''s most innocent adult film. Everyman''s fantasy turns into a hilarious misadventure when they find they''re in way over their heads.', 'Sex sells in America and these guys know it. The Amateurs follows a small town band of loveable losers who hit upon an idea that can make their dreams and fantasies come true. Thinking they''ve found the road to riches and fame they decide to make the world''s most innocent adult film. Everyman''s fantasy turns into a hilarious misadventure when they find they''re in way over their heads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kj4ZZpyP95ltT4ZF2c6aiyEH5N9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17035'),
  ('414261782898162513', 'The Amazing Bulk', 2012, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure, Animation', 'Lewis Schoenbrun, David S. Sterling, Dennis Devine', 'Keith Schaffner', 'Jordan Lawson, Shevaun Kastl, Terence Lording, Randal Malone, Juliette Angeli, Jed Rowen, Deirdre V. Lyons, Mark E. Fletcher', 'PG-13', 'Henry Howard, an ambitious young scientist struggles to develop a super human serum designed to improve muscle mass and prolong life expectancy. His boss, the grumpy General Darwin, will not allow Hank to marry his daughter, Hannah, until the experiment is a success. Against Darwin''s wishes Hank proposes to Hannah anyway, but his life is shattered by a mugger who steals his engagement ring. Dejected, Hank injects himself with the experimental serum and is transformed into the Amazing Bulk. The Bulk goes on a rampage through the city destroying everything in his path. Hank is caught by a relentless detective, imprisoned by Darwin and forced to battle the sadistic Dr. Kantlove, who threatens to blow up the moon with his arsenal of weapons.', 'Henry Howard, an ambitious young scientist struggles to develop a super human serum designed to improve muscle mass and prolong life expectancy. His boss, the grumpy General Darwin, will not allow Hank to marry his daughter, Hannah, until the experiment is a success. Against Darwin''s wishes Hank proposes to Hannah anyway, but his life is shattered by a mugger who steals his engagement ring. Dejected, Hank injects himself with the experimental serum and is transformed into the Amazing Bulk. The Bulk goes on a rampage through the city destroying everything in his path. Hank is caught by a relentless detective, imprisoned by Darwin and forced to battle the sadistic Dr. Kantlove, who threatens to blow up the moon with his arsenal of weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mClp6KhHY42iDQIC5Spha8ozbvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109125'),
  ('152399628095974321', 'The Amazing Captain Nemo', 1978, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Alex March, Lamar Boren', 'Preston Wood, Larry Alexander, Robert Bloch', 'José Ferrer, Burgess Meredith, Mel Ferrer, Horst Buchholz, Tom Hallick, Burr DeBenning, Lynda Day George, Warren Stevens', 'G', 'Captain Nemo is found in suspended animation under the sea and revived by modern-day Navy men in order to battle a fiendish mad scientist.', 'Captain Nemo is found in suspended animation under the sea and revived by modern-day Navy men in order to battle a fiendish mad scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19VzZoyC0udUZ6bLI3xsA3gcV9M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1851'),
  ('475514152391632576', 'The Amazing Catfish', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claudia Sainte-Luce, Agnès Godard', 'Claudia Sainte-Luce', 'Ximena Ayala, Lisa Owen, Sonia Franco, Wendy Guillén, Andrea Baeza, Alejandro Ramírez-Muñoz, Vera Wilson, Cynthia Bordes', 'NR', 'Young Claudia works in a supermarket where she promotes various types of products. One night, she ends up in the emergency room with severe appendicitis and meets Martha, a patient, laying in the bed next to hers.', 'Young Claudia works in a supermarket where she promotes various types of products. One night, she ends up in the emergency room with severe appendicitis and meets Martha, a patient, laying in the bed next to hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZ9wdeh2jXZJYUxngOapEUsCVYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215924'),
  ('959230229587730966', 'The Amazing Colossal Man', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'Bert I. Gordon, Joseph F. Biroc, Jack R. Berne', 'George Worthing Yates', 'Glenn Langan, Cathy Downs, William Hudson, Larry Thor, James Seay, Russ Bender, Hank Patterson, Frank Jenks', null, 'Lt. Col. Glenn Manning is inadvertently exposed to a plutonium bomb blast and although he sustains burns over 90% of his body, he survives. Then he begins to grow, but as he grows he starts losing his mind. By the time he stops he is 50 ft tall, insane and is on the rampage.', 'Lt. Col. Glenn Manning is inadvertently exposed to a plutonium bomb blast and although he sustains burns over 90% of his body, he survives. Then he begins to grow, but as he grows he starts losing his mind. By the time he stops he is 50 ft tall, insane and is on the rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nq0DFAzu4qTcmNk8jwkvXmO9SQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43241'),
  ('894864328454385218', 'The Amazing Dobermans', 1976, 'Crime, Comedy, Family', 'Byron Chudnow, Gregory Sandor', 'William Goldstein, Michael Kraike, Richard Chapman', 'Fred Astaire, James Franciscus, Barbara Eden, Jack Carter, Billy Barty, Charlie Brill, Parley Baer, James Almanzar', 'G', 'An ex-con man and his five trained Dobermans help a Treasury Dept. agent stop a racketeer and his gang.', 'An ex-con man and his five trained Dobermans help a Treasury Dept. agent stop a racketeer and his gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htM7PcpsL4kLqdGEZMMnYzXmeto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130024'),
