  ('637788226954812001', 'The Amazing Quest of Ernest Bliss', 1936, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Alfred Zeisler, Otto Heller', 'John L. Balderston', 'Cary Grant, Mary Brian, Peter Gawthorne, Henry Kendall, Leon M. Lion, John Turnbull, Arthur Hardy, Iris Ashley', 'NR', 'A bored millionaire wagers his doctor that he can support himself at a working class job for a year without touching his inheritance.', 'A bored millionaire wagers his doctor that he can support himself at a working class job for a year without touching his inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rR6G2EWvt5ykKzb7mSuc17GnFAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35810'),
  ('330366978561574231', 'The Amazing Screw-On Head', 2006, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Horror, TV Movie', 'Chris Prynoski', 'Mike Mignola, Bryan Fuller', 'Paul Giamatti, David Hyde Pierce, Patton Oswalt, Corey Burton, Mindy Sterling, Molly Shannon', 'NR', 'Based on the award-winning comic book by Mike Mignola (creator of Hellboy), The Amazing Screw-On Head chronicles the adventures of a Civil War-era secret agent with an extraordinary special power who serves under president Abraham Lincoln.', 'Based on the award-winning comic book by Mike Mignola (creator of Hellboy), The Amazing Screw-On Head chronicles the adventures of a Civil War-era secret agent with an extraordinary special power who serves under president Abraham Lincoln.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTANNf43FKKxN5bEGNGIhBF9Wg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213110'),
  ('759561424912682425', 'The Amazing Spider-Man', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Marc Webb, John Schwartzman, Christina Fong', 'James Vanderbilt, Alvin Sargent, Steve Kloves', 'Andrew Garfield, Emma Stone, Rhys Ifans, Denis Leary, Martin Sheen, Sally Field, Irrfan Khan, Campbell Scott', 'PG-13', 'Peter Parker is an outcast high schooler abandoned by his parents as a boy, leaving him to be raised by his Uncle Ben and Aunt May. Like most teenagers, Peter is trying to figure out who he is and how he got to be the person he is today. As Peter discovers a mysterious briefcase that belonged to his father, he begins a quest to understand his parents'' disappearance – leading him directly to Oscorp and the lab of Dr. Curt Connors, his father''s former partner. As Spider-Man is set on a collision course with Connors'' alter ego, The Lizard, Peter will make life-altering choices to use his powers and shape his destiny to become a hero.', 'Peter Parker is an outcast high schooler abandoned by his parents as a boy, leaving him to be raised by his Uncle Ben and Aunt May. Like most teenagers, Peter is trying to figure out who he is and how he got to be the person he is today. As Peter discovers a mysterious briefcase that belonged to his father, he begins a quest to understand his parents'' disappearance – leading him directly to Oscorp and the lab of Dr. Curt Connors, his father''s former partner. As Spider-Man is set on a collision course with Connors'' alter ego, The Lizard, Peter will make life-altering choices to use his powers and shape his destiny to become a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jexoNYnPd6vVrmygwF6QZmWPFdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1930'),
  ('624057880074763568', 'The Amazing Spider-Man 2', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Marc Webb, Dan Mindel, Eric Lewis Beauzay', 'Alex Kurtzman, Roberto Orci, Jeff Pinkner', 'Andrew Garfield, Emma Stone, Jamie Foxx, Dane DeHaan, Colm Feore, Felicity Jones, Paul Giamatti, Sally Field', 'PG-13', 'For Peter Parker, life is busy. Between taking out the bad guys as Spider-Man and spending time with the person he loves, Gwen Stacy, high school graduation cannot come quickly enough. Peter has not forgotten about the promise he made to Gwen’s father to protect her by staying away, but that is a promise he cannot keep. Things will change for Peter when a new villain, Electro, emerges, an old friend, Harry Osborn, returns, and Peter uncovers new clues about his past.', 'For Peter Parker, life is busy. Between taking out the bad guys as Spider-Man and spending time with the person he loves, Gwen Stacy, high school graduation cannot come quickly enough. Peter has not forgotten about the promise he made to Gwen’s father to protect her by staying away, but that is a promise he cannot keep. Things will change for Peter when a new villain, Electro, emerges, an old friend, Harry Osborn, returns, and Peter uncovers new clues about his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bU7nTmvmy0h3VUP01v1T2imgH6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102382'),
  ('90843486334690114', 'The Amazing Transparent Man', 1960, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Thriller', 'Edgar G. Ulmer, Meredith M. Nicholson, Leonard J. Shapiro', 'Jack Lewis', 'Marguerite Chapman, Douglas Kennedy, James Griffith, Ivan Triesault, Boyd ''Red'' Morgan, Cormel Daniel, Edward Erwin, Jonathan Ledford', 'NR', 'An ex-major forces a scientist to develop a invisibility formula, with which he plans to create an invisible army and sell it to the highest bidder. However there are side effects to the formula.', 'An ex-major forces a scientist to develop a invisibility formula, with which he plans to create an invisible army and sell it to the highest bidder. However there are side effects to the formula.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOME46GMTef0rkseEi4phAo4gRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31634'),
  ('445729084296278686', 'The Amazing Transplant', 1971, 'Fantasy, Mystery, Horror, Crime', 'Doris Wishman, C. Davis Smith', 'Doris Wishman', 'João Fernandes, Linda Southern, Larry Hunter, Olive Denneccio, Mary Lamay, Kim Pope, Bernard Marcel, Susan Landau', 'R', 'A nice guy turns murderous after undergoing a penis transplant.', 'A nice guy turns murderous after undergoing a penis transplant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvGkoNV0WnfcmJq3iJMNLFGoeZj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94261'),
  ('117126080725352759', 'The Amazing Truth About Queen Raquela', 2008, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Olaf de Fleur Johannesson', null, 'Raquela Rios, Olivia Galudo, Stefan C. Schaefer', null, 'Raquela is a transsexual, or lady boy, from the Philippines, who dreams of escaping the streets of Cebu City for a fairy tale life in Paris. In order to make her dreams come true, she turns from prostitution toward the more lucrative business of Internet porn. Her success as a porn star brings new friends, including Valerie, a lady boy in Iceland, and Michael, the owner of the website Raquela works for. Valerie helps Raquela get as far as Iceland. From there, Michael offers her a rendezvous in Paris. Will Paris be everything she dreamed of? And will Michael turn out to be her Prince Charming?', 'Raquela is a transsexual, or lady boy, from the Philippines, who dreams of escaping the streets of Cebu City for a fairy tale life in Paris. In order to make her dreams come true, she turns from prostitution toward the more lucrative business of Internet porn. Her success as a porn star brings new friends, including Valerie, a lady boy in Iceland, and Michael, the owner of the website Raquela works for. Valerie helps Raquela get as far as Iceland. From there, Michael offers her a rendezvous in Paris. Will Paris be everything she dreamed of? And will Michael turn out to be her Prince Charming?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dd6S4Q1x55kBgBaKkwbVp497V15.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54911'),
  ('493760621991675101', 'The Ambassador', 1985, 'Drama, Thriller', 'J. Lee Thompson, Adam Greenberg', 'Ronald M. Cohen, Max Jack', 'Robert Mitchum, Ellen Burstyn, Rock Hudson, Fabio Testi, Donald Pleasence, Chelli Goldenberg, Michal Bat-Adam, Ori Levy', 'PG', 'An American ambassador to Israel tries to bring peace to the Middle East conflict through unconventional methods, but his efforts are hampered at every turn and his personal life threatened.', 'An American ambassador to Israel tries to bring peace to the Middle East conflict through unconventional methods, but his efforts are hampered at every turn and his personal life threatened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mcYdWE0bYIqDkEPdiO2ypfcQ3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167484'),
  ('670837875560210948', 'The Ambassador', 2011, 'Documentary, History', 'Mads Brügger', null, 'Mads Brügger', 'NR', 'Danish journalist Mads Brügger goes undercover as a Liberian Ambassador to embark on a dangerous yet hysterical journey to uncover the blood diamond trade in Africa.', 'Danish journalist Mads Brügger goes undercover as a Liberian Ambassador to embark on a dangerous yet hysterical journey to uncover the blood diamond trade in Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgxu7aVRwQ3e1IlrKQOQEi1jeMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84172'),
  ('65123865336568941', 'The Ambiguous Focus', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Xu Fangyi', 'Ryan Xia', 'Huang Li-feng, John Wu', 'NR', 'Torn by betrayal, Zhang Nan and Zhe must face the past and decide if their love can survive—or if it’s time to walk away for good.', 'Torn by betrayal, Zhang Nan and Zhe must face the past and decide if their love can survive—or if it’s time to walk away for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljjJX43lwg6S3ZLPeSRWjJryMLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486906'),
  ('898091164902157394', 'The Ambitious', 1970, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Daisuke Itō', 'Daisuke Itō', 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Toshirō Mifune, Keiju Kobayashi, Tatsuya Nakadai, Sayuri Yoshinaga, Katsuo Nakamura, Noboru Nakaya, Eitarō Matsuyama', null, 'The story of Ryoma Sakamoto, considered to be the architect behind the downfall of the Tokugawa shogunate. He was considered an outlaw by his own clan, hunted by his government, and was despised by supporters of the Shogun as well as the Loyalists for desiring the opening of Japan to the West in order to learn its technology, in the hopes of one day defeating the West with a modern army and navy.', 'The story of Ryoma Sakamoto, considered to be the architect behind the downfall of the Tokugawa shogunate. He was considered an outlaw by his own clan, hunted by his government, and was despised by supporters of the Shogun as well as the Loyalists for desiring the opening of Japan to the West in order to learn its technology, in the hopes of one day defeating the West with a modern army and navy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7l6lLO3gVOF9Xizc5HOsOXhtlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284011'),
  ('914703854162244245', 'The Ambulance', 1990, 'Action, Thriller, Comedy', 'Larry Cohen, Jacques Haitkin', 'Larry Cohen', 'Eric Roberts, Megan Gallagher, James Earl Jones, Red Buttons, Janine Turner, Eric Braeden, Richard Bright, James Dixon', 'R', 'When the woman of his dreams is snatched by a strange ambulance, a young man risks it all to find her and tracks down a trafficking ring.', 'When the woman of his dreams is snatched by a strange ambulance, a young man risks it all to find her and tracks down a trafficking ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nq9zbzTY93Hg8nhi2axGqobw1sc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79509'),
  ('901888269685881050', 'The Ambulance', 2005, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Laurits Munch-Petersen, Jan Pallesen, Jimmy Leavens', 'Laurits Munch-Petersen, Lars Andreas Pedersen', 'Thomas Bo Larsen, Paw Henriksen, Helle Fagralid, Charlotte Bidstrup, Nicolei Faber, Torbjørn Hummel, Rasmus Iversen, Lars Oluf Larsen', null, 'Two brothers commit a robbery to pay their dying mother''s medical bills and are forced to steal an ambulance during their getaway. But, unbeknownst to them, the ambulance has a dying heart patient and a hospital intern in the back.', 'Two brothers commit a robbery to pay their dying mother''s medical bills and are forced to steal an ambulance during their getaway. But, unbeknownst to them, the ambulance has a dying heart patient and a hospital intern in the back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGyVx66TCiZGf7UKBvuCOePdjZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15821'),
  ('527832287339429201', 'The Ambush', 2021, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Pierre Morel', 'Brandon Birtell, Kurtis Birtell', 'Marwan Abdullah, Khalifa Al Jassem, Mohammed Ahmed, Abdulla Saeed Bin Haider, Saeed Alharsh, Hassan Yousuf Alblooshi, Khalifa Albahri, Ghanim Nasser', 'R', 'It is the winter of 2018, the men and women of the UAE military are deployed to provide aid. At the Mocha Base, spirits are high as three Emirati soldiers anticipate an imminent return home. While on their final routine patrol, the three soldiers, Ali, Bilal and Hindasi are ambushed by heavily armed militants on their route, through a narrow canyon. Trapped, wounded, and out of communication range, the three soldiers realize the gravity of their situation. They are running out of options, munitions - and time. Back at the base, their commander receives word and realizes that the assault on the UAE army patrol was premeditated. A rescue mission is quickly put into action, but will air and land support reach the men in time, and will they survive?', 'It is the winter of 2018, the men and women of the UAE military are deployed to provide aid. At the Mocha Base, spirits are high as three Emirati soldiers anticipate an imminent return home. While on their final routine patrol, the three soldiers, Ali, Bilal and Hindasi are ambushed by heavily armed militants on their route, through a narrow canyon. Trapped, wounded, and out of communication range, the three soldiers realize the gravity of their situation. They are running out of options, munitions - and time. Back at the base, their commander receives word and realizes that the assault on the UAE army patrol was premeditated. A rescue mission is quickly put into action, but will air and land support reach the men in time, and will they survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEZJgTWjq5ex8lEvI6XcYMxnTSn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884452'),
  ('1090699028300249751', 'The Ambushers', 1967, 'Action, Comedy', 'Henry Levin, Edward Colman, Burnett Guffey', 'Herbert Baker', 'Dean Martin, Senta Berger, Janice Rule, James Gregory, Albert Salmi, Kurt Kasznar, Beverly Adams, David Mauro', 'NR', 'When an experimental flying saucer crashes, secret agent Matt Helm has to bring back the secret weapons hidden on board.', 'When an experimental flying saucer crashes, secret agent Matt Helm has to bring back the secret weapons hidden on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wplPG11BF4rxHamotqDeG4uIxaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36775'),
  ('72823031296269159', 'The American', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Martin Ruhe, Anton Corbijn, Denis Schnegg', 'Rowan Joffé', 'George Clooney, Violante Placido, Thekla Reuten, Paolo Bonacelli, Johan Leysen, Irina Björklund, Lars Hjelm, Björn Granath', 'R', 'Dispatched to a small Italian town to await further orders, assassin Jack embarks on a double life that may be more relaxing than is good for him.', 'Dispatched to a small Italian town to await further orders, assassin Jack embarks on a double life that may be more relaxing than is good for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OEOsRaBsSxD0qBtAhus0iKDzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27579'),
  ('837916495121331111', 'The American', 2023, 'Drama', 'Tomasz Naumiuk, Monika Mazur, Anne-Sophie Puget', 'James Napier Robertson', 'Talia Ryder, Diane Kruger, Oleg Ivenko, Natasha Alderslade, Natalia Osipova, Charlotte Ubben, Borys Szyc, Tomasz Kot', null, 'American ballet dancer Joy Womack is accepted into Moscow''s infamously tough Bolshoi Ballet Academy, with the dream of becoming a great ballerina.', 'American ballet dancer Joy Womack is accepted into Moscow''s infamously tough Bolshoi Ballet Academy, with the dream of becoming a great ballerina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dNpUdJHjCue7H22jQR1NIX1kou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714675'),
  ('877916170427324370', 'The American Astronaut', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction, Music', 'Cory McAbee, W. Mott Hupfel III', 'Cory McAbee', 'Joshua Taylor, Greg Russell Cook, Rocco Sisto, Cory McAbee, James Ransone, Annie Golden', null, 'Samual Curtis''s first mission in this bizarre science fiction musical comedy requires him to take a cat to a saloon on an asteroid. There, he meets his former dance partner (the Blueberry Pirate) and collects his payment: a device capable of producing a Real Live Girl. Including music by alternative rock group The Billy Nayer Show, this film began life as a live show with a loyal following.', 'Samual Curtis''s first mission in this bizarre science fiction musical comedy requires him to take a cat to a saloon on an asteroid. There, he meets his former dance partner (the Blueberry Pirate) and collects his payment: a device capable of producing a Real Live Girl. Including music by alternative rock group The Billy Nayer Show, this film began life as a live show with a loyal following.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeh8Rzyr7VJaZWep7Vi5MP1e5hG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21538'),
  ('54714296234869452', 'The American Backyard', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Pupi Avati, Mariantonia Avati, Cesare Bastelli', 'Pupi Avati, Tommaso Avati', 'Filippo Scotti, Rita Tushingham, Roberto De Francesco, Armando De Ceccon, Chiara Caselli, Massimo Bonetti, Morena Gentile, Mildred Gustafsson', null, 'A troubled young man falls for an American military auxiliary in postwar Italy. A year later, he relocates to the American Midwest to write his first novel, next to her elderly mother''s house—separated by a grim garden.', 'A troubled young man falls for an American military auxiliary in postwar Italy. A year later, he relocates to the American Midwest to write his first novel, next to her elderly mother''s house—separated by a grim garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIsE5JS94WU30W4u3ajpaNo7Bqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1191815'),
  ('206604995846321877', 'The American Beauty', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Robert Dhéry, Pierre Tchernia, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Alfred Adam, Robert Dhéry, Pierre Tchernia', 'Robert Dhéry, Colette Brosset, Louis de Funès, Michel Serrault, Jean Lefebvre, Alfred Adam, Robert Burnier, Pierre Dac', null, 'Marcel, a simple-minded factory worker, is tricked into buying a high-priced American convertable car by a widow determined not to let it fall into the hands of her late husband''s secretary/secret lover. Once in pocession of the car, Marcel only encounters one bad luck episode after another with the excessive gasoline consumtion, his wife trying to sell it to make ammends meet, getting into traffic jams, accidently riding into a car wash with the top down, and more.', 'Marcel, a simple-minded factory worker, is tricked into buying a high-priced American convertable car by a widow determined not to let it fall into the hands of her late husband''s secretary/secret lover. Once in pocession of the car, Marcel only encounters one bad luck episode after another with the excessive gasoline consumtion, his wife trying to sell it to make ammends meet, getting into traffic jams, accidently riding into a car wash with the top down, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyYTH4t5fEf66fpSP9L2vBIeebI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59969'),
  ('127523066014000783', 'The American Dream', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Marciano, Antony Diaz', 'Anthony Marciano', 'Jean-Pascal Zadi, Raphaël Quenard, Gregory Defleur, David Clark, Josh Casaubon, Etienne Guillou-Kervern, Gabriel Caballero, Momar Sakanoko', null, 'No one would have bet on Jérémy, stuck behind the counter of a video store, or on Bouna, who cleans airports. With no money, no connections, and speaking painfully poor English, who could have predicted they’d one day become big-name agents in the NBA ? What they lack in experience, they will make up for in audacity, while remaining true to their one credo, doing business with a human touch. Scouting raw talent while improvising their way up, they’ll fake it until they make it – chasing their American Dream and landing multi-million-dollar deals.', 'No one would have bet on Jérémy, stuck behind the counter of a video store, or on Bouna, who cleans airports. With no money, no connections, and speaking painfully poor English, who could have predicted they’d one day become big-name agents in the NBA ? What they lack in experience, they will make up for in audacity, while remaining true to their one credo, doing business with a human touch. Scouting raw talent while improvising their way up, they’ll fake it until they make it – chasing their American Dream and landing multi-million-dollar deals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXGqYv2cahBG062OQ93oMqWQCs5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1365378'),
  ('542566833644876410', 'The American Dreamer', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Lawrence Schiller, L.M. Kit Carson, Chuck Levey', 'L.M. Kit Carson, Dennis Hopper, Lawrence Schiller', 'Dennis Hopper, Lois Ursone, L.M. Kit Carson, Lawrence Schiller, Margareth Clémenti', null, 'A documentary about actor/director Dennis Hopper, showing him at his home and studio putting together his film "The Last Movie."', 'A documentary about actor/director Dennis Hopper, showing him at his home and studio putting together his film "The Last Movie."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4AJlgZdjcIigm1McY66yhebygT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126563'),
  ('362456398526816285', 'The American Friend', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Wim Wenders, Robby Müller, Emmanuel Clot', 'Wim Wenders', 'Dennis Hopper, Bruno Ganz, Lisa Kreuzer, Gérard Blain, Nicholas Ray, Samuel Fuller, Peter Lilienthal, Daniel Schmid', 'NR', 'Tom Ripley, an American who deals in forged art, is slighted at an auction in Hamburg by picture framer Jonathan Zimmerman. When Ripley is asked by gangster Raoul Minot to kill a rival, he suggests Zimmerman, and the two, exploiting Zimmerman''s terminal illness, coerce him into being a hitman.', 'Tom Ripley, an American who deals in forged art, is slighted at an auction in Hamburg by picture framer Jonathan Zimmerman. When Ripley is asked by gangster Raoul Minot to kill a rival, he suggests Zimmerman, and the two, exploiting Zimmerman''s terminal illness, coerce him into being a hitman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHVe5EHDFj9ac2F2aU86sWTGKnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11222'),
  ('907623706317458460', 'The American Mall', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Shawn Ku', 'Tomás Romero, P.J. Hogan', 'Nina Dobrev, Rob Mayes, Autumn Reeser, Yassmin Alers, Al Sapienza, Brooke Lyons, Bresha Webb, Bianca Collins', 'PG', 'The executive producers of High School Musical keep the good times rolling with this upbeat musical comedy set in the one place every American teenager''s home away from home - the local shopping mall. Ally (Nina Dobrev) is an optimistic adolescent singer/songwriter whose hard working mother owns the mall music shop frequented by every teen in town. When Ally shares her music with Joey (Rob Mayes), a janitor in the mall who harbors rock star ambitions, she is thrilled to find someone who can truly relate to her songs as well as her heart. Trouble looms on the horizon, however, in the form of the mall owner''s spoiled rotten daughter Madison (Autumn Reeser). Madison is the kind of girl who''s used to getting whatever she wants, and what she wants now could prove disastrous for both Ally''s ambitions, and her mother''s popular music store.', 'The executive producers of High School Musical keep the good times rolling with this upbeat musical comedy set in the one place every American teenager''s home away from home - the local shopping mall. Ally (Nina Dobrev) is an optimistic adolescent singer/songwriter whose hard working mother owns the mall music shop frequented by every teen in town. When Ally shares her music with Joey (Rob Mayes), a janitor in the mall who harbors rock star ambitions, she is thrilled to find someone who can truly relate to her songs as well as her heart. Trouble looms on the horizon, however, in the form of the mall owner''s spoiled rotten daughter Madison (Autumn Reeser). Madison is the kind of girl who''s used to getting whatever she wants, and what she wants now could prove disastrous for both Ally''s ambitions, and her mother''s popular music store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48wxXQeOl4T8sJx4BMV0IFntmF1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25041'),
  ('623751959256918713', 'The American Meme', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Bert Marcus, Abraham Martinez, Will Dearborn', 'Bert Marcus', 'Paris Hilton, Brittany Furlan, Hailey Bieber, Kirill Bichutsky, Dane Cook, DJ Khaled, Matthew Felker, Josh Ostrovsky', null, 'Paris Hilton, the Fat Jew, and Brittany Furlan have all used social media to achieve massive internet fame. But, American Meme explores, is it worth it?', 'Paris Hilton, the Fat Jew, and Brittany Furlan have all used social media to achieve massive internet fame. But, American Meme explores, is it worth it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xibKd8E4WefIqnwujHCJxd3sWBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520370'),
  ('867520792332533271', 'The American Nightmare', 2000, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Adam Simon', 'Adam Simon', 'George A. Romero, John Carpenter, Tom Savini, David Cronenberg, Wes Craven, Tobe Hooper, John Landis, Tom Gunning', 'R', 'An examination into the nature of 1960''s-70''s horror films, the involved artists, and how they reflected contemporary society.', 'An examination into the nature of 1960''s-70''s horror films, the involved artists, and how they reflected contemporary society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qE21nRtXgUKbDY94tEkCqimn0rg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70779'),
  ('804249545284327929', 'The American President', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Seale, Rob Reiner, Trevor Loomis', 'Aaron Sorkin', 'Michael Douglas, Annette Bening, Martin Sheen, Michael J. Fox, Anna Deavere Smith, Samantha Mathis, Shawna Waldron, David Paymer', 'PG-13', 'Widowed U.S. president Andrew Shepherd, one of the world''s most powerful men, can have anything he wants -- and what he covets most is Sydney Ellen Wade, a Washington lobbyist. But Shepherd''s attempts at courting her spark wild rumors and decimate his approval ratings.', 'Widowed U.S. president Andrew Shepherd, one of the world''s most powerful men, can have anything he wants -- and what he covets most is Sydney Ellen Wade, a Washington lobbyist. But Shepherd''s attempts at courting her spark wild rumors and decimate his approval ratings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yObOAYFIHXHkFPQ3jhgkN2ezaD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9087'),
  ('636884005392145416', 'The American Scream', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Mitchell Linden, Bryan England', 'Phil Hopper, Mitchell Linden', 'Pons Maar, Jennifer Darling, Matt Borlenghi, Riley Weston, Kevin Kaye, Jeanne Sapienza, James Cooper, George Buck Flower', 'R', 'An American family takes their classic Christmas vacation at a perfect mountain resort, but the strange residents of Wilson Creek seem to have something else planned... something gruesome.', 'An American family takes their classic Christmas vacation at a perfect mountain resort, but the strange residents of Wilson Creek seem to have something else planned... something gruesome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGwASgt098N9He0PUJDyMR3aBE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113344'),
  ('609451197551399108', 'The American Society of Magical Negroes', 2024, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Doug Emmett, Kobi Libii, Micheal Edward King', 'Kobi Libii', 'Justice Smith, David Alan Grier, An-Li Bogan, Drew Tarver, Michaela Watkins, Aisha Hinds, Tim Baltz, Rupert Friend', 'PG-13', 'A young man, Aren, is recruited into a secret society of magical Black people who dedicate their lives to a cause of utmost importance: making white people’s lives easier.', 'A young man, Aren, is recruited into a secret society of magical Black people who dedicate their lives to a cause of utmost importance: making white people’s lives easier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czV7JRPPPGk9bqUsnJuJUYn34mM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039773'),
