  ('939470582986189441', 'The Amityville Curse', 1990, 'Horror', 'Rodney Gibbons, Tom Berry, John Rainey', 'Michael Krueger, Norvell Rose', 'Kim Coates, Dawna Wightman, Helen Hughes, David Stein, Anthony Dean Rubeš, Cassandra Gava, Jan Rubeš, Norris Domingue', 'R', 'After purchasing a property in Amityville, New York, Debbie and her husband invite three of their closest friends to help renovate. Immediately uneasy in her new surroundings, she begins experiencing shockingly vivid nightmares.', 'After purchasing a property in Amityville, New York, Debbie and her husband invite three of their closest friends to help renovate. Immediately uneasy in her new surroundings, she begins experiencing shockingly vivid nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGTF4uusklWxN0kBBe3msPKPCrb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41848'),
  ('97073334633669408', 'The Amityville Harvest', 2020, 'Horror', 'David M. Parks, Thomas J. Churchill', 'Thomas J. Churchill', 'Kyle Lowder, Sadie Katz, Brandon Alan Smith, Johanna Rae, Alexa Pellerin, Michael Cervantes, Eva Ceja, George W. Scott', 'R', 'While staying at an aging manor to research its liquor-smuggling history, Christina and her documentary video team interview their spooky host Vincent—but no one can capture his image or voice on video. After shocking dreams and bloody encounters, the crew members fall under Victor’s hypnotic spell.', 'While staying at an aging manor to research its liquor-smuggling history, Christina and her documentary video team interview their spooky host Vincent—but no one can capture his image or voice on video. After shocking dreams and bloody encounters, the crew members fall under Victor’s hypnotic spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGYf7TKZPSvbI11IwoQBvbTCuq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732472'),
  ('117005453727503989', 'The Amityville Haunting', 2011, 'Horror', 'Geoff Meed, Ben Demaree', 'Geoff Meed', 'Nadine Crocker, Piper Kennedy, Mary LeGault, Amy Van Horne, Jason Williams, Kristen Hager Meed, Gracie Largent, Devin Clark', null, 'This movie is a ''found-footage'' film about the Benson family who move in to the infamous house where the DeFeo family were murdered in the 1970s over 30 years earlier. Things start happening to anyone who visits this house, and whoever lives there. This is the footage retrieved from the camera.', 'This movie is a ''found-footage'' film about the Benson family who move in to the infamous house where the DeFeo family were murdered in the 1970s over 30 years earlier. Things start happening to anyone who visits this house, and whoever lives there. This is the footage retrieved from the camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8T0AS932umKIhwh9vbnX1Nr44y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81185'),
  ('1055290438453921750', 'The Amityville Horror', 1979, 'Horror', 'Fred J. Koenekamp, Stuart Rosenberg, Benjamin Rosenberg', 'Sandor Stern', 'James Brolin, Margot Kidder, Rod Steiger, Don Stroud, Murray Hamilton, John Larch, Natasha Ryan, K.C. Martel', 'R', 'George Lutz, his wife Kathy, and their three children have just moved into a beautiful, and improbably cheap, Victorian mansion nestled in the sleepy coastal town of Amityville, Long Island. However, their dream home is concealing a horrific past and soon each member of the Lutz family is plagued with increasingly strange and violent visions and impulses.', 'George Lutz, his wife Kathy, and their three children have just moved into a beautiful, and improbably cheap, Victorian mansion nestled in the sleepy coastal town of Amityville, Long Island. However, their dream home is concealing a horrific past and soon each member of the Lutz family is plagued with increasingly strange and violent visions and impulses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VMscq0659xKmcXzd86de1DGV4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11449'),
  ('112927092659809680', 'The Amityville Horror', 2005, 'Horror', 'Andrew Douglas, Peter Lyons Collister, Craig A. Pinckes', 'Sandor Stern, Scott Kosar', 'Ryan Reynolds, Melissa George, Jesse James, Jimmy Bennett, Chloë Grace Moretz, Rachel Nichols, Philip Baker Hall, Isabel Conner', 'R', 'George Lutz, his wife Kathy, and their three children have just moved into a beautiful, and improbably cheap, Dutch colonial mansion nestled in the sleepy coastal town of Amityville, Long Island. However, their dream home is concealing a horrific past and soon each member of the Lutz family is plagued with increasingly strange and violent visions and impulses.', 'George Lutz, his wife Kathy, and their three children have just moved into a beautiful, and improbably cheap, Dutch colonial mansion nestled in the sleepy coastal town of Amityville, Long Island. However, their dream home is concealing a horrific past and soon each member of the Lutz family is plagued with increasingly strange and violent visions and impulses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4D246dpe7yy2GvHI2IbpeqkUXry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10065'),
  ('84903543794677998', 'The Amityville Murders', 2018, 'Horror', 'Sazzy Lee Calhoun, Daniel Farrands, Carlo Rinaldi', 'Daniel Farrands', 'John Robinson, Diane Franklin, Paul Ben-Victor, Chelsea Ricketts, Zane Austin, Noa Brenner, Kue Lawrence, Lainie Kazan', null, 'On the night of November 13th, 1974, Ronald DeFeo Jr. took a high powered rifle and murdered his entire family as they slept. At his trial, DeFeo claimed that ''voices'' in the house commanded him to kill. This is their story.', 'On the night of November 13th, 1974, Ronald DeFeo Jr. took a high powered rifle and murdered his entire family as they slept. At his trial, DeFeo claimed that ''voices'' in the house commanded him to kill. This is their story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bE5ClVWxIJhzXRFqNoGIuGDWED8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473902'),
  ('1146230752466218814', 'The Amityville Playhouse', 2015, 'Horror', 'Matthew Hickinbottom, John R. Walker', 'Steve Hardy', 'Monèle LeStrat, Linden Baker, Kennie Benoit, Hollie Anne Kornik, Eva Kwok, Logan Russell, Gary Martin, John R. Walker', null, 'Following the tragic death of her parents Fawn Harriman discovers she has inherited a theatre in the town of Amityville. She, along with 3 friends, decides to spend the weekend there looking the place over. Meanwhile one of her High School teachers begins an investigation into the village''s past and makes a connection with something that goes back beyond recorded history.', 'Following the tragic death of her parents Fawn Harriman discovers she has inherited a theatre in the town of Amityville. She, along with 3 friends, decides to spend the weekend there looking the place over. Meanwhile one of her High School teachers begins an investigation into the village''s past and makes a connection with something that goes back beyond recorded history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmdM38XSFA1Aj61zCucY6H4SLyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335753'),
  ('381257930994662000', 'The Amityville Terror', 2016, 'Horror', 'Michael Angelo, Michael S. Ojeda', 'Amanda Barton', 'Nicole Tompkins, Kaiwi Lyman, Kim Nielsen, Amanda Barton, Trevor Stines, Christy St. John, Tonya Kay, Bobby Emprechtinger', null, 'When a new family moves to an old house in Amityville, they are tormented and tortured by an evil spirit living in the home while trapped by the malicious townspeople who want to keep them there.', 'When a new family moves to an old house in Amityville, they are tormented and tortured by an evil spirit living in the home while trapped by the malicious townspeople who want to keep them there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Wqb3NGJ5scvLiUsvSD7XWwFNid.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410537'),
  ('474814100253583821', 'The Amorous Adventures of Moll Flanders', 1965, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Terence Young, David C. Anderson, Ted Moore', 'Denis Cannan, Roland Kibbee', 'Kim Novak, Angela Lansbury, George Sanders, Richard Johnson, Vittorio De Sica, Lilli Palmer, Leo McKern, Daniel Massey', null, 'A bawdy story of how a poor damsel surrenders her virtue again and again to get to the top of society.', 'A bawdy story of how a poor damsel surrenders her virtue again and again to get to the top of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5eTacGAQc3oaJE9OtPxZQYhFBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105537'),
  ('557724943048814035', 'The Amorous Indies', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Clément Cogitore', null, null, null, 'Les Indes Galantes (The amorous indies), is an opera-ballet created by Jean Philippe Rameau in 1735. He was inspired for one of the dance by tribal Indian dances of Louisiana performed by Metchigaema chiefs, in Paris in 1723. Clément Cogitore adapts a short part of the ballet by mobilizing a group of Krump dancers, an art form born in Los Angeles black ghetto in the 1990s. Its birth occurred in the aftermath of the beating up of Rodney King and the riots, as well as police repression it triggered. Amidst this coercive atmosphere, young dancers started to embody the violent tensions of the physical, social and political body. Both the tribal dance performed in Paris in 1723, and the rebelious Krump dancers of the 1990s shape a reenactment of Rameau’s original libretto, staging young people dancing on the verge of a volcano.', 'Les Indes Galantes (The amorous indies), is an opera-ballet created by Jean Philippe Rameau in 1735. He was inspired for one of the dance by tribal Indian dances of Louisiana performed by Metchigaema chiefs, in Paris in 1723. Clément Cogitore adapts a short part of the ballet by mobilizing a group of Krump dancers, an art form born in Los Angeles black ghetto in the 1990s. Its birth occurred in the aftermath of the beating up of Rodney King and the riots, as well as police repression it triggered. Amidst this coercive atmosphere, young dancers started to embody the violent tensions of the physical, social and political body. Both the tribal dance performed in Paris in 1723, and the rebelious Krump dancers of the 1990s shape a reenactment of Rameau’s original libretto, staging young people dancing on the verge of a volcano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiRERShj6w5LeQcs7yBlND1E3JK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497318'),
  ('336230012247591146', 'The Amorous Sisters', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Erwin C. Dietrich, Peter Baumgartner', 'Christine Lembach', 'Brigitte Lahaie, Flore Sollier, Jane Baker, Barbara Moose, Élodie Delage, France Lomay, Nadine Pascal, Mike Montana', null, 'Comedy about some schoolgirls being taught anatomy (of the sexual nature) by the sexually frustrated Barbara Moose. In bed at nighttime the girls practice their daily lessons on each other and on any unsuspecting visitors of the night. When they''re not in class they enjoy frolicking around outside (naked most of the time!) experiencing the joys of nature.', 'Comedy about some schoolgirls being taught anatomy (of the sexual nature) by the sexually frustrated Barbara Moose. In bed at nighttime the girls practice their daily lessons on each other and on any unsuspecting visitors of the night. When they''re not in class they enjoy frolicking around outside (naked most of the time!) experiencing the joys of nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxkwhnBFbdz3g2lFYWUuWhsN0LZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197786'),
  ('92631775599691371', 'The Amputee', 1974, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Lynch, Frederick Elmes, Herbert Cardwell', 'David Lynch', 'Catherine E. Coulson, David Lynch', null, 'A double amputee attempts to write a letter while her nurse gets in the way.', 'A double amputee attempts to write a letter while her nurse gets in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yRz5TOhNCbpOQ76daKSPh8x3Fe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48847'),
  ('1107327317806554741', 'The Amsterdam Kill', 1977, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Robert Clouse, Alan Hume', 'Gregory Teifer', 'Robert Mitchum, Richard Egan, Leslie Nielsen, Bradford Dillman, Keye Luke, Chan Sing, George Cheung, Lam Ching-Ying', 'R', 'Former DEA Agent Quinlan, removed from the force some years earlier for stealing confiscated drug money, is hired by Chung Wei, a leader in the Amsterdam drug cartel, who wants out of the business. Quinlan''s job is to use Chung''s information to tip DEA agents to drug busts, thereby destroying the cartel. But when the first two "tips" go awry, resulting in murdered DEA officers, the feds must decide whether to trust Quinlan further...', 'Former DEA Agent Quinlan, removed from the force some years earlier for stealing confiscated drug money, is hired by Chung Wei, a leader in the Amsterdam drug cartel, who wants out of the business. Quinlan''s job is to use Chung''s information to tip DEA agents to drug busts, thereby destroying the cartel. But when the first two "tips" go awry, resulting in murdered DEA officers, the feds must decide whether to trust Quinlan further...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNERfF1Hue6H3PN1AJLuy1o0ey7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97870'),
  ('480350331840880781', 'The Amulet of Ogum', 1974, 'Fantasy, Crime, Drama, Action', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos', 'Jofre Soares, Anecy Rocha, Ney Santanna, Maria Ribeiro, Emmanuel Cavalcanti, José Marinho, Antonio Carnera, Francisco Santos', null, 'An ubiquitous folk singer narrates the tale of a young boy, who apparently becomes immune to gunfire after his mother arranges for him to have an amulet bearing Ogum''s blessings. As time goes by, he becomes a valuable member of a mobster''s hit-team, but ends up joining a group of people who resist his original employers.', 'An ubiquitous folk singer narrates the tale of a young boy, who apparently becomes immune to gunfire after his mother arranges for him to have an amulet bearing Ogum''s blessings. As time goes by, he becomes a valuable member of a mobster''s hit-team, but ends up joining a group of people who resist his original employers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBHqWehLd6knn95t1eXxrVAs4u9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86234'),
  ('461341843067339179', 'The Amusement Park', 2021, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'George A. Romero, S. William Hinzman', 'Wally Cook', 'Lincoln Maazel, Harry Albacker, Phyllis Casterwiler, Pete Chovan, Marion Cook, Sally Erwin, Michael Gornick, Jack Gottlob', 'NR', 'An elderly gentleman goes for what he assumes will be an ordinary day at the amusement park, only to find himself in the midst of a hellish nightmare.', 'An elderly gentleman goes for what he assumes will be an ordinary day at the amusement park, only to find himself in the midst of a hellish nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djaD4Z1lw4Lk2ayCCe6sqy1bCY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560981'),
