  ('1151938573969722846', 'The Anacondas', 2025, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Marcel Walz, Kasia Szarek, James Mahoney', 'Ryan Ebert, Marc Gottlieb', 'Hannah Hueston, Jordan Iverach, Philipp Karner, Dominic Keating, Maureen Kedes, Bix Krieger, Giselle Garci, Marcus Mannis', 'NR', 'Explorers in Mexico uncover the ruins of an ancient snake-worshiping civilization. Celebration turns to horror when they awaken an ever-growing anaconda, starved of human sacrifices for centuries. Now, the team must band together to survive.', 'Explorers in Mexico uncover the ruins of an ancient snake-worshiping civilization. Celebration turns to horror when they awaken an ever-growing anaconda, starved of human sacrifices for centuries. Now, the team must band together to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rp8NJ0IpDe4xB3wF3A08N7WCvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1595325'),
  ('83121878547751082', 'The Anarchist''s Wife', 2008, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Peter Sehr, Marie Noëlle, Jean-François Robin', 'Marie Noëlle', 'María Valverde, Juan Diego Botto, Ivana Baquero, Nina Hoss, Laura Morante, Jean-Marc Barr, Irene Montalà, Adrià Collado', null, 'Manuela is left behind when her husband Justo fights for his ideals against Franco''s Nationalists during the Spanish Civil War. He is deported to a concentration camp, and upon his release, continues the fight against nationalism in the French resistance. Years pass without a word from him, but his wife never gives up hope of seeing him again.', 'Manuela is left behind when her husband Justo fights for his ideals against Franco''s Nationalists during the Spanish Civil War. He is deported to a concentration camp, and upon his release, continues the fight against nationalism in the French resistance. Years pass without a word from him, but his wife never gives up hope of seeing him again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptCXzppwtPjdTEgB3enGAzoLuXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8889'),
  ('265231734998696026', 'The Anarchists', 2000, 'Action, Thriller', 'Yu Young-sik, O Seung-hyeon', 'Park Chan-wook', 'Jang Dong-gun, Jung Jun-ho, Kim Sang-joong, Lee Beom-soo, Kim In-kwon, Ye Ji-won, Lee Yoon-geon', null, 'Set in 1920s Shanghai, the film recounts the activities of a group of young Koreans trying to destabilize Japanese control of their penninsula. Through an anti-occupation terrorist campaign, the five men hope to inspire a resurrection throughout their penninsular homeland.', 'Set in 1920s Shanghai, the film recounts the activities of a group of young Koreans trying to destabilize Japanese control of their penninsula. Through an anti-occupation terrorist campaign, the five men hope to inspire a resurrection throughout their penninsular homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x6NW4KmEYYeRrPz0k82hExcs1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127613'),
  ('632077001124245189', 'The Anarchists', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Elie Wajeman, David Chizallet, Thomas Lemierre', 'Gaëlle Macé, Elie Wajeman', 'Tahar Rahim, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Swann Arlaud, Cédric Kahn, Guillaume Gouix, Karim Leklou, Sarah Le Picard, Emilie de Preissac', null, 'Set in 1899 Paris, a young police sergeant is chosen to infiltrate a group of anarchists, an opportunity he sees to rise through the ranks. However, he soon finds himself becoming attached to the group.', 'Set in 1899 Paris, a young police sergeant is chosen to infiltrate a group of anarchists, an opportunity he sees to rise through the ranks. However, he soon finds himself becoming attached to the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BWjl6DCwfWmLElrKsnEuPIEjRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329682'),
  ('245289229453356393', 'The Anatomy of Love', 1954, 'Comedy, Music', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Rolando Stragliati, Filippo Mercati', 'Sandro Continenza, Claude-André Puget, Alessandro Blasetti', 'Vittorio De Sica, Sophia Loren, Totò, Dany Robin, François Périer, Alba Arnova, Andrea Checchi, Alberto Sordi', null, 'Nine episodes about life in Italy in the period just before its economic boom.', 'Nine episodes about life in Italy in the period just before its economic boom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnJIrRj8YWEIvXYLSj2AF7mgNs4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59102'),
  ('1076233636957458790', 'The Ancestral', 2022, 'Horror', 'Le Van Kiet, Morgan Schmidt', 'Le Van Kiet', 'Lam Thanh My, Quang Tuấn, Mai Cát Vi, Dieu Nhi', 'NR', 'After suffering a family tragedy, a widower named Thanh moves his two daughters to a centuries-old ancestral home. Both daughters fall prey to sleep paralysis and night terrors. Their father seeks the help of a local psychologist, but chilling secrets and visions eventually prove that all is not what it seems in the old family house.', 'After suffering a family tragedy, a widower named Thanh moves his two daughters to a centuries-old ancestral home. Both daughters fall prey to sleep paralysis and night terrors. Their father seeks the help of a local psychologist, but chilling secrets and visions eventually prove that all is not what it seems in the old family house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tT4DpPzy4jiBSFbxlFA2gixX1MD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947890'),
  ('130943590197981462', 'The Anchor', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Kang Min-woo, Lee Seung-ho, Song Byeong-gi', 'Jeong Ji-yeon', 'Chun Woo-hee, Shin Ha-kyun, Lee Hye-young, Park Ji-hyun, Cha Rae-hyung, Kim Young-pil, Park Se-hyun, Jung Soon-won', null, 'A mysterious informant calls a broadcast news anchor to request that the anchor report on the informant’s inevitable death.', 'A mysterious informant calls a broadcast news anchor to request that the anchor report on the informant’s inevitable death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Z4bi97AzflpOFOBVtib3xCDGpq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626129'),
  ('536299336997154560', 'The Anchorite', 1976, 'Drama', 'Juan Estelrich March, Alejandro Ulloa, Esteban Gutiérrez', 'Rafael Azcona, Juan Estelrich March', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, José María Mompín, Charo Soriano, Maribel Ayuso, Martine Audó, Claude Dauphin, Eduardo Calvo, Ángel Álvarez', null, 'Eleven years ago Fernando Tobajas, a man of a certain age, decided to live in the bathroom, in which he created a small apartment, and never leaves it. Tobajas has given up everything except vanity, and his contacts with the world are reduced to visits from friends and messages sent through the toilet inside aspirin tubes in the hope that someone will receive them and know about his existence. Arabel Lee, a beautiful girl, finds one of those messages.', 'Eleven years ago Fernando Tobajas, a man of a certain age, decided to live in the bathroom, in which he created a small apartment, and never leaves it. Tobajas has given up everything except vanity, and his contacts with the world are reduced to visits from friends and messages sent through the toilet inside aspirin tubes in the hope that someone will receive them and know about his existence. Arabel Lee, a beautiful girl, finds one of those messages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xqe9BtGsaHFB6uvJ92PWnCLk5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95031'),
  ('439960936172413927', 'The Ancines Woods', 1970, 'Drama, Horror, History', 'Pedro Olea, Federico Canudas, Aurelio G. Larraya', 'Pedro Olea, Juan Antonio Porto', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Amparo Soler Leal, Antonio Casas, John Steiner, Nuria Torray, María Fernanda Ladrón de Guevara, Alfredo Mayo, Víctor Israel', null, 'Benito Freire, a pedlar in a small village in northern Spain suffers from epileptic seizures and rumours start to spread that he may be a werewolf and responsible for a series of killings. The local Abbot is called upon to form a team to investigate, in an effort to halt the harrowing murders.', 'Benito Freire, a pedlar in a small village in northern Spain suffers from epileptic seizures and rumours start to spread that he may be a werewolf and responsible for a series of killings. The local Abbot is called upon to form a team to investigate, in an effort to halt the harrowing murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xlhWmo3VfK6j2ImDHuOwogDsCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168502'),
  ('189748715634971797', 'The Andalusian Widow', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Ángel González, Francesc Betriu, Domingo Solano', 'Francesc Betriu', 'Bárbara Rey, Francisco Algora, Escamillo, Laura Riera, Rafael Anglada, Josep Peñalver, Carlos Ibarzábal, Tomás Sánchez', null, 'Lozana, a young, beautiful and clever woman decides to move to the city after a tragic love story. There, she meets Rampin, a naughty rascal who soon finds out that her wit surpasses his own by a handful. When he falls in love with her, he can''t help suffering as he sees how she plays not only with him, but with all of her lovers as well.', 'Lozana, a young, beautiful and clever woman decides to move to the city after a tragic love story. There, she meets Rampin, a naughty rascal who soon finds out that her wit surpasses his own by a handful. When he falls in love with her, he can''t help suffering as he sees how she plays not only with him, but with all of her lovers as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huejt0eBNg4sfqrK6Rj32vFYpbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369816'),
  ('535986158161681578', 'The Anderson Platoon', 1967, 'Documentary, War', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer, Dominique Merlin', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer, Joseph B. Anderson, Stuart Whitman', null, 'A documentary feature by Pierre Schoendoerffer about the Vietnam War. Winner of the 1968 Academy Award for best Documentary Feature.', 'A documentary feature by Pierre Schoendoerffer about the Vietnam War. Winner of the 1968 Academy Award for best Documentary Feature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tUXcKxBAt8nNYVBx09Bq6v0xZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66569'),
  ('439108904351908402', 'The Anderson Tapes', 1971, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Sidney Lumet, Arthur J. Ornitz, Alan Hopkins', 'Frank Pierson', 'Sean Connery, Dyan Cannon, Martin Balsam, Ralph Meeker, Alan King, Christopher Walken, Val Avery, Dick Anthony Williams', 'PG', 'Thief Duke Anderson—just released from ten years in jail—takes up with his old girlfriend in her posh apartment block, and makes plans to rob the entire building. What he doesn''t know is that his every move is being recorded on audio and video, although he is not the subject of any surveillance.', 'Thief Duke Anderson—just released from ten years in jail—takes up with his old girlfriend in her posh apartment block, and makes plans to rob the entire building. What he doesn''t know is that his every move is being recorded on audio and video, although he is not the subject of any surveillance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pjMMwqnL4qkl5pFnlfAqp0cNn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30941'),
  ('950191652519797578', 'The Andromeda Strain', 1971, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robert Wise, Richard H. Kline, Ridgeway Callow', 'Nelson Gidding', 'Arthur Hill, David Wayne, James Olson, Kate Reid, Paula Kelly, George Mitchell, Ramon Bieri, Peter Hobbs', 'G', 'When virtually all of the residents of Piedmont, New Mexico, are found dead after the return to Earth of a space satellite, the head of the US Air Force''s Project Scoop declares an emergency. A group of eminent scientists led by Dr. Jeremy Stone scramble to a secure laboratory and try to first isolate the life form while determining why two people from Piedmont - an old alcoholic and a six-month-old baby - survived. The scientists methodically study the alien life form unaware that it has already mutated and presents a far greater danger in the lab, which is equipped with a nuclear self-destruct device designed to prevent the escape of dangerous biological agents.', 'When virtually all of the residents of Piedmont, New Mexico, are found dead after the return to Earth of a space satellite, the head of the US Air Force''s Project Scoop declares an emergency. A group of eminent scientists led by Dr. Jeremy Stone scramble to a secure laboratory and try to first isolate the life form while determining why two people from Piedmont - an old alcoholic and a six-month-old baby - survived. The scientists methodically study the alien life form unaware that it has already mutated and presents a far greater danger in the lab, which is equipped with a nuclear self-destruct device designed to prevent the escape of dangerous biological agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FBSFz8wLpxd4o6hnvKOJJ8WSIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10514'),
  ('807634875066309321', 'The Andy Baker Tape', 2022, 'Comedy, Thriller, Horror', 'Bret Lada', 'Bret Lada, Dustin Fontaine', 'Bret Lada, Dustin Fontaine, Caitlin Borek, Raymond Lada, Bethany Kay', 'NR', 'In October of 2020 food blogger Jeff Blake and his half-brother Andy Baker hit the road on a food tour that had the potential to change their lives. They were never seen again. This is their footage…', 'In October of 2020 food blogger Jeff Blake and his half-brother Andy Baker hit the road on a food tour that had the potential to change their lives. They were never seen again. This is their footage…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cARzESUwjGur9LBXzKQ74Pbjhjk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:832601'),
  ('137004187536752451', 'The Angel', 1982, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Patrick Bokanowski, Philippe Lavalette, Patrick Bokanowski', 'Patrick Bokanowski', 'Rita Renoir, Maurice Baquet, Martine Couture, Dominique Serrand, Jean-Marie Bon, René Patrignani, Mario Gonzales, Alain Salomon', null, 'The climbing of an immense staircase made up of the most varied stairs. Symbolic scenes occur on different levels where characters seem to be prisoners of their deeds and of their own folly. The steep staircase leads little by little towards the zones of great light where human beings and nonhuman beings meet.', 'The climbing of an immense staircase made up of the most varied stairs. Symbolic scenes occur on different levels where characters seem to be prisoners of their deeds and of their own folly. The steep staircase leads little by little towards the zones of great light where human beings and nonhuman beings meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtRYTODf0nxEZNC0FZNThlc4J3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107391'),
  ('833147958809305918', 'The Angel', 2018, 'Action, Drama, History, Thriller, War', 'Maya Markova, Ariel Vromen, Terry Stacey', 'David Arata', 'Marwan Kenzari, Toby Kebbell, Hannah Ware, Waleed Zuaiter, Maisa Abd Elhadi, Sasson Gabai, Ori Pfeffer, Slimane Dazi', null, 'True story of Ashraf Marwan, who was President Nasser''s son-in-law and special adviser and confidant to his successor Anwar Sadat - while simultaneously Israeli Intelligence''s most precious asset of the 20th century. Based on NYT bestselling book ''The Angel: The Egyptian Spy Who Saved Israel'' by Uri Bar-Joseph.', 'True story of Ashraf Marwan, who was President Nasser''s son-in-law and special adviser and confidant to his successor Anwar Sadat - while simultaneously Israeli Intelligence''s most precious asset of the 20th century. Based on NYT bestselling book ''The Angel: The Egyptian Spy Who Saved Israel'' by Uri Bar-Joseph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5vBixJD1coOvHvr8N2pbyffxFU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468362'),
  ('505806404032886195', 'The Angel and the Woman', 1977, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 'Gilles Carle, François Protat', 'Gilles Carle', 'Carole Laure, Lewis Furey, Jean Comptois, Joe Elsnor, Conrad Peterson, Stephen J. Roth, Stephen Lack, Pierre Giard', null, 'Unable to keep her social commentary to herself and concentrate solely on her show dancing, the girl in this film is shot to death in the Quebec woods by people who don''t want propagandizing about Chile to be openly voiced. She is discovered by a mysterious stranger, who heals her wounds and reanimates her by blowing on them. After he takes her back to his cabin, they fall in love.', 'Unable to keep her social commentary to herself and concentrate solely on her show dancing, the girl in this film is shot to death in the Quebec woods by people who don''t want propagandizing about Chile to be openly voiced. She is discovered by a mysterious stranger, who heals her wounds and reanimates her by blowing on them. After he takes her back to his cabin, they fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lcGkFHMYnmCx2eMkt1S3yRIf3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171217'),
  ('780041227934912689', 'The Angel in the Wall', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Lorenzo Bianchini, Marta Pasqualini, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Fabrizio Bozzetti, Michela Bianchini, Lorenzo Bianchini', 'Pierre Richard, Iva Krajnc Bagola, Gioia Heinz, Paolo Fagiolo, Alessandro Mizzi, Franko Korošec, Andrej Rismondo, Zita Fusco', null, 'Under threat of eviction, an old man hides himself inside his flat, ready for anything - except the cruel twist of fate that will force him to reassess his whole life.', 'Under threat of eviction, an old man hides himself inside his flat, ready for anything - except the cruel twist of fate that will force him to reassess his whole life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfMPAHhqmBeiR7XH6j7uC9ziUfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912367'),
  ('970776599336010010', 'The Angel Maker', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Esben Tønnesen, Julie R. Ølgaard', null, 'Julie R. Ølgaard, Roland Møller, Stine Stengade, Christopher Læssø, Andrea Vagn Jensen, Amanda-Lie Rasmussen, Jesper Ole Feit Andersen, Anders Grau', null, 'Laura is a detective on leave with postpartum depression. When a horrifying serial killer begins methodically murdering women in the most brutal ways, she decides it is time to return to the field. As the bodies pile up, it becomes increasingly clear that she too hides a dark secret that could derail the case and her career.', 'Laura is a detective on leave with postpartum depression. When a horrifying serial killer begins methodically murdering women in the most brutal ways, she decides it is time to return to the field. As the bodies pile up, it becomes increasingly clear that she too hides a dark secret that could derail the case and her career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqqDvNVqAN3Z3VWtfcuDlAlRXeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115377'),
  ('652035205555767334', 'The Angel of Vengeance: The Female Hamlet', 1976, 'Drama, Fantasy, Music', 'Metin Erksan, İbrahim Tabakoğlu, Zafer Par', 'Metin Erksan', 'Fatma Girik, Sevda Ferdağ, Reha Yurdakul, Ahmet Sezerel, Nevra Serezli, Orçun Sonat, Yüksel Gözen, İsmail Yavuz Selekman', null, 'Hamlet returns home from drama school in United States, after the cold-blooded assassination of her father by her uncle, who has married Hamlet’s mother. After seeing her father’s ghost, Hamlet decides to feign insanity, in order to get to the truth.', 'Hamlet returns home from drama school in United States, after the cold-blooded assassination of her father by her uncle, who has married Hamlet’s mother. After seeing her father’s ghost, Hamlet decides to feign insanity, in order to get to the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xao8rw00vcekfM7rQwga4Ql6wB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270336'),
  ('80624278374077105', 'The Angel Tree', 2020, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Romance', 'Jessica Harmon', 'Teresa Kale', 'Jill Wagner, Lucas Bryant, Cassidy Nugent, Clare Filipow, Oscar Farrell, Tom Pickett, Annabel Kershaw, Jason Burkart', null, 'A writer seeks the identity of the person who helps grant wishes that are placed upon the angel tree, and in the process, reconnects with her childhood friend.', 'A writer seeks the identity of the person who helps grant wishes that are placed upon the angel tree, and in the process, reconnects with her childhood friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ykv13npXiwTQiMv3Qf2VXIOdPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746466'),
  ('215513956766314208', 'The Angel Was Born', 1969, 'Crime, Drama', 'Júlio Bressane, Thiago Veloso', 'Júlio Bressane', 'Hugo Carvana, Milton Gonçalves, Norma Bengell, Maria Gladys, Neville D''Almeida, Carlos Guimas, Guará Rodrigues, Richard Nixon', null, 'Santamaria and Urtigo are two bandits on the run, one is white, the other black. Santamaria is a mystical visionary and believes in the imminent coming of a purifying angel. Urtiga, his inseparable companion, is a simple-minded and ingenious man who follows Santamaria around and participates in the crimes he commits. The two bandits take over a house after kidnapping its owner and his girlfriend.', 'Santamaria and Urtigo are two bandits on the run, one is white, the other black. Santamaria is a mystical visionary and believes in the imminent coming of a purifying angel. Urtiga, his inseparable companion, is a simple-minded and ingenious man who follows Santamaria around and participates in the crimes he commits. The two bandits take over a house after kidnapping its owner and his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ngXmZaLe7KPe1ErklU3wurtIZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86238'),
  ('350456948114785328', 'The Angel Wore Red', 1960, 'War, Romance, Drama', 'Carlo Lastricati, Nunnally Johnson, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Nunnally Johnson, Diego Fabbri', 'Ava Gardner, Dirk Bogarde, Joseph Cotten, Vittorio De Sica, Aldo Fabrizi, Arnoldo Foà, Finlay Currie, Franco Castellani', null, 'A clergyman travels to Spain to join the Loyalist side during the Spanish Civil War and finds himself attracted to a beautiful entertainer.', 'A clergyman travels to Spain to join the Loyalist side during the Spanish Civil War and finds himself attracted to a beautiful entertainer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83lPWVqNJZ43j0Bqzty8UiSE2md.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139916'),
  ('489338340713454208', 'The Angelic Conversation', 1987, 'Drama', 'Derek Jarman, James Mackay, Derek Jarman', null, 'Judi Dench, Paul Reynolds, Philip Williamson, Dave Baby, Timothy Burke, Simon Costin, Christopher Hobbs, Philip MacDonald', null, 'The Angelic Conversation is a lyrical, haunting film about a young man’s search for love in a dreamlike landscape. Its tone is set by the juxtaposition of slow moving homo-erotic images and opaque landscapes through which two men take a journey into their own desires. Offscreen, Dame Judi Dench recites a sequence of Shakespeare''s sonnets that counterpoint the action. Jarman called it, “My most austere work, but also the closest to my heart.”', 'The Angelic Conversation is a lyrical, haunting film about a young man’s search for love in a dreamlike landscape. Its tone is set by the juxtaposition of slow moving homo-erotic images and opaque landscapes through which two men take a journey into their own desires. Offscreen, Dame Judi Dench recites a sequence of Shakespeare''s sonnets that counterpoint the action. Jarman called it, “My most austere work, but also the closest to my heart.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYMSkyXCKnj52TtUNzErNJ1IqlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47093'),
  ('307147724736984555', 'The Angels'' Share', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ken Loach, Robbie Ryan, Barry Ackroyd', 'Paul Laverty', 'Paul Brannigan, Siobhan Reilly, John Henshaw, Gary Maitland, William Ruane, Jasmin Riggins, Scott Dymond, Scott Kyle', 'R', 'Narrowly avoiding jail, new dad Robbie vows to turn over a new leaf. A visit to a whisky distillery inspires him and his mates to seek a way out of their hopeless lives.', 'Narrowly avoiding jail, new dad Robbie vows to turn over a new leaf. A visit to a whisky distillery inspires him and his mates to seek a way out of their hopeless lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bt9kJ8gwTMaDcmL0INlJYIZ887t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103747'),
  ('478479663327983996', 'The Angriest Man in Brooklyn', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Phil Alden Robinson, John Bailey', 'Daniel Taplitz, Assi Dayan', 'Robin Williams, Mila Kunis, Peter Dinklage, Melissa Leo, Hamish Linklater, Sutton Foster, James Earl Jones, Richard Kind', 'R', 'After learning that a brain aneurysm will kill him in about 90 minutes, a perpetually unhappy man struggles to come to terms with his fate and make amends with everyone he has ever hurt.', 'After learning that a brain aneurysm will kill him in about 90 minutes, a perpetually unhappy man struggles to come to terms with his fate and make amends with everyone he has ever hurt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0tiYRNhMYbefWlgWFmbhXiOwjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152790'),
  ('293638282431770693', 'The Angry Birds Movie', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Clay Kaytis, Fergal Reilly', 'Jon Vitti', 'Jason Sudeikis, Josh Gad, Danny McBride, Maya Rudolph, Bill Hader, Peter Dinklage, Sean Penn, Keegan-Michael Key', 'PG', 'An island populated entirely by happy, flightless birds or almost entirely. In this paradise, Red, a bird with a temper problem, speedy Chuck, and the volatile Bomb have always been outsiders. But when the island is visited by mysterious green piggies, it’s up to these unlikely outcasts to figure out what the pigs are up to.', 'An island populated entirely by happy, flightless birds or almost entirely. In this paradise, Red, a bird with a temper problem, speedy Chuck, and the volatile Bomb have always been outsiders. But when the island is visited by mysterious green piggies, it’s up to these unlikely outcasts to figure out what the pigs are up to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOH0fEFtV9z9rZp9zmBFGGeWicv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153518'),
  ('402766681884595788', 'The Angry Birds Movie 2', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Tom Bruno Jr., Thurop Van Orman, John Rice', 'Peter Ackerman, Eyal Podell, Jonathon E. Stewart', 'Jason Sudeikis, Josh Gad, Danny McBride, Leslie Jones, Bill Hader, Rachel Bloom, Awkwafina, Sterling K. Brown', 'PG', 'Red, Chuck, Bomb and the rest of their feathered friends are surprised when a green pig suggests that they put aside their differences and unite to fight a common threat. Aggressive birds from an island covered in ice are planning to use an elaborate weapon to destroy the fowl and swine.', 'Red, Chuck, Bomb and the rest of their feathered friends are surprised when a green pig suggests that they put aside their differences and unite to fight a common threat. Aggressive birds from an island covered in ice are planning to use an elaborate weapon to destroy the fowl and swine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKk4bfnouKEY5iPzYDMcVmtgDEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454640'),
