  ('532455734620258366', 'The Angry Black Girl and Her Monster', 2023, 'Horror', 'Bomani J. Story', 'Bomani J. Story', 'Laya DeLeon Hayes, Denzel Whitaker, Chad L. Coleman, Reilly Brooke Stith, Keith Holliday, Edem Atsu-Swanzy, Beth Felice, Ellis Hobbs IV', null, 'Vicaria is a brilliant teenager who believes death is a disease that can be cured. After the brutal and sudden murder of her brother, she embarks on a dangerous journey to bring him back to life.', 'Vicaria is a brilliant teenager who believes death is a disease that can be cured. After the brutal and sudden murder of her brother, she embarks on a dangerous journey to bring him back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4c3rU9R5oYexKFWaAHAc195B0RN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083858'),
  ('859745974420139914', 'The Angry Earth', 1989, 'Drama', 'Karl Francis, Roger Pugh Evans', null, 'Sue Roderick, Mark Lewis Jones, Maria Pride, Dafydd Hywel, Robert Pugh, Gareth Skelding, Catrin Elisa, Jack Shepherd', null, 'About the oppression of the Welsh coal miners during the 19th century and early 20th century as seen through the the eyes of Gwen, a 110 year old woman.', 'About the oppression of the Welsh coal miners during the 19th century and early 20th century as seen through the the eyes of Gwen, a 110 year old woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37aLqxNiIHk0U7jEFsWbpf9ypUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842101'),
  ('20456427465406318', 'The Angry Guest', 1972, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Godfrey Ho, Liu Tien-Min', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Ching Li, Yasuaki Kurata, Fang Jen-Tzu, Chan Sing, Woo Wai, Hong Seong-joong', null, 'The Angry Guest is a direct sequel to Duel of Fists which had two long-separated brothers, Ti Lung and David Chiang, reuniting in Bangkok and running afoul of the local mob after Ti Lung, a boxer, beats the local favorite in the ring. In this film, the action shifts from Bangkok to Hong Kong to Japan and then back to HK as the brothers contend with a Japanese mob led by crime boss Yamaguchi, who is played by the film''s director, Chang Cheh, in a rare screen appearance.', 'The Angry Guest is a direct sequel to Duel of Fists which had two long-separated brothers, Ti Lung and David Chiang, reuniting in Bangkok and running afoul of the local mob after Ti Lung, a boxer, beats the local favorite in the ring. In this film, the action shifts from Bangkok to Hong Kong to Japan and then back to HK as the brothers contend with a Japanese mob led by crime boss Yamaguchi, who is played by the film''s director, Chang Cheh, in a rare screen appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1rkLLWB3A2ACOOrHeZcDCextYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187378'),
  ('79153626624721915', 'The Angry Hills', 1959, 'Drama, War, Thriller', 'Robert Aldrich, Stephen Dade, Buddy Booth', 'A.I. Bezzerides', 'Robert Mitchum, Stanley Baker, Elisabeth Müller, Gia Scala, Theodore Bikel, Sebastian Cabot, Peter Illing, Marius Goring', null, 'In 1941 Greece, on the eve of German occupation, cynical American foreign correspondent Michael Morrison arrives in Athens, intending to depart for London the following day. While there he is tricked into smuggling a list of resistance leaders out of the country and is pursued by the Germans.', 'In 1941 Greece, on the eve of German occupation, cynical American foreign correspondent Michael Morrison arrives in Athens, intending to depart for London the following day. While there he is tricked into smuggling a list of resistance leaders out of the country and is pursued by the Germans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iueNm6V3CyUZOuAg4TufyxZKLmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106017'),
  ('1124781538965234979', 'The Angry Red Planet', 1959, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Stanley Cortez, Ib Melchior', 'Sidney W. Pink, Ib Melchior', 'Gerald Mohr, Naura Hayden, Les Tremayne, Jack Kruschen, Paul Hahn, J. Edward McKinley, Tom Daly, Don Lamond', 'NR', 'The first manned flight to Mars returns after having been out of communications since it had arrived on Mars. What would it reveal?', 'The first manned flight to Mars returns after having been out of communications since it had arrived on Mars. What would it reveal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtY9aJjUdbw6CaQ3rHQW6WJKB6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6974'),
  ('424023230141433950', 'The Angry Silence', 1960, 'Drama', 'Guy Green, Arthur Ibbetson, Basil Rayburn', 'Bryan Forbes', 'Richard Attenborough, Pier Angeli, Michael Craig, Bernard Lee, Alfred Burke, Geoffrey Keen, Laurence Naismith, Russell Napier', 'NR', 'When the union in his factory walks out on strike, a family man refuses to participate, risking the wrath — and retaliation — of his fellow workers.', 'When the union in his factory walks out on strike, a family man refuses to participate, risking the wrath — and retaliation — of his fellow workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXQtp9KOgqisXO73WkjiRJnh9mE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83995'),
  ('413323930469289052', 'The Animal', 2001, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Luke Greenfield, Peter Lyons Collister, Conte Mark Matal', 'Tom Brady, Rob Schneider', 'Rob Schneider, Colleen Haskell, John C. McGinley, Ed Asner, Michael Caton, Louis Lombardi, Guy Torry, Bob Rubin', 'PG-13', 'When loser Marvin Mange is involved in a horrible car accident, he''s brought back to life by a deranged scientist as half man and half animal. His newfound powers are awesome -- but their adverse side effects could take over his life. Now, Marvin must fight to control his crazy primal urges around his new squeeze, Rianna, and his rival, Sgt. Sisk, who both think he''s one cool cat.', 'When loser Marvin Mange is involved in a horrible car accident, he''s brought back to life by a deranged scientist as half man and half animal. His newfound powers are awesome -- but their adverse side effects could take over his life. Now, Marvin must fight to control his crazy primal urges around his new squeeze, Rianna, and his rival, Sgt. Sisk, who both think he''s one cool cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNxEXmKTZtECHs0bQbI6dQoXYMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11090'),
  ('1130532590790542763', 'The Animal Kingdom', 1932, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Edward H. Griffith, George J. Folsey, Thomas Atkins', 'Horace Jackson', 'Ann Harding, Leslie Howard, Myrna Loy, William Gargan, Neil Hamilton, Ilka Chase, Henry Stephenson, Leni Stengel', null, 'Tom Collier has had a great relationship with Daisy, but when he decides to marry, it is not Daisy whom he asks, it is Cecelia. After the marriage, Tom is bored with the social scene and the obligations of his life. He publishes books that will sell, not books that he wants to write. Even worse, he has his old friend working as a butler and Cecelia wants him fired. When Tom tries to get back together with Daisy to renew the feelings that he once felt, Daisy turns the tables on him and leaves to protect both of them.', 'Tom Collier has had a great relationship with Daisy, but when he decides to marry, it is not Daisy whom he asks, it is Cecelia. After the marriage, Tom is bored with the social scene and the obligations of his life. He publishes books that will sell, not books that he wants to write. Even worse, he has his old friend working as a butler and Cecelia wants him fired. When Tom tries to get back together with Daisy to renew the feelings that he once felt, Daisy turns the tables on him and leaves to protect both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nONPUIWAj2UtuZOmBvPtOEfVozk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120862'),
  ('157750930137339388', 'The Animal Kingdom', 2023, 'Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Thomas Cailley, Mahaut Pellerin, Tristan Minault', 'Pauline Munier, Thomas Cailley', 'Romain Duris, Paul Kircher, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Tom Mercier, Billie Blain, Xavier Aubert, Saadia Bentaïeb, Gabriel Caballero', null, 'In a world hit by a wave of mutations transforming humans into animals, François does everything he can to save his wife. As some of the creatures disappear into a nearby forest, he and their son Émile embark on a quest that will change their lives forever.', 'In a world hit by a wave of mutations transforming humans into animals, François does everything he can to save his wife. As some of the creatures disappear into a nearby forest, he and their son Émile embark on a quest that will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39AiQnXlXOjoqBSkiUpTG80rXLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943134'),
  ('742050289470094270', 'The Animal''s Wife', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Víctor Gaviria, Mercedes Gaviria, Silvio Gustavo Vertel', 'Víctor Gaviria, Rafael Hely Urrea Soto, Gloria Nancy Monsalve', 'Natalia Polo, Tito Alexander Gómez Arias, Michelle Madrigal García, Dulce María Jiménez Londoño, Karen Lorena Ricardo Silva, Luisa Fernanda Valderrama Méndez, Adriana López, Juan Camilo Martínez Muñoz', null, 'Amparo, a submissive young woman, tries to escape from her strict convent school but falls into the hands of “El Animal,” a violent and abusive man who forces her to become his wife. Trapped by fear and constant mistreatment, she clings to her love for her daughter and her hope for a better life. However, her strength and dignity may not be enough to stand against the cruelty of the ruthless Animal.', 'Amparo, a submissive young woman, tries to escape from her strict convent school but falls into the hands of “El Animal,” a violent and abusive man who forces her to become his wife. Trapped by fear and constant mistreatment, she clings to her love for her daughter and her hope for a better life. However, her strength and dignity may not be enough to stand against the cruelty of the ruthless Animal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0uB9ZfLkniNlBGtHvvvS2wZyCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412199'),
  ('922559577597308832', 'The Animals', 1970, 'Western', 'Ron Joy, Keith C. Smith', 'Richard Bakalyan', 'Michele Carey, Henry Silva, Keenan Wynn, John Anderson, Joe Turkel, Pepper Martin, Bobby Hall, Peter Hellman', 'R', 'A woman tracks down the three men who raped her, helped by an Apache. Traveling through the Old West to her new home, young schoolteacher Alice McAndrew is abducted by five outlaws headed by robber Pudge Elliott. The thugs rape Alice before leaving her for dead, but she is rescued by Chatto, an Apache chief. He restores her health and aids her in her bloodthirsty quest for revenge. With her sanity wavering, will Alice be able to find the men who tortured her?', 'A woman tracks down the three men who raped her, helped by an Apache. Traveling through the Old West to her new home, young schoolteacher Alice McAndrew is abducted by five outlaws headed by robber Pudge Elliott. The thugs rape Alice before leaving her for dead, but she is rescued by Chatto, an Apache chief. He restores her health and aids her in her bloodthirsty quest for revenge. With her sanity wavering, will Alice be able to find the men who tortured her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ww0D6wNLyIR56eKm3LXjYCBYxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79192'),
  ('878980665540508825', 'The Animated Adventures of Tom Sawyer', 1998, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'William R. Kowalchuk Jr.', 'Bob Merrill', 'Ross Malinger, Ryan Slater, Kirsten Dunst, Christopher Lloyd, Jane Mortifee, Blu Mankuma, Jay Brazeau, Jim Byrnes', null, 'Join Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn on a series of exciting adventures that lead to mischief and mayhem wherever they go. No matter how hard they try, Tom and Huck just can''t seem to stay out of trouble - but they have a lot of fun trying! They also learn some important lessons along the way.', 'Join Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn on a series of exciting adventures that lead to mischief and mayhem wherever they go. No matter how hard they try, Tom and Huck just can''t seem to stay out of trouble - but they have a lot of fun trying! They also learn some important lessons along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZ3scZHFVy5YePZ0cBsHZ3NpW2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67357'),
  ('71838696975517563', 'The Animation Show / Intermission in the Third Dimension / The End of the Show', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Robert May, Don Hertzfeldt', null, 'A "trilogy" of surreal and funny cartoons, produced exclusively to book-end the first year of The Animation Show''s travelling theatrical tour.', 'A "trilogy" of surreal and funny cartoons, produced exclusively to book-end the first year of The Animation Show''s travelling theatrical tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/K1APwCmDEK334dG8vrnnU4rlW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36154'),
  ('267841337288695222', 'The Animatrix', 2003, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Peter Chung, Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Takeshi Koike', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Koji Morimoto, Shinichiro Watanabe', 'Keanu Reeves, Carrie-Anne Moss, Clayton Watson, Pamela Adlon, Melinda Clarke, John DiMaggio, Kevin Michael Richardson, Tom Kenny', 'NR', 'Straight from the creators of the groundbreaking Matrix trilogy, this collection of short animated films from the world''s leading anime directors fuses computer graphics and Japanese anime to provide the background of the Matrix universe and the conflict between man and machines. The shorts include Final Flight of the Osiris, The Second Renaissance, Kid''s Story, Program, World Record, Beyond, A Detective Story and Matriculated.', 'Straight from the creators of the groundbreaking Matrix trilogy, this collection of short animated films from the world''s leading anime directors fuses computer graphics and Japanese anime to provide the background of the Matrix universe and the conflict between man and machines. The shorts include Final Flight of the Osiris, The Second Renaissance, Kid''s Story, Program, World Record, Beyond, A Detective Story and Matriculated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDjIG2hAeMU5cxLrd6oiQqdqoZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55931'),
  ('1019484071578875916', 'The Annihilation of Fish', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Charles Burnett, Kris Krengel, Beat Frutiger', 'Anthony C. Winkler', 'James Earl Jones, Lynn Redgrave, Margot Kidder, Sarah Benoit, Andy Garza, Tommy Redmond Hicks, Ronald F. Hoiseck, Shannon Wilcox', null, 'A Jamaican widower recently released from a mental institution and a former housewife with an imagined lover in the form of 19th-century composer Giacomo Puccini become the unlikely tenants of an eccentric widow in Los Angeles.', 'A Jamaican widower recently released from a mental institution and a former housewife with an imagined lover in the form of 19th-century composer Giacomo Puccini become the unlikely tenants of an eccentric widow in Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7ego9fmduGstTZejoq9SmLQwMj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49796'),
  ('579972238820358637', 'The Annihilators', 1981, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Charles E. Sellier Jr., Henning Schellerup', 'Brian Russell', 'Jim Antonio, Sid Conrad, Gerrit Graham, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, Paul Koslo, Dennis Redfield, Christopher Stone, Andy Wood', 'R', 'Upon his return from Vietnam, an ex-soldier finds his neighborhood has deteriorated badly, and is being terrorized by a vicious street gang. He calls some of his GI buddies, and together they hatch a plan to get rid of the gang.', 'Upon his return from Vietnam, an ex-soldier finds his neighborhood has deteriorated badly, and is being terrorized by a vicious street gang. He calls some of his GI buddies, and together they hatch a plan to get rid of the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGWXT7z5m2oA6SOLZ7GPkgo4YYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129302'),
  ('636358117392432506', 'The Anniversary', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Harry Waxman, Roy Ward Baker, Bert Batt', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Bette Davis, Sheila Hancock, Jack Hedley, James Cossins, Christian Roberts, Elaine Taylor, Timothy Bateson, Sally-Jane Spencer', null, 'Mrs Taggart always celebrates her anniversary with her grown sons. It’s a tradition practised since the death of her husband and she is determined for it to continue. None of her three sons have dared to cross their ruthless domineering mother but this anniversary they intend to try. With cruel and brutal twists, the family get-together becomes a social nightmare beyond endurance.', 'Mrs Taggart always celebrates her anniversary with her grown sons. It’s a tradition practised since the death of her husband and she is determined for it to continue. None of her three sons have dared to cross their ruthless domineering mother but this anniversary they intend to try. With cruel and brutal twists, the family get-together becomes a social nightmare beyond endurance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5VFZLUhhqkJa5Qo0Wh3pxN7qkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58293'),
  ('134958449141426089', 'The Anniversary Party', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alan Cumming, Jennifer Jason Leigh, John Bailey', 'Jennifer Jason Leigh, Alan Cumming', 'Alan Cumming, Jennifer Jason Leigh, John Benjamin Hickey, Parker Posey, Phoebe Cates, Kevin Kline, Owen Kline, Greta Kline', 'R', 'While celebrating their reconciliation and six years of marriage, American actress Sally Nash and British novelist Joe Therrian receive their close friends, some colleagues and their next door neighbors in a party. Under the effect of Ecstasy, revelations are disclosed and relationships deteriorate among the group.', 'While celebrating their reconciliation and six years of marriage, American actress Sally Nash and British novelist Joe Therrian receive their close friends, some colleagues and their next door neighbors in a party. Under the effect of Ecstasy, revelations are disclosed and relationships deteriorate among the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3c4t8tTQp7TV1Z3qeltmhjRi5Ex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26475'),
  ('609999431631449943', 'The Announcement', 2017, 'Drama', 'Mahmut Fazıl Coşkun', 'Mahmut Fazıl Coşkun, Ercan Kesal', 'Ali Seçkiner Alıcı, Murat Kılıç, Tarhan Karagöz, Şencan Güleryüz, Serkan Ercan, Erdem Şenocak, Mehmet Yılmaz Ak, Sanem Öge', null, 'May 22nd, 1963. Unhappy with the existing social and political situation in Turkey, a group of military officers has planned a coup d’état to take down the government in Ankara. Meanwhile in Istanbul, their conspirators have undertaken the vital mission of taking over the National Radio station and making a formal announcement about the coup. But nothing goes to plan. Faced with a number of obstacles, including a sudden rainstorm, the absence of the radio station technician, a betrayal, the lack of feedback from Ankara and their very own inefficiency, the conspirators scramble to keep their plan on track and announce the success of the coup – that is, if the coup in the capital has taken place at all.', 'May 22nd, 1963. Unhappy with the existing social and political situation in Turkey, a group of military officers has planned a coup d’état to take down the government in Ankara. Meanwhile in Istanbul, their conspirators have undertaken the vital mission of taking over the National Radio station and making a formal announcement about the coup. But nothing goes to plan. Faced with a number of obstacles, including a sudden rainstorm, the absence of the radio station technician, a betrayal, the lack of feedback from Ankara and their very own inefficiency, the conspirators scramble to keep their plan on track and announce the success of the coup – that is, if the coup in the capital has taken place at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbv0MSL9JKwu06CsaTrLCppkARR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538102'),
  ('253997013430146781', 'The Annuity', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Tchernia, Jean Tournier', 'René Goscinny, Pierre Tchernia', 'Michel Serrault, Claude Brasseur, Rosy Varte, Odette Laure, Jean-Pierre Darras, Michel Galabru, Yves Robert, Jean Richard', null, 'In 1930, Louis Martinet, a peaceful sexagenarian, no longer has a long life to live according to the words of his doctor, Leon Galipeau, who sees to take advantage of the very interesting situation of the "future deceased". This one indeed has a small house in Saint-Tropez. Galipeau sniffs the windfall. Following his advice, Martinet agrees to give it in life to the brother of the doctor, Emile, and then rushes back to a health of iron. Worse, he even survives the war. Galipeau, exhausted, decide to use the great means to get rid of the importunce who persists in thwarting their project ...', 'In 1930, Louis Martinet, a peaceful sexagenarian, no longer has a long life to live according to the words of his doctor, Leon Galipeau, who sees to take advantage of the very interesting situation of the "future deceased". This one indeed has a small house in Saint-Tropez. Galipeau sniffs the windfall. Following his advice, Martinet agrees to give it in life to the brother of the doctor, Emile, and then rushes back to a health of iron. Worse, he even survives the war. Galipeau, exhausted, decide to use the great means to get rid of the importunce who persists in thwarting their project ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axblx8rNjqvNXH3rolqKkWWUAeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62363'),
  ('891454036490453434', 'The Annunciation', 1984, 'Drama', 'András Jeles', 'András Jeles', 'Péter Bocsor, Júlia Mérő, Eszter Gyalog, György Belme, Róbert Borók, Attila Dobay, Evelin Fehér, Réka Gévai', null, 'Adam and Eve, after Eden, are granted dreams of the world to come by a deceptively sweet but ultimately contemptuous Lucifer. Adam confronts an endless procession of the horror of the human story... rapists and concubines, betrayal and savagery, mindless cruelty and fanaticism.', 'Adam and Eve, after Eden, are granted dreams of the world to come by a deceptively sweet but ultimately contemptuous Lucifer. Adam confronts an endless procession of the horror of the human story... rapists and concubines, betrayal and savagery, mindless cruelty and fanaticism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nG7PHaX47rxZzTODMDVJ5rqhAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56927'),
  ('572306343760933284', 'The Anomaly', 2014, 'Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'Noel Clarke, David Katznelson, James Nunn', 'Simon Lewis', 'Noel Clarke, Ian Somerhalder, Kumud Pant, Alexis Knapp, Victoria Broom, Brian Cox, Luke Hemsworth, Michael Bisping', 'PG-13', 'A former soldier is taken captive and awakens in the back of a van where he learns that he only has less than 10 minutes to figure out how he got there.', 'A former soldier is taken captive and awakens in the back of a van where he learns that he only has less than 10 minutes to figure out how he got there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s56VZf9TsFmRSJ549nCI8RgKTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269173'),
  ('856771588124400466', 'The Anonymous', 2013, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Pierre Schoeller, Julien Hirsch', 'Pierre Schoeller', 'Mathieu Amalric, Olivier Gourmet, Patrick Azam, Jean-Philippe Ricci, Didier Ferrari, Nathanaël Maïni, Cyril Lecomte, Pierre-Laurent Santelli', null, 'A counterterrorism task force investigates the 1998 Ajaccio assassination of Claude Érignac, the prefect of Corsica. Based on true events.', 'A counterterrorism task force investigates the 1998 Ajaccio assassination of Claude Érignac, the prefect of Corsica. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foiJrmyP3iEF1qkK605vrKLqWzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180612'),
  ('196956097584904985', 'The Anonymous Heroes', 1971, 'Action, Comedy', 'Chang Cheh, Liu Tien-Min, Kung Mu-To', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Ching Li, Ku Feng, Ching Miao, Yang Chi-Ching, Wong Chung, Chan Sing', null, 'A perennial Chang Cheh favorite, Anonymous Heroes focuses on two vagabond brothers, Meng Kang and Tieh who, in the search for fame and fortune, join in a rebellion against a provincial general. Used to shaking down local vendors for food and gambling away their limited funds, they are recruited by a local rebel leader who promises them a glorious adventure. The rebels plan is to steal a huge cache of new rifles set to be delivered to the barracks of the local army. With the help of an officer''s daughter, their plan starts out well, but inevitably slips toward a heroic but tragic finale.', 'A perennial Chang Cheh favorite, Anonymous Heroes focuses on two vagabond brothers, Meng Kang and Tieh who, in the search for fame and fortune, join in a rebellion against a provincial general. Used to shaking down local vendors for food and gambling away their limited funds, they are recruited by a local rebel leader who promises them a glorious adventure. The rebels plan is to steal a huge cache of new rifles set to be delivered to the barracks of the local army. With the help of an officer''s daughter, their plan starts out well, but inevitably slips toward a heroic but tragic finale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pq6fUvpaOC2FMbNou2SGqmuzc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75844'),
  ('840117735747893799', 'The Anonymous Venetian', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcello Gatti, Enrico Maria Salerno, Vittorio Salerno', 'Giuseppe Berto, Enrico Maria Salerno', 'Tony Musante, Florinda Bolkan, Toti Dal Monte, Sandro Grinfan, Brizio Montinaro, Giuseppe Bella', null, 'Without mentioning the reason, Venetian musician Enrico invites his ex-wife Valeria to visit him, and her heart is broken again during their last days together.', 'Without mentioning the reason, Venetian musician Enrico invites his ex-wife Valeria to visit him, and her heart is broken again during their last days together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkOg6qXNGVv9sBD8XsgVavlN5Oh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56923'),
  ('599228584202653131', 'The Answer Man', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Hindman, Oliver Bokelberg', 'John Hindman', 'Jeff Daniels, Lauren Graham, Lou Taylor Pucci, Kat Dennings, Olivia Thirlby, Morgan Turner, Nora Dunn, Tony Hale', 'R', 'Twenty years ago, Arlen Faber wrote a book about spirituality that became wildly popular. These days, he''s a curmudgeonly recluse who only enjoys the company of his chiropractor, Elizabeth. As Elizabeth''s warmth starts to melt Arlen''s cold heart, he comes to realize what love really means.', 'Twenty years ago, Arlen Faber wrote a book about spirituality that became wildly popular. These days, he''s a curmudgeonly recluse who only enjoys the company of his chiropractor, Elizabeth. As Elizabeth''s warmth starts to melt Arlen''s cold heart, he comes to realize what love really means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDSP2O9hdqq4Ndh07XJAhzGGX4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20407'),
  ('264857925666254558', 'The Ant and the Aardvark', 1969, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Art Davis, Gerry Chiniquy, Hawley Pratt', null, 'John Byner', null, 'An aardvark tries to catch one ant without success.', 'An aardvark tries to catch one ant without success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EMQZD2BZHyvejG0ShE1EgThvPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92402'),
  ('909672409230112028', 'The Ant Bully', 2006, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ken Mitchroney, John A. Davis, Zubin Wadia', 'John A. Davis, John Nickle', 'Zach Tyler Eisen, Julia Roberts, Meryl Streep, Nicolas Cage, Paul Giamatti, Bruce Campbell, Regina King, Lily Tomlin', 'PG', 'Fed up with being targeted by the neighborhood bully, 10-year-old Lucas Nickle vents his frustrations on the anthill in his front yard ... until the insects shrink him to the size of a bug with a magic elixir. Convicted of "crimes against the colony," Lucas can only regain his freedom by living with the ants and learning their ways.', 'Fed up with being targeted by the neighborhood bully, 10-year-old Lucas Nickle vents his frustrations on the anthill in his front yard ... until the insects shrink him to the size of a bug with a magic elixir. Convicted of "crimes against the colony," Lucas can only regain his freedom by living with the ants and learning their ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFuqX0inTvbA1XAFv2x3CQnI65m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9906'),
  ('796784665637821559', 'The Antares Paradox', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Luis Tinoco, Luis Tinoco', 'Luis Tinoco', 'Andrea Trepat, Aleida Torrent, Jaume de Sans, David Ramírez, Ferran Vilajosana, Dermot Arrigan, Eduard Gibert, Helena Carrión', null, 'In a race against the clock, Alexandra will be forced to choose how to spend the next hours: facing a critic family drama or trying to bring an answer to one of humanity''s most important questions.', 'In a race against the clock, Alexandra will be forced to choose how to spend the next hours: facing a critic family drama or trying to bring an answer to one of humanity''s most important questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wa7e4n6MELbp53vCndsOn0L5kNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002515'),
  ('125905193837007754', 'The Anthem of the Heart', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Shinobu Yoshioka, Hiroyuki Kambe, Naotaka Hayashi', 'Mari Okada', 'Inori Minase, Koki Uchiyama, Sora Amamiya, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Taishi Murata, Rie Takahashi, Shizuka Ishigami, Takanori Ooyama', null, 'A young girl had her voice magically taken away so that she would never hurt people with it, but her outlook changes when she encounters music and friendship. Will Naruse be able to convey the anthem of her heart?', 'A young girl had her voice magically taken away so that she would never hurt people with it, but her outlook changes when she encounters music and friendship. Will Naruse be able to convey the anthem of her heart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bJHM6t6j3YLjDNTwe4hyghKqSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364111'),
