  ('1149672573836657843', 'The Anthrax Attacks: In the Shadow of 9/11', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Dan Krauss', 'Dan Krauss', 'Clark Gregg, Regan Burns, Brigitte Kali Canales, Tongayi Chirisa, Peri Gilpin, Chris Johnson, Derek Phillips, John Redlinger', 'R', 'Days after 9/11, letters containing fatal anthrax spores spark panic and tragedy in the US. This documentary follows the subsequent FBI investigation.', 'Days after 9/11, letters containing fatal anthrax spores spark panic and tragedy in the US. This documentary follows the subsequent FBI investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTJvGRD7AKaEMUOahCDfvq5rwx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013609'),
