  ('706953160890830244', 'The Apartment', 1960, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Joseph LaShelle, Billy Wilder, Hal W. Polaire', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Jack Lemmon, Shirley MacLaine, Fred MacMurray, Ray Walston, Jack Kruschen, David Lewis, Hope Holiday, Joan Shawlee', null, 'Bud Baxter is a minor clerk in a huge New York insurance company, until he discovers a quick way to climb the corporate ladder. He lends out his apartment to the executives as a place to take their mistresses. Although he often has to deal with the aftermath of their visits, one night he''s left with a major problem to solve.', 'Bud Baxter is a minor clerk in a huge New York insurance company, until he discovers a quick way to climb the corporate ladder. He lends out his apartment to the executives as a place to take their mistresses. Although he often has to deal with the aftermath of their visits, one night he''s left with a major problem to solve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhSRt1KKfRT0yEhEtRW3qp31JFU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284'),
  ('178418098302610904', 'The Apartment', 1996, 'Mystery, Drama, Romance', 'Gilles Mimouni, Thierry Arbogast', 'Gilles Mimouni', 'Romane Bohringer, Vincent Cassel, Monica Bellucci, Jean-Philippe Écoffey, Olivier Granier, Sandrine Kiberlain, Paul Pavel, Nelly Alard', 'R', 'Max is a former playboy who has decided to settle down by marrying his current love, Muriel. However, when Max catches a glimpse of the great lost love of his life, he becomes obsessed with rekindling their relationship.', 'Max is a former playboy who has decided to settle down by marrying his current love, Muriel. However, when Max catches a glimpse of the great lost love of his life, he becomes obsessed with rekindling their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EWKKGnAQPdTXhr2aRde1aLwPQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12531'),
  ('68567816389734174', 'The Apartment Above', 1937, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Seweryn Steinwurzel, Leon Trystan', 'Ludwik Starski, Eugeniusz Bodo, Emanuel Schlechter', 'Eugeniusz Bodo, Helena Grossówna, Józef Orwid, Ludwik Sempoliński, Stanisław Woliński, Czesław Skonieczny, Feliks Chmurkowski, Alina Żeliska', null, 'Two apartment house dwellers, although unrelated, share the same name. One is an older man with an appreciation for and love of classical music, while the other is a younger man addicted to swing music. The niece of the older man arrives for a visit and gets into the wrong apartment. Complications arise.', 'Two apartment house dwellers, although unrelated, share the same name. One is an older man with an appreciation for and love of classical music, while the other is a younger man addicted to swing music. The niece of the older man arrives for a visit and gets into the wrong apartment. Complications arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfqRi3gfqR7uyeWSjGoh0rP1DJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344129'),
  ('366561140462166374', 'The Apartment Complex', 1999, 'Comedy, Mystery, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Tobe Hooper, Jacques Haitkin', 'Karl Schaefer', 'Chad Lowe, Fay Masterson, Obba Babatundé, Patrick Warburton, Amanda Plummer, Ron Canada, Miguel Sandoval, Jon Polito', 'R', 'A psychology graduate student becomes embroiled in a murder mystery after he takes a job as manager of Wonder View Apartments.', 'A psychology graduate student becomes embroiled in a murder mystery after he takes a job as manager of Wonder View Apartments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QPAjMMijZ6P8IaMAADARU3O06d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121016'),
  ('458392108076063510', 'The Ape', 1940, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'William Nigh, Harry Neumann, Edward J. Kay', 'Curt Siodmak, Richard Carroll', 'Boris Karloff, Maris Wrixon, Gene O''Donnell, Dorothy Vaughan, Henry Hall, Selmer Jackson, Gertrude Hoffmann, Jessie Arnold', 'NR', 'Dr. Bernard Adrian is a kindly scientist who seeks to cure a young woman''s polio. He needs human spinal fluid to complete the formula for his experimental serum. Meanwhile, a vicious circus ape has broken out of its cage, and is terrorizing the townspeople. Can there be a connection?', 'Dr. Bernard Adrian is a kindly scientist who seeks to cure a young woman''s polio. He needs human spinal fluid to complete the formula for his experimental serum. Meanwhile, a vicious circus ape has broken out of its cage, and is terrorizing the townspeople. Can there be a connection?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXb0rlowlyXOriVMaEhpqBzmySk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37426'),
  ('63348451108218963', 'The Ape', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jesper Ganslandt, Fredrik Wenzel', 'Jesper Ganslandt', 'Olle Sarri, Françoise Joyce, Sean Pietrulewicz, Niclas Gillis, Samuel Haus, Eva Rexed, Lennart Andersson, Lena Carlsson', null, 'A descent into hell, Jesper Ganslandt''s disturbing and suspenseful second feature begins with a man waking up in unfamiliar surroundings, only to find the life he knew the day before is gone.', 'A descent into hell, Jesper Ganslandt''s disturbing and suspenseful second feature begins with a man waking up in unfamiliar surroundings, only to find the life he knew the day before is gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2YX9Z7Aiyc5W3zB37eLN0C1HNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38307'),
