  ('468143949448605545', 'The Ape Woman', 1964, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marco Ferreri, Aldo Tonti, Giancarlo Santi', 'Rafael Azcona, Marco Ferreri', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Annie Girardot, Achille Majeroni, Filippo Pompa Marcelli, Ermelinda De Felice, Elvira Paolini, Ugo Rossi, Eva Belami', null, 'A modest Neapolitan man meets a young woman with excessive hairiness. He exhibits her at fairs and marries her. It is after marriage that he receives a tempting offer from a French manager.', 'A modest Neapolitan man meets a young woman with excessive hairiness. He exhibits her at fairs and marries her. It is after marriage that he receives a tempting offer from a French manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38avfcyrLqAzWE19jIpTnoQATZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61823'),
  ('127331565582483303', 'The Aphid and the Ant', 2021, 'Drama', 'Mario Vitale', 'Saverio Tavano, Francesco Governà, Mario Vitale', 'Giuseppe Fiorello, Valentina Lodovini, Alessio Praticò, Cristina Parku, Nadia Kibout, Anna Maria De Luca, Ettore Signorelli, Alessio De Lorenzi', null, 'Fatima is 16 years old and wears a veil. Her culture requires it, and her mother Amina imposes it on her. Born in Calabria to Muslim parents, the girl experiences all the conflicts and emotions typical of her age, but feels she is not like her peers: she is closed in her solitude, constantly out of place. Until one day the physical education teacher, Michele Scimone, suggests his students to sign up for the Sant''Antonio Marathon. For Fatima it is the first real opportunity to be seized. But for the teacher, a shy and depressed former runner, tormented by an unresolved past and a failed relationship with Anna, the veil that Fatima wears is a cause of prejudice.', 'Fatima is 16 years old and wears a veil. Her culture requires it, and her mother Amina imposes it on her. Born in Calabria to Muslim parents, the girl experiences all the conflicts and emotions typical of her age, but feels she is not like her peers: she is closed in her solitude, constantly out of place. Until one day the physical education teacher, Michele Scimone, suggests his students to sign up for the Sant''Antonio Marathon. For Fatima it is the first real opportunity to be seized. But for the teacher, a shy and depressed former runner, tormented by an unresolved past and a failed relationship with Anna, the veil that Fatima wears is a cause of prejudice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpUEYPMK4BqY4KjSf3IQy0AoLBw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:891676'),
  ('799329057961590675', 'The Apocalypse', 2004, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Raffaele Mertes, Giovanni Galasso, Amine Louadni', 'Gianmario Pagano, Raffaele Mertes', 'Richard Harris, Benjamin Sadler, Christian Kohlund, Vittoria Belvedere, Erol Sander, Ian Duncan, Bruce Payne, Walter Nudo', null, 'The film is set in 90 AD and concerns Jesus Christ''s last surviving disciple, John of Patmos, and his writings and visions from the Apocalypse of John. Emperor Domitian has declared himself to be God and ruler, over heaven and earth. The Christians do not recognize his divinity and face persecution, from the God Emperor. John has been imprisoned on, the island of Patmos, a Roman mining, penal colony, with many others. He writes out messages of his visions and sends the "Revelation of God", to the seven churches of Greek Asia Minor. The Christian church, in Ephesus, sends Irene to make sure John is alive and to confer with him in person. The movie depicts scenes from the Book of Revelation and links them to events happening to the church in Asia.', 'The film is set in 90 AD and concerns Jesus Christ''s last surviving disciple, John of Patmos, and his writings and visions from the Apocalypse of John. Emperor Domitian has declared himself to be God and ruler, over heaven and earth. The Christians do not recognize his divinity and face persecution, from the God Emperor. John has been imprisoned on, the island of Patmos, a Roman mining, penal colony, with many others. He writes out messages of his visions and sends the "Revelation of God", to the seven churches of Greek Asia Minor. The Christian church, in Ephesus, sends Irene to make sure John is alive and to confer with him in person. The movie depicts scenes from the Book of Revelation and links them to events happening to the church in Asia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzwlAnjrui9tmYyw29k1qOnKEry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58433'),
  ('397268385295559243', 'The Apocalypse Code', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Vadim Shmelyov, Dayan Gaytkulov, Aleksandr Ligay', 'Denis Karyshev, Vadim Shmelyov', 'Anastasiya Zavorotnyuk, Vincent Perez, Vladimir Menshov, Oskar Kuchera, Aleksey Serebryakov, Oleg Stefan, Sergey Gazarov, Aleksandr Tyutin', null, 'Terrorist Jaffad Ben Zayidi steals four nuclear bombs from a sunken American submarine and hides them in four major cities throughout the world. The charges can be activated by an 11-digit code. Zayidi dies and his accomplice, nicknamed "The Executioner," is about to blow up the bombs. The Executioner is chased by FSB, whose agent Marie has previously infiltrated Zayidi''s team.', 'Terrorist Jaffad Ben Zayidi steals four nuclear bombs from a sunken American submarine and hides them in four major cities throughout the world. The charges can be activated by an 11-digit code. Zayidi dies and his accomplice, nicknamed "The Executioner," is about to blow up the bombs. The Executioner is chased by FSB, whose agent Marie has previously infiltrated Zayidi''s team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Cel7xcLMkvzlwbzpcx2cGBxDx3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27379'),
  ('374613401367430899', 'The Apocalypse of St John', 2024, 'Documentary, History', 'Simón Delacre, Patricio Dondo', 'Simón Delacre', 'Ricardo Castro, Miguel Angel Marchessi, Héctor Hugo Larriera, Carlos Secilio', null, 'Embark on an epic journey through time and faith with ''The Apocalypse of Saint John.'' Join the Apostle John in a stunning visual narrative that unravels the visions of the End Times. Experience each vision like never before, with striking visual effects and epic scenes that immerse you in the apocalyptic narrative.', 'Embark on an epic journey through time and faith with ''The Apocalypse of Saint John.'' Join the Apostle John in a stunning visual narrative that unravels the visions of the End Times. Experience each vision like never before, with striking visual effects and epic scenes that immerse you in the apocalyptic narrative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzXU586n4uDBgMtVMPPQW7UJwu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1262299'),
  ('189542012574090108', 'The Apology', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Alison Locke, Jack Caswell, Cédric Chabloz', 'Alison Locke', 'Anna Gunn, Linus Roache, Janeane Garofalo, Mary Leeholland, Esme McSherry, Zena Leigh Logan', 'NR', 'Twenty years after the disappearance of her daughter, a recovering alcoholic is preparing to host her family''s Christmas celebration when her estranged ex-brother-in-law arrives unannounced, bearing nostalgic gifts and a heavy secret.', 'Twenty years after the disappearance of her daughter, a recovering alcoholic is preparing to host her family''s Christmas celebration when her estranged ex-brother-in-law arrives unannounced, bearing nostalgic gifts and a heavy secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUFHThondPpmjqeh3XI1yXnCRDa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1035654'),
  ('735419467414875963', 'The Apology King', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Nobuo Mizuta, Kimiyoshi Adachi, Kôichi Nakayama', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Sadao Abe, Mao Inoue, Masaki Okada, Katsumi Takahashi, Yutaka Takenouchi, Machiko Ono, Yasuko Matsuyuki, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa', null, 'Ryoro Kurojima is the director of a Tokyo apology center. His job is to teach others how to apologize. Ryoro Kurojima solves problems by using his apology techniques on anything from simple arbitration to a national crisis.', 'Ryoro Kurojima is the director of a Tokyo apology center. His job is to teach others how to apologize. Ryoro Kurojima solves problems by using his apology techniques on anything from simple arbitration to a national crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abaHB1oL7NfsJPTs8PL1FomhaMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229282'),
  ('514053266299851802', 'The Apostate', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Arauco Hernández Holz, Sonia González Riera, Adrián Orr', 'Federico Veiroj, Álvaro Ogalla, Gonzalo Delgado', 'Andrés Gertrúdix, Vicky Peña, Bárbara Lennie, Marta Larralde, Álvaro Ogalla, Kaiet Rodríguez, Juan Calot, Joaquín Climent', null, 'A young man navigates the bureaucracy of the Catholic Church when he tries to renounce his faith.', 'A young man navigates the bureaucracy of the Catholic Church when he tries to renounce his faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8dZaY6s42DDdXVwVq6PdTZR0XZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351097'),
