  ('177612668143897158', 'The Apple Dumpling Gang Rides Again', 1979, 'Comedy, Family, Western', 'Vincent McEveety', 'Don Tait', 'Tim Conway, Don Knotts, Tim Matheson, Kenneth Mars, Elyssa Davalos, Jack Elam, Robert Pine, Harry Morgan', 'G', 'Amos and Theodore, the two bumbling outlaw wannabes from The Apple Dumpling Gang, are back and trying to make it on their own. This time, the crazy duo gets involved in an army supply theft case -- and, of course, gets in lots of comic trouble along the way!', 'Amos and Theodore, the two bumbling outlaw wannabes from The Apple Dumpling Gang, are back and trying to make it on their own. This time, the crazy duo gets involved in an army supply theft case -- and, of course, gets in lots of comic trouble along the way!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPGACB1ZfPM9bKlQva2TFpCkWSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22328'),
  ('175106046520130980', 'The Apple of My Eye', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Axelle Ropert, Sébastien Buchmann', 'Axelle Ropert', 'Mélanie Bernier, Bastien Bouillon, Antonin Fresson, Chloé Astor, Swann Arlaud, Laurent Mothe, Thierry Gibault, Camille Cayol', null, 'A boy, a girl. They live in the same building. They share a passion for music. But when they meet in the elevator, Théo doesn’t see that Élise is blind. It’s hate at first sight. Love takes its time. Will that early misunderstanding bring them together or drive them apart?', 'A boy, a girl. They live in the same building. They share a passion for music. But when they meet in the elevator, Théo doesn’t see that Élise is blind. It’s hate at first sight. Love takes its time. Will that early misunderstanding bring them together or drive them apart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCatQ1aEkqAuDdNmNoG4KI9v0A0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408274'),
  ('412011488338540244', 'The Apple War', 1971, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Tage Danielsson, Lars Swanberg, Per Carleson', 'Tage Danielsson, Hans Alfredson', 'Per Grundén, Gösta Ekman, Sture Ericson, Ingvar Ottoson, Per Waldvik, Yvonne Lombard, Monica Zetterlund, Håkan Serner', null, 'A German businessman wants to buy land in southern Sweden for a gigantic amusement park, his new project called "Deutschneyland" (a wordplay of Deutschland and Disneyland). Some of the locals dislike the idea, including the magically talented Lindberg family, and work to frustrate the development plans.', 'A German businessman wants to buy land in southern Sweden for a gigantic amusement park, his new project called "Deutschneyland" (a wordplay of Deutschland and Disneyland). Some of the locals dislike the idea, including the magically talented Lindberg family, and work to frustrate the development plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpAxwj6OANg46MgmgmBeJgZoagi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45983'),
  ('296563216142357945', 'The Appointment', 1969, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Sidney Lumet, Carlo Di Palma', 'James Salter, Antonio Leonviola', 'Omar Sharif, Anouk Aimée, Didi Perego, Fausto Tozzi, Lotte Lenya, Gabriella Boccardo, Gigi Proietti, Paola Barbara', null, 'Lawyer Federico Fendi has reasons to suspect that his fashion model wife Carla is secretly one of Rome''s highest paid call-girls.', 'Lawyer Federico Fendi has reasons to suspect that his fashion model wife Carla is secretly one of Rome''s highest paid call-girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQTZcdZ3guzHII6lhO9SNTeuxGC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57666'),
