  ('303656819835101494', 'The Appointments of Dennis Jennings', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Dean Parisot, Gary Marcus', 'Steven Wright, Mike Armstrong', 'Steven Wright, Rowan Atkinson, Laurie Metcalf, Carrotte, Christopher Durang, Martha Gehman, Joe Grifasi, Thomas Ikeda', 'R', 'Dennis Jennings is an introverted daydreamer, sleepwalking through life. He is a professional waiter and has an equally-dull girlfriend, Emma. In an attempt to release his pent-up feelings of isolation, he begins seeing a psychiatrist, only to discover that the doctor is somewhat less than interested in what he has to say. The film won an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'Dennis Jennings is an introverted daydreamer, sleepwalking through life. He is a professional waiter and has an equally-dull girlfriend, Emma. In an attempt to release his pent-up feelings of isolation, he begins seeing a psychiatrist, only to discover that the doctor is somewhat less than interested in what he has to say. The film won an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbFWHqxURoNBn8BwRHEF1j86JhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47057'),
  ('376039656971082325', 'The Apprentice', 2024, 'History, Drama', 'Ali Abbasi, Kasper Tuxen, Joel Hay', 'Gabriel Sherman', 'Sebastian Stan, Jeremy Strong, Martin Donovan, Maria Bakalova, Catherine McNally, Charlie Carrick, Ben Sullivan, Mark Rendall', 'R', 'A young Donald Trump, eager to make his name as a hungry scion of a wealthy family in 1970s New York, comes under the spell of Roy Cohn, the cutthroat attorney who would help create the Donald Trump we know today. Cohn sees in Trump the perfect protégé—someone with raw ambition, a hunger for success, and a willingness to do whatever it takes to win.', 'A young Donald Trump, eager to make his name as a hungry scion of a wealthy family in 1970s New York, comes under the spell of Roy Cohn, the cutthroat attorney who would help create the Donald Trump we know today. Cohn sees in Trump the perfect protégé—someone with raw ambition, a hunger for success, and a willingness to do whatever it takes to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/549Hdul2BgPnZMhqFxp6npp2opr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1182047'),
  ('1096018172475898670', 'The Apprentices', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pierre Salvadori, Gilles Henry', 'Pierre Salvadori, Nicolas Cuche, Marc Syrigas', 'Marie Trintignant, François Cluzet, Guillaume Depardieu, Judith Henry, Claire Laroche, Philippe Girard, Bernard Yerlès, Jean-Pol Brissart', null, 'Antoine is a failed and depressed writer. Fred doesn''t do much in his life and seems to be happy about it. The two of them share an apartment and live in a shambles. The adventures and mostly the misadventures of these two buddies/losers, makes them realise that despite everything that happens their friendship is the most important thing in their lives.', 'Antoine is a failed and depressed writer. Fred doesn''t do much in his life and seems to be happy about it. The two of them share an apartment and live in a shambles. The adventures and mostly the misadventures of these two buddies/losers, makes them realise that despite everything that happens their friendship is the most important thing in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnUhtrw1zsBdQ3tFl8xmO3KFayc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62013'),
  ('899051025649482178', 'The Apprenticeship of Duddy Kravitz', 1974, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ted Kotcheff, Brian West', 'Mordecai Richler', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Henry Ramer, Alan Rosenthal, Susan Friedman, Joseph Wiseman, Micheline Lanctôt, Jack Warden, Randy Quaid', 'PG', 'The younger son of a working-class Jewish family in Montreal, Duddy Kravitz yearns to make a name for himself in society. This film chronicles his short and dubious rise to power, as well as his changing relationships with family and friends. Along the way the film explores the themes of anti-semitism and the responsibilities which come with adulthood.', 'The younger son of a working-class Jewish family in Montreal, Duddy Kravitz yearns to make a name for himself in society. This film chronicles his short and dubious rise to power, as well as his changing relationships with family and friends. Along the way the film explores the themes of anti-semitism and the responsibilities which come with adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wizmy0hFKs7lsn2ljHMctj86KEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42451'),
  ('937174072410535043', 'The Approach of Autumn', 1960, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Jun Yasumoto, Masaji Nonagase', 'Ryōzō Kasahara', 'Nobuko Otowa, Yōsuke Natsuki, Chisako Hara, Daisuke Katō, Seizaburō Kawazu, Kenzaburo Osawa, Futaba Ichiki, Kamatari Fujiwara', null, 'A single mother from the country raising a 6th grade boy comes to Tokyo, leaves the boy to live with his uncle''s family, runs a struggling grocery store, and works a local inn. The boy befriends a girl, the daughter of the innkeeper.', 'A single mother from the country raising a 6th grade boy comes to Tokyo, leaves the boy to live with his uncle''s family, runs a struggling grocery store, and works a local inn. The boy befriends a girl, the daughter of the innkeeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nduxUQxRFvRFqyNHMoxmf5FfCSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175061'),
  ('185149342338199289', 'The April Fools', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Stuart Rosenberg, Michel Hugo, Charles Ziarko', 'Hal Dresner', 'Jack Lemmon, Catherine Deneuve, Peter Lawford, Jack Weston, Myrna Loy, Charles Boyer, Kenneth Mars, Melinda Dillon', 'PG', 'Newly-promoted if none too happily married Howard Brubaker leaves a rowdy company party early with the stunning Catherine, whom it turns out is herself unhappily married — to the boss. They spend an innocent night in New York becoming more and more attracted to each other, so that when Catherine announces she intends to leave her husband and return to Paris, Howard asks to go along too.', 'Newly-promoted if none too happily married Howard Brubaker leaves a rowdy company party early with the stunning Catherine, whom it turns out is herself unhappily married — to the boss. They spend an innocent night in New York becoming more and more attracted to each other, so that when Catherine announces she intends to leave her husband and return to Paris, Howard asks to go along too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99MXK0a8wyrK3qd695DcgLhdqhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90563'),
  ('938213512573640271', 'The Aquanauts', 1980, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Igor Voznesensky, Georgi Zelenin, Aleksandr Filatov', 'Igor Voznesensky, Sergei Pavlov', 'German Poloskov, Aleksandr Yakovlev, Iren Azer, Vatslav Dvorzhetsky, Arnis Līcītis, Nikolai Kryukov, Yuriy Sarantsev, Pauls Butkevics', null, 'While doing their work on the deep underwater station two aquanauts discover strange mystery: it seems as if one of the aquanaut''s girlfriend who recently died in a car crash had turned into a big manta fish. That manta writes words on the station''s port-holes and tries to draw attention many other ways.', 'While doing their work on the deep underwater station two aquanauts discover strange mystery: it seems as if one of the aquanaut''s girlfriend who recently died in a car crash had turned into a big manta fish. That manta writes words on the station''s port-holes and tries to draw attention many other ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWEm5WiDJbaR3A27OOCNHub5X0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193323'),
  ('884270472275463163', 'The Arbors', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Clayton Witmer, Ayinde Anderson', 'Chelsey Cummings, Clayton Witmer', 'Drew Matthews, Ryan Davenport, Sarah Cochrane, Daryl Munroe, Alexandra Rose, Brooks Addis, Tony Hughes, Noah Lewis Scialom', null, 'Set against a dreary small town, reclusive locksmith Ethan Daunes struggles to keep ties with his younger brother Shane. Ethan''s life takes an unsettling turn after finding a strange small creature and forming a mysterious connection. After a string of unexplained killings, the creature''s true nature is soon revealed, and Ethan finds himself at the center of panic and paranoia.', 'Set against a dreary small town, reclusive locksmith Ethan Daunes struggles to keep ties with his younger brother Shane. Ethan''s life takes an unsettling turn after finding a strange small creature and forming a mysterious connection. After a string of unexplained killings, the creature''s true nature is soon revealed, and Ethan finds himself at the center of panic and paranoia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqOzUdbCjWYeY1BmCC82zMNqR3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695452'),
  ('848656737272643925', 'The Arch', 1969, 'Drama', 'Tang Shu-Shuen, Subrata Mitra, Ho-Hsi Chi', 'Tang Shu-Shuen', 'Lisa Lu, Hilda Chow Hsuen, Roy Chiao, Lee Ying, Tang Shu-Shuen, Man Sau, Leung Yui, Man Lei', null, 'A widow upholds feudal virtue by suppressing her love for a cavalry captain in favor of her daughter.', 'A widow upholds feudal virtue by suppressing her love for a cavalry captain in favor of her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QjKQPuXKycMIEAnBOQSHiVZFxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157243'),
  ('1101391733501571412', 'The Archer', 2017, 'Action', 'Valerie Weiss, Adam Santelli', 'Casey Schroen', 'Bailey Noble, Jeanine Mason, Michael Grant Terry, Bill Sage, Dendrie Taylor, Kyanna Simone Simpson, Alexis Rosinsky, Timothy Granaderos', null, 'Archer champion Lauren Pierce escapes a corrupt juvenile correctional facility with Rebecca, a fierce but alluring inmate. Together they must survive a desperate warden who is bow-hunting his prey to make sure his secret stays buried', 'Archer champion Lauren Pierce escapes a corrupt juvenile correctional facility with Rebecca, a fierce but alluring inmate. Together they must survive a desperate warden who is bow-hunting his prey to make sure his secret stays buried', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x59nM0V4T0fRVtorpAv2zxgjzZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438455'),
  ('426824945938129655', 'The Archer: Fugitive from the Empire', 1981, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Nicholas Corea, John McPherson', 'Nicholas Corea', 'Lane Caudell, Belinda Bauer, Victor Campos, Kabir Bedi, George Innes, Marc Alaimo, Allan Rich, John Hancock', 'PG', 'A rugged warrior is on a quest to avenge his father''s brutal slaying and in search of a legendary sorcerer who can help him. Joining him on his mission is a beautiful enchantress who is also searching for the sorcerer; pursuing him is a malevolent wizard who wants him dead.', 'A rugged warrior is on a quest to avenge his father''s brutal slaying and in search of a legendary sorcerer who can help him. Joining him on his mission is a beautiful enchantress who is also searching for the sorcerer; pursuing him is a malevolent wizard who wants him dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBO4zYrHpJIL1OqoObGP9Y3DyGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73209'),
  ('633369913373707862', 'The Archies', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Zoya Akhtar, Nikos Andritsakis, Nandini Shrikent', 'Zoya Akhtar, Ayesha DeVitre, Reema Kagti', 'Agastya Nanda, Suhana Khan, Khushi Kapoor, Mihir Ahuja, Vedang Raina, Aditi Saigal, Yuvraj Menda, Vinay Pathak', 'PG-13', 'Set in 1960s India, Archie and the gang navigate romance, friendship and the future of Riverdale as developers threaten to destroy a beloved park.', 'Set in 1960s India, Archie and the gang navigate romance, friendship and the future of Riverdale as developers threaten to destroy a beloved park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmhWb4NTj02FyDxwBm4x9x2JxwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975533'),
  ('156129228114109595', 'The Architect', 2006, 'Drama', 'Matt Tauber, John Bailey', 'David Greig, Matt Tauber', 'Anthony LaPaglia, Viola Davis, Isabella Rossellini, Hayden Panettiere, Sebastian Stan, Paul James, Serena Reeder, Walton Goggins', null, 'An architect engages in conflict with an activist who lives in a dangerous complex the architect designed.', 'An architect engages in conflict with an activist who lives in a dangerous complex the architect designed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYdvNcumrVzbjkhTr1Y68pKIWN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18590'),
  ('670446811105921858', 'The Architect', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ina Weisse, Carl-Friedrich Koschnick', 'Daphne Charizani, Ina Weisse', 'Josef Bierbichler, Hilde Van Mieghem, Sandra Hüller, Matthias Schweighöfer, Sophie Rois, Lucas Zolgar, Hark Bohm, Harald Abdelhamed', null, 'Accepting a prize, architect Georg Winter explains that an architect has the good fortune of measuring every completed building against the rightness of his original idea. Soon Georg himself is forced to take stock of the achievements and mistakes he has made in his personal life. An intense drama in which the four members of the family travel to a mountain village to bury Georg''s mother. They get stranded in bad weather. This unexpected isolation throws new light on the past and present life of the parents and the two almost-adult children.', 'Accepting a prize, architect Georg Winter explains that an architect has the good fortune of measuring every completed building against the rightness of his original idea. Soon Georg himself is forced to take stock of the achievements and mistakes he has made in his personal life. An intense drama in which the four members of the family travel to a mountain village to bury Georg''s mother. They get stranded in bad weather. This unexpected isolation throws new light on the past and present life of the parents and the two almost-adult children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vReorfR0VXymnVdrDJm9mMktLTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62966'),
  ('869754129235430718', 'The Architecture of Doom', 1989, 'Documentary', 'Peter Cohen', 'Peter Cohen', 'Rolf Arsenius, Bruno Ganz, Jeanne Moreau, Sam Gray', null, 'Featuring never-before-seen film footage of Adolf Hitler and the Nazi regime, The Architecture of Doom captures the inner workings of the Third Reich and illuminates the Nazi aesthetic in art, architecture and popular culture. From Nazi party rallies to the final days inside Hitler''s bunker, this sensational film shows how Adolf Hitler rose from being a failed artist to creating a world of ponderous kitsch and horrifying terror. Hitler worshipped ancient Rome and Greece, and dreamed of a new Golden Age of classical art and monumental architecture, populated by beautiful, patriotic Aryans. Degenerated artists and inferior races had no place in his lurid fantasy. As this riveting film shows, the Nazis went from banning the art of modernists like Picasso to forced euthanasia of the retarded and sick, and finally to the persecution of homosexuals and the extermination of the Jews.', 'Featuring never-before-seen film footage of Adolf Hitler and the Nazi regime, The Architecture of Doom captures the inner workings of the Third Reich and illuminates the Nazi aesthetic in art, architecture and popular culture. From Nazi party rallies to the final days inside Hitler''s bunker, this sensational film shows how Adolf Hitler rose from being a failed artist to creating a world of ponderous kitsch and horrifying terror. Hitler worshipped ancient Rome and Greece, and dreamed of a new Golden Age of classical art and monumental architecture, populated by beautiful, patriotic Aryans. Degenerated artists and inferior races had no place in his lurid fantasy. As this riveting film shows, the Nazis went from banning the art of modernists like Picasso to forced euthanasia of the retarded and sick, and finally to the persecution of homosexuals and the extermination of the Jews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/802z31I21EFE8TfsOloTnVSKrHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68348'),
  ('1109142634190302165', 'The Arctic Convoy', 2023, 'War, Drama', 'Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken, Oskar Dahlsbakken', 'Lars Gudmestad, Harald Rosenløw-Eeg, Christian Siebenherz', 'Tobias Santelmann, Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Heidi Ruud Ellingsen, Preben Hodneland, Adam Lundgren, Jon Ranes, Olav Waastad, Jakob Fort', null, 'In 1942, a convoy of 35 civilian ships, carrying vital supplies from Iceland to the Soviet Union, faces deadly challenges in the Arctic. Despite Allied naval escort, catastrophic intelligence errors expose the convoy to relentless German air and naval attacks. In the brutal conditions, inexperienced civilian sailors fight for survival, with only 12 ships making it to their destination.', 'In 1942, a convoy of 35 civilian ships, carrying vital supplies from Iceland to the Soviet Union, faces deadly challenges in the Arctic. Despite Allied naval escort, catastrophic intelligence errors expose the convoy to relentless German air and naval attacks. In the brutal conditions, inexperienced civilian sailors fight for survival, with only 12 ships making it to their destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qtd6xschdz7GBnEMZfPfUir7cs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983044'),
  ('222946391221831642', 'The Arctic Giant', 1942, 'Fantasy, Animation, Action, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Bud Collyer, Joan Alexander, Jackson Beck, Julian Noa', null, 'A frozen Tyrannosaurus rex is found and put on display in a museum, but when he thaws out and revives, Superman has to stop his rampage!', 'A frozen Tyrannosaurus rex is found and put on display in a museum, but when he thaws out and revives, Superman has to stop his rampage!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mb7S7awIFe5iQ5zJNpFFkbFU2v7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145961'),
  ('383917805363389396', 'The Ardennes', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Robin Pront, Robrecht Heyvaert', 'Jeroen Perceval, Robin Pront', 'Jeroen Perceval, Veerle Baetens, Kevin Janssens, Éric Godon, Jan Bijvoet, Peter van den Begin, Sam Louwyck, Viviane de Muynck', null, 'A brutal home-jacking goes hopelessly wrong. Dave, one of the two robbers, manages to run off, leaving his brother Kenneth behind. Four years later, Kenneth is released from prison and much has changed. Dave has his life back on track and is trying to help Kenneth however possible, but is witnessing how the highly strung Kenneth tries to win back his ex-girlfriend Sylvie.', 'A brutal home-jacking goes hopelessly wrong. Dave, one of the two robbers, manages to run off, leaving his brother Kenneth behind. Four years later, Kenneth is released from prison and much has changed. Dave has his life back on track and is trying to help Kenneth however possible, but is witnessing how the highly strung Kenneth tries to win back his ex-girlfriend Sylvie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVfABxAnahoU65o61cZ77tKNbD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351037'),
  ('804223810873326797', 'The Ardor', 2014, 'Western, Drama', 'Pablo Fendrik, Julián Apezteguia', 'Pablo Fendrik', 'Gael García Bernal, Alice Braga, Claudio Tolcachir, Chico Diaz, Jorge Sesán, Julián Tello, Lautaro Vilo, Iván Steinhardt', 'R', 'Kaí is a mysterious shaman who emerges from the Rio Paraná to help a poor farmer and his daughter, who are threatened by a band of cold-blooded mercenaries hired to force them to sell their land.', 'Kaí is a mysterious shaman who emerges from the Rio Paraná to help a poor farmer and his daughter, who are threatened by a band of cold-blooded mercenaries hired to force them to sell their land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWifXtBV2xeXVOZj0hiqA7ToVbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267579'),
  ('995088659970567184', 'The Arena', 1974, 'Action, Adventure', 'Steve Carver, Joe D''Amato', 'Joyce Hooper Corrington, John William Corrington', 'Pam Grier, Margaret Markov, Lucretia Love, Paul Müller, Daniele Vargas, Maria Pia Conte, Rosalba Neri, Marie Louise Sinclair', 'R', 'Female gladiators fight to the death. Inspired by the story of Spartacus, follow the adventures of a bevy of slave girls who, upon finding themselves thrust into the gladiator ring, mount a vicious rebellion to fight their way to freedom.', 'Female gladiators fight to the death. Inspired by the story of Spartacus, follow the adventures of a bevy of slave girls who, upon finding themselves thrust into the gladiator ring, mount a vicious rebellion to fight their way to freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqQlMxVJWPwYM74IhEqDane2FSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29039'),
  ('558469538016371825', 'The Argument', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Schwartzman', 'Zac Stanford', 'Dan Fogler, Emma Bell, Maggie Q, Danny Pudi, Tyler James Williams, Cleopatra Coleman, Karan Brar, Charlotte McKinney', null, 'A couple get into an argument at their cocktail party that escalates until it brings an abrupt end to the festivities. They and their guests decide to re-create the entire night again and again to determine who was right.', 'A couple get into an argument at their cocktail party that escalates until it brings an abrupt end to the festivities. They and their guests decide to re-create the entire night again and again to determine who was right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jq67d2UvbozXszkrLnGDzwnWSnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735436'),
  ('247334519625514927', 'The Argyle Secrets', 1948, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Cy Endfield, Mack Stengler, Clarence Eurist', 'Cy Endfield', 'William Gargan, Marjorie Lord, Ralph Byrd, Jack Reitzen, John Banner, Barbara Billingsley, Alex Frazer, Peter Brocco', 'NR', 'A framed reporter and the crooks on his trail scramble to locate a book containing the names of American war profiteers and traitors who collaborated with the Nazis during the war.', 'A framed reporter and the crooks on his trail scramble to locate a book containing the names of American war profiteers and traitors who collaborated with the Nazis during the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qd5ysE1MDZkFMXWTmlw7FdJJa7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173635'),
  ('946148851393907884', 'The Aristo-Cat', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Michael Maltese, Tedd Pierce', 'G', 'Meadows the butler quits after being tormented by the spoiled family cat, who finds he is unable to survive on his own, especially after meeting the mice Hubie and Bertie.', 'Meadows the butler quits after being tormented by the spoiled family cat, who finds he is unable to survive on his own, especially after meeting the mice Hubie and Bertie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EVD4Vf7PG1KKEad5pJzvQdvQFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171269'),
  ('842584343371579999', 'The Aristocats', 1970, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Wolfgang Reitherman, Ken Anderson', 'Ken Anderson, Frank Thomas, Vance Gerry', 'Phil Harris, Eva Gabor, Sterling Holloway, Scatman Crothers, Paul Winchell, Lord Tim Hudson, Vito Scotti, Thurl Ravenscroft', 'G', 'When Madame Adelaide Bonfamille leaves her fortune to Duchess and her children—Bonfamille’s beloved family of cats—the butler plots to steal the money and kidnaps the legatees, leaving them out on a country road. All seems lost until the wily Thomas O’Malley Cat and his jazz-playing alley cats come to the aristocats’ rescue.', 'When Madame Adelaide Bonfamille leaves her fortune to Duchess and her children—Bonfamille’s beloved family of cats—the butler plots to steal the money and kidnaps the legatees, leaving them out on a country road. All seems lost until the wily Thomas O’Malley Cat and his jazz-playing alley cats come to the aristocats’ rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BVOSmQUhphMgnTxnXyfQ9tL1Sc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10112'),
  ('247828364074611042', 'The Aristocrats', 2005, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Paul Provenza, Penn Jillette', null, 'Jason Alexander, Chris Albrecht, Hank Azaria, Shelley Berman, Steven Gary Banks, Lewis Black, Mario Cantone, George Carlin', 'NR', 'One hundred superstar comedians tell the same very, VERY dirty, filthy joke--one shared privately by comics since Vaudeville.', 'One hundred superstar comedians tell the same very, VERY dirty, filthy joke--one shared privately by comics since Vaudeville.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ag25aONVwWspQAuEPwNKmwUOvce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15258'),
  ('343837724088873317', 'The Ark Of Disperata', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Giannoccaro, Edoardo Winspeare, Miguel Lombardi', 'Edoardo Winspeare, Alessandro Valenti', 'Antonio Carluccio, Gustavo Caputo, Celeste Casciaro, Davide Riso, Claudio Giangreco, Alessandra De Luca, Francesco Ferrante, Antonio Pennarella', null, 'At Disperata, a small town in Southern Italy, the melancholy mayor Filippo Pisanelli feels terribly unfit for his role. Only a love of poetry and his passion for the literature lessons he gives to prison inmates admit a chink of light into his general state of depression. In jail he meets Pati, a small-time criminal from his own town. Pati and his brother Angiolino were dreaming of becoming the mafia bosses of Capo di Leuca, but the encounter with art changes everything and an unusual friendship between the three men will lead them to make courageous choices.', 'At Disperata, a small town in Southern Italy, the melancholy mayor Filippo Pisanelli feels terribly unfit for his role. Only a love of poetry and his passion for the literature lessons he gives to prison inmates admit a chink of light into his general state of depression. In jail he meets Pati, a small-time criminal from his own town. Pati and his brother Angiolino were dreaming of becoming the mafia bosses of Capo di Leuca, but the encounter with art changes everything and an unusual friendship between the three men will lead them to make courageous choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LhJkWmweYC8vmQf82sirhUrFis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473505'),
  ('333135646658732327', 'The Ark Of Mr. Chow', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Xiao Yang', 'Xiao Yang, Zhang Ji', 'Sun Honglei, Zhou Dongyu, Dong Zijian, Wang Yuexin, Zhao Lixin, Liu Xilong, Wang Sen, Wang Zixuan', null, 'A group of bright teenagers are recruited for a special college program for young geniuses only to find themselves socially awkward among their more normal peers.', 'A group of bright teenagers are recruited for a special college program for young geniuses only to find themselves socially awkward among their more normal peers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9WJAGboE8RYg5DR6D1EHOxB1NF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344938'),
  ('5904937319380715', 'The Ark of the Sun God', 1984, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Antonio Margheriti, Sandro Mancori', 'Giovanni Simonelli', 'David Warbeck, Luciano Pigozzi, Ricardo Palacios, Susie Sudlow, John Steiner, Achille Brugnini, Aytekin Akkaya', null, 'A safecracker takes a job where he must go to Istanbul and steal a scepter that once belonged to the god Gilgamesh but is now in the temple of a secret cult.', 'A safecracker takes a job where he must go to Istanbul and steal a scepter that once belonged to the god Gilgamesh but is now in the temple of a secret cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jh21vQpulkLu8bL9ZZ71ailNfL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105236'),
  ('828532140695526972', 'The Armadillo''s Prophecy', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gherardo Gossi, Emanuele Scaringi', 'Oscar Glioti, Zerocalcare, Valerio Mastandrea', 'Simone Liberati, Valerio Aprea, Pietro Castellitto, Laura Morante, Gianluca Gobbi, Diana Del Bufalo, Guglielmo Poggi, Valentino Campitelli', null, 'A 27-year-old suburban slacker entertains daily conversations bordering on paradoxical with his conscience, which manifests itself in the form of a human-sized armadillo. Based on the best-selling graphic novel by Zerocalcare.', 'A 27-year-old suburban slacker entertains daily conversations bordering on paradoxical with his conscience, which manifests itself in the form of a human-sized armadillo. Based on the best-selling graphic novel by Zerocalcare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dHaWQxkm8gmdTuuignUOg5kmx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537847'),
  ('1133483590030632028', 'The Armstrong Lie', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gibney, Maryse Alberti', 'Alex Gibney', 'Lance Armstrong, Betsy Andreu, Frankie Andreu, Reed Albergotti, Johan Bruyneel, Daniel Coyle, Michele Ferrari, Michael Bloomberg', 'R', 'In 2009, Alex Gibney was hired to make a film about Lance Armstrong''s comeback to cycling. The project was shelved when the doping scandal erupted, and re-opened after Armstrong''s confession. The Armstrong Lie picks up in 2013 and presents a riveting, insider''s view of the unraveling of one of the most extraordinary stories in the history of sports. As Lance Armstrong says himself, "I didn''t live a lot of lies, but I lived one big one."', 'In 2009, Alex Gibney was hired to make a film about Lance Armstrong''s comeback to cycling. The project was shelved when the doping scandal erupted, and re-opened after Armstrong''s confession. The Armstrong Lie picks up in 2013 and presents a riveting, insider''s view of the unraveling of one of the most extraordinary stories in the history of sports. As Lance Armstrong says himself, "I didn''t live a lot of lies, but I lived one big one."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i90vU3XY68o27nxJexDqT7S4cGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214083'),
  ('411468208046298910', 'The Army Mascot', 1942, 'Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi, Don A. Duckwall', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto longs to be an Army mascot (especially after he sees how well they are fed) so he hatches a plan to take the place of the real mascot.', 'Pluto longs to be an Army mascot (especially after he sees how well they are fed) so he hatches a plan to take the place of the real mascot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpPCdydpbyvRqz00Wr0rnLASrhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64697'),
  ('485813860075493529', 'The Arnelo Affair', 1947, 'Crime, Drama', 'Thomas Theuerkauf, Charles Salerno Jr., Arch Oboler', 'Arch Oboler', 'John Hodiak, George Murphy, Frances Gifford, Dean Stockwell, Eve Arden, Warner Anderson, Lowell Gilmore, Archie Twitchell', null, 'A neglected wife gets mixed up with an hypnotic charmer and murder.', 'A neglected wife gets mixed up with an hypnotic charmer and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acyOsK8da5FGY1zRaR8XWXaKmr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29236'),
  ('202972805972384422', 'The Aroma of Tea', 2006, 'Animation', 'Michael Dudok de Wit', null, null, null, 'The Aroma of Tea is a 2006 Dutch animated short film made by Michaël Dudok de Wit. It shows how a small sphere travels in a determined and rhythmical manner through landscapes, emerging at the end into a larger sphere of white light. Both the graphic brushstroke and the music, with its haunting rhythms, are strikingly simple and direct. The theme of the film, a quest followed by a union, is as old as time and recognizable despite its limitless variations.', 'The Aroma of Tea is a 2006 Dutch animated short film made by Michaël Dudok de Wit. It shows how a small sphere travels in a determined and rhythmical manner through landscapes, emerging at the end into a larger sphere of white light. Both the graphic brushstroke and the music, with its haunting rhythms, are strikingly simple and direct. The theme of the film, a quest followed by a union, is as old as time and recognizable despite its limitless variations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFm4yLnrQzvcr0I8ojdE1VaEn7c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245300'),
  ('1092350862373671615', 'The Arrangement', 1969, 'Drama, Romance', 'Elia Kazan, Robert Surtees, Burtt Harris', 'Elia Kazan', 'Kirk Douglas, Faye Dunaway, Deborah Kerr, Richard Boone, Hume Cronyn, Michael Higgins, Carol Eve Rossen, William Hansen', 'R', 'An adman attempts to rebuild his shattered life after suffering a nervous breakdown.', 'An adman attempts to rebuild his shattered life after suffering a nervous breakdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBghjtl7pEF1D9LVIR2TN48yPP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48612'),
  ('728392444053336183', 'The Arrangement', 1983, 'Drama', 'Fernando Ayala, Alberto Lecchi, Víctor Hugo Caula', 'Roberto Cossa, Carlos Somigliana', 'Federico Luppi, Julio De Grazia, Rodolfo Ranni, Haydée Padilla, Susú Pecoraro, Dora Prince, María Visconti, Mario Alarcón', null, 'Luis is a righteous man who begins a struggle and a moral debate with his family, neighbors and close friends when a corrupt municipal official offers a very convenient "arrangement".', 'Luis is a righteous man who begins a struggle and a moral debate with his family, neighbors and close friends when a corrupt municipal official offers a very convenient "arrangement".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgrbOcNOwDnVaDGg4kvGMRqV6XR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342731'),
  ('378865317621561961', 'The Arrival', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'David Schmoeller, Steve Grass', 'Kevin Daniel Ljoka', 'John Saxon, Joseph Culp, Robin Frates, Robert Sampson, Geoff Hansen, Danna Garen, Danny Fendley, Kim Dawson', 'PG-13', 'An old man, who has been near a fallen meteor, starts to get younger and younger, with a terrible thirst for blood.', 'An old man, who has been near a fallen meteor, starts to get younger and younger, with a terrible thirst for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZunF0TOHL9j4hONvyA1XDKJ9Nt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132369'),
  ('288003445859115479', 'The Arrival', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'David Twohy, Hiro Narita, René Villarreal', 'David Twohy', 'Charlie Sheen, Lindsay Crouse, Richard Schiff, Ron Silver, Teri Polo, Phyllis Applegate, Tony T. Johnson, Alan Coates', 'PG-13', 'Zane Ziminski is an astrophysicist who receives a message that seems to have extraterrestrial origins. Eerily soon after his discovery, Zane is fired. He then embarks on a search to determine the origins of the transmission that leads him into a Hitchcockian labyrinth of paranoia and intrigue.', 'Zane Ziminski is an astrophysicist who receives a message that seems to have extraterrestrial origins. Eerily soon after his discovery, Zane is fired. He then embarks on a search to determine the origins of the transmission that leads him into a Hitchcockian labyrinth of paranoia and intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3051CM0SZfZJ3oOJG8P0YERQl1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10547'),
  ('978831351870055279', 'The Arrival', 1999, 'Drama', 'Peter Tscherkassky, Peter Tscherkassky', 'Peter Tscherkassky', null, null, 'The first of Peter Tscherkassky''s Cinemascope trilogy of short films is a fragmented glimpse of images pulsating with chaotic rhythm as they fight white margins for room in his palette. Mirrored frames being split by white margin and trying to reassemble again like the poles of a magnet, a train approaching station and colliding with itself in white-hot blistering chaos.', 'The first of Peter Tscherkassky''s Cinemascope trilogy of short films is a fragmented glimpse of images pulsating with chaotic rhythm as they fight white margins for room in his palette. Mirrored frames being split by white margin and trying to reassemble again like the poles of a magnet, a train approaching station and colliding with itself in white-hot blistering chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tlJywzPugrG79abtuPKezhnzW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179382'),
  ('551273376468611199', 'The Arrival of a Train at La Ciotat', 1896, 'History', 'Louis Lumière, Louis Lumière, Auguste Lumière', null, 'Madeleine Koehler, Marcel Koehler, Marguerite Lumière, Jeanne-Joséphine Lumière, Rose Lumière, Suzanne Lumière', null, 'A group of people are standing along the platform of a railway station in La Ciotat, waiting for a train. One is seen coming, at some distance, and eventually stops at the platform. Doors of the railway-cars open and attendants help passengers off and on. Popular legend has it that, when this film was shown, the first-night audience fled the café in terror, fearing being run over by the "approaching" train. This legend has since been identified as promotional embellishment, though there is evidence to suggest that people were astounded at the capabilities of the Lumières'' cinématographe.', 'A group of people are standing along the platform of a railway station in La Ciotat, waiting for a train. One is seen coming, at some distance, and eventually stops at the platform. Doors of the railway-cars open and attendants help passengers off and on. Popular legend has it that, when this film was shown, the first-night audience fled the café in terror, fearing being run over by the "approaching" train. This legend has since been identified as promotional embellishment, though there is evidence to suggest that people were astounded at the capabilities of the Lumières'' cinématographe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5HSlaNCzwV95rAriDmT19el5h1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160'),
  ('136369351584623861', 'The Arrival of Joachim Stiller', 1976, 'Mystery', 'Harry Kümel, Eduard van der Enden', 'Harry Kümel, Jan Blokker, Jean Ferry', 'Hugo Metsers, Cox Habbema, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Ward de Ravet, Charles Janssens, Dora van der Groen, Raf Reymen, Joan Remmelts', null, 'The film tells the story of Freek Groenevelt and Simone Marijnissen whose lives are taken over by Joachim Stiller.', 'The film tells the story of Freek Groenevelt and Simone Marijnissen whose lives are taken over by Joachim Stiller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnTr52LOLPqHalKkQjx7iyULudd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94674'),
  ('289344057357145677', 'The Arrival of Wang', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Antonio Manetti, Marco Manetti, Alessandro Chiodo', 'Antonio Manetti, Marco Manetti', 'Ennio Fantastichini, Francesca Cuttica, Juliet Esey Joseph, Li Yong, Antonello Morroni, Jader Giraldi, Carmen Giardina, Rodolfo Baldini', null, 'Chinese-language interpreter Gaia is called up out of the blue by the Italian authorities with an urgent and confidential translation assignment. She is whisked away to a secret underground location and ushered into a pitch-black room where she is asked to interpret the harsh interrogation of a mysterious presence, the eponymous Mr. Wang.', 'Chinese-language interpreter Gaia is called up out of the blue by the Italian authorities with an urgent and confidential translation assignment. She is whisked away to a secret underground location and ushered into a pitch-black room where she is asked to interpret the harsh interrogation of a mysterious presence, the eponymous Mr. Wang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ks90Wx2T1ur5GYDoYu4DtFdKci3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91929'),
  ('400276743592433936', 'The Arrow', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Don McBrearty', 'Keith Ross Leckie', 'Dan Aykroyd, Sara Botsford, Aidan Devine, Nigel Bennett, Jonathan Whittaker, Ian D. Clark, David Lawrence Brown, Catherine Fitch', null, 'The story of the Avro Arrow, the world''s fastest fighter plane built in 1950''s Canada, and how the project was dropped due to political pressure from the United States.', 'The story of the Avro Arrow, the world''s fastest fighter plane built in 1950''s Canada, and how the project was dropped due to political pressure from the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lQQx47YC7L8no42kiaJggDnCuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19665'),
  ('347577570662099812', 'The Arrows of Robin Hood', 1976, 'History, Adventure', 'Sergei Tarasov, Dāvis Sīmanis, Igors Jakovlevs', 'Kirill Rapoport, Sergei Tarasov', 'Boris Khmelnitsky, Ivars Kalnins, Yuriy Kamorniy, Vija Artmane, Regīna Razuma, Algimantas Masiulis, Aleksandr Belyavskiy', null, 'With a traditional archery contest, the winner wins a silver arrow with gold lace and gold feathers. Even Robin Hood, although unrecognizable, takes part in this competition. As more and more participants are losing and Robin Hood eventually wins the award, his masquerade reveals. For none of the participants is as handy with a bow and an arrow like Robin Hood. With the help of his coolness and his friends Robin Hood may escape the dangerous situation.', 'With a traditional archery contest, the winner wins a silver arrow with gold lace and gold feathers. Even Robin Hood, although unrecognizable, takes part in this competition. As more and more participants are losing and Robin Hood eventually wins the award, his masquerade reveals. For none of the participants is as handy with a bow and an arrow like Robin Hood. With the help of his coolness and his friends Robin Hood may escape the dangerous situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNDfzsZcfIQRcBKj48ZmRcJ3q0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75392'),
  ('342410741338945030', 'The Arsenal Stadium Mystery', 1939, 'Mystery', 'Thorold Dickinson, Desmond Dickinson, Cecil Dixon', 'Donald Bull, Patrick Kirwan', 'Leslie Banks, Greta Gynt, Ian McLean, Liane Linden, Anthony Bushell, Esmond Knight, Brian Worth, Richard Norris', null, 'During a charity football match between Arsenal and touring amateur side Trojans, the Trojan''s new star player collapses and dies. Inspector Slade of Scotland Yard is called in and declares it was murder. It takes all his ingenuity and another death before the motive is discovered and the killer revealed.', 'During a charity football match between Arsenal and touring amateur side Trojans, the Trojan''s new star player collapses and dies. Inspector Slade of Scotland Yard is called in and declares it was murder. It takes all his ingenuity and another death before the motive is discovered and the killer revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czAps8V6SWLZ00tIayBW8trWc8K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68310'),
  ('854956797155795653', 'The Art of Breaking Up', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Pierre-William Glenn, Michel Deville', 'Georges Feydeau, Rosalinde Deville', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Charles Berling, Dominique Blanc, Jacques Bonnaffé, Mathieu Demy, Julie Depardieu, Sara Forestier, Stanislas Merhar', null, 'Lucette and Edouard: Two lovers passionate about sex, money and life. He is a spoiled but penniless child who wants it all while she is a celebrated figure of la vie parisienne who knows what she wants and what she is worth. Edouard is marrying a young, pretty and rich heiress. He comes to confess this to Lucette and to make their parting official, but he doesn’t want to leave her. He struggles with all his might to hide his betrayal but her opportunities to learn of it are countless and unpredictable.', 'Lucette and Edouard: Two lovers passionate about sex, money and life. He is a spoiled but penniless child who wants it all while she is a celebrated figure of la vie parisienne who knows what she wants and what she is worth. Edouard is marrying a young, pretty and rich heiress. He comes to confess this to Lucette and to make their parting official, but he doesn’t want to leave her. He struggles with all his might to hide his betrayal but her opportunities to learn of it are countless and unpredictable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Aa3DEJyDIa3fA7SVGLDPRc5q3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77154'),
  ('560876178409725377', 'The Art of Crying', 2007, 'Drama', 'Peter Schønau Fog', 'Bo Hr. Hansen', 'Jannik Lorenzen, Jesper Asholt, Julie Kolbech, Hanne Hedelund, Thomas Knuth-Winterfeldt, Rita Angela, Gitte Siem, Lene Tiemroth', null, 'Life is not easy for 11-year-old Allan living in South Jutland during the early 1970s. His mentally unstable father frequently threatens suicide and his mother has long since given up. It''s up to Allan to keep the family together. When a rival family threatens his father''s livelihood, Allan starts committing atrocious acts.', 'Life is not easy for 11-year-old Allan living in South Jutland during the early 1970s. His mentally unstable father frequently threatens suicide and his mother has long since given up. It''s up to Allan to keep the family together. When a rival family threatens his father''s livelihood, Allan starts committing atrocious acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krtnNxK8bl3o8VjkXOVvxs5gAeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15776'),
  ('1012293439809731395', 'The Art of Dying', 1991, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Richard Pepin, Wings Hauser, Charla Driver', 'Joseph Merhi', 'Wings Hauser, Kathleen Kinmont, Gary Werntz, Mitch Hara, Sarah Douglas, Michael J. Pollard, Sydney Lassick, Angela Rae', 'R', 'A cinematographer and his assistant are attracting aspiring young actors and actresses by getting them to try out for their movie. Once filming, the evil cameraman actually kills them. The detective on the case has his hands full trying to help out runaways with stars in their eyes. When some of the people he knows turn up dead, he takes it personally, and as he gets closer to the truth his girlfriend is endangered.', 'A cinematographer and his assistant are attracting aspiring young actors and actresses by getting them to try out for their movie. Once filming, the evil cameraman actually kills them. The detective on the case has his hands full trying to help out runaways with stars in their eyes. When some of the people he knows turn up dead, he takes it personally, and as he gets closer to the truth his girlfriend is endangered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxS0PZQiYGzoDtO17ntst9JrwmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119205'),
  ('950295064489073455', 'The Art of Dying', 2000, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero, Javier Salmones, José Picazo', 'Curro Royo, Juan Vicente Pozuelo', 'Fele Martínez, María Esteve, Gustavo Salmerón, Adrià Collado, Lucía Jiménez, Elsa Pataky, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba', null, 'Four years after his disappearance, the mysterious case of Nacho, a young and promising painter, is reopened by the police.', 'Four years after his disappearance, the mysterious case of Nacho, a young and promising painter, is reopened by the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWKYOXkmUxJoOPL1APiq2ZN8NR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100122'),
  ('1019307143409819898', 'The Art of Fighting', 2006, 'Action, Comedy', 'Shin Han-sol', 'Min Dong-hyun, Shin Han-sol', 'Baek Yoon-sik, Jae Hee, Kim Eung-soo, Choi Yeo-jin, Park Won-sang, Hong Seung-jin, Park Ki-woong, Jeon Jae-hyeong', null, 'Byung-tae is the kid who is always on the receiving end of beatings from the school bullies—that is, until he meets Pan-su, a martial arts expert who takes him under his wing.', 'Byung-tae is the kid who is always on the receiving end of beatings from the school bullies—that is, until he meets Pan-su, a martial arts expert who takes him under his wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBGsa9OQtKeMjdzPkNKgPYT1GXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39021'),
  ('22255986456526322', 'The Art of Flight', 2011, 'Adventure, Documentary', 'Curt Morgan', null, 'Travis Rice, Nicholas Müller, Mark Landvik, Jake Blauvelt, Pat Moore, David Carrier-Porcheron, Scotty Lago, Eero Niemela', 'PG-13', 'Iconic snowboarder Travis Rice and friends redefine what is possible in the mountains. Experience the highs, as new tricks are landed and new zones opened, alongside the lows, where avalanches, accidents, and wrong-turns strike.', 'Iconic snowboarder Travis Rice and friends redefine what is possible in the mountains. Experience the highs, as new tricks are landed and new zones opened, alongside the lows, where avalanches, accidents, and wrong-turns strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5k4edlPT6TeBnYzicIQSbprQIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68450'),
  ('311033252762089441', 'The Art of Getting Along', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Zampa, Marco Scarpelli, Luciano Martino', 'Vitaliano Brancati', 'Alberto Sordi, Giacomo Furia, Marco Guglielmi, Franco Coop, Luisa Della Noce, Franco Jamonte, Elli Parvo, Armenia Balducci', null, 'In this comedy Alberto Sordi plays Rosario Scimoni, known as Sasà, an opportunistic and unscrupulous guy, nephew of the mayor of Catania, and he''s always ready to take sides with anyone who can help him. He switches from socialism to fascism; he changes his political faith the same way he changes women. He even tries to found his own party.', 'In this comedy Alberto Sordi plays Rosario Scimoni, known as Sasà, an opportunistic and unscrupulous guy, nephew of the mayor of Catania, and he''s always ready to take sides with anyone who can help him. He switches from socialism to fascism; he changes his political faith the same way he changes women. He even tries to found his own party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXUOxwP9F9uk5luEgnMly38ltrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82470'),
