  ('60243442128859149', 'The Art of Losing', 2004, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Sergio Cabrera, Hans Burmann', 'Jorge Goldenberg', 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, Martina García, César Mora, Víctor Mallarino, Jairo Camargo, Humberto Dorado, Mimí Lazo, Gustavo Angarita', null, 'A body is discovered impaled on a stake near a scenic lake near Bogota. A journalist try to find what happened. With a friend, they set about to find the cause of the crime and uncover an intricate real estate fraud involving corrupt politicians, emerald hunters, nudists...', 'A body is discovered impaled on a stake near a scenic lake near Bogota. A journalist try to find what happened. With a friend, they set about to find the cause of the crime and uncover an intricate real estate fraud involving corrupt politicians, emerald hunters, nudists...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Xom3UdD3we73p3vN8AM6et71jW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34005'),
  ('698637557545550899', 'The Art of Love', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Norman Jewison, Wendell Franklin, Douglas Green', 'Carl Reiner', 'James Garner, Dick Van Dyke, Elke Sommer, Angie Dickinson, Ethel Merman, Carl Reiner, Pierre Olaf, Miiko Taka', null, 'Struggling artist fakes his own death so his works will increase in value.', 'Struggling artist fakes his own death so his works will increase in value.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geceztwEdKyacORmEwWtWme4aq8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105465'),
  ('388251888967144408', 'The Art of Love', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Emmanuel Mouret, Laurent Desmet', 'Emmanuel Mouret', 'Emmanuel Mouret, Pascale Arbillot, Ariane Ascaride, Frédérique Bel, François Cluzet, Julie Depardieu, Judith Godrèche, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing', null, 'Several interconnected chapters follow a variety of Parisian couples navigating love, desire, and relationships. Isabelle, frustrated by a year of celibacy, rejects her friend Zoé’s offer to "borrow" her husband and instead impersonates their mutual friend Amélie, who cannot bring herself to sleep with her close friend Boris. Meanwhile, the lonely Achille is stunned when his alluring new neighbor appears at his door in a negligee, proposing an affair. Elsewhere, middle-aged Emmanuelle struggles with an overwhelming attraction to every handsome man she encounters, threatening her marriage, while a young couple wrestles with jealousy. Each chapter delves into the unpredictability of love with humor and poignancy.', 'Several interconnected chapters follow a variety of Parisian couples navigating love, desire, and relationships. Isabelle, frustrated by a year of celibacy, rejects her friend Zoé’s offer to "borrow" her husband and instead impersonates their mutual friend Amélie, who cannot bring herself to sleep with her close friend Boris. Meanwhile, the lonely Achille is stunned when his alluring new neighbor appears at his door in a negligee, proposing an affair. Elsewhere, middle-aged Emmanuelle struggles with an overwhelming attraction to every handsome man she encounters, threatening her marriage, while a young couple wrestles with jealousy. Each chapter delves into the unpredictability of love with humor and poignancy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBDqfxQpRCMSRvmj4uPVhO8ykMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92424'),
  ('189624205975239466', 'The Art of Loving: Story of Michalina Wislocka', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Maria Sadowska, Michał Fojcik, Michał Sobociński', 'Krzysztof Rak', 'Magdalena Boczarska, Piotr Adamczyk, Justyna Wasilewska, Eryk Lubos, Jaśmina Polak, Karolina Gruszka, Danuta Stenka, Arkadiusz Jakubik', null, 'Michalina Wislocka, the most famous and recognized sexologist of communist Poland, fights for the right to publish her book, which will change the sex life of Polish people forever.', 'Michalina Wislocka, the most famous and recognized sexologist of communist Poland, fights for the right to publish her book, which will change the sex life of Polish people forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZ9yE8zutovEcXwARSv3RBugo6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432025'),
  ('238854108180325230', 'The Art of Negative Thinking', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bård Breien, Gaute Gunnari', 'Bård Breien', 'Fridtjov Såheim, Kirsti Eline Torhaug, Henrik Mestad, Marian Saastad Ottesen, Kari Simonsen, Per Schaanning, Kjersti Holmen, Christian Soldal', null, 'The local disability support group visits an involuntary member, not realizing that it will bring them to a critical mass.', 'The local disability support group visits an involuntary member, not realizing that it will bring them to a critical mass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ze2048EyOqImLuDo2XNNEduqSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12167'),
  ('1116955957321549408', 'The Art of Nothing', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Stefan Liberski, Hichame Alaouié', 'Stefan Liberski', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Gustave Kervern, Camille Cottin, François Damiens, Laurence Bibot, Lorella Cravotta, Frédéric Clou, Chloé Larrère', null, 'Jean-Yves Machond, a globally unknown and generally unhappy painter, decides one day to change his life. He seeks inspiration in a small Norman town, in order to design a masterpiece that will finally earn him glory and eternal recognition. But his meeting with local artists, from the warm Bagnoule to the skillful Cécile, will somewhat make him deviate from his path, and bring him face to face with his deepest dream: that of simply being a happy man.', 'Jean-Yves Machond, a globally unknown and generally unhappy painter, decides one day to change his life. He seeks inspiration in a small Norman town, in order to design a masterpiece that will finally earn him glory and eternal recognition. But his meeting with local artists, from the warm Bagnoule to the skillful Cécile, will somewhat make him deviate from his path, and bring him face to face with his deepest dream: that of simply being a happy man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1e4f79KcxvjyKsQEHBunlHS2k5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168543'),
  ('346140593117354961', 'The Art of Return', 2020, 'Drama', 'Pedro Collantes', 'Pedro Collantes, Daniel Remón', 'Macarena García, Nacho Sánchez, Ingrid García Jonsson, Mireia Oriol, Luka Peroš, Celso Bugallo, Lucía Juárez', null, 'Noemí is a young actress who returns home after 6 years in New York for an audition that could change her career. During the first 24 hours back in Madrid, she has a series of encounters that teach her how to cherish the seasons of life.', 'Noemí is a young actress who returns home after 6 years in New York for an audition that could change her career. During the first 24 hours back in Madrid, she has a series of encounters that teach her how to cherish the seasons of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wA5k0VfNz6hlJKCQGB54h6Yu4S7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728206'),
  ('1096410012883806093', 'The Art of Seduction', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Oh Ki-hwan, Lee Seok-hyun', 'Hwang Da-eun, Oh Ki-hwan, Shin Jung-goo', 'Son Ye-jin, Song Il-gook, Ahn Sun-Young, Woo Hyeon, Jung Sung-il, Ahn Sang-tae, Hong Seok-cheon, Hyun Young', null, 'A man and woman have great success in all of their dating pursuits. The woman uses her dating rules and fakes a car accident to capture the guy''s attention, but she can''t get him to succumb to her charm.', 'A man and woman have great success in all of their dating pursuits. The woman uses her dating rules and fakes a car accident to capture the guy''s attention, but she can''t get him to succumb to her charm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsl8l97CtFONXiYFwI4AIxCq6eI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20969'),
  ('534676723994359982', 'The Art of Seduction', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Guy Mazarguil, Martin De Chabaneix', 'Guy Mazarguil, Erick Malabry', 'Mathieu Demy, Julie Gayet, Valérie Donzelli, Lionel Abelanski, Émilie Caen, Élisabeth Vitali, Alban Lenoir, Eva Mazauric', null, 'Jean-François is a psychoanalyst in love with one of his patients. When she decides to stop therapy, Jean-François at last feels free to seduce the woman. Paralyzed when in front of his object of love, Jean-François accumulates blunders of every kind. He hence turns to Julien, one his patients who is in therapy to overcome his compulsive-obsessive flirting disorder. It''s a totally absurd initiative on Jean-François''s part. But, even so...', 'Jean-François is a psychoanalyst in love with one of his patients. When she decides to stop therapy, Jean-François at last feels free to seduce the woman. Paralyzed when in front of his object of love, Jean-François accumulates blunders of every kind. He hence turns to Julien, one his patients who is in therapy to overcome his compulsive-obsessive flirting disorder. It''s a totally absurd initiative on Jean-François''s part. But, even so...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3UKgvRDgN7jQd1ZQH3axHOnZAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80512'),
  ('1126053847375262092', 'The Art of Self Defense', 1941, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jack Kinney, Louis Debney', 'Ralph Wright, Rex Cox', 'John McLeish, George Johnson', 'NR', 'Goofy takes a lighthearted look at self defense through the ages: cavemen, knights, the age of chivalry, and finally boxing.', 'Goofy takes a lighthearted look at self defense through the ages: cavemen, knights, the age of chivalry, and finally boxing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLzDoY9HGiOvVrbtUAHqNLcwXYH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67570'),
  ('596143150364431901', 'The Art of Self-Defense', 2019, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Riley Stearns, Michael Ragen, Siena Brown', 'Riley Stearns', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Alessandro Nivola, Imogen Poots, Steve Terada, David Zellner, Phillip Andre Botello, Jason Burkey, Mike Brooks', 'R', 'Casey is attacked at random on the street and enlists in a local dojo led by a charismatic and mysterious Sensei in an effort to learn how to defend himself. What he uncovers is a sinister world of fraternity, violence and hypermasculinity and a woman fighting for her place in it.', 'Casey is attacked at random on the street and enlists in a local dojo led by a charismatic and mysterious Sensei in an effort to learn how to defend himself. What he uncovers is a sinister world of fraternity, violence and hypermasculinity and a woman fighting for her place in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTq793Qwl3tCXb94zrDPAwppbsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480001'),
  ('1060895568771102862', 'The Art of Skiing', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'John McLeish, Hannes Schroll', 'NR', 'Goofy, staying at the Sugar Bowl resort, demonstrates the basics of downhill skiing, which the titles and announcer insist is pronounced "SHEEing". The equipment is, of course, of the era. As you can imagine, Goofy has much trouble keeping his skis parallel and pointing downhill. The final ski jump conveniently lands Goofy right back in bed.', 'Goofy, staying at the Sugar Bowl resort, demonstrates the basics of downhill skiing, which the titles and announcer insist is pronounced "SHEEing". The equipment is, of course, of the era. As you can imagine, Goofy has much trouble keeping his skis parallel and pointing downhill. The final ski jump conveniently lands Goofy right back in bed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsh0RdmBB5h8tl3NtuPl0UgYNnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67571'),
  ('984041223466098788', 'The Art of Stealing', 2008, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Leonel Vieira', 'João Quadros, Roberto Santiago', 'Ivo Canelas, Flora Martínez, Enrique Arce, Soraia Chaves, Nicolau Breyner, Miguel Borges, Aldo Lima, Almeno Gonçalves', null, 'Two amateur thieves are hired to steal an extremely valuable Van Gogh painting from the abandoned farm of an Argentinian countess.', 'Two amateur thieves are hired to steal an extremely valuable Van Gogh painting from the abandoned farm of an Argentinian countess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBGVNKPVCT34l0O7WIUl0nrwELf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21455'),
  ('515062802571584623', 'The Art of Telling Lies', 2026, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Pascal Payant', 'Pascal Payant', 'Christian Wennberg, Charleen Elea, Maria Alm Norell, Henrik Norman, Stefan Kaminsky', null, 'Four strangers from Europe receive invitations to a special event at a secluded castle, only to realize that they are being blackmailed for their past scandals. The gathering forces them to confront the harsh truth of who they are.', 'Four strangers from Europe receive invitations to a special event at a secluded castle, only to realize that they are being blackmailed for their past scandals. The gathering forces them to confront the harsh truth of who they are.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FbR23eSZSnjYpYpAjbbwecnEROTq.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-art-of-telling-lies'),
  ('75392118609530193', 'The Art of the Steal', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jonathan Sobol, Adam Swica', 'Jonathan Sobol', 'Kurt Russell, Matt Dillon, Jay Baruchel, Kenneth Welsh, Chris Diamantopoulos, Katheryn Winnick, Jason Jones, Terence Stamp', 'R', 'Crunch Calhoun, a third-rate motorcycle daredevil and part-time art thief, teams up with his snaky brother to steal one of the most valuable books in the world. But it''s not just about the book for Crunch — he''s keen to rewrite some chapters of his own past as well.', 'Crunch Calhoun, a third-rate motorcycle daredevil and part-time art thief, teams up with his snaky brother to steal one of the most valuable books in the world. But it''s not just about the book for Crunch — he''s keen to rewrite some chapters of his own past as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4R6ojBfyO8fj3WszLE9rog5qR4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209247'),
  ('479436308288819130', 'The Art of Travel', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Thomas Whelan', null, 'Christopher Masterson, Brooke Burns, Johnny Messner, James Duval, Angelika Libera, Jake Muxworthy, Shalim Ortiz, Ernie Lively', 'R', 'High school grad. Conner Layne is about to marry his first love, but when wedding plans fail, he goes solo on his honeymoon to Central America, finding adventure with a ragtag group of foreigners who attempt to cross the Darien Gap in record time.', 'High school grad. Conner Layne is about to marry his first love, but when wedding plans fail, he goes solo on his honeymoon to Central America, finding adventure with a ragtag group of foreigners who attempt to cross the Darien Gap in record time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wZX3NitmlqBUhcHwByuyokUMRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18175'),
  ('1130558413524640347', 'The Art of War', 2000, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Pierre Gill, Christian Duguay', 'Wayne Beach, Simon Barry', 'Wesley Snipes, Donald Sutherland, Anne Archer, Maury Chaykin, Liliana Komorowska, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Michael Biehn, Marie Matiko', 'R', 'Neil Shaw is both agent and weapon - a critical line of defense for the Secretary General of the United Nations. He does not even officially exist. As an international security expert, he must uncover an international plot in which ruthless terrorists threatened to bring down the United Nations on the eve of an historic summit with China. A mysterious chain of events leads to the murder of the Chinese U.N. Ambassador, and the terrorists frame Neil Shaw, the one man they believe can stop them. Accused of the crime, Shaw goes underground — in effect, vanishing from his own life — as he tries to stop what could become World War III.', 'Neil Shaw is both agent and weapon - a critical line of defense for the Secretary General of the United Nations. He does not even officially exist. As an international security expert, he must uncover an international plot in which ruthless terrorists threatened to bring down the United Nations on the eve of an historic summit with China. A mysterious chain of events leads to the murder of the Chinese U.N. Ambassador, and the terrorists frame Neil Shaw, the one man they believe can stop them. Accused of the crime, Shaw goes underground — in effect, vanishing from his own life — as he tries to stop what could become World War III.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fbStI2ht3gMgsVRusqoBDWeK9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11398'),
  ('1041742395461760732', 'The Art of War II: Betrayal', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Josef Rusnak, Neil Cervin, Mike Crain', 'Jason Bourque, Keith Shaw', 'Wesley Snipes, Lochlyn Munro, Athena Karkanis, Winston Rekert, Ryan McDonald, Rachel Hayward, Scott Heindl, Michael Ryan', 'R', 'Agent Neil Shaw is called out of retirement and finds himself in the midst of a plot to assassinate several leading Senators with himself set-up to take the rap for a recent killing', 'Agent Neil Shaw is called out of retirement and finds himself in the midst of a plot to assassinate several leading Senators with himself set-up to take the rap for a recent killing', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJmkrZSJmPckuB3uwhZTOqZIRDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13988'),
  ('457525633514423946', 'The Art of War III: Retribution', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Gerry Lively, Suki Medencevic', 'Joe Halpin', 'Treach, Warren Derosa, Sung-Hi Lee, Janet Carroll, Leo Lee, Charles Rahi Chun, Brian Fitzpatrick, Jack Conley', null, 'When international diplomacy comes up short, extreme measures must be taken. In the newest installment of The Art of War, Agent Neil Shaw is on a covert mission to stop North Korean terrorists from obtaining a nuclear bomb. But when the deal turns deadly, Shaw is drawn into the crossfire to save a beautiful facilitator and ends up framed for murder...', 'When international diplomacy comes up short, extreme measures must be taken. In the newest installment of The Art of War, Agent Neil Shaw is on a covert mission to stop North Korean terrorists from obtaining a nuclear bomb. But when the deal turns deadly, Shaw is drawn into the crossfire to save a beautiful facilitator and ends up framed for murder...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igxwKUqgGh5gD1Z2TzVmW1f4DZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24756'),
  ('276603683149351245', 'The Artifice Girl', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Britt McTammany, Franklin Ritch', 'Franklin Ritch', 'Tatum Matthews, Franklin Ritch, Sinda Nichols, David Girard, Lance Henriksen, Rashaud Sessoms, Alyssa Moody, Lucy Noelle', 'NR', 'A team of special agents discovers a revolutionary new computer program to bait and trap online predators. After teaming up with the program''s troubled developer, they soon find that the AI is rapidly advancing beyond its original purpose.', 'A team of special agents discovers a revolutionary new computer program to bait and trap online predators. After teaming up with the program''s troubled developer, they soon find that the AI is rapidly advancing beyond its original purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3qrVjsBd4IZ3QWHMs2x1dwRxuX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983282'),
  ('1035920839811204149', 'The Artificial Man', 1916, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Carl Hoffmann, Otto Rippert', 'Robert Reinert', 'Fern Andra, Josef Bunzl, Maria Carmi, Aud Egede-Nissen, Lia Borré, Olaf Fønss, Friedrich Kühne, Theodor Loos', null, 'Part of the artificial-creature series encompassing Der Golem (1914 and 1920), Alraune (1918, 1928, 1930) and Metropolis (1926), ''Homunculus'' was the most popular serial in Germany during World War I even influencing the dress of fashionable Berlin. Foenss, a Danish star, is the perfect creature manufactured in a laboratory by Kuehne. Having discovered his origins, that he has no ''soul'' and is incapable of love, he revenges himself on mankind, instigating revolutions and becoming a monstrous but beautiful tyrant, relentlessly pursued by his creator-father who seeks to rectify his mistake.', 'Part of the artificial-creature series encompassing Der Golem (1914 and 1920), Alraune (1918, 1928, 1930) and Metropolis (1926), ''Homunculus'' was the most popular serial in Germany during World War I even influencing the dress of fashionable Berlin. Foenss, a Danish star, is the perfect creature manufactured in a laboratory by Kuehne. Having discovered his origins, that he has no ''soul'' and is incapable of love, he revenges himself on mankind, instigating revolutions and becoming a monstrous but beautiful tyrant, relentlessly pursued by his creator-father who seeks to rectify his mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYdwfZrgV3QeUr0eAeiS9B06wJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2956'),
  ('347738069319409967', 'The Artist', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat', 'Andrés Duprat', 'Alberto Laiseca, Sergio Pángaro, Andrés Duprat, Enrique Gagliesi, Ana Laura Loza', null, 'A male nurse steals some of one of his patient''s drawings and makes money with them.', 'A male nurse steals some of one of his patient''s drawings and makes money with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCdY2zEo4VpJv59FoEG9gIpwFtD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278458'),
  ('233176897830294902', 'The Artist', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Michel Hazanavicius, Guillaume Schiffman, Josh Lusby', 'Michel Hazanavicius', 'Jean Dujardin, Bérénice Bejo, John Goodman, James Cromwell, Penelope Ann Miller, Missi Pyle, Beth Grant, Ed Lauter', 'PG-13', 'Hollywood, 1927: As silent movie star George Valentin wonders if the arrival of talking pictures will cause him to fade into oblivion, he sparks with Peppy Miller, a young dancer set for a big break.', 'Hollywood, 1927: As silent movie star George Valentin wonders if the arrival of talking pictures will cause him to fade into oblivion, he sparks with Peppy Miller, a young dancer set for a big break.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYMYV8lMIeQMymuNPBvq3hOnqXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74643'),
  ('603599384110456148', 'The Artist and the City', 1956, 'Documentary', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Manoel de Oliveira', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'António Cruz', null, 'The painter António Cruz wanders around the city of Porto painting what he sees: old and modern buildings, people arriving and leaving work in the factories, children playing. The impressionist realism of Cruz’s drawings dissolves into Oliveira’s vision of Porto, which at the same time portrays the painter and his work.', 'The painter António Cruz wanders around the city of Porto painting what he sees: old and modern buildings, people arriving and leaving work in the factories, children playing. The impressionist realism of Cruz’s drawings dissolves into Oliveira’s vision of Porto, which at the same time portrays the painter and his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWXE1JhXFx4qIsi8XvAzCuXTFzL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186955'),
  ('471538138936106393', 'The Artist and the Dummy', 1900, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A very simple gag film as a young lady substitutes herself for a dummy in order to play a practical joke on an artist.', 'A very simple gag film as a young lady substitutes herself for a dummy in order to play a practical joke on an artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPEnipO7gyqlNHbrn4OCbAPKfBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195584'),
  ('1148081292894056210', 'The Artist and the Model', 2012, 'Drama', 'Fernando Trueba, Daniel Vilar, Angélica Huete', 'Fernando Trueba, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Jean Rochefort, Aida Folch, Claudia Cardinale, Götz Otto, Chus Lampreave, Christian Sinniger, Martin Gamet, Mateo Deluz', 'R', 'In occupied France in summer 1943, a world-weary famous sculptor finds the desire to work again with the arrival of a beautiful young Spanish refugee.', 'In occupied France in summer 1943, a world-weary famous sculptor finds the desire to work again with the arrival of a beautiful young Spanish refugee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBqimTaw2X8ISMT8hYLT0gQ88r5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115821'),
  ('508865175464434393', 'The Artist from Gribov', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Leonid Kvinikhidze, Evgeniy Guslinskiy', 'Emil Braginskiy', 'Irina Muravyova, Sergey Shakurov, Mikhail Pugovkin, Mikhail Filippov, Valentin Smirnitskiy, Yelena Solovey, Aleksandr Pankratov-Chyornyy, Mikhail Kokshenov', null, 'The film is about a movie actress who has arrived to conquer Moscow from a distant village. Started career doesn''t add up. To the bad luck in the profession added disorder of personal life. Trying to do away with the unfortunate past, the heroine decides to return to her village. Keeping charm and vitality, she follows her own desires. As a result, her intentions are truly rewarded...', 'The film is about a movie actress who has arrived to conquer Moscow from a distant village. Started career doesn''t add up. To the bad luck in the profession added disorder of personal life. Trying to do away with the unfortunate past, the heroine decides to return to her village. Keeping charm and vitality, she follows her own desires. As a result, her intentions are truly rewarded...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSoeexJxqk0yJwzU9EcpBER7jQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261172'),
  ('787089252851938911', 'The Aryans', 2014, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime', 'Mo Asumang', 'Mo Asumang', 'André Aden, Mo Asumang, Rebecca Lina, Tom Metzger, Dr. Axel Stoll, Esther Bejarano, Felix Wiedemann', null, 'THE ARYANS is Mo Asumang''s personal journey into the madness of racism during which she meets German neo-Nazis, the US leading racist, the notorious Tom Metzger and Ku Klux Klan members in the alarming twilight of the Midwest. In The ARYANS Mo questions the completely wrong interpretation of "Aryanism" - a phenomenon of the tall, blond and blue-eyed master race.', 'THE ARYANS is Mo Asumang''s personal journey into the madness of racism during which she meets German neo-Nazis, the US leading racist, the notorious Tom Metzger and Ku Klux Klan members in the alarming twilight of the Midwest. In The ARYANS Mo questions the completely wrong interpretation of "Aryanism" - a phenomenon of the tall, blond and blue-eyed master race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osII683LuEO5n0w6Cz2d5e8ZL1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267430'),
  ('212769869086489055', 'The Asadas!', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ryota Nakano, Hironori Yamasaki, Koji Tanimoto', 'Ryota Nakano, Tomoe Kanno', 'Kazunari Ninomiya, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Haru Kuroki, Masaki Suda, Jun Fubuki, Mitsuru Hirata, Makiko Watanabe, Yukiya Kitamura', null, 'Masashi is a photographer. He has his parents and an older brother Yukihiro. Through the 2011 Tohoku earthquake and tsunami, Masashi begins to take staged photos of his family.', 'Masashi is a photographer. He has his parents and an older brother Yukihiro. Through the 2011 Tohoku earthquake and tsunami, Masashi begins to take staged photos of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjYcsp7ghLfvCgCde578E0l3Kcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586393'),
  ('506470052837534373', 'The Ascent', 1977, 'Drama, War, History', 'Larisa Shepitko, Vladimir Chukhnov, Yan Pototsky', 'Larisa Shepitko, Yuri Klepikov', 'Boris Plotnikov, Vladimir Gostyukhin, Anatoliy Solonitsyn, Lyudmila Polyakova, Viktoriya Goldentul, Sergei Yakovlev, Mariya Vinogradova, Mykola Sektymenko', null, 'During a freezing WWII winter, two Soviet partisans on a mission to gather food contend with the temperature, the occupying Germans, and their own psyches.', 'During a freezing WWII winter, two Soviet partisans on a mission to gather food contend with the temperature, the occupying Germans, and their own psyches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJOju5XZfmq4Lg5dPa8IPVY3mDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50183'),
  ('995446968978409601', 'The Ash Lad: In Search of the Golden Castle', 2019, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Jan Kalous, Jan Gregor, Antony Castle', 'Aleksander Kirkwood Brown', 'Vebjørn Enger, Eili Harboe, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Elias Holmen Sørensen, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Thorbjørn Harr, Gard B. Eidsvold, Gisken Armand', null, 'When the King and Queen are poisoned, brothers Per and Pål get arrested, suspected of being behind it. Younger brother Espen "Ash Lad" and Princess Kristin set out on a quest to find the mythical Soria Moria castle, which is said to be built of pure gold. In Soria Moria, there sits a well containing the Water of Life; the only thing that can cure Kristin''s parents. But some wicked Danes are also on the hunt to find the castle. If Espen and Kristin fail, it will spell the end for the brothers, the kingdom - and perhaps the entire world.', 'When the King and Queen are poisoned, brothers Per and Pål get arrested, suspected of being behind it. Younger brother Espen "Ash Lad" and Princess Kristin set out on a quest to find the mythical Soria Moria castle, which is said to be built of pure gold. In Soria Moria, there sits a well containing the Water of Life; the only thing that can cure Kristin''s parents. But some wicked Danes are also on the hunt to find the castle. If Espen and Kristin fail, it will spell the end for the brothers, the kingdom - and perhaps the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LVjFm8tGRtpapvexWi6RaXEHOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561557'),
  ('638127090409408465', 'The Ash Lad: In the Hall of the Mountain King', 2017, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Gjyljeta Berisha, Jiri Dolezal, Martin Král', 'Espen Enger, Aleksander Kirkwood Brown', 'Vebjørn Enger, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Elias Holmen Sørensen, Eili Harboe, Allan Hyde, Thorbjørn Harr, Gard B. Eidsvold, Synnøve Macody Lund', null, 'Espen “Ash Lad”, a poor farmer’s son, embarks on a dangerous quest with his brothers to save the princess from a vile troll known as the Mountain King – in order to collect a reward and save his family’s farm from ruin.', 'Espen “Ash Lad”, a poor farmer’s son, embarks on a dangerous quest with his brothers to save the princess from a vile troll known as the Mountain King – in order to collect a reward and save his family’s farm from ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyJEfpAflLCkqn6PFHu9EHxmbI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444090'),
  ('1001273866893203569', 'The Ash Tree', 1975, 'Mystery, Horror, TV Movie', 'Lawrence Gordon Clark, John McGlashan', 'David Rudkin', 'Edward Petherbridge, Preston Lockwood, Barbara Ewing, Lalla Ward, Lucy Griffiths, Oliver Maguire, Clifford Kershaw, Cyril Appleton', null, 'Man of leisure Sir Richard receives notification that his Uncle has died, bequeathing him his stately country manor and all its lands. On his return to England he immediately sets about taking stock of all legal matters concerning his new property, but during these dealings Sir Richard seems to be more than a little distracted, he hears strange noises from the ash tree outside his bedroom window.', 'Man of leisure Sir Richard receives notification that his Uncle has died, bequeathing him his stately country manor and all its lands. On his return to England he immediately sets about taking stock of all legal matters concerning his new property, but during these dealings Sir Richard seems to be more than a little distracted, he hears strange noises from the ash tree outside his bedroom window.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snPRHy2UVmQUw75PqtY1zbK8Lma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109159'),
  ('546406209851109932', 'The Ashes', 1965, 'War, Drama, History', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Petar Batalov, Halina Lachowicz', 'Aleksander Ścibor-Rylski', 'Daniel Olbrychski, Bogusław Kierc, Piotr Wysocki, Beata Tyszkiewicz, Pola Raksa, Władysław Hańcza, Jan Świderski, Jan Koecher', null, 'Set in the time of Napoleon wars, shows how the wars swept over the unfortunate Polish country at the beginning of the XIX-th century. Story revolves around the Polish legion under command of General Dabrowski, who then fought on Napoleon''s side with the hopes of Poland''s revival.', 'Set in the time of Napoleon wars, shows how the wars swept over the unfortunate Polish country at the beginning of the XIX-th century. Story revolves around the Polish legion under command of General Dabrowski, who then fought on Napoleon''s side with the hopes of Poland''s revival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDqpOIknr3EG4TRLhf7eDdF9dbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149511'),
  ('520136815777619676', 'The Ashlad and His Good Helpers', 1961, 'Animation', 'Ivo Caprino', null, 'Harald Heide Steen, Toralv Maurstad, Henki Kolstad, Carsten Winger, Frank Robert, Sverre Hansen, Turid Haaland, Ola Isene', null, 'Askeladden (Norwegian "The Ash Lad") is the main character in many Norwegian folktales.', 'Askeladden (Norwegian "The Ash Lad") is the main character in many Norwegian folktales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvhUeOPy2EjPEXj755GYYiU6tbx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62831'),
  ('878620841762788960', 'The Ashlad and the Hungry Troll', 1967, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Ivo Caprino', null, 'Harald Heide Steen, Claes Gill, Henki Kolstad, Else Heiberg, Toralv Maurstad, Egil Hjorth-Jenssen, Finn Mehlum, Johan Tømmerbakk', null, 'An exuberant story about Askeladden, the hero of Norwegian traditional fairy tales, outwitting the good-natured troll.', 'An exuberant story about Askeladden, the hero of Norwegian traditional fairy tales, outwitting the good-natured troll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEYkyve5WgZXYNI4EmoKzny4UGi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62834'),
  ('152083877314640316', 'The Asian Connection', 2016, 'Action, Crime', 'Daniel Zirilli, Orlando Herrera, Aniwat Tawai', 'D. Glase Lomond', 'Steven Seagal, John Edward Lee, Byron Gibson, Pim Bubear, Michael Jai White, Ron Smoorenburg, Natalie Lorence, Alexander Winters', 'R', 'Two American expatriates, Jack and Sam, unwittingly steal a drug lord''s money when they rob a series of banks in Southeast Asia and become the target of the gang''s vengeance.', 'Two American expatriates, Jack and Sam, unwittingly steal a drug lord''s money when they rob a series of banks in Southeast Asia and become the target of the gang''s vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/238oPc2NTSyecouDULg3WPHhabk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397003'),
  ('696132335100985250', 'The Asphalt Jungle', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Huston, Harold Rosson, Jack Greenwood', 'Ben Maddow, John Huston', 'Sterling Hayden, Louis Calhern, Jean Hagen, James Whitmore, Sam Jaffe, John McIntire, Marc Lawrence, Barry Kelley', 'NR', 'Recently paroled from prison, legendary burglar "Doc" Riedenschneider, with funding from Alonzo Emmerich, a crooked lawyer, gathers a small group of veteran criminals together in the Midwest for a big jewel heist.', 'Recently paroled from prison, legendary burglar "Doc" Riedenschneider, with funding from Alonzo Emmerich, a crooked lawyer, gathers a small group of veteran criminals together in the Midwest for a big jewel heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xsUnT0P2fJWQv9jGDhs3i9Zx2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16958'),
  ('964325241790413235', 'The Asphalt Kiss', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Murilo Benício, Walter Carvalho', 'Murilo Benício', 'Lázaro Ramos, Débora Falabella, Otávio Müller, Augusto Madeira, Luiza Tiso, Amir Haddad, Stênio Garcia, Fernanda Montenegro', null, 'When witnessing a hit, Arandir, a newly married banker, tries to succor the victim, but the man, almost dead, has only time to make one last request: a kiss. Arandir kisses the man, but his act is spotted by his father-in-law Aprígio and photographed by Amado Ribeiro, a tabloid reporter.', 'When witnessing a hit, Arandir, a newly married banker, tries to succor the victim, but the man, almost dead, has only time to make one last request: a kiss. Arandir kisses the man, but his act is spotted by his father-in-law Aprígio and photographed by Amado Ribeiro, a tabloid reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eL8uOCxMkqRuNymIKVKWBdizVG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482272'),
  ('525326537798953826', 'The Asphyx', 1972, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Peter Newbrook, Roger Simons, Nigel Wooll', 'Brian Comport', 'Robert Powell, Robert Stephens, Jane Lapotaire, Alex Scott, Ralph Arliss, Fiona Walker, Terry Scully, Tony Caunter', 'PG', 'Hugo is a brilliant turn-of-the-century scientist, loved and respected by his family and friends, admired by his colleagues. But he is a man quickly becoming obsessed with a curious and frightening question...What is the mysterious apparition found in the photographs of his dying subjects?', 'Hugo is a brilliant turn-of-the-century scientist, loved and respected by his family and friends, admired by his colleagues. But he is a man quickly becoming obsessed with a curious and frightening question...What is the mysterious apparition found in the photographs of his dying subjects?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grAI6PofWfdW41bNUY5uKRiLn4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37618'),
  ('296463589707836398', 'The Assailant', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'João Daniel Tikhomiroff, Enrique Chediak, Rica Amabis', 'Bráulio Tavares, João Daniel Tikhomiroff, Patrícia Andrade', 'Aílton Carmo, Jéssica Barbosa, Ânderson Santos de Jesus, Flávio Rocha, Irandhir Santos, Servílio de Holanda, Leno Sacramento, Nilton Souza Junior', null, 'Based on the life of a legendary capoeira fighter from Bahia, "Besouro" spins a fantastic tale of a young Brazilian man of African descent in search of his mission.', 'Based on the life of a legendary capoeira fighter from Bahia, "Besouro" spins a fantastic tale of a young Brazilian man of African descent in search of his mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Gx36iu3gOhNFx2nxzEv1ffncmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23854'),
  ('168736745339822019', 'The Assassin', 1961, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Elio Petri, Maurice Hartwig, Giuliano Montaldo', 'Tonino Guerra, Pasquale Festa Campanile, Elio Petri', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Micheline Presle, Cristina Gaïoni, Salvo Randone, Andrea Checchi, Francesco Grandjacquet, Enrico Maria Salerno, Marco Mariani', null, 'Suave antiques dealer Alfredo Martelli is picked up by the police with no justification. At the precinct, Martelli realizes what the investigation is all about-- that he is the main suspect in the killing of his wealthy ex-lover. Is he guilty, or is he just a sleaze?', 'Suave antiques dealer Alfredo Martelli is picked up by the police with no justification. At the precinct, Martelli realizes what the investigation is all about-- that he is the main suspect in the killing of his wealthy ex-lover. Is he guilty, or is he just a sleaze?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFxmjIcfsxDeiuna9SzPPtzwlZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47240'),
  ('614688540111016359', 'The Assassin', 1967, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Huang Yuan-Shen, Hsiung Ting-Wu', 'Chang Cheh', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Lisa Chiao Chiao, Li Hsiang-Chun, Chiu Sam-Yin, Huang Tsung-Hsun, Tien Feng, Chang Pei-Shan, Cheng Lui', null, 'Yu is a swordsman who is betrayed by a jealous rival, but initially seeks a life of simple pleasures until an accidental meeting with another patriot sets him back on the road to bloody, brutal vengeance.', 'Yu is a swordsman who is betrayed by a jealous rival, but initially seeks a life of simple pleasures until an accidental meeting with another patriot sets him back on the road to bloody, brutal vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIXHJujbcmMt6uAHu7mdwl4xodK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90548'),
  ('159886153216364860', 'The Assassin', 1993, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Billy Chung Siu-Hung, Zhao Fei', 'Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk', 'Zhang Fengyi, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, Max Mok Siu-Chung, Zhao Jun, Zhang Guangbei, Ni Dahong, Song Ge, Diao Xiao-Xiao', null, 'A poor farmer who loves a woman he is forbidden to associate with becomes a hardened mercenary, and is hired by a local warlord as a professional assassin. Years later, he runs into his old love and begins to question his violent past', 'A poor farmer who loves a woman he is forbidden to associate with becomes a hardened mercenary, and is hired by a local warlord as a professional assassin. Years later, he runs into his old love and begins to question his violent past', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDuuzL1MMUkL7yTOVKiRAv6ya5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67080'),
  ('1103670164778752302', 'The Assassin', 2015, 'Drama, Action', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Chu Tien-Wen, Hou Hsiao-hsien, Hsieh Hai-Meng', 'Shu Qi, Chang Chen, Zhou Yun, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Ni Dahong, Yong Mei, Lei Zhenyu, Nikki Hsieh', 'NR', '9th century China. Ten year old general’s daughter Nie Yinniang is abducted by a nun who initiates her into the martial arts, transforming her into an exceptional assassin charged with eliminating cruel and corrupt local governors. One day, having failed in a task, she is sent back by her mistress to the land of her birth, with orders to kill the man to whom she was promised – a cousin who now leads the largest military region in North China. After 13 years of exile, the young woman must confront her parents, her memories and her long-repressed feelings.', '9th century China. Ten year old general’s daughter Nie Yinniang is abducted by a nun who initiates her into the martial arts, transforming her into an exceptional assassin charged with eliminating cruel and corrupt local governors. One day, having failed in a task, she is sent back by her mistress to the land of her birth, with orders to kill the man to whom she was promised – a cousin who now leads the largest military region in North China. After 13 years of exile, the young woman must confront her parents, her memories and her long-repressed feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10RcGMfzg2lIW1aLcR4ILfNbHK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253450'),
  ('412549669921225825', 'The Assassin', 2023, 'Action', 'Kwak Jieong-duk', 'Kwak Jieong-duk', 'Shin Hyun-jun, Lee Moon-sik, Kim Min-kyung, Hong Eun-ki, Choi Seong-won, Kwon Ra-hui, Lee Jung-min', null, 'An action historical drama depicting the story of Joseon''s best swordsman Yi Nan in front of an irreversible fate.', 'An action historical drama depicting the story of Joseon''s best swordsman Yi Nan in front of an irreversible fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulobyNR62zvI1cKUk1YJ9QwKGkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890154'),
  ('837774135895153578', 'The Assassin Next Door', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Danny Lerner, Ram Shweky', 'Danny Lerner', 'Olga Kurylenko, Ninet Tayeb, Vladimir Friedman, Zohar Shtrauss, Liron Levo, Shalom Michaelshvili, Henry David, Ester Rada', 'R', 'In an old apartment building on the wrong side of the tracks, two women, unknown to each other, live across the hall on the second floor. Galia is an assassin involved against her will with the local sex-traffic mafia. All she wants is to reunite with her little daughter that she left back home in Ukraine . Eleanor is a grocery store cashier and a battered wife. She dreams of winning the lottery and running away from her abusive husband. Galia and Eleanor don''t know each other, but as neighbors they share two things: an adjoining wall and a strong need to plan their escape. As Galia disobeys her latest contract, a woman target, and Eleanor discovers that she''s pregnant, the two women decide to take action against their oppressors in a fight for survival and freedom.', 'In an old apartment building on the wrong side of the tracks, two women, unknown to each other, live across the hall on the second floor. Galia is an assassin involved against her will with the local sex-traffic mafia. All she wants is to reunite with her little daughter that she left back home in Ukraine . Eleanor is a grocery store cashier and a battered wife. She dreams of winning the lottery and running away from her abusive husband. Galia and Eleanor don''t know each other, but as neighbors they share two things: an adjoining wall and a strong need to plan their escape. As Galia disobeys her latest contract, a woman target, and Eleanor discovers that she''s pregnant, the two women decide to take action against their oppressors in a fight for survival and freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EWG78UUowHBMOsDXvDtHol07N3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37714'),
  ('636077115046555323', 'The Assassin: Maria', 2014, null, 'Wataru Oku', 'Yuta Takahashi', 'Hibiki Otsuki, Ryô Asagiri, Horiken, Ryôichi Inaba, Makoto Inamori', null, 'Maria, who lost her parents when she was young and grew up in a church, considers Father Kuros, who took care of her, as her father, and is raised as a professional hitman. A nun, Maria, who kills people at the request of her bride. She also lives with being brainwashed with the sexual playthings of Kuros, who she pretends to be meditating. Maria feels her pity and love for a similarly plighted Hayato who comes close to her, and Kurosu moves her to deal with the former killer who killed her Maria''s father, but she kills her own parents. He finds out that it is her Father Kuros...', 'Maria, who lost her parents when she was young and grew up in a church, considers Father Kuros, who took care of her, as her father, and is raised as a professional hitman. A nun, Maria, who kills people at the request of her bride. She also lives with being brainwashed with the sexual playthings of Kuros, who she pretends to be meditating. Maria feels her pity and love for a similarly plighted Hayato who comes close to her, and Kurosu moves her to deal with the former killer who killed her Maria''s father, but she kills her own parents. He finds out that it is her Father Kuros...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JgnHKy1UFso4XhHwpwITRO8NcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:991647'),
  ('284923634989399225', 'The Assassination', 1972, 'Thriller, History', 'Yves Boisset, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Ben Barzman, Basilio Franchina', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Michel Piccoli, Jean Seberg, Gian Maria Volonté, Michel Bouquet, Bruno Cremer, Daniel Ivernel, Philippe Noiret', 'PG', 'Darien, a left-wing police informant, is forced to lure his old friend Sadiel to Paris, allegedly to film a television special about the Third World. Sadiel, the exiled leader of a North African state, is being hunted by the ruthless Colonel Kassar, who will stop at nothing to capture his political rival. Once Sadiel arrives in Paris, Darien realizes he has been manipulated. He tries to turn back the clock, not realizing what or who he’s truly dealing with.', 'Darien, a left-wing police informant, is forced to lure his old friend Sadiel to Paris, allegedly to film a television special about the Third World. Sadiel, the exiled leader of a North African state, is being hunted by the ruthless Colonel Kassar, who will stop at nothing to capture his political rival. Once Sadiel arrives in Paris, Darien realizes he has been manipulated. He tries to turn back the clock, not realizing what or who he’s truly dealing with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcwij6QBlf1DOTAUxw1YsjwhQFU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152635'),
  ('713249022702745236', 'The Assassination Bureau', 1969, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Basil Dearden, Geoffrey Unsworth, John Peverall', 'Michael Relph', 'Oliver Reed, Diana Rigg, Telly Savalas, Curd Jürgens, Philippe Noiret, Warren Mitchell, Beryl Reid, Clive Revill', 'PG', 'In 1908 London, a women''s rights campaigner discovers the Assassination Bureau Limited, an organization that kills for justice. When its motives are called into question, she commissions the assassination of its chairman. Knowing that his colleagues have recently become more motivated by greed than morality, he turns the situation into a challenge for his board members: kill him or be killed.', 'In 1908 London, a women''s rights campaigner discovers the Assassination Bureau Limited, an organization that kills for justice. When its motives are called into question, she commissions the assassination of its chairman. Knowing that his colleagues have recently become more motivated by greed than morality, he turns the situation into a challenge for his board members: kill him or be killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAQ8z14i2UyAd3NrMFxbeGz6Kpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69526'),
  ('761957398264147897', 'The Assassination of Jesse James by the Coward Robert Ford', 2007, 'Drama, Western', 'Andrew Dominik, Roger Deakins, Kimberley Zaharko', 'Andrew Dominik', 'Brad Pitt, Casey Affleck, Sam Rockwell, Paul Schneider, Jeremy Renner, Garret Dillahunt, Sam Shepard, Mary-Louise Parker', 'R', 'Outlaw Jesse James is rumored to be the ''fastest gun in the West''. An eager recruit into James'' notorious gang, Robert Ford eventually grows jealous of the famed outlaw and, when Robert and his brother sense an opportunity to kill James, their murderous action elevates their target to near mythical status.', 'Outlaw Jesse James is rumored to be the ''fastest gun in the West''. An eager recruit into James'' notorious gang, Robert Ford eventually grows jealous of the famed outlaw and, when Robert and his brother sense an opportunity to kill James, their murderous action elevates their target to near mythical status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMKn6EQS7eR5ubhPJbw5pQSBZMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4512'),
  ('716693439466194949', 'The Assassination of Matteotti', 1973, 'History, Drama', 'Florestano Vancini, Franco Longo, Dario Di Palma', 'Lucio Battistrada, Florestano Vancini', 'Franco Nero, Mario Adorf, Umberto Orsini, Vittorio De Sica, Renzo Montagnani, Gastone Moschin, Riccardo Cucciolla, Damiano Damiani', null, 'How the Italian Fascist Party managed to turn the physical elimination of a political enemy into a test of strength fundamental for the ascent into the totalitarian regime.', 'How the Italian Fascist Party managed to turn the physical elimination of a political enemy into a test of strength fundamental for the ascent into the totalitarian regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZ2ZrbbSDEaL4P37W7fuxIoeZPb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64830'),
  ('4348260368743689', 'The Assassination of Richard Nixon', 2004, 'Drama, History, Thriller, Crime', 'Scott Cobb, Emmanuel Lubezki, Niels Mueller', 'Niels Mueller, Kevin Kennedy, Steve Bannatyne', 'Sean Penn, Don Cheadle, Jack Thompson, Mykelti Williamson, Michael Wincott, Naomi Watts, Nick Searcy, Brad William Henke', null, 'It’s 1974 and Sam Bicke has lost everything. His wife leaves him with his three kids, his boss fires him, his brother turns away from him, and the bank won’t give him any money to start anew. He tries to find someone to blame for his misfortunes and comes up with the President of the United States who he plans to murder.', 'It’s 1974 and Sam Bicke has lost everything. His wife leaves him with his three kids, his boss fires him, his brother turns away from him, and the bank won’t give him any money to start anew. He tries to find someone to blame for his misfortunes and comes up with the President of the United States who he plans to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jOOvAVvP0XtwC5yYQpQCy4cjq1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842'),
  ('267892057321484099', 'The Assassination of Ryoma', 1974, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kazuo Kuroki, Masaki Tamura, Kōichi Gotō', 'Kunio Shimizu, Yasushi Tanabe', 'Yoshio Harada, Renji Ishibashi, Rie Nakagawa, Kaori Momoi, Keisuke Noro, Ryo Tamura, Yūsaku Matsuda, Gō Awazu', null, 'Story of the last three days in the life of Sakamoto Ryoma (1836-1867), the imperial loyalist who tried to unite the Choshu and Satsuma clans and prepared the way for the Meiji Restoration (1868).', 'Story of the last three days in the life of Sakamoto Ryoma (1836-1867), the imperial loyalist who tried to unite the Choshu and Satsuma clans and prepared the way for the Meiji Restoration (1868).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sjNz4wtI0C0Cuc3rLiSJXKzt5r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107547'),
  ('133865375982726292', 'The Assassination of the Duke de Guise', 1908, 'History, Drama', 'André Calmettes, Charles le Bargy', 'Henri Lavedan', 'Charles le Bargy, Albert Lambert, Gabrielle Robinne, Berthe Bovy, Jean Angelo, Albert Dieudonné, Huguette Duflos, Raphaël Duflos', null, 'The film portrays the events on the day King Henri III of France arranged for Duke Henri de Guise to be murdered.', 'The film portrays the events on the day King Henri III of France arranged for Duke Henri de Guise to be murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjYvSoLaRRNLqamW4GpCI2wkHmO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144586'),
  ('344029239401863689', 'The Assassination of Trotsky', 1972, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Joseph Losey, Pasqualino De Santis', 'Masolino D''Amico, Franco Solinas', 'Richard Burton, Alain Delon, Romy Schneider, Valentina Cortese, Duilio Del Prete, Enrico Maria Salerno, Luigi Vannucchi, Jean Desailly', null, 'A Stalinist assassin tracks exiled revolutionary Leon Trotsky to Mexico in 1940.', 'A Stalinist assassin tracks exiled revolutionary Leon Trotsky to Mexico in 1940.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBYtcu7BVZAVa8LtvXIUmYO6tuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4702'),
  ('115009128553472909', 'The Assassins', 2012, 'Drama, History', 'Zhao Linshan, Zhao Xiaoding', 'Wang Bin, Wang Hailin', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Liu Yifei, Hiroshi Tamaki, Alec Su, Annie Shizuka Inoh, Yao Lu, Ni Dahong, Bao Jianfeng', 'NR', 'In his old age, Cao Cao assesses his former military tactics, love, and relationship with his son.', 'In his old age, Cao Cao assesses his former military tactics, love, and relationship with his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iflthXJoh1jDND6CWCrEAG9JgwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136701'),
  ('479048883515742645', 'The Assault', 1986, 'War, Drama, Thriller', 'Fons Rademakers, Theo van de Sande', 'Gerard Soeteman', 'Derek de Lint, Marc van Uchelen, Monique van de Ven, Johnny Kraaijkamp Sr., Christian Golusda, Harold Bendig, Lex Wiertz, Huub van der Lubbe', null, 'At the end of WWII the Dutch resistance kills a German officer in front of the house of a Dutch family. Years after the war the young boy who witnessed the killing runs into the members of the resistance who committed the killing.', 'At the end of WWII the Dutch resistance kills a German officer in front of the house of a Dutch family. Years after the war the young boy who witnessed the killing runs into the members of the resistance who committed the killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvklfVmpr4i5BexkvytKtpfu7DM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2753'),
  ('944492272862980772', 'The Assault', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Thierry Lecomte, Mathieu Elbaz, Julien Leclercq', 'Julien Leclercq, Simon Moutaïrou', 'Vincent Elbaz, Grégori Derangère, Mélanie Bernier, Aymen Saïdi, Chems Dahmani, Mohid Abid, Djanis Bouzyani, Marie Guillard', 'R', 'December 1994. On Saturday 24th, four GIA terrorists hijack an Air France A300 Airbus, bound for Paris, with 227 passengers on board, at the Algiers airport.', 'December 1994. On Saturday 24th, four GIA terrorists hijack an Air France A300 Airbus, bound for Paris, with 227 passengers on board, at the Algiers airport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYGQJGsGWmmq8L0EOSDJGdHiz1i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59145'),
  ('860824467462804182', 'The Assault', 2014, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jason Winn, Brian Crane', 'Jennifer Maisel', 'Makenzie Vega, Khandi Alexander, Gary Weeks, Malik Yoba, Pierson Fodé, Amy Bruckner, Michael Cognata, Andria Blackman', 'NR', 'After a cheerleader is sexually assaulted by the high school football team, she must overcome her shame and use the evidence gathered from the subsequent social media firestorm to piece together the night that she can''t remember in her fight for justice. Based on the true story of the Steubenville, Ohio rape case.', 'After a cheerleader is sexually assaulted by the high school football team, she must overcome her shame and use the evidence gathered from the subsequent social media firestorm to piece together the night that she can''t remember in her fight for justice. Based on the true story of the Steubenville, Ohio rape case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztyBW1fC7oRrxNdrZsZztcGkvs4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295237'),
  ('1042863901036929985', 'The Assembly Line', 2023, 'Drama', 'Christophe Orcand, Marion Briec, Florian Cabaret', 'Mathias Gokalp, Marcia Romano, Nadine Lamari', 'Mélanie Thierry, Swann Arlaud, Olivier Gourmet, Denis Podalydès, Luca Terracciano, Robin Migné, Éric Nantchouang, Raphaëlle Rousseau', null, 'A few months after May ''68, Robert, a graduate of the Ecole Normale Supérieure and a far-left activist, decides to get a job at Citroën as a line worker. Like other comrades, he wants to infiltrate the factory to rekindle the revolutionary fire, but the majority of workers no longer want to hear about politics. When Citroën decides to pay back the Grenelle Agreements by requiring workers to work 3 hours overtime per week for free, Robert and some others see the possibility of a social movement.', 'A few months after May ''68, Robert, a graduate of the Ecole Normale Supérieure and a far-left activist, decides to get a job at Citroën as a line worker. Like other comrades, he wants to infiltrate the factory to rekindle the revolutionary fire, but the majority of workers no longer want to hear about politics. When Citroën decides to pay back the Grenelle Agreements by requiring workers to work 3 hours overtime per week for free, Robert and some others see the possibility of a social movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IPhULxzFXIFZl6fDJovRXDuD1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892513'),
  ('1061598195755373686', 'The Assent', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sazzy Lee Calhoun, Pearry Reginald Teo', 'Pearry Reginald Teo', 'Robert Kazinsky, Peter Jason, Hannah Ward, Tatum O''Neal, Caden Dragomer, Douglas Spain, Eileen Dietz, Margarita Reyes', null, 'After a series of disturbing supernatural events in his home, Joel a young single father, comes to suspect that his young son may be possessed. Soon Joel receives a visit from Father Lambert, a controversial exorcist in town whose last patient died during his treatment. As increasing chilling occurrences begin to unfold, the priest informs a resistant Joel that unless he can successfully perform an exorcism, the devil will soon take full control of his boy.', 'After a series of disturbing supernatural events in his home, Joel a young single father, comes to suspect that his young son may be possessed. Soon Joel receives a visit from Father Lambert, a controversial exorcist in town whose last patient died during his treatment. As increasing chilling occurrences begin to unfold, the priest informs a resistant Joel that unless he can successfully perform an exorcism, the devil will soon take full control of his boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHVy3bKsfi8AbVwzelliNBt3SUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632309'),
  ('894132766027084926', 'The Assessment', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Fleur Fortuné, Marino Darés, Urs Hirschbiegel', 'Nell Garfath-Cox, John Donnelly, Dave Thomas', 'Elizabeth Olsen, Alicia Vikander, Himesh Patel, Indira Varma, Minnie Driver, Nicholas Pinnock, Charlotte Ritchie, Leah Harvey', 'R', 'In a climate change-ravaged world, a utopian society optimizes life, including parenthood assessments. A successful couple faces scrutiny by an evaluator over seven days to determine their fitness for childbearing.', 'In a climate change-ravaged world, a utopian society optimizes life, including parenthood assessments. A successful couple faces scrutiny by an evaluator over seven days to determine their fitness for childbearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1K7be85FAauSbVPzCQ0GjOXUqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317088'),
  ('843396233625741751', 'The Assignation', 1953, 'Drama', 'Curtis Harrington', 'Curtis Harrington', null, null, 'Long considered lost, The Assignation was Curtis Harrington''s first color film. It was shot in Venice, Italy, and follows a masked figure through the labyrinthine canals of the city, building to a spectacular climax. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'Long considered lost, The Assignation was Curtis Harrington''s first color film. It was shot in Venice, Italy, and follows a masked figure through the labyrinthine canals of the city, building to a spectacular climax. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbpNIfKjmsY3KCnqdirCqtCGsS5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321827'),
  ('140787829953108669', 'The Assignment', 1997, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Christian Duguay, Robbie Ditchburn, Christian Duguay', 'Sabi H. Shabtai, Dan Gordon', 'Aidan Quinn, Donald Sutherland, Ben Kingsley, Claudia Ferri, Céline Bonnier, Vlasta Vrana, Liliana Komorowska, Von Flores', 'R', 'Jack Shaw has experienced the terror first-hand. He''s a top CIA agent who''s tracked international killer-for-hire Carlos "The Jackal" Sanchez for over twenty years and barely survived Carlos'' devastating bombing of a Parisian cafe. Now, he finally gets a break when he discovers Carlos'' dead ringer: American naval officer and dedicated family man Annibal Ramirez.', 'Jack Shaw has experienced the terror first-hand. He''s a top CIA agent who''s tracked international killer-for-hire Carlos "The Jackal" Sanchez for over twenty years and barely survived Carlos'' devastating bombing of a Parisian cafe. Now, he finally gets a break when he discovers Carlos'' dead ringer: American naval officer and dedicated family man Annibal Ramirez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhuV5cvxFhUrB6F4smVZGmdSwbT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18355'),
  ('267149727467014559', 'The Assignment', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Walter Hill, James Liston, Ashley Sawyer', 'Walter Hill, Denis Hamill', 'Michelle Rodriguez, Sigourney Weaver, Tony Shalhoub, Caitlin Gerard, Anthony LaPaglia, Paul McGillion, Ken Kirzinger, Paul Lazenby', 'R', 'Ace assassin Frank Kitchen is double crossed by gangsters and falls into the hands of rogue surgeon known as The Doctor who turns him into a woman. The hitman, now a hitwoman, sets out for revenge, aided by a nurse named Johnnie who also has secrets.', 'Ace assassin Frank Kitchen is double crossed by gangsters and falls into the hands of rogue surgeon known as The Doctor who turns him into a woman. The hitman, now a hitwoman, sets out for revenge, aided by a nurse named Johnnie who also has secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wx83iGCATiIAyrZHI6AeeNfiAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399173'),
  ('955064909974465628', 'The Assistant', 2015, 'Thriller', 'Christophe Ali, Nicolas Bonilauri, Philippe Roux', 'Christophe Ali', 'Nathalie Baye, Malik Zidi, Johan Leysen, Sabrina Seyvecou, Hervé Sogne, Aïssatou Diop, Jean-Stan du Pac', null, 'With his wife in labor, father-to-be Thomas (Malik Zidi) speeds to the hospital, and in the process, accidentally kills a young man on the road. That death sets into motion events that will change everyone’s lives forever, including the young man’s mother Marie-France (Nathalie Baye), who cannot recover from the trauma. Nine years later, Marie-France takes a job as Thomas’s secretary without him knowing about her connection to his past. As Marie-France’s maternal rage reaches tragic proportions, she insinuates herself into his life, his work and his family in this classic thriller à la Hitchcock.', 'With his wife in labor, father-to-be Thomas (Malik Zidi) speeds to the hospital, and in the process, accidentally kills a young man on the road. That death sets into motion events that will change everyone’s lives forever, including the young man’s mother Marie-France (Nathalie Baye), who cannot recover from the trauma. Nine years later, Marie-France takes a job as Thomas’s secretary without him knowing about her connection to his past. As Marie-France’s maternal rage reaches tragic proportions, she insinuates herself into his life, his work and his family in this classic thriller à la Hitchcock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRX31QALsr5CKkXZOYW5SzKEoAZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358206'),
  ('162346750718884548', 'The Assistant', 2020, 'Drama', 'Kitty Green, Michael Latham, Willy McGee', 'Kitty Green', 'Julia Garner, Matthew Macfadyen, Makenzie Leigh, Kristine Froseth, Jonny Orsini, Noah Robbins, Alexander Chaplin, Jay O. Sanders', 'R', 'A searing look at a day in the life of an assistant to a powerful executive. As Jane follows her daily routine, she grows increasingly aware of the insidious abuse that threatens every aspect of her position.', 'A searing look at a day in the life of an assistant to a powerful executive. As Jane follows her daily routine, she grows increasingly aware of the insidious abuse that threatens every aspect of her position.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJpJkVgezsR7dp6KQwyxtGIAOZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627463'),
  ('126886119633161414', 'The Associate', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Donald Petrie, Alex Nepomniaschy, Patrick Markey', 'Nick Thiel', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Dianne Wiest, Eli Wallach, Tim Daly, Bebe Neuwirth, Austin Pendleton, Lainie Kazan, George Martin', 'PG-13', 'Laurel Ayres is a businesswoman trying to make it but unfortunately she works at a investment firm where she does all the work but all the senior investors like Frank Peterson grab all the credit. She then leaves and starts her own firm. While trying to find clients Laurel pretends that she has a male partner named Robert Cutty. And when she starts to do well all of her clients wants to meet Cutty which is difficult since he doesn''t exist.', 'Laurel Ayres is a businesswoman trying to make it but unfortunately she works at a investment firm where she does all the work but all the senior investors like Frank Peterson grab all the credit. She then leaves and starts her own firm. While trying to find clients Laurel pretends that she has a male partner named Robert Cutty. And when she starts to do well all of her clients wants to meet Cutty which is difficult since he doesn''t exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDGc4JqVf4n04cEO0rU36UI4cvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11112'),
  ('679262893937041756', 'The Asthenic Syndrome', 1989, 'Drama', 'Kira Muratova, Volodymyr Pankov, Nadezhda Popova', 'Sergei Popov, Kira Muratova, Aleksandr Chernykh', 'Olga Antonova, Sergei Popov, Natalya Buzko, Alexandra Svenskaya, Natalya Ralleva, Viktor Aristov, Oleh Shkolnyk, Vera Storozheva', null, 'In the old days it was called hypochrondria, or black melancholia. Now, apparently, it''s termed the Asthenic Syndrome. Whatever it is, Nikolai, a teacher of epicly indifferent pupils, has got it, and it''s not much fun.', 'In the old days it was called hypochrondria, or black melancholia. Now, apparently, it''s termed the Asthenic Syndrome. Whatever it is, Nikolai, a teacher of epicly indifferent pupils, has got it, and it''s not much fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kE0HAjG6Awe0nOta9uvnzVKVgsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97039'),
  ('996784951659564109', 'The Astounding She-Monster', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ronald V. Ashcroft, William C. Thompson', 'Ronald V. Ashcroft, Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Robert Clarke, Kenne Duncan, Shirley Kilpatrick, Marilyn Harvey, Jeanne Tatum, Ewing Miles Brown, Scott Douglas, Al Avalon', 'NR', 'A scientist and a gang that has kidnapped a rich heiress come up against a beautiful but lethal alien who has crash-landed her spaceship on Earth.', 'A scientist and a gang that has kidnapped a rich heiress come up against a beautiful but lethal alien who has crash-landed her spaceship on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiaYRfkR7ybxmmjAoE2N629iyoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44693'),
  ('1030108355326412567', 'The Astral Factor', 1978, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Horror', 'John Florea, Alan Stensvold, Gene Fowler Jr.', 'Arthur C. Pierce', 'Robert Foxworth, Stefanie Powers, Sue Lyon, Mark Slade, Leslie Parrish, Marianna Hill, Elke Sommer, Percy Rodriguez', 'PG', 'Demonstrating that a little knowledge is a dangerous thing, a convicted strangler studies the paranormal and finds a way to render himself invisible. Once he escapes, he sets out to find and eliminate five women who remind him of the mother he murdered. A police lieutenant sets out to safeguard them and bring the invisible killer to justice.', 'Demonstrating that a little knowledge is a dangerous thing, a convicted strangler studies the paranormal and finds a way to render himself invisible. Once he escapes, he sets out to find and eliminate five women who remind him of the mother he murdered. A police lieutenant sets out to safeguard them and bring the invisible killer to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au5jfGGmjXO9EV2ye1hGdAJjVZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113337'),
  ('392663509464191915', 'The Astro-Zombies', 1968, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Ted V. Mikels, Robert Maxwell, Art Names', 'Wayne Rogers, Ted V. Mikels', 'Wendell Corey, John Carradine, Tom Pace, Joan Patrick, Tura Satana, Rafael Campos, Victor Izay, William Bagdad', null, 'For devilishly mad "astro-scientist" Dr. DeMarco (John Carradine), a typical day involves run-ins with reanimated corpses, bloodthirsty solar-powered killer robot zombies, Chinese communist spies and vicious Mexican secret agents. But when a bloody trail of young female murder victims leads an intrepid CIA agent to his door, things get really interesting. Ted V. Mikels directs this unique B horror-thriller.', 'For devilishly mad "astro-scientist" Dr. DeMarco (John Carradine), a typical day involves run-ins with reanimated corpses, bloodthirsty solar-powered killer robot zombies, Chinese communist spies and vicious Mexican secret agents. But when a bloody trail of young female murder victims leads an intrepid CIA agent to his door, things get really interesting. Ted V. Mikels directs this unique B horror-thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6qLDiE98SAwAlpMwpTzX4tpH0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27831'),
  ('286602537542347733', 'The Astrologer', 1975, 'Horror', 'James Glickenhaus, Francis A. Romero', 'James Glickenhaus', 'Bob Byrd, Monica Tidwell, Mark Buntzman, James Glickenhaus, Alison McCarthy, Al Narcisse, Ivy White, Julie Raggio', null, 'A scientist investigating reports of the Second Coming of Christ finds himself battling against a suicidal devil cult.', 'A scientist investigating reports of the Second Coming of Christ finds himself battling against a suicidal devil cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eT5EckUmASYXmXNUG7S0WvwkeDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112975'),
  ('518213056202004391', 'The Astrologer', 1976, 'Drama, Crime', 'Craig Denney, Alan Gornick, Terry Berg', 'Dorothy June Pidgeon', 'Craig Denney, Darrien Earle, Rocky Barbanica, Boyd Hamlyn, Jacqueline Day, Lawrence Lee, James Moore, Harvey Hunter', 'NR', 'Craig Alexander, a con-man "psychic" on the carnival circuit receives the opportunity to pilfer some legendary rubies in Kenya. His luck holds and he winds up the sole beneficiary of the ill-gotten wealth, which he parlays into an astrological broadcasting empire. But once he reaches the top, there''s only one direction he can go...', 'Craig Alexander, a con-man "psychic" on the carnival circuit receives the opportunity to pilfer some legendary rubies in Kenya. His luck holds and he winds up the sole beneficiary of the ill-gotten wealth, which he parlays into an astrological broadcasting empire. But once he reaches the top, there''s only one direction he can go...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BKA85xTb1IXipIYnsJlFimhE7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180220'),
  ('159306357871244808', 'The Astronaut', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nicolas Giraud, Renaud Chassaing, Philippe Hagège', 'Nicolas Giraud, Stéphane Cabel', 'Nicolas Giraud, Mathieu Kassovitz, Hélène Vincent, Hippolyte Girardot, Bruno Lochet, Ayumi Roux, Carole Trevoux, Féodor Atkine', null, 'An aeronautical engineer at Ariane Espace, Jim has devoted himself for years to a secret project: building his own rocket and accomplishing the first manned space flight as an amateur. But to realize his dream, he must learn to share it.', 'An aeronautical engineer at Ariane Espace, Jim has devoted himself for years to a secret project: building his own rocket and accomplishing the first manned space flight as an amateur. But to realize his dream, he must learn to share it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWlujFryYpoogVwKhAnnHOV9Uis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881693'),
  ('942529757455146164', 'The Astronaut', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'Jess Varley, Dave Garbett', 'Jess Varley', 'Kate Mara, Laurence Fishburne, Gabriel Luna, Ivana Miličević, Scarlett Holmes, Macy Gray, Reza Diako, Daniel Quirke', 'PG-13', 'After returning from her first space mission, astronaut Sam Walker is placed under NASA’s care at a high security house for rehabilitation and medical testing. However, when disturbing occurrences begin happening around the property, she fears that something extraterrestrial has followed her back to Earth', 'After returning from her first space mission, astronaut Sam Walker is placed under NASA’s care at a high security house for rehabilitation and medical testing. However, when disturbing occurrences begin happening around the property, she fears that something extraterrestrial has followed her back to Earth', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/souvvkJHYhztC1UqZ8lEVUiJa3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086260'),
  ('816761131678155387', 'The Astronaut Farmer', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Polish, M. David Mullen', 'Michael Polish, Mark Polish', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Virginia Madsen, Max Thieriot, Jasper Polish, Logan Polish, Jon Gries, Mark Polish, Bruce Dern', 'PG', 'Texan Charles Farmer left the Air Force as a young man to save the family ranch when his dad died. Like most American ranchers, he owes his bank. Unlike most, he''s an astrophysicist with a rocket in his barn - one he''s built and wants to take into space. It''s his dream. The FBI puts him under surveillance when he tries to buy rocket fuel, and the FAA stalls him when he files a flight plan – but Charles is undeterred.', 'Texan Charles Farmer left the Air Force as a young man to save the family ranch when his dad died. Like most American ranchers, he owes his bank. Unlike most, he''s an astrophysicist with a rocket in his barn - one he''s built and wants to take into space. It''s his dream. The FBI puts him under surveillance when he tries to buy rocket fuel, and the FAA stalls him when he files a flight plan – but Charles is undeterred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19uGc8wW3Ert1QvMYxvnReQkFMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5172'),
  ('113546655133118666', 'The Astronaut Lovers', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marco Berger, Mariano De Rosa', 'Marco Berger', 'Javier Orán, Lautaro Bettoni, Mora Arenillas, Agustín Frías, Ailín Salas, Melina Furgiuela, Camila del Campo, Iván Masliah', 'NR', 'Pedro travels from Spain to Argentina for a vacation at his uncle''s home, where he meets Maxi again, a childhood friend. Maxi is surprised when he finds out Pedro is gay. When Maxi finds his ex-girlfriend is also there, he asks Pedro to pretend to be his boyfriend to win her back. Pedro accepts the game, unaware of the dangers of playing with love.', 'Pedro travels from Spain to Argentina for a vacation at his uncle''s home, where he meets Maxi again, a childhood friend. Maxi is surprised when he finds out Pedro is gay. When Maxi finds his ex-girlfriend is also there, he asks Pedro to pretend to be his boyfriend to win her back. Pedro accepts the game, unaware of the dangers of playing with love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyu2nt255VLL4RgGCAtcDK8RLv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058128'),
  ('764208046698633815', 'The Astronaut''s Wife', 1999, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Allen Daviau, Rand Ravich, Darin Rivetti', 'Rand Ravich', 'Johnny Depp, Charlize Theron, Joe Morton, Clea DuVall, Nick Cassavetes, Donna Murphy, Gary Grubbs, Blair Brown', 'R', 'When astronaut Spencer Armacost returns to Earth after a mission that nearly cost him his life, he decides to take a desk job in order to see his beautiful wife, Jillian, more often. Gradually, Jillian notices that Spencer''s personality seems to have changed, but her concerns fade when she discovers that she''s pregnant. As Jillian grows closer to becoming a mother, her suspicions about Spencer return. Why does it seem as if he''s a different person?', 'When astronaut Spencer Armacost returns to Earth after a mission that nearly cost him his life, he decides to take a desk job in order to see his beautiful wife, Jillian, more often. Gradually, Jillian notices that Spencer''s personality seems to have changed, but her concerns fade when she discovers that she''s pregnant. As Jillian grows closer to becoming a mother, her suspicions about Spencer return. Why does it seem as if he''s a different person?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54RGJ6INW9ERG8IaalmMKbbDgwH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2900'),
  ('578342918126793491', 'The Astronauts', 1959, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Chris Marker, Daniel Harispe', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Michel Boschet, Ligia Branice, Anatole Dauman, Philippe Lifchitz', null, 'An inventor builds a homemade spacecraft, and uses it to have various adventures, including peeping at women, visiting ‘human’ planets, and becoming involved in intergalactic warfare.', 'An inventor builds a homemade spacecraft, and uses it to have various adventures, including peeping at women, visiting ‘human’ planets, and becoming involved in intergalactic warfare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKlEeqRNLEFxTKaT3GublWoM72P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103158'),
