  ('1099665683810977137', 'The Atomic Kid', 1954, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'John L. Russell, Leslie H. Martinson', 'John Fenton Murray, Benedict Freedman', 'Mickey Rooney, Robert Strauss, Elaine Devry, Bill Goodwin, Whit Bissell, Joey Forman, Peter Leeds, Hal March', 'NR', 'A uranium prospector is eating a peanut butter sandwich in the desert where atom bomb tests are being done. He becomes radioactive, and helps the FBI break up an enemy spy ring.', 'A uranium prospector is eating a peanut butter sandwich in the desert where atom bomb tests are being done. He becomes radioactive, and helps the FBI break up an enemy spy ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xs30UsoUpDr73qoekWrBJ26GZXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115608'),
