  ('24995695530013092', 'The Atoning', 2017, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Williams, Michael Williams', 'Michael Williams', 'Cannon Bosarge, Michael LaCour, Virginia Newcomb, Dorothy Weems, Sherri Eakin, Ashlyn Jade Lopez, Alex Zuko, Jessy Hughes', 'NR', 'Vera, Ray, and Sam, a seemingly normal family, are haunted by more than mere ghosts. The lingering horror of their past threatens their ability to function as a loving family until they become enlightened by a mystical encounter. From that moment on, they''re thrust into a horror worse than anything they''ve ever experienced. Personal demons manifest and tear the family apart from the inside out as they come to terms with their past.', 'Vera, Ray, and Sam, a seemingly normal family, are haunted by more than mere ghosts. The lingering horror of their past threatens their ability to function as a loving family until they become enlightened by a mystical encounter. From that moment on, they''re thrust into a horror worse than anything they''ve ever experienced. Personal demons manifest and tear the family apart from the inside out as they come to terms with their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8TucRd6IaqaHp0uVzPmKJFO6jn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470390'),
  ('605841312146406157', 'The Atrocity Exhibition', 1998, 'Drama, Horror', 'Jonathan Weiss, Bud Gardner', 'Jonathan Weiss', 'Victor Slezak, Anna Juvander, Michael Kirby, Mariko Takai, Robert Patrick Brink, Diane Grotke, Caroline McGee, Robert Morgan', 'NR', 'A doctor in a mental research institution is driven insane by the spectacle of the horrors of the twentieth century.', 'A doctor in a mental research institution is driven insane by the spectacle of the horrors of the twentieth century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZGQhSB4jG6OwhrL3uCyvmTOUn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65456'),
