  ('1001489942660899372', 'The Attack of the Giant Mousaka', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Panos H. Koutras', 'Panos H. Koutras', 'Giannis Angelakis, Christos Mantakas, Themis Bazaka, Myriam Vourou, Yannis Kokiasmenos, Gregory Patrick Karr, Roubini Vasilakopoulou, Argyris Xafis', null, 'Around the year 2000, a terrible occurence shocks the city of Athens: a huge piece of moussaka appears on the city streets, spreading panic and death. Everyone keeps wondering: why, where, how, for what reason? But no one can give an answer...', 'Around the year 2000, a terrible occurence shocks the city of Athens: a huge piece of moussaka appears on the city streets, spreading panic and death. Everyone keeps wondering: why, where, how, for what reason? But no one can give an answer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glrNplv6UWozFEeuhJNdbR7Sdp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47856'),
