  ('958220244516998281', 'The Attempt Against the Life of Maitre Labori', 1899, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Maître Labori is seen approaching the bridge of Rennes in company with Colonel Picquart and M. Gast, Mayor of Rennes. They notice that they are followed by another man to whom Colonel Picquart calls Labori''s attention. They, however, consider his proximity of no importance, and continue to speak together. As soon as their backs are turned, the man draws a revolver and fires twice at Maître Labori, who is seen to fall to the ground. The culprit makes his escape, pursued by Colonel Picquart and M. Gast.', 'Maître Labori is seen approaching the bridge of Rennes in company with Colonel Picquart and M. Gast, Mayor of Rennes. They notice that they are followed by another man to whom Colonel Picquart calls Labori''s attention. They, however, consider his proximity of no importance, and continue to speak together. As soon as their backs are turned, the man draws a revolver and fires twice at Maître Labori, who is seen to fall to the ground. The culprit makes his escape, pursued by Colonel Picquart and M. Gast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lRMfh8AyQYZixbMOGEKNg8SZBm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105333'),
  ('227669819044355880', 'The Attic', 1980, 'Horror', 'George Edwards, Gary Graver, Gary Graver', 'Tony Crechales, George Edwards', 'Carrie Snodgress, Ray Milland, Ruth Cox, Rosemary Murphy, Frances Bay, Fern Barry, Marjorie Eaton, Dick Welsbacher', 'PG', 'A librarian devotes her life to caring for her wheelchair-bound tyrannical father after being stood up at altar. She fantasizes his death and finds joy only with her pet monkey. When the monkey disappears, a shocking past is revealed.', 'A librarian devotes her life to caring for her wheelchair-bound tyrannical father after being stood up at altar. She fantasizes his death and finds joy only with her pet monkey. When the monkey disappears, a shocking past is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6319pq8j9Dro5Fmde3Zm9pWIbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86149'),
  ('554150287772853287', 'The Attic', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mary Lambert, James Callanan', 'Robert M. Reitano, Tom Malloy', 'Elisabeth Moss, Tom Malloy, John Savage, Jason Lewis, Catherine Mary Stewart, Alexandra Daddario, Nick Gregory, Thomas Jay Ryan', 'R', 'Emma has a strong aversion towards her family’s new house, especially the attic. After moving in, she becomes miserable and reclusive. The rest of her family also seems unhappy and unsettled. The situation escalates one day when Emma is in the attic alone. All of a sudden someone who looks exactly like Emma attacks her viciously.', 'Emma has a strong aversion towards her family’s new house, especially the attic. After moving in, she becomes miserable and reclusive. The rest of her family also seems unhappy and unsettled. The situation escalates one day when Emma is in the attic alone. All of a sudden someone who looks exactly like Emma attacks her viciously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFUtefvTdSTlxaEQBcKh0AQ2Lwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27122'),
  ('635578210731991244', 'The Attic Expeditions', 2001, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Michael Negrin, Greg Littlewood, Jeremy Kasten', 'Rogan Russell Marshall', 'Andras Jones, Seth Green, Wendy Robie, Ted Raimi, Beth Bates, Jerry Hauck, Nancy Wolfe, Shannon Hart Cleary', 'R', 'Trevor Blackburn is accused of murdering his girlfriend, Faith, in a brutal ritual. He''s sentenced to live in an experimental rehabilitation community and falls into a coma. When he wakes up, he meets the mysterious Dr. Ek, who tortures Trevor in an attempt to learn the whereabouts of a powerful occult book. As other patients start to disappear, Trevor begins to wonder who and where he really is.', 'Trevor Blackburn is accused of murdering his girlfriend, Faith, in a brutal ritual. He''s sentenced to live in an experimental rehabilitation community and falls into a coma. When he wakes up, he meets the mysterious Dr. Ek, who tortures Trevor in an attempt to learn the whereabouts of a powerful occult book. As other patients start to disappear, Trevor begins to wonder who and where he really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0p8CjMLWc7B1nnIfFQ2uY3HLe0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17140'),
  ('504244709051277185', 'The Atticus Institute', 2015, 'Horror', 'Chris Sparling, Alex Vendler, Ian J. Putnam', 'Chris Sparling', 'William Mapother, Rya Kihlstedt, Sharon Maughan, Anne Betancourt, John Rubinstein, Suzanne Jamieson, Gerald McCullouch, Brian Chenoweth', 'NR', 'In the early 1970s, Dr. Henry West creates an institute to find people with supernatural abilities. When Judith Winstead comes to the facility, she exhibits amazing abilities that the military wants to turn into a weapon.', 'In the early 1970s, Dr. Henry West creates an institute to find people with supernatural abilities. When Judith Winstead comes to the facility, she exhibits amazing abilities that the military wants to turn into a weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ompMn7y7LAlRgwfOYjp88bCCD1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299551'),
  ('699843195330117218', 'The Attorney', 2013, 'History, Drama', 'Yang Woo-seok, Lee Tae-yoon, Kim Jun-su', 'Yang Woo-seok, Yoon Hyun-ho', 'Song Kang-ho, Kim Young-ae, Oh Dal-su, Yim Si-wan, Kwak Do-won, Jo Min-ki, Song Young-chang, Lee Sung-min', null, 'Song Woo-seok is a lawyer with no clients. When his friend''s son is falsely accused of a crime and tortured, he takes up the case and the course of his life changes for good.', 'Song Woo-seok is a lawyer with no clients. When his friend''s son is falsely accused of a crime and tortured, he takes up the case and the course of his life changes for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNCJgCCC97ABZ6yplyosNHI4Pjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242452'),
  ('458264924922682304', 'The Auction', 2013, 'Drama', 'Michel La Veaux, Sébastien Pilote, Marc Larose', 'Sébastien Pilote', 'Gabriel Arcand, Gilles Renaud, Lucie Laurier, Sophie Desmarais, Dominique Leduc, Pierre-Luc Brillant, Normand Carrière, Claude Desjardins', null, 'Gaby owns a farm on which he raises lambs: Bouchard &amp; Sons Farm. But he has no sons. Rather, he has two daughters that he raised like princesses and who live far away, in the big city. One day, the oldest asks him for some financial support so she doesn''t end up losing her house...', 'Gaby owns a farm on which he raises lambs: Bouchard &amp; Sons Farm. But he has no sons. Rather, he has two daughters that he raised like princesses and who live far away, in the big city. One day, the oldest asks him for some financial support so she doesn''t end up losing her house...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Sw3AEh9VMHnWFUQIeTrL8UIxOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190876'),
  ('456424880312734756', 'The Audience', 1972, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marco Ferreri, Verena D''Alessandro, Michele Guidugli', 'Dante Matelli, Marco Ferreri', 'Enzo Jannacci, Claudia Cardinale, Ugo Tognazzi, Michel Piccoli, Vittorio Gassman, Alain Cuny, Daniele Dublino, Sigelfrido Rossi', null, 'Caustic satire on bureaucracy of the Vatican authority and a simple Italian who wants to achieve the audience with the Pope.', 'Caustic satire on bureaucracy of the Vatican authority and a simple Italian who wants to achieve the audience with the Pope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twsQq5mmkN60sQkLr2aucZBr4qO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81775'),
  ('1011007862086100303', 'The Audition', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Julien Bureau, Juliette Beneich, Estelle Chauvin', 'Pierre Niney, Igor Gotesman', 'François Civil, Brice Hillairet, Yann Sorton, Noémie Merlant', null, 'François attends a casting. After a very strange interview, he finds out he is actually at the heart of the mysterious set up in which he is forced to take part...', 'François attends a casting. After a very strange interview, he finds out he is actually at the heart of the mysterious set up in which he is forced to take part...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0Xvj7IMHwK4yu8KAzpV0N6oo7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568425'),
  ('318809268907394994', 'The Audition', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Martin Scorsese, Rodrigo Prieto', 'Terence Winter', 'Robert De Niro, Leonardo DiCaprio, Brad Pitt, Martin Scorsese, Rodrigo Prieto, K.K. Moggie, Ron Nakahara, Lyman Chen', null, 'Robert De Niro and Leonardo DiCaprio must compete for the lead role in Martin Scorsese''s next film.', 'Robert De Niro and Leonardo DiCaprio must compete for the lead role in Martin Scorsese''s next film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1PDIeDpJGgI9JPqIRMuG7WDdId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365717'),
  ('478267146812167617', 'The Audition', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ina Weisse, Judith Kaufmann', 'Daphne Charizani, Ina Weisse', 'Nina Hoss, Simon Abkarian, Jens Albinus, Ilja Monti, Serafin Mishiev, Sophie Rois, Thomas Thieme, Thorsten Merten', null, 'Anna teaches violin at a music school, her husband is an instrument-maker. They have a 10-year-old son, Jonas. At school, Anna champions young Alexander, in whom she alone sees great talent. She devotes much energy and attention preparing him for the next stage exam to prove she was right. Soon Anna devotes more time to him than to Jonas, bringing the two boys into rivalry. At the same time her marriage is collapsing, she withdraws increasingly from her own family and starts an affair with her colleague Christian, who is encouraging her to join a quartet. When she fails during their joint concert, the pressure mounts. With Alexander now her vehicle, she drives him ever onwards and upwards. Come the day of the exam, events take a tragic turn...', 'Anna teaches violin at a music school, her husband is an instrument-maker. They have a 10-year-old son, Jonas. At school, Anna champions young Alexander, in whom she alone sees great talent. She devotes much energy and attention preparing him for the next stage exam to prove she was right. Soon Anna devotes more time to him than to Jonas, bringing the two boys into rivalry. At the same time her marriage is collapsing, she withdraws increasingly from her own family and starts an affair with her colleague Christian, who is encouraging her to join a quartet. When she fails during their joint concert, the pressure mounts. With Alexander now her vehicle, she drives him ever onwards and upwards. Come the day of the exam, events take a tragic turn...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7igFXZt0Uk6Z4h9HAXZdn5FEuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575563'),
  ('374103271184889785', 'The Audrey Hepburn Story', 2000, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Steven Robman, Pierre Letarte', 'Marsha Norman', 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Frances Fisher, Keir Dullea, Gabriel Macht, Peter Giles, Emmy Rossum, Eric McCormack, Seana Kofoed', 'PG', 'The film spans from Hepburn''s early childhood to the 1950s which details her life as a Dutch ballerina, coming to grips with her parents'' divorce, and enduring life in the Nazi-occupied Netherlands during World War II. She then settles in the U.S. where she succeeds in making it big as a movie actress, in such movies as Breakfast at Tiffany''s.', 'The film spans from Hepburn''s early childhood to the 1950s which details her life as a Dutch ballerina, coming to grips with her parents'' divorce, and enduring life in the Nazi-occupied Netherlands during World War II. She then settles in the U.S. where she succeeds in making it big as a movie actress, in such movies as Breakfast at Tiffany''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w42uOb4BrYPS7aDEYy2hBYh5pVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60587'),
  ('357054359701482827', 'The August Virgin', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Jonás Trueba, Santiago Racaj, Lorena Tudela', 'Itsaso Arana, Jonás Trueba', 'Itsaso Arana, Vito Sanz, Isabelle Stoffel, Joe Manjón, Mikele Urroz, Luis Alberto Heras, María Herrador, Naiara Carmona', null, 'Young Eva makes her decision to stay in Madrid for the month of August an act of faith. She needs to feel things differently and think of summer as a time of opportunity. On days of festivities and verbenas, while events and encounters take place, Eva will discover that she still has time, that an opportunity can still be given.', 'Young Eva makes her decision to stay in Madrid for the month of August an act of faith. She needs to feel things differently and think of summer as a time of opportunity. On days of festivities and verbenas, while events and encounters take place, Eva will discover that she still has time, that an opportunity can still be given.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybsLltBY2HWE43mvDgfW8nnDldh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:562299'),
  ('359794786749569864', 'The Augusta Street Ripper', 2014, 'Horror', 'Geisla Fernandes, Felipe M. Guerra', 'Felipe M. Guerra, Geisla Fernandes', 'Monica Mattos, Henrique Zanoni, Geisla Fernandes, Daniela Monteiro, Felipe M. Guerra, Herica Giacomin, Elise Miyazaki de Siqueira, Carina Bueno', null, 'A vampire pretends to be a hooker on Augusta St., in São Paulo, to feed on her victims, until she comes across a monster that attacks at the same address.', 'A vampire pretends to be a hooker on Augusta St., in São Paulo, to feed on her victims, until she comes across a monster that attacks at the same address.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ft76XVPTEe4NcEjowMA6XeHpoAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293831'),
  ('494778171281182368', 'The Auntie from Chicago', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Georgia Vasileiadou, Orestis Makris, Eleni Zafeiriou, Pantelis Zervos, Jenny Karezi, Gelly Mavropoulou, Margarita Papageorgiou, Niki Papadatou', null, 'Charilaos (Orestis Makris), a retired officer with very strict and conservative principles, raises his four daughters with... military discipline, taking care of their culture, their appearance and their good behavior. Despite all his desire to marry them, he does not leave them anywhere alone, as a result of which no man approaches them. His wife, Efterpi (Eleni Zafiriou), as well as his friend and neighbor Xenophon (Pantelis Zervos), make remarkable efforts to convince him to change his tactics, but he insists on his very conservative behavior. But when the conversation reaches the well-to-do sister of Kalliopis (Georgia Vassiliadou) who has been living in Chicago, USA for years, everything turns upside down. She returns to Athens and undertakes to modernize the general''s house, as well as help the four girls (and her nieces) to be rehabilitated.', 'Charilaos (Orestis Makris), a retired officer with very strict and conservative principles, raises his four daughters with... military discipline, taking care of their culture, their appearance and their good behavior. Despite all his desire to marry them, he does not leave them anywhere alone, as a result of which no man approaches them. His wife, Efterpi (Eleni Zafiriou), as well as his friend and neighbor Xenophon (Pantelis Zervos), make remarkable efforts to convince him to change his tactics, but he insists on his very conservative behavior. But when the conversation reaches the well-to-do sister of Kalliopis (Georgia Vassiliadou) who has been living in Chicago, USA for years, everything turns upside down. She returns to Athens and undertakes to modernize the general''s house, as well as help the four girls (and her nieces) to be rehabilitated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOkb0ymIYnDpFp0OdgBoexPtV7G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288526'),
  ('582992542550491181', 'The Aunts', 2024, 'Horror', 'Felipe Martínez Amador', null, 'Ximena Sariñana, Camila Nuñez, Diego Klein, Roberto Quijano, Beatriz Monroy, Mireya Kilmon, Neher Jacqueline Briceño, Edgar Ojeda', null, 'A mother enters an old home for her autistic daughter''s therapy. Unexpectedly, the daughter start speaking but has encountered dark entities from the past seeking payback. The family faces supernatural forces related to the home''s history.', 'A mother enters an old home for her autistic daughter''s therapy. Unexpectedly, the daughter start speaking but has encountered dark entities from the past seeking payback. The family faces supernatural forces related to the home''s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEgWL3PlfEA6IFXNLoi6x9IWLZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1340602'),
  ('1135259803586402151', 'The Aura', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fabián Bielinsky, Checco Varese', 'Pablo De Santis', 'Ricardo Darín, Dolores Fonzi, Pablo Cedrón, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Jorge D''Elía, Alejandro Awada, Rafa Castejón, Manuel Rodal', 'NR', 'A quiet, epileptic taxidermist plans the perfect crime. All he needs is the right opportunity. An accident, perhaps…', 'A quiet, epileptic taxidermist plans the perfect crime. All he needs is the right opportunity. An accident, perhaps…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/waaFS27AOSt2JvKMZyFi9m7uGKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13653'),
  ('622953760283679828', 'The Aurora', 2000, 'Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Yoshinori Sugano, Katsuyoshi Kobayashi', 'Takehiko Hata, Michiru Shimada', 'Shigeru Chiba, Toshio Furukawa, Takaya Hashi, Megumi Okina, Akira Kamiya, Hideyuki Tanaka, Junichi Ishida, Issei Ishida', null, 'Deep-sea archeologist Hiroshi Ibuki is the member of the digging team working at the bottom of the sea hoping to uncover the origins of Earth''s existence but instead uncovers a mysterious colony of bacteria which gives off light similar to the Aurora Borealis. The ancient bacteria, once revived, attempt to make the world habitable for themselves - a process that would bring Earth back to its early primal form, killing all current life in the process.', 'Deep-sea archeologist Hiroshi Ibuki is the member of the digging team working at the bottom of the sea hoping to uncover the origins of Earth''s existence but instead uncovers a mysterious colony of bacteria which gives off light similar to the Aurora Borealis. The ancient bacteria, once revived, attempt to make the world habitable for themselves - a process that would bring Earth back to its early primal form, killing all current life in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXo5ukh1s3K9vLHNNEjekwA1JaC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461711'),
  ('189196953086266519', 'The Auschwitz Report', 2021, 'Drama, History, War', 'Pavel Svatoň, Matúš Ryšan, Peter Bebjak', 'Peter Bebjak, Josef Pešťák, Tomáš Bombík', 'Noël Czuczor, Peter Ondrejička, John Hannah, Wojciech Mecwaldowski, Jacek Beler, Jan Nedbal, Michal Režný, Kamil Nożyński', 'R', 'This is the true story of Freddy and Walter – two young Slovak Jews, who were deported to Auschwitz in 1942. On 10 April 1944, after meticulous planning, they manage to escape. While the inmates they had left behind courageously stand their ground against the Nazi officers, the two men are driven on by the hope that their evidence could save lives.', 'This is the true story of Freddy and Walter – two young Slovak Jews, who were deported to Auschwitz in 1942. On 10 April 1944, after meticulous planning, they manage to escape. While the inmates they had left behind courageously stand their ground against the Nazi officers, the two men are driven on by the hope that their evidence could save lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UJQS6V0KbHjaZbI0Wv7rL57S7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717694'),
  ('103465536313785118', 'The Autobiography of Miss Jane Pittman', 1974, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Korty, Nathan Haggard, Ric Rondell', 'Tracy Keenan Wynn', 'Cicely Tyson, Eric Brown, Richard Dysart, Joel Fluellen, Will Hare, Katherine Helmond, David Hooks, Elinora B. Johnson', null, 'In February, 1962, as the civil rights movement reaches Bayonne, Louisiana, a New York journalist arrives to interview Jane Pittman, who has just turned 110. She tells him her story dating back to her earliest memories before slavery ended. In between the chapters of her life, the present-day struggles of Blacks in Bayonne, urged on by Jimmy, are dramatized.', 'In February, 1962, as the civil rights movement reaches Bayonne, Louisiana, a New York journalist arrives to interview Jane Pittman, who has just turned 110. She tells him her story dating back to her earliest memories before slavery ended. In between the chapters of her life, the present-day struggles of Blacks in Bayonne, urged on by Jimmy, are dramatized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0Zg9uJGA2CgYGReA4fE1NU6Inj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57868'),
