  ('251095767987336386', 'The Autopsy of Jane Doe', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Laurie Mahon, Daniel Jerome Gill, André Øvredal', 'Ian B. Goldberg, Richard Naing', 'Emile Hirsch, Brian Cox, Ophelia Lovibond, Olwen Catherine Kelly, Michael McElhatton, Parker Sawyers, Jane Perry, Mark Phoenix', 'R', 'Father and son coroners receive a mysterious unidentified corpse with no apparent cause of death. As they attempt to examine the "Jane Doe," they discover increasingly bizarre clues that hold the key to her terrifying secrets.', 'Father and son coroners receive a mysterious unidentified corpse with no apparent cause of death. As they attempt to examine the "Jane Doe," they discover increasingly bizarre clues that hold the key to her terrifying secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6K0wjP8kPCiPYy9PtXBGuypyt5I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397243'),
