  ('664106801246027636', 'The Avengers', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Jeremiah S. Chechik, Roger Pratt, Jim Morahan', 'Don MacPherson, Sydney Newman', 'Ralph Fiennes, Uma Thurman, Sean Connery, Patrick Macnee, Jim Broadbent, Fiona Shaw, Eddie Izzard, Eileen Atkins', 'PG-13', 'British Ministry agent John Steed, under direction from "Mother", investigates a diabolical plot by arch-villain Sir August de Wynter to rule the world with his weather control machine. Steed investigates the beautiful Doctor Mrs. Emma Peel, the only suspect, but simultaneously falls for her and joins forces with her to combat Sir August.', 'British Ministry agent John Steed, under direction from "Mother", investigates a diabolical plot by arch-villain Sir August de Wynter to rule the world with his weather control machine. Steed investigates the beautiful Doctor Mrs. Emma Peel, the only suspect, but simultaneously falls for her and joins forces with her to combat Sir August.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1p5thyQ4pCy876HpdvFARqJ62N9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9320'),
  ('709068745882626566', 'The Avengers', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Joss Whedon, Nick S. Cross, Stephen Morahan', 'Joss Whedon', 'Robert Downey Jr., Chris Evans, Mark Ruffalo, Chris Hemsworth, Scarlett Johansson, Jeremy Renner, Tom Hiddleston, Clark Gregg', 'PG-13', 'When an unexpected enemy emerges and threatens global safety and security, Nick Fury, director of the international peacekeeping agency known as S.H.I.E.L.D., finds himself in need of a team to pull the world back from the brink of disaster. Spanning the globe, a daring recruitment effort begins!', 'When an unexpected enemy emerges and threatens global safety and security, Nick Fury, director of the international peacekeeping agency known as S.H.I.E.L.D., finds himself in need of a team to pull the world back from the brink of disaster. Spanning the globe, a daring recruitment effort begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RYMX2wcKCBAr24UyPD7xwmjaTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24428'),
