  ('402832309014301556', 'The Avenging Eagle', 1978, 'Action, Adventure', 'Sun Chung, Lam Nai-Choi', 'Ni Kuang', 'Ti Lung, Alexander Fu Sheng, Ku Feng, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Eddy Ko Hung, Austin Wai Tin-Chi, Bruce Tong Yim-Chaan, Lam Fai-Wong', 'PG', 'Eagle Chief Yoh Xi-hung raises orphans to be his personal killers. One such is Chik Ming-sing who now wants to put his killer life behind him. When the Eagle Clan come after him, a stranger called Cheuk comes to his assistance It turns out that Cheuk is the son of a family who were robbed and murdered by the Eagles. Now they will team up to destroy the evil clan.', 'Eagle Chief Yoh Xi-hung raises orphans to be his personal killers. One such is Chik Ming-sing who now wants to put his killer life behind him. When the Eagle Clan come after him, a stranger called Cheuk comes to his assistance It turns out that Cheuk is the son of a family who were robbed and murdered by the Eagles. Now they will team up to destroy the evil clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpOVfLNNmWQFNJrfrAnLmdsx8pT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83876'),
  ('807775662658037025', 'The Aviary', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Elie Smolkin, Chris Cullari, Jennifer Raite', 'Jennifer Raite, Chris Cullari', 'Malin Åkerman, Lorenza Izzo, Chris Messina, Sandrine Holt', 'R', 'A twisted journey of two women’s desperate flee to escape the clutches of Skylight, an insidious cult. Lured in by the promise of “freedom” in the isolated desert campus called The Aviary, Jillian and Blair join forces to escape in hopes of real freedom. Consumed by fear and paranoia, they can’t shake the feeling that they are being followed by the cult’s leader, Seth, a man as seductive as he is controlling. The more distance the pair gains from the cult, the more Seth holds control of their minds. With supplies dwindling and their senses failing, Jillian and Blair are faced with a horrifying question: how do you run from an enemy who lives inside your head?', 'A twisted journey of two women’s desperate flee to escape the clutches of Skylight, an insidious cult. Lured in by the promise of “freedom” in the isolated desert campus called The Aviary, Jillian and Blair join forces to escape in hopes of real freedom. Consumed by fear and paranoia, they can’t shake the feeling that they are being followed by the cult’s leader, Seth, a man as seductive as he is controlling. The more distance the pair gains from the cult, the more Seth holds control of their minds. With supplies dwindling and their senses failing, Jillian and Blair are faced with a horrifying question: how do you run from an enemy who lives inside your head?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6HUQcOQsgkFFO8xCITfxQz6ivc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:952374'),
  ('460126189056790086', 'The Aviator', 1985, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'George T. Miller, David Connell', 'Ernest K. Gann', 'Christopher Reeve, Rosanna Arquette, Jack Warden, Sam Wanamaker, Scott Wilson, Tyne Daly, Marcia Strassman, Will Hare', 'PG', 'A 1920s mail pilot and a rich man''s daughter crash-land on a mountain full of hungry wolves.', 'A 1920s mail pilot and a rich man''s daughter crash-land on a mountain full of hungry wolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJXxGAmrOEpos4kSTm5OxoOYOC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73462'),
