  ('167264475058638131', 'The Awakening of Gabriella', 1999, 'Drama', 'Michael Goi, Carlton McRae', null, 'Susan Featherly, Mark Ritter, Jeannie Millar, Taimie Hannum, Nikita Gross, Paul Dion Monte, Ron Galbraith, Venus', 'R', 'After leaving her small-town lover, an innocent beauty named Gabriella hits Hollywood with plans to enter a daring and exciting new chapter in her life. And it turns out that stripping at a gentlemen''s club is a good start. During her first week strutting her stuff on the runway, a wealthy couple pays her to join them at their estate for a scintillating session of voyeuristic sex that leaves Gabriella both confused and aroused. But Gabriella''s real education begins when the man of the house, Stephen, makes her his pet project. When he and his exotic servant Nicole induct Gabriella into their steamy world of carnal indulgence, Gabriella''s world changes forever', 'After leaving her small-town lover, an innocent beauty named Gabriella hits Hollywood with plans to enter a daring and exciting new chapter in her life. And it turns out that stripping at a gentlemen''s club is a good start. During her first week strutting her stuff on the runway, a wealthy couple pays her to join them at their estate for a scintillating session of voyeuristic sex that leaves Gabriella both confused and aroused. But Gabriella''s real education begins when the man of the house, Stephen, makes her his pet project. When he and his exotic servant Nicole induct Gabriella into their steamy world of carnal indulgence, Gabriella''s world changes forever', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93dIQRdV7D0FHFJnsg9szf69fx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335151'),
  ('42265637150793944', 'The Awakening of Motti Wolkenbruch', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Michael Steiner, Michael Saxer', 'Thomas Meyer', 'Noémie Schmidt, Joel Basman, Sunnyi Melles, Udo Samel, Inge Maux, Alexander Seibt, Oriana Schrage, Philippe Graber', null, 'The young Orthodox Jew, Motti Wolkenbruch, finds himself at a turning point. His beloved mother wants him to get married and presents one marriage candidate after the other. Unfortunately none of the woman pleases him, because they all look just like her. The situation gets even more complicated, when Motti secretly falls in love with the non-Jewish girl Laura, a so-called Shiksa.', 'The young Orthodox Jew, Motti Wolkenbruch, finds himself at a turning point. His beloved mother wants him to get married and presents one marriage candidate after the other. Unfortunately none of the woman pleases him, because they all look just like her. The situation gets even more complicated, when Motti secretly falls in love with the non-Jewish girl Laura, a so-called Shiksa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtDQaXTLEP6AkAUrliCi9iTrgjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486225'),
