  ('733571411263285427', 'The Baader Meinhof Complex', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Drama, History, Thriller', 'Uli Edel, Rainer Klausmann', 'Uli Edel, Bernd Eichinger', 'Martina Gedeck, Moritz Bleibtreu, Johanna Wokalek, Nadja Uhl, Stipe Erceg, Niels-Bruno Schmidt, Vinzenz Kiefer, Simon Licht', 'R', 'When German police viciously quell a protest against the shah of Iran, popular journalist Ulrike Meinhof rebels against her dishonest marriage, walks away from her children and joins radical anarchist Andreas Baader. Together with Baader''s girlfriend, Gudrun Ensslin, they form the violent Red Faction Army, and together perpetrate a slew of terrorist attacks as a way of disrupting the fabric of what they see as an increasingly fascist state.', 'When German police viciously quell a protest against the shah of Iran, popular journalist Ulrike Meinhof rebels against her dishonest marriage, walks away from her children and joins radical anarchist Andreas Baader. Together with Baader''s girlfriend, Gudrun Ensslin, they form the violent Red Faction Army, and together perpetrate a slew of terrorist attacks as a way of disrupting the fabric of what they see as an increasingly fascist state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36Y0UT6bXnkHBGmmVFWGEnEh8nI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6968'),
  ('864727483343842767', 'The Baader-Meinhof Gang on Trial', 1986, 'Drama, History, Action, Crime', 'Reinhard Hauff, Frank Brühne', 'Stefan Aust', 'Ulrich Tukur, Therese Affolter, Ulrich Pleitgen, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Dominique Horwitz, Sabine Wegner, Hans Kremer, Peter Danzeisen', null, 'Based on the research for his non-fiction book "Der Baader-Meinhoff-Komplex", "Spiegel" journalist Stefan Aust wrote the screen play to Reinhard Hauff’s controversial feature film that re-narrates the startling trial against the RAF terrorists Baader, Meinhoff, Ensslin, and Raspe. The trial that started in May 1975 in the Stammheim maximum-security prison extended over 192 days and ended with a lifetime sentence for all defendants.', 'Based on the research for his non-fiction book "Der Baader-Meinhoff-Komplex", "Spiegel" journalist Stefan Aust wrote the screen play to Reinhard Hauff’s controversial feature film that re-narrates the startling trial against the RAF terrorists Baader, Meinhoff, Ensslin, and Raspe. The trial that started in May 1975 in the Stammheim maximum-security prison extended over 192 days and ended with a lifetime sentence for all defendants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neFrkGrwWYGUvIG5bGmd9UIx3Jr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52327'),
  ('1004292753507069032', 'The Babadook', 2014, 'Drama, Horror', 'Jennifer Kent, Radek Ładczuk, Nima Nabili Rad', 'Jennifer Kent', 'Essie Davis, Noah Wiseman, Hayley McElhinney, Daniel Henshall, Barbara West, Ben Winspear, Cathy Adamek, Craig Behenna', 'R', 'A grieving single mother and her child fall into a deep well of paranoia when an eerie children''s book manifests in their home.', 'A grieving single mother and her child fall into a deep well of paranoia when an eerie children''s book manifests in their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qt3fqapeo94TfvMyld8P7gkpXLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242224'),
  ('1069895000392461468', 'The Babe', 1992, 'Drama', 'Arthur Hiller, Haskell Wexler', 'John Fusco', 'John Goodman, Kelly McGillis, Trini Alvarado, Randy Steinmeyer, James Cromwell, Michael McGrady, Richard Tyson, Joseph Ragno', 'PG', 'A chronicle of Babe Ruth''s phenomenal story--from his hard knock beginnings at a Baltimore orphanage, to his meteoric rise to baseball superstardom and his poignant retirement from the game. His amazing career included seven American League pennants, four World Series championships, two tempestuous marriages and a wild lifestyle that earned him numerous suspensions.', 'A chronicle of Babe Ruth''s phenomenal story--from his hard knock beginnings at a Baltimore orphanage, to his meteoric rise to baseball superstardom and his poignant retirement from the game. His amazing career included seven American League pennants, four World Series championships, two tempestuous marriages and a wild lifestyle that earned him numerous suspensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lso2f5jbglHtGke2A8NwRkcfxF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61225'),
  ('468474536177051530', 'The Baby', 1973, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ted Post, Michael D. Margulies, Jesse Corallo', 'Abe Polsky', 'Anjanette Comer, Susanne Zenor, Ruth Roman, Marianna Hill, Tod Andrews, Michael Pataki, David Mooney, Beatrice Manley', 'PG', 'A social worker who recently lost her husband investigates the strange Wadsworth family. The Wadsworths might not seem too unusual to hear about them at first - consisting of the mother, two grown daughters and the diaper-clad, bottle-sucking baby. The problem is, the baby is twenty-one years old.', 'A social worker who recently lost her husband investigates the strange Wadsworth family. The Wadsworths might not seem too unusual to hear about them at first - consisting of the mother, two grown daughters and the diaper-clad, bottle-sucking baby. The problem is, the baby is twenty-one years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovk7WxoO5Bu970qGCQuF6DgrwZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28156'),
  ('695814494971078392', 'The Baby', 2023, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Florian Cabaret, Yves Cape', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Fanny Chesnel', 'Fabrice Luchini, Mara Taquin, Maud Wyler, Veerle Baetens, Lucas Van den Eynde, Viv van Dingenen, Sandrine Dumas, Aurélia Thiérrée', null, 'Joseph learns that his son and his companion have just perished in an accident. They were expecting a child via a surrogate mother in Belgium. What will become of their future baby? Is Joseph the legitimate grandfather? Carried by the promise of this birth which will prolong the existence of his son, the sexagenarian goes to meet the young Flemish woman with a fierce and indomitable character.', 'Joseph learns that his son and his companion have just perished in an accident. They were expecting a child via a surrogate mother in Belgium. What will become of their future baby? Is Joseph the legitimate grandfather? Carried by the promise of this birth which will prolong the existence of his son, the sexagenarian goes to meet the young Flemish woman with a fierce and indomitable character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui7QMxB890YVSCKqXz6CJOCcY5P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962775'),
  ('982977732800446628', 'The Baby Carriage', 1963, 'Drama', 'Bo Widerberg, Jan Troell', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Inger Taube, Thommy Berggren, Lars Passgård, Ulla Akselson, Gunnar Öhlund, Stig Torstensson, Lena Brundin, Marianne Hedengrahn', null, 'A tale of a young woman, Britt, who has two flings, but finds herself with difficult decisions when she finds herself pregnant.', 'A tale of a young woman, Britt, who has two flings, but finds herself with difficult decisions when she finds herself pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rG2b1lylsyKzVrO4e7KAAOeul7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135380'),
  ('892555310900230305', 'The Baby Dance', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jane Anderson, Jan Kiesser', null, 'Laura Dern, Stockard Channing, Peter Riegert, Richard Lineback, Sandra Seacat, Wally Dalton, Stephen E. Miller, Heather McEwen', null, 'Six months pregnant and living in a beat-up tiny mobile home, Wanda LeFauve thinks she has found the solution to her problems when she agrees to meet well-to-do Rachel Luckman and her husband. The childless Luckmans are desperate to raise a baby and Wanda is anxious to find a home for her latest. They strike a deal, but as the birth parents and the potential adoptive parents get to know each other, fundamental differences emerge.', 'Six months pregnant and living in a beat-up tiny mobile home, Wanda LeFauve thinks she has found the solution to her problems when she agrees to meet well-to-do Rachel Luckman and her husband. The childless Luckmans are desperate to raise a baby and Wanda is anxious to find a home for her latest. They strike a deal, but as the birth parents and the potential adoptive parents get to know each other, fundamental differences emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jU9mNlwE8kRHFy37Tu81hIrULnp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126748'),
  ('1126217575776537305', 'The Baby of Mâcon', 1993, 'Drama, History', 'Sacha Vierny, Peter Greenaway', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Julia Ormond, Ralph Fiennes, Philip Stone, Jonathan Lacey, Don Henderson, Celia Gregory, Jeff Nuttall, Jessica Hynes', 'NR', 'In 17th-century Tuscany, a church play is performed for the benefit of young aristocrat Cosimo. In the play, a grotesque old woman gives birth to a beautiful baby boy. The child''s older sister is quick to exploit the situation, selling blessings from the baby, and even claiming she''s the true mother by virgin birth. However, when she attempts to seduce the bishop''s son, the Church exacts a terrible revenge.', 'In 17th-century Tuscany, a church play is performed for the benefit of young aristocrat Cosimo. In the play, a grotesque old woman gives birth to a beautiful baby boy. The child''s older sister is quick to exploit the situation, selling blessings from the baby, and even claiming she''s the true mother by virgin birth. However, when she attempts to seduce the bishop''s son, the Church exacts a terrible revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYB5uF36JE61GMLInD3Gp7yCCyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5051'),
  ('487541933379582130', 'The Baby-Sitters Club', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Melanie Mayron, Willy Kurant', 'Dalene Young', 'Schuyler Fisk, Bre Blair, Rachael Leigh Cook, Larisa Oleynik, Tricia Joe, Stacy Linn Ramsower, Zelda Harris, Vanessa Zima', 'PG', 'Seven junior-high-school girls organize a daycare camp for children while at the same time experiencing classic adolescent growing pains.', 'Seven junior-high-school girls organize a daycare camp for children while at the same time experiencing classic adolescent growing pains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJ5caIjtASchaTFx2VJr6drFYBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48287'),
  ('561973567702602518', 'The Baby''s Room', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Rodrigo Sancho, Félix Rodríguez', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría, Álex de la Iglesia', 'Javier Gutiérrez, Leonor Watling, Sancho Gracia, María Asquerino, Antonio Dechent, Terele Pávez, Ramón Barea, Eulalia Ramón', null, 'Juan and Sonia arrive at a large old house, an ideal place to raise their newborn son. When, one night before going to bed, they check the operation of the monitoring device installed in the baby''s room, they discover that someone is sitting next to the crib.', 'Juan and Sonia arrive at a large old house, an ideal place to raise their newborn son. When, one night before going to bed, they check the operation of the monitoring device installed in the baby''s room, they discover that someone is sitting next to the crib.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5BtCJyju9ltoVUV0VmwKUt5N0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15021'),
  ('752469788833621782', 'The Babymakers', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jay Chandrasekhar, Frankie DeMarco, Jasmine Marie Alhambra', 'Gerry Swallow, Peter Gaulke', 'Paul Schneider, Olivia Munn, Kevin Heffernan, Wood Harris, Nat Faxon, Jay Chandrasekhar, Aisha Tyler, Collette Wolfe', 'R', 'After he flunks a fertility test, a man realizes that the only way he can get his wife pregnant is by robbing a sperm bank to take back the last of the deposits he made there years earlier.', 'After he flunks a fertility test, a man realizes that the only way he can get his wife pregnant is by robbing a sperm bank to take back the last of the deposits he made there years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiJYF8wPkXVtWrMXni0YlUMJQJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98066'),
  ('904372217551499101', 'The Babysitter', 1980, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama', 'Peter Medak, Rexford L. Metz, Hugh Spencer-Phillips', 'Jennifer Miller', 'Patty Duke, William Shatner, Quinn Cummings, Stephanie Zimbalist, David Wallace, Kenneth Tigar, Virginia Kiser, John Houseman', 'NR', 'Overprotective mother Liz Benedict meets 18-year-old orphan Joanna Redwine and hires her as house help and live-in companion to rambunctious daughter Tara. Liz''s husband Jeff isn''t too thrilled with the arrangement, and his fears soon prove justified when Joanna begins to manipulate everyone and to slowly destroy the family. Meanwhile, next-door neighbor Dr. Linquist investigates and discovers Joanna has a disturbing past.', 'Overprotective mother Liz Benedict meets 18-year-old orphan Joanna Redwine and hires her as house help and live-in companion to rambunctious daughter Tara. Liz''s husband Jeff isn''t too thrilled with the arrangement, and his fears soon prove justified when Joanna begins to manipulate everyone and to slowly destroy the family. Meanwhile, next-door neighbor Dr. Linquist investigates and discovers Joanna has a disturbing past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXcq9ISs9gtsgmVXIm9RBk9kl56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276530'),
  ('957216731477911841', 'The Babysitter', 1995, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Guy Ferland, Rick Bota', 'Guy Ferland', 'Alicia Silverstone, Jeremy London, J.T. Walsh, Nicky Katt, Lee Garlington, George Segal, Ryan Slater, Lois Chiles', 'R', 'Jennifer is a lovely teen who has been hired to baby-sit the kids of Harry Tucker and his wife, Dolly. The Tuckers go to a party and proceed to get inebriated, with Mr. Tucker fantasizing about his beautiful baby sitter. Meanwhile, Jack, her boyfriend, and Mark, another guy interested in her, decide to spy on Jennifer at the Tucker house, with each young man also fixated on her.', 'Jennifer is a lovely teen who has been hired to baby-sit the kids of Harry Tucker and his wife, Dolly. The Tuckers go to a party and proceed to get inebriated, with Mr. Tucker fantasizing about his beautiful baby sitter. Meanwhile, Jack, her boyfriend, and Mark, another guy interested in her, decide to spy on Jennifer at the Tucker house, with each young man also fixated on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOv6HKiKTcDiyZRXPOsjm2JhVZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37141'),
  ('1130225395995776489', 'The Babysitter', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Brian Relyea, Matthew Janssen, McG', 'Brian Duffield', 'Judah Lewis, Samara Weaving, Robbie Amell, Hana Mae Lee, Bella Thorne, Emily Alyn Lind, Andrew Bachelor, Doug Haley', 'R', 'When Cole stays up past his bedtime, he discovers that his hot babysitter is part of a Satanic cult that will stop at nothing to keep him quiet.', 'When Cole stays up past his bedtime, he discovers that his hot babysitter is part of a Satanic cult that will stop at nothing to keep him quiet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAzKNxGnbK5SL7VF7UeQyZdQLHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419479'),
  ('403664184270315942', 'The Babysitter: Killer Queen', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Tim Trella, McG, Scott Henriksen', 'Dan Lagana, McG, Jimmy Warden', 'Judah Lewis, Jenna Ortega, Robbie Amell, Emily Alyn Lind, Andrew Bachelor, Bella Thorne, Hana Mae Lee, Ken Marino', 'R', 'Two years after defeating a satanic cult led by his babysitter Bee, Cole''s trying to forget his past and focus on surviving high school. But when old enemies unexpectedly return, Cole will once again have to outsmart the forces of evil.', 'Two years after defeating a satanic cult led by his babysitter Bee, Cole''s trying to forget his past and focus on surviving high school. But when old enemies unexpectedly return, Cole will once again have to outsmart the forces of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imy1OoT1xddt2kqw6hhc4v01e8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623491'),
  ('224307873816791747', 'The Babysitter''s Seduction', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'David Burton Morris, Robin A. Warren, Richard Peter Schroer', 'Nancy Hersage, Shirley Tallman', 'Keri Russell, Stephen Collins, Phylicia Rashād, Tobin Bell, John D''Aquino, Linda Kelsey, Arian Ash, Dawn Lambing', 'PG-13', 'The mother of the family for which Michelle baby-sits dies unexpectedly. Michelle is asked to take over looking after the children and is gradually "seduced" by the father.', 'The mother of the family for which Michelle baby-sits dies unexpectedly. Michelle is asked to take over looking after the children and is gradually "seduced" by the father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvyqO99xPHuKwqCfCXf0p2KBj7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69945'),
  ('80319468365429794', 'The Babysitters', 2008, 'Drama', 'David Ross, Urs Hirschbiegel, Jason Graham', 'David Ross', 'John Leguizamo, Katherine Waterston, Cynthia Nixon, Andy Comeau, Denis O''Hare, Lauren Birkell, Louisa Krause, Halley Wegryn Gross', 'R', 'Seventeen-year-old Shirley is a good student who works as a babysitter in order to make money for college. One night Michael, a father Shirley works for, confesses he''s unhappy with married life. Shirley has a crush on Michael, and seizes this moment to kiss him. Michael is so happy he presents Shirley with a big tip, which gives her an idea. Shirley plans to make extra money by setting up her teenage friends with other unhappy fathers.', 'Seventeen-year-old Shirley is a good student who works as a babysitter in order to make money for college. One night Michael, a father Shirley works for, confesses he''s unhappy with married life. Shirley has a crush on Michael, and seizes this moment to kiss him. Michael is so happy he presents Shirley with a big tip, which gives her an idea. Shirley plans to make extra money by setting up her teenage friends with other unhappy fathers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsrNUqGXI95unRKZEu8BJ584xWn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13078'),
  ('955792726103618071', 'The Bachelor', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Pietrangeli, Franco Zeffirelli, Armando Crispino', 'Ruggero Maccari, Antonio Pietrangeli, Ettore Scola', 'Alberto Sordi, Sandra Milo, Nino Manfredi, Madeleine Fischer, Anna Maria Pancani, María Asquerino, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Pina Bottin', null, 'Paolo Anselmi is a happily single man. He lives in a flat with a friend but is forced to leave when the friend gets married. He then goes to a boarding house where he flirts with a girl but ditches her when she proposes marriage. When he goes and visits his mother he finds out that she is also trying to find the right girl for him. Is he going to surrender this time?', 'Paolo Anselmi is a happily single man. He lives in a flat with a friend but is forced to leave when the friend gets married. He then goes to a boarding house where he flirts with a girl but ditches her when she proposes marriage. When he goes and visits his mother he finds out that she is also trying to find the right girl for him. Is he going to surrender this time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9hMCNr5HdJLjevBxd33YSSDMW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82481'),
  ('566006436129469607', 'The Bachelor', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gary Sinyor, Simon Archer', 'Steve Cohen', 'Chris O''Donnell, Renée Zellweger, Artie Lange, Ed Asner, Hal Holbrook, James Cromwell, Marley Shelton, Peter Ustinov', 'PG-13', 'Jimmie is seeing his single friends get married one by one. He isn''t too worried until his girlfriend Anne catches the bouquet at his friend Marco''s wedding. Suddenly, his wild mustang days are numbered. He finally decides to propose to her, but he sticks his foot in his mouth and botches the proposal. Being insulted by the defeatist proposal, Anne leaves town on an assignment. After she''s gone, he finds out that his recently-deceased grandfather''s will stipulates that he gets nothing of a multi-million dollar fortune unless he''s married by 6:05pm on his 30th birthday: tomorrow! Not being able to find Anne, Jimmie begins backtracking through his past girlfriends to find a wife.', 'Jimmie is seeing his single friends get married one by one. He isn''t too worried until his girlfriend Anne catches the bouquet at his friend Marco''s wedding. Suddenly, his wild mustang days are numbered. He finally decides to propose to her, but he sticks his foot in his mouth and botches the proposal. Being insulted by the defeatist proposal, Anne leaves town on an assignment. After she''s gone, he finds out that his recently-deceased grandfather''s will stipulates that he gets nothing of a multi-million dollar fortune unless he''s married by 6:05pm on his 30th birthday: tomorrow! Not being able to find Anne, Jimmie begins backtracking through his past girlfriends to find a wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAF7cDx3SNqx6vjqgH2FLFM9pcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2020'),
  ('878586002477079395', 'The Bachelor and the Bobby-Soxer', 1947, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Irving Reis, Nicholas Musuraca, Nate Levinson', 'Sidney Sheldon', 'Cary Grant, Myrna Loy, Shirley Temple, Rudy Vallee, Ray Collins, Harry Davenport, Johnny Sands, Don Beddoe', 'NR', 'Teenager Susan Turner, with a severe crush on playboy artist Richard Nugent, sneaks into his apartment to model for him and is found there by her sister Judge Margaret Turner. Threatened with jail, Nugent agrees to date Susan until the crush abates.', 'Teenager Susan Turner, with a severe crush on playboy artist Richard Nugent, sneaks into his apartment to model for him and is found there by her sister Judge Margaret Turner. Threatened with jail, Nugent agrees to date Susan until the crush abates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeBn5yhOBMBq2qQ9x2xQHyP1ZJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27437'),
  ('413500570386493672', 'The Bachelor''s Paradise', 1901, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A sorceress conjures up a bevy of beauties for a bachelor to peruse.', 'A sorceress conjures up a bevy of beauties for a bachelor to peruse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7I36LOlZb7R19Ni0DGlvTXT6Ka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107268'),
  ('266343065822576315', 'The Bachelorette Party', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Apolloni, Giulio Pietromarchi', 'Francesco Apolloni, Daniela Delle Foglie, Fabrizio Nardi', 'Laura Chiatti, Antónia Lišková, Chiara Francini, Jun Ichikawa, Adrian Gaeta, Thierno Thiam, Antonia Fotaras, Emma Matilda Lió', null, 'Five women celebrate one of the girl''s bachelorette party but one of them doesn''t show up.', 'Five women celebrate one of the girl''s bachelorette party but one of them doesn''t show up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQDdMsjQ0GEN93G0GEl4RU8kt01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:771502'),
  ('850721981239415878', 'The Bachelors', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kurt Voelker, Antonio Riestra', 'Kurt Voelker', 'J.K. Simmons, Josh Wiggins, Julie Delpy, Odeya Rush, Kevin Dunn, Kitana Turnbull, Tyrel Jackson Williams, Jae Head', 'NR', 'After the early death of his wife, a mourning father moves with his teenage son across the country for a private school teaching job. Their lives begin to transform due to two unique women, who help them embrace life and love again', 'After the early death of his wife, a mourning father moves with his teenage son across the country for a private school teaching job. Their lives begin to transform due to two unique women, who help them embrace life and love again', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAwoDmcLFuZxg5bHzYgRexYhykm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397601'),
