  ('326619617167476091', 'The Bad Guys', 2022, 'Family, Comedy, Crime, Animation, Action', 'Pierre Perifel, Lisa Curtis Saunders', 'Etan Cohen', 'Sam Rockwell, Marc Maron, Awkwafina, Craig Robinson, Anthony Ramos, Richard Ayoade, Zazie Beetz, Alex Borstein', 'PG', 'When the Bad Guys, a crew of criminal animals, are finally caught after years of heists and being the world’s most-wanted villains, Mr. Wolf brokers a deal to save them all from prison.', 'When the Bad Guys, a crew of criminal animals, are finally caught after years of heists and being the world’s most-wanted villains, Mr. Wolf brokers a deal to save them all from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qop80YfuO0BwJa1uXk1DXUUEwv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629542'),
