  ('628022424839578885', 'The Bad News Bears', 1976, 'Family, Comedy', 'Michael Ritchie, John A. Alonzo, Al Murphy', 'Bill Lancaster', 'Walter Matthau, Tatum O''Neal, Vic Morrow, Joyce Van Patten, Ben Piazza, Jackie Earle Haley, Alfred Lutter, Chris Barnes', 'PG', 'An aging, down-on-his-luck ex-minor leaguer coaches a team of misfits in an ultra-competitive California little league.', 'An aging, down-on-his-luck ex-minor leaguer coaches a team of misfits in an ultra-competitive California little league.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJNXMni0ObOXLth6v9xpUhWbtrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23479'),
  ('258931068206662723', 'The Bad News Bears Go to Japan', 1978, 'Comedy', 'John Berry, Gene Polito, Kōzō Okazaki', 'Bill Lancaster', 'Tony Curtis, Jackie Earle Haley, Tomisaburō Wakayama, Kanji Inoki, Hatsune Ishihara, George Wyner, Lonny Chapman, Matthew Anton', 'PG', 'A small time promotor/hustler takes the pint-sized baseball team to Japan for a match against the country''s best little league baseball team which sparks off a series of adventures and mishaps the boys come into.', 'A small time promotor/hustler takes the pint-sized baseball team to Japan for a match against the country''s best little league baseball team which sparks off a series of adventures and mishaps the boys come into.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NNRDDMCZAI4UEgcQPUqRD147cw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66946'),
  ('110095814425658730', 'The Bad News Bears in Breaking Training', 1977, 'Comedy, Family', 'Michael Pressman, Fred J. Koenekamp, Kim Kurumada', 'Paul Brickman', 'William Devane, Clifton James, Jackie Earle Haley, Jimmy Baio, Erin Blunt, Jaime Escobedo, George Gonzales, Alfred Lutter', 'PG', 'A troubled, rebellious teen drives his rambunctious baseball team out to Houston where they play an exhibition game and the boy meets his estranged father, and hires him as the teams coach.', 'A troubled, rebellious teen drives his rambunctious baseball team out to Houston where they play an exhibition game and the boy meets his estranged father, and hires him as the teams coach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAwVRX1EsnSKzvo5HEA4S2rBoDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19050'),
  ('717400503397765444', 'The Bad Nun 3', 2024, 'Horror', 'Corry Raymond, Francesco Gabriele', 'John Oak Dalton', 'Danielle Scott, Kelly Rian Sanson, Charlotte Coleman, Connor Powles, Matt Tolson, Stephen Stallone Thomas, Alesia Lifantii, Arthur Edwards', null, 'When a traumatized young woman in a grief counselling group suddenly dies, a trio of friends from the group decide to find out what really happened.', 'When a traumatized young woman in a grief counselling group suddenly dies, a trio of friends from the group decide to find out what really happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sj41kN0tVEQm8GUFDXC6Kic1iwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136347'),
  ('1120732510771966150', 'The Bad Poet', 2021, 'History, Drama', 'Gianluca Jodice, Daniele Ciprì', 'Gianluca Jodice', 'Sergio Castellitto, Francesco Patanè, Tommaso Ragno, Clotilde Courau, Fausto Russo Alesi, Massimiliano Rossi, Elena Bucci, Lidiya Liberman', null, '1936. Giovanni Comini, the youngest Federal in Fascist Italy, is summoned to Rome for a delicate mission: to surveil aging national poet Gabriele D''Annunzio, whose increasingly restless behavior Mussolini fears could damage his alliance with Nazi Germany. However, after spending time with D''Annunzio, Comini finds himself torn between loyalty to the Party and his fascination with the poet, who will put his burgeoning career at risk.', '1936. Giovanni Comini, the youngest Federal in Fascist Italy, is summoned to Rome for a delicate mission: to surveil aging national poet Gabriele D''Annunzio, whose increasingly restless behavior Mussolini fears could damage his alliance with Nazi Germany. However, after spending time with D''Annunzio, Comini finds himself torn between loyalty to the Party and his fascination with the poet, who will put his burgeoning career at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ngoRjEiVOuTdKOH5A6hWaO9r2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654350'),
  ('136231732673613791', 'The Bad Seed', 1956, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Harold Rosson, Mel Dellar', 'John Lee Mahin', 'Patty McCormack, Nancy Kelly, Henry Jones, Eileen Heckart, Evelyn Varden, William Hopper, Paul Fix, Jesse White', 'NR', 'Air Force Colonel Kenneth Penmark and his wife, Christine, adore their daughter Rhoda, despite her secret tendency for selfishness. Christine keeps her knowledge of her daughter''s darker side to herself, but when a schoolmate of Rhoda''s dies mysteriously, her self-deception unravels.', 'Air Force Colonel Kenneth Penmark and his wife, Christine, adore their daughter Rhoda, despite her secret tendency for selfishness. Christine keeps her knowledge of her daughter''s darker side to herself, but when a schoolmate of Rhoda''s dies mysteriously, her self-deception unravels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAgSkpZslQ2s3onL9TaHbyWygtC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42196'),
  ('341768726593755372', 'The Bad Seed', 1985, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror, Crime, TV Movie', 'Ted Voigtlander, Paul Wendkos, Lorin Bennett Salob', null, 'Blair Brown, Lynn Redgrave, David Carradine, Carrie Wells, Richard Kiley, David Ogden Stiers, Chad Allen, Weldon Bleiler', null, 'Rachel is a 9-year-old girl who is perfection itself - unless she''s crossed or challenged. Several disturbing recent incidents have led Rachel''s mother Christine to suspect that her child is a latent murderess. Upon discovering that she herself is the daughter of a convicted killer, Christine becomes convinced that sweet little Rachel is a "bad seed" - an inherent killer who feels no remorse because she doesn''t know any better.', 'Rachel is a 9-year-old girl who is perfection itself - unless she''s crossed or challenged. Several disturbing recent incidents have led Rachel''s mother Christine to suspect that her child is a latent murderess. Upon discovering that she herself is the daughter of a convicted killer, Christine becomes convinced that sweet little Rachel is a "bad seed" - an inherent killer who feels no remorse because she doesn''t know any better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAI3EPljPRYxVqzbdIGSXgigLyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123075'),
  ('35009280828800408', 'The Bad Seed', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Peter Menzies Jr., Peter Dashkewytch, Kristy Jelinek', 'John Lee Mahin', 'Rob Lowe, Mckenna Grace, Sarah Dugdale, Marci T. House, Lorne Cardinal, Chris Shields, Cara Buono, Patty McCormack', 'PG-13', 'A widower suspects that his seemingly perfect adolescent daughter is a heartless killer.', 'A widower suspects that his seemingly perfect adolescent daughter is a heartless killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1m10QitDjpbZgFP1syXgVOv2pH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532814'),
  ('252976389599141660', 'The Bad Seed Returns', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Louise Archambault, Shawn Seifert, Patrick Weir', null, 'Mckenna Grace, Michelle Morgan, Benjamin Ayres, Ella Dixon, Marlowe Zimmerman, Gabriela Bee, Lucia Walters, Marlee Walchuk', 'PG-13', 'Several years after the murderous events of the first movie left her father dead, Emma is now living with her aunt Angela and navigating high school. Angela’s husband begins to suspect that Emma may not be as innocent as she appears and suggests sending her off to boarding school. Meanwhile, a new girl at school seems to know Emma’s secrets, leaving Emma no choice but to slip back to her old ways and take care of her enemies by any means necessary.', 'Several years after the murderous events of the first movie left her father dead, Emma is now living with her aunt Angela and navigating high school. Angela’s husband begins to suspect that Emma may not be as innocent as she appears and suggests sending her off to boarding school. Meanwhile, a new girl at school seems to know Emma’s secrets, leaving Emma no choice but to slip back to her old ways and take care of her enemies by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84WdfgbaShhsuwW08V2IpqDo7nB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897338'),
  ('176163419866709978', 'The Bad Shepherd', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Kevin Perry, Geo Santini', 'Ryan David Jahn', 'Christos Kalabogias, Scotty Tovar, Geo Santini, Brett Zimmerman, Justin Taite, Andrew Pagana, Annie Gonzalez, Courtney Blythe Turk', 'R', 'In remote wilderness, a group of friends who stumble upon a duffle bag full of cash after accidentally killing an unknown woman with their car. In attempt to keep the money to themselves, they decided to hide the body. However, this leads them to a much more bigger problem when the mysterious owner of the bag comes looking for them.', 'In remote wilderness, a group of friends who stumble upon a duffle bag full of cash after accidentally killing an unknown woman with their car. In attempt to keep the money to themselves, they decided to hide the body. However, this leads them to a much more bigger problem when the mysterious owner of the bag comes looking for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lb8D9uTxV1hoY6AFkkrxhwzGHsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1238358'),
  ('389718142488716348', 'The Bad Sister', 1931, 'Drama', 'Hobart Henley, Karl Freund', 'Edwin H. Knopf', 'Conrad Nagel, Sidney Fox, Bette Davis, Humphrey Bogart, Charles Winninger, Emma Dunn, Zasu Pitts, Slim Summerville', 'NR', 'Marianne falls in love with con man Valentine who uses their relation to get her father''s endorsement on a money-raising scheme. He runs off with the money and Marianne, later dumping her. Her sister Laura loves Dr. Lindley although she knows he loves Marianne. Marianne returns and marries a wealthy young man, and Lindley turns his love toward Laura.', 'Marianne falls in love with con man Valentine who uses their relation to get her father''s endorsement on a money-raising scheme. He runs off with the money and Marianne, later dumping her. Her sister Laura loves Dr. Lindley although she knows he loves Marianne. Marianne returns and marries a wealthy young man, and Lindley turns his love toward Laura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7jx03EnD2eyob8ld07bOD5XOcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156322'),
  ('686149785266189422', 'The Bad Sleep Well', 1960, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Akira Kurosawa, Yuzuru Aizawa, Yoshimitsu Banno', 'Eijiro Hisaita, Ryuzo Kikushima, Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Toshirō Mifune, Masayuki Mori, Kamatari Fujiwara, Takeshi Katō, Kyōko Kagawa, Tatsuya Mihashi, Takashi Shimura, Kō Nishimura', null, 'In this loose adaptation of "Hamlet," illegitimate son Kôichi Nishi climbs to a high position within a Japanese corporation and marries the crippled daughter of company vice president Iwabuchi. At the reception, the wedding cake is a replica of their corporate headquarters, but an aspect of the design reminds the party of the hushed-up death of Nishi''s father. It is then that Nishi unleashes his plan to avenge his father''s death.', 'In this loose adaptation of "Hamlet," illegitimate son Kôichi Nishi climbs to a high position within a Japanese corporation and marries the crippled daughter of company vice president Iwabuchi. At the reception, the wedding cake is a replica of their corporate headquarters, but an aspect of the design reminds the party of the hushed-up death of Nishi''s father. It is then that Nishi unleashes his plan to avenge his father''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0LhZ121uaqa31RUeu1mOnaFb5w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31589'),
  ('175110782190933744', 'The Badge', 2002, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Robby Henson, Irek Hartowicz', 'Robby Henson', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Patricia Arquette, Sela Ward, William Devane, Marcus Lyle Brown, Ray McKinnon, Tom Bower, Audrey Marie Anderson', null, 'A sheriff begins an investigation into the death of a local transsexual after hearing that high ranking politicians may have been involved. Although he is homophobic, his investigation causes him to be rejected by others, forcing him to seek help from the people he once despised.', 'A sheriff begins an investigation into the death of a local transsexual after hearing that high ranking politicians may have been involved. Although he is homophobic, his investigation causes him to be rejected by others, forcing him to seek help from the people he once despised.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GbBnwqYYfSMTwmTWxT9N3dzUfR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2091'),
  ('368611607845798132', 'The Badlanders', 1958, 'Western, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Delmer Daves, Ridgeway Callow, John F. Seitz', 'Richard Collins', 'Alan Ladd, Ernest Borgnine, Katy Jurado, Claire Kelly, Kent Smith, Nehemiah Persoff, Robert Emhardt, Anthony Caruso', 'NR', 'Two men are released from the Arizona Territorial Prison at Yuma in 1898. One, The Dutchman, is out to get both gold and revenge from certain people in a small mining town who had him imprisoned unjustly. The other, McBain, is just trying to go straight, but that is easier said than done once The Dutchman involves him in his gold theft scheme. Based on the 1949 novel The Asphalt Jungle by W. R. Burnett, the story is given an 1898 setting. It is the second film adaptation of the novel following 1950''s noir classic The Asphalt Jungle.', 'Two men are released from the Arizona Territorial Prison at Yuma in 1898. One, The Dutchman, is out to get both gold and revenge from certain people in a small mining town who had him imprisoned unjustly. The other, McBain, is just trying to go straight, but that is easier said than done once The Dutchman involves him in his gold theft scheme. Based on the 1949 novel The Asphalt Jungle by W. R. Burnett, the story is given an 1898 setting. It is the second film adaptation of the novel following 1950''s noir classic The Asphalt Jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHn8MOXIPq0WzI1zURb8nOQiGUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94533'),
  ('401405878603935407', 'The Bag Man', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David Grovic, Steve Mason', 'Paul Conway, David Grovic', 'John Cusack, Rebecca Da Costa, Robert De Niro, Crispin Glover, Dominic Purcell, Sticky Fingaz, Martin Klebba, Theodus Crane', 'R', 'A criminal waits in a seedy motel for his boss after killing several men to steal a bag.', 'A criminal waits in a seedy motel for his boss after killing several men to steal a bag.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWVuYsgZYhtDVroaxu6zCF5FA63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242076'),
  ('641316028228458518', 'The Bag Of Apples', 1974, 'Animation', 'Vitold Bordzilovskiy, Mikhail Druyan', 'Vladimir Suteev', 'Georgiy Vitsin, Anatoliy Papanov, Boris Vladimirov, Boris Runge, Tamara Dmitrieva, Gotlib Roninson, Klara Rumyanova, Lidiya Kataeva', null, 'Hare carries bag of apples for 4 sonnies and lovely daughter. But along the way he gives all apples to forest dwellers leaving his children hungry.', 'Hare carries bag of apples for 4 sonnies and lovely daughter. But along the way he gives all apples to forest dwellers leaving his children hungry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLuP4c3DsrLthbcTFb6PXZDzFX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295855'),
  ('113391400150024086', 'The Bait', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Kostas Lyhnaras', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Alekos Alexandrakis, Dinos Iliopoulos, Vagelis Voulgaridis, Andreas Barkoulis, Dimitris Nikolaidis, Periklis Hristoforidis, Kostas Naos', null, 'Α crook turns a cabaret girl into a fine lady to use her as bait for his victims.', 'Α crook turns a cabaret girl into a fine lady to use her as bait for his victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1m4oU7LV1RuS1KMflSW3jg3an6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301489'),
  ('190290248529952805', 'The Bait', 2010, 'Comedy, Action', 'Yves Simoneau, Guy Dufaux', 'Yves Simoneau, William Reymond', 'Guy A. Lepage, Rachid Badouri, Serge Dupire, Maxim Roy, Ayisha Issa, Romano Orzari, Manuel Tadros, Michel Perron', null, 'Poirier is a lieutenant with the metropolitan police. More often than not, his dyed-in-the-wool idealism leads to disaster instead of successful arrests. Ventura is a member of the French Secret Service. A polyglot spy with abs of steel. Following a series of unpredictable events, our two policemen find themselves working together, somewhat reluctantly. From culture shocks to linguistic surprises, from wild chases to practical lessons, the two men will look beyond their differences to discover the true meaning of friendship.', 'Poirier is a lieutenant with the metropolitan police. More often than not, his dyed-in-the-wool idealism leads to disaster instead of successful arrests. Ventura is a member of the French Secret Service. A polyglot spy with abs of steel. Following a series of unpredictable events, our two policemen find themselves working together, somewhat reluctantly. From culture shocks to linguistic surprises, from wild chases to practical lessons, the two men will look beyond their differences to discover the true meaning of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyWGD9GxMKMvHZL0qg4MuJkUHoz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60699'),
  ('382338964634829783', 'The Baker', 2007, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Gareth Lewis, Sean Bobbitt', 'Gareth Lewis', 'Damian Lewis, Kate Ashfield, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Michael Gambon, Dyfan Dwyfor, Anthony O''Donnell, Annette Badland, Steve Speirs', 'PG-13', 'Milo is a professional hit man living on the edge. When failing to fulfill a contract for the first time, he escapes the city to avoid the wrath of his employers. Hiding out in a remote rural village, the locals mistake him for the new baker.', 'Milo is a professional hit man living on the edge. When failing to fulfill a contract for the first time, he escapes the city to avoid the wrath of his employers. Hiding out in a remote rural village, the locals mistake him for the new baker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSCfWh9joaock0Tl3sbDxDmdfJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14606'),
  ('510828752034975743', 'The Baker', 2023, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Jonathan Sobol, Adam Swica', 'Thomas Michael, Paolo Mancini', 'Ron Perlman, Elias Koteas, Harvey Keitel, Joel David Moore, Emma Ho, Samantha Kaine, Dax Ravina, Ben Milord', 'R', 'A quiet, stoic man, lives a monk-like existence in self-imposed exile. When his estranged son is killed in a drug deal gone bad, he is left to look after a granddaughter he never knew existed, and he is forced back into a life he tried to put behind him.', 'A quiet, stoic man, lives a monk-like existence in self-imposed exile. When his estranged son is killed in a drug deal gone bad, he is left to look after a granddaughter he never knew existed, and he is forced back into a life he tried to put behind him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijzMEf8ZhGiz0f1mb2zeuTVjXj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823395'),
  ('987665702342042819', 'The Baker''s Son', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'William McKnight, Mark Jean, Matthew Blecha', 'Gary Dontzig, Steven Peterman', 'Eloise Mumford, Brant Daugherty, Maude Green, Haig Sutherland, Elysia Rotaru, Brenda Crichlow, Serge Houde, Oliver Rice', 'G', 'Matt’s passion transforms his bread from bland to brilliant. But when his bread loses its magic, the island locals panic and turn to Annie - Matt’s childhood friend and true love - for help.', 'Matt’s passion transforms his bread from bland to brilliant. But when his bread loses its magic, the island locals panic and turn to Annie - Matt’s childhood friend and true love - for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrtQw23W4lzVh2ltcFbJYD3J8CF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809338'),
  ('424543667628678244', 'The Baker''s Wife', 1938, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marcel Pagnol, Georges Benoît', 'Marcel Pagnol', 'Raimu, Ginette Leclerc, Charles Moulin, Fernand Charpin, Robert Vattier, Alida Rouffe, Charles Blavette, Robert Bassac', null, 'In this little Provencal village, a new baker, Aimable, settles down. His wife Aurelie is beautiful and much younger than he. She departs with a shepherd the night after Aimable produces his first breads. Aimable is so afflicted that he can not work anymore. Therefore, the villagers, who initially laughed at his cuckoldry, take the matter very seriously (they want the bread) and organize a plan to find Aurelie and to bring her back to the bakery.', 'In this little Provencal village, a new baker, Aimable, settles down. His wife Aurelie is beautiful and much younger than he. She departs with a shepherd the night after Aimable produces his first breads. Aimable is so afflicted that he can not work anymore. Therefore, the villagers, who initially laughed at his cuckoldry, take the matter very seriously (they want the bread) and organize a plan to find Aurelie and to bring her back to the bakery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVWZMaCEYNW6EcBD2PX7frhdIzp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43844'),
  ('435933233815227011', 'The Bakery Girl of Monceau', 1963, 'Romance, Drama', 'Éric Rohmer, Jean-Michel Meurice, Bruno Barbey', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Barbet Schroeder, Claudine Soubrier, Michèle Girardon, Michel Mardore, Fred Junck, Bertrand Tavernier', null, 'Early new wave effort from Rohmer, which was the first of his six moral tales. It concerns a young man who approaches a girl in the street, but after several days without seeing her again, he becomes involved with the girl in the local bakery. Eventually, he has to choose between them when he arranges dates with them on the same day.', 'Early new wave effort from Rohmer, which was the first of his six moral tales. It concerns a young man who approaches a girl in the street, but after several days without seeing her again, he becomes involved with the girl in the local bakery. Eventually, he has to choose between them when he arranges dates with them on the same day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSNRv4hvTwNnOYKbWZNPjiilW7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81399'),
  ('113099420681636', 'The Balconettes', 2024, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Noémie Merlant, Pierre-François Créancier, Léa Cammarata', 'Céline Sciamma, Noémie Merlant, Pauline Munier', 'Souheila Yacoub, Sanda Codreanu, Noémie Merlant, Lucas Bravo, Nadège Beausson-Diagne, François Cottrelle, Christophe Montenez, Augustin Palvanh', null, 'As a heat wave brings a Marseille neighborhood to a boil, three roommates gleefully meddle in the lives of their neighbors from their balcony. Until a late night drink turns into a bloody affair.', 'As a heat wave brings a Marseille neighborhood to a boil, three roommates gleefully meddle in the lives of their neighbors from their balcony. Until a late night drink turns into a bloody affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEgAdJtf8S8JgUG2NJoWiRvpTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1112466'),
  ('436665043498428021', 'The Balcony', 1963, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Joseph Strick, George J. Folsey', 'Ben Maddow', 'Shelley Winters, Peter Falk, Lee Grant, Peter Brocco, Joyce Jameson, Jeff Corey, Arnette Jens, Ruby Dee', null, 'The Madam of a brothel satisfies the erotic fantasies of her customers, while a revolution is sweeping the nation.', 'The Madam of a brothel satisfies the erotic fantasies of her customers, while a revolution is sweeping the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zcfRaj2nwNPKAJs4tiFh3DXWXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134288'),
  ('549594586152386028', 'The Balcony Movie', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Paweł Łoziński, Paweł Łoziński', 'Paweł Łoziński', 'Paweł Łoziński', null, 'Composed from the conversations that the director holds with people passing by in the street under his Warsaw apartment, each story in ''The Balcony Movie'' is unique and deals with the way we try to cope with life as individuals. All together, they create a self-portrait of contemporary human life, and the passers-by present a composite picture of today''s world.', 'Composed from the conversations that the director holds with people passing by in the street under his Warsaw apartment, each story in ''The Balcony Movie'' is unique and deals with the way we try to cope with life as individuals. All together, they create a self-portrait of contemporary human life, and the passers-by present a composite picture of today''s world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yB6iLGeXCkt8lQc1IPIOY6uuEHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846892'),
  ('189951553294001580', 'The Bald Boy', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Süreyya Duru', 'Turgut Özakman, Suavi Sualp', 'Rüştü Asyalı, Birtane Güngör, Zeki Alpan, Tarzan Baba, Aydın Babaoğlu, Celal Yonat, Faik Coşkun, Ali Demir', null, 'Keloglan (Bald Boy) is a poor villager, one day he learns the Sultan''s Daughter is sick and can''t wake up since a long time and the Sultan gave a word he will marry his daughter with whoever wakes her up but people who fails will be executed, so Keloglan decides to try his luck because he has a feeling about he will be succeed.', 'Keloglan (Bald Boy) is a poor villager, one day he learns the Sultan''s Daughter is sick and can''t wake up since a long time and the Sultan gave a word he will marry his daughter with whoever wakes her up but people who fails will be executed, so Keloglan decides to try his luck because he has a feeling about he will be succeed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z13F0Zue1GFk71z7gkF1cl39zfv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447092'),
  ('959858272846559114', 'The Bald Boy and Cankiz', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Metin Erksan', 'Turgut Özakman', 'Rüştü Asyalı, Alev Oraloğlu, Aydın Babaoğlu, Deniz Erkanat, Suna Pekuysal, Reha Yurdakul, İsmail Yavuz Selekman, Ergun Köknar', null, 'Keloglan (Bald Boy) is a dreamer but his only ability is talking, one day The Sultan announces a tournament and best warrior of the land will win his daughter, Keloglan wants to join the tournament to make his dreams come true but didn''t know how to fight so he begins a travel to learn fighting from famous warrior Master Ali Cengiz.', 'Keloglan (Bald Boy) is a dreamer but his only ability is talking, one day The Sultan announces a tournament and best warrior of the land will win his daughter, Keloglan wants to join the tournament to make his dreams come true but didn''t know how to fight so he begins a travel to learn fighting from famous warrior Master Ali Cengiz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jM80q8CDvhNKGd8sksjlIdnRuW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447093'),
  ('477806213470641866', 'The Ball at the Anjo House', 1947, 'Drama', 'Kōzaburō Yoshimura, Toshio Ubukata', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Setsuko Hara, Yumeko Aizome, Osamu Takizawa, Masayuki Mori, Masao Shimizu, Takashi Kanda, Akemi Sora, Chieko Murata', null, 'After Japan''s defeat in the war, the Anjo family lose their peerage and wealth. Since their mansion is due to pass into the hands of a creditor, the family holds one last ball before leaving.', 'After Japan''s defeat in the war, the Anjo family lose their peerage and wealth. Since their mansion is due to pass into the hands of a creditor, the family holds one last ball before leaving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEu2uOCAzqGjsgTBCncL8xsuSmR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125232'),
  ('696103547093553501', 'The Ball of Letters', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Andrés López', 'Andrés López', 'Andrés López', null, 'The Ball of Letters (from the Spanish: La Pelota de Letras) is a stand-up comedy DVD released by Colombian comedian Andrés López Forero. In 2005 he won the HOLA Award from the Hispanic Organization of Latin Actors for the "Outstanding Solo Performance" after sold out shows in New York and Miami.', 'The Ball of Letters (from the Spanish: La Pelota de Letras) is a stand-up comedy DVD released by Colombian comedian Andrés López Forero. In 2005 he won the HOLA Award from the Hispanic Organization of Latin Actors for the "Outstanding Solo Performance" after sold out shows in New York and Miami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/re3GNKZnGcKKCLqI2A8rucEKJpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75117'),
  ('744027438211035402', 'The Ballad of Buster Scruggs', 2018, 'Western, Comedy, Drama', 'Zack Gonchor, Chris Farmer, Betsy Magruder', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen', 'Tim Blake Nelson, Willie Watson, Clancy Brown, Danny McCarthy, David Krumholtz, Thomas Wingate, Tim DeZarn, E.E. Bell', 'R', 'Vignettes weaving together the stories of six individuals in the old West at the end of the Civil War. Following the tales of a sharp-shooting songster, a wannabe bank robber, two weary traveling performers, a lone gold prospector, a woman traveling the West to an uncertain future, and a motley crew of strangers undertaking a carriage ride.', 'Vignettes weaving together the stories of six individuals in the old West at the end of the Civil War. Following the tales of a sharp-shooting songster, a wannabe bank robber, two weary traveling performers, a lone gold prospector, a woman traveling the West to an uncertain future, and a motley crew of strangers undertaking a carriage ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voxl654m7p36y8FLu8oQD7dfwwK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537996'),
  ('358554069634080799', 'The Ballad of Cable Hogue', 1970, 'Comedy, Western, Action', 'Sam Peckinpah, Lucien Ballard, John Gaudioso', 'Gordon T. Dawson, Edmund Penney, John Crawford', 'Jason Robards, Stella Stevens, Slim Pickens, David Warner, L.Q. Jones, Strother Martin, R.G. Armstrong, Peter Whitney', 'R', 'Double-crossed and left without water in the desert, Cable Hogue is saved when he finds a spring. It is in just the right spot for a much needed rest stop on the local stagecoach line, and Hogue uses this to his advantage. He builds a house and makes money off the stagecoach passengers. Hildy, a prostitute from the nearest town, moves in with him. Hogue has everything going his way until the advent of the automobile ends the era of the stagecoach.', 'Double-crossed and left without water in the desert, Cable Hogue is saved when he finds a spring. It is in just the right spot for a much needed rest stop on the local stagecoach line, and Hogue uses this to his advantage. He builds a house and makes money off the stagecoach passengers. Hildy, a prostitute from the nearest town, moves in with him. Hogue has everything going his way until the advent of the automobile ends the era of the stagecoach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEth8XAYaytjzxnHkLkj4nZx2XD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23330'),
  ('956997266545097605', 'The Ballad of Davy Crockett', 2024, 'Action', 'Derek Estlin Purvis', 'Derek Estlin Purvis', 'William Moseley, Colm Meaney, Jesse Hutch, Valerie Jane Parker, Nico Tirozzi, Edward Finlay, Rocky Abou-Sakher, Gray Wolf Herrera', null, 'In 1815, an American Legend, whose wife has fallen deathly ill, leaving his young children to survive on their own, must fight his way back to them across the many perils found in the Savage Lands of the wild frontier.', 'In 1815, an American Legend, whose wife has fallen deathly ill, leaving his young children to survive on their own, must fight his way back to them across the many perils found in the Savage Lands of the wild frontier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3eg88OcnLcCihQdaW3IAOlui4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075789'),
  ('359280350498827671', 'The Ballad of Gregorio Cortez', 1983, 'Western, History', 'Robert M. Young, Reynaldo Villalobos', 'Robert M. Young, Victor Villaseñor', 'Edward James Olmos, James Gammon, Tom Bower, Bruce McGill, Brion James, Alan Vint, Timothy Scott, Pepe Serna', 'PG', 'Forced to run from Texas Rangers after a heated misunderstanding leads to the death of a lawman, Mexican American farmer Gregorio Cortez sets off in desperate flight, evading a massive manhunt on horseback for days.', 'Forced to run from Texas Rangers after a heated misunderstanding leads to the death of a lawman, Mexican American farmer Gregorio Cortez sets off in desperate flight, evading a massive manhunt on horseback for days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nU5xLRQBn1nLqhW9UumdRQTGjbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218500'),
  ('831762510898087313', 'The Ballad of Jack and Rose', 2005, 'Drama', 'Rebecca Miller, Erik Burge, John M. Tyson', 'Rebecca Miller', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Camilla Belle, Catherine Keener, Ryan McDonald, Paul Dano, Jason Lee, Jena Malone, Beau Bridges', 'R', 'Jack Slavin is an environmentalist with a heart condition who lives with his daughter, Rose, on an isolated island. While Jack fights against developers who wish to build in the area, he also craves more contact with other people. When he invites his girlfriend, Kathleen, and her sons, Rodney and Thaddius, to move in, Rose is upset. The complicated family dynamics makes things difficult for everyone in the house.', 'Jack Slavin is an environmentalist with a heart condition who lives with his daughter, Rose, on an isolated island. While Jack fights against developers who wish to build in the area, he also craves more contact with other people. When he invites his girlfriend, Kathleen, and her sons, Rodney and Thaddius, to move in, Rose is upset. The complicated family dynamics makes things difficult for everyone in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhID43WmWf3HeH3M3tBCPTSeBOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17113'),
  ('972599305438530618', 'The Ballad of Josie', 1968, 'Comedy, Western', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Terry Morse Jr., Milton Krasner', 'Harold Swanton', 'Doris Day, Peter Graves, George Kennedy, Andy Devine, William Talman, David Hartman, Guy Raymond, Audrey Christie', 'G', 'A frontier widow aims to raise sheep despite a cattle rancher in old Wyoming.', 'A frontier widow aims to raise sheep despite a cattle rancher in old Wyoming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlthYoRvDYx5TpW1j5vWpXOpCmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81046'),
  ('507615460893751488', 'The Ballad of Lefty Brown', 2017, 'Western', 'Jared Moshé, David McFarland, Eric LaFranchi', 'Jared Moshé', 'Bill Pullman, Peter Fonda, Kathy Baker, Jim Caviezel, Tommy Flanagan, Diego Josef, Joseph Lee Anderson, Michael Spears', 'R', 'Aging sidekick Lefty Brown has ridden with Eddie Johnson his entire life. But when a rustler kills Eddie, Lefty is forced from his partner’s shadow and must confront the ugly realities of frontier justice.', 'Aging sidekick Lefty Brown has ridden with Eddie Johnson his entire life. But when a rustler kills Eddie, Lefty is forced from his partner’s shadow and must confront the ugly realities of frontier justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4L5DM3ZeEuAawFxd2ftgISQMZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438457'),
  ('97028837285006388', 'The Ballad of Little Jo', 1993, 'Romance, Drama, Western', 'Declan Quinn, Maggie Greenwald', 'Maggie Greenwald', 'Suzy Amis, Bo Hopkins, Ian McKellen, David Chung, Heather Graham, René Auberjonois, Carrie Snodgress, Anthony Heald', 'R', 'After being thrown out of her home, a young woman decides to disguise herself as a man to survive the ruthless Wild West.', 'After being thrown out of her home, a young woman decides to disguise herself as a man to survive the ruthless Wild West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFGLQ3NigGdDmJy2Wjhcp9nmHe4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71940'),
  ('324588294011514596', 'The Ballad of Narayama', 1958, 'Drama', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Hiroshi Kusuda, Yoshikazu Ōtsuki', 'Keisuke Kinoshita', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Teiji Takahashi, Yūko Mochizuki, Seiji Miyaguchi, Yūnosuke Itō, Ken Mitsuda, Danko Ichikawa, Keiko Ogasawara', null, 'In Kabuki style, the film tells the story of a remote mountain village where the scarcity of food leads to a voluntary but socially-enforced policy in which relatives carry 70-year-old family members up Narayama mountain to die. Granny Orin is approaching 70, content to embrace her fate. Her widowed son Tatsuhei cannot bear losing his mother, even as she arranges his marriage to a widow his age. Her grandson Kesa, who''s girlfriend is pregnant, is selfishly happy to see Orin die. Around them, a family of thieves are dealt with severely, and an old man, past 70, whose son has cast him out, scrounges for food. Will Orin''s loving and accepting spirit teach and ennoble her family?', 'In Kabuki style, the film tells the story of a remote mountain village where the scarcity of food leads to a voluntary but socially-enforced policy in which relatives carry 70-year-old family members up Narayama mountain to die. Granny Orin is approaching 70, content to embrace her fate. Her widowed son Tatsuhei cannot bear losing his mother, even as she arranges his marriage to a widow his age. Her grandson Kesa, who''s girlfriend is pregnant, is selfishly happy to see Orin die. Around them, a family of thieves are dealt with severely, and an old man, past 70, whose son has cast him out, scrounges for food. Will Orin''s loving and accepting spirit teach and ennoble her family?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwvNyyXFsVAPg9PYQsogcXj99lV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116690'),
  ('215218572615763552', 'The Ballad of Narayama', 1983, 'Drama', 'Shōhei Imamura, Shunsaku Ikehata, Nobuaki Murooka', 'Shōhei Imamura', 'Ken Ogata, Sumiko Sakamoto, Tonpei Hidari, Aki Takejo, Shoichi Ozawa, Fujio Tokita, Sanshō Shinsui, Seiji Kurasaki', null, 'In a small village in a valley everyone who reaches the age of 70 must leave the village and go to a certain mountain top to die. If anyone should refuse they would disgrace their family. Old Orin is 69. This winter it is her turn to go to the mountain. But first she must make sure that her eldest son Tatsuhei finds a wife.', 'In a small village in a valley everyone who reaches the age of 70 must leave the village and go to a certain mountain top to die. If anyone should refuse they would disgrace their family. Old Orin is 69. This winter it is her turn to go to the mountain. But first she must make sure that her eldest son Tatsuhei finds a wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3iNimtw6HsFTtAvEDF3XYZ4Y5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42113'),
  ('158606753890922865', 'The Ballad of Nessie', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Stevie Wermers-Skelton, Kevin Deters', 'Regina Conroy, Kevin Deters, Stevie Wermers-Skelton', 'Billy Connolly, Kevin Deters', 'G', 'A legendary and friendly creature named Nessie lives happily in a small pond with her friend MacQuack, a rubber duck. When a rich developer takes the pond and land surrounding it to build a miniature golf course, Nessie is forced to search for a new home.', 'A legendary and friendly creature named Nessie lives happily in a small pond with her friend MacQuack, a rubber duck. When a rich developer takes the pond and land surrounding it to build a miniature golf course, Nessie is forced to search for a new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/za3XO3Na1vSBUWBImQB2VaE4c2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76346'),
  ('29204674957709779', 'The Ballad of Tam Lin', 1970, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Roddy McDowall, Kip Gowans, David Wimbury', 'William Spier', 'Ava Gardner, Ian McShane, Richard Wattis, Cyril Cusack, Stephanie Beacham, David Whitman, Fabia Drake, Sinéad Cusack', null, 'Based upon the Celtic legend Tam Lin, a young man is bewitched by a beautiful, heartless, aging sorceress to become her lover. When his attention wanders to a lovely girl, he is doomed to ritual sacrifice by the sorceress.', 'Based upon the Celtic legend Tam Lin, a young man is bewitched by a beautiful, heartless, aging sorceress to become her lover. When his attention wanders to a lovely girl, he is doomed to ritual sacrifice by the sorceress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uT2REaT2WIrrlmQp0qt9F2qInNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126927'),
  ('279890315137356771', 'The Ballad of the Sad Cafe', 1991, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy, Mystery', 'Simon Callow, Walter Lassally, Gary Marcus', 'Michael Hirst', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Keith Carradine, Cork Hubbert, Rod Steiger, Austin Pendleton, Beth Dixon, Lanny Flaherty, Mert Hatfield', 'PG-13', 'A small-town eccentric opens a café in her decaying home.', 'A small-town eccentric opens a café in her decaying home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5DFcZR8BChuSmiXvvMWoAOV8NK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135473'),
  ('764313463836706895', 'The Ballad of Wallis Island', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'James Griffiths, G. Magni Ágústsson, Ina Lüders', 'Tom Basden, Tim Key', 'Tom Basden, Tim Key, Carey Mulligan, Sian Clifford, Akemnji Ndifornyen, Steve Marsh, Luka Downie, Kerrie Thomason', 'PG-13', 'An eccentric lottery winner who lives alone on a remote island tries to make his fantasies come true by getting his favourite musicians to perform at his home.', 'An eccentric lottery winner who lives alone on a remote island tries to make his fantasies come true by getting his favourite musicians to perform at his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haS6bnqDqZoi5sYcCPJWaj2yMbB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1122099'),
  ('164860397239198436', 'The Ballet Master''s Dream', 1903, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Zizi Papillon', null, 'It''s late in the evening, and the ballet master''s bed has been prepared for him. But he cannot take his mind off of his work, and instead of going to sleep he paces the floor and tries out dance steps. Finally, he goes to bed and falls asleep, but ballet dominates even his dreams. He sees two dancers who seem to come right into his room as they perform, and that''s just the beginning.', 'It''s late in the evening, and the ballet master''s bed has been prepared for him. But he cannot take his mind off of his work, and instead of going to sleep he paces the floor and tries out dance steps. Finally, he goes to bed and falls asleep, but ballet dominates even his dreams. He sees two dancers who seem to come right into his room as they perform, and that''s just the beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eD20OEcfD8P5xUMDxZgFnfNTpxB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195944'),
  ('449464035357435264', 'The Balloon', 1956, 'Drama', 'Yūzō Kawashima, Kuratarō Takamura, Shōhei Imamura', 'Shōhei Imamura, Yūzō Kawashima', 'Masayuki Mori, Tatsuya Mihashi, Mie Kitahara, Sachiko Hidari, Izumi Ashikawa, Michiyo Aratama, Hiroshi Nihon''yanagi, Shinsuke Maki', null, 'Haruki Murakami is a successful family man and the head of a camera company. Unbeknownst to Murakami, his arrogant son oscillates between a mistress and a new lover who sings at a nightclub. When Murakami’s daughter befriends the mistress, the affair throws the family into turmoil.', 'Haruki Murakami is a successful family man and the head of a camera company. Unbeknownst to Murakami, his arrogant son oscillates between a mistress and a new lover who sings at a nightclub. When Murakami’s daughter befriends the mistress, the affair throws the family into turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTsbkFCr0ukvriuF7MRj1g4BIwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376093'),
  ('1127768769803142897', 'The Balloonatic', 1923, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Babe London, Phyllis Haver, John Brown, Joseph A. Mitchell, Edward F. Cline, Natalie Talmadge', null, 'Buster and Phyllis endure a number of outdoor adventures trying to prove to each other their survival skills. The balloon, which lands Buster in the wilderness, later proves useful as their canoe is about go over a waterfall.', 'Buster and Phyllis endure a number of outdoor adventures trying to prove to each other their survival skills. The balloon, which lands Buster in the wilderness, later proves useful as their canoe is about go over a waterfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzSISL0q2yuFm9fMGIH71WLX0M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45807'),
  ('1101938847549548530', 'The Balloonist', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tim Oliehoek', 'Benny Lindelauf', 'Sallie Harmsen, Pieter Embrechts, Beau Minnaert, Frieda Pittoors, Nazanin Taheri, Thomas Höppener, René Groothof, Leòn Ali Çifteci', null, 'Gaby, a heritage chicken keeper, is turned upside down when an arrogant air balloon pilot crashes on her chicken coop. The crash reveals the roots of a family conflict and forces Gaby to confront the air balloon pilot as well as her past.', 'Gaby, a heritage chicken keeper, is turned upside down when an arrogant air balloon pilot crashes on her chicken coop. The crash reveals the roots of a family conflict and forces Gaby to confront the air balloon pilot as well as her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWX6kEdSWYfyTqqiJW2uzn47Lsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100800'),
  ('984112204822861244', 'The Ballroom', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Laís Bodanzky, Walter Carvalho', 'Adriana Falcão', 'Leonardo Villar, Tônia Carrero, Cássia Kis, Betty Faria, Stepan Nercessian, Maria Flor, Paulo Vilhena, Marku Ribas', null, 'An evening in an old time dance hall in Sao Paulo introduces us to local characters who reminisce about the past, wonder about the future, have fun, flirt, fight and, of course, dance. Its earthy humour and eternal themes of ageing, loneliness and desire is an antidote to grumpy old men and women everywhere.', 'An evening in an old time dance hall in Sao Paulo introduces us to local characters who reminisce about the past, wonder about the future, have fun, flirt, fight and, of course, dance. Its earthy humour and eternal themes of ageing, loneliness and desire is an antidote to grumpy old men and women everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2y86JHciwhYICh1pxskLNKrnfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74294'),
  ('671543054695700043', 'The Baltimore Bullet', 1980, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Robert Ellis Miller, James Crabe', 'John Brascia, Robert Vincent O''Neil', 'James Coburn, Omar Sharif, Ronee Blakley, Bruce Boxleitner, Jack O''Halloran, Michael Lerner, Calvin Lockhart, Cisse Cameron', 'PG', 'A tale of two hustlers trying to set up a big game.', 'A tale of two hustlers trying to set up a big game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hj3CKA1N4ISONepiXRk8A8fprA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189888'),
  ('153719875321840673', 'The Baltimorons', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jay Duplass, Jon Bregel, Drew Langer', 'Jay Duplass, Michael Strassner', 'Michael Strassner, Liz Larsen, Olivia Luccardi, Chris Strassner, Lewis Peterson, Rob Phoenix, Jessie Cohen, Zoe Strassner', 'R', 'A newly sober man''s Christmas Eve dental emergency leads to an unexpected romance with his older dentist as they explore Baltimore together.', 'A newly sober man''s Christmas Eve dental emergency leads to an unexpected romance with his older dentist as they explore Baltimore together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZWcrfj3mFf9LGItIFwa7DSkedz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1421990'),
  ('624463970702433420', 'The Bamboo House of Dolls', 1973, 'Action, Drama, Horror, War', 'Kuei Chih-Hung, Yau Kei', null, 'Lo Lieh, Birte Tove, Wang Hsieh, Lee Hae-suk, Terry Lau Wai-Yue, Got Ping, Jin Bong-jin, Li Min-Lang', 'R', 'A nurse in a Japanese women''s POW camp during World War II masterminds an escapee.', 'A nurse in a Japanese women''s POW camp during World War II masterminds an escapee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5q0Jc0ih29Wwg3I9wF0tY4OCuhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40029'),
  ('778875043364655219', 'The Bamboo Incident', 1970, 'War, Drama', 'Raoul Coutard, Georges Liron', null, 'Phi Lan, Huynh Cazenas, Danièle Delorme, Le Quynh, Bui Thi Thanh, Tran Van Lich, Anh Tuan, Kieu Anh', null, 'A young Vietnamese boy''s life is thrown into turmoil by the war raging in his country. The ten year old remains with his mother and baby sister as his father goes off to fight for the Viet Cong. During his father''s absence, his mother dies from overwork and the inability to find proper medical care for her illness. He cares for his baby sister and struggles to earn a living by shining shoes and doing other odd jobs before his father returns. Both an American soldier and a Viet Cong regular are shown defending their country''s political agenda. Also shown are guerilla tactics and bombings in this feature directed by veteran combat photographer Raoul Coutard.', 'A young Vietnamese boy''s life is thrown into turmoil by the war raging in his country. The ten year old remains with his mother and baby sister as his father goes off to fight for the Viet Cong. During his father''s absence, his mother dies from overwork and the inability to find proper medical care for her illness. He cares for his baby sister and struggles to earn a living by shining shoes and doing other odd jobs before his father returns. Both an American soldier and a Viet Cong regular are shown defending their country''s political agenda. Also shown are guerilla tactics and bombings in this feature directed by veteran combat photographer Raoul Coutard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRES6TJ8jdArmMxOm8auhDMoQrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202776'),
  ('237542513609722948', 'The Bamboo Saucer', 1968, 'Science Fiction', 'Frank Telford, Hal Mohr, Henry Gilbert', 'Frank Telford', 'Dan Duryea, John Ericson, Lois Nettleton, Bob Hastings, Vincent Beck, Bernard Fox, Robert Dane, Rico Cattani', 'G', 'A flying saucer hidden in a Red Chinese peasant village is sought by teams from the United States and U.S.S.R. On finding it, they band together to explore the saucer and take a trip into space.', 'A flying saucer hidden in a Red Chinese peasant village is sought by teams from the United States and U.S.S.R. On finding it, they band together to explore the saucer and take a trip into space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbbDksz3eqV0TdXM12d4z2WP2mG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25808'),
  ('174952200011070897', 'The Banana Splits Movie', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Danishka Esterhazy, Trevor Calverley, Jaci Cheiman', 'Jed Elinoff, Scott Thomas', 'Finlay Wojtak-Hissong, Maria Nash, Dani Kind, Eric Bauza, Terry Sauls, Brandon Vraagom, Steve Lund, Buntu Plam', 'R', 'A boy named Harley and his family attend a taping of The Banana Splits TV show, which is supposed to be a fun-filled birthday for young Harley and business as usual for Rebecca, the producer of the series. But things take an unexpected turn - and the body count quickly rises. Can Harley, his mom and their new pals safely escape?', 'A boy named Harley and his family attend a taping of The Banana Splits TV show, which is supposed to be a fun-filled birthday for young Harley and business as usual for Rebecca, the producer of the series. But things take an unexpected turn - and the body count quickly rises. Can Harley, his mom and their new pals safely escape?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vG9FY2wHVwOOQfqNlUt2LbRzRNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608654'),
  ('575110349932818693', 'The Band Concert', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Mickey is trying to lead a concert of The William Tell Overture, but he''s continually disrupted by ice cream vendor Donald, who uses a seemingly endless supply of flutes to play Turkey in the Straw instead. After Donald gives up, a bee comes along and causes his own havoc. The band then reaches the Storm sequence, and the weather also starts to pick up; a tornado comes along, but they keep playing.', 'Mickey is trying to lead a concert of The William Tell Overture, but he''s continually disrupted by ice cream vendor Donald, who uses a seemingly endless supply of flutes to play Turkey in the Straw instead. After Donald gives up, a bee comes along and causes his own havoc. The band then reaches the Storm sequence, and the weather also starts to pick up; a tornado comes along, but they keep playing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veEJ9AjgdcuGT9Yylvw2xdcJlUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67572'),
  ('911954756422629511', 'The Band of Honest Men', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Mauro Morassi, Mario Fioretti', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Totò, Peppino De Filippo, Giulia Rubini, Giacomo Furia, Gabriele Tinti, Yoka Berretty, Luigi Pavese, Annette Ciarli', null, 'Italy, mid ''60s. Three guys from a poor neighbourhood try to get rich by printing fake money using the fact that one of them works as a typographer. The story unravels around their embarrassed efforts to spend the money, their little family issues and ends with a surprise.', 'Italy, mid ''60s. Three guys from a poor neighbourhood try to get rich by printing fake money using the fact that one of them works as a typographer. The story unravels around their embarrassed efforts to spend the money, their little family issues and ends with a surprise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIxcQHq9WDWmcDoJ1qVxhQWlstX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56068'),
  ('692798723019141427', 'The Band Wagon', 1953, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Vincente Minnelli, Harry Jackson, Jerry Thorpe', 'Betty Comden, Adolph Green', 'Fred Astaire, Cyd Charisse, Oscar Levant, Nanette Fabray, Jack Buchanan, James Mitchell, Robert Gist, Ava Gardner', 'NR', 'A Broadway artiste turns a faded film star''s comeback vehicle into an artsy flop.', 'A Broadway artiste turns a faded film star''s comeback vehicle into an artsy flop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxWFMdbgQ5TSZvUMVkHDeDCaGH8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29376'),
  ('1030415585158637901', 'The Band''s Visit', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eran Kolirin, Shai Goldman, Lihi Levin', 'Eran Kolirin', 'Sasson Gabai, Ronit Elkabetz, Saleh Bakri, Khalifa Natour, Shlomi Avraham, Rubi Moskovitz, Jabarin Camal, Uri Gavriel', null, 'A small Egyptian police band travels to Israel to play at the inaugural ceremony of an Arab arts center, only to find themselves stuck in the wrong town.', 'A small Egyptian police band travels to Israel to play at the inaugural ceremony of an Arab arts center, only to find themselves stuck in the wrong town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZPUNtSWnn23Zd88wxL5xzqYYqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5259'),
  ('756783454927561977', 'The Bandit', 1946, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alberto Lattuada, Aldo Buzzi, Aldo Tonti', 'Ettore Maria Margadonna, Oreste Biancoli, Mino Caudana', 'Anna Magnani, Amedeo Nazzari, Carla Del Poggio, Carlo Campanini, Eliana Banducci, Mino Doro, Folco Lulli, Mario Perrone', null, 'Among others, Ernesto returns to Turin after the war from a German POW camp; his household destroyed and family deceased, he tries making an honest living.', 'Among others, Ernesto returns to Turin after the war from a German POW camp; his household destroyed and family deceased, he tries making an honest living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zB59CV56pLSxKjNWYYQNccQoyPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146783'),
  ('1059361489403530542', 'The Bandit', 1953, 'Drama, Adventure, Western', 'Lima Barreto, H.E. Fowle, Galileu Garcia', 'Lima Barreto', 'Milton Ribeiro, Alberto Ruschel, Marisa Prado, Vanja Orico, Zé do Norte, Adoniran Barbosa, Ricardo Campos, Nieta Junqueira', null, 'In the time of the "cangaceiros" in the badlands of the Northeast of Brazil, the cruel Captain Galdino Ferreira and his band abduct the schoolteacher Olívia, expecting to receive a ransom for her. However, one of his men, Teodoro, falls in love and flees with her through the arid backcountry chased by the brigands.', 'In the time of the "cangaceiros" in the badlands of the Northeast of Brazil, the cruel Captain Galdino Ferreira and his band abduct the schoolteacher Olívia, expecting to receive a ransom for her. However, one of his men, Teodoro, falls in love and flees with her through the arid backcountry chased by the brigands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGIVTLSxQnVUnScwdyROH5iynQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67615'),
  ('299467602011834323', 'The Bandit', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Yavuz Turgul, Uğur İçbak', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Şener Şen, Uğur Yücel, Sermin Hürmeriç, Yeşim Salkım, Kamran Usluer, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu, Necdet Mahfi Ayral, Güven Hokna', null, 'Baran the Bandit, released from prison after serving 35 years, searches for vengeance against his former best friend who betrayed him and stole his lover, teaming up with a young punk with his own demons along the way.', 'Baran the Bandit, released from prison after serving 35 years, searches for vengeance against his former best friend who betrayed him and stole his lover, teaming up with a young punk with his own demons along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44KTRoayojxpzti2okBZGKmjEGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26900'),
  ('1054255579437233566', 'The Bandit of Sherwood Forest', 1946, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Henry Levin, George Sherman, William E. Snyder', 'Wilfrid H. Pettitt, Melvin Levy', 'Cornel Wilde, Anita Louise, Jill Esmond, Edgar Buchanan, Henry Daniell, George Macready, Russell Hicks, John Abbott', 'NR', 'Robin Hood''s swashbuckling son comes to the rescue when England''s boy-king is captured by the evil, power-hungry William of Pembroke.', 'Robin Hood''s swashbuckling son comes to the rescue when England''s boy-king is captured by the evil, power-hungry William of Pembroke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0m4PoYd5ZyiLy6vG9csucvko37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110248'),
  ('1115702881619433331', 'The Bandit of Tacca del Lupo', 1952, 'Action, Drama', 'Pietro Germi, Leonida Barboni, Marcello Giannini', 'Fausto Tozzi', 'Amedeo Nazzari, Saro Urzì, Cosetta Greco, Fausto Tozzi, Vincenzo Musolino, Aldo Bufi Landi, Oscar Andriani, Amedeo Trilli', null, 'In 19th century southern Italy (near Melfi, Basilicata), a small force of soldiers fight in the hills against the bandits who are holding their country to ransom.', 'In 19th century southern Italy (near Melfi, Basilicata), a small force of soldiers fight in the hills against the bandits who are holding their country to ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIwA0n0X3RjRjRBu2uXntKhclhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64031'),
  ('260148837170431702', 'The Bang Bang Club', 2011, 'Drama, History', 'Steven Silver, Mirosław Baszak', 'Steven Silver', 'Malin Åkerman, Ryan Phillippe, Taylor Kitsch, Frank Rautenbach, Neels Van Jaarsveld, Russel Savadier, Ashley Friedlander, Patrick Lyster', 'R', 'In the early to mid ''90s, when the South African system of apartheid was in its death throes, four photographers - Greg Marinovich, Kevin Carter, Ken Oosterbroek and João Silva - bonded by their friendship and a sense of purpose, worked together to chronicle the violence and upheaval leading up to the 1994 election of Nelson Mandela as president. Their work is risky and dangerous, potentially fatally so, as they thrust themselves into the middle of chaotic clashes between forces backed by the government (including Inkatha Zulu warriors) and those in support of Mandela''s African National Congress.', 'In the early to mid ''90s, when the South African system of apartheid was in its death throes, four photographers - Greg Marinovich, Kevin Carter, Ken Oosterbroek and João Silva - bonded by their friendship and a sense of purpose, worked together to chronicle the violence and upheaval leading up to the 1994 election of Nelson Mandela as president. Their work is risky and dangerous, potentially fatally so, as they thrust themselves into the middle of chaotic clashes between forces backed by the government (including Inkatha Zulu warriors) and those in support of Mandela''s African National Congress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyBDhcgxyffS7uomHDLIuvNwvd9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60011'),
  ('523177625287474767', 'The Banger Sisters', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Bob Dolman, Phil Dupont', 'Bob Dolman', 'Goldie Hawn, Susan Sarandon, Geoffrey Rush, Erika Christensen, Robin Thomas, Eva Amurri, Matthew Carey, Andre Ware', 'R', 'In the late ''60s, the self-proclaimed belles of the rock ''n'' roll ball, rocked the worlds of every music legend whose pants they could take off -- and they have the pictures to prove it. But it''s been more than two decades since the Banger Sisters earned their nickname -- or even laid eyes on each other. Their reunion is the collision of two women''s worlds; one who''s living in the past, and one who''s hiding from it. Together they learn to live in the moment.', 'In the late ''60s, the self-proclaimed belles of the rock ''n'' roll ball, rocked the worlds of every music legend whose pants they could take off -- and they have the pictures to prove it. But it''s been more than two decades since the Banger Sisters earned their nickname -- or even laid eyes on each other. Their reunion is the collision of two women''s worlds; one who''s living in the past, and one who''s hiding from it. Together they learn to live in the moment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQ7XoEqroHcCQVKP9Xo8JpujuHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9034'),
  ('1103019594469750884', 'The Banished', 2019, 'Horror', 'David Bohórquez', null, 'Fiona Horsey, Jennifer Hyde, Tigre Haller', null, 'A disabled man is haunted by the torture he suffered as a child when his terminally ill half-sister returns to their small Upstate New York town seeking answers to why their mother abandoned her 40 years before, which sets them both on a tragic and horrific journey.', 'A disabled man is haunted by the torture he suffered as a child when his terminally ill half-sister returns to their small Upstate New York town seeking answers to why their mother abandoned her 40 years before, which sets them both on a tragic and horrific journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahxLvy5sg300cvPXuPYeN8NO1SE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593946'),
  ('1151802038295306416', 'The Banishing', 2021, 'Horror', 'Christopher Smith, Sarah Cunningham', 'Dean Lines, David Beton, Ray Bogdanovich', 'Jessica Brown Findlay, John Heffernan, John Lynch, Sean Harris, Jason Thorpe, Anya McKenna-Bruce, Jean St. Clair, Adam Hugill', 'NR', 'In the 1930s, a young reverend and his family are forced to confront their worst fears when they discover their new home holds a horrifying secret.', 'In the 1930s, a young reverend and his family are forced to confront their worst fears when they discover their new home holds a horrifying secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD9mc8JCVXA8T8u4Od7qOUBuGH4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573680'),
  ('676851090071617713', 'The Banishment', 2008, 'Drama', 'Andrey Zvyagintsev, Mikhail Krichman, Eugeny Mayorov', 'Oleg Negin, Artyom Melkumyan', 'Konstantin Lavronenko, Aleksandr Baluev, Maria Bonnevie, Dmitri Ulyanov, Vitaly Kishchenko, Maksim Shibayev, Aleksey Vertkov, Igor Sergeev', null, 'While vacationing in the countryside at his childhood home, a woman suddenly reveals to her husband that she is expecting a child – but not his.', 'While vacationing in the countryside at his childhood home, a woman suddenly reveals to her husband that she is expecting a child – but not his.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hD5Dg3VztZbvk2aqQsHh1e5jUP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25142'),
  ('845546190939270568', 'The Bank', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Connolly, Tristan Milani', 'Mike Betar, Brian Price, Robert Connolly', 'David Wenham, Anthony LaPaglia, Sibylla Budd, Steve Rodgers, Mitchell Butel, Mandy McElhinney, Bruce Myles, Kazuhiro Muroyama', 'NR', 'The Bank, a world ripe with avarice and corruption, where O''Reilly and his ilk can thrive and honest Aussie battlers lose everything. Enter Jim Doyle a maverick mathematician who has devised a formula to predict the fluctuations of the stock market. When he joins O''Reilly''s fold, he must first prove his loyalty to the "greed is good" ethos. Which way will he go? What does he have to hide?', 'The Bank, a world ripe with avarice and corruption, where O''Reilly and his ilk can thrive and honest Aussie battlers lose everything. Enter Jim Doyle a maverick mathematician who has devised a formula to predict the fluctuations of the stock market. When he joins O''Reilly''s fold, he must first prove his loyalty to the "greed is good" ethos. Which way will he go? What does he have to hide?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiCMypGhw4vmTXOoPIF2IboiYEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15486'),
  ('78633312101249613', 'The Bank Dick', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Milton Krasner, Edward F. Cline', 'W.C. Fields', 'W.C. Fields, Cora Witherspoon, Una Merkel, Evelyn Del Rio, Jessie Ralph, Franklin Pangborn, Shemp Howard, Dick Purcell', null, 'Egbert Sousé becomes an unexpected hero when a bank robber falls over a bench he''s occupying. Now considered brave, Egbert is given a job as a bank guard. Soon, he is approached by charlatan J. Frothingham Waterbury about buying shares in a mining company. Egbert persuades teller Og Oggilby to lend him bank money, to be returned when the scheme pays off. Unfortunately, bank inspector Snoopington then makes a surprise appearance.', 'Egbert Sousé becomes an unexpected hero when a bank robber falls over a bench he''s occupying. Now considered brave, Egbert is given a job as a bank guard. Soon, he is approached by charlatan J. Frothingham Waterbury about buying shares in a mining company. Egbert persuades teller Og Oggilby to lend him bank money, to be returned when the scheme pays off. Unfortunately, bank inspector Snoopington then makes a surprise appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XrqHTrJpTaUeyqXqb4fVacYWpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911'),
  ('483105378790597166', 'The Bank Job', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Roger Donaldson, Michael Coulter, Richard Selway', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais', 'Jason Statham, Saffron Burrows, Stephen Campbell Moore, Daniel Mays, James Faulkner, Andrew Brooke, Michael Jibson, Georgia Taylor', 'R', 'Terry is a small-time car dealer trying to leave his shady past behind and start a family. Martine is a beautiful model from Terry''s old neighbourhood who knows that Terry is no angel. When Martine proposes a foolproof plan to rob a bank, Terry recognises the danger but realises this may be the opportunity of a lifetime.', 'Terry is a small-time car dealer trying to leave his shady past behind and start a family. Martine is a beautiful model from Terry''s old neighbourhood who knows that Terry is no angel. When Martine proposes a foolproof plan to rob a bank, Terry recognises the danger but realises this may be the opportunity of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfXjFTytfFTdo9WeO7lYqzkHG7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8848'),
  ('178046488597373008', 'The Bank of Broken Hearts', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Vedat Özdemir, Onur Ünlü', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Haluk Bilginer, Hazal Kaya, Serkan Keskin, Taner Ölmez, Tansu Biçer, Osman Sonant, Fatih Artman, Metin Akdülger', null, 'Based on William Shakespeare''s Romeo and Juliet, set in Istanbul, the tragic story of three heroes chasing an unlikely dream, running towards their sad end in a Shakespearean manner.', 'Based on William Shakespeare''s Romeo and Juliet, set in Istanbul, the tragic story of three heroes chasing an unlikely dream, running towards their sad end in a Shakespearean manner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR44BrxpNxKq2eBd64VvvoXIqRV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452024'),
  ('471333849137782458', 'The Bank Shot', 1974, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gower Champion, Harry Stradling Jr., Tom Shaw', 'Wendell Mayes', 'George C. Scott, Joanna Cassidy, Sorrell Booke, Clifton James, Bob Balaban, Bibi Osterwald, G. Wood, Frank McRae', 'PG', 'A bank temporarily housed in a mobile home while a new building is built, looks like an easy target to break into. On the other hand, why not steal the whole bank, and rob it in a safer location.', 'A bank temporarily housed in a mobile home while a new building is built, looks like an easy target to break into. On the other hand, why not steal the whole bank, and rob it in a safer location.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfWlczsaz3a9oYJa8rXwxwmECVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97313'),
