  ('1018477545762102359', 'The Basilisks', 1963, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lina Wertmüller, Gabriella Tagliaferri, Franca Invernizzi', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Stefano Satta Flores, Antonio Petruzzi, Rosanna Santoro, Sergio Ferranino, Luigi Barbieri, Flora Carabella, Mimma Quirico, Enzo Di Vecchia', null, 'The uneventful lives of three young men who live in a small, poverty-stricken village in southern Italy.', 'The uneventful lives of three young men who live in a small, poverty-stricken village in southern Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEfzpwwH8W9kGpovI6h7Flz0UtN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230415'),
