  ('280201232215399740', 'The Basque Ball: Skin Against Stone', 2003, 'Documentary, History', 'Julio Medem, Javier Aguirre, Ricardo de Gracia', 'Julio Medem', 'Julio Medem, Ione Hernández, Maider Oleaga, Xabier Arzalluz, Bernardo Atxaga, Txiki Benegas, Txetxo Bengoetxea, Odón Elorza', null, 'An attempt to create a bridge between the different political positions that coexist, sometimes violently, in the Basque Country, in northern Spain.', 'An attempt to create a bridge between the different political positions that coexist, sometimes violently, in the Basque Country, in northern Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wN3uIKqtALYYLd7RRqK0KkRPL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2537'),
  ('72877385643890306', 'The Bastard', 1968, 'Crime, Action', 'Duccio Tessari, Carlo Carlini', 'Duccio Tessari, Mario Di Nardo, Ennio De Concini', 'Rita Hayworth, Giuliano Gemma, Klaus Kinski, Margaret Lee, Claudine Auger, Serge Marquand, Umberto Raho, Carl Cik', 'PG-13', 'A criminal (Giuliano Gemma) seeks vengeance when his double-dealing brother (Klaus Kinski) steals his jewels and mutilates his shooting hand.', 'A criminal (Giuliano Gemma) seeks vengeance when his double-dealing brother (Klaus Kinski) steals his jewels and mutilates his shooting hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Hsjs4FSEM3XL2QfMhrObWG8Tuq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98273'),
  ('421593274761059752', 'The Bastards', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Amat Escalante, Matthew Uhry, Alex Ezpeleta', 'Martín Escalante, Amat Escalante', 'Jesus Moises Rodriguez, Rubén Sosa, Nina Zavarin, Kenny Johnston, David Albaca, Teri Booker, Aron Briggs, Trevor Glen Campbell', null, 'A 24 hour period in the lives of Fausto and Jesus, two undocumented Mexican day-laborers in L.A. Each day another task, each day the same pressure to find money. They go about their daily routine, standing on the corner at the Home Improvement Store waiting for work to come. Today, the job they are given is well paid compared to their poor usual wages.', 'A 24 hour period in the lives of Fausto and Jesus, two undocumented Mexican day-laborers in L.A. Each day another task, each day the same pressure to find money. They go about their daily routine, standing on the corner at the Home Improvement Store waiting for work to come. Today, the job they are given is well paid compared to their poor usual wages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IWueGE4lsO3xEvqzd9zsYi5I3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8931'),
  ('563384210530634181', 'The Bastards'' Fig Tree', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ana Murugarren, Josu Inchaustegui', 'Ana Murugarren', 'Karra Elejalde, Carlos Areces, Pepa Aniorte, Mikel Losada, Jordi Sánchez, Ramón Barea, Marcos Balgañón, Juanlu Escudero', null, 'A trigger-happy Nationalist fears retribution from the son of a man he executed. To mollify the boy''s anger, he takes a drastic step: he keeps constant watch over the fig tree the boy has planted at his father''s gravesite. As the years pass, the man''s lonely vigil makes him a tourist attraction, much to the chagrin of his former colleagues.', 'A trigger-happy Nationalist fears retribution from the son of a man he executed. To mollify the boy''s anger, he takes a drastic step: he keeps constant watch over the fig tree the boy has planted at his father''s gravesite. As the years pass, the man''s lonely vigil makes him a tourist attraction, much to the chagrin of his former colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBQw41u55jdeDrqWUCDFmS13tmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437299'),
  ('700814175440846231', 'The Bat', 1926, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Roland West, Arthur Edeson', 'Julien Josephson, George Marion Jr.', 'George Beranger, Charles Herzinger, Emily Fitzroy, Louise Fazenda, Arthur Housman, Robert McKim, Jack Pickford, Jewel Carmen', null, 'A masked criminal who dresses like a giant bat terrorizes the guests at an old house rented by a mystery writer.', 'A masked criminal who dresses like a giant bat terrorizes the guests at an old house rented by a mystery writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2l6KQPfoz9j1JOulfLstfC8YES3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27501'),
  ('216751601091574500', 'The Bat', 1959, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Crane Wilbur, Joseph F. Biroc, Cliff P. Broughton', 'Crane Wilbur', 'Vincent Price, Agnes Moorehead, Gavin Gordon, John Sutton, Lenita Lane, Elaine Edwards, Darla Hood, John Bryant', null, 'Mystery writer Cornelia Van Gorder has rented a country house called "The Oaks", which not long ago was the scene of some murders committed by a strange and violent criminal known as "The Bat". Meanwhile, the house''s owner, bank president John Fleming, has recently embezzled one million dollars in securities and has hidden the proceeds in the house, but is killed before he can retrieve it.', 'Mystery writer Cornelia Van Gorder has rented a country house called "The Oaks", which not long ago was the scene of some murders committed by a strange and violent criminal known as "The Bat". Meanwhile, the house''s owner, bank president John Fleming, has recently embezzled one million dollars in securities and has hidden the proceeds in the house, but is killed before he can retrieve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78PVHYnadZ0e2BkBBSNonMZvViB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35813'),
  ('161653422828825750', 'The Bat', 1979, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Yan Frid', 'Mikhail Volpin, Nikolay Erdman, Yan Frid', 'Yuriy Solomin, Lyudmila Maksakova, Larisa Udovichenko, Vitali Solomin, Oleg Vidov, Igor Dmitriev, Yuri Vasilyev, Yevgeni Vesnik', null, 'Eisenstein gets in trouble for shooting a grouse. He is told that he must go to prison for his crime. However, his friend has invited him to an aristocratic ball. Eisenstein, despite being married, wants to go to the ball to meet women. Eisenstein lies to his wife. He tells her that he is going to prison but actually he goes to the ball. His story arises the suspicion of his wife. His wife devises a plot to catch her womanizing husband.', 'Eisenstein gets in trouble for shooting a grouse. He is told that he must go to prison for his crime. However, his friend has invited him to an aristocratic ball. Eisenstein, despite being married, wants to go to the ball to meet women. Eisenstein lies to his wife. He tells her that he is going to prison but actually he goes to the ball. His story arises the suspicion of his wife. His wife devises a plot to catch her womanizing husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ccr8idgrszoehzV9xuLaDdMzEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65102'),
  ('868246586387854312', 'The Bat People', 1974, 'Horror', 'Jerry Jameson, Matthew F. Leonetti', 'Lou Shaw', 'Stewart Moss, Marianne McAndrew, Michael Pataki, Paul Carr, Arthur Space, Robert Berk, Pat Delaney', 'PG', 'Dr. John Beck, recently married, decides to take his wife, Cathy, spelunking in Carlsbad Cavern. While there, Dr. Beck, who specializes in bats, is bitten by a fruit bat. He is then, inexplicably, transformed into a vampire bat. While he escapes and seeks help from another doctor, it is clear the treatments are not working. In fact, they are aggravating his condition. Dr. Beck unwittingly goes on a killing spree, catching the attention of Sergeant Ward.', 'Dr. John Beck, recently married, decides to take his wife, Cathy, spelunking in Carlsbad Cavern. While there, Dr. Beck, who specializes in bats, is bitten by a fruit bat. He is then, inexplicably, transformed into a vampire bat. While he escapes and seeks help from another doctor, it is clear the treatments are not working. In fact, they are aggravating his condition. Dr. Beck unwittingly goes on a killing spree, catching the attention of Sergeant Ward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37D2iBv7ihU4RsQcXo4uGFYGOaS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28159'),
  ('360853291572543398', 'The Bat Whispers', 1930, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime, Horror', 'Roland West, Ray June, Robert H. Planck', 'Roland West', 'Chester Morris, Chance Ward, Una Merkel, Richard Tucker, Wilson Benge, DeWitt Jennings, Sidney D''Albrook, S.E. Jennings', 'NR', 'Infamous burglar "The Bat" commits a daring jewelry theft despite heavy police presence. Soon after, a bank theft occurs, which may be the work of the criminal as well. Meanwhile, Cornelia Van Gorder has various people arrive at her old mansion, including her niece, Dale, a bank employee, and police detective Anderson. When guests start turning up dead, Cornelia begins to suspect that The Bat may be lurking around the estate.', 'Infamous burglar "The Bat" commits a daring jewelry theft despite heavy police presence. Soon after, a bank theft occurs, which may be the work of the criminal as well. Meanwhile, Cornelia Van Gorder has various people arrive at her old mansion, including her niece, Dale, a bank employee, and police detective Anderson. When guests start turning up dead, Cornelia begins to suspect that The Bat may be lurking around the estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMc1VkdNwtyKJqsQVBWadsc0OJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26162'),
  ('732679191266825503', 'The Bat Woman', 1968, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Horror', 'René Cardona, Julio Cahero, Antonio Díaz Conde', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'Maura Monti, Roberto Cañedo, Héctor Godoy, David Silva, Crox Alvarado, Armando Silvestre, Manuel Capetillo, Ofelia Chávez', null, 'When a mad scientist begins kidnapping wrestlers and extracting their spinal fluid to create a race of Gill Men, two cops call in Batwoman to investigate. But when her mission leaves the scientist horrifically scarred, he seeks revenge.', 'When a mad scientist begins kidnapping wrestlers and extracting their spinal fluid to create a race of Gill Men, two cops call in Batwoman to investigate. But when her mission leaves the scientist horrifically scarred, he seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtmB85uT9wuxgvA92KMho9VoNL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106904'),
  ('92434616568779353', 'The Batman', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Alonzo, Bradley Parker, Will Houghton-Connell', 'Matt Reeves, Peter Craig, Mattson Tomlin', 'Robert Pattinson, Zoë Kravitz, Jeffrey Wright, Colin Farrell, Paul Dano, John Turturro, Andy Serkis, Peter Sarsgaard', 'PG-13', 'In his second year of fighting crime, Batman uncovers corruption in Gotham City that connects to his own family while facing a serial killer known as the Riddler.', 'In his second year of fighting crime, Batman uncovers corruption in Gotham City that connects to his own family while facing a serial killer known as the Riddler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74xTEgt7R36Fpooo50r9T25onhq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414906'),
  ('778823873850811011', 'The Batman vs. Dracula', 2005, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Michael Goguen, Seung Eun Kim, Brandon Vietti', 'Duane Capizzi', 'Rino Romano, Peter Stormare, Tara Strong, Alastair Duncan, Tom Kenny, Kevin Michael Richardson, Jeff Bennett, Richard Green', 'NR', 'Gotham City is terrorized not only by recent escapees Joker and Penguin, but by the original creature of the night, Dracula! Can Batman stop the ruthless vampire before he turns everyone in the city, including The Caped Crusader, Joker and Penguin, into his mindless minions?', 'Gotham City is terrorized not only by recent escapees Joker and Penguin, but by the original creature of the night, Dracula! Can Batman stop the ruthless vampire before he turns everyone in the city, including The Caped Crusader, Joker and Penguin, into his mindless minions?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uKIqZBXfxhflenI2LkNZIHUp7I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20077'),
  ('166926557938520833', 'The Battered Bastards of Baseball', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Chapman Way, Maclain Way, Chapman Way', null, 'Kurt Russell, Todd Field, Jim Bouton, Lou Russell, Ken Wheeler, Jack Faust, Carren Woods, Nick Bertram', 'R', 'Hollywood veteran Bing Russell creates the only independent baseball team in the country—alarming the baseball establishment and sparking the meteoric rise of the 1970s Portland Mavericks.', 'Hollywood veteran Bing Russell creates the only independent baseball team in the country—alarming the baseball establishment and sparking the meteoric rise of the 1970s Portland Mavericks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7hdQt7zpCRlDU3EqeJR6IVqNZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250700'),
  ('603098824346035860', 'The Battery', 2012, 'Drama, Horror', 'Christian Stella, Jeremy Gardner', 'Jeremy Gardner', 'Jeremy Gardner, Adam Cronheim, Niels Bolle, Alana O''Brien, Jamie Pantanella, Larry Fessenden, Kelly McQuade, Matt Bacco', null, 'In rural Connecticut, baseball players Ben and Mickey are trying to survive a zombie plague. They are forced to form a battery: a catcher and a pitcher who work together to outwit the batter, the one who hits the ball. And the batter in this case just happens to be a zombie. Tough Ben and gentle Mickey frequently disagree on the best way to go about the situation. Then they suddenly hear a human voice through their walkie-talkies. Is salvation nearby, like Mickey thinks, or is Ben’s suspicion justified?', 'In rural Connecticut, baseball players Ben and Mickey are trying to survive a zombie plague. They are forced to form a battery: a catcher and a pitcher who work together to outwit the batter, the one who hits the ball. And the batter in this case just happens to be a zombie. Tough Ben and gentle Mickey frequently disagree on the best way to go about the situation. Then they suddenly hear a human voice through their walkie-talkies. Is salvation nearby, like Mickey thinks, or is Ben’s suspicion justified?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nI7lzx2t4UPfuqhunB5bEVymOOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177221'),
  ('397535589010316910', 'The Battle at Apache Pass', 1952, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Charles P. Boyle', 'Gerald Drayson Adams', 'John Lund, Jeff Chandler, Susan Cabot, Bruce Cowling, Beverly Tyler, Richard Egan, Jay Silverheels, John Hudson', 'NR', 'Major Jim Colton is a sympathetic leader who has a working relationship with Apache leader Cochise. Colton is undermined by corrupt and politically ambitious Indian agent Neil Baylor who sets up a false attack, and the abduction of a local farmer''s son. While Colton is away investigating the matter, Baylor convinces Lieutenant Bascom that Cochise''s band is to blame, and incites him to lead an expedition against the Apache band to return the boy.', 'Major Jim Colton is a sympathetic leader who has a working relationship with Apache leader Cochise. Colton is undermined by corrupt and politically ambitious Indian agent Neil Baylor who sets up a false attack, and the abduction of a local farmer''s son. While Colton is away investigating the matter, Baylor convinces Lieutenant Bascom that Cochise''s band is to blame, and incites him to lead an expedition against the Apache band to return the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7b4e89bfIWkhtIzQdx1om1Vhdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38682'),
  ('1093985826084112637', 'The Battle at Lake Changjin', 2021, 'Drama, War', 'Kenny Tse Chung-To, Ning Haiqiang, Peter Pau Tak-Hai', 'Lan Xiaolong, Huang Jianxin', 'Wu Jing, Jackson Yee, Duan Yihong, Zhu Yawen, Kevin Lee, Jerry Lee, John F. Cruz, Elvis Han', null, 'Korean War, winter 1950. In the frozen and snowy area of Changjin Lake, a bloody battle is about to begin between the elite troops of the United States and China.', 'Korean War, winter 1950. In the frozen and snowy area of Changjin Lake, a bloody battle is about to begin between the elite troops of the United States and China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXvAlIo4DPLBiraC2KLu4977Wo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779029'),
  ('182888073820190517', 'The Battle at Lake Changjin II: Water Gate Bridge', 2022, 'War, History, Action', 'Tsui Hark, Park Ju-chun, Huang Jianxin', 'Lan Xiaolong, Huang Jianxin', 'Wu Jing, Jackson Yee, Zhu Yawen, Jerry Lee, Elvis Han, Zhang Hanyu, Geng Le, Du Chun', null, 'Commander Wu Qianli leads the 7th Infantry Company soldiers to Funchilin Pass where they are tasked to destroy a bridge to stop enemy troops from retreating.', 'Commander Wu Qianli leads the 7th Infantry Company soldiers to Funchilin Pass where they are tasked to destroy a bridge to stop enemy troops from retreating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4W58wirZhbzcw2lNzRS2ErKnOGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928123'),
  ('569417114554996412', 'The Battle of Austerlitz', 1960, 'Drama, History, War', 'Abel Gance, Robert Juillard, Henri Alekan', 'Nelly Kaplan, Abel Gance, Roger Richebé', 'Pierre Mondy, Martine Carol, Claudia Cardinale, Leslie Caron, Vittorio De Sica, Elvira Popescu, Jean Marais, Michel Simon', null, 'Napoleon Bonaparte crowns himself emperor and fights the English, Austrians and Russians in 1802.', 'Napoleon Bonaparte crowns himself emperor and fights the English, Austrians and Russians in 1802.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFeUHIXTaySLwJVx6Zwh8CVhe5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50791'),
  ('965186807234106143', 'The Battle of Canudos', 1997, 'War, History, Drama', 'César Cavalcanti, Antonio Luiz Mendes, Sérgio Rezende', 'Sérgio Rezende, Paulo Halm', 'Cláudia Abreu, Marieta Severo, Paulo Betti, José Wilker, José de Abreu, Selton Mello, Tonico Pereira, Roberto Bomtempo', null, 'At the end of the 19th century, a poor family comes to the rural Canudos, a community led by Antônio Conselheiro, seen by many as a holy prophet. Their ways bother the powerful people of the region, and the newly founded Republic sends their army to destroy the settlement, which culminates in one of the bloodiest wars in the history of Brazil.', 'At the end of the 19th century, a poor family comes to the rural Canudos, a community led by Antônio Conselheiro, seen by many as a holy prophet. Their ways bother the powerful people of the region, and the newly founded Republic sends their army to destroy the settlement, which culminates in one of the bloodiest wars in the history of Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IvivmRjwNJNCavfYoRs3fsyBD1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50370'),
  ('18155203584226717', 'The Battle of Chernobyl', 2007, 'Documentary, History', 'Thomas Johnson, Tom Jennings', 'Olivier Julien', 'Tim Birkett, Mikhail Gorbachev, Hans Blix, Oleg Mirochnikov', null, 'On April 26, 1986, a 1,000 feet high flame rises into the sky of the Ukraine. The fourth reactor of the Chernobyl nuclear power plant just exploded. A battle begins in which 500,000 men are engaged throughout the Soviet Union to "liquidate" the radioactivity, build the "sarcophagus" of the damaged reactor and save the world from a second explosion that would have destroyed half of Europe. Become a reference film, this documentary combines testimonials and unseen footage, tells for the first time the Battle of Chernobyl.', 'On April 26, 1986, a 1,000 feet high flame rises into the sky of the Ukraine. The fourth reactor of the Chernobyl nuclear power plant just exploded. A battle begins in which 500,000 men are engaged throughout the Soviet Union to "liquidate" the radioactivity, build the "sarcophagus" of the damaged reactor and save the world from a second explosion that would have destroyed half of Europe. Become a reference film, this documentary combines testimonials and unseen footage, tells for the first time the Battle of Chernobyl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75T5WQZU6x2eQO8i0g2FOgPda3q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63046'),
  ('718223260921245059', 'The Battle of Chile: Part I', 1975, 'Documentary, History', 'Patricio Guzmán, Jose Bartolome, Bernardo Menz', 'Julio García Espinosa, Pedro Chaskel, Federico Elton', 'Salvador Allende, Abilio Fernández', null, 'The chronicle of the political tension in Chile in 1973 and of the violent counter revolution against the democratically elected government of Salvador Allende.', 'The chronicle of the political tension in Chile in 1973 and of the violent counter revolution against the democratically elected government of Salvador Allende.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rJnhieQrm5HRt5AGgqxxXrnPKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132144'),
  ('60240512073842831', 'The Battle of Chile: Part II', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Patricio Guzmán, Jorge Müller Silva', 'Pedro Chaskel, Julio García Espinosa, Federico Elton', 'Abilio Fernández, Salvador Allende, Augusto Pinochet', null, 'Chronicles the events immediately surrounding the CIA- supported coup itself.', 'Chronicles the events immediately surrounding the CIA- supported coup itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/566lwvXAEGoRp7QGspqH8ByBTrF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132148'),
  ('1052739932534211747', 'The Battle of Chile: Part III', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Patricio Guzmán, Jorge Müller Silva', 'Patricio Guzmán', 'Abilio Fernández, Salvador Allende', null, 'Guzmán’s final installment shifts from covering the actions of Allende’s opponents to those who battled to revive & promote their toppled leader’s vision for a new Chile.', 'Guzmán’s final installment shifts from covering the actions of Allende’s opponents to those who battled to revive & promote their toppled leader’s vision for a new Chile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vF1bO0MY0mOLUOoGkaTOi01zaKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132150'),
  ('92897398208724755', 'The Battle of El Alamein', 1969, 'War, Action', 'Giorgio Ferroni, Sergio D''Offizi, Roberto Pariante', 'Remigio Del Grosso, Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Frederick Stafford, Enrico Maria Salerno, George Hilton, Robert Hossein, Michael Rennie, Giuseppe Castellano, Sal Borgese, Nello Pazzafini', 'PG', 'June 1942. As Rommel swept toward the Nile, the fall of Egypt and the capture of the Suez Canal seemed inevitable. Italian and German advance units raced toward Alexandria. Mussolini had given explicit orders: The Italians must arrive first!', 'June 1942. As Rommel swept toward the Nile, the fall of Egypt and the capture of the Suez Canal seemed inevitable. Italian and German advance units raced toward Alexandria. Mussolini had given explicit orders: The Italians must arrive first!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIP3e61xsOLtb73r65DpDtyu5Ue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141974'),
  ('918092938153605820', 'The Battle of Kerzhenets', 1971, 'Animation', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Yuri Norstein, Vladimir Sarukhanov', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano', null, null, 'The story is based on the legend of the Invisible City of Kitezh, which disappears under the waters of a lake to escape an attack by the Mongols.', 'The story is based on the legend of the Invisible City of Kitezh, which disappears under the waters of a lake to escape an attack by the Mongols.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wmCU1zvbYROMqHNClmIQ71QOg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90327'),
  ('1065265060262974562', 'The Battle of Midway', 1942, 'Documentary, War', 'John Ford, John Ford, Jack MacKenzie', 'James Kevin McGuinness, Dudley Nichols, John Ford', 'Henry Fonda, Jane Darwell, Donald Crisp, Irving Pichel', 'NR', 'The Japanese attack on Midway in June 1942, filmed as it happened. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive, in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation, in 2006.', 'The Japanese attack on Midway in June 1942, filmed as it happened. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive, in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation, in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Hisq6sR3sOveUPeBqidzF7JsQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56143'),
  ('532553992171124790', 'The Battle of Monte Cassino', 2024, 'Drama, History, War', 'Krzysztof Łukaszewicz, Arkadiusz Tomiak, Danyło Jaryj', 'Krzysztof Łukaszewicz', 'Nicolas Przygoda, Leszek Lichota, Michał Żurawski, Magdalena Żak, Szymon Piotr Warszawski, Mateusz Banasiuk, Dariusz Toczek, Bartłomiej Topa', null, 'The story of the legendary battle through the eyes of Jedrek - a boy who went through the hell of the gulag and left Russia with the Polish Army as one of thousands of polish orphans. Soon a decisive attack on a monastery located on the hills of Monte Cassino is to take place at the front - this spectacular battle will decide the lives of many soldiers and the fate of the Allied offensive in Italy, and will change Jedrek''s life forever.', 'The story of the legendary battle through the eyes of Jedrek - a boy who went through the hell of the gulag and left Russia with the Polish Army as one of thousands of polish orphans. Soon a decisive attack on a monastery located on the hills of Monte Cassino is to take place at the front - this spectacular battle will decide the lives of many soldiers and the fate of the Allied offensive in Italy, and will change Jedrek''s life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sxRBwBOIEUmXDsuGkGdqZvhEbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1210184'),
  ('981698834578725606', 'The Battle of Neretva', 1969, 'Drama, War', 'Veljko Bulajić, Tomislav Pinter', 'Ratko Đurović, Veljko Bulajić, Stevan Bulajić', 'Yul Brynner, Franco Nero, Curd Jürgens, Hardy Krüger, Sylva Koscina, Orson Welles, Anthony Dawson, Sergey Bondarchuk', null, 'In January 1943 the German army, afraid of an Allied invasion of the Balkans, launched a great offensive against Yugoslav Partisans in Western Bosnia. The only way out for Partisan forces and thousands of refugees was the bridge on the river Neretva.', 'In January 1943 the German army, afraid of an Allied invasion of the Balkans, launched a great offensive against Yugoslav Partisans in Western Bosnia. The only way out for Partisan forces and thousands of refugees was the bridge on the river Neretva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNgBGWnlfkXHAH06dcTCW5QVxm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34449'),
  ('955707374793270283', 'The Battle of Okinawa', 1971, 'War, History', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Kensho Yamashita, Yoshihiro Kawasaki', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Keiju Kobayashi, Yūzō Kayama, Tetsuro Tamba, Tatsuya Nakadai, Mayumi Ozora, Kenji Sahara, Katsuhiko Sasaki, Hideyo Amamoto', null, 'The Americans are swiftly closing on Okinawa, an island just south of the Japanese mainland. The Imperial command sends top generals and several army divisions to defend it at all costs. The mission quickly degenerates as vital resources and troops are diverted to other islands. After a civilian evacuation ends in tragedy most of non-combatants are forced to remain on the island. Many convert to soldier status. Tokyo sends mixed messages that squander time and resources, as when they order the defenders to build an airstrip for aircraft that never come. The truth soon becomes obvious: the high command decides that the island cannot be held and effectively abandons the Okinawan defenders. When the Americans land many troops are deployed in the wrong places. As the slaughter mounts, a suicidal attitude takes hold. Okinawa becomes a death trap, for civilian volunteers and non-combatants as well.', 'The Americans are swiftly closing on Okinawa, an island just south of the Japanese mainland. The Imperial command sends top generals and several army divisions to defend it at all costs. The mission quickly degenerates as vital resources and troops are diverted to other islands. After a civilian evacuation ends in tragedy most of non-combatants are forced to remain on the island. Many convert to soldier status. Tokyo sends mixed messages that squander time and resources, as when they order the defenders to build an airstrip for aircraft that never come. The truth soon becomes obvious: the high command decides that the island cannot be held and effectively abandons the Okinawan defenders. When the Americans land many troops are deployed in the wrong places. As the slaughter mounts, a suicidal attitude takes hold. Okinawa becomes a death trap, for civilian volunteers and non-combatants as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZW56GUytEGeEydA1gGhR5VZVjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130853'),
  ('555323027305702195', 'The Battle of San Pietro', 1945, 'War, Documentary', 'John Huston', null, 'Mark W. Clark, John Huston', null, 'This documentary movie is about the battle of San Pietro, a small village in Italy. Over 1,100 US soldiers were killed while trying to take this location, that blocked the way for the Allied forces from the Germans. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2005.', 'This documentary movie is about the battle of San Pietro, a small village in Italy. Over 1,100 US soldiers were killed while trying to take this location, that blocked the way for the Allied forces from the Germans. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2005.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JmUoqqdHKfbMUcRKHdca5x6fIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84701'),
  ('606308025635047558', 'The Battle of Shaker Heights', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kyle Rankin, Efram Potelle, Thomas E. Ackerman', 'Erica Beeney', 'Shia LaBeouf, Elden Henson, Amy Smart, Billy Kay, Kathleen Quinlan, Shiri Appleby, William Sadler, Ray Wise', 'PG-13', 'A quirky teen with a penchant for war reenactments, Kelly Ernswiler obsesses over military tactics with his buddy Bart. The school bully is one of Kelly''s regular headaches, and he also has to deal with a frustrating situation at home, where his father is a recovering drug addict. Kelly''s life gets even more complicated when he falls for Tabby, Bart''s pretty and soon-to-be-wed older sister.', 'A quirky teen with a penchant for war reenactments, Kelly Ernswiler obsesses over military tactics with his buddy Bart. The school bully is one of Kelly''s regular headaches, and he also has to deal with a frustrating situation at home, where his father is a recovering drug addict. Kelly''s life gets even more complicated when he falls for Tabby, Bart''s pretty and soon-to-be-wed older sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7PDR9rtbUN5b4gMVPSLMqIgfov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21413'),
  ('887477125831241835', 'The Battle of Sutjeska', 1973, 'War', 'Tomislav Pinter, Stipe Delić', 'Wolf Mankowitz, Ugo Pirro, Branimir Šćepanović', 'Richard Burton, Ljuba Tadić, Velimir Živojinović, Irene Papas, Milena Dravić, Bert Sotlar, Günter Meisner, Anton Diffring', null, 'The headquarters of the Marshal Tito''s Liberation Army are surrounded by Axis forces. The Partisans have no choice but to fight their way out of the encirclement and face the enemy on the plains of Sutjeska.', 'The headquarters of the Marshal Tito''s Liberation Army are surrounded by Axis forces. The Partisans have no choice but to fight their way out of the encirclement and face the enemy on the plains of Sutjeska.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9zYSjL4qir0cYjYWmyxAdFLJzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143355'),
  ('42195616258247901', 'The Battle of the Century', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Clyde Bruckman, George Stevens', 'Hal Roach', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Dorothy Coburn, Lou Costello, Anita Garvin, Dick Gilbert, Charlie Hall, Al Hallett', 'NR', 'Fight manager takes out an insurance policy on his puny pugilist and then proceeds to try to arrange for an accident so that he can collect.', 'Fight manager takes out an insurance policy on his puny pugilist and then proceeds to try to arrange for an accident so that he can collect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tu05UkXPu1MlnvUBdYIYhMJLmst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50859'),
  ('3953909861952540', 'The Battle of the Eagles', 1979, 'Drama, History, War', 'Hajrudin ''Šiba'' Krvavac, Dragan Resner', 'Đorđe Lebović, Miljenko Smoje', 'Bekim Fehmiu, Velimir Živojinović, Ljubiša Samardžić, Radoš Bajić, Radko Polič, Branko Pleša, Faruk Begolli, Branko Đurić', null, 'The first Yugoslav Partisan air force unit. Loosely based on historical facts.', 'The first Yugoslav Partisan air force unit. Loosely based on historical facts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOIkyCkpaq967MIKWS9frbKoR5x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202433'),
  ('283317618108105247', 'The Battle of the Rails', 1946, 'Drama, War', 'René Clément, Henri Alekan', 'Colette Audry', 'Charles Boyer, Jean Clarieux, Jean Daurand, François Joux, Tony Laurent, Robert Le Ray, Léon Pauléon, Michel Salina', 'NR', 'A dramatized account of the French Resistance, this wartime film depicts how railway workers sabotaged German trains to disrupt troop movements and supply lines during the Nazi occupation. Blending documentary realism with fiction, it pays tribute to the courage and sacrifice of ordinary workers who became central to the fight for liberation.', 'A dramatized account of the French Resistance, this wartime film depicts how railway workers sabotaged German trains to disrupt troop movements and supply lines during the Nazi occupation. Blending documentary realism with fiction, it pays tribute to the courage and sacrifice of ordinary workers who became central to the fight for liberation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olRrnwadx2JYgphNdSN6PQlQFvE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39142'),
  ('8896594759005747', 'The Battle of the River Plate', 1956, 'Drama, History, War', 'Michael Powell, Emeric Pressburger, Christopher Challis', 'Emeric Pressburger, Michael Powell', 'John Gregson, Anthony Quayle, Ian Hunter, Jack Gwillim, Bernard Lee, Lionel Murton, Anthony Bushell, Peter Illing', 'NR', 'In the early years of the World War II, the Royal Navy is fighting a desperate battle to keep the Atlantic convoy routes open to supply the British Isles, facing the great danger posed by the many German warships, such as the Admiral Graf Spee, which are scouring the ocean for cargo ships to sink.', 'In the early years of the World War II, the Royal Navy is fighting a desperate battle to keep the Atlantic convoy routes open to supply the British Isles, facing the great danger posed by the many German warships, such as the Admiral Graf Spee, which are scouring the ocean for cargo ships to sink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCkNI9LVDkH5z6PzwQUbutQcm3U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17591'),
  ('276184323017962496', 'The Battle of the Sexes', 1928, 'Drama, Comedy', 'D.W. Griffith, Billy Bitzer, Karl Struss', 'Gerrit J. Lloyd', 'Jean Hersholt, Phyllis Haver, Belle Bennett, Sally O''Neil, Don Alvarado, William Bakewell, John Batten', 'NR', 'Gum-chewing frizzy-haired golddigger Marie Skinner cooks up a scheme with her lover Babe Winsor, a jazz hound, to fleece a portly middle-aged real estate tycoon, William Judson. Marie moves into Judson''s apartment building and contrives to meet and seduce him, plying him with compliments, music, swoons, décolletage, and batted eyes. When his loyal wife (and their two children) see him out catting with Marie at a night club, mom''s devastated and confronts him. He moves out. Babe wants Marie to sell Judson worthless bonds. Will mom commit suicide? Will sis shoot the floozy? Will pops figure out he''s being a fool?', 'Gum-chewing frizzy-haired golddigger Marie Skinner cooks up a scheme with her lover Babe Winsor, a jazz hound, to fleece a portly middle-aged real estate tycoon, William Judson. Marie moves into Judson''s apartment building and contrives to meet and seduce him, plying him with compliments, music, swoons, décolletage, and batted eyes. When his loyal wife (and their two children) see him out catting with Marie at a night club, mom''s devastated and confronts him. He moves out. Babe wants Marie to sell Judson worthless bonds. Will mom commit suicide? Will sis shoot the floozy? Will pops figure out he''s being a fool?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acajCMXgjrX8S4h1mZnAFfVhkSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109944'),
  ('263992150231296258', 'The Battle of the Sexes', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Charles Crichton', 'Monja Danischewsky', 'Peter Sellers, Robert Morley, Constance Cummings, Jameson Clark, Donald Pleasence, Michael Goodliffe, Alex Mackenzie, Ernest Thesiger', null, 'Angela Barrows is a man-eating business woman sent by her American employer to investigate their export opportunities in Edinburgh. En route she meets Robert MacPherson, a businessman who asks for her help to bring his company into the 20th Century. The staff, led by Mr Martin, has other ideas—and a battle between the old and new business methods soon breaks out.', 'Angela Barrows is a man-eating business woman sent by her American employer to investigate their export opportunities in Edinburgh. En route she meets Robert MacPherson, a businessman who asks for her help to bring his company into the 20th Century. The staff, led by Mr Martin, has other ideas—and a battle between the old and new business methods soon breaks out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFoxIZp9suLSH8acN2oAj0ov8hC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43106'),
  ('113481903481910925', 'The Battle Over Citizen Kane', 1996, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Thomas Lennon, Michael Epstein, Michael Chin', 'Thomas Lennon, Richard Ben Cramer', 'Richard Ben Cramer, William Alland, Thomas Anderson, Peter Bogdanovich, Jimmy Breslin, Marion Davies, Leonard de Paur, Douglas Fairbanks Jr.', 'NR', 'Documentary about the battle between Orson Welles and William Randolph Hearst over Welles'' Citizen Kane (1941). Features interviews with Welles'' and Hearst''s co-workers also acts as a relatively complete biograph of Hearst''s career.', 'Documentary about the battle between Orson Welles and William Randolph Hearst over Welles'' Citizen Kane (1941). Features interviews with Welles'' and Hearst''s co-workers also acts as a relatively complete biograph of Hearst''s career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPZ9EioXBZ8j8aUqVdBX3vD8uKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278484'),
  ('262556876675207874', 'The Battle Wizard', 1977, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Pao Hsueh-Li, Yuen Teng-Bong', 'Ni Kuang', 'Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Tanny Tien-Ni, Lin Chen-Chi, Shih Chung-Tien, Chiang Tao, Keung Hon, Wai Wang, Si Wai', null, 'A brother who loves books and a sister who loves swords must face a yellow-robed warrior, the Red Python, a sinuous snake-charmer, and a silk-masked beauty (who must kill or wed the first man to see her face) before they can bring peace to their battle-addled family.', 'A brother who loves books and a sister who loves swords must face a yellow-robed warrior, the Red Python, a sinuous snake-charmer, and a silk-masked beauty (who must kill or wed the first man to see her face) before they can bring peace to their battle-addled family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8NoWSzCvPqmL8Puk4CAFrAa5Tg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66759'),
  ('968703241806874971', 'The Battle: Roar to Victory', 2019, 'History, Action, War', 'Hwang Sun-wook, Kim Min-soo, Won Shin-yun', 'Cheon Jin-wu', 'Ryu Jun-yeol, Yoo Hai-jin, Jo Woo-jin, Kotaro Daigo, Kazuki Kitamura, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Sung Yoo-bin, Park Ji-hwan', null, 'Over a 4 day period, a fierce battle takes place between Korean independence militias and imperialist Japanese forces in Manchuria, China. The militia includes a master swordsman and an expert marksman.', 'Over a 4 day period, a fierce battle takes place between Korean independence militias and imperialist Japanese forces in Manchuria, China. The militia includes a master swordsman and an expert marksman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KOiETUJcXcm6HTtEXbzv4ZWj6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573791'),
  ('36664684676410668', 'The Battles of Coronel and Falkland Islands', 1927, 'Drama, War', 'Walter Summers, Stanley Rodwell, Jack Parker', 'Frank Bowden, Merritt Crawford, Harry Engholm', 'Roger Maxwell, Craighall Sherry, Hans von Slock', null, 'The film focuses on the naval warfare around the Battle of Coronel and Battle of the Falkland Islands during the First World War. It was the last in a successful series of documentary reconstructions of First World War battles by British Instructional Films made between 1921 and 1927.', 'The film focuses on the naval warfare around the Battle of Coronel and Battle of the Falkland Islands during the First World War. It was the last in a successful series of documentary reconstructions of First World War battles by British Instructional Films made between 1921 and 1927.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4DVnKIAFRHNGhj3QWdUBJFWSOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287262'),
  ('350358199387547273', 'The Battleship Island', 2017, 'Action, History, Drama, War', 'Lee Seong-hwan, Lee Seok-sool, Jo Gyeong-hun', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Shin Kyung-il', 'Hwang Jung-min, So Ji-sub, Song Joong-ki, Lee Jung-hyun, Kim Su-an, Kim Min-jae, Kim Joong-hee, Kim In-woo', 'PG-13', 'During the Japanese colonial era, roughly 400 Korean people, who were forced onto Battleship Island ''Hashima Island'' to mine for coal, attempt to escape.', 'During the Japanese colonial era, roughly 400 Korean people, who were forced onto Battleship Island ''Hashima Island'' to mine for coal, attempt to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Pn9IK13JHhB7vS5TSgz79cdLra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436391'),
  ('212025187952188914', 'The Baxter', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Showalter', 'Michael Showalter', 'Michael Showalter, Elizabeth Banks, Michelle Williams, Justin Theroux, Zak Orth, Michael Ian Black, Catherine Lloyd Burns, Peter Dinklage', 'PG-13', 'Mild mannered tax accountant Elliot Sherman is what he calls a "Baxter": the kind of calm, unexciting fellow who "wears sock garters" and "enjoys raking leaves." Loved by bosses and parents, Elliot is a perfectly nice guy. And that''s his problem.', 'Mild mannered tax accountant Elliot Sherman is what he calls a "Baxter": the kind of calm, unexciting fellow who "wears sock garters" and "enjoys raking leaves." Loved by bosses and parents, Elliot is a perfectly nice guy. And that''s his problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9V1ASfnxMZxrkqIvVQYySE5qSwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13169'),
  ('227711397827446350', 'The Bay', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Barry Levinson, Josh Nussbaum, Jennifer Spence', 'Michael Wallach', 'Kristen Connolly, Will Rogers, Michael Beasley, Christopher Denham, Kenny Alfonso, Kether Donohue, Anthony Reynolds, Frank Deal', 'R', 'Two million fish washed ashore. One thousand blackbirds dropped from the sky. On July 4, 2009 a deadly menace swept through the quaint seaside town of Claridge, Maryland, but the harrowing story of what happened that Independence Day has never been told—until now. The authorities believed they had buried the truth about the tragedy that claimed over 700 human lives. Now, three years later, a reporter has emerged with footage revealing the cover-up and an unimaginable killer: a mysterious parasitic outbreak. Told from the perspective of those who were there and saw what happened, The Bay unfolds over 24 hours through people''s iPhones, Androids, 911 calls, webcams, and whatever else could be used to document the nightmare in Claridge. What follows is a nerve-shredding tale of a small town plunged into absolute terror.', 'Two million fish washed ashore. One thousand blackbirds dropped from the sky. On July 4, 2009 a deadly menace swept through the quaint seaside town of Claridge, Maryland, but the harrowing story of what happened that Independence Day has never been told—until now. The authorities believed they had buried the truth about the tragedy that claimed over 700 human lives. Now, three years later, a reporter has emerged with footage revealing the cover-up and an unimaginable killer: a mysterious parasitic outbreak. Told from the perspective of those who were there and saw what happened, The Bay unfolds over 24 hours through people''s iPhones, Androids, 911 calls, webcams, and whatever else could be used to document the nightmare in Claridge. What follows is a nerve-shredding tale of a small town plunged into absolute terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnmYgr4AOOE09zKa7omPW1FWT8K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123105'),
  ('695892248238975546', 'The Bay Boy', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Petrie, Claude Agostini', 'Daniel Petrie', 'Liv Ullmann, Kiefer Sutherland, Peter Donat, Alan Scarfe, Mathieu Carrière, Chris Wiggins, Thomas Peacocke, Isabelle Mejias', null, 'A Roman Catholic teenage boy in Glace Bay, Cape Breton Island, Nova Scotia during the 1930s faces various growing-up problems: Should he become a priest? What should he do about the murder he witnessed, committed by a local cop and upstanding parishioner? And how far should he go with his girlfriend, who happens to be the murderer''s daughter?', 'A Roman Catholic teenage boy in Glace Bay, Cape Breton Island, Nova Scotia during the 1930s faces various growing-up problems: Should he become a priest? What should he do about the murder he witnessed, committed by a local cop and upstanding parishioner? And how far should he go with his girlfriend, who happens to be the murderer''s daughter?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ds8RNFx0HlwT1ZqD17VhtWqUTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71445'),
  ('1132192323097284405', 'The Bay of Silence', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Paula van der Oest, Ben Rogers, Guido van Gennep', 'Caroline Goodall', 'Claes Bang, Olga Kurylenko, Brian Cox, Assaad Bouab, Alice Krige, Litiana Biutanaseva, Lilibet Biutanaseva, Shalisha James-Davis', 'NR', 'Will believes his wife Rosalind is innocent of their son''s suspected murder, only to discover the devastating truth behind her past links her to another unsolved crime.', 'Will believes his wife Rosalind is innocent of their son''s suspected murder, only to discover the devastating truth behind her past links her to another unsolved crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oB3LX9C3FbJvPtrk1J7qHQKvzLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623958'),
  ('411027685910895168', 'The Bayou', 2025, 'Thriller, Horror, Action', 'Taneli Mustonen, Brad Watson, Steven Hall', 'Ashley Holberry, Gavin Cosmo Mehrtens', 'Athena Strates, Madalena Aragão, Elisha Applebaum, Mohammed Mansaray, Tayla Kovacevic-Ebong, Andonis Anthony, Sarah Priddy, Isabelle Bonfrer', null, 'Vacation turns disaster when Houston grad Kyle and her friends survive a plane crash in the desolate Louisiana everglades, only to discover there''s something way more dangerous lurking in the shallows.', 'Vacation turns disaster when Houston grad Kyle and her friends survive a plane crash in the desolate Louisiana everglades, only to discover there''s something way more dangerous lurking in the shallows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sf6j1SbgDf7VTjL1MRq5MAQSOyE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1407861'),
  ('479686343967239313', 'The Baytown Outlaws', 2012, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Barry Battles, David McFarland', 'Barry Battles, Griffin Hood', 'Clayne Crawford, Travis Fimmel, Daniel Cudmore, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Andre Braugher, Paul Wesley, Eva Longoria, Billy Bob Thornton', 'R', 'When three redneck brothers agree to help a woman save her son from an abusive father, they become targets on the run from an odd cast of characters.', 'When three redneck brothers agree to help a woman save her son from an abusive father, they become targets on the run from an odd cast of characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oevsox25ZnoUBms45KARDs8epmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81446'),
  ('1127985954501218941', 'The Beach', 1992, 'Animation', 'Patrick Bokanowski', 'Patrick Bokanowski', null, null, 'Reworked and colored images of people playing at the seashore.', 'Reworked and colored images of people playing at the seashore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYyoyuL1O4ulACIZiLHUo2mmfyf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228587'),
  ('505059668450353754', 'The Beach', 2000, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance, Thriller', 'Danny Boyle, Darius Khondji, Nick Heckstall-Smith', 'John Hodge', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Virginie Ledoyen, Guillaume Canet, Tilda Swinton, Staffan Kihlbom, Paterson Joseph, Peter Youngblood Hills, Robert Carlyle', 'R', 'Twenty-something Richard travels to Thailand and finds himself in possession of a strange map. Rumours state that it leads to a solitary beach paradise, a tropical bliss - excited and intrigued, he sets out to find it.', 'Twenty-something Richard travels to Thailand and finds himself in possession of a strange map. Rumours state that it leads to a solitary beach paradise, a tropical bliss - excited and intrigued, he sets out to find it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4y7LxD8TSi6AtsM2xSYqUm1gu7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1907'),
  ('307626910907087759', 'The Beach Boys', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'Frank Marshall, Thom Zimny, Ernesto Lomeli', 'Mark Monroe', 'Brian Wilson, Mike Love, Al Jardine, David Marks, Bruce Johnston, Lindsey Buckingham, Janelle Monáe, Ryan Tedder', 'PG-13', 'A celebration of the legendary band that revolutionized pop music, and the iconic, harmonious sound they created that personified the California dream, captivating fans for generations and generations to come.', 'A celebration of the legendary band that revolutionized pop music, and the iconic, harmonious sound they created that personified the California dream, captivating fans for generations and generations to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqrKimzSHgXRJlYgDw9LYqtTXbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1265066'),
  ('732598828993604167', 'The Beach Bum', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Harmony Korine, Benoît Debie, Reynaldo Rodriguez', 'Harmony Korine', 'Matthew McConaughey, Snoop Dogg, Isla Fisher, Jimmy Buffett, Zac Efron, Martin Lawrence, Stefania LaVie Owen, Jonah Hill', 'R', 'An irreverent comedy about the misadventures of Moondog, a rebellious stoner and lovable rogue who lives large.', 'An irreverent comedy about the misadventures of Moondog, a rebellious stoner and lovable rogue who lives large.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXMxdC7T0t3dxislnUNybcvJmAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441384'),
  ('72604626488194959', 'The Beach Girls', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Bud Townsend, Tom Stockfisch, Stephen Eshelman', 'Patrick Sheane Duncan', 'Debra Blee, Val Kline, Jeana Keough, James Daughton, Adam Roarke, Dan Barrows, Herbie Braha, Mary Jo Catlett', 'R', 'School is out, and three girls head to the beach for vacation. Two of the girls are world-wise party-goers who attempt to loosen up their naive, virginal friend, whose uncle has allowed the girls to stay at his beach house. When the near-sighted, drug smuggling Captain Bly dumps his cargo of marijuana, the bales wash up on shore. The two party girls, Ginger and Ducky, quickly stuff the dope into giant bags and spirit it back to the beach house, where it fuels a party with assorted misfits, delivery persons, and passersby.', 'School is out, and three girls head to the beach for vacation. Two of the girls are world-wise party-goers who attempt to loosen up their naive, virginal friend, whose uncle has allowed the girls to stay at his beach house. When the near-sighted, drug smuggling Captain Bly dumps his cargo of marijuana, the bales wash up on shore. The two party girls, Ginger and Ducky, quickly stuff the dope into giant bags and spirit it back to the beach house, where it fuels a party with assorted misfits, delivery persons, and passersby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f83xGpjLVwAYqsTr6vlrRxUxUP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54803'),
  ('838617006858488812', 'The Beach Girls and the Monster', 1965, 'Horror', 'Jon Hall, Jon Hall', 'Joan Gardner', 'Jon Hall, Sue Casey, Elaine DuPont, Arnold Lessing, Read Morgan, Carolyn Williamson, Gloria Neil, Kal Roberts', 'NR', 'A young girl is killed at the beach in Malibu. Professor Otto Lindsay suspects that it is some form of mutated fish. However, his son Richard, who was a good friend of the girl, thinks that it is a madman who has a grudge against Richard and his friends. Soon the list of victims grows.', 'A young girl is killed at the beach in Malibu. Professor Otto Lindsay suspects that it is some form of mutated fish. However, his son Richard, who was a good friend of the girl, thinks that it is a madman who has a grudge against Richard and his friends. Soon the list of victims grows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tITqhiIr5VhjoaTqtHDxG2TUBEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69780'),
  ('612026640412664058', 'The Beach House', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Michael McKay, Mark Romanelli, Jane Ferguson', 'Maria Nation', 'Minka Kelly, Chad Michael Murray, Andie MacDowell, Makenzie Vega, Donna Biscoe, Donny Boaz, Alyshia Ochse, Havana Blum', 'G', 'Cara Rudland thought she’d left her Southern roots and troubled family far behind, but returns to the scenic Lowcountry of her childhood summers after losing her job in Chicago. There, she reconnects with her mother Lovie, who has been caring for her young, pregnant friend Toy in her charming beach house.', 'Cara Rudland thought she’d left her Southern roots and troubled family far behind, but returns to the scenic Lowcountry of her childhood summers after losing her job in Chicago. There, she reconnects with her mother Lovie, who has been caring for her young, pregnant friend Toy in her charming beach house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdGh7K00iaeD03EYqtXT70bivf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521190'),
  ('1014085987100365635', 'The Beach House', 2020, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Jeffrey A. Brown, Owen Levelle, Nick Flavin', 'Jeffrey A. Brown', 'Liana Liberato, Noah Le Gros, Jake Weber, Maryann Nagel, Steven Corkin, Michael Brumfield, Matt Maisto, Dan Zakarija', 'NR', 'A romantic getaway for two troubled college sweethearts turns into a struggle for survival when unexpected guests – and the surrounding environment – exhibit signs of a mysterious infection.', 'A romantic getaway for two troubled college sweethearts turns into a struggle for survival when unexpected guests – and the surrounding environment – exhibit signs of a mysterious infection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyMjZJNAsvfnW8OS4JWh6TdKWzk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632304'),
  ('625913286417185182', 'The Beach Party', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, null, 'A fun day at the beach. While Mickey, Horace, and Clarabelle go swimming, or try to, Minnie lays out a picnic. Pluto discovers why you shouldn''t chase a crab. Everyone digs in to lunch. Mickey throws Pluto a string of sausages; he dives after them, and comes up with an angry octopus instead, who crashes into the picnic. Everyone fights the octopus, and Mickey finally manages to send it out to sea by throwing an anchor like a lasso.', 'A fun day at the beach. While Mickey, Horace, and Clarabelle go swimming, or try to, Minnie lays out a picnic. Pluto discovers why you shouldn''t chase a crab. Everyone digs in to lunch. Mickey throws Pluto a string of sausages; he dives after them, and comes up with an angry octopus instead, who crashes into the picnic. Everyone fights the octopus, and Mickey finally manages to send it out to sea by throwing an anchor like a lasso.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMrTIFlEK7vD4Umt9bVGRkJSyVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162559'),
  ('913139056860652161', 'The Beaches of Agnès', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Alain Sakot, Agnès Varda', 'Agnès Varda, Didier Rouget', 'Agnès Varda, André Lubrano, Blaise Fournier, Vincent Fournier, Andrée Vilar, Stéphane Vilar, Christophe Vilar, Rosalie Varda', null, 'Filmmaking icon Agnès Varda, the award-winning director regarded by many as the grandmother of the French new wave, turns the camera on herself with this unique autobiographical documentary. Composed of film excerpts and elaborate dramatic re-creations, Varda''s self-portrait recounts the highs and lows of her professional career, the many friendships that affected her life and her longtime marriage to cinematic giant Jacques Demy.', 'Filmmaking icon Agnès Varda, the award-winning director regarded by many as the grandmother of the French new wave, turns the camera on herself with this unique autobiographical documentary. Composed of film excerpts and elaborate dramatic re-creations, Varda''s self-portrait recounts the highs and lows of her professional career, the many friendships that affected her life and her longtime marriage to cinematic giant Jacques Demy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqTFhLpdyMNLBvmN5KFhCOFWWIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38879'),
  ('307942688856877095', 'The Beachnickers', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Cacala Carvana, Felipe Reinheimer, Roberto Santucci', 'Odete Damico, Paulo Cursino', 'Antonio Fragoso, Danielle Winits, Maurício Manfrini, Cacau Protásio, Charles Paraventi, Elisa Pinheiro, Nilton Bicudo, Aline Campos', null, 'Things go from bad to worse when four co-workers decide to enjoy the extended holiday at a beach house with their families.', 'Things go from bad to worse when four co-workers decide to enjoy the extended holiday at a beach house with their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSUGsF1GSNLZAEjeePsDlHBhG0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494493'),
  ('904453814272888641', 'The Beachnickers 2', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Marcelo Brasil, Roberto Santucci, Mariangela Furtado', 'Paulo Cursino', 'Antonio Fragoso, Danielle Winits, Maurício Manfrini, Cacau Protásio, Charles Paraventi, Elisa Pinheiro, Nilton Bicudo, Aline Campos', null, 'Coworkers Alexandre, Lima, Rocha, Diguinho and their families are treated by the company to a trip to Bahia. However, problems and unforeseen events can ruin this dream trip.', 'Coworkers Alexandre, Lima, Rocha, Diguinho and their families are treated by the company to a trip to Bahia. However, problems and unforeseen events can ruin this dream trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gn10uF6keUD1lwLvdc9JU1eH1CT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136897'),
  ('387420021846317366', 'The Beacon', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Stokes, Don Reddy', 'Michael Stokes', 'Teri Polo, David Rees Snell, Elaine Hendrix, Michael Ironside, Marnette Patterson, Ken Howard, Kelli Dawn Hancock, Jonny Cruz', null, 'While trying to get their lives back on track after the loss of their four year old son, Bryn and Paul Shaw move to the charming old Beacon Apartments. Bryn begins seeing a ghostly little boy skulking around the building. With the help of an eccentric young professor and a tough old beat cop, Bryn tries to uncover the details of the boy''s death.', 'While trying to get their lives back on track after the loss of their four year old son, Bryn and Paul Shaw move to the charming old Beacon Apartments. Bryn begins seeing a ghostly little boy skulking around the building. With the help of an eccentric young professor and a tough old beat cop, Bryn tries to uncover the details of the boy''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZj5D9PXPycYzaKGwuTfoG3a3F1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32585'),
  ('516053022349237093', 'The Bead Game', 1977, 'Animation', 'Ishu Patel', null, null, null, 'To a percussive soundtrack, a succession of more complex animals forms and is consumed by their successors (all formed from beads). Finally, We reach man, who develops ever more sophisticated forms of war.', 'To a percussive soundtrack, a succession of more complex animals forms and is consumed by their successors (all formed from beads). Finally, We reach man, who develops ever more sophisticated forms of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRVSkgTrWVgCszo0dkDgJRw8wsp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115036'),
  ('416794236442447471', 'The Beales of Grey Gardens', 2006, 'Documentary, Drama', 'David Maysles, Albert Maysles, Albert Maysles', null, 'Edith Bouvier Beale, Albert Maysles, David Maysles, Jerry Torre, Lois Wright, Edith Ewing Bouvier Beale', 'NR', 'Mother and daughter - Big Edie and Little Edie Beale - live with six cats in a crumbling house in East Hampton. Little Edie, in her 50s, who wears scarves and bright colors, sings, mugs for the camera, and talks to Al and David Maysles, the filmmakers. Big Edie, in her 70s, recites poetry, comments on her daughter''s behavior, and sings "If I Loved You" in fine voice. She talks in short sentences; her daughter in volumes. The film is episodic: friends visit, there''s a small fire in the house, Little Edie goes to the shore and swims. She talks about the Catholic Church. She''s ashamed that local authorities raided the house because of all the cats. She values being different.', 'Mother and daughter - Big Edie and Little Edie Beale - live with six cats in a crumbling house in East Hampton. Little Edie, in her 50s, who wears scarves and bright colors, sings, mugs for the camera, and talks to Al and David Maysles, the filmmakers. Big Edie, in her 70s, recites poetry, comments on her daughter''s behavior, and sings "If I Loved You" in fine voice. She talks in short sentences; her daughter in volumes. The film is episodic: friends visit, there''s a small fire in the house, Little Edie goes to the shore and swims. She talks about the Catholic Church. She''s ashamed that local authorities raided the house because of all the cats. She values being different.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9csh8HyBEgp6rW1RQW88ua5iTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47491'),
  ('137243456427192956', 'The Beanie Bubble', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Riley Flanagan, Kristin Gore, Damian Kulash', 'Kristin Gore', 'Zach Galifianakis, Elizabeth Banks, Sarah Snook, Geraldine Viswanathan, Tracey Bonner, Carl Clemons-Hopkins, Jeff Schine, Jason Burkey', 'R', 'Ty was a frustrated toy salesman until his collaboration with three women turned his stuffed animals into a defining ''90s trend. This behind-the-scenes look at history''s biggest toy craze is a wild story about what—and who—is valued in this world.', 'Ty was a frustrated toy salesman until his collaboration with three women turned his stuffed animals into a defining ''90s trend. This behind-the-scenes look at history''s biggest toy craze is a wild story about what—and who—is valued in this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YDW8dCrQyRpppK5985hKY1Mc8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926008'),
  ('543502873652374594', 'The Bear', 1988, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Philippe Rousselot', 'Gérard Brach', 'Youk the Bear, Bart the Bear, Tchéky Karyo, Jack Wallace, André Lacombe', 'PG', 'An orphan bear cub hooks up with an adult male as they try to dodge human hunters.', 'An orphan bear cub hooks up with an adult male as they try to dodge human hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ry4A1Y2udvqyDlVHLtSeP1u9qwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2383'),
  ('247866868360857506', 'The Bear', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Hilary Audus', 'Hilary Audus, Joanna Harrison', 'Charlotte Church, Peter Knapp, Philip Sheffield', null, 'A polar bear breaks out of his enclosure to bring a little girl''s teddy bear back to her. While she cares for him, the bear takes her on a magical journey. Based on Raymond Briggs'' best selling storybook, this enchanting animated tale is from the makers of The Snowman.', 'A polar bear breaks out of his enclosure to bring a little girl''s teddy bear back to her. While she cares for him, the bear takes her on a magical journey. Based on Raymond Briggs'' best selling storybook, this enchanting animated tale is from the makers of The Snowman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6MsFUSFwm1SvQp2hswxgRWpptR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48819'),
  ('157427732107209110', 'The Bear and the Doll', 1970, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michel Deville, Claude Lecomte', 'Nina Companéez, Michel Deville', 'Brigitte Bardot, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Daniel Ceccaldi, Georges Claisse, Julien Verdier, Sabine Haudepin, Valérie Stroh, Claude Jetter', 'NR', 'A quiet cellist living in the countryside has his life disrupted when he accidentally bumps into a wealthy, temperamental woman in a Rolls-Royce. Angered by his indifference to her charm, she attempts to seduce him, but he resists her attempts to invade his peaceful life.', 'A quiet cellist living in the countryside has his life disrupted when he accidentally bumps into a wealthy, temperamental woman in a Rolls-Royce. Angered by his indifference to her charm, she attempts to seduce him, but he resists her attempts to invade his peaceful life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76q2NxDGGXjHtMg5TudDT2MhmiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63882'),
  ('911815411201202624', 'The Bear Tales', 2018, 'Drama', 'Samuele Sestieri, Olmo Amato, Olmo Amato', 'Olmo Amato, Samuele Sestieri', 'Freya Roberts, Bengt Roberts, Samuele Sestieri, Olmo Amato, Virginia Quaranta', null, 'Through deserted Scandinavian landscapes, a robot monk follows a little red man. Only when they find a wounded teddy bear do they have a common goal.', 'Through deserted Scandinavian landscapes, a robot monk follows a little red man. Only when they find a wounded teddy bear do they have a common goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pStmgbJ8R2R68INYtBLGYfP2tog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368386'),
  ('426104407756707042', 'The Bear That Wasn''t', 1967, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Paul Frees', 'NR', 'A bear settles down for his long winter nap, and while he sleeps the progress of man continues. He wakes up to find himself in the middle of an industrial complex where nobody believes he''s a bear.', 'A bear settles down for his long winter nap, and while he sleeps the progress of man continues. He wakes up to find himself in the middle of an industrial complex where nobody believes he''s a bear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ak9cYg1cVcbea87O88Rpsc53G1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89816'),
  ('705765684669284120', 'The Bear Who Slept Through Christmas', 1973, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Hawley Pratt, Gerry Chiniquy', 'John Barrett, Larry Spiegel', 'Tom Smothers, Arte Johnson, Barbara Feldon, Casey Kasem, Bob Holt, Michael Bell, Kelly Lange, Caryn Paperny', 'NR', 'While the rest of the world is getting ready for Christmas, all the bears in Bearbank are getting ready to sleep… except for Ted E. Bear. Ted gets curious about the holiday, and sets out to learn the meaning of it from Santa Claus himself.', 'While the rest of the world is getting ready for Christmas, all the bears in Bearbank are getting ready to sleep… except for Ted E. Bear. Ted gets curious about the holiday, and sets out to learn the meaning of it from Santa Claus himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljEUhvy3IoLBgtmlhffWs4rEVfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147492'),
  ('497577341712670285', 'The Bear''s Tale', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Tex Avery, Bea Benaderet, Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce, Bernice Hansen', null, 'The Three Bears meets Little Red Riding Hood, told in the style of Tex Avery.', 'The Three Bears meets Little Red Riding Hood, told in the style of Tex Avery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYl3IwmHxJRLFoCdqBV6FbXiy9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173438'),
  ('584682882300303668', 'The Bears and I', 1974, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Bernard McEveety', null, 'Patrick Wayne, Chief Dan George, Andrew Duggan, Michael Ansara, Robert Pine, Valentin de Vargas, Hal Baylor', 'G', 'When a man adopts three black bear cubs, he faces one of the hardest decisions of his life. Set in the wilderness of British Columbia, Canada, Robert Leslie struggles to keep his bears safe and maintain relations with native Americans and park rangers.', 'When a man adopts three black bear cubs, he faces one of the hardest decisions of his life. Set in the wilderness of British Columbia, Canada, Robert Leslie struggles to keep his bears safe and maintain relations with native Americans and park rangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXrViNk53YIN2zFPZ93DQt8nDMX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103698'),
  ('518245388219915376', 'The Bears and the Bees', 1932, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, null, 'NR', 'Two bear cubs tussle harmlessly, then start to munch on a berry bush, until a bigger, meaner bear chases them off. They nibble some flowers and find a bee, which they follow to the hive, which they then proceed to raid. The big bear chases them off, but unknown to him, a bee spotted the raid and has summoned the attack squad. The bees run him off, and the cubs dig in.', 'Two bear cubs tussle harmlessly, then start to munch on a berry bush, until a bigger, meaner bear chases them off. They nibble some flowers and find a bee, which they follow to the hive, which they then proceed to raid. The big bear chases them off, but unknown to him, a bee spotted the raid and has summoned the attack squad. The bees run him off, and the cubs dig in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVMV5b4UkrZ7fpkZ3vt0Np6J4Ez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67573'),
  ('863754539166508108', 'The Bears'' Famous Invasion of Sicily', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Lorenzo Mattotti', 'Thomas Bidegain, Jean-Luc Fromental, Lorenzo Mattotti', 'Toni Servillo, Alberto Boubakar Malanchino, Maurizio Lombardi, Lorenzo Mattotti, Antonio Albanese, Linda Caridi, Corrado Invernizzi, Beppe Chierici', null, 'Our story starts with Tonio, the son the bears King, being kidnapped by some hunters in the Sicilian mountains. Because of the harshness of a winter that threatens its clan with famine, the Bear King decides to invade the land of men (in the hope of finding his son). Thanks to his powerful army and the help of a wizard, he will succeed at both quests but he will soon find out that bears are not meant to live in the land of men.', 'Our story starts with Tonio, the son the bears King, being kidnapped by some hunters in the Sicilian mountains. Because of the harshness of a winter that threatens its clan with famine, the Bear King decides to invade the land of men (in the hope of finding his son). Thanks to his powerful army and the help of a wizard, he will succeed at both quests but he will soon find out that bears are not meant to live in the land of men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmSLN2bNCQ8fEex3rEw7GobJP3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537655'),
