  ('423112797086368465', 'The Beasts', 1980, 'Horror, Crime', 'Bob Thompson, Dennis Yu Wan-Kwong, Stanley Kwan Kam-Pang', 'Dang Lee, Eddie Fong Ling-Ching', 'Eddie Chen, Patricia Chong Jing-Yee, Wong Ching, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Chan Sing, Paul Chung Biu-Law, Siu Ling Wong, Kwan Kam-Ming', null, 'A father seeks revenge from a gang of thugs who raped his daughter and murdered his son.', 'A father seeks revenge from a gang of thugs who raped his daughter and murdered his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uuM4eRICCix2niNH05CXgUkYTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141883'),
  ('490678875265574253', 'The Beasts', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Alejandro de Pablo, Curro González-Cebrián', 'Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Isabel Peña', 'Marina Foïs, Denis Ménochet, Luis Zahera, Diego Anido, Marie Colomb, Machi Salgado, David Menéndez, Luisa Merelas', 'NR', 'Antoine and Olga, a French couple, have been living in a small village in Galicia for a long time. They practice eco-responsible agriculture and restore abandoned houses to facilitate repopulation. Everything should be idyllic except for their opposition to a wind turbine project that creates a serious conflict with their neighbors. The tension will rise to the point of irreparability.', 'Antoine and Olga, a French couple, have been living in a small village in Galicia for a long time. They practice eco-responsible agriculture and restore abandoned houses to facilitate repopulation. Everything should be idyllic except for their opposition to a wind turbine project that creates a serious conflict with their neighbors. The tension will rise to the point of irreparability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytWMRYLlusyzMFFjyuFRY1liteR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848685'),
  ('743189054659542972', 'The Beasts'' Carnival', 1980, 'Crime, Horror', 'Paul Naschy, Alejandro Ulloa, Sebastián Almeida', 'Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Eiko Nagashima, Lautaro Murúa, Silvia Aguilar, Azucena Hernández, Julia Saly, Luis Ciges, Rafael Hernández', null, 'A hit man working for the Yakuza double crosses his employers and flees with a cache of diamonds from the latest heist. Injured and hiding in the mountain regions of Spain, with Japanese assassins in hot pursuit, he takes refuge in the home of a local doctor and his two daughters who nurse him back to health and hide him from his pursuers, taking drastic and murderous measures to protect him... for they have plans of their own in store for their current guest.', 'A hit man working for the Yakuza double crosses his employers and flees with a cache of diamonds from the latest heist. Injured and hiding in the mountain regions of Spain, with Japanese assassins in hot pursuit, he takes refuge in the home of a local doctor and his two daughters who nurse him back to health and hide him from his pursuers, taking drastic and murderous measures to protect him... for they have plans of their own in store for their current guest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7FdW40VN4a2DI7aHTcgWHgw3js.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29910'),
  ('582323034807239092', 'The Beat Generation', 1959, 'Crime', 'Walter Castle, Charles F. Haas', 'Richard Matheson, Lewis Meltzer', 'Steve Cochran, Mamie Van Doren, Ray Danton, Fay Spain, Louis Armstrong, Margaret Hayes, Jackie Coogan, James Mitchum', null, 'A group of beatniks unwittingly harbor a serial rapist. A cop goes after him after his wife is attacked.', 'A group of beatniks unwittingly harbor a serial rapist. A cop goes after him after his wife is attacked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yphQUePKEE2DjBKby0cCtCUJSGc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37066'),
  ('220867469404301654', 'The Beat That My Heart Skipped', 2005, 'Drama, Crime', 'Stéphane Fontaine, Jacques Audiard', 'Jacques Audiard, Tonino Benacquista', 'Romain Duris, Niels Arestrup, Jonathan Zaccaï, Gilles Cohen, Linh-Dan Pham, Aure Atika, Emmanuelle Devos, Anton Yakovlev', 'NR', 'A ruthless real estate agent discovers a passion for piano and auditions with help from a young virtuoso, but the pressures of his corrupt career threaten to derail his musical aspirations.', 'A ruthless real estate agent discovers a passion for piano and auditions with help from a young virtuoso, but the pressures of his corrupt career threaten to derail his musical aspirations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4Y1WJMUP6w2hZo5FnQdZL3OWjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1553'),
  ('476806017383676357', 'The Beatles and India', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Ajoy Bhose, Peter Compton', null, 'Paul McCartney, John Lennon, George Harrison, Ringo Starr', null, 'Explores the The Beatles’ love affair with India, its religions and its culture and, in turn, the impact of their music and style on a young generation in India.', 'Explores the The Beatles’ love affair with India, its religions and its culture and, in turn, the impact of their music and style on a young generation in India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tMTK0N0fCRvBRdNdl1vOXup5Fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820453'),
  ('345423687240190876', 'The Beatles at Shea Stadium', 1977, 'Music, Documentary', 'Robert Precht', null, 'John Lennon, George Harrison, Ringo Starr, Paul McCartney, Ed Sullivan', null, 'The Beatles at Shea Stadium is a fifty-minute-long documentary of the Beatles'' 1965 concert at Shea Stadium in New York, the highlight of the group''s 1965 tour.', 'The Beatles at Shea Stadium is a fifty-minute-long documentary of the Beatles'' 1965 concert at Shea Stadium in New York, the highlight of the group''s 1965 tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbxyojYqIAfIzrZlltCYzpqK4iK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72396'),
  ('685590113624358619', 'The Beatles: Eight Days a Week - The Touring Years', 2016, 'Documentary, Music', 'Ron Howard, Caleb Deschanel, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Mark Monroe, P.G. Morgan', 'Paul McCartney, Ringo Starr, Larry Kane, Whoopi Goldberg, Elvis Costello, Eddie Izzard, Sigourney Weaver, Richard Lester', 'NR', 'The Beatles stormed through Europe''s music scene in 1963, and, in 1964, they conquered America. Their groundbreaking world tours changed global youth culture forever and, arguably, invented mass entertainment as we know it today. All the while, the group were composing and recording a series of extraordinarily successful singles and albums. However the relentless pressure of such unprecedented fame, that in 1966 became uncontrollable turmoil, led to the decision to stop touring. In the ensuing years The Beatles were then free to focus on a series of albums that changed the face of recorded music.', 'The Beatles stormed through Europe''s music scene in 1963, and, in 1964, they conquered America. Their groundbreaking world tours changed global youth culture forever and, arguably, invented mass entertainment as we know it today. All the while, the group were composing and recording a series of extraordinarily successful singles and albums. However the relentless pressure of such unprecedented fame, that in 1966 became uncontrollable turmoil, led to the decision to stop touring. In the ensuing years The Beatles were then free to focus on a series of albums that changed the face of recorded music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6q7Jy4vXgXXoCoHX4lpCaKvcMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391698'),
  ('1042385000217529798', 'The Beatles: Get Back - The Rooftop Concert', 2022, 'Music, Documentary', 'Peter Jackson, Anthony B. Richmond', null, 'John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison, Ringo Starr, Billy Preston, Yoko Ono, Michael Lindsay-Hogg, George Martin', 'PG-13', 'On the 30th of January, 1969, the Beatles performed an unannounced concert from the rooftop of their Apple Corps headquarters at Savile Row, within central London''s office and fashion district. Experience the final and unforgettable iconic performance of The Beatles in a special 60-minute presentation, digitally remastered into the image and sound quality of IMAX DMR technology.', 'On the 30th of January, 1969, the Beatles performed an unannounced concert from the rooftop of their Apple Corps headquarters at Savile Row, within central London''s office and fashion district. Experience the final and unforgettable iconic performance of The Beatles in a special 60-minute presentation, digitally remastered into the image and sound quality of IMAX DMR technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MPsj31FTnfXg1NO93lzr3PqNuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923403'),
  ('802966162785703483', 'The Beatniks', 1959, 'Drama, Crime', 'Paul Frees, Murray De Atley, Richard Taylor', 'Paul Frees', 'Tony Travis, Karen Kadler, Peter Breck, Joyce Terry, Bob Wells, Sam Edwards, Charles Delaney, Claude Stroud', null, 'A young singer''s chance at fame is threatened by his hoodlum pals.', 'A young singer''s chance at fame is threatened by his hoodlum pals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ghqUJ9lh0wxoNxo69tIgR6hO6j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89751'),
  ('546434442767355019', 'The Beau Brummels', 1928, 'Comedy, Music', 'Sam Lee, Al Shaw', null, 'Al Shaw, Sam Lee', null, 'Vaudeville team Shaw &amp; Lee sing songs and tell jokes in hilarious deadpan.', 'Vaudeville team Shaw &amp; Lee sing songs and tell jokes in hilarious deadpan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UQSPTSdyZzYs0fIAOlVxGrx7oJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138917'),
  ('751527489770361233', 'The Beautician and the Beast', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ken Kwapis, Christina Fong, Peter Lyons Collister', 'Todd Graff', 'Fran Drescher, Timothy Dalton, Michael Lerner, Ian McNeice, Patrick Malahide, Lisa Jakub, Tamara Mello, Phyllis Newman', 'PG', 'A New York City beautician is mistakenly hired as the school teacher for the children of the president of a small Eastern European country.', 'A New York City beautician is mistakenly hired as the school teacher for the children of the president of a small Eastern European country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2RaTrqoPvD4eYEaZCyF0zFbbpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17894'),
  ('478294818147539045', 'The Beautiful Beast', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Karim Hussain, Karim Hussain', 'Marie-Claire Blais, Karim Hussain', 'Carole Laure, Caroline Dhavernas, Marc-André Grondin, David La Haye, Sébastien Huberdeau, Ludivine Reding, Normand Lévesque, Nicolas Girard Deltruc', null, 'Louise, a widow, lives with her son Patrice and her daughter Isabelle-Marie in a house in the country. All her affection is directed towards her son, who is socially dysfunctional but very handsome. In contrast, Louise neglects her daughter, whom she considers ugly. However, their small, obsessed universe is soon interrupted by a blind boy and an elegant fop from the outside world.', 'Louise, a widow, lives with her son Patrice and her daughter Isabelle-Marie in a house in the country. All her affection is directed towards her son, who is socially dysfunctional but very handsome. In contrast, Louise neglects her daughter, whom she considers ugly. However, their small, obsessed universe is soon interrupted by a blind boy and an elegant fop from the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qsAMpqH6223IbIEE242QPEeX7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85537'),
  ('619226936107436328', 'The Beautiful Blonde from Bashful Bend', 1949, 'Comedy, Western, Romance', 'Preston Sturges, Harry Jackson', 'Preston Sturges', 'Betty Grable, Cesar Romero, Rudy Vallee, Olga San Juan, Porter Hall, Hugh Herbert, Al Bridge, El Brendel', 'NR', 'Saloon-bar singer Freddie gets very angry whenever boyfriend Blackie seems to be playing around. She always packs a six-shooter, so this is bad news for anything that happens to be in the way. As this is usually the local judge''s rear-end, Freddie and friend Conchita are soon hiding out teaching school in the middle of nowhere.', 'Saloon-bar singer Freddie gets very angry whenever boyfriend Blackie seems to be playing around. She always packs a six-shooter, so this is bad news for anything that happens to be in the way. As this is usually the local judge''s rear-end, Freddie and friend Conchita are soon hiding out teaching school in the middle of nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1KfxkEjXD69aFSzHKnfeY5alZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56131'),
  ('22123264887466734', 'The Beautiful Country', 2004, 'Drama', 'Hans Petter Moland, Stuart Dryburgh', 'Sabina Murray', 'Damien Nguyen, Bai Ling, Nick Nolte, Tim Roth, Temuera Morrison, Thu An, Kim Xuân, Vũ Tăng', null, 'After reuniting with his mother in Ho Chi Minh City, a family tragedy causes Binh to flee from Viet Nam to America. Landing in New York, Binh begins a road trip to Texas, where his American father is said to live.', 'After reuniting with his mother in Ho Chi Minh City, a family tragedy causes Binh to flee from Viet Nam to America. Landing in New York, Binh begins a road trip to Texas, where his American father is said to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyPJuYz3c8kL7FcjfJDoB2o5yVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41714'),
  ('904180096990026076', 'The Beautiful Days of Aranjuez', 2016, 'Drama', 'Wim Wenders, Benoît Debie, Léocadie Handke', 'Wim Wenders', 'Reda Kateb, Sophie Semin, Jens Harzer, Nick Cave, Peter Handke', null, 'A man and a woman share their musings on love and freedom one summer night. The couple’s conversation meanders through memories, unspoken desires and passion through poetic dialogue.', 'A man and a woman share their musings on love and freedom one summer night. The couple’s conversation meanders through memories, unspoken desires and passion through poetic dialogue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfBFRuVg5ZL9hYJik2k7QP5va2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351414'),
  ('1048586376357766918', 'The Beautiful Game', 2024, 'Drama', 'Thea Sharrock, Anthony Steven Visciglia, Mike Eley', 'Frank Cottrell Boyce', 'Bill Nighy, Micheal Ward, Valeria Golino, Susan Wokoma, Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Callum Scott Howells, Kit Young, Sheyi Cole', 'PG-13', 'A group of advocates to end homelessness organize an annual tournament for homeless people to compete in a series of football matches known as The Homeless World Cup.', 'A group of advocates to end homelessness organize an annual tournament for homeless people to compete in a series of football matches known as The Homeless World Cup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Laz0p3Qg47vI2XIalpL2SlNUDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857655'),
  ('15831636394780486', 'The Beautiful Person', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christophe Honoré, Laurent Brunet', 'Christophe Honoré, Gilles Taurand', 'Léa Seydoux, Louis Garrel, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Simon Truxillo, Agathe Bonitzer, Jean-Michel Portal, Valérie Lang, Jacob Lyon', null, 'In the wake of her mother''s tragic death, French teenager Junie transfers to a different high school. Though Junie lives mostly inside her own head, her beauty and stoicism win her the attention of the entire male student population. Junie begins dating the gentle Otto Cleves, but finds herself intensely drawn to her youthful Italian language teacher, Nemours. When Nemours begins to reciprocate, serious complications ensue.', 'In the wake of her mother''s tragic death, French teenager Junie transfers to a different high school. Though Junie lives mostly inside her own head, her beauty and stoicism win her the attention of the entire male student population. Junie begins dating the gentle Otto Cleves, but finds herself intensely drawn to her youthful Italian language teacher, Nemours. When Nemours begins to reciprocate, serious complications ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRMvvfrRL7VDeLOMusggY1RC8pb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38846'),
  ('149090909222048939', 'The Beautiful Prisoner', 1983, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet, Henri Alekan', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet', 'Daniel Mesguich, Gabrielle Lazure, Cyrielle Clair, Daniel Emilfork, Roland Dubillard, François Chaumette, Arielle Dombasle, Gilles Arbona', null, 'Walter is told by his boss, Sara, to deliver an urgent letter to Henri de Corinthe. On the way he finds a beautiful woman he had been eying in a nightclub, lying in the road, bound up. He takes her to a villa to get a doctor, and ends up being locked in a bedroom with her. While she is making love to him, he has visions of surrealistic images from René Magritte''s paintings. In the morning, the girl, Marie-Ange, has vanished, the villa looks derelict, and his neck is bleeding. Was it all just a nightmare?', 'Walter is told by his boss, Sara, to deliver an urgent letter to Henri de Corinthe. On the way he finds a beautiful woman he had been eying in a nightclub, lying in the road, bound up. He takes her to a villa to get a doctor, and ends up being locked in a bedroom with her. While she is making love to him, he has visions of surrealistic images from René Magritte''s paintings. In the morning, the girl, Marie-Ange, has vanished, the villa looks derelict, and his neck is bleeding. Was it all just a nightmare?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe4P55RqRG2yPcirvHolXxsxDip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104338'),
  ('660790081004369943', 'The Beautiful Sailor', 1932, 'Drama', 'Harry Lachman', 'Marcel Achard', 'Jean Gabin, Madeleine Renaud, Rosine Deréan, Pierre Blanchar, Jean Wall, Charles Lorrain, Hubert Daix', null, 'A barge captain saves Marinette from drowning and soon marries her. On the wedding day, Sylvestre, the captain’s best friend, falls in love with Marinette.', 'A barge captain saves Marinette from drowning and soon marries her. On the wedding day, Sylvestre, the captain’s best friend, falls in love with Marinette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMwG19eai9dDf4XsIHsTb6QitD1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144883'),
  ('107279914071364911', 'The Beautiful Story', 1992, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Claude Lelouch, Jean-Yves Le Mener', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Gérard Lanvin, Béatrice Dalle, Vincent Lindon, Marie-Sophie L., Patrick Chesnais, Jacques Gamblin, Paul Préboist, Amidou', null, 'A film with emphasis on visuals and music, the plot concerns characters who meet in present time, mainly the male gypsy Jesus, and the female thief and con-artist Odona, who share parallel experiences from lives 2000 years in the past. These stories are juxtaposed.', 'A film with emphasis on visuals and music, the plot concerns characters who meet in present time, mainly the male gypsy Jesus, and the female thief and con-artist Odona, who share parallel experiences from lives 2000 years in the past. These stories are juxtaposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNKRikAtpG6dXE8JUmUo8XVbfSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45777'),
  ('538720404251344574', 'The Beautiful Summer', 2023, 'Drama', 'Laura Luchetti, Diego Romero Suárez-Llanos', 'Laura Luchetti', 'Yle Vianello, Deva Cassel, Nicolas Maupas, Alessandro Piavani, Adrien Dewitte, Cosima Centurioni, Gabriele Graham Gasco, Anna Bellato', null, 'Seventeen-year-old Ginia leaves the countryside in search of a new life in Turin. Restless and seeking adventure, Ginia soon finds it in the beautiful, enigmatic Amelia, whose sensuality and confidence embolden her to begin modeling for the bohemian artists in their circle. A whirlwind affair ensues, and the young seamstress finds herself swept up in an unfamiliar and exciting world of discovery.', 'Seventeen-year-old Ginia leaves the countryside in search of a new life in Turin. Restless and seeking adventure, Ginia soon finds it in the beautiful, enigmatic Amelia, whose sensuality and confidence embolden her to begin modeling for the bohemian artists in their circle. A whirlwind affair ensues, and the young seamstress finds herself swept up in an unfamiliar and exciting world of discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcE4o7iyqttKqP5AP7rXYT9Ypu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1043997'),
  ('719037460842273262', 'The Beautiful Washing Machine', 2004, null, 'James Lee, Teoh Gay Hian', 'James Lee', 'Bok Lai Loh, Ho Yuhang, Berg Lee, Danny Lim, Len Siew Mee, Patrick Teoh', null, 'Teoh is dumped by his live-in girlfriend who takes all her possessions, including the washing machine. He buys a second-hand machine, which is when things go wrong.', 'Teoh is dumped by his live-in girlfriend who takes all her possessions, including the washing machine. He buys a second-hand machine, which is when things go wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLKUtBiGTVzyhg2xbK5xIbLS44P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182856'),
  ('640079510343247368', 'The Beauty', 1969, 'Drama, Family', 'Algimantas Mockus, Arūnas Žebriūnas', 'Yuri Yakovlev', 'Inga Mickytė, Lilija Žadeikytė, Arvydas Samukas, Tauras Ragalevičius, Sergei Martinson, Gražina Baikštytė, Gediminas Girdvainis, Vladas Jurkūnas', null, 'Little Inga considers herself pretty and is pampered by her mother and other children in her housing block, until a new boy with questionable habits arrives and calls her ugly to her face.', 'Little Inga considers herself pretty and is pampered by her mother and other children in her housing block, until a new boy with questionable habits arrives and calls her ugly to her face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQyRpHjrA199GulfxNcpLtVV9XW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342898'),
  ('681321100939139324', 'The Beauty and the Moody', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Juan Carlos Vásquez, Alfonso Parra', 'Dago García', 'Andrés Castañeda, Lina Tejeiro, Juan Pablo Barragán, Ana Jaraba, Lina Castrillón, Álvaro Bayona, Carmenza Cossio, Diana Belmonte', null, 'Meet Cheo Martinez, the neighbor you do not want to have and whose time has come when his neighbors, tired of putting up with him, hire Carolina Rico, a beautiful and audacious escort, to make him fall in love and get him out of the building. What will happen when Cheo falls into the tricks of love and Carolina’s dark past reaches her?', 'Meet Cheo Martinez, the neighbor you do not want to have and whose time has come when his neighbors, tired of putting up with him, hire Carolina Rico, a beautiful and audacious escort, to make him fall in love and get him out of the building. What will happen when Cheo falls into the tricks of love and Carolina’s dark past reaches her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/em2LVkDDRcNWLexiQDs5JKGfT0x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943158'),
  ('181097557622793274', 'The Beauty and the Paparazzo', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'António-Pedro Vasconcelos, José António Loureiro', 'Tiago R. Santos', 'Soraia Chaves, Marco D''Almeida, Pedro Laginha, Nuno Markl, Virgílio Castelo, Maria João Falcão, Maria João Luís, Ivo Canelas', null, 'Telenovela star Mariana is on the verge of a nervous breakdown: shooting is not going smoothly, her popularity is waning, and she is forever being hounded by paparazzi. Frustrated, Mariana can''t find out who is responsible for these invasions of her privacy. It is the feared ''Paparazzo'' Gabriela Santos, who''s real name is Juan. One day, Juan and Mariana meet by chance and fall in love. Now Juan must do everything he can to prevent Mariana from discovering his true identity.', 'Telenovela star Mariana is on the verge of a nervous breakdown: shooting is not going smoothly, her popularity is waning, and she is forever being hounded by paparazzi. Frustrated, Mariana can''t find out who is responsible for these invasions of her privacy. It is the feared ''Paparazzo'' Gabriela Santos, who''s real name is Juan. One day, Juan and Mariana meet by chance and fall in love. Now Juan must do everything he can to prevent Mariana from discovering his true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zawHxrMPUjbW8vDLcDTCk5pojUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48962'),
  ('599129739980998791', 'The Beauty Inside', 2015, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Hong Seung-chul, Martin Hladík, Hwang Jeong-hyeon', 'Park Jeong-ye, Kim Seon-jeong', 'Han Hyo-joo, Kim Dae-myung, Do Ji-han, Bae Sung-woo, Park Shin-hye, Lee Beom-soo, Park Seo-jun, Kim Sang-ho', null, 'Woo-jin, a furniture designer who wakes up in a different body every day, falls for Yi-soo, a woman he meets through his work.', 'Woo-jin, a furniture designer who wakes up in a different body every day, falls for Yi-soo, a woman he meets through his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5gpjqQwo0h8rMvBLedRXfHHDKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338729'),
  ('130072348263017099', 'The Beauty of Athens', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Nikos Tsiforos, Filippos Fylaktos, Aristeidis Karydis-Fuchs', 'Nikos Tsiforos', 'Mimis Fotopoulos, Georgia Vasileiadou, Nikos Stavridis, Sperantza Vrana, Gelly Mavropoulou, Vasilis Avlonitis, Stavros Xenidis, Velissarios Kondogiannis', null, 'A streetwise guy, according to a will, has to marry an extremely ugly old lady to get the money of the inheritance.So he tries to trick a poor devil into getting married with her.', 'A streetwise guy, according to a will, has to marry an extremely ugly old lady to get the money of the inheritance.So he tries to trick a poor devil into getting married with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kxbd1YrmpmqYNlHMVPYTTzLDAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307709'),
  ('1105787989043695597', 'The Beauty of the Devil', 1950, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'René Clair, Michel Kelber', 'Armand Salacrou', 'Michel Simon, Gérard Philipe, Nicole Besnard, Simone Valère, Carlo Ninchi, Raymond Cordy, Paolo Stoppa, Tullio Carminati', null, 'Henri Faust, retiring after 50 years as a professor in a circa-1700 French university, despairs at the ravages of old age ... whereupon Mephistopheles, agent of Lucifer, appears as a virile, handsome young man and exchanges bodies with him to induce Faust to sign a pact to exchange his soul for renewed youth, riches and power. But though the "new" Faust is attracted by the material improvements in his life, he remains wary of signing, while Mephistopheles, now posing as the aged professor whose body he inhabits, must find a way to trick him into signing the pact - and dissuade him from the love of a gypsy girl who prays for his soul - or find himself damned by his own Master...', 'Henri Faust, retiring after 50 years as a professor in a circa-1700 French university, despairs at the ravages of old age ... whereupon Mephistopheles, agent of Lucifer, appears as a virile, handsome young man and exchanges bodies with him to induce Faust to sign a pact to exchange his soul for renewed youth, riches and power. But though the "new" Faust is attracted by the material improvements in his life, he remains wary of signing, while Mephistopheles, now posing as the aged professor whose body he inhabits, must find a way to trick him into signing the pact - and dissuade him from the love of a gypsy girl who prays for his soul - or find himself damned by his own Master...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amyT9hugNHyGbmFFPUgDWKB3zZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58513'),
  ('474272033050033971', 'The Beauty of Vice', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Radoslav Vladić, Živko Nikolić', 'Živko Nikolić', 'Mira Furlan, Milutin ''Mima'' Karadžić, Petar Božović, Alain Noury, Ines Kotman, Mira Banjac, Eva Ras, Dobrila Ćirković', null, 'In the mountains of Montenegro people have lived by strict and Draconian laws for centuries, almost untouched by modern civilization. However, a young couple are going to seek their fortune on the more liberal coast and there they find jobs in the nudist colony. Hundreds of naked bodies and atmosphere of joie d''vivre make the husband and wife question their rigid way of life.', 'In the mountains of Montenegro people have lived by strict and Draconian laws for centuries, almost untouched by modern civilization. However, a young couple are going to seek their fortune on the more liberal coast and there they find jobs in the nudist colony. Hundreds of naked bodies and atmosphere of joie d''vivre make the husband and wife question their rigid way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpM2lbfua9HT5RiheMqZXzdvHPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4560'),
  ('468804341705347057', 'The Beaver', 2011, 'Drama', 'Mirashyam Blakeslee, Francisco Ortiz, Doug Torres', 'Kyle Killen', 'Mel Gibson, Jodie Foster, Jennifer Lawrence, Anton Yelchin, Zachary Booth, Riley Thomas Stewart, Kelly Coffield Park, Cherry Jones', 'PG-13', 'Suffering from a severe case of depression, toy company CEO Walter Black begins using a beaver hand puppet to help him open up to his family. With his father seemingly going insane, adolescent son Porter pushes for his parents to get a divorce.', 'Suffering from a severe case of depression, toy company CEO Walter Black begins using a beaver hand puppet to help him open up to his family. With his father seemingly going insane, adolescent son Porter pushes for his parents to get a divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlaWgS7iIb6MG3t0FitV1xdPqIV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50780'),
  ('545457634757456846', 'The Beckham Feud: Truth & Lies', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Perez Hilton, Rebecca Loos, Mayah Riaz', null, 'The documentary investigates the explosive rift between David and Victoria Beckham and their son Brooklyn Peltz Beckham', 'The documentary investigates the explosive rift between David and Victoria Beckham and their son Brooklyn Peltz Beckham', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fmpxh5ATiWe7cjOCSKnncY29YRsU.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-beckham-feud-truth-and-lies-2026-1'),
  ('229572046508256073', 'The Beckoning', 2009, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Elio Quiroga', 'Elio Quiroga', 'Ana Torrent, Francisco Boira, Héctor Colomé, Rocío Muñoz-Cobo, Francisco Casares, Julio Perillán', null, 'Francesca is a pediatrician who is dedicated to both motherhood and children, married to another physician, Pedro. After the birth of a new child, Francesca begins to suffer from postpartum depression. Following the advice of friend and psychiatrist Jean, the couple move to a new home away from the city…', 'Francesca is a pediatrician who is dedicated to both motherhood and children, married to another physician, Pedro. After the birth of a new child, Francesca begins to suffer from postpartum depression. Following the advice of friend and psychiatrist Jean, the couple move to a new home away from the city…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLANgbaulRfGfhthqwGLQkCOooh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35212'),
  ('689469351896694276', 'The Beckoning Silence', 2007, 'Documentary, Action, Drama', 'Louise Osmond', null, 'Andreas Abegglen, Simon Anthamatten, Cyrille Berthod, Steven Mackintosh, Roger Schäli, Joe Simpson', null, 'In The Beckoning Silence, Joe Simpson, whose amazing battle for survival featured in the multi-award winning "Touching the Void", travels to the treacherous North Face of the Eiger to tell the story of one of mountaineering''s most epic tragedies. As a child, it was this story and that of one of the climbers in particular, that first captured Simpson''s imagination and inspired him to take up mountaineering.', 'In The Beckoning Silence, Joe Simpson, whose amazing battle for survival featured in the multi-award winning "Touching the Void", travels to the treacherous North Face of the Eiger to tell the story of one of mountaineering''s most epic tragedies. As a child, it was this story and that of one of the climbers in particular, that first captured Simpson''s imagination and inspired him to take up mountaineering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwmxQfgAtB1NOCjt439oYyv0gPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58820'),
  ('532419692783201414', 'The Bed', 1967, null, 'James Broughton, Bill Desloge', null, null, null, 'James Broughton''s counterculture masterpiece about nudity and a bed.', 'James Broughton''s counterculture masterpiece about nudity and a bed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkJKSuMdVyGYb5I2sEUieaoxTIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282865'),
  ('705580270481232706', 'The Bed Hostesses', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Ingrid Steeger, Karin Hofmann, Christa Free, Monica Marc, Kurt Meinicke, Kenita Flynn, Tiara Moana, Carlo Monti', null, 'A man of many occupations -- who gets "all the women" -- describes sex he''s seen and some sex he''s had to a movie producer.', 'A man of many occupations -- who gets "all the women" -- describes sex he''s seen and some sex he''s had to a movie producer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NkGpsvvRLvdkIL5DI3DIO77BXa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170749'),
  ('1143241331613257688', 'The Bed Sitting Room', 1969, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Richard Lester, David Watkin, Richard Burgess', 'John Antrobus', 'Ralph Richardson, Rita Tushingham, Michael Hordern, Arthur Lowe, Mona Washbourne, Richard Warwick, Peter Cook, Dudley Moore', 'R', 'In the hazy aftermath of World War III, the fallout from a ''nuclear misunderstanding'' is producing strange mutations amongst the survivors, and the noble Lord Fortnum finds himself transforming into a bed sitting room.', 'In the hazy aftermath of World War III, the fallout from a ''nuclear misunderstanding'' is producing strange mutations amongst the survivors, and the noble Lord Fortnum finds himself transforming into a bed sitting room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2hbnDZI0R8myBsW0MLuA5et0px.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26509'),
  ('345586549881924637', 'The Bed You Sleep In', 1993, 'Drama', 'Jon Jost, Jon Jost', 'Jon Jost', 'Tom Blair, Marshall Gaddis, Ellen McLaughlin, Kate Sannella, Brad Shelton, Thomas Morris', null, 'Times are hard for Northwestern lumber-mill operators like Ray and his wife Jean. Ray and Jean''s lives are thrown into chaos when their daughter writes home from college, claiming to have a horrifying revelation.', 'Times are hard for Northwestern lumber-mill operators like Ray and his wife Jean. Ray and Jean''s lives are thrown into chaos when their daughter writes home from college, claiming to have a horrifying revelation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LHDaKKYuSditXVIEqmJtfYam77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220500'),
  ('518266727632489117', 'The Bedford Incident', 1965, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, War', 'James B. Harris, Gilbert Taylor, Lionel Couch', 'James Poe', 'Richard Widmark, Sidney Poitier, James MacArthur, Martin Balsam, Wally Cox, Eric Portman, Michael Kane, Gary Cockrell', 'PG', 'During a routine patrol, a reporter is given permission to interview a hardened cold-war warrior and captain of the American destroyer USS Bedford. The reporter gets more than he bargained for when the Bedford discovers a Soviet sub and the captain begins a relentless pursuit, pushing his crew to breaking point.', 'During a routine patrol, a reporter is given permission to interview a hardened cold-war warrior and captain of the American destroyer USS Bedford. The reporter gets more than he bargained for when the Bedford discovers a Soviet sub and the captain begins a relentless pursuit, pushing his crew to breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRs46zijLxcXQ3MXu1UwU3dz8GU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17744'),
  ('25823538381536231', 'The Bedroom Window', 1987, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Curtis Hanson, Leigh Webb, Barbara Bruno', 'Curtis Hanson', 'Steve Guttenberg, Elizabeth McGovern, Isabelle Huppert, Paul Shenar, Carl Lumbly, Wallace Shawn, Frederick Coffin, Brad Greenquist', 'R', 'Baltimore, Maryland. Sylvia sees a girl being attacked from her lover Terry''s bedroom window. The assailant flees and his victim is saved. But that same night another girl is found murdered.', 'Baltimore, Maryland. Sylvia sees a girl being attacked from her lover Terry''s bedroom window. The assailant flees and his victim is saved. But that same night another girl is found murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JT5mzLBuABKqDNvCvfnjrvYQC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39074'),
  ('593391244942892966', 'The Bedside Detective', 2007, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Pramett Chankrasse, Khomkrit Treewimol', 'Benjamaporn Srabua', 'Sunny Suwanmethanon, Pattarasaya Kreursuwansiri, Panissara Arayaskul, Chaleumpol Tikumpornteerawong, Daraneenute Pasutanavin, Jarupus Pattamasiri, Prakasit Bosuwan, Sumet Ong-ard', null, 'An apprentice private detective is hired to gather evidence of a wealthy man''s infidelity but falls in love with his target''s adorable girlfriend.', 'An apprentice private detective is hired to gather evidence of a wealthy man''s infidelity but falls in love with his target''s adorable girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a98VwtqaSz6tShPluIPjPxuwBLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76429'),
  ('484453262148146591', 'The Bee Gees: How Can You Mend a Broken Heart', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Frank Marshall, Michael Dwyer', 'Mark Monroe', 'Barry Gibb, Andy Gibb, Maurice Gibb, Robin Gibb, Lulu, Noel Gallagher, Chris Martin, Mark Ronson', 'R', 'The story of the triumphs and hurdles of brothers Barry, Maurice, and Robin Gibb, otherwise known as the Bee Gees. The iconic trio, who found early fame in the 1960s, went on to write over 1,000 songs and have 20 No. 1 hits throughout their career, transcending more than five decades of changing tastes and styles.', 'The story of the triumphs and hurdles of brothers Barry, Maurice, and Robin Gibb, otherwise known as the Bee Gees. The iconic trio, who found early fame in the 1960s, went on to write over 1,000 songs and have 20 No. 1 hits throughout their career, transcending more than five decades of changing tastes and styles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jltze3h9mbkw98PAmZite5QLE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730009'),
  ('594611037226199814', 'The Beehive', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mario Camus, Benito Rabal, Amaya Echevarría', 'José Luis Dibildos', 'Ana Belén, Concha Velasco, Victoria Abril, Francisco Rabal, Mario Pardo, Fiorella Faltoyano, José «Saza» Sazatornil, José Luis López Vázquez', null, 'As in the novel of the same title from Camilo Jose Cela, "La Colmena" is a sad composition with the stories of many people in the Madrid of 1942, just the postwar of the spanish civil war. The main theme of the film is the contrast between the poets, surviving close to misery under the Franco''s regime, and the winners of the war, the emerging class of the people that makes easy money with illegal business.', 'As in the novel of the same title from Camilo Jose Cela, "La Colmena" is a sad composition with the stories of many people in the Madrid of 1942, just the postwar of the spanish civil war. The main theme of the film is the contrast between the poets, surviving close to misery under the Franco''s regime, and the winners of the war, the emerging class of the people that makes easy money with illegal business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJUO2vceur1qsSH7EyfIPzzMs2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104435'),
  ('1043693448094659053', 'The Beekeeper', 1986, 'Drama', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Tonino Guerra, Dimitris Nollas', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Nadia Mourouzi, Serge Reggiani, Jenny Roussea, Dinos Iliopoulos, Vasia Panagopoulou, Iakovos Panotas, Stamatis Gardelis', null, 'Following the wedding of his daughter, stone-faced beekeeper Spyros makes an annual journey from the north of Greece to the south, traveling along with his hives. En route, he meets an erratic, young female drifter, with whom he strikes up an unusual, self-destructive relationship.', 'Following the wedding of his daughter, stone-faced beekeeper Spyros makes an annual journey from the north of Greece to the south, traveling along with his hives. En route, he meets an erratic, young female drifter, with whom he strikes up an unusual, self-destructive relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owuAPJZlkBTTyDkmolF6gRyfsZs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48210'),
  ('800359854665288030', 'The Beekeeper', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Philippa Howson, Gabriel Beristain, Vanluke Watson', 'Kurt Wimmer', 'Jason Statham, Emmy Raver-Lampman, Josh Hutcherson, Jeremy Irons, Bobby Naderi, David Witts, Michael Epp, Taylor James', 'R', 'One man''s campaign for vengeance takes on national stakes after he is revealed to be a former operative of a powerful and clandestine organization known as Beekeepers.', 'One man''s campaign for vengeance takes on national stakes after he is revealed to be a former operative of a powerful and clandestine organization known as Beekeepers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7EByudX0eOzlkQ2FIbogzyazm2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866398'),
  ('844430664153532344', 'The Beekeeper 2', 2027, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Timo Tjahjanto, Callan Green, Steve Griffin', 'Kurt Wimmer', 'Jason Statham, Jeremy Irons, Yara Shahidi, Emmy Raver-Lampman, Bobby Naderi, Jemma Redgrave, Pom Klementieff, Adam Copeland', null, 'The second installment in the franchise. Plot TBA.', 'The second installment in the franchise. Plot TBA.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1440769'),
  ('960074198992344138', 'The Bees', 1978, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Alfredo Zacarías, León Sánchez', null, 'John Saxon, Angel Tompkins, John Carradine, Claudio Brook, Alicia Encinas, José Chávez, Julio César Imbert, Armando Martín', 'PG', 'Corporate smuggling of South American killer bees into the United States results in huge swarms terrorizing the northern hemisphere. A small team of scientists work desperately to destroy the threat, but the bees soon mutate into a super-intelligent species that threatens the world.', 'Corporate smuggling of South American killer bees into the United States results in huge swarms terrorizing the northern hemisphere. A small team of scientists work desperately to destroy the threat, but the bees soon mutate into a super-intelligent species that threatens the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4H3odEasZuZKDimxDMUafm8T8a9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29342'),
  ('829269162550706263', 'The Beggar', 1983, 'Comedy, Romance, Action', 'Ahmed El-Sabawy, Ghonim Bahnasy', 'Samir Abdelazim', 'Adel Emam, Esaad Younes, Waheid Seif, Ahmad Rateb, Sayed Zayan, Hayatem, Ali Al Sharif, Salah Nazmi', null, 'After failing to find stable work in Cairo, Hassanein joins a group of beggars and unwittingly becomes involved with a corrupt businessman who suspects him of being a police informant.', 'After failing to find stable work in Cairo, Hassanein joins a group of beggars and unwittingly becomes involved with a corrupt businessman who suspects him of being a police informant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfuWyLANDgXOf0KEfLR4ay68UTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86586'),
  ('191599971114245671', 'The Beginner', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Sigi Rothemund, Heinz Hölscher', 'Mike Krüger, Thomas Gottschalk', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Mike Krüger, Anja Kruse, Sylvia Engelmann, Ankie Lau, Kurt Weinzierl, Gerd Baltus, Eiji Kusuhara', null, 'Movie fan Mike has invented a machine with which he is able to take part in every movie which is currently running on his video tape recorder. But he and his friend Tommy are watched while trying out this new device and soon two electronic companies are on their trail to discover the secret of this invention.', 'Movie fan Mike has invented a machine with which he is able to take part in every movie which is currently running on his video tape recorder. But he and his friend Tommy are watched while trying out this new device and soon two electronic companies are on their trail to discover the secret of this invention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzDCUch6Nchs7hPxURsl5Hnfw4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10853'),
  ('1122916114748453077', 'The Beginning', 1970, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Gleb Panfilov, Dmitriy Dolinin, Galina Gavrilova', 'Gleb Panfilov, Yevgeni Gabrilovich', 'Inna Churikova, Valentina Telichkina, Tatyana Stepanova, Leonid Kuravlyov, Mikhail Kononov, Nina Skomorokhova, Tatyana Bedova, Yuri Klepikov', null, 'A talented girl from the provincial Russian town Pasha Stroganova dreams of becoming an actress. She plays the role of Baba Yaga in the amateur theatre — and does it so organically that the visiting filmmaker offers her the most difficult role in the historical drama about Joan of Arc. She was given not only great acting talent, but the talent of deep, selfless love. A dream comes true: she is invited to the main role, and she begins a completely different life, full of real creative torment, insights and true happiness.', 'A talented girl from the provincial Russian town Pasha Stroganova dreams of becoming an actress. She plays the role of Baba Yaga in the amateur theatre — and does it so organically that the visiting filmmaker offers her the most difficult role in the historical drama about Joan of Arc. She was given not only great acting talent, but the talent of deep, selfless love. A dream comes true: she is invited to the main role, and she begins a completely different life, full of real creative torment, insights and true happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7dV0vBs6JCPdZ9jNV2aBoT21tI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83475'),
  ('271500246203767471', 'The Beginning', 1986, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Atef Ibrahim, Salah Abu Seif, Mohsen Ahmed', 'Salah Abu Seif, Lenin EL Ramly', 'Ahmed Zaki, Yousra, Gamil Ratib, Safia ElEmary, Souad Nasr, Hamdy Ahmed, Sabry Abdelmonem, Samir Waheed', null, 'After a crash, a group of passengers are stranded in the desert. They attempt to cope with their new conditions as the most privileged of them all, an overpaid lawyer, declares himself a dictator of the nearby oasis and names it after him.', 'After a crash, a group of passengers are stranded in the desert. They attempt to cope with their new conditions as the most privileged of them all, an overpaid lawyer, declares himself a dictator of the nearby oasis and names it after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92dEJT78D7Bz0Veb3xlXXIKr6jt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469144'),
  ('719924044682050412', 'The Beginning and the End', 1994, 'Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Claudio Rocha', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Julieta Egurrola, Ernesto Laguardia, Bruno Bichir, Lucía Muñoz, Alberto Estrella, Verónica Merchant, Luis Felipe Tovar, Blanca Guerra', null, 'The film tells the story of the Boteros, a middle-class Mexican family struggling against poverty after their father''s death. Ignacia (Egurrola) is the Boteros mother, a desperate woman who chooses to sacrifice the destiny of her three older children, in order to protect Gabriel (Laguardia) the youngest one. She believes Gabriel will climb the social structure and bring back the lost fortune to the family. But destiny has other plans for the Boteros and tragedy will overcome eventually. Based on the novel of Nobel Prize winner Naguib Mahfouz.', 'The film tells the story of the Boteros, a middle-class Mexican family struggling against poverty after their father''s death. Ignacia (Egurrola) is the Boteros mother, a desperate woman who chooses to sacrifice the destiny of her three older children, in order to protect Gabriel (Laguardia) the youngest one. She believes Gabriel will climb the social structure and bring back the lost fortune to the family. But destiny has other plans for the Boteros and tragedy will overcome eventually. Based on the novel of Nobel Prize winner Naguib Mahfouz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZGl2IsDPla49JbHznr9Ks8KJYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133757'),
  ('982663976786599821', 'The Beginning of Life', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Juliana Borges, Estela Renner, Mari Adela Mitre', null, null, null, 'One of the greatest neuroscience breakthroughs is having discovered that babies are far more than a genetic load. The development of all human beings lies on the combination of genetics, the quality of the relationships and the environment they are set on. The Beginning of Life invites everyone to reflect: are we taking good care of this unique moment, which defines both the present and future of humankind?', 'One of the greatest neuroscience breakthroughs is having discovered that babies are far more than a genetic load. The development of all human beings lies on the combination of genetics, the quality of the relationships and the environment they are set on. The Beginning of Life invites everyone to reflect: are we taking good care of this unique moment, which defines both the present and future of humankind?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9qFCUJh8c5BA6cAKRm73grduRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397093'),
  ('596326713955653590', 'The Beginning or the End', 1947, 'Drama, Documentary, History, War', 'Norman Taurog, Frank E. Myers, Stanley Goldsmith', 'Frank Wead', 'Brian Donlevy, Robert Walker, Tom Drake, Beverly Tyler, Hume Cronyn, Audrey Totter, Hurd Hatfield, Joseph Calleia', 'NR', 'The research, development, and deployment of the first atomic bomb, as well as the bombing of Hiroshima, are detailed in this docudrama.', 'The research, development, and deployment of the first atomic bomb, as well as the bombing of Hiroshima, are detailed in this docudrama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qbbDHxuATQUZBTzFpmvaSt70tr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93151'),
  ('333690274569938253', 'The Beginning: Making Episode I', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Jon Shenk, Jon Shenk', null, 'George Lucas, Jake Lloyd, Steven Spielberg, Ewan McGregor, Ahmed Best, Rick McCallum, Pernilla August, Ray Park', null, 'The entire process of making Star Wars: Episode I - The Phantom Menace (1999) is shown here in this documentary. From pre-production through post-production, we get to see visual effects meetings, John Williams'' music sessions, and even the storm that wiped out the pod-racers & props.', 'The entire process of making Star Wars: Episode I - The Phantom Menace (1999) is shown here in this documentary. From pre-production through post-production, we get to see visual effects meetings, John Williams'' music sessions, and even the storm that wiped out the pod-racers & props.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IuUCEH9C9XYYLPtFGB7A0M0kqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65083'),
  ('375240562267045678', 'The Beguiled', 1971, 'Thriller, Drama, War', 'Don Siegel, Bruce Surtees, Burt Astor', 'Claude Traverse', 'Clint Eastwood, Geraldine Page, Elizabeth Hartman, Jo Ann Harris, Darleen Carr, Mae Mercer, Pamelyn Ferdin, Melody Thomas Scott', 'R', 'Offbeat Civil War drama in which a wounded Yankee soldier, after finding refuge in an isolated girls'' school in the South towards the end of the war, becomes the object of the young women''s sexual fantasies. The soldier manipulates the situation for his own gratification, but when he refuses to completely comply with the girls'' wishes, they make it very difficult for him to leave.', 'Offbeat Civil War drama in which a wounded Yankee soldier, after finding refuge in an isolated girls'' school in the South towards the end of the war, becomes the object of the young women''s sexual fantasies. The soldier manipulates the situation for his own gratification, but when he refuses to completely comply with the girls'' wishes, they make it very difficult for him to leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfYYQxt0rjrgEVTbpBQ2oVWlVfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31906'),
  ('27818818349410987', 'The Beguiled', 2017, 'Drama', 'Sofia Coppola, Philippe Le Sourd, Paul B. Uddo', 'Albert Maltz, Irene Kamp', 'Colin Farrell, Nicole Kidman, Kirsten Dunst, Elle Fanning, Oona Laurence, Angourie Rice, Addison Riecke, Emma Howard', 'R', 'During the Civil War, at a Southern girls’ boarding school, young women take in an injured enemy soldier. As they provide refuge and tend to his wounds, the house is taken over with sexual tension and dangerous rivalries, and taboos are broken in an unexpected turn of events.', 'During the Civil War, at a Southern girls’ boarding school, young women take in an injured enemy soldier. As they provide refuge and tend to his wounds, the house is taken over with sexual tension and dangerous rivalries, and taboos are broken in an unexpected turn of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4R9jyiZhJzevASus5n6WyHQTdR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399019'),
  ('909443468861504716', 'The Beguines', 1972, 'Drama', 'Guy Casaril, Andréas Winding', 'Guy Casaril, Françoise Mallet-Joris', 'Anicée Alvina, Nicole Courcel, Venantino Venantini, Jean Martin, Ginette Leclerc, Harry-Max, Yvonne Clech, Elizabeth Teissier', null, 'Hélène, a fragile and romantic teenager, discovers that her father, a rich business man, has a mistress. Curious, she decides to go and meet this woman who is described as strange. At the first chance she has she goes to her house in the Ramparts of Béguines... from then on she goes back often, discovering a new world of artists and nightowls where she also experiences love in the arms of Tamara.', 'Hélène, a fragile and romantic teenager, discovers that her father, a rich business man, has a mistress. Curious, she decides to go and meet this woman who is described as strange. At the first chance she has she goes to her house in the Ramparts of Béguines... from then on she goes back often, discovering a new world of artists and nightowls where she also experiences love in the arms of Tamara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQ7nxNkQS7IHaNeQP06owhRUi78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442285'),
  ('532363200142248701', 'The Being', 1983, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jackie Kong, Robert Ebinger', 'Jackie Kong', 'Martin Landau, Marianne Gordon, Bill Osco, José Ferrer, Dorothy Malone, Ruth Buzzi, Murray Langston, Kinky Friedman', 'R', 'Toxic waste dumping in a small Idaho town turns a young boy into horrible mutant monster. The town''s police chief and a government scientist team up to stop the monster, which is quickly killing off the town''s citizenry.', 'Toxic waste dumping in a small Idaho town turns a young boy into horrible mutant monster. The town''s police chief and a government scientist team up to stop the monster, which is quickly killing off the town''s citizenry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaiiYALkRbwd3Dl9jF7zEu3JDBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73218'),
  ('891623936816057999', 'The Beldham', 2025, 'Horror', 'Angela Gulner, Ricki Maslar, Sidney Brown', 'Angela Gulner', 'Patricia Heaton, Corbin Bernsen, Katie Parker, Emma Fitzpatrick, Angela Baumgardner, Sabreena Iman, Thesa Loving, Hannah Reese', null, 'At the edge of postpartum psychosis, new mother Harper moves in with her own mother at their family''s rural farmhouse. Soon she finds herself hunted by a threatening monster who has designs on her child.', 'At the edge of postpartum psychosis, new mother Harper moves in with her own mother at their family''s rural farmhouse. Soon she finds herself hunted by a threatening monster who has designs on her child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suY2CNfGwq3kccMZuMA1sXAcNXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1090983'),
  ('929875236446414038', 'The Belgian Job', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Christian Merret-Palmair', 'Alexandre de La Patellière, Matthieu Delaporte', 'François-Xavier Demaison, Anne Marivin, Jean-Luc Couchard, Charlie Dupont, Didier Flamand, Abdelhafid Metalsi, Philippe Hérisson, Xavier Lemaître', null, 'Willy Vander Brook, a world with Franco-Belgian roots, travels to Paris for an interview. He is welcomed by his childhood friend Serge, an ex pub operator, and his roommate Frank, a fierce supporter of the Walloon independence. When Willy discovers that his candidacy is not accepted because he is Belgian, he and his compatriots decide to take revenge', 'Willy Vander Brook, a world with Franco-Belgian roots, travels to Paris for an interview. He is welcomed by his childhood friend Serge, an ex pub operator, and his roommate Frank, a fierce supporter of the Walloon independence. When Willy discovers that his candidacy is not accepted because he is Belgian, he and his compatriots decide to take revenge', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLBQzA5sN1vl5kq37oE187CTjnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94973'),
  ('193218034141332676', 'The Belgian Wave', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Jean Francois Awad, Raphaël Kaddour, Elodie Marchal', 'Jérôme Vandewattyne, Jérôme Di Egidio, Kamal Messaoudi', 'Dominique Rongvaux, Karim Barras, Karen De Paduwa, Freddy Bozzo, Olivia Carrere, Séverine Cayron, Jacques de Pierpont, Thierry Janssen', null, 'This movies examines a period in modern Belgian history which is as heavily mocked as it is revered: the wave of UFO sightings recorded at the end of the 80s.', 'This movies examines a period in modern Belgian history which is as heavily mocked as it is revered: the wave of UFO sightings recorded at the end of the 80s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NRdbUCgxuU9Snp4sl6kNt6gaHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002000'),
  ('424562424687338006', 'The Bélier Family', 2014, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Romain Winding, Eric Lartigau', 'Victoria Bedos, Stanislas Carré de Malberg', 'Louane, Karin Viard, François Damiens, Éric Elmosnino, Roxane Duran, Ilian Bergala, Luca Gelberg, Mar Sodupe', 'PG', 'The whole Bélier family is deaf, except for sixteen year old Paula who is the important translator in her parents'' day to day life especially when it comes to matters concerning the family farm. When her music teacher discovers she has a fantastic singing voice and she gets an opportunity to enter a big Radio France contest the whole family''s future is set up for big changes.', 'The whole Bélier family is deaf, except for sixteen year old Paula who is the important translator in her parents'' day to day life especially when it comes to matters concerning the family farm. When her music teacher discovers she has a fantastic singing voice and she gets an opportunity to enter a big Radio France contest the whole family''s future is set up for big changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAQeZUZ1pMTSjSF3d6eBZClFGgN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304410'),
  ('491849552213430818', 'The Believer', 2001, 'Drama', 'Henry Bean, Jim Denault, Roger M. Bobb', 'Henry Bean', 'Ryan Gosling, Summer Phoenix, Theresa Russell, Billy Zane, Garret Dillahunt, A.D. Miles, Glenn Fitzgerald, Elizabeth Reaser', 'R', 'A hardcore US racist skinhead who, because of his intelligence, leads a gang dedicated to fighting the enemy: the supposed American-Jewish conspiracy for domination. However, he''s hiding a secret: he''s Jewish-born, a brilliant scholar whose questioning of the tenets of his faith has left him angry and confused, turning against those who he thinks have a tragic history of their own making.', 'A hardcore US racist skinhead who, because of his intelligence, leads a gang dedicated to fighting the enemy: the supposed American-Jewish conspiracy for domination. However, he''s hiding a secret: he''s Jewish-born, a brilliant scholar whose questioning of the tenets of his faith has left him angry and confused, turning against those who he thinks have a tragic history of their own making.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doe1zmrCRCSRkC3EdalFiUZhMxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4012'),
  ('365682758948486903', 'The Believers', 1987, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'John Schlesinger, Robby Müller, Michael Childers', 'Mark Frost', 'Martin Sheen, Helen Shaver, Harley Cross, Robert Loggia, Elizabeth Wilson, Harris Yulin, Lee Richardson, Richard Masur', 'R', 'Mourning the accidental death of his wife and having just moved to New York with his young son, laconic police psychologist Cal Jamison is reluctantly drawn into a series of grisly, ritualistic murders involving the immolation of two youths.', 'Mourning the accidental death of his wife and having just moved to New York with his young son, laconic police psychologist Cal Jamison is reluctantly drawn into a series of grisly, ritualistic murders involving the immolation of two youths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMDOgjHoDdKKj3UNZzjP8AW0wxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32076'),
  ('659633563974327019', 'The Belko Experiment', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller, Action', 'Greg McLean, Luis David Sansans, Marisa Vélez', 'James Gunn', 'John Gallagher Jr., Tony Goldwyn, Adria Arjona, John C. McGinley, Melonie Díaz, Michael Rooker, Josh Brener, Owain Yeoman', 'R', 'A group of eighty American workers are locked in their office and ordered by an unknown voice to participate in a twisted game.', 'A group of eighty American workers are locked in their office and ordered by an unknown voice to participate in a twisted game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faJK0dP3S92kQoKtO4LZMjy41kf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341006'),
  ('489036984600626916', 'The Bell Keeper', 2023, 'Horror, Action', 'Colton Tran', 'Joe Davison', 'Randy Couture, Kathleen Kenny, Reid Miller, Mike C. Manning, Cathy Marks, Bonnie Aarons, Chaz Bono, Capri-Antoine Vaillancourt', null, 'A group of friends travel to a secluded campsite to film a documentary. What they find is something much more sinister than they could have ever imagined.', 'A group of friends travel to a secluded campsite to film a documentary. What they find is something much more sinister than they could have ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m37w2WJrmEWnFSjyQylIYfYAzMj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938669'),
  ('792858103533724865', 'The Bell Witch Haunting', 2013, 'Horror', 'Bryan Koss, Glenn Miller, Laura Beth Love', null, 'Marissa Lynne Johnson, Laura Alexandra Ramos, Cat Alter, Natalie Burtney, Drew Cash, Julia Cearley, M. Steven Felty, Drew Hellenthal', null, 'The Robertson County Sheriff''s Department has released footage found on the bodies of the Sawyer family''s cell phones and video cameras. What was first thought to be a murder-suicide is now believed to be the return of a centuries-old demon responsible for America''s most famous paranormal event.', 'The Robertson County Sheriff''s Department has released footage found on the bodies of the Sawyer family''s cell phones and video cameras. What was first thought to be a murder-suicide is now believed to be the return of a centuries-old demon responsible for America''s most famous paranormal event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0eW2t1IOTxIOnfg6civIkiSbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220677'),
  ('265672029703006955', 'The Bellboy', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Lewis, Haskell B. Boggs, Ralph Axness', 'Jerry Lewis', 'Jerry Lewis, Alex Gerry, Bob Clayton, Sonnie Sands, Eddie Shaeffer, Herkie Styles, David Landfield, Bill Richmond', null, 'Stanley is a bellboy at the Fountainbleau Hotel in Miami Beach, where he performs his duties quietly and without a word to anyone. All he displays are facial expressions and a comedic slapstick style. And anything that can go wrong, does go wrong when Stanley is involved. One day, Jerry Lewis arrives at the hotel and some of the staff notice the striking resemblance.', 'Stanley is a bellboy at the Fountainbleau Hotel in Miami Beach, where he performs his duties quietly and without a word to anyone. All he displays are facial expressions and a comedic slapstick style. And anything that can go wrong, does go wrong when Stanley is involved. One day, Jerry Lewis arrives at the hotel and some of the staff notice the striking resemblance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmdlbkVeUn97buYm4ZZ8quY0EVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15788'),
  ('858603666223472312', 'The Bellboy and the Playgirls', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Fritz Umgelter', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'June Wilkinson, Don Kenney, Karin Dor, Willy Fritsch, Michael Cramer, Louise Lawson, Laura Cummings, Gigi Martine', null, 'A re-edited U.S. release of the 1958 West German film Mit Eva fing die Sünde an (Sin Began with Eve), The Bellboy and the Playgirls (1962) features roughly fifteen minutes of new color footage directed by Francis Ford Coppola and edited by Jack Hill. The added material follows a bellboy who dreams of becoming a private detective and spies on a group of women at the hotel—lingerie sales representatives who give him more than enough to investigate.', 'A re-edited U.S. release of the 1958 West German film Mit Eva fing die Sünde an (Sin Began with Eve), The Bellboy and the Playgirls (1962) features roughly fifteen minutes of new color footage directed by Francis Ford Coppola and edited by Jack Hill. The added material follows a bellboy who dreams of becoming a private detective and spies on a group of women at the hotel—lingerie sales representatives who give him more than enough to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LVcl2vHyzbgGqh0V4RUK9na4Sp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989207'),
  ('1143666512391313086', 'The Belle of New York', 1952, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Charles Walters, Adolph Deutsch', 'Irving Elinson, Robert O''Brien', 'Fred Astaire, Vera-Ellen, Marjorie Main, Keenan Wynn, Alice Pearce, Clinton Sundberg, Gale Robbins, Tom Dugan', null, 'In squeaky-clean New York at the turn of the century, playboy Charlie Hill falls so much in love that he can walk on air. The object of his affections is beautiful Angela Bonfils, a mission house worker in the Bowery. He promises to reform his dissolute life, even trying to do an honest day''s work.', 'In squeaky-clean New York at the turn of the century, playboy Charlie Hill falls so much in love that he can walk on air. The object of his affections is beautiful Angela Bonfils, a mission house worker in the Bowery. He promises to reform his dissolute life, even trying to do an honest day''s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lauMXPbB6ZhT3snMSXdzAF8jOYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43366'),
  ('1042608355250116633', 'The Belle Starr Story', 1968, 'Western', 'Lina Wertmüller, Piero Cristofani, Remo De Angelis', 'Piero Cristofani, Lina Wertmüller', 'Elsa Martinelli, George Eastman, Robert Woods, Francesca Righini, Bruno Piergentili, Bruno Corazzari, Vladimir Medar, Eugene Walter', null, 'Dominated by men in her youth, Belle Starr now out-shoots and out-gambles them as she makes her way around the West. One man who''s her equal is Larry Blackie with whom she has an on-again, off-again relationship. Together they become involved in a robbery which goes awry....', 'Dominated by men in her youth, Belle Starr now out-shoots and out-gambles them as she makes her way around the West. One man who''s her equal is Larry Blackie with whom she has an on-again, off-again relationship. Together they become involved in a robbery which goes awry....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipSw1v2cU2cfq0kUt3UXk6id3rK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104173'),
  ('646756474661936462', 'The Belles of St Trinian''s', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Frank Launder, Stanley Pavey, Jack N. Green', 'Frank Launder, Sidney Gilliat, Val Valentine', 'Alastair Sim, Joyce Grenfell, George Cole, Hermione Baddeley, Betty Ann Davies, Renée Houston, Beryl Reid, Irene Handl', 'NR', 'The unruly schoolgirls of St Trinian''s are more interested in men and mischief than homework and hockey. But greater trouble than ever beckons when the arrival at the school of Princess Fatima of Makyad coincides with the return of recently expelled Arabella Fritton, who has the kidnap of a prize racehorse on her mind.', 'The unruly schoolgirls of St Trinian''s are more interested in men and mischief than homework and hockey. But greater trouble than ever beckons when the arrival at the school of Princess Fatima of Makyad coincides with the return of recently expelled Arabella Fritton, who has the kidnap of a prize racehorse on her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKqPAMTJA7df8bHiPPbpV7RzEl8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11402'),
  ('931637648402358213', 'The Bells', 1926, 'Drama, Crime, Horror', 'James Young, L. William O''Connell', 'James Young', 'Lionel Barrymore, Caroline Frances Cooke, Gustav von Seyffertitz, Lorimer Johnston, Boris Karloff, Eddie Phillips, Lola Todd, E. Alyn Warren', 'NR', 'A kindly but desperate Alsatian innkeeper named Mathias murders and robs a rich Jewish merchant staying at his inn, but the ghost of his victim will not let him rest. Meanwhile, a mysterious Mesmerist has come to town, claiming he has made many criminals confess their crimes...', 'A kindly but desperate Alsatian innkeeper named Mathias murders and robs a rich Jewish merchant staying at his inn, but the ghost of his victim will not let him rest. Meanwhile, a mysterious Mesmerist has come to town, claiming he has made many criminals confess their crimes...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcvGcYyS9jEGNifLR3XqSiJ0WTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184885'),
  ('905336349536066510', 'The Bells Go Down', 1943, 'Drama, War', 'Basil Dearden', 'Roger MacDougall', 'Tommy Trinder, James Mason, Philip Friend, Mervyn Johns, William Hartnell, Finlay Currie, Philippa Hiatt, Meriel Forbes', null, 'Comedian Tommy Trinder plays it straight in this tribute to the wartime AFS (Auxiliary Fire Service). The dedicated band who kept the fires of London under control during the blitz and fire bombings of WWII.', 'Comedian Tommy Trinder plays it straight in this tribute to the wartime AFS (Auxiliary Fire Service). The dedicated band who kept the fires of London under control during the blitz and fire bombings of WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRJrNbY7260DpPnp0HqUs2eJGjD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238929'),
  ('698676148249686561', 'The Bells of Death', 1968, 'Action, Drama', 'Griffin Yueh Feng, Pao Hsueh-Li, Ming Ta-Chun', 'Chiu Kang-Chien', 'Chang Yi, Chin Ping, Chiu Sam-Yin, Lam Kau, Tien Shun, Ku Feng, Yang Chi-Ching, Lee Wan-Chung', null, 'A simple woodcutter named Wei Fu finds his world shattered when three murderous horsemen arrive to kill his family and kidnap his sister. Left with nothing but his mother’s bell-laden bracelet, he sets out to seek his revenge. Lucky for him, Wei Fu encounters a master swordsman, who takes him under his wing.', 'A simple woodcutter named Wei Fu finds his world shattered when three murderous horsemen arrive to kill his family and kidnap his sister. Left with nothing but his mother’s bell-laden bracelet, he sets out to seek his revenge. Lucky for him, Wei Fu encounters a master swordsman, who takes him under his wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9SWu2mlX3n3TYM37cDzhxuHqdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58361'),
  ('739326543304254442', 'The Bells of St. Mary''s', 1945, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Leo McCarey, Harry Scott, George Barnes', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Bing Crosby, Ingrid Bergman, Henry Travers, William Gargan, Ruth Donnelly, Joan Carroll, Martha Sleeper, Rhys Williams', 'NR', 'Father O''Malley is sent to St. Mary''s, a run-down parochial school on the verge of condemnation. He and Sister Benedict work together in an attempt to save the school, though their differing methods often lead to good-natured disagreements.', 'Father O''Malley is sent to St. Mary''s, a run-down parochial school on the verge of condemnation. He and Sister Benedict work together in an attempt to save the school, though their differing methods often lead to good-natured disagreements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2REwGOzsD21acHSRcXcXzkQmUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32430'),
  ('728875840258966208', 'The Belly of an Architect', 1987, 'Drama', 'Peter Greenaway, Sacha Vierny', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Brian Dennehy, Chloe Webb, Lambert Wilson, Sergio Fantoni, Stefania Casini, Vanni Corbellini, Alfredo Varelli, Geoffrey Copleston', 'R', 'Stourley Kracklite, a driven, detail-obsessed architect, travels from America to Rome with his much younger wife, Louisa, to oversee an architectural homage to a personal hero, 18th-century master builder Etienne-Louis Boullée. En route by train, Stourley and Louisa conceive a much-wanted child — but Stourley''s obsession with his wife''s expanding belly, her perceived infidelity, and his own recurrent bouts of abdominal pain reach epic and dangerous proportions.', 'Stourley Kracklite, a driven, detail-obsessed architect, travels from America to Rome with his much younger wife, Louisa, to oversee an architectural homage to a personal hero, 18th-century master builder Etienne-Louis Boullée. En route by train, Stourley and Louisa conceive a much-wanted child — but Stourley''s obsession with his wife''s expanding belly, her perceived infidelity, and his own recurrent bouts of abdominal pain reach epic and dangerous proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjS08AHtZ7b44WC2NCuYWpJRoCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17238'),
  ('592746744890152650', 'The Beloved Rogue', 1927, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, History', 'Alan Crosland, Joseph H. August, Gordon Hollingshead', 'Paul Bern', 'John Barrymore, Conrad Veidt, Marceline Day, Lawson Butt, Henry Victor, Slim Summerville, Angelo Rossitto, Nigel De Brulier', null, 'François Villon, in his lifetime the most renowned poet in France, is also a prankster, an occasional criminal, and an ardent patriot.', 'François Villon, in his lifetime the most renowned poet in France, is also a prankster, an occasional criminal, and an ardent patriot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6O5EpF7XgbUQPo8XclbF01n6u5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120829'),
  ('48859533429421765', 'The Belovs', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Viktor Kossakovsky', 'Viktor Kossakovsky', 'Anna Fyodorovna Belova, Mikhail Fyodorovich Belov, Vasiliy Belov, Sergey Fyodorovich Belov', null, 'Portrait of a troubled peasant family. The film tells the story of two times widow Anna Belova who lives together with her brother Mikhail. Blending the two personalities, Kosakovsky characterizes the true Russian soul: she is the rational worker, honest and strong - he is the drunken poet, the idealist, his philosophy fades into radical nonsense time after time.', 'Portrait of a troubled peasant family. The film tells the story of two times widow Anna Belova who lives together with her brother Mikhail. Blending the two personalities, Kosakovsky characterizes the true Russian soul: she is the rational worker, honest and strong - he is the drunken poet, the idealist, his philosophy fades into radical nonsense time after time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26HL0TlX60D5mMy87ye2F8XK14n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111248'),
  ('21301928056388892', 'The Belstone Fox', 1973, 'Drama', 'James Hill', 'James Hill', 'Eric Porter, Jeremy Kemp, Bill Travers, Rachel Roberts, Heather Wright, Dennis Waterman', 'PG', 'Based on the novel "The Ballad of the Belstone Fox", this heartwarming film chronicles the life of a fox much smarter than the dogs that hunt him. In fact, they never could catch him!', 'Based on the novel "The Ballad of the Belstone Fox", this heartwarming film chronicles the life of a fox much smarter than the dogs that hunt him. In fact, they never could catch him!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKWPZmwEtsQmNGspdI5EW5wes3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202175'),
  ('923889629193896485', 'The Bench', 2000, 'Drama', 'Per Fly', 'Kim Leona, Per Fly', 'Jesper Christensen, Nicolaj Kopernikus, Jens Albinus, Sarah Boberg, Lars Brygmann, John Martinus, Petrine Agger, Anette Støvelbæk', null, 'Kaj is a stubborn man with a great deal of pride. The former chef lives in a council flat. He has wasted his life and is now on a council job training scheme for the long-term unemployed, where he refuses to let the foreman of the activation project boss him about. When Kaj''s daughter, with whom he has not been in touch for nineteen years, moves into the same council estate on the run from her violent husband, a change comes over Kaj. His initial instinct is to avoid her, but by chance he ends up helping to look after Jonas, her six-year-old son. For the first time for years Kaj need not survive on his own devices. Now he has responsibilities and a family of his own.', 'Kaj is a stubborn man with a great deal of pride. The former chef lives in a council flat. He has wasted his life and is now on a council job training scheme for the long-term unemployed, where he refuses to let the foreman of the activation project boss him about. When Kaj''s daughter, with whom he has not been in touch for nineteen years, moves into the same council estate on the run from her violent husband, a change comes over Kaj. His initial instinct is to avoid her, but by chance he ends up helping to look after Jonas, her six-year-old son. For the first time for years Kaj need not survive on his own devices. Now he has responsibilities and a family of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bOteNFp8WsXaK44GHWGCugsotv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15830'),
  ('617980213338047397', 'The Benchwarmers', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Thomas E. Ackerman, Dennis Dugan, John Collins', 'Allen Covert, Nick Swardson', 'Rob Schneider, David Spade, Jon Heder, Molly Sims, Jon Lovitz, Amaury Nolasco, Tim Meadows, Nick Swardson', 'PG-13', 'A trio of guys try and make up for missed opportunities in childhood by forming a three-player baseball team to compete against standard little league squads.', 'A trio of guys try and make up for missed opportunities in childhood by forming a three-player baseball team to compete against standard little league squads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yMPCr4qhuNg6fT538xicHaMaG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9957'),
  ('21736463373184735', 'The Benefactor', 2015, 'Drama', 'Andrew Renzi, Joe Anderson', 'Andrew Renzi', 'Richard Gere, Dakota Fanning, Theo James, Dylan Baker, Cheryl Hines, Brian Anthony Wilson, Justin Goncalves, Dennisha Pratt', null, 'A newly married couple are forced to navigate the all-consuming interest of a powerful, mysterious, and possessive philanthropist.', 'A newly married couple are forced to navigate the all-consuming interest of a powerful, mysterious, and possessive philanthropist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uL0fCJuT0ERaKVM8ftduLlhObaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328901'),
  ('941106855928856465', 'The Benefit of the Doubt', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Samuel Tilman', 'Samuel Tilman', 'Fabrizio Rongione, Natacha Régnier, Christophe Paou, Yoann Blanc, Baptiste Lalieu, Myriem Akheddiou, Steve Driesen, Erika Sainte', null, 'David has a woman he loves, two lovely young children, a band of friends with whom they go on holiday. But on his return from a stay in the Vosges, he is interrogated by the police in connection with an investigation into a murder. Quickly, it is established that David, under irreproachable looks, does not have a life as smooth as what he claims. Despite the support of his best friend, Noël, and his lawyer, Marco, the doubt spreads.', 'David has a woman he loves, two lovely young children, a band of friends with whom they go on holiday. But on his return from a stay in the Vosges, he is interrogated by the police in connection with an investigation into a murder. Quickly, it is established that David, under irreproachable looks, does not have a life as smooth as what he claims. Despite the support of his best friend, Noël, and his lawyer, Marco, the doubt spreads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NJ8AUJwnxTGySQ3U5jWnF9PF8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479379'),
  ('219389338438131772', 'The Benetón Family', 2024, 'Comedy, Family', 'Joaquín Mazón', 'Benjamín Herranz, Curro Velázquez', 'Leo Harlem, El Langui, Damián Alcázar, Alí Dia, Gala Bichir, Diego Montejo, Pepe Viyuela, Diana Bovio', null, 'Toni, a grumpy in his fifties, avoids children at all costs. His life changes when he suddenly has to take care of his sister''s five adopted children, each from a different country. Toni will have to deal with new parenthood and cultural differences.', 'Toni, a grumpy in his fifties, avoids children at all costs. His life changes when he suddenly has to take care of his sister''s five adopted children, each from a different country. Toni will have to deal with new parenthood and cultural differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VISxbDN4YSFZao3MAkElC4WE6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181511'),
  ('853218223884961900', 'The Benny Goodman Story', 1956, 'Drama, Music', 'Valentine Davies, William H. Daniels', 'Valentine Davies', 'Steve Allen, Donna Reed, Berta Gersten, Barry Truex, Herbert Anderson, Robert F. Simon, Hy Averback, Sammy Davis Sr.', null, 'Young Benny Goodman is taught clarinet by a music professor. He is advised to play whichever kind of music he likes best, but to make a living, Benny begins by joining the Ben Pollack traveling band.', 'Young Benny Goodman is taught clarinet by a music professor. He is advised to play whichever kind of music he likes best, but to make a living, Benny begins by joining the Ben Pollack traveling band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbxZjnYn2hcwHb4Vr20wu0k2HYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43261'),
