  ('247202579790970570', 'The Besieged Fortress', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Philippe Calderon, Geneviève Liénard', 'Philippe Calderon, Guillaume Vincent, Georges Marbeck', 'Benoît Allemane, Christian Brückner', null, 'A young couple, a king and queen termite, settle down and build a grand empire within a massive mound. When the mound suffers damage from rain, fire, and a falling branch, the scent from the termite colony is carried off by wind and catches the attention of a swarming driver ant colony led by their "black queen." Now a war is waged as ant and termite fight a battle of minuscule proportions for the survival of their very colonies.', 'A young couple, a king and queen termite, settle down and build a grand empire within a massive mound. When the mound suffers damage from rain, fire, and a falling branch, the scent from the termite colony is carried off by wind and catches the attention of a swarming driver ant colony led by their "black queen." Now a war is waged as ant and termite fight a battle of minuscule proportions for the survival of their very colonies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wxf3q6gMj3IQqVN92a2MsELCQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53497'),
  ('724609028590896459', 'The Bespoke Overcoat', 1955, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jack Clayton, Buddy Booth, Wolfgang Suschitzky', 'Wolf Mankowitz', 'David Kossoff, Alfie Bass, Alan Tilvern, Alf Dean, Howard Goorney', null, 'A humble clerk yearns for an overcoat, but his employer''s refusal and his subsequent death lead him to return as a ghost, determined to claim the garment with the help of a tailor friend.', 'A humble clerk yearns for an overcoat, but his employer''s refusal and his subsequent death lead him to return as a ghost, determined to claim the garment with the help of a tailor friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccxFzqcPPifOQHRdWgsKLsAxqzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203901'),
  ('854951005654619793', 'The Best Century of My Life', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Bardani, Timoty Aliprandi, Germano Boldorini', 'Alessandro Bardani, Luigi Di Capua, Leonardo Fasoli', 'Sergio Castellitto, Valerio Lundini, Carla Signoris, Antonio Zavatteri, Elena Lander, Marzio El Moety, Betti Pedrazzi, Sandra Milo', null, 'An absurd law prevents John, an unrecognized child at birth, from knowing the identity of his biological parents before his 100th birthday. To succeed in attracting public opinion, his only hope is to obtain the complicity of Gustavo, the only unrecognized-at-birth centenarian alive. The only one who would have the right to avail himself of this legislation but seems to have no interest in doing so. The Most Beautiful Century of My Life tells of the meeting between a centenarian projected into the future and a young man anchored in the past and of their unexpected friendship.', 'An absurd law prevents John, an unrecognized child at birth, from knowing the identity of his biological parents before his 100th birthday. To succeed in attracting public opinion, his only hope is to obtain the complicity of Gustavo, the only unrecognized-at-birth centenarian alive. The only one who would have the right to avail himself of this legislation but seems to have no interest in doing so. The Most Beautiful Century of My Life tells of the meeting between a centenarian projected into the future and a young man anchored in the past and of their unexpected friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HEuWlP8lQkjCP4X66gqwIzNuao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027717'),
  ('836863787062515465', 'The Best Christmas Pageant Ever', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'George Schaefer, Edward R. Brown, Jacques Hubert', 'Barbara Robinson', 'Loretta Swit, Jackson Davies, Antony Holland, David Alexander, Fairuza Balk, Ocean Hellman, Janet Wright, Teri Dean', 'PG', 'The Herdmans – Gladys, Claude, Imogene, Leroy, Ollie and Ralph – are undeniably the worst kids in the history of the world. They lie, steal, cheat, bully and overall terrorize their small community. But this Christmas, they’re taking over their local church Pageant – and they just might unwittingly teach a shocked little town the true meaning of Christmas.', 'The Herdmans – Gladys, Claude, Imogene, Leroy, Ollie and Ralph – are undeniably the worst kids in the history of the world. They lie, steal, cheat, bully and overall terrorize their small community. But this Christmas, they’re taking over their local church Pageant – and they just might unwittingly teach a shocked little town the true meaning of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4gFAjfnMpiJw9lOViuz22lR9RQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27163'),
