  ('335913745155160852', 'The Best Exotic Marigold Hotel', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'John Madden, Ben Davis, Peter Francis', 'Ol Parker', 'Bill Nighy, Maggie Smith, Tom Wilkinson, Judi Dench, Dev Patel, Penelope Wilton, Celia Imrie, Ronald Pickup', 'PG-13', 'British retirees travel to India to take up residence in what they believe is a newly restored hotel. Less luxurious than its advertisements, the Marigold Hotel nevertheless slowly begins to charm in unexpected ways as the residents find new purpose in their old age.', 'British retirees travel to India to take up residence in what they believe is a newly restored hotel. Less luxurious than its advertisements, the Marigold Hotel nevertheless slowly begins to charm in unexpected ways as the residents find new purpose in their old age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNWiOKTWDvPTpr7QfPWk18gLftz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74534'),
  ('824651150198295836', 'The Best Families', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Paúl Córdova, Javier Fuentes-León, Mauricio Vidal', 'Javier Fuentes-León', 'Tatiana Astengo, Gabriela Velásquez, Gracia Olayo, Grapa Paola, Jely Reategui, César Ritter, Roberto Cano, Susana Freyre', null, 'Luzmila and Peta are two sisters who come from a modest environment and work as housemaids for Alicia and Carmen, two aristocratic ladies of Peru. They are almost considered a part of the families or, at least, that’s what it seems… But one day, as the city is taken over by violent protests, a birthday celebration gathers all the members of both families together. A long-held secret involving both households — upstairs and downstairs — is suddenly revealed, blowing up the bubble of their perfect aristocratic world forever.', 'Luzmila and Peta are two sisters who come from a modest environment and work as housemaids for Alicia and Carmen, two aristocratic ladies of Peru. They are almost considered a part of the families or, at least, that’s what it seems… But one day, as the city is taken over by violent protests, a birthday celebration gathers all the members of both families together. A long-held secret involving both households — upstairs and downstairs — is suddenly revealed, blowing up the bubble of their perfect aristocratic world forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gXT0MZr4RPDa88wVzfAzOqXUEu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:742777'),
  ('516084650769545240', 'The Best Friend', 2025, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Beto Martins, Jules Vandystadt, Allan Deberton', 'Raul Damasceno, Pedro Karam, Allan Deberton', 'Vinicius Teixeira, Gabriel Fuentes, Leo Bahia, Gretchen, Claudia Ohana, Mateus Carrieri, Denis Lacerda, Diego Montez', null, 'Two great friends meet again after five years. Among so many things that have changed, the resumption of the bond awakens an old feeling for which they remain unprepared.', 'Two great friends meet again after five years. Among so many things that have changed, the resumption of the bond awakens an old feeling for which they remain unprepared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEhj1fS3hcGgHNEyAEzNi08b1IN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1182088'),
  ('553282416635209701', 'The Best in Hell', 2022, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Andrey Batov', null, 'Aleksei Kravchenko, Georgy Bolonev, Sergey Garusov, Dmitriy Murashev, Georgy Marishin, Sergey Bespalov, Vladislav Demin, Zakhar Cherezov', null, 'Movie about units of the "whites" (PMC "Wagner") who perform an assault operation to capture buildings. They are opposed by the "yellow" units, which have dug in these buildings and are also ready to fight to the end.', 'Movie about units of the "whites" (PMC "Wagner") who perform an assault operation to capture buildings. They are opposed by the "yellow" units, which have dug in these buildings and are also ready to fight to the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2x1swT7xOyYZAdsKO3GclVcYrR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032742'),
  ('312678553941772889', 'The Best Intentions', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jörgen Persson, Bille August, Stefan Baron', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Samuel Fröler, Pernilla August, Max von Sydow, Ghita Nørby, Lennart Hjulström, Mona Malm, Lena Endre, Keve Hjelm', null, 'In this film about Ingmar Bergman''s parents, Henrik Bergman is studying for the priesthood and trying to make ends meet when he encounters the lovely, affluent Anna. Despite their social differences, Henrik and Anna fall in love, wed and move to the country. They lead a quiet life as Henrik works as a priest, but it isn''t long before the simple people and plain surroundings make Anna long for a more lavish lifestyle, which causes marital stress.', 'In this film about Ingmar Bergman''s parents, Henrik Bergman is studying for the priesthood and trying to make ends meet when he encounters the lovely, affluent Anna. Despite their social differences, Henrik and Anna fall in love, wed and move to the country. They lead a quiet life as Henrik works as a priest, but it isn''t long before the simple people and plain surroundings make Anna long for a more lavish lifestyle, which causes marital stress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkwKpqYac8zUNNMkRTfAQfbMQWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41764'),
  ('530689225210446512', 'The Best is Yet to Come', 2023, 'Drama', 'Li Xingbo, Wang Jing, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Huang Minmin, Chen Chengfeng, Li Jingrui', 'White-K, Miao Miao, Zhang Songwen, Song Yang, Wang Yiquan, Zhou Yemang, Jia Zhangke, Qin Hailu', null, 'In 2003, Han Dong, a teenager who dropped out of high school, arrives at Beijing with a dream of becoming a journalist.', 'In 2003, Han Dong, a teenager who dropped out of high school, arrives at Beijing with a dream of becoming a journalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/689jKSbCXWhVhnh59PsvN4jHeXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664412'),
  ('192435411457154842', 'The Best Is Yet to Come', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Guillaume Schiffman, Shubhank Rishi, Dylan Talleux', 'Alexandre de La Patellière, Matthieu Delaporte', 'Fabrice Luchini, Patrick Bruel, Zineb Triki, Pascale Arbillot, Marie Narbonne, Jean-Marie Winling, André Marcon, Thierry Godard', null, 'Following a huge misunderstanding, two friends always decide to tackle everything to make up for lost time.', 'Following a huge misunderstanding, two friends always decide to tackle everything to make up for lost time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSAJYJbPqrmJP5eucSHtRvymMXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582206'),
  ('940329402724352320', 'The Best Job in the World', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gérard Lauzier, Jean-Yves Le Mener', 'Gérard Lauzier', 'Gérard Depardieu, Ticky Holgado, Michèle Laroque, Souad Amidou, Guy Marchand, Philippe Khorsand, Daniel Prévost, Roschdy Zem', null, 'To be closer to his children following his divorce, Laurent Monier, a history and geography teacher in a peaceful provincial high school, accepts a position in a sensitive college in the Paris suburbs. He is assigned the hardest class, the fourth techno, and he finds an apartment in the Cité des Muriers, a particularly difficult district.', 'To be closer to his children following his divorce, Laurent Monier, a history and geography teacher in a peaceful provincial high school, accepts a position in a sensitive college in the Paris suburbs. He is assigned the hardest class, the fourth techno, and he finds an apartment in the Cité des Muriers, a particularly difficult district.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiO6LZ6FyHkqTBklR011vlkEZyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40089'),
  ('721492343820088384', 'The Best Little Whorehouse in Texas', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Colin Higgins, William A. Fraker, Emmitt-Leon O''Neill', 'Larry L. King, Peter Masterson, Colin Higgins', 'Burt Reynolds, Dolly Parton, Dom DeLuise, Charles Durning, Jim Nabors, Robert Mandan, Lois Nettleton, Theresa Merritt', 'R', 'When a Conservative TV crusader threatens to shut down beloved brothel, the Chicken Ranch, proprietress Miss Mona Stangley and her girls won''t go down without a fight.', 'When a Conservative TV crusader threatens to shut down beloved brothel, the Chicken Ranch, proprietress Miss Mona Stangley and her girls won''t go down without a fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yw3PNR3NVeKKfLWv8SgFQnXoHZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16363'),
  ('1127856759612945270', 'The Best Man', 1964, 'Drama', 'Dick Moder, Franklin J. Schaffner, Haskell Wexler', 'Gore Vidal', 'Henry Fonda, Cliff Robertson, Edie Adams, Margaret Leighton, Shelley Berman, Lee Tracy, Ann Sothern, Gene Raymond', 'NR', 'The other party is in disarray. Five men vie for the party nomination for president. No one has a majority as the first ballot closes and the front-runners begin to decide how badly they want the job.', 'The other party is in disarray. Five men vie for the party nomination for president. No one has a majority as the first ballot closes and the front-runners begin to decide how badly they want the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0P6pKJLUbdG4og9Kk3JNWeTtE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37315'),
  ('438346562165930827', 'The Best Man', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini', 'Pupi Avati', 'Inés Sastre, Diego Abatantuono, Dario Cantarelli, Cinzia Mascoli, Valeria D''Obici, Mario Erpichini, Ugo Conti, Nini Salerno', null, 'Incredibly, the bride at the altar falls in love with the best man on first sight, and even though he makes efforts to avoid her infatuation with him, she is determined to annul her marriage and marry the best man. And although she is able to dissolve her marriage, because she has never consummated it, the best man leaves... only to return to her many months later.', 'Incredibly, the bride at the altar falls in love with the best man on first sight, and even though he makes efforts to avoid her infatuation with him, she is determined to annul her marriage and marry the best man. And although she is able to dissolve her marriage, because she has never consummated it, the best man leaves... only to return to her many months later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/it3TqsjG19roZJTM1zbogEj10Mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125124'),
  ('966848695926163766', 'The Best Man', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Malcolm D. Lee, Frank Prinzi, H.H. Cooper', 'Malcolm D. Lee', 'Taye Diggs, Morris Chestnut, Nia Long, Harold Perrineau, Terrence Howard, Sanaa Lathan, Regina Hall, Monica Calhoun', 'R', 'After writing a soon-to-be bestselling novel, writer and committed bachelor Harper attempts to hide the fact that his saucy new book is loosely based on the lives and loves of his tight-knit group of friends. Harper is set to be best man at his friend Lance''s wedding, and all his friends will be in attendance. When an advance copy of the book makes its way into the hands of his ex-flame, Jordan, Harper attempts to keep it under wraps.', 'After writing a soon-to-be bestselling novel, writer and committed bachelor Harper attempts to hide the fact that his saucy new book is loosely based on the lives and loves of his tight-knit group of friends. Harper is set to be best man at his friend Lance''s wedding, and all his friends will be in attendance. When an advance copy of the book makes its way into the hands of his ex-flame, Jordan, Harper attempts to keep it under wraps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ub2Njdn4kq49ndyg7QglnE8PUqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16162'),
  ('1084086203253298391', 'The Best Man', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stefan Schwartz, Haris Zambarloukos, Michael Fleischer', 'Stefan Schwartz, Ed Roe', 'Stuart Townsend, Seth Green, Amy Smart, Kate Ashfield, Jodhi May, Philip Jackson, Anna Chancellor, Simon Callow', 'R', 'When writer''s block derails the literary dreams of Olly Pickering, he has to move in with his friend Murray after losing all his money. Things start to look up when Olly''s college pal James asks him to be the best man at his wedding. Prior to the nuptials, Olly is drawn to a woman whom he thinks is the bride''s sister -- only she turns out to be the bride, Sarah. Can Murray, who dislikes James, help get Sarah and Olly together?', 'When writer''s block derails the literary dreams of Olly Pickering, he has to move in with his friend Murray after losing all his money. Things start to look up when Olly''s college pal James asks him to be the best man at his wedding. Prior to the nuptials, Olly is drawn to a woman whom he thinks is the bride''s sister -- only she turns out to be the bride, Sarah. Can Murray, who dislikes James, help get Sarah and Olly together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Buo27SaY1tHBVLiHyUKiBS0X5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27594'),
  ('758013920452321821', 'The Best Man', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Shane Dax Taylor', 'Shane Dax Taylor, C. Alec Rossel', 'Brendan Fehr, Dolph Lundgren, Luke Wilson, Nicky Whelan, Scout Taylor-Compton, Scott Martin, Ryan Devlin, Wes Hager', 'R', 'Mercenaries seize control of a remote resort hotel during a wedding and it''s up to the best man, the groom and their drunken best friend to stop the terrorists and save the hostages.', 'Mercenaries seize control of a remote resort hotel during a wedding and it''s up to the best man, the groom and their drunken best friend to stop the terrorists and save the hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9f6mFZqkyz4AD0sxGmynE1pe0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094319'),
  ('62585555599162660', 'The Best Man Holiday', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Malcolm D. Lee, Greg Gardiner', 'Malcolm D. Lee', 'Terrence Howard, Harold Perrineau, Morris Chestnut, Sanaa Lathan, Taye Diggs, Regina Hall, Nia Long, Monica Calhoun', 'R', 'When college friends reunite after 15 years over the Christmas holidays, they discover just how easy it is for long-forgotten rivalries and romances to be reignited.', 'When college friends reunite after 15 years over the Christmas holidays, they discover just how easy it is for long-forgotten rivalries and romances to be reignited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4ecMHJQpclIEr4mh5uzjWr38GC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146304'),
  ('789985388522528072', 'The Best Man''s Wedding', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aril Wretblad, Josef Fares, Gunnar Hellström Jr.', 'Josef Fares', 'Fares Fares, Torkel Petersson, Tuva Novotny, Laleh Pourkarim, Leonard Terfelt, Jan Fares, Sofi Ahlström Helleday, Benyam Eriksson', null, 'Roro, a foreign worker in Swedish parks, loves his girlfriend but is about to marry another girl to prevent her from being sent back to Lebanon. Meanwhile, Roro''s best friend, Måns, has serious problems getting an erection.', 'Roro, a foreign worker in Swedish parks, loves his girlfriend but is about to marry another girl to prevent her from being sent back to Lebanon. Meanwhile, Roro''s best friend, Måns, has serious problems getting an erection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwx3W0NAv7OOgODBoYHh62yaKDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10978'),
  ('440202684276828073', 'The Best Mother in the World', 2025, 'Drama', 'Anna Muylaert, Lílis Soares, Henrique Lapa', 'Anna Muylaert, Mariana Jaspe, Grace Passô', 'Shirley Cruz, Seu Jorge, Rihanna Barbosa, Benin Ayo, Rejane Faria, Luedji Luna, Rubens Santos, Katiuscia Canoro', null, 'To escape her abusive husband, garbage collector Gal packs her two young children, Rihanna and Benin, onto the top of her cart and heads across São Paulo to her cousin’s house. As she struggles to avoid the dangers of the streets along the way, she convinces the children that they are on a big and exciting adventure. When they arrive at her cousin’s house, they are warmly welcomed and fed. However, what initially seems like a safe haven soon turns out to be a trap. Gal realises that not only her own safety is at risk, but also the future of her children.', 'To escape her abusive husband, garbage collector Gal packs her two young children, Rihanna and Benin, onto the top of her cart and heads across São Paulo to her cousin’s house. As she struggles to avoid the dangers of the streets along the way, she convinces the children that they are on a big and exciting adventure. When they arrive at her cousin’s house, they are warmly welcomed and fed. However, what initially seems like a safe haven soon turns out to be a trap. Gal realises that not only her own safety is at risk, but also the future of her children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3NGx2xilIUtbgrvFpKdTq85Zjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1208758'),
  ('790326135463385260', 'The Best Movie', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Kirill Kuzin, Ulugbek Khamraev, Yuri Reinbakh', 'Artak Gasparyan, Garik Kharlamov', 'Garik Kharlamov, Mikhail Galustyan, Elena Velikanova, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Pavel Volya, Valeriy Barinov, Iosif Buyanovskiy, Dmitriy Nagiev', null, 'Vadik Volnov (Garik Kharlamov) dies on his own wedding of cannabis overdose and has to prove to God that he is worthy to enter Heaven. During his conversation with God''s secretary, Vadik recalls numerous memorable moments of his earthly existence, such as getting drunk on cognac on his 8th birthday, service in the Soviet Army in Afghanistan, bandit showdowns in crime-ridden 1990s Russia, and, finally, meeting the love of his life.', 'Vadik Volnov (Garik Kharlamov) dies on his own wedding of cannabis overdose and has to prove to God that he is worthy to enter Heaven. During his conversation with God''s secretary, Vadik recalls numerous memorable moments of his earthly existence, such as getting drunk on cognac on his 8th birthday, service in the Soviet Army in Afghanistan, bandit showdowns in crime-ridden 1990s Russia, and, finally, meeting the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AHQFjDUgSdNcnGkD3qvtdYLOkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62737'),
  ('903032329899297246', 'The Best Movie 2', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Oleg Fomin, Vasily Sikachinsky, Sergey Kulishenko', 'Artak Gasparyan, Garik Kharlamov', 'Garik Kharlamov, Mikhail Galustyan, Dmitriy Khrustalev, Mikhail Efremov, Yuriy Galtsev, Tatyana Lyutaeva, Dmitriy Nagiev, Oleg Vereshchagin', null, 'Russian comedy film. Continuation of 2008 The Best Movie film, spoofing such famous Russian films as Zhara, The Irony of Fate 2 and TV-programs: Malakhov+, King of Ring and Taxi.', 'Russian comedy film. Continuation of 2008 The Best Movie film, spoofing such famous Russian films as Zhara, The Irony of Fate 2 and TV-programs: Malakhov+, King of Ring and Taxi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rA62dXP88Xfvn0hWuvsJ1ahX2cb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62738'),
  ('1009653150659543939', 'The Best of All Worlds', 2017, 'Drama', 'Yoshi Heimrath, Adrian Goiginger', 'Adrian Goiginger', 'Verena Altenberger, Jeremy Miliker, Lukas Miko, Michael Pink, Michael Fuith, Reinhold G. Moritz, Philipp Stix, Georg Veitl', null, 'Seven-year-old Adrian is growing up in the underground drug scene of Salzburg, usually famous for culture and classical music. His mother Helga is torn between her drug addiction and her love for her son. Despite this, Adrian has a happy childhood, the best of all worlds. But it is tested to the limit when the authorities and child welfare services find out about Helga''s addiction.', 'Seven-year-old Adrian is growing up in the underground drug scene of Salzburg, usually famous for culture and classical music. His mother Helga is torn between her drug addiction and her love for her son. Despite this, Adrian has a happy childhood, the best of all worlds. But it is tested to the limit when the authorities and child welfare services find out about Helga''s addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rX4dzFp5GePoNoYKSMO23BIbB9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440952'),
  ('618013034264342664', 'The Best of Benny Hill', 1974, 'Comedy', 'John Robins', 'Benny Hill', 'Benny Hill, Patricia Hayes, Henry McGee, Nicholas Parsons, Bob Todd, Walter Goodman', null, 'The Best of Benny Hill is a 1974 film version of material from the television comedy series, The Benny Hill Show. This movie features sketches from the early Thames Television years, from 1969 to 1973.', 'The Best of Benny Hill is a 1974 film version of material from the television comedy series, The Benny Hill Show. This movie features sketches from the early Thames Television years, from 1969 to 1973.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xWK065fGXLXMQu1ZgLmt4NSE1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347985'),
  ('89079163759325457', 'The Best of Enemies', 1961, 'Comedy, War', 'Giuseppe Rotunno, Guy Hamilton, Joel Silberg', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Furio Scarpelli, Agenore Incrocci', 'David Niven, Alberto Sordi, Michael Wilding, Harry Andrews, Noel Harrison, Amedeo Nazzari, Aldo Giuffrè, David Opatoshu', 'NR', 'During World War II, a plane full of RAF fighter crashes in the Ethiopian desert and they are met upon by an enemy Italian patrol that allows them to go free. But, when the Brits are given orders to attack the Italians, lots of problems ensue.', 'During World War II, a plane full of RAF fighter crashes in the Ethiopian desert and they are met upon by an enemy Italian patrol that allows them to go free. But, when the Brits are given orders to attack the Italians, lots of problems ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsTBx6VLQDUQLr62v5qhr5reBXX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67377'),
  ('195775636884100227', 'The Best of Enemies', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Robin Bissell, David Lanzenberg', 'Robin Bissell', 'Taraji P. Henson, Sam Rockwell, Babou Ceesay, Anne Heche, Wes Bentley, Nick Searcy, Bruce McGill, John Gallagher Jr.', 'PG-13', 'Centers on the unlikely relationship between Ann Atwater, an outspoken civil rights activist, and C.P. Ellis, a local Ku Klux Klan leader who reluctantly co-chaired a community summit, battling over the desegregation of schools in Durham, North Carolina during the racially-charged summer of 1971. The incredible events that unfolded would change Durham and the lives of Atwater and Ellis forever.', 'Centers on the unlikely relationship between Ann Atwater, an outspoken civil rights activist, and C.P. Ellis, a local Ku Klux Klan leader who reluctantly co-chaired a community summit, battling over the desegregation of schools in Durham, North Carolina during the racially-charged summer of 1971. The incredible events that unfolded would change Durham and the lives of Atwater and Ellis forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pA9318BY7CSnXVi3xKBtPYMe1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458131'),
  ('905399024523815536', 'The Best of Everything', 1959, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Negulesco, William C. Mellor', 'Edith R. Sommer, Mann Rubin', 'Hope Lange, Stephen Boyd, Suzy Parker, Martha Hyer, Diane Baker, Brian Aherne, Robert Evans, Brett Halsey', null, 'An exposé of the lives and loves of Madison Avenue working girls and their higher-ups.', 'An exposé of the lives and loves of Madison Avenue working girls and their higher-ups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrBGdCREbrjxx4ZbBPsohcFZLks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57103'),
  ('457317566404765414', 'The Best of Me', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Oliver Stapleton, Michael Hoffman, Ann C. Salzer', 'Will Fetters, J. Mills Goodloe', 'Michelle Monaghan, James Marsden, Luke Bracey, Liana Liberato, Gerald McRaney, Caroline Goodall, Clarke Peters, Sebastian Arcelus', 'PG-13', 'A pair of former high school sweethearts reunite after many years when they return to visit their small hometown.', 'A pair of former high school sweethearts reunite after many years when they return to visit their small hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUSemUPEJ9wKar5uYzMyIlLmWjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239571'),
  ('570559824296552564', 'The Best of the Martial Arts Films', 1990, 'Documentary, Action', 'Sandra Weintraub, Kent L. Wakeford', 'Sandra Weintraub', 'John Saxon, Robert Clouse', null, 'The most explosive barehanded combat sequences ever filmed. An electrifying video of martial arts mastery and mayhem. This program takes a behind-the-scenes look at the weapons, the mystical eastern philosophy, and the incredible skills that have made martial arts films one of the most popular genres in the world today.', 'The most explosive barehanded combat sequences ever filmed. An electrifying video of martial arts mastery and mayhem. This program takes a behind-the-scenes look at the weapons, the mystical eastern philosophy, and the incredible skills that have made martial arts films one of the most popular genres in the world today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzKbLbMUlinOPyaoLG7y7Vh1B8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356568'),
  ('338327752264576321', 'The Best of Times', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Don Mischer', 'Bob Arnott, Carol Hatfield Sarasohn, Lane Sarasohn', 'Crispin Glover, Jill Schoelen, Nicolas Cage, Julie Piekarski, Kevin Cortes, Lisa Hope Ross, David Rambo, Janet Robin', null, 'This ABC pilot starred seven teenagers in an ''80s-style laugh-in. It told the light and dark side of teenage thoughts with dancing and singing added in for color.', 'This ABC pilot starred seven teenagers in an ''80s-style laugh-in. It told the light and dark side of teenage thoughts with dancing and singing added in for color.', null, 'tmdb:movie:64837'),
  ('604722919999897112', 'The Best of Times', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Roger Spottiswoode, James Dyer, Harry V. Bring', 'Ron Shelton', 'Robin Williams, Kurt Russell, Pamela Reed, Holly Palance, Donald Moffat, Margaret Whitton, M. Emmet Walsh, Donovan Scott', 'PG-13', 'A small-town loser determines to have one more shot at the big time by winning a football game.', 'A small-town loser determines to have one more shot at the big time by winning a football game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KSuob3tStXyxaQ52Fceu9Mc015.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30653'),
  ('294027001011545006', 'The Best Offer', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Fabio Zamarion, Giuseppe Tornatore', 'Giuseppe Tornatore', 'Geoffrey Rush, Jim Sturgess, Sylvia Hoeks, Donald Sutherland, Maximilian Dirr, Philip Jackson, Dermot Crowley, Liya Kebede', 'R', 'Virgil Oldman is a world renowned antiques expert and auctioneer. An eccentric genius, he leads a solitary life, going to extreme lengths to keep his distance from the messiness of human relationships. When appointed by the beautiful but emotionally damaged Claire to oversee the valuation and sale of her family’s priceless art collection, Virgil allows himself to form an attachment to her – and soon he is engulfed by a passion which will rock his bland existence to the core.', 'Virgil Oldman is a world renowned antiques expert and auctioneer. An eccentric genius, he leads a solitary life, going to extreme lengths to keep his distance from the messiness of human relationships. When appointed by the beautiful but emotionally damaged Claire to oversee the valuation and sale of her family’s priceless art collection, Virgil allows himself to form an attachment to her – and soon he is engulfed by a passion which will rock his bland existence to the core.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibDGPgUZn6vxHiSgt2xeQyFp8Np.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152742'),
  ('228423063099011309', 'The Best Place to Be', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Helmut Pirnat, Marcus H. Rosenmüller', 'Karin Michalke', 'Anna Maria Sturm, Rosalie Thomass, Volker Bruch, Stefan Murr, Ferdinand Schmidt-Modrow, Florian Brückner, Peter Mitterrutzner, Andreas Giebel', null, 'After they have graduated from school, the two best friends Kati and Jo jump into their purple Benz and embark on a journey around the world southwards. Kati, however, struggled with the decision for the journey as the love of her life returned to their hometown Tandern shortly before their departure. The journey leads the two friends over the Brenner pass, where their car suddenly stops working. When Kati then also learns that her grandfather is about to die, she wants to return home – this puts the friendship of the two to an acid test.', 'After they have graduated from school, the two best friends Kati and Jo jump into their purple Benz and embark on a journey around the world southwards. Kati, however, struggled with the decision for the journey as the love of her life returned to their hometown Tandern shortly before their departure. The journey leads the two friends over the Brenner pass, where their car suddenly stops working. When Kati then also learns that her grandfather is about to die, she wants to return home – this puts the friendship of the two to an acid test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLEihPjQ5ogNBFdnJ3cSOG91iMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5970'),
  ('213119287283495132', 'The Best Summer of My Life', 2018, 'Comedy, Family', 'Valentín Álvarez, Dani de la Orden', 'Olatz Arroyo, Dani de la Orden, Marta Suárez', 'Leo Harlem, Gracia Olayo, Maggie Civantos, Antonio Dechent, Toni Acosta, Salva Reina, Berto Romero, Arturo Valls', null, 'A father in financial problems takes his son on vacation as he tries to solve his life.', 'A father in financial problems takes his son on vacation as he tries to solve his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3RwcNpLTdum99fTWcMazEwSd4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519597'),
  ('757174360493653265', 'The Best Summer of Our Lives', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Talento, Adolpho Knauth', 'Cadu Pereiva', 'Bia Torres, Laura Castro, Giulia Nassa, Enrico Lima, Maurício Meirelles, Bela Fernandes, Giovanna Chaves, Márvio Lúcio', null, 'Three girls are invited to participate in a music festival in their summer. However, they discover that they are in summer school, so they need to find a way to go to the musical festival without their parents finding out.', 'Three girls are invited to participate in a music festival in their summer. However, they discover that they are in summer school, so they need to find a way to go to the musical festival without their parents finding out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHUxVCnB3DPu9afBnl01MtlH7q6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655371'),
  ('496871996831718687', 'The Best Things in the World', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Laís Bodanzky, Mauro Pinheiro Jr.', 'Sílvia Lourenço', 'Francisco Miguez, Denise Fraga, Zécarlos Machado, Fiuk, Paulo Vilhena, Caio Blat, Gustavo Machado, Gabriela Rocha', null, 'Everyday family life as perfectly normal madness. “As Melhores Coisas do Mundo“ follows a few days in the life of the 15-year-old Mano, who is fighting on two fronts: his parents have just got divorced and he is going through puberty. Mano tries to make his way through life, with its first sexual experiences, his depressed brother and his self-centered parents. It’s a humorous homage to the pitfalls of daily life and the diversity of life.', 'Everyday family life as perfectly normal madness. “As Melhores Coisas do Mundo“ follows a few days in the life of the 15-year-old Mano, who is fighting on two fronts: his parents have just got divorced and he is going through puberty. Mano tries to make his way through life, with its first sexual experiences, his depressed brother and his self-centered parents. It’s a humorous homage to the pitfalls of daily life and the diversity of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykvUvNuqb61Fw6k6oI6Xeo4GSZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24243'),
  ('91125111849380325', 'The Best Way to Walk', 1976, 'Drama', 'Claude Miller, Bruno Nuytten', 'Luc Béraud, Claude Miller', 'Patrick Dewaere, Patrick Bouchitey, Christine Pascal, Claude Piéplu, Michel Blanc, Marc Chapiteau, Michel Such, Franck d''Ascanio', null, 'In 1960, Marc and Philippe are counselors at a summer camp in the French countryside. One night, Marc finds Philippe dressed and made up as a woman, and from now on, he will keep on humiliating Philippe.', 'In 1960, Marc and Philippe are counselors at a summer camp in the French countryside. One night, Marc finds Philippe dressed and made up as a woman, and from now on, he will keep on humiliating Philippe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iW72f6PG7BAXdjIEvB2R7h4Gv6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70460'),
  ('179435862749534414', 'The Best Years', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Eloi Moli, Roy Bava, Luca John Rosati', 'Paolo Costella, Gabriele Muccino', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Micaela Ramazzotti, Kim Rossi Stuart, Claudio Santamaria, Nicoletta Romanoff, Emma Marrone, Alma Noce, Francesco Centorame', null, 'Italy from the ''80s to the present day, through the dreams, loves, successes and failures of four friends.', 'Italy from the ''80s to the present day, through the dreams, loves, successes and failures of four friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FYekXUC4QMYIBc06JiBHS5Zpbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606566'),
  ('91670623779636401', 'The Best Years of a Life', 2019, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Claude Lelouch, Robert Alazraki', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Anouk Aimée, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Antoine Sire, Marianne Denicourt, Souad Amidou, Monica Bellucci, Tess Lauvergne, Laurent Prudhomme', null, 'They knew each other long ago: a man and a woman whose dazzling and unexpected romance captured in the now-iconic film revolutionized our understanding of love. Today, the former race car driver seems lost in the pathways of his memory. In order to help him, his son seeks out the woman his father wasn’t able to cherish but whom he constantly revisits in his thoughts and dreams. Anne reunites with Jean-Louis and their story picks up where they left it…', 'They knew each other long ago: a man and a woman whose dazzling and unexpected romance captured in the now-iconic film revolutionized our understanding of love. Today, the former race car driver seems lost in the pathways of his memory. In order to help him, his son seeks out the woman his father wasn’t able to cherish but whom he constantly revisits in his thoughts and dreams. Anne reunites with Jean-Louis and their story picks up where they left it…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41jZAOJvZRj4e1jshl3sFzKqHnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582887'),
  ('505962223011461971', 'The Best You Can', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Michael J. Weithorn, Allison Jones, Jennifer Euston', 'Michael J. Weithorn', 'Kyra Sedgwick, Kevin Bacon, Judd Hirsch, Brittany O''Grady, Olivia Luccardi, Meera Rohit Kumbhani, Ray Romano, Pennie Diamond Quintana', 'R', 'Cynthia Rand is a buttoned-up New Yorker married to a brilliant professor 25 years her senior. She begins feeling the effects of her husband’s advancing age on their relationship, just as her world is turned upside down by the arrival of sharp but chronically underachieving security guard Stan Olszewski in this smart rom-com that reunites Bacon and Sedgwick on screen for the first time in 20 years.', 'Cynthia Rand is a buttoned-up New Yorker married to a brilliant professor 25 years her senior. She begins feeling the effects of her husband’s advancing age on their relationship, just as her world is turned upside down by the arrival of sharp but chronically underachieving security guard Stan Olszewski in this smart rom-com that reunites Bacon and Sedgwick on screen for the first time in 20 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JYSb2qiOSkAdCuIRmXRWBecAAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1238379'),
  ('972534362519991874', 'The Bet', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Bernard Campan, Didier Bourdon, Manuel Teran', 'Bernard Campan, Didier Bourdon', 'Didier Bourdon, Bernard Campan, Isabelle Ferron, Isabel Otero, Hélène Surgère, Kelly Lawson, Roger Ibáñez, Philippe Chevallier', null, 'Two rival "brothers-in-law" make a bet that they can stop smoking for 2 weeks. But, it''s just not that easy...', 'Two rival "brothers-in-law" make a bet that they can stop smoking for 2 weeks. But, it''s just not that easy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guTwU8fAQVQ2cLUDLeBph5iQGIB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44706'),
