  ('542363264562237909', 'The Betrothed', 1941, 'History, Romance, Drama', 'Mario Camerini, Anchise Brizzi, Ivo Perilli', 'Mario Camerini, Ivo Perilli, Gabriele Baldini', 'Gino Cervi, Dina Sassoli, Ruggero Ruggeri, Armando Falconi, Enrico Glori, Carlo Ninchi, Luis Hurtado, Evi Maltagliati', null, 'Renzo and Lucia''s love story is jeopardized by Don Rodrigo, a wicked nobleman, who is interested in Lucia. When she refuses his attentions he has her kidnapped and brought to a convent whose prioress is a nun as wicked as he is. The two youths will have to go through a lot of misfortunes before being reunited and being able to marry.', 'Renzo and Lucia''s love story is jeopardized by Don Rodrigo, a wicked nobleman, who is interested in Lucia. When she refuses his attentions he has her kidnapped and brought to a convent whose prioress is a nun as wicked as he is. The two youths will have to go through a lot of misfortunes before being reunited and being able to marry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYz2R7hAEMHEmsWKduZ6Hf9QkJP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98393'),
  ('685237290677263210', 'The Betsy', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Petrie, Mario Tosi', 'William Bast, Walter Bernstein', 'Laurence Olivier, Tommy Lee Jones, Robert Duvall, Katharine Ross, Jane Alexander, Lesley-Anne Down, Joseph Wiseman, Kathleen Beller', 'R', 'Ruthless patriarch Loren hires racecar driver Angelo to build a more efficient vehicle against the wishes of his grandson. But things get even messier when Angelo romances two women in Loren''s life -- his great-granddaughter and his grandson''s mistress.', 'Ruthless patriarch Loren hires racecar driver Angelo to build a more efficient vehicle against the wishes of his grandson. But things get even messier when Angelo romances two women in Loren''s life -- his great-granddaughter and his grandson''s mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK8kTSDTV8JIca8m00pHi3a2bml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58628'),
  ('939596156982908882', 'The Better Angels', 2014, 'Drama, History', 'A.J. Edwards, Matthew J. Lloyd', 'A.J. Edwards', 'Diane Kruger, Jason Clarke, Brit Marling, Wes Bentley, Braydon Denney, Cameron Mitchell Williams, McKenzie Blankenship, Ryan McFall', 'PG', 'At an isolated log cabin in the harsh wilderness of Indiana circa 1817, the rhythms of love, tragedy, and the daily hardships of life on the developing frontier shaped one of our nation’s greatest heroes: Abraham Lincoln. Abe is a thoughtful and quiet boy who spends his days at the side of his beloved mother while learning to work the land from his stern father. When illness takes his mother, Abe''s new guardian angel comes in the form of his new stepmother, who sees the potential in the boy and pushes for his further education.', 'At an isolated log cabin in the harsh wilderness of Indiana circa 1817, the rhythms of love, tragedy, and the daily hardships of life on the developing frontier shaped one of our nation’s greatest heroes: Abraham Lincoln. Abe is a thoughtful and quiet boy who spends his days at the side of his beloved mother while learning to work the land from his stern father. When illness takes his mother, Abe''s new guardian angel comes in the form of his new stepmother, who sees the potential in the boy and pushes for his further education.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6qHQrKBNnUdTLnWfzQ4T1XnU4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192142'),
  ('805139207669385413', 'The Beverly Hillbillies', 1993, 'Comedy, Family', 'Penelope Spheeris, Robert Brinkmann, Evelyne Barbier', 'Jim Fisher, Jim Staahl, Mark Rosenthal', 'Jim Varney, Diedrich Bader, Erika Eleniak, Cloris Leachman, Lily Tomlin, Lea Thompson, Dolly Parton, Rob Schneider', 'PG', 'Mild-mannered dirt-poor hill-dweller Jed Clampett strikes it rich when oil is discovered on his property. At cousin Pearl''s insistence, he moves his family to Beverly Hills to better enjoy his newfound wealth.', 'Mild-mannered dirt-poor hill-dweller Jed Clampett strikes it rich when oil is discovered on his property. At cousin Pearl''s insistence, he moves his family to Beverly Hills to better enjoy his newfound wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/refYLEQvzkY63i2IHronCPQODex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11041'),
  ('593655361635567459', 'The Bewitched House', 1907, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Animation, Horror', 'Segundo de Chomón', 'Segundo de Chomón', null, null, 'A group of travellers go into a house for protection. Little do they know, it is filled with ghosts who make unusual things happen to them.', 'A group of travellers go into a house for protection. Little do they know, it is filled with ghosts who make unusual things happen to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbqlLso0yVgZnoFIZ63ylSxXkMN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138730'),
  ('688961450436794487', 'The Bewitched Inn', 1897, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A weary traveler stops at an inn along the way to get a good night''s sleep, but his rest is interrupted by odd happenings when he gets to his room--beds vanishing and re-appearing, candles exploding, pants flying through the air and his shoes walking away by themselves.', 'A weary traveler stops at an inn along the way to get a good night''s sleep, but his rest is interrupted by odd happenings when he gets to his room--beds vanishing and re-appearing, candles exploding, pants flying through the air and his shoes walking away by themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iC2KCyAhLMoq7wanjmkjPSYlOCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104476'),
  ('683638860211005640', 'The Bewitched Trunk', 1904, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A medieval magician performs a magic show involving a long ornate trunk in which he makes his assistants appear, disappear, and transform into other people.', 'A medieval magician performs a magic show involving a long ornate trunk in which he makes his assistants appear, disappear, and transform into other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVyWXWhY856xCjzYnDAen3gAC12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190729'),
  ('564110282544921200', 'The Bey Doorman', 1987, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Hassan Ibrahim, Samir Farag, Reda El Sayed', 'Youssef Gohar, Atef Shokry', 'Ahmed Zaki, Safia ElEmary, Fouad Al-Mohandes, Ragaa Al-Giddawy, Sayed Zayan, Mohamed Reda, Wael Nour, Farida Saif Elnasr', null, 'Abdel Samea goes to Egypt with his wife and children looking for a job so he works as a doorman, and by being smart he works as a broker until he makes a lot of money', 'Abdel Samea goes to Egypt with his wife and children looking for a job so he works as a doorman, and by being smart he works as a broker until he makes a lot of money', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZRN1z9kDQVboOx4WnxpcBLbVIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502444'),
  ('470214402247594097', 'The Beyond', 1981, 'Horror', 'Lucio Fulci, Sergio Salvati, Roberto Giandalia', 'Giorgio Mariuzzo, Dardano Sacchetti, Lucio Fulci', 'Catriona MacColl, David Warbeck, Cinzia Monreale, Antoine Saint-John, Veronica Lazăr, Larry Ray, Al Cliver, Michele Mirabella', 'NR', 'A young woman inherits an old hotel in Louisiana where, following a series of supernatural "accidents", she learns that the building was built over one of the entrances to Hell.', 'A young woman inherits an old hotel in Louisiana where, following a series of supernatural "accidents", she learns that the building was built over one of the entrances to Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMSZHq9VYQV1FCbM8nz2zrZShzx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19204'),
  ('1054594706097228764', 'The Beyond', 2018, 'Science Fiction', 'Hasraf Dulull', 'Hasraf Dulull', 'David Bailie, Jane Perry, Kosha Engler, Brian Deacon, Noeleen Comiskey, Amy Argyle, Melissa Graham, Bruce Chong', null, 'Set in 2019, The Beyond chronicles the groundbreaking mission which sent astronauts - modified with advanced robotics, through a newly discovered wormhole known as the Void. When the mission returns unexpectedly, the space agency races to discover what the astronauts encountered on their first of its kind interstellar space journey.', 'Set in 2019, The Beyond chronicles the groundbreaking mission which sent astronauts - modified with advanced robotics, through a newly discovered wormhole known as the Void. When the mission returns unexpectedly, the space agency races to discover what the astronauts encountered on their first of its kind interstellar space journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuezKxgZReQmqIrI9QOJZ23Z0y4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449575'),
  ('682562828535557457', 'The BFG', 1990, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Brian Cosgrove', null, 'David Jason, Amanda Root, Angela Thorne, Ballard Berkeley, Michael Knowles, Don Henderson, Mollie Sugden, Frank Thornton', null, 'Sophie is snatched from her orphanage early one morning by the BFG (Big Friendly Giant), whom she witnesses engaged in mysterious activities. She is soon put at ease, as she learns that BFG''s job is to collect, catalog and deliver pleasant dreams to children. She joins him that night, but a mean giants follow them, planning to eat the children of the world.', 'Sophie is snatched from her orphanage early one morning by the BFG (Big Friendly Giant), whom she witnesses engaged in mysterious activities. She is soon put at ease, as she learns that BFG''s job is to collect, catalog and deliver pleasant dreams to children. She joins him that night, but a mean giants follow them, planning to eat the children of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjA5u7ZLgwkSoNCGCUfNSMv4fYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15433'),
  ('690724737074353527', 'The BFG', 2016, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Steven Spielberg, Todd Cherniawsky, Janusz Kamiński', 'Melissa Mathison', 'Mark Rylance, Ruby Barnhill, Rebecca Hall, Jemaine Clement, Bill Hader, Penelope Wilton, Marilyn Norry, Chris Shields', 'PG', 'An orphan little girl befriends a benevolent giant who takes her to Giant Country, where they attempt to stop the man-eating giants that are invading the human world.', 'An orphan little girl befriends a benevolent giant who takes her to Giant Country, where they attempt to stop the man-eating giants that are invading the human world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w17Mc2x2olB5CtewznUFxgpvne0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267935'),
  ('833867842253361451', 'The Bibi Files', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Alexis Bloom, Avner Shahaf', null, 'Benjamin Netanyahu, Ehud Olmert, Nir Hefetz, Ami Ayalon, Raviv Drucker, Arnon Milchan, Simon northway', null, 'Using never-seen-before interrogation footage, this investigation of Benjamin Netanyahu and his inner circle provides an unflinching gaze into the private world behind the headlines. Petty vanity and a sense of entitlement lead to corruption and the Netanyahus'' unwillingness to give up power. The extreme right senses opportunity in Bibi''s weakness, and the dominos fall.', 'Using never-seen-before interrogation footage, this investigation of Benjamin Netanyahu and his inner circle provides an unflinching gaze into the private world behind the headlines. Petty vanity and a sense of entitlement lead to corruption and the Netanyahus'' unwillingness to give up power. The extreme right senses opportunity in Bibi''s weakness, and the dominos fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZTt7g857dGU9YUIIMHd5yNSKnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1353263'),
  ('112611883980377989', 'The Bible: In the Beginning...', 1966, 'Adventure, History, Drama', 'John Huston, Giuseppe Rotunno, Donald C. Rogers', 'Jonathan Griffin, Ivo Perilli, Vittorio Bonicelli', 'Michael Parks, Ulla Bergryd, Richard Harris, John Huston, Stephen Boyd, George C. Scott, Ava Gardner, Peter O''Toole', 'NR', 'Covering only the first 22 chapters of the Book of Genesis, vignettes include: Adam and Eve frolicking in the Garden of Eden until their indulgence in the forbidden fruit sees them driven out; Cain murdering his brother Abel; Noah building an ark to preserve the animals of the world from the coming flood; and Abraham making a covenant with God.', 'Covering only the first 22 chapters of the Book of Genesis, vignettes include: Adam and Eve frolicking in the Garden of Eden until their indulgence in the forbidden fruit sees them driven out; Cain murdering his brother Abel; Noah building an ark to preserve the animals of the world from the coming flood; and Abraham making a covenant with God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BtesvzFQJYFS2sPVVbUdet0TTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2525'),
  ('24375377242173809', 'The Big 4', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Meirina Alwie, Batara Goempar, Timo Tjahjanto', 'Johanna Wattimena, Timo Tjahjanto', 'Abimana Aryasatya, Putri Marino, Lutesha, Arie Kriting, Kristo Immanuel, Marthino Lio, Michelle Tahalea, Michael Kho', null, 'A by-the-book female detective teams up with four down-on-their-luck assassins to investigate her father''s murder.', 'A by-the-book female detective teams up with four down-on-their-luck assassins to investigate her father''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxtf1bovLDyd0dMcKXdwVyqVsuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683328'),
  ('908713836759232786', 'The Big Animal', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Paweł Edelman', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Anna Dymna, Dominika Bednarczyk, Błażej Wójcik, Andrzej Franczyk, Feliks Szajnert, Zbigniew Kaleta, Andrzej Kozak', null, 'When the circus leaves town, Zygmunt and Marysia unwittingly adopt a camel into their home. The couple quickly forms a close bond with the nameless camel, but as the bond grows stronger, their neighbors slowly begin to ostracize them.', 'When the circus leaves town, Zygmunt and Marysia unwittingly adopt a camel into their home. The couple quickly forms a close bond with the nameless camel, but as the bond grows stronger, their neighbors slowly begin to ostracize them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oObL5cFHWzY3XxpMnE4n6KWvp6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89823'),
  ('761165924525750229', 'The Big Apartment', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pascal Thomas, Renan Pollès', 'François Caviglioli, Pascal Thomas, Nathalie Lafaurie', 'Laetitia Casta, Mathieu Amalric, Pierre Arditi, Noémie Lvovsky, Maurice Risch, Sylvie Lachat, Élizabeth Macocco, Dominique Harispuru', null, 'Francesca and her husband, Martin, are dreamers. They live a carefree existence oblivious to the increasingly hostile world closing in on them. Their huge Parisian apartment is a refuge for an array of colorful characters in need of a roof over their heads and in particular for Adrien, a filmmaker who turns their home into his office, studio and love-nest. When their mean landlady tries to evict them all and Martin succumbs to the charms of a beautiful vamp, Francesca comes up with some original and entertaining solutions in the defense of her and everybody else''s happiness.', 'Francesca and her husband, Martin, are dreamers. They live a carefree existence oblivious to the increasingly hostile world closing in on them. Their huge Parisian apartment is a refuge for an array of colorful characters in need of a roof over their heads and in particular for Adrien, a filmmaker who turns their home into his office, studio and love-nest. When their mean landlady tries to evict them all and Martin succumbs to the charms of a beautiful vamp, Francesca comes up with some original and entertaining solutions in the defense of her and everybody else''s happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKQhdfWf78Ov9cG1blQC8xQr5fB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59954'),
  ('886835273722481109', 'The Big Bad Swim', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ishai Setton, Josh Silfen', 'Daniel Schechter', 'Paget Brewster, Jeff Branson, Jess Weixler, Raviv Ullman, Avi Setton, Todd Susman, Kevin Porter Young, Darla Hill', null, 'An adult swim class sets the stage for this sexually charged comedy-drama about love, loss, and second chances. Three strangers -- inextricably connected through personal heartbreak -- find themselves entering deep water as they learn that life isn''t always about diving right in -- it''s about getting your feet wet once in awhile.', 'An adult swim class sets the stage for this sexually charged comedy-drama about love, loss, and second chances. Three strangers -- inextricably connected through personal heartbreak -- find themselves entering deep water as they learn that life isn''t always about diving right in -- it''s about getting your feet wet once in awhile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zDACIUPPzlD5oNaKDwLZgJEebv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23817'),
  ('357141810290714906', 'The Big Bad Wolf', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Sara Berner, Billy Bletcher, Pinto Colvig, Dorothy Compton, Mary Moder, Shirley Reed', 'NR', 'The Big Bad Wolf torments Little Red Riding Hood and the Three Little Pigs.', 'The Big Bad Wolf torments Little Red Riding Hood and the Three Little Pigs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Gezi4uqCAyr0LNWXO3t5HavlXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109298'),
  ('85717020314851852', 'The Big Bad Wolf', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bruno Lavaine, Nicolas Charlet, Laurent Dailland', 'Nicolas Charlet, Bruno Lavaine', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Kad Merad, Fred Testot, Valérie Donzelli, Charlotte Le Bon, Zabou Breitman, Cristiana Réali, Léa Drucker', null, 'Once upon a time in 2012, three brothers lived happily. One day their mom fell into a coma. So Henri, Philippe, and Louis suddenly started wondering about the meaning of their lives and were swamped by a wave of existential doubts. An entirely new situation for this bourgeois trio in their forties, one which opened a door to the novel and indeed the forbidden... and to the big bad wolf!', 'Once upon a time in 2012, three brothers lived happily. One day their mom fell into a coma. So Henri, Philippe, and Louis suddenly started wondering about the meaning of their lives and were swamped by a wave of existential doubts. An entirely new situation for this bourgeois trio in their forties, one which opened a door to the novel and indeed the forbidden... and to the big bad wolf!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mb8lzhFqVG3eduojRXz7s88Wfwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199643'),
  ('642533590424910657', 'The Big Bang', 1984, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Picha', 'Picha, Tony Hendra', 'David L. Lander, Marshall Efron, Marvin Silbersher, Alice Playten, Carole Androsky, Joanna Rush, Ray Owens, Jerry Bledsoe', null, 'In 1995, Italy annihilates Libya, which destroys Israel. Africa bombs Germany, which in turn attacks France. Luxembourg conquers England. Sweden, Monte Carlo and Switzerland immolate themselves.The Russians decide to liquidate the Americans, who unleash their nuclear fleet, leaving only two continents on the verge of World War IV.', 'In 1995, Italy annihilates Libya, which destroys Israel. Africa bombs Germany, which in turn attacks France. Luxembourg conquers England. Sweden, Monte Carlo and Switzerland immolate themselves.The Russians decide to liquidate the Americans, who unleash their nuclear fleet, leaving only two continents on the verge of World War IV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jT1UHQ43d8SR4fUMtJ7AFyYX5pg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16218'),
  ('448134316939151853', 'The Big Bang', 2011, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Tony Krantz, Shelly Johnson', 'Erik Jendresen', 'Antonio Banderas, Thomas Kretschmann, Sienna Guillory, William Fichtner, Delroy Lindo, Sam Elliott, Autumn Reeser, James Van Der Beek', 'R', 'A private detective is hired to find a missing stripper but the job turns complicated when everyone he questions ends up dead. From the mean streets of Los Angeles to the desolate desert of New Mexico, Cruz must contend with a brutal Russian Boxer, three brash LAPD detectives, an aged billionaire looking for the Big Bang, and the billionaire''s stunningly gorgeous wife. The solution to the mystery will cost ten lives, net $30 million and just might explain - well - everything.', 'A private detective is hired to find a missing stripper but the job turns complicated when everyone he questions ends up dead. From the mean streets of Los Angeles to the desolate desert of New Mexico, Cruz must contend with a brutal Russian Boxer, three brash LAPD detectives, an aged billionaire looking for the Big Bang, and the billionaire''s stunningly gorgeous wife. The solution to the mystery will cost ten lives, net $30 million and just might explain - well - everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDBDk1wWOQ7PYSaGKbv8dEsFVYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54271'),
  ('565311214118618182', 'The Big Bee', 2015, 'Thriller', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Yoshiaki Tago, Satoru Karasawa', 'Ichiro Kusuno', 'Yosuke Eguchi, Yukie Nakama, Go Ayano, Ken Mitsuishi, Jiro Sato, Jiro Kagoshima, Kyosuke Yabe, Tasuku Nagase', null, 'Set in 1995. A helicopter, operated remotely, is hovering in the sky over a nuclear power plant. The power company, prefectural government and media all receive a fax. The fax contains a threat that if the nuclear power plant is not taken offline the helicopter will be dropped. 8 hours is given as the deadline. Making the situation even more dire, a young child is in the helicopter.', 'Set in 1995. A helicopter, operated remotely, is hovering in the sky over a nuclear power plant. The power company, prefectural government and media all receive a fax. The fax contains a threat that if the nuclear power plant is not taken offline the helicopter will be dropped. 8 hours is given as the deadline. Making the situation even more dire, a young child is in the helicopter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1XfTNBxLYZsdscsiDb1HIifiwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359592'),
  ('242558217829766334', 'The Big Bet', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Mike Frankovich Jr., William Holbrook, Thomas F. Denove', 'Bert I. Gordon', 'Lance Sloane, Kim Evenson, Sylvia Kristel, Ron Thomas, Robert Anthony Marcucci, Kenneth Ian Davis, John Smith, Stephanie Blake', 'R', 'A high school student obsessed with sex tries to seduce both his beautiful older neighbor and the shy new girl in school over a bet, only to end up falling in love.', 'A high school student obsessed with sex tries to seduce both his beautiful older neighbor and the shy new girl in school over a bet, only to end up falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1P7KTgTpJr3EeZD5lpl2F8cq4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29631'),
  ('63068146194264784', 'The Big Bird Cage', 1972, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Jack Hill, Felipe Sacdalan, Sid Haig', 'Jack Hill', 'Pam Grier, Anitra Ford, Candice Roman, Sid Haig, Teda Bracci, Carol Speed, Karen McKevic, Vic Diaz', 'R', 'Women rebel against slave labor in a filthy jungle prison where they feed sugar cane to a mechanical maw.', 'Women rebel against slave labor in a filthy jungle prison where they feed sugar cane to a mechanical maw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lO5o4si8JPPFi7XAGlFH5az4Yp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22910'),
  ('1137568053035596402', 'The Big Blue', 1988, 'Romance, Adventure, Drama', 'Carlo Varini, Luc Besson, Gary Marcus', 'Luc Besson, Marilyn Goldin, Robert Garland', 'Jean-Marc Barr, Jean Reno, Rosanna Arquette, Paul Shenar, Sergio Castellitto, Jean Bouise, Marc Duret, Griffin Dunne', 'PG-13', 'Childhood friends Jacques and Enzo share a passion for the danger of free diving. Professional diver Jacques opted to follow in the footsteps of his father, who died at sea when Jacques was a boy; to the bewilderment of scientists, Jacques harbors a remarkable ability to adjust his heart rate and breathing pattern in the water, so that his vital signs more closely resemble that of dolphins than men. As Enzo persuades a reluctant Jacques to compete against him in a free diving contest -- determining who can dive deeper and longer without scuba gear -- Jacques meets Johana, a beautiful American insurance investigator, and finds that he must choose between his love for her and his love of the sea.', 'Childhood friends Jacques and Enzo share a passion for the danger of free diving. Professional diver Jacques opted to follow in the footsteps of his father, who died at sea when Jacques was a boy; to the bewilderment of scientists, Jacques harbors a remarkable ability to adjust his heart rate and breathing pattern in the water, so that his vital signs more closely resemble that of dolphins than men. As Enzo persuades a reluctant Jacques to compete against him in a free diving contest -- determining who can dive deeper and longer without scuba gear -- Jacques meets Johana, a beautiful American insurance investigator, and finds that he must choose between his love for her and his love of the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3t5t7yaFiTJQlqxiTkXJMFZdkh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175'),
  ('393452221749863916', 'The Big Bluff', 1955, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Gordon Avil, W. Lee Wilder', 'Fred Freiberger', 'John Bromfield, Martha Vickers, Robert Hutton, Rosemarie Stack, Eve Miller, Max Palmer, Eddie Bee, Robert Bice', null, 'When a scheming fortune hunter finds his rich wife is not going to die as expected, he and his lover make other plans to get her millions.', 'When a scheming fortune hunter finds his rich wife is not going to die as expected, he and his lover make other plans to get her millions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bU8bv4DmKj9aUJyxM0VrxPPcB1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55601'),
  ('762975232340840529', 'The Big Boodle', 1957, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Richard Wilson, Lee Garmes, Henry Hartman', 'Jo Eisinger', 'Errol Flynn, Pedro Armendáriz, Rossana Rory, Gia Scala, Jacques Aubuchon, Sandro Giglio, Charles Todd, Francisco Canero', 'NR', 'Tough guy fights gangsters and counterfeiters in pre-Castro Cuba.', 'Tough guy fights gangsters and counterfeiters in pre-Castro Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nilIBJ6dJVpWUf9fqaR2QubUYBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62026'),
  ('731276731450287089', 'The Big Boss', 1971, 'Action', 'Chris Chen Ching-Chu, Lo Wei, Chan Chue', 'Lo Wei', 'Bruce Lee, Maria Yi, James Tien Chun, Marilyn Bautista, Han Ying-Chieh, Tony Liu Tian-jue, Li Kun, Nora Miao', 'R', 'Cheng is a young Chinese mainlander who moves in with his expatriate cousins to work at an ice factory in Thailand. He does this with a family promise never to get involved in any fights. However, when members of his family begin disappearing after meeting the management of the factory, the resulting mystery and pressures force him to break that vow and take on the villainy of the Big Boss.', 'Cheng is a young Chinese mainlander who moves in with his expatriate cousins to work at an ice factory in Thailand. He does this with a family promise never to get involved in any fights. However, when members of his family begin disappearing after meeting the management of the factory, the resulting mystery and pressures force him to break that vow and take on the villainy of the Big Boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VFYDWYnAhXAgyqgs94lwNmMBbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12481'),
  ('144214602009358805', 'The Big Bounce', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime', 'George Armitage, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Brent Armitage', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Owen Wilson, Morgan Freeman, Gary Sinise, Sara Foster, Willie Nelson, Vinnie Jones, Bebe Neuwirth, Charlie Sheen', 'PG-13', 'A small-time con artist and a Hawaiian real estate developer''s mischievous, enterprising mistress team up for a potential $200,000 score.', 'A small-time con artist and a Hawaiian real estate developer''s mischievous, enterprising mistress team up for a potential $200,000 score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6tzLXXGubnC6TbFgg8acfcvGRO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12634'),
  ('619431071063839235', 'The Big Brass Ring', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'George Hickenlooper, Kramer Morgenthau, Mark Anthony Little', 'Oja Kodar, Orson Welles', 'William Hurt, Nigel Hawthorne, Miranda Richardson, Irène Jacob, Ewan Stewart, Gregg Henry, Ron Livingston, Jefferson Mays', 'PG', 'Blake Pellarin is on the campaign trail to become president of the United States. While making a stop in St. Louis, a chance encounter brings his past back to haunt him.', 'Blake Pellarin is on the campaign trail to become president of the United States. While making a stop in St. Louis, a chance encounter brings his past back to haunt him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYWX7eCzM08ewfHxSk8MsNTqPRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63108'),
