  ('525199343433360702', 'The Big Brother', 1982, 'Crime', 'Francis Girod, Bernard Zitzermann', 'Michel Grisolia, Francis Girod', 'Gérard Depardieu, Souad Amidou, Hakim Ghanem, Jean Rochefort, Roger Planchon, Jacques Villeret, Christine Fersen, Smaïn', null, 'The plot in this story weaves around like a New Year''s reveler at four in the morning, heading first in one direction and then in another, with the intention of going home if things would just stop moving. Bernard (Gerard Depardieu) is a doctor whose Hippocratic oath was a hypocritic failure -- the not-so-good doctor kills his wife because she is having an affair, and he kills her lover too. Then he joins the French Foreign Legion. On his way to the former French colonies in Africa, the plane he is in crashes, and Rossi, a "friend" on the plane with some overweight in carry-on money, shoots Bernard and takes off, leaving him for dead. He is nursed back to life and health by friendly villagers and just his luck, he not only manages to make his fortune in Africa, he also nabs a French passport from a dying man who will clearly not need it anymore unless the Pearly Gates have a French guard.', 'The plot in this story weaves around like a New Year''s reveler at four in the morning, heading first in one direction and then in another, with the intention of going home if things would just stop moving. Bernard (Gerard Depardieu) is a doctor whose Hippocratic oath was a hypocritic failure -- the not-so-good doctor kills his wife because she is having an affair, and he kills her lover too. Then he joins the French Foreign Legion. On his way to the former French colonies in Africa, the plane he is in crashes, and Rossi, a "friend" on the plane with some overweight in carry-on money, shoots Bernard and takes off, leaving him for dead. He is nursed back to life and health by friendly villagers and just his luck, he not only manages to make his fortune in Africa, he also nabs a French passport from a dying man who will clearly not need it anymore unless the Pearly Gates have a French guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAn2AC9MC44Z3k6dBftF1nsrzzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67649'),
  ('806965901321849585', 'The Big Bull', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Vishnu Rao, R.P. Yadav, Kookie Gulati', 'Kookie Gulati, Arjun Dhawan', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Ileana D''Cruz, Sohum Shah, Nikita Dutta, Ram Kapoor, Saurabh Shukla, Kanan Arunachalam, Supriya Pathak', null, 'Inspired by events from the late ''80s and the early ''90s that shook the country''s financial fabric, The Big Bull tells the story of the biggest hustle in the stock market.', 'Inspired by events from the late ''80s and the early ''90s that shook the country''s financial fabric, The Big Bull tells the story of the biggest hustle in the stock market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0R4hvkS5KNkChVz0UZTDkrdKzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660042'),
  ('1146443653866704997', 'The Big Bus', 1976, 'Action, Comedy', 'James Frawley, Harry Stradling Jr.', 'Fred Freeman, Lawrence J. Cohen', 'Joseph Bologna, Stockard Channing, John Beck, René Auberjonois, Ned Beatty, Bob Dishy, José Ferrer, Ruth Gordon', 'PG', 'A nuclear-powered bus is making its maiden non-stop trip from New York to Denver. The journey is plagued by disasters due to the machinations of a mysterious group allied with the oil lobby. Will the down-on-his-luck driver, with a reputation for eating his passengers, be able to complete the journey?', 'A nuclear-powered bus is making its maiden non-stop trip from New York to Denver. The journey is plagued by disasters due to the machinations of a mysterious group allied with the oil lobby. Will the down-on-his-luck driver, with a reputation for eating his passengers, be able to complete the journey?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcwW5YBEGvWPx8NBN5PxdvoYc0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19133'),
