  ('65466396813927092', 'The Big City', 1963, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Subrata Mitra', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Madhabi Mukherjee, Anil Chatterjee, Haren Chatterjee, Haradhan Bandyopadhyay, Vicky Redwood, Jaya Bachchan, Sefalika Devi, Prasenjit Sarkar', null, 'After her husband loses his job, a housewife from a middle-class, conservative family in Calcutta gets a job as a salesperson.', 'After her husband loses his job, a housewife from a middle-class, conservative family in Calcutta gets a job as a salesperson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2GjQ8WGS20KtqsbgeHgSjiwnln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60567'),
