  ('21604223711810020', 'The Big Night', 1959, 'Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Armando Nannuzzi, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Jacques-Laurent Bost', 'Laurent Terzieff, Jean-Claude Brialy, Franco Interlenghi, Rosanna Schiaffino, Elsa Martinelli, Anna Maria Ferrero, Tomas Milian, Antonella Lualdi', 'NR', 'The exploits of three young Roman criminals are chronicled in this socially conscious drama. The young men commit petty crimes all day, beginning with arms theft, leading to an encounter with three streetwalkers. After their pleasure, the boys try to cheat the hookers, but the ladies are smarter than that and have stolen their cash ahead of time. It''s back to the city for the boys, where they continue their destructive games...', 'The exploits of three young Roman criminals are chronicled in this socially conscious drama. The young men commit petty crimes all day, beginning with arms theft, leading to an encounter with three streetwalkers. After their pleasure, the boys try to cheat the hookers, but the ladies are smarter than that and have stolen their cash ahead of time. It''s back to the city for the boys, where they continue their destructive games...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/285bE6u0t0xOwkaRg1lrW3zyN0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68821'),
  ('595299991534401453', 'The Big Night', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Hugues Poulain, Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern', 'Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Albert Dupontel, Areski Belkacem, Brigitte Fontaine, Gérard Depardieu, Yolande Moreau, Chloé Mons, Bouli Lanners', null, 'An ageing punk-with-a-dog and his brother the conformist decide to get their revenge on a shopping mall. Directing duo Benoit Delepine and Gustave Kervern, longstanding comic crusaders against capitalism, again set out to surprise and shock the bourgeois audience.', 'An ageing punk-with-a-dog and his brother the conformist decide to get their revenge on a shopping mall. Directing duo Benoit Delepine and Gustave Kervern, longstanding comic crusaders against capitalism, again set out to surprise and shock the bourgeois audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6N04MHSs9hToOTSwWY3gP8PE31w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70793'),
