  ('1049244120373299648', 'The Biggest Fan', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Guillard, Anna Lichtenberg, Stéphane Bidault', 'Philippe Guillard', 'Gérard Lanvin, Artus, Antoine Bertrand, Laura del Sol, Natasha Andrews, Caroline Bourg, Lou Chauvain, Antony Hickling', null, 'Gérard Lanvin has an important role in a new blockbuster! Filming is about to begin in the South of France. On site, he meets Momo Zapareto, the pool boy at the house he is renting for the duration or the shoot. But Momo is a fan, a big fan… an uberfan! He has seen all his films and is soon doing all he can to make himself indispensable to his idol and the technical crew. For Gérard, the nightmare has just begun…', 'Gérard Lanvin has an important role in a new blockbuster! Filming is about to begin in the South of France. On site, he meets Momo Zapareto, the pool boy at the house he is renting for the duration or the shoot. But Momo is a fan, a big fan… an uberfan! He has seen all his films and is soon doing all he can to make himself indispensable to his idol and the technical crew. For Gérard, the nightmare has just begun…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7q9yYShODKJBpf6BJH3xA00eh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838916'),
