  ('47905598368425513', 'The Biggest Heroes', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Anthony Dod Mantle', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Bo Hr. Hansen', 'Thomas Bo Larsen, Ulrich Thomsen, Mia Maria Back, Bjarne Henriksen, Paprika Steen, Trine Dyrholm, Hella Joof, Eva Röse', null, 'The two medicated low-lifes Carsten and Peter are long time partners, an old flame of Peter''s turns up to tell him that he has a twelve year old daughter, whom he should present himself to. Her adoptive father is a mean bastard, and incestive undertones lies in the relationship between the two. The daughter escapes from her adoptive father, turns up at Peter''s place, and Carsten, Peter, and the daughter escapes to Sweden.', 'The two medicated low-lifes Carsten and Peter are long time partners, an old flame of Peter''s turns up to tell him that he has a twelve year old daughter, whom he should present himself to. Her adoptive father is a mean bastard, and incestive undertones lies in the relationship between the two. The daughter escapes from her adoptive father, turns up at Peter''s place, and Carsten, Peter, and the daughter escapes to Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0AObd9g2FIi4hlSuU6l89elESB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49302'),
  ('803024806000280218', 'The Biggest Little Farm', 2019, 'Documentary', 'John Chester, John Chester', 'Mark Monroe, John Chester', 'John Chester, Molly Chester, Beaudie Chester', 'PG', 'The successes and failures of a couple determined to live in harmony with nature on a farm outside of Los Angeles are lovingly chronicled by filmmaking farmer John Chester, in this inspiring documentary.', 'The successes and failures of a couple determined to live in harmony with nature on a farm outside of Los Angeles are lovingly chronicled by filmmaking farmer John Chester, in this inspiring documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpR9OdRibETfuWNrdxStAJDRU7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543084'),
