  ('501221411870754813', 'The Binge', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jeremy Garelick, Andrew Huebscher', 'Jordan VanDina', 'Skyler Gisondo, Dexter Darden, Eduardo Franco, Vince Vaughn, Grace Van Dien, Esteban Benito, Eileen Galindo, Marta Piekarz', null, 'In the not-so-distant future, all drinking and drugs have been made completely illegal by the government, except for one night a year. High school seniors Griffin, Hags, and Andrew make a pilgrimage to get to the best party in town where all their dreams will come true. They will have to avoid their crazed principal, violent siblings, and the wild animals roaming the streets.', 'In the not-so-distant future, all drinking and drugs have been made completely illegal by the government, except for one night a year. High school seniors Griffin, Hags, and Andrew make a pilgrimage to get to the best party in town where all their dreams will come true. They will have to avoid their crazed principal, violent siblings, and the wild animals roaming the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQlkeVkziJe3Jb9tdGSYnNGisSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647265'),
  ('5859688412228331', 'The Bingo Long Traveling All-Stars & Motor Kings', 1976, 'Comedy', 'John Badham, Bill Butler, Tom Joyner', 'Hal Barwood, Matthew Robbins', 'Billy Dee Williams, James Earl Jones, Richard Pryor, Rico Dawson, Sam Brison, Jophery C. Brown, Leon Wagner, Tony Burton', 'PG', 'Top baseball pitcher Bingo Long is fed up with how his Negro League team owner treats him, so he forms his own lineup, recruiting big-hitting Leon Carter and Charlie Snow, who dreams of playing in the majors. Boycotted by black teams, Long''s outfit play minor league white teams, earning more attention as entertainers than as players. However, their success wins them a chance to play again in the Negro League, this time as equals.', 'Top baseball pitcher Bingo Long is fed up with how his Negro League team owner treats him, so he forms his own lineup, recruiting big-hitting Leon Carter and Charlie Snow, who dreams of playing in the majors. Boycotted by black teams, Long''s outfit play minor league white teams, earning more attention as entertainers than as players. However, their success wins them a chance to play again in the Negro League, this time as equals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kvjllELG8AGLifc433GhLzShj0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42243'),
