  ('171229837141030994', 'The Birdcage', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Mike Nichols, Emmanuel Lubezki, Joel Tuber', 'Édouard Molinaro, Francis Veber, Marcello Danon', 'Robin Williams, Gene Hackman, Nathan Lane, Dianne Wiest, Dan Futterman, Calista Flockhart, Hank Azaria, Christine Baranski', 'R', 'A gay cabaret owner and his drag queen partner agree to put up a false heterosexual front so that their son can introduce them to his fiancée''s conservative parents.', 'A gay cabaret owner and his drag queen partner agree to put up a false heterosexual front so that their son can introduce them to his fiancée''s conservative parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hU2XeckncHS61TWZKDtw1BrKmOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11000'),
  ('166356921491447503', 'The Birdcatcher', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Ross Clarke, John Christian Rosenlund, Ellen Michelsen', 'Trond Morten Venaasen', 'Sarah-Sofie Boussnina, Arthur Hakalahti, Jakob Cedergren, Laura Birn, Johannes Bah Kuhnke, August Diehl, Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Jonas Hoff Oftebro', null, 'Norway, 1942, during World War II. After being separated from her family, Esther, a young Jewish girl from Trondheim, arrives at an isolated farm where she must assume a new identity in order to survive the Nazi persecution.', 'Norway, 1942, during World War II. After being separated from her family, Esther, a young Jewish girl from Trondheim, arrives at an isolated farm where she must assume a new identity in order to survive the Nazi persecution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYRWp7S9gpERJFvVt9TaTDWRPQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489176'),
  ('183233483090042470', 'The Birds', 1963, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Robert Burks, Alfred Hitchcock, James H. Brown', 'Evan Hunter', 'Tippi Hedren, Rod Taylor, Jessica Tandy, Suzanne Pleshette, Veronica Cartwright, Ethel Griffies, Charles McGraw, Ruth McDevitt', 'NR', 'Thousands of birds flock into a seaside town and terrorize the residents in a series of deadly attacks.', 'Thousands of birds flock into a seaside town and terrorize the residents in a series of deadly attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eClg8QPg8mwB6INIC4pyR5pAbDr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571'),
  ('864749705856645732', 'The Birds II: Land''s End', 1994, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Rick Rosenthal, Bruce Surtees, Michael Kelly', null, 'Brad Johnson, Chelsea Field, James Naughton, Jan Rubeš, Tippi Hedren, Stephanie Milford, Megan Gallacher, Richard K. Olsen', 'R', 'Ted and his family have just moved to the sleepy coastal town of Gull Island so that he can complete work on his thesis. Everything couldn’t seem more picturesque about their new, seaside home… that is, except for the increasing number of aggressively behaving birds.', 'Ted and his family have just moved to the sleepy coastal town of Gull Island so that he can complete work on his thesis. Everything couldn’t seem more picturesque about their new, seaside home… that is, except for the increasing number of aggressively behaving birds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hJ1WWMmR5IyhpSmZjcFz5PwdED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4337'),
  ('691614533709898124', 'The Birds, the Bees and the Italians', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Pietro Germi, Francesco Massaro, Michael Haggiag', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Pietro Germi, Agenore Incrocci', 'Virna Lisi, Gastone Moschin, Nora Ricci, Alberto Lionello, Olga Villi, Beba Lončar, Franco Fabrizi, Gigi Ballista', null, 'An anthology presents three storylines, all set in the Italian town of Treviso: A husband pretends to be impotent as a cover for having an affair; a bank clerk abandons his wife for his mistress, but the rest of the town''s husbands become jealous and unite to conspire against them; and local men all seduce a promiscuous young woman, but when her father eventually reveals that she is underage, they all face prosecution for statutory rape.', 'An anthology presents three storylines, all set in the Italian town of Treviso: A husband pretends to be impotent as a cover for having an affair; a bank clerk abandons his wife for his mistress, but the rest of the town''s husbands become jealous and unite to conspire against them; and local men all seduce a promiscuous young woman, but when her father eventually reveals that she is underage, they all face prosecution for statutory rape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9q3b1tVa4LO2Xx3JUcjThdV3b12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17974'),
  ('791382482867679268', 'The Birth of a Nation', 1915, 'Drama, History, War', 'Billy Bitzer, Joseph Carl Breil, Robert Harron', 'D.W. Griffith', 'Lillian Gish, Mae Marsh, Henry B. Walthall, Miriam Cooper, Mary Alden, Ralph Lewis, George Siegmann, Walter Long', 'NR', 'Two families, abolitionist Northerners the Stonemans and Southern landowners the Camerons, intertwine. When Confederate colonel Ben Cameron is captured in battle, nurse Elsie Stoneman petitions for his pardon. In Reconstruction-era South Carolina, Cameron founds the Ku Klux Klan, battling Elsie''s congressman father and his African-American protégé, Silas Lynch.', 'Two families, abolitionist Northerners the Stonemans and Southern landowners the Camerons, intertwine. When Confederate colonel Ben Cameron is captured in battle, nurse Elsie Stoneman petitions for his pardon. In Reconstruction-era South Carolina, Cameron founds the Ku Klux Klan, battling Elsie''s congressman father and his African-American protégé, Silas Lynch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNpOXpQI5GSUfiWypubYtMh9928.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618'),
  ('933748397082472871', 'The Birth of a Nation', 2016, 'Drama', 'Nate Parker, Elliot Davis, Mark C. Stevens', 'Nate Parker', 'Nate Parker, Armie Hammer, Aja Naomi King, Jackie Earle Haley, Penelope Ann Miller, Gabrielle Union, Mark Boone Junior, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor', 'R', 'Nat Turner, a former slave in America, leads a liberation movement in 1831 to free African-Americans in Virginia that results in a violent retaliation from whites.', 'Nat Turner, a former slave in America, leads a liberation movement in 1831 to free African-Americans in Virginia that results in a violent retaliation from whites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlbvPL3uXem7JaVWM2mVHJLkRqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339408'),
  ('815389533877800968', 'The Birth of Kitaro: The Mystery of GeGeGe', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Fantasy, Horror', 'Tomoyuki Ishiyama, Gou Koga, Kohei Kido', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Masako Nozawa, Toshihiko Seki, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Umeka Shouji, Toshio Furukawa, Atsumi Tanezaki, Yumiko Kobayashi', null, '1955. Kitaro''s father, Medama Oyaji, comes to Yagura Village in search of his missing wife. The village was ruled by the Ryuga clan, which controls Japan''s political and business circles behind the scenes. Mizuki, who works at a blood bank, visits the village with a secret mission to mourn the death of the head of his family, and meets Kitaro''s father. While an ugly fight unfolds over the succession of the head of the family, a member of the family is brutally murdered at the village shrine. It was the beginning of a terrifying chain of events.', '1955. Kitaro''s father, Medama Oyaji, comes to Yagura Village in search of his missing wife. The village was ruled by the Ryuga clan, which controls Japan''s political and business circles behind the scenes. Mizuki, who works at a blood bank, visits the village with a secret mission to mourn the death of the head of his family, and meets Kitaro''s father. While an ugly fight unfolds over the succession of the head of the family, a member of the family is brutally murdered at the village shrine. It was the beginning of a terrifying chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5g1i5EJgMNI70titUJSIBKpmEVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:904759'),
  ('914209997806425932', 'The Birth of Love', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philippe Garrel, Raoul Coutard', 'Philippe Garrel, Muriel Cerf, Marc Cholodenko', 'Lou Castel, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Johanna ter Steege, Dominique Reymond, Marie-Paule Laval, Max McCarthy, Margi Clarke, Aurélia Alcaïs', null, 'The unhappy love lives of Paul and Marcus, two artists and friends who are neither particularly young nor successful anymore.', 'The unhappy love lives of Paul and Marcus, two artists and friends who are neither particularly young nor successful anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYNxF3p7inOfRKN62yAeZoKUzE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84003'),
  ('22657958652050074', 'The Birth of Magellan: Cadenza I', 1977, null, 'Hollis Frampton', null, null, null, 'Hollis Frampton alludes to origins and creation as he cuts between a garden featuring a bride and groom and an 1902 film entitled "A Little Piece of String."', 'Hollis Frampton alludes to origins and creation as he cuts between a garden featuring a bride and groom and an 1902 film entitled "A Little Piece of String."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofhZillP3PWscG00L4MDra04MOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154612'),
  ('461968060518413135', 'The Birth of Saké', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'Erik Shirai, Erik Shirai', 'Erik Shirai', null, null, 'Through the unrelenting winter in the north of Japan, a small group of workers must brave unusual working conditions to bring to life a 2,000-year-old tradition known as sake. A cinematic documentary, The Birth of Sake is a visually immersive experience of an almost-secret world in which large sacrifices must be made for the survival of a time-honored brew.', 'Through the unrelenting winter in the north of Japan, a small group of workers must brave unusual working conditions to bring to life a 2,000-year-old tradition known as sake. A cinematic documentary, The Birth of Sake is a visually immersive experience of an almost-secret world in which large sacrifices must be made for the survival of a time-honored brew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kzKjSvC3t3pRS14WUkKi1ne4Il.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328594'),
  ('390019357647376470', 'The Birth of the Robot', 1936, 'Animation', 'Len Lye, Alex Strasser', 'C.H. David', null, null, 'This experiment was a “prestige advertisement” for Shell Motor Oil. As conventional animation became dominated by Walt Disney, many European filmmakers turned to puppets as an alternative, and Lye enlisted the help of avant-garde friends such as Humphrey Jennings and John Banting to make the amusing puppets. Exploring the still-complex color process, which involved the combination of three separate images, Lye creates such a vivid storm scene that reviewers hailed it as “proof that the color film has entered a new stage.” The music is Holst’s The Planets. - Harvard Film Archive', 'This experiment was a “prestige advertisement” for Shell Motor Oil. As conventional animation became dominated by Walt Disney, many European filmmakers turned to puppets as an alternative, and Lye enlisted the help of avant-garde friends such as Humphrey Jennings and John Banting to make the amusing puppets. Exploring the still-complex color process, which involved the combination of three separate images, Lye creates such a vivid storm scene that reviewers hailed it as “proof that the color film has entered a new stage.” The music is Holst’s The Planets. - Harvard Film Archive', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A37h1Qbl1U0Sd4jkycqEXHRjkq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203089'),
  ('22246061099814088', 'The Birth Reborn', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Eduardo Chauvet', 'Érica de Paula, Eduardo Chauvet', 'Márcio Garcia', null, 'The feature film '' The Birth Reborn'' portrays the serious obstetric reality in the world, which is characterized by an alarming number of cesarean or deliveries with traumatic and unnecessary interventions, as opposed to what is known and recommended by science today. This situation has serious perinatal, psychological, social, anthropological and financial consequences. Through the reports of some of the leading experts in the area and the latest scientific discoveries, the film questions the current obstetric model, leads to a reflection on the new paradigm of the twenty-first century and the future of a civilization born without the so-called ''love hormones'', released only under specific conditions of labor.', 'The feature film '' The Birth Reborn'' portrays the serious obstetric reality in the world, which is characterized by an alarming number of cesarean or deliveries with traumatic and unnecessary interventions, as opposed to what is known and recommended by science today. This situation has serious perinatal, psychological, social, anthropological and financial consequences. Through the reports of some of the leading experts in the area and the latest scientific discoveries, the film questions the current obstetric model, leads to a reflection on the new paradigm of the twenty-first century and the future of a civilization born without the so-called ''love hormones'', released only under specific conditions of labor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHtGIuSuKJg53AZpVtTWdZYwcub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227108'),
  ('1035965428983138060', 'The Birth, the Life and the Death of Christ', 1906, 'Drama, History', 'Alice Guy-Blaché, Victorin-Hippolyte Jasset, Anatole Thiberville', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, 'The stations of Christ''s life are segmented into a series of performative tableaux.', 'The stations of Christ''s life are segmented into a series of performative tableaux.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOsyQKe6CauSel73w0oIp52hpVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120015'),
  ('717879556339772489', 'The Birthday Cake', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Cassius Corrigan, Hans Augustave, Nick Page', 'Diomedes Raul Bermudez, Shiloh Fernandez, Jimmy Giannopoulos', 'Shiloh Fernandez, Ewan McGregor, Val Kilmer, Lorraine Bracco, William Fichtner, Aldis Hodge, Penn Badgley, Jeremy Allen White', 'R', 'On the 10th anniversary of his father''s death, Giovanni reluctantly accepts the task of bringing a cake to the home of his uncle, a mob boss, for a celebration. Just two hours into the night, Gio''s life is forever changed.', 'On the 10th anniversary of his father''s death, Giovanni reluctantly accepts the task of bringing a cake to the home of his uncle, a mob boss, for a celebration. Just two hours into the night, Gio''s life is forever changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kI3lTv3f24Fzl2kD0sYVCvCOZh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624481'),
  ('738318876785578588', 'The Birthday of the Dog', 1975, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo, Alex Phillips', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo', 'Jorge Martínez de Hoyos, Diana Bracho, Lina Montes, Héctor Bonilla, Marcelo Villamil, María Guadalupe Delgado, Delia Casanova, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Jr.', null, 'Two men who kill their wives so they can be together. A tailor goes from having his dog as his best friend to a young man, in a friendship that becomes so very close that the younger man murders his wife. He is helped by the other man. The husband wants to help him, but his wife wants to turn him in to the police. So he also kills his wife.', 'Two men who kill their wives so they can be together. A tailor goes from having his dog as his best friend to a young man, in a friendship that becomes so very close that the younger man murders his wife. He is helped by the other man. The husband wants to help him, but his wife wants to turn him in to the police. So he also kills his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sqWfp7J8SBaZflPNs9TwsNUHmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337484'),
  ('1096661243053527239', 'The Birthday Party', 1931, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', null, 'Mickey''s friends throw him a surprise birthday party at Minnie''s house. The chef brings out the cake (with 2 candles); Mickey manages to blow all the cake onto the chef''s face, while the candles stay lit. He unwraps his present: a miniature piano. He plays a duet of I Can''t Give You Anything But Love, Baby with Minnie, followed by an instrumental version of The Darktown Strutter''s Ball, which everyone dances to (including Mickey and Minnie, while the piano stools keep playing). Mickey then plays There''s No Place Like Home on the xylophone, then accompanies Minnie on another piece, after which the xylophone gets frisky and eventually dumps Mickey in the fish bowl.', 'Mickey''s friends throw him a surprise birthday party at Minnie''s house. The chef brings out the cake (with 2 candles); Mickey manages to blow all the cake onto the chef''s face, while the candles stay lit. He unwraps his present: a miniature piano. He plays a duet of I Can''t Give You Anything But Love, Baby with Minnie, followed by an instrumental version of The Darktown Strutter''s Ball, which everyone dances to (including Mickey and Minnie, while the piano stools keep playing). Mickey then plays There''s No Place Like Home on the xylophone, then accompanies Minnie on another piece, after which the xylophone gets frisky and eventually dumps Mickey in the fish bowl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTvvCNPnYCEYlyAylvr6uGceVCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39304'),
  ('352499266820868945', 'The Birthday Party', 1968, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'William Friedkin, Denys N. Coop, Andrew Grieve', 'Harold Pinter', 'Robert Shaw, Patrick Magee, Dandy Nichols, Sydney Tafler, Moultrie Kelsall, Helen Fraser', 'PG-13', 'Based on Harold Pinter''s enigmatic play about a boarder in a British seaside dwelling who is visited by two strangers. They torment him verbally, ask him idiotic unanswerable questions, force him to sit down and stand up, and give him a "party". Then, eventually, they take him away, a tongue-tied idiot. The trivial becomes the terrible, and with it a certain wonder, a certain pity.', 'Based on Harold Pinter''s enigmatic play about a boarder in a British seaside dwelling who is visited by two strangers. They torment him verbally, ask him idiotic unanswerable questions, force him to sit down and stand up, and give him a "party". Then, eventually, they take him away, a tongue-tied idiot. The trivial becomes the terrible, and with it a certain wonder, a certain pity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgPV2nIX4i7pmoUF3ds6PBjBrhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121052'),
  ('848975589946540076', 'The Birthday Party', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Francesco Sossai, Giulia Schelhas, Adriano Candiago', 'Francesco Sossai', 'Nicola Cannarella, Matthias Tormen, Denis Fasolo, Elia Luciani, Luisa Trigilla, Livio Pacella', null, 'December 1999. I remember that, amidst the Millennium Bug anxiety, I went to the birthday of Enrico, a kid who lived with his family in an old and isolated farmhouse.', 'December 1999. I remember that, amidst the Millennium Bug anxiety, I went to the birthday of Enrico, a kid who lived with his family in an old and isolated farmhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/de8F6gLYHUhiEaOhj6jCkhi2SMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1116548'),
  ('1061420044825679179', 'The Birthday Wish', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Sarah Rogers, Bill Mizel, Erez T. Yanuv Barzilay', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Jessy Schram, Luke Macfarlane, Marcus Rosner, David James Lewis, Cardi Wong, Derek Green, Drew Ray Tanner, Benita Ha', 'G', 'A woman expecting to get engaged on her all-important 30th birthday gets a different surprise after she makes her birthday wish: a glimpse into her future – which doesn’t resemble anything she’s ever imagined for herself.', 'A woman expecting to get engaged on her all-important 30th birthday gets a different surprise after she makes her birthday wish: a glimpse into her future – which doesn’t resemble anything she’s ever imagined for herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9gK5vq7ByP76dYUC5xeCa7jWCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435117'),
  ('754086244765569686', 'The Biscuit Eater', 1972, 'Drama, Family', 'Vincent McEveety, Richard Caffey, Richard A. Kelley', 'Lawrence Edward Watkin', 'Earl Holliman, Johnny Whitaker, Pat Crowley, Lew Ayres, Godfrey Cambridge, Beah Richards, Clifton James, George Spell', 'G', 'Nothing warms the heart like the story of a boy and his dog. Lonnie (Johnny Whitaker) and Text (George Spell) are two friends determined, against all odds, to turn a misfit hound into a hero. Tennessee farmer and dog trainer Harve McNeil (Earl Holliman) tells his son Lonnie that his dog, Moreover, is a good-for-nothing "biscuit eater."', 'Nothing warms the heart like the story of a boy and his dog. Lonnie (Johnny Whitaker) and Text (George Spell) are two friends determined, against all odds, to turn a misfit hound into a hero. Tennessee farmer and dog trainer Harve McNeil (Earl Holliman) tells his son Lonnie that his dog, Moreover, is a good-for-nothing "biscuit eater."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvUcdJVJ0hNMMUa1QFoLtXUoPQS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56067'),
  ('1037558656376304959', 'The Bishop Murder Case', 1929, 'Mystery', 'Nick Grindé, David Burton, Roy F. Overbaugh', 'Lenore J. Coffee', 'Basil Rathbone, Leila Hyams, Roland Young, Alec B. Francis, George F. Marion, Zelda Sears, Bodil Rosing, Carroll Nye', 'PG', 'The murders start with the body of Robin. He is found with a arrow through the heart, but Vance deduces that the body was placed and not found where he was killed. The note found dealing with the murder was part of a nursery rhyme and signed by ''Bishop''. The only witness may have been Mrs. Drukker and Adolph, but they are not talking. As the murders progress, each one is accompanied by a nursery rhyme. It is up to Philo Vance to unravel the clues and unmask the identity of the murderer ''Bishop''.', 'The murders start with the body of Robin. He is found with a arrow through the heart, but Vance deduces that the body was placed and not found where he was killed. The note found dealing with the murder was part of a nursery rhyme and signed by ''Bishop''. The only witness may have been Mrs. Drukker and Adolph, but they are not talking. As the murders progress, each one is accompanied by a nursery rhyme. It is up to Philo Vance to unravel the clues and unmask the identity of the murderer ''Bishop''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNueCH8pzU8alf1c9hXlZiwYUV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61546'),
  ('291306840301454798', 'The Bishop''s Bedroom', 1977, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Dino Risi, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Dino Risi', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Patrick Dewaere, Ornella Muti, Lia Tanzi, Gabriella Giacobbe, Katia Tchenko, Karine Verlier, Franco Sangermano', null, 'Mario, a rich and eccentric war hero befriends Marco, a loner with a sailboat, and takes him home to meet his estranged wife Cleofe and sexually repressed sister in law Matilde. Mario confesses his love for Matilde and so ensues a love triangle.', 'Mario, a rich and eccentric war hero befriends Marco, a loner with a sailboat, and takes him home to meet his estranged wife Cleofe and sexually repressed sister in law Matilde. Mario confesses his love for Matilde and so ensues a love triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxlQS5p0AdWT3RS4HatliFZv8Kv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63071'),
  ('547614655046392432', 'The Bishop''s Wife', 1947, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Henry Koster, Gregg Toland, Joseph Boyle', 'Leonardo Bercovici, Robert E. Sherwood', 'Cary Grant, Loretta Young, David Niven, Monty Woolley, James Gleason, Gladys Cooper, Elsa Lanchester, Sara Haden', 'NR', 'An Episcopal Bishop, Henry Brougham, has been working for months on the plans for an elaborate new cathedral which he hopes will be paid for primarily by a wealthy, stubborn widow. He is losing sight of his family and of why he became a churchman in the first place. Enter Dudley, an angel sent to help him. Dudley does help everyone he meets, but not necessarily in the way they would have preferred. With the exception of Henry, everyone loves him, but Henry begins to believe that Dudley is there to replace him, both at work and in his family''s affections, as Christmas approaches.', 'An Episcopal Bishop, Henry Brougham, has been working for months on the plans for an elaborate new cathedral which he hopes will be paid for primarily by a wealthy, stubborn widow. He is losing sight of his family and of why he became a churchman in the first place. Enter Dudley, an angel sent to help him. Dudley does help everyone he meets, but not necessarily in the way they would have preferred. With the exception of Henry, everyone loves him, but Henry begins to believe that Dudley is there to replace him, both at work and in his family''s affections, as Christmas approaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sMpffmvoJlW7WBcvyHTPR9DEsj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19490'),
  ('1030352902000707225', 'The Bitch', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dennis C. Lewiston, Gerry O''Hara', 'Jackie Collins', 'Joan Collins, Antonio Cantafora, Ian Hendry, Kenneth Haigh, Sue Lloyd, Mark Burns, John Ratzenberger, Peter Wight', null, 'The owner of a trendy disco starts having problems with the men in her life and the Mafia, which is trying to move in on her place.', 'The owner of a trendy disco starts having problems with the men in her life and the Mafia, which is trying to move in on her place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qc2xwjbp1OFnthbEe04Hy43IMeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50672'),
  ('682382594036668545', 'The Bitch', 1984, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Christine Pascal, Raoul Coutard, Olivier Péray', 'Christine Pascal, André Marc Delocque-Fourcaud, Pierre Fabre', 'Isabelle Huppert, Richard Berry, Vittorio Mezzogiorno, Jean Benguigui, Clément Harari, Jean-Claude Leguay, Jenny Clève, Jean-Pierre Bagot', null, 'After serving time for sexual assault, a disgraced cop finds work as a private detective and becomes enmeshed in a bizarre web that includes a gangster and his former girlfriend…the same woman who sent the cop to prison years before.', 'After serving time for sexual assault, a disgraced cop finds work as a private detective and becomes enmeshed in a bizarre web that includes a gangster and his former girlfriend…the same woman who sent the cop to prison years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwdEELbQxLYOUtgsEkF9PI5xxfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4270'),
  ('551029508894059477', 'The Bitter Stems', 1956, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fernando Ayala, Ricardo Younis, Rubén W. Cavalloti', 'Sergio Leonardo', 'Carlos Cores, Julia Sandoval, Vassili Lambrinos, Gilda Lousek, Aída Luz, Bernardo Perrone, Virginia Romay, Pablo Moret', null, 'Buenos Aires, Argentina. A failed reporter teams up with a Hungarian immigrant to set up a fake correspondence journalism school.', 'Buenos Aires, Argentina. A failed reporter teams up with a Hungarian immigrant to set up a fake correspondence journalism school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbyOlt6BSqyFx1FpqealxlLkaeO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185250'),
  ('1086783364031899806', 'The Bitter Tea of General Yen', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Capra, Joseph Walker, Charles C. Coleman', 'Edward E. Paramore Jr.', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Nils Asther, Toshia Mori, Walter Connolly, Gavin Gordon, Lucien Littlefield, Richard Loo, Helen Jerome Eddy', null, 'An American missionary is gradually seduced by a courtly warlord holding her in Shanghai.', 'An American missionary is gradually seduced by a courtly warlord holding her in Shanghai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqFOHLqvqcaCIaMy4ZK9NNkf4jV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34187'),
  ('596668106475453648', 'The Bitter Tears of Petra von Kant', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus, Harry Baer', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Margit Carstensen, Hanna Schygulla, Katrin Schaake, Eva Mattes, Gisela Fackeldey, Irm Hermann', null, 'Petra von Kant is a successful fashion designer -- arrogant, caustic, and self-satisfied. She mistreats Marlene (her secretary, maid, and co-designer). Enter Karin, a 23-year-old beauty who wants to be a model. Petra falls in love with Karin and invites her to move in.', 'Petra von Kant is a successful fashion designer -- arrogant, caustic, and self-satisfied. She mistreats Marlene (her secretary, maid, and co-designer). Enter Karin, a 23-year-old beauty who wants to be a model. Petra falls in love with Karin and invites her to move in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkxrRfXaoTvZObG1Gd91x2mnmFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10310'),
  ('630837246175799692', 'The Bittersweet', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'D. Ho', null, 'Océane Zhu, Lee Tae-ri', null, 'As a killer stalks the streets, a troubled young courier suspects that a doctor may be the long-lost sister he hasn''t seen since childhood.', 'As a killer stalks the streets, a troubled young courier suspects that a doctor may be the long-lost sister he hasn''t seen since childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Agb13P1v74GnkEksdy8xJMMxe3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484619'),
  ('923009489485758726', 'The Black Abbot', 1963, 'Crime', 'Rudolf Sandtner, Franz Josef Gottlieb, Richard Angst', 'Johannes Kai, Franz Josef Gottlieb', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Grit Boettcher, Dieter Borsche, Charles Regnier, Eva Ingeborg Scholz, Werner Peters, Alice Treff, Harry Wüstenhagen', null, 'Several employees on a nobleman''s estate show up at a former abbey, reputed to be haunted, to search for a hidden treasure. Howver, a mysterious hooded figure begins killing off those who may have figured out where the treasure is hidden.', 'Several employees on a nobleman''s estate show up at a former abbey, reputed to be haunted, to search for a hidden treasure. Howver, a mysterious hooded figure begins killing off those who may have figured out where the treasure is hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBG3kPPB8OPpwCYG77iwV1fvCXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6556'),
  ('975338372075733779', 'The Black Angel', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau, Romain Winding, María Luisa García', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau', 'Tchéky Karyo, Sylvie Vartan, Michel Piccoli, Alexandra Winisky, María Luisa García, Philippe Torreton, Bernard Verley, Claude Faraldo', null, 'Stephane, the wife of a prominent magistrate, shoots and kills a man in her home and claims he tried to rape her. While investigating her case, her lawyer becomes hopelessly enmeshed in a web of lies and subterfuges concerning her past.', 'Stephane, the wife of a prominent magistrate, shoots and kills a man in her home and claims he tried to rape her. While investigating her case, her lawyer becomes hopelessly enmeshed in a web of lies and subterfuges concerning her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wlNZI53V4j0o0bnwqx2GHz6u2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120554'),
  ('1073308425493226632', 'The Black Ball', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Denis Malleval', null, 'Bernard Campan, Antoine Duléry, Virginie Lemoine, François-Régis Marchasson, Joël Lefrançois, Linda de Suza, Tom Hudson, Louise Herrero', null, 'Married with a family and professionally successful, Vincent Ferreira has all he needs to be happy. Sensitive about his modest origins, he dreams of joining the local upmarket club attended by the town big wigs. But with each election, his bad luck prevents him from being admitted.', 'Married with a family and professionally successful, Vincent Ferreira has all he needs to be happy. Sensitive about his modest origins, he dreams of joining the local upmarket club attended by the town big wigs. But with each election, his bad luck prevents him from being admitted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKqUByMnq3WGuFR3K8QkC4Bv13H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326182'),
  ('784102946110262652', 'The Black Ball', 2026, 'Drama', 'Javier Ambrossi, Javier Calvo, Eva Leira', 'Javier Ambrossi, Javier Calvo', 'Guitarricadelafuente, Miguel Bernardeau, Carlos González, Milo Quifes, Lola Dueñas, Penélope Cruz, Glenn Close, Lorenzo Zurzolo', null, 'The Black Ball, inspired by an unfinished play by Federico García Lorca, will be a queer vindication about three men in three different moments of Spanish history: 1932, 1937, and 2017.', 'The Black Ball, inspired by an unfinished play by Federico García Lorca, will be a queer vindication about three men in three different moments of Spanish history: 1932, 1937, and 2017.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/du0WFunZDoFqddLa8G1vk4o0Y0c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422041'),
  ('533810533157158772', 'The Black Balloon', 2008, 'Drama', 'Elissa Down, Denson Baker', 'Elissa Down, Jimmy Jack', 'Rhys Wakefield, Luke Ford, Toni Collette, Erik Thomson, Gemma Ward, Sarah Woods, Sam Fraser, Zelie Bullen', 'PG-13', 'Thomas is turning 16. His dad''s in the army and they''ve just moved to a town in New South Wales; his mom is pregnant; his older brother, Charlie, who''s autistic, has his own adolescent sexual issues. Thomas finds Charlie an embarrassment in public, so when Thomas is attracted to Jackie, a girl in his swim class, Charlie presents any number of obstacles when she drops by their house, when the three of them go for a walk, and during a family birthday dinner. Can Thomas find a way to enter the world of teen romance and still be his brother''s keeper, or is Charlie''s disability going to prove more than Thomas can handle?', 'Thomas is turning 16. His dad''s in the army and they''ve just moved to a town in New South Wales; his mom is pregnant; his older brother, Charlie, who''s autistic, has his own adolescent sexual issues. Thomas finds Charlie an embarrassment in public, so when Thomas is attracted to Jackie, a girl in his swim class, Charlie presents any number of obstacles when she drops by their house, when the three of them go for a walk, and during a family birthday dinner. Can Thomas find a way to enter the world of teen romance and still be his brother''s keeper, or is Charlie''s disability going to prove more than Thomas can handle?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3D0PF1xpZHfyO3787TP6KS24Cme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8747'),
  ('403362481195758470', 'The Black Bear', 2015, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Méryl Fortunat-Rossi, Xavier Seron', 'Méryl Fortunat-Rossi, Xavier Seron', 'François Neycken, Terence Rion, Catherine Salée, Jean-Benoît Ugeux, Jean-Jacques Rausin, François Ebouelé, Philippe Grand''Henry', null, 'Five hikers go looking for adventure in a Canadian national park where the black bear lives. What’s the worst that could happen?', 'Five hikers go looking for adventure in a Canadian national park where the black bear lives. What’s the worst that could happen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z981834ihHwVUajcVH2Wsfj42e0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369297'),
  ('779101258210394616', 'The Black Belly of the Tarantula', 1971, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Paolo Cavara, Marcello Gatti', 'Lucile Laks', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Claudine Auger, Barbara Bouchet, Rossella Falk, Silvano Tranquilli, Annabella Incontrera, Ezio Marano, Barbara Bach', 'R', 'Inspector Tellini investigates serial crimes where victims are paralyzed while having their bellies ripped open with a sharp knife.', 'Inspector Tellini investigates serial crimes where victims are paralyzed while having their bellies ripped open with a sharp knife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3ycrZfaDeTt3ITh9MOmV6fGp7R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26504'),
  ('1069240501775385801', 'The Black Belt - The True History of Fernando Tererê', 2022, 'Drama', 'Caco Souza, David Reis, Abraao Oliveira', 'Rangel Neto', 'Raphael Logam, Miguel Henrique, Luis Otávio, Isabel Fillardis, Lui Mendes, Reinaldo Junior, David Reis, Vitor Britto', null, 'Five-time Jiu-jitsu world champion, Tererê won almost every battle he faced on the tatami mats, but it was far from them that he suffered his worst defeat.', 'Five-time Jiu-jitsu world champion, Tererê won almost every battle he faced on the tatami mats, but it was far from them that he suffered his worst defeat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTkFYi5YW0qY1xf2GYryIaOBOw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096634'),
  ('1114154669932566730', 'The Black Bomber', 1992, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Radan Popović, Darko Bajić', 'Darko Bajić, Aleksandar Barišić', 'Dragan Bjelogrlić, Anica Dobra, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Petar Božović, Dragan Maksimović, Žarko Laušević, Bogdan Diklić, Danilo ''Bata'' Stojković', null, 'In a near-future Belgrade, a DJ stirs up trouble with his rocking anti-establishment broadcasts. After his station is shut down, he takes to the street and starts transmitting revolution with the police hot on his trail.', 'In a near-future Belgrade, a DJ stirs up trouble with his rocking anti-establishment broadcasts. After his station is shut down, he takes to the street and starts transmitting revolution with the police hot on his trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EX4KsWGN26k43jeH9sIBH1CrM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109143'),
  ('667653526093939727', 'The Black Book', 2018, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Acácio de Almeida, Valeria Sarmiento, Paulo MilHomens', 'Carlos Saboga', 'Jenna Thiam, Lou de Laâge, Niels Schneider, Victoria Guerra, Stanislas Merhar, Joana Ribeiro, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Catarina Wallenstein', null, 'The story of the adventures, in the twilight of the eighteenth century, of a singular couple formed by a little orphan with mysterious origins and his young Italian nurse of a similarly uncertain birth. They lead us in their wake, from Rome to Paris, from Lisbon to London, from Parma to Venice. Always followed in the shadows, for obscure reasons, by a suspicious-looking Calabrian and a troubling cardinal, they make us explore the dark intrigues of the Vatican, the pangs of a fatal passion, a gruesome duel, banter at the court of Versailles and the convulsions of the French Revolution.', 'The story of the adventures, in the twilight of the eighteenth century, of a singular couple formed by a little orphan with mysterious origins and his young Italian nurse of a similarly uncertain birth. They lead us in their wake, from Rome to Paris, from Lisbon to London, from Parma to Venice. Always followed in the shadows, for obscure reasons, by a suspicious-looking Calabrian and a troubling cardinal, they make us explore the dark intrigues of the Vatican, the pangs of a fatal passion, a gruesome duel, banter at the court of Versailles and the convulsions of the French Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlvEyMhwdmuYcJ66ve6wsVkcKnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506043'),
  ('638020123485126121', 'The Black Book', 2023, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Editi Effiong, Yinka Edward', 'Editi Effiong, Bunmi Ajakaiye', 'Richard Mofe-Damijo, Ade Laoye, Sam Dede, Alex Usifo Omiagbo, Shaffy Bello, Kelechi Udegbe, Ikechukwu Onunaku, Taiwo Ajai-Lycett', 'R', 'After his son is wrongly accused of kidnapping, a deacon who has just lost his wife takes matters into his own hands and fights a crooked police gang to clear him.', 'After his son is wrongly accused of kidnapping, a deacon who has just lost his wife takes matters into his own hands and fights a crooked police gang to clear him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kn28W24slBLyGr8ZIZnxNE5YZrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172009'),
  ('227374328512091189', 'The Black Brothers', 2014, 'Family, Drama', 'Xavier Koller, Felix von Muralt', 'Klaus Richter, Fritjof Hohagen', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Waldemar Kobus, Richy Müller, Ruby O. Fee, Catrin Striebeck, Oliver Ewy, Sabine Timoteo, Margherita Schoch', null, 'Up until the middle of the 19Th century, poverty stricken mountain farmers from the Ticino area of Switzerland frequently sold their children to Milan as chimney sweeps or spazzacamini. That is also young Giorgios fate. He is forced to climb through pitch black chimneys, flinging down the soot with his bare hands. But he does not lose heart. Together with his buddies sharing in the same misery, he establishes the association of Black Brothers. They stick together, struggling against their penury and getting involved in fights with the street gangs of Milan. The film tells of the gripping adventures of the chimney sweep boys and their spectacular escape back to their native land.', 'Up until the middle of the 19Th century, poverty stricken mountain farmers from the Ticino area of Switzerland frequently sold their children to Milan as chimney sweeps or spazzacamini. That is also young Giorgios fate. He is forced to climb through pitch black chimneys, flinging down the soot with his bare hands. But he does not lose heart. Together with his buddies sharing in the same misery, he establishes the association of Black Brothers. They stick together, struggling against their penury and getting involved in fights with the street gangs of Milan. The film tells of the gripping adventures of the chimney sweep boys and their spectacular escape back to their native land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXPe5kBw3oazbcm4NRMtWDK7ILA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218071'),
  ('786696899285558245', 'The Black Camel', 1931, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Hamilton MacFadden, Joseph H. August, Daniel B. Clark', 'Barry Conners, Philip Klein', 'Warner Oland, Sally Eilers, Bela Lugosi, Dorothy Revier, Victor Varconi, Murray Kinnell, William Post Jr., Robert Young', null, 'Movie star Shelah Fane is seeing wealthy Alan Jaynes while filming in Honolulu, Hawaii, but won''t marry him without consulting famed psychic Tarneverro first. Enter inspector Charlie Chan of the Honolulu Police, investigating the unsolved murder, three years earlier, of a Hollywood actor.', 'Movie star Shelah Fane is seeing wealthy Alan Jaynes while filming in Honolulu, Hawaii, but won''t marry him without consulting famed psychic Tarneverro first. Enter inspector Charlie Chan of the Honolulu Police, investigating the unsolved murder, three years earlier, of a Hollywood actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oq1NH2ZJkkp31zzOqXiCOeGnLqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38453'),
  ('643185404232588484', 'The Black Cannon Incident', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Huang Jianxin, Wang Xinsheng, Feng Wei', 'Zhang Xianliang', 'Liu Zifeng, Gao Ming, Yang Fengliang, Yang Yazhou, Wang Yi, Ge Hui, Wang Beilong, Xie Wei', null, 'A mining engineer acting as a technical translator is suspected of industrial espionage after sending an innocent telegram that is intercepted by a militant snoop. Placed under investigation and reassigned to a less sensitive department, but never informed of the reason for his demotion, he petitions to get his job back, sparking an increasingly obtuse series of Party meetings.', 'A mining engineer acting as a technical translator is suspected of industrial espionage after sending an innocent telegram that is intercepted by a militant snoop. Placed under investigation and reassigned to a less sensitive department, but never informed of the reason for his demotion, he petitions to get his job back, sparking an increasingly obtuse series of Party meetings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ac6eCB69s6aL056ZgdKSIgHEzc2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176643'),
