  ('776955347651274358', 'The Black Knight', 1954, 'Action, Adventure', 'Tay Garnett, John Wilcox, John Box', 'Alec Coppel', 'Alan Ladd, Patricia Medina, André Morell, Harry Andrews, Peter Cushing, Anthony Bushell, Laurence Naismith, Patrick Troughton', 'NR', 'John, a blacksmith and swordsmith, is tutored at Camelot. As a commoner, he can''t hope to win the hand of Lady Linet, daughter of the Earl of Yeoniland, so he creates a secret alternate identity as the Black Knight. In this new role, he is now able to help King Arthur when Saracens and Cornish men—disguised as Vikings -- plot to take over the country.', 'John, a blacksmith and swordsmith, is tutored at Camelot. As a commoner, he can''t hope to win the hand of Lady Linet, daughter of the Earl of Yeoniland, so he creates a secret alternate identity as the Black Knight. In this new role, he is now able to help King Arthur when Saracens and Cornish men—disguised as Vikings -- plot to take over the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMVzUJTHapgymAgzJgGNd3q6Bs9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35692'),
  ('1063307270804559219', 'The Black Madonna', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Lasse Spang Olsen, Jens Schlosser, Emil Øigaard', 'Lasse Spang Olsen, Nikolaj Peyk', 'Anders W. Berthelsen, Tuva Novotny, Nicolas Bro, Ole Thestrup, Morten Grunwald, Birthe Neumann, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Andrzej Szopa', null, 'When Maria''s father sends her a valuable icon that he stole, she must decide whether to collect the reward or protect her father.', 'When Maria''s father sends her a valuable icon that he stole, she must decide whether to collect the reward or protect her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ianw5Jx4lvcUHlGNncDLReQRgS1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15836'),
  ('703385501404871540', 'The Black Marble', 1980, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Harold Becker, Owen Roizman, Thomas J. Mack', 'Joseph Wambaugh', 'Robert Foxworth, Paula Prentiss, Harry Dean Stanton, Barbara Babcock, John Hancock, Raleigh Bond, Judy Landers, Pat Corley', null, 'When alcoholic homicide investigator Valnikov is transferred to a burglary case that seems to involve a creepy dogcatcher, he''s also given a new partner -- the pragmatic Sgt. Natalie Zimmerman, who''s experiencing a midlife crisis and does not welcome Valnikov''s company. But as these emotionally bruised cops are drawn deeper into the bizarre world of dog shows, animal fanatics and pet cemeteries, they''re also drawn to each other.', 'When alcoholic homicide investigator Valnikov is transferred to a burglary case that seems to involve a creepy dogcatcher, he''s also given a new partner -- the pragmatic Sgt. Natalie Zimmerman, who''s experiencing a midlife crisis and does not welcome Valnikov''s company. But as these emotionally bruised cops are drawn deeper into the bizarre world of dog shows, animal fanatics and pet cemeteries, they''re also drawn to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrCgdNQOPcRagYRSj6NQ4VSH2FG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75808'),
  ('468946946969462520', 'The Black Minutes', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Mario Muñoz', 'Mario Muñoz, Martín Solares', 'Leonardo Ortizgris, Kristyan Ferrer, Enrique Arreola, Sofía Espinosa, Carlos Aragón, Mauricio Isaac, José Sefami, Tiaré Scanda', null, 'In the late 1970s, a group of young cops lead by ex-musician turned detective Vicente Rangel will face the darkest minutes of their lives while attempting to catch a serial killer of young girls in a corrupt oil town in the Gulf of Mexico.', 'In the late 1970s, a group of young cops lead by ex-musician turned detective Vicente Rangel will face the darkest minutes of their lives while attempting to catch a serial killer of young girls in a corrupt oil town in the Gulf of Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UhETlMjG8yiI0Mj7PoKpTWIoSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888185'),
  ('68587571863125938', 'The Black Monocle', 1961, 'Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Georges Lautner, Claude Vital, Bertrand Blier', 'Pierre Laroche', 'Paul Meurisse, Bernard Blier, Elga Andersen, Pierre Blanchar, Marie Dubois, Gérard Buhr, Albert Rémy, Jacques Marin', null, 'The Marquis de Villemaur reunite strange visitors in his Castle, to meet a survivor of the Third Reich. There is an Italian fascist, Heinrich; a German, Matthias; a Russian; and Dromard, a blind French war hero with a black monocle.', 'The Marquis de Villemaur reunite strange visitors in his Castle, to meet a survivor of the Third Reich. There is an Italian fascist, Heinrich; a German, Matthias; a Russian; and Dromard, a blind French war hero with a black monocle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udVSYzSvH6O3LLFhFWCgmnY0syr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333252'),
  ('292136777827622729', 'The Black Moon', 1990, 'Drama, Horror', 'Imanol Uribe, Javier Aguirresarobe, Javier Chinchilla', 'Imanol Uribe', 'Lydia Bosch, Fernando Guillén, Emma Suárez, Jose Coronado, Yolanda Ríos, Patricia Figón, Óscar Ramos, Mario Adorf', null, 'After experiencing a series of traumatic, seemingly unrelated, accidents, Eva begins to notice that her daughter Luna is behaving in increasingly strange ways.', 'After experiencing a series of traumatic, seemingly unrelated, accidents, Eva begins to notice that her daughter Luna is behaving in increasingly strange ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9Al8ukmbHxb1VNBmaMtXNDpRMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189322'),
