  ('66605074738296415', 'The Black Panther Warriors', 1993, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Crime', 'Clarence Ford, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung', 'Tsang Kan-Cheong', 'Alan Tang Kwong-Wing, Simon Yam, Brigitte Lin, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Jennifer Chen, Carrie Ng Ka-Lai, Dicky Cheung Wai-Kin, Yuen Wah', null, 'A group of specialists are recruited to steal from a police station.', 'A group of specialists are recruited to steal from a police station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pB8Ti73bPTdh9Os8G59k9OaBBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252505'),
  ('218552754813922624', 'The Black Panthers: Vanguard of the Revolution', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Stanley Nelson', 'Stanley Nelson', 'Kathleen Cleaver, Julian Bond, Jamal Joseph, Blair Anderson, Omar Barbour, Elaine Brown, Scot Brown, William Calhoun', null, 'The story of the Black Panthers is often told in a scatter of repackaged parts, often depicting tragic, mythic accounts of violence and criminal activity; but this is an essential story, vibrant, human; a living and breathing chronicle of a pivotal movement that birthed a new revolutionary culture in America.', 'The story of the Black Panthers is often told in a scatter of repackaged parts, often depicting tragic, mythic accounts of violence and criminal activity; but this is an essential story, vibrant, human; a living and breathing chronicle of a pivotal movement that birthed a new revolutionary culture in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uw0zW1jlC9Yf3rK0KFkKx9iEFYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319089'),
  ('1061153171824349477', 'The Black Peacock', 1975, null, 'Osvaldo Civirani', null, 'Karin Schubert, Chris Avram, Gigi Angelillo, Lorenzo Piani, Samantha Starr, Franco Ressel', null, 'Marco, an Italian engineer comes from Milan to Santo Domingo, Haiti to continue the construction of a dam. The predecessor, Kluger, has disappeared without a trace and he would take his place. When he arrives, his wife Laura is there waiting for him and the two - along with their guide Romero. They go to the small, isolated jungle shack where Kluger was staying before he vanished. The couple is soon involved in mysterious voodoo rituals carried out by the Haitian religious leader, Balaga who is against the work. Meanwhile, the ghost of Kluger warns him about completing the work. Only thanks to the intervention of the police Laura, fascinated by the rites, is saved and brought back to Italy', 'Marco, an Italian engineer comes from Milan to Santo Domingo, Haiti to continue the construction of a dam. The predecessor, Kluger, has disappeared without a trace and he would take his place. When he arrives, his wife Laura is there waiting for him and the two - along with their guide Romero. They go to the small, isolated jungle shack where Kluger was staying before he vanished. The couple is soon involved in mysterious voodoo rituals carried out by the Haitian religious leader, Balaga who is against the work. Meanwhile, the ghost of Kluger warns him about completing the work. Only thanks to the intervention of the police Laura, fascinated by the rites, is saved and brought back to Italy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLW7KMZ9qzcTUy2Mwb4GGk76mtA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424140'),
  ('245305998434660271', 'The Black Pearl', 1982, 'Drama', 'Yao Feng-Pan', 'Yao Genshi', 'Hsiang Yun-Peng, Sophia Ching, Wa Lun, Phoenix Chu', null, 'Women are beaten, raped, tortured and killed in brutal prison.', 'Women are beaten, raped, tortured and killed in brutal prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRlYkjecV3lJf51jIJI9ECzofVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484503'),
  ('202957406005923461', 'The Black Pharaoh, the Savage and the Princess', 2022, 'Animation, Drama', 'Michel Ocelot, David Bertrand', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Oscar Lesage, Claire de la Rüe du Can, Aïssa Maïga, Serge Bagdassarian, Didier Sandre, Annie Mercier, Gaël Raës, Thissa d''Avila Bensalah', null, 'Three tales, three ages, three worlds. At the time of Ancient Egypt, a young king becomes the first black pharaoh to deserve the hand of his loved one. During the French Middle Ages, a mysterious wild boy steals from the rich to give to the poor. In 18th-century Turkey, a prince of pastries and a princess of roses escape the palace to live their love.', 'Three tales, three ages, three worlds. At the time of Ancient Egypt, a young king becomes the first black pharaoh to deserve the hand of his loved one. During the French Middle Ages, a mysterious wild boy steals from the rich to give to the poor. In 18th-century Turkey, a prince of pastries and a princess of roses escape the palace to live their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOjV2vaFxDSJZkozCJV4yRecEUb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947590'),
  ('210355612961018922', 'The Black Phone', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Maggie Levin, Scott Oberholzer, Brett Jutkiewicz', 'Scott Derrickson, C. Robert Cargill', 'Mason Thames, Madeleine McGraw, Ethan Hawke, Jeremy Davies, E. Roger Mitchell, Troy Rudeseal, James Ransone, Miguel Mora', 'R', 'Finney Blake, a shy but clever 13-year-old boy, is abducted by a sadistic killer and trapped in a soundproof basement where screaming is of little use. When a disconnected phone on the wall begins to ring, Finney discovers that he can hear the voices of the killer’s previous victims. And they are dead set on making sure that what happened to them doesn’t happen to Finney.', 'Finney Blake, a shy but clever 13-year-old boy, is abducted by a sadistic killer and trapped in a soundproof basement where screaming is of little use. When a disconnected phone on the wall begins to ring, Finney discovers that he can hear the voices of the killer’s previous victims. And they are dead set on making sure that what happened to them doesn’t happen to Finney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9ZUzCyy9wRTDuuQexkQ78R2BgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756999'),
  ('792336058975345659', 'The Black Pirate', 1926, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Albert Parker, Henry Sharp', 'Jack Cunningham', 'Douglas Fairbanks, Billie Dove, Anders Randolf, Donald Crisp, Tempe Pigott, Sam De Grasse, Charles Stevens, John Wallace', 'NR', 'A nobleman vows to avenge the death of his father by the hands of pirates. To this end, he infiltrates the pirate band; Acting in character, he single-handedly captures a merchant vessel, but things are complicated when he finds that there is a beautiful young woman of royal blood aboard.', 'A nobleman vows to avenge the death of his father by the hands of pirates. To this end, he infiltrates the pirate band; Acting in character, he single-handedly captures a merchant vessel, but things are complicated when he finds that there is a beautiful young woman of royal blood aboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/841WLSvTRN3TQKxiUjD1TY9dc42.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50075'),
  ('724904929447328296', 'The Black Raven', 1943, 'Mystery, Crime, Horror', 'Sam Newfield, Robert E. Cline, Melville De Lay', 'Fred Myton', 'George Zucco, Wanda McKay, Noel Madison, Robert Livingston, Byron Foulger, Charles Middleton, Robert Middlemass, Glenn Strange', 'NR', 'One dark and stormy night, an escaped convict, an embezzler, a runaway daughter, her intended and her father, and a gangster take refuge in a remote inn called "The Black Raven" after the nickname of a second gangster who owns it; and murder ensues.', 'One dark and stormy night, an escaped convict, an embezzler, a runaway daughter, her intended and her father, and a gangster take refuge in a remote inn called "The Black Raven" after the nickname of a second gangster who owns it; and murder ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nt5HxyaWhnxUciJvIucBgf5HI6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86772'),
  ('423956494031007585', 'The Black Room', 1935, 'Horror, Crime', 'Roy William Neill, Allen G. Siegler', 'Henry Myers, Arthur Strawn', 'Boris Karloff, Marian Marsh, Robert Allen, Thurston Hall, Katherine DeMille, John Buckler, Henry Kolker, Colin Tapley', 'NR', 'In a 16th-century European town, the ruling family has been given a prophecy that, should there ever be twin boys born, the younger will murder the older; so is dismayed when twins are born to the popular baron. The older grows to be a selfish, slovenly man, who inherits the castle at his father''s death and becomes ruler over the formerly happy villagers. He enjoys his power until he learns his younger brother is returning from abroad and, afraid of the prophecy, he determines to murder his sibling, hide his body in the "black room" - an old torture chamber sealed away behind the fireplace - and then impersonate him, right down to his withered arm. In this way he hopes to not only avoid the prophecy, but also escape consequences of his other criminal deeds and obtain marriage to a local girl of the nobility...', 'In a 16th-century European town, the ruling family has been given a prophecy that, should there ever be twin boys born, the younger will murder the older; so is dismayed when twins are born to the popular baron. The older grows to be a selfish, slovenly man, who inherits the castle at his father''s death and becomes ruler over the formerly happy villagers. He enjoys his power until he learns his younger brother is returning from abroad and, afraid of the prophecy, he determines to murder his sibling, hide his body in the "black room" - an old torture chamber sealed away behind the fireplace - and then impersonate him, right down to his withered arm. In this way he hopes to not only avoid the prophecy, but also escape consequences of his other criminal deeds and obtain marriage to a local girl of the nobility...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXjHM4k632aV4F9vd6u5sJkJF6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27003'),
  ('258796202137421801', 'The Black Room', 1982, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Elly Kenner, Norman Thaddeus Vane, Robert Harmon', 'Norman Thaddeus Vane', 'Stephen Knight, Cassandra Gava, Jimmy Stathis, Clara Perryman, Charlie Young, Geanne Frank, Linnea Quigley, Christopher McDonald', 'R', 'An unfaithful businessman rents a spare room from two siblings to use for his sexual conquests, unaware that they''re serial killers who murder every woman he brings there.', 'An unfaithful businessman rents a spare room from two siblings to use for his sexual conquests, unaware that they''re serial killers who murder every woman he brings there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBlF5Gh4GQO5WC96MSfa2S5p4R6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27630'),
  ('782921915295927439', 'The Black Room', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Kyle Stryker, Rolfe Kanefsky', 'Rolfe Kanefsky', 'Natasha Henstridge, Lukas Hassel, Augie Duke, Lin Shaye, Alex Rinehart, Tiffany Shepis, Robert Donavan, Caleb Scott', null, 'Paul and Jennifer Hemdale have just moved into their dream house. But their happy marriage is about to be put to the test as they slowly discover the secret behind the black room in the cellar. Something else is already living in their new home and it is growing stronger every day.', 'Paul and Jennifer Hemdale have just moved into their dream house. But their happy marriage is about to be put to the test as they slowly discover the secret behind the black room in the cellar. Something else is already living in their new home and it is growing stronger every day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHZDs43AxPhitL2Xrw7mncuyS4q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425931'),
  ('570438875878180325', 'The Black Rose', 1950, 'War, Adventure, History', 'Henry Hathaway, Muir Mathieson, Jack Cardiff', 'Talbot Jennings', 'Tyrone Power, Orson Welles, Cécile Aubry, Jack Hawkins, Michael Rennie, Finlay Currie, Herbert Lom, Mary Clare', null, 'In the 13th century, Walter of Gurnie, a disinherited Saxon youth, is forced to flee England. With his friend, Tristram, he falls in with the army of the fierce but avuncular General Bayan, and journeys all the way to China, where both men become involved in intrigues in the court of Kublai Khan.', 'In the 13th century, Walter of Gurnie, a disinherited Saxon youth, is forced to flee England. With his friend, Tristram, he falls in with the army of the fierce but avuncular General Bayan, and journeys all the way to China, where both men become involved in intrigues in the court of Kublai Khan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8038EuXcIIT10TCj6H3iDSf6xJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44398'),
  ('212813026817943492', 'The Black Scorpion', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Edward Ludwig, Lionel Lindon', 'David Duncan, Robert Blees', 'Richard Denning, Mara Corday, Carlos Rivas, Mario Navarro, Carlos Múzquiz, Pascual García Peña, Fanny Schiller, Arturo Martínez', null, 'Volcanic activity frees giant scorpions from the earth who wreak havoc in the rural countryside and eventually threaten Mexico City.', 'Volcanic activity frees giant scorpions from the earth who wreak havoc in the rural countryside and eventually threaten Mexico City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6gEzeLl3NWuESexRiUpk4rtLPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44591'),
  ('895503731546350442', 'The Black Sheep', 1949, 'Drama', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Jesús González Gancy, Jack Draper', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Rogelio A. González', 'Fernando Soler, Pedro Infante, Andrés Soler, Dalia Íñiguez, Virginia Serret, Amelia Wilhelmy, Amanda del Llano, Antonio R. Frausto', null, 'The Trevino family tries to overcome the irresponsible behavior of Don Cruz, an erratic father with numerous defects that contrast with his son Silvano, a young kid man that is incapable of passing judgment on his own father.', 'The Trevino family tries to overcome the irresponsible behavior of Don Cruz, an erratic father with numerous defects that contrast with his son Silvano, a young kid man that is incapable of passing judgment on his own father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5n1BMWtey4gXSajUnzPVeELmDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30322'),
  ('409816317730702645', 'The Black Sheep', 1960, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Erich Claunigk, Helmut Ashley, Walter Boos', 'István Békeffy, Hans Jacoby', 'Heinz Rühmann, Karl Schönböck, Maria Sebaldt, Siegfried Lowitz, Lina Carstens, Fritz Rasp, Hans Leibelt, Johannes Buzalski', null, 'Father Brown starts solving crimes, much to the annoyance of his housekeeper, the police and especially his bishop, who is not amused by a priest playing detective.', 'Father Brown starts solving crimes, much to the annoyance of his housekeeper, the police and especially his bishop, who is not amused by a priest playing detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOsJM6j1QB8FTu8IlTKPUOIlcUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67354'),
  ('479309733546492489', 'The Black Sheep', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Valia Santella, Daniele Ciprì, Ascanio Celestini', 'Ascanio Celestini, Ugo Chiti, Wilma Labate', 'Ascanio Celestini, Giorgio Tirabassi, Maya Sansa, Luisa De Santis, Teresa Saponangelo, Barbara Valmorin, Nicola Rignanese, Luigi Fedele', null, 'Nicola is a man who has spent much of his life in a mental institution, though not always as a patient. Nicola''s mother suffered from mental illness, and when young Nicola grew old enough to understand some of her stranger behavior as well as the family''s other dark secrets, a few of the adults around him preferred to suggest he was disturbed like his mother, and he was encouraged to visit an asylum not far from his home. As an adult, Nicola has spent enough time around people who have a tenuous connection with reality that he has a superficial resemblance to them, and has developed a strange set of imaginary friends to go along with his eccentric real-life companions and the woman he loves from afar, Marinella.', 'Nicola is a man who has spent much of his life in a mental institution, though not always as a patient. Nicola''s mother suffered from mental illness, and when young Nicola grew old enough to understand some of her stranger behavior as well as the family''s other dark secrets, a few of the adults around him preferred to suggest he was disturbed like his mother, and he was encouraged to visit an asylum not far from his home. As an adult, Nicola has spent enough time around people who have a tenuous connection with reality that he has a superficial resemblance to them, and has developed a strange set of imaginary friends to go along with his eccentric real-life companions and the woman he loves from afar, Marinella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fe1sJrFYKKFFyKqZrgYRJNPQZY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56799'),
  ('998872166977613017', 'The Black Shield of Falworth', 1954, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'Rudolph Maté, Irving Glassberg, Tom Shaw', 'Oscar Brodney', 'Tony Curtis, Janet Leigh, David Farrar, Barbara Rush, Herbert Marshall, Torin Thatcher, Dan O''Herlihy, Patrick O''Neal', null, 'In the days of King Henry IV, stalwart young Myles and his sister Meg have been raised as peasants, without any knowledge of who their father really was. But one day, they journey to Macworth Castle. There, Myles falls in love with Lady Anne Macworth, makes friends and enemies, and learns to be a knight.', 'In the days of King Henry IV, stalwart young Myles and his sister Meg have been raised as peasants, without any knowledge of who their father really was. But one day, they journey to Macworth Castle. There, Myles falls in love with Lady Anne Macworth, makes friends and enemies, and learns to be a knight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gXIl5Ql8VGv5Hmm3LM5y5d1AD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24442'),
  ('445183395166947411', 'The Black Six', 1973, 'Action', 'Matt Cimber', 'Mikel Angel', 'Robert Howard, Cindy Daly, Mikel Angel, John Isenbarger, Gene Washington, Carl Eller, Joe Greene, Mercury Morris', 'R', 'A black high school student is caught dating a white girl by the girl''s brother. He and his biker gang beat the boy to death. The boy''s brother, who is a member of a black biker gang, hears about it and comes to town to avenge his brother''s death.', 'A black high school student is caught dating a white girl by the girl''s brother. He and his biker gang beat the boy to death. The boy''s brother, who is a member of a black biker gang, hears about it and comes to town to avenge his brother''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4doMBE0wrKY96BQ5uWDy1XrK5Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86273'),
  ('140485208760861835', 'The Black Sleep', 1956, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Reginald Le Borg, Gordon Avil', 'John C. Higgins', 'Basil Rathbone, Herbert Rudley, Patricia Blair, Akim Tamiroff, Phyllis Stanley, Lon Chaney Jr., Bela Lugosi, John Carradine', 'NR', 'In 19th century England, a noted brain surgeon rescues a former student from being hanged on a false conviction for murder, and spirits him away to an ancient, repurposed abbey far in the countryside. There, he connives his pupil into assisting him in mapping the functions of the various parts of the human brain, using living subjects who are under a terrible animation-suspending drug called "black sleep". Subsequently, the student, along with the daughter of one of the subjects, discover that most of these subjects have survived but are being kept in a dungeon-like cellar, in various stages of physical and mental derangement...', 'In 19th century England, a noted brain surgeon rescues a former student from being hanged on a false conviction for murder, and spirits him away to an ancient, repurposed abbey far in the countryside. There, he connives his pupil into assisting him in mapping the functions of the various parts of the human brain, using living subjects who are under a terrible animation-suspending drug called "black sleep". Subsequently, the student, along with the daughter of one of the subjects, discover that most of these subjects have survived but are being kept in a dungeon-like cellar, in various stages of physical and mental derangement...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIGG1C5t8qS4S0wfaVOdZRzYGwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28437'),
  ('325859145171061179', 'The Black Snake', 2026, 'Drama', 'Aurélien Vernhes-Lermusiaux, Sylvain Verdet, Santiago Porras, Ana María Nieto, Diego Castillo, Aurelien Vernhes Lermusiaux', 'Aurélien Vernhes-Lermusiaux, Marlène Poste, Aurelien Vernhes Lermusiaux', 'Alexis Lozano Tafur, Miguel Ángel Viera, Angela Rodriguez, Laura Valentina Quintero, Virgelina Gil Saénz', null, 'After years of absence, Ciro returns home to his mother''s bedside. In the Colombian desert of Tatacoa, he meets those he fled and confronts the last guardians of a territory as fragile as it is enchanting.', 'After years of absence, Ciro returns home to his mother''s bedside. In the Colombian desert of Tatacoa, he meets those he fled and confronts the last guardians of a territory as fragile as it is enchanting.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FqkQfQpXVnGgUVmyPkp84W0Y1GJt.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-black-snake-2026'),
  ('663575680938558132', 'The Black Spider', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Ruth Hirschfeld, Ralph Berkin, Lóránd Banner-Szûcs', 'Plinio Bachmann, Barbara Sommer', 'Anatole Taubman, Ronald Zehrfeld, Lilith Stangenberg, Marcus Signer, Narantsogt Tsogtsaikhan, András Sütö, Gera Marina, Andreas Matti', null, 'The courageous young midwife Christine makes a pact with the devil to save her village from the brutal terror of the Teutonic Knights. Punished by a spider plague, Christine goes from savior to hunted.', 'The courageous young midwife Christine makes a pact with the devil to save her village from the brutal terror of the Teutonic Knights. Punished by a spider plague, Christine goes from savior to hunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0GjWn94mtzKOV1T1ae0MfOHnHo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916283'),
  ('870677318955195568', 'The Black Spot', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Enrique García, Jose Antonio Crespillo', 'Isa Sánchez, Enrique García', 'Pablo Puyol, Cuca Escribano, María Alfonsa Rosso, Sebastián Haro, Noemí Ruíz, Juanma Lara, Virginia de Morata, Natalia Roig', null, 'In an Andalusian village in the early 70s, three daughters who lose their mother go up against the local community. Meanwhile, the unexpected arrival of their estranged brother brings to the surface secrets of the past.', 'In an Andalusian village in the early 70s, three daughters who lose their mother go up against the local community. Meanwhile, the unexpected arrival of their estranged brother brings to the surface secrets of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8viPl31WLHWA2h475PrbjrpcHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835159'),
  ('103208849064855070', 'The Black Square', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Peter Meister', 'Peter Meister', 'Bernhard Schütz, Jacob Matschenz, Sandra Hüller, Pheline Roggan, Christopher Schärf, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Wolfgang Packhäuser, Tobias van Dieken', null, 'VINCENT, a struggling art-thief and failed artist, stole Malewitsch’s legendary abstract painting the „Black Square”. The sale and handover to a Russian Oligarch and his designated art expert MARTHA is set to take place on a cruise ship. When Vincent and his younger partner NILS realise that their principal accomplice will not show-up to provide the boarding tickets and fake ID’s, they desperately overbear two men in order to sneak their way onto the ship. To their horror they quickly learn that their victims are part of the cruise ship’s entertainment act. Desperate not to blow their cover, Vincent and Nils take on their roles as David Bowie and Elvis Presley doubles with varying degrees of success. Despite his best efforts, Vincent’s talents hardly convince the passengers and it does not take long until various crew members discover their true identities and the value of their loot. A wild goose chase for the “Black Square” breaks loose in the belly of the cruise ship…', 'VINCENT, a struggling art-thief and failed artist, stole Malewitsch’s legendary abstract painting the „Black Square”. The sale and handover to a Russian Oligarch and his designated art expert MARTHA is set to take place on a cruise ship. When Vincent and his younger partner NILS realise that their principal accomplice will not show-up to provide the boarding tickets and fake ID’s, they desperately overbear two men in order to sneak their way onto the ship. To their horror they quickly learn that their victims are part of the cruise ship’s entertainment act. Desperate not to blow their cover, Vincent and Nils take on their roles as David Bowie and Elvis Presley doubles with varying degrees of success. Despite his best efforts, Vincent’s talents hardly convince the passengers and it does not take long until various crew members discover their true identities and the value of their loot. A wild goose chase for the “Black Square” breaks loose in the belly of the cruise ship…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLFmh6XnixgpzGd08xkmbL9XFRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840576'),
  ('637995421652259816', 'The Black Stallion', 1979, 'Family, Adventure', 'Carroll Ballard, Caleb Deschanel', 'Jeanne Rosenberg, Melissa Mathison, Walter Murch', 'Kelly Reno, Mickey Rooney, Teri Garr, Clarence Muse, Hoyt Axton, Michael Higgins, Ed McNamara, Doghmi Larbi', 'G', 'While traveling with his father, young Alec becomes fascinated by a mysterious Arabian stallion that is brought on board and stabled in the ship he is sailing on. When it tragically sinks both he and the horse survive only to be stranded on a deserted island. He befriends it, so when finally rescued both return to his home where they soon meet Henry Dailey, a once successful trainer. Together they begin training the horse to race against the fastest ones in the world.', 'While traveling with his father, young Alec becomes fascinated by a mysterious Arabian stallion that is brought on board and stabled in the ship he is sailing on. When it tragically sinks both he and the horse survive only to be stranded on a deserted island. He befriends it, so when finally rescued both return to his home where they soon meet Henry Dailey, a once successful trainer. Together they begin training the horse to race against the fastest ones in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZtNc31LR5Ik3ZVo2jxwOvhkNRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17264'),
  ('1105666424767257114', 'The Black Stallion Returns', 1983, 'Family, Adventure', 'Robert Dalva, Michael Haley, Carlo Di Palma', 'Richard Kletter, Jerome Kass', 'Kelly Reno, Vincent Spano, Allen Garfield, Woody Strode, Ferdy Mayne, Jodi Thelen, Teri Garr, Doghmi Larbi', 'PG', '"Black" is a stunning fire-and-silk stallion celebrated the world over. But to his young American owner, Alec Ramsay, he''s much more. So, when the amazing animal is stolen, Alec will stop at nothing to get him back. Alec finally unravels the mystery of Black''s theft...only to discover that he must overcome even greater odds to reclaim his beloved horse.', '"Black" is a stunning fire-and-silk stallion celebrated the world over. But to his young American owner, Alec Ramsay, he''s much more. So, when the amazing animal is stolen, Alec will stop at nothing to get him back. Alec finally unravels the mystery of Black''s theft...only to discover that he must overcome even greater odds to reclaim his beloved horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bozQVxJLeHMXMdfY76YLSAwVQBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24883'),
  ('253152829220942116', 'The Black Stuff', 1980, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jim Goddard, David Jackson', 'Alan Bleasdale', 'Bernard Hill, Michael Angelis, Alan Igbon, Peter Kerrigan, Tom Georgeson, Gary Bleasdale, David Calder, Jean Warren', null, 'A Liverpool tarmac gang set off for a contract in Middlesbrough. After a day of work, the group are approached by two gypsies who offer them a lucrative side job.', 'A Liverpool tarmac gang set off for a contract in Middlesbrough. After a day of work, the group are approached by two gypsies who offer them a lucrative side job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93h1s1gPORjQQrsrfzAD6t0wnac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178881'),
  ('373331498526935729', 'The Black Swan', 1942, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Henry King, Albert R. Broccoli, Henry Weinberger', 'Ben Hecht, Seton I. Miller', 'Tyrone Power, Maureen O''Hara, Laird Cregar, Thomas Mitchell, George Sanders, Anthony Quinn, George Zucco, Edward Ashley', null, 'When notorious pirate Henry Morgan is made governor of Jamaica, he enlists the help of some of his former partners in ridding the Caribbean of buccaneers. When one of them apparently abducts the previous governor''s pretty daughter and joins up with the rebels, things are set for a fight.', 'When notorious pirate Henry Morgan is made governor of Jamaica, he enlists the help of some of his former partners in ridding the Caribbean of buccaneers. When one of them apparently abducts the previous governor''s pretty daughter and joins up with the rebels, things are set for a fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGeoslDZmLq0k5bIN71sswdzm7Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29882'),
  ('230699161492765244', 'The Black Swindler', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Yasuharu Ishii, Ayato Matsuda', 'Eriko Shinozaki', 'Tomohisa Yamashita, Maki Horikita, Show Aikawa, Mao Daichi, Yui Ichikawa, Naoko Iijima, Koji Kato, Shiro Kishibe', null, 'There are three kinds of swindler. One, called the "WHITE SWINDLER", finds a mark and steals money. The "RED SWINDLER" preys on the other sex and steals a mark''s body and soul. Then there is the "BLACK SWINDLER". Ignoring ordinary marks, targeting only the white and red swindlers, and preying on their flesh grown fat and corrupt with the money they have stolen, he is the worst of them all. There is a boy who once became a victim of a swindler and lost his family. Later, he turns into the most hideous "black swindler" to deceive only other swindlers. His name is Kurosaki. This time, he is requested by Reiko, whose daughter is sick, to hunt down a swindler named Ishigaki, who has defrauded her of money. But, behind Ishigaki, there is actually a bigger swindle which has even destabilized the Japanese economy…', 'There are three kinds of swindler. One, called the "WHITE SWINDLER", finds a mark and steals money. The "RED SWINDLER" preys on the other sex and steals a mark''s body and soul. Then there is the "BLACK SWINDLER". Ignoring ordinary marks, targeting only the white and red swindlers, and preying on their flesh grown fat and corrupt with the money they have stolen, he is the worst of them all. There is a boy who once became a victim of a swindler and lost his family. Later, he turns into the most hideous "black swindler" to deceive only other swindlers. His name is Kurosaki. This time, he is requested by Reiko, whose daughter is sick, to hunt down a swindler named Ishigaki, who has defrauded her of money. But, behind Ishigaki, there is actually a bigger swindle which has even destabilized the Japanese economy…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7i7Dq4myHhi8Hr5brYNFGDgNivO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17330'),
  ('936469728247546801', 'The Black Tavern', 1972, 'Action, Drama', 'Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, Yau Kei', 'Yip Yat-Fong', 'Shih Szu, Tung Li, Ku Feng, Kong Ling, Kwok Chuk-Hing, Barry Chan, Yang Chi-Ching, Dean Shek Tin', null, 'A rumor has spread that a retiring corrupt official is traveling with a box filled with all kinds of valuables, and is going to make a stop at a remote inn. And multiple criminal martial artists planning to rob him descend on the tavern.', 'A rumor has spread that a retiring corrupt official is traveling with a box filled with all kinds of valuables, and is going to make a stop at a remote inn. And multiple criminal martial artists planning to rob him descend on the tavern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySjUQjYTX8Me1r6eDCfKuqfZBZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86275'),
  ('192456817313230501', 'The Black Torment', 1964, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Robert Hartford-Davis, Ray Frift, Roger Simons', 'Derek Ford, Donald Ford', 'Heather Sears, John Turner, Ann Lynn, Peter Arne, Norman Bird, Raymond Huntley, Annette Whiteley, Francis de Wolff', null, 'A lord returns to his manor with his new wife, to hear rumours that he had already secretly returned and had committed several murders. Has he lost his mind, or is something dark afoot ?', 'A lord returns to his manor with his new wife, to hear rumours that he had already secretly returned and had committed several murders. Has he lost his mind, or is something dark afoot ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMvAhXUshF8hH89Tv0SWpbVgc6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100770'),
  ('295094057362947607', 'The Black Tower', 1987, 'Horror', 'John Smith', 'John Smith', 'John Smith, Anna Hatt', null, 'A man finds himself haunted by a mysterious black tower in London that appears to follow him wherever he goes.', 'A man finds himself haunted by a mysterious black tower in London that appears to follow him wherever he goes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym0uhGrS5PpcQMLJ5GaUMKNpWIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345408'),
  ('703505099465438748', 'The Black Tulip', 1964, 'Adventure', 'Christian-Jaque, Henri Decaë', 'José Luis Dibildos, Paul Andréota, Christian-Jaque', 'Alain Delon, Virna Lisi, Adolfo Marsillach, Dawn Addams, Akim Tamiroff, Laura Valenzuela, George Rigaud, Francis Blanche', null, 'Aristocrat Guillaume de Saint Preux leads a double life as a masked bandit known as the Black Tulip. The Black Tulip only robs rich aristocrats, so the local peasants regard him as a hero. Baron La Mouche is convinced Guillaume is the Tulip. During a robbery, he scars the Tulip''s face, and hopes to use this to expose Guillaume, but Guillaume is one step ahead.', 'Aristocrat Guillaume de Saint Preux leads a double life as a masked bandit known as the Black Tulip. The Black Tulip only robs rich aristocrats, so the local peasants regard him as a hero. Baron La Mouche is convinced Guillaume is the Tulip. During a robbery, he scars the Tulip''s face, and hopes to use this to expose Guillaume, but Guillaume is one step ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYaIoQrEEz2fnJcY3KAzBsPwvF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12539'),
  ('846065602919450856', 'The Black Vampire', 1953, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Román Viñoly Barreto, Aníbal González Paz, Mario Fezia', 'Fritz Lang', 'Nathán Pinzón, Olga Zubarry, Roberto Escalada, Nelly Panizza, Mariano Vidal Molina, Gloria Castilla, Emma Bernal, Lucía Besse', null, 'A cabaret performer tries to protect her daughter from a mysterious killer while resisting the advances of the prosecutor pursuing the criminal.', 'A cabaret performer tries to protect her daughter from a mysterious killer while resisting the advances of the prosecutor pursuing the criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mH8Y5StDlC5PAGbAQse4rXt4LT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252697'),
