  ('134415155081808971', 'The Black Windmill', 1974, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Don Siegel, Ousama Rawi, Kip Gowans', 'Leigh Vance', 'Michael Caine, Donald Pleasence, Delphine Seyrig, Clive Revill, John Vernon, Joss Ackland, Janet Suzman, Catherine Schell', 'PG', 'A British agent''s son is kidnapped and held for a ransom of diamonds. The agent finds out that he can''t even count on the people he thought were on his side to help him, so he decides to track down the kidnappers himself.', 'A British agent''s son is kidnapped and held for a ransom of diamonds. The agent finds out that he can''t even count on the people he thought were on his side to help him, so he decides to track down the kidnappers himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92lbZJZreeGYFdmjEuXuoQCbhL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32050'),
  ('105512741530445957', 'The Blackbird', 1926, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Tod Browning, Percy Hilburn, Harry Sharrock', 'Waldemar Young', 'Lon Chaney, Owen Moore, Renée Adorée, Doris Lloyd, Andy MacLennan, William Weston, Sidney Bracey, Ernie Adams', 'NR', 'Two thieves, the Blackbird and West End Bertie, fall in love with the same girl, a French nightclub performer named Fifi. Each man tries to outdo the other to win her heart.', 'Two thieves, the Blackbird and West End Bertie, fall in love with the same girl, a French nightclub performer named Fifi. Each man tries to outdo the other to win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idRhSavLX2sAECg4mEqK6ru4sau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111302'),
  ('232374892378978666', 'The Blackcoat''s Daughter', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Osgood Perkins, Julie Kirkwood, Taralee Gerhard', 'Osgood Perkins', 'Emma Roberts, Kiernan Shipka, Lucy Boynton, James Remar, Lauren Holly, Peter J. Gray, Emma Holzer, Matthew Stefiuk', 'R', 'Two young women at a prestigious prep school are assailed by an evil, invisible power when they''re stranded over winter break.', 'Two young women at a prestigious prep school are assailed by an evil, invisible power when they''re stranded over winter break.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO2aHAiWgQSlpAIPGZikiMDdMXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334536'),
  ('87768322354207968', 'The Blackening', 2023, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Tim Story, Todd Dos Reis, Sarah Balboa', 'Dewayne Perkins, Tracy Oliver', 'Grace Byers, Jermaine Fowler, Melvin Gregg, X Mayo, Dewayne Perkins, Antoinette Robertson, Sinqua Walls, Jay Pharoah', 'R', 'Seven black friends go away for the weekend, only to find themselves trapped in a cabin with a killer who has a vendetta. They must pit their street smarts and knowledge of horror movies against the murderer to stay alive.', 'Seven black friends go away for the weekend, only to find themselves trapped in a cabin with a killer who has a vendetta. They must pit their street smarts and knowledge of horror movies against the murderer to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2aS9FE0C3VUHtSb3Ak41aU9K3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008392'),
  ('122626929987625057', 'The Blackout', 1997, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Abel Ferrara, Ken Kelsch, Noga Isackson', 'Abel Ferrara, Christ Zois, Marla Hanson', 'Matthew Modine, Claudia Schiffer, Dennis Hopper, Béatrice Dalle, Sarah Lassez, Steven Bauer, Nancy Ferrara, Andrew Fiscella', 'R', 'A debauched Hollywood movie actor tries to piece together one wild night in Miami years earlier which remains a drug-induced blur, and soon finds out that some questions about his past are best left unanswered.', 'A debauched Hollywood movie actor tries to piece together one wild night in Miami years earlier which remains a drug-induced blur, and soon finds out that some questions about his past are best left unanswered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBnqj8PNEwkIt2xjlm46TdD6G2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25690'),
  ('1099949556592148116', 'The Blackout', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Robert David Sanders', 'Jim Beck', 'Barbara Streifel Sanders, Joseph Dunn, Ian Malcolm, Michael Caruso, Caroline Rich, Anthony Tedesco, James Martinez, Alexis Zibolis', null, 'It''s Christmas Eve, the city goes dark, and the few remaining tenants of The Ravenwood find themselves trapped in their building. And they are not alone.', 'It''s Christmas Eve, the city goes dark, and the few remaining tenants of The Ravenwood find themselves trapped in their building. And they are not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZHXqZVpdVnboyPgrS51xfJap8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25170'),
  ('839606575138771125', 'The Blackout', 2019, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Action', 'Yury Korobeynikov, Sergey Trofimov, Egor Baranov', 'Ilya Kulikov', 'Lukerya Ilyashenko, Pyotr Fyodorov, Svetlana Ivanova, Aleksey Chadov, Kseniya Kutepova, Konstantin Lavronenko, Philipp Avdeev, Artyom Markaryan', null, 'Contact between most towns on Earth has been severed. A small ring-like area in Eastern Europe still has electricity, and maybe even life is being reported from space. What military forces find outside the ring is shocking.', 'Contact between most towns on Earth has been severed. A small ring-like area in Eastern Europe still has electricity, and maybe even life is being reported from space. What military forces find outside the ring is shocking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avl9MEQhtvokNnzoWepkmHBZ2ss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574982'),
  ('730648996344526500', 'The Blackout Experiment', 2021, 'Drama, Horror', 'Daphne Qin Wu, John David Moffat IV', 'Ryan Graff, Jill Killington', 'Yasmin Irvine, Stefani Rose, Uli Auliani, Cheverly Amalia, Troy Jones, Steven Synstelien, Dominic Cole, Aleece Jones', null, 'Six strangers wake up in a room full of weapons. If they do not kill each other, someone they care about will die.', 'Six strangers wake up in a room full of weapons. If they do not kill each other, someone they care about will die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cPWVjWVi6XnwFGOXoa2cfHvqiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848067'),
  ('253251009186528113', 'The Blacksheep Affair', 1998, 'Action, Thriller', 'Lam Wai-Lun', 'Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk', 'Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Shu Qi, Andrew Lin Hoi, Ken Wong, Kenneth Tsang, Xiong Xinxin, Joe Cheung Tung-Cho, Lau Shun', null, 'A patriotic Chinese cop is reposted to fictional East European country Lavernia as punishment for ignoring orders during a plane hijack operation. There he encounters his ex-girlfriend, who fled to Lavernia after Tiananmen Square. Their paths soon tangle with the charismatic but evil leader of the Japanese cult Aum Shinryuu', 'A patriotic Chinese cop is reposted to fictional East European country Lavernia as punishment for ignoring orders during a plane hijack operation. There he encounters his ex-girlfriend, who fled to Lavernia after Tiananmen Square. Their paths soon tangle with the charismatic but evil leader of the Japanese cult Aum Shinryuu', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqINp7DO75HfGELLPnN1zlSeYn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45395'),
  ('446127756469513455', 'The Blacksmith', 1922, 'Comedy', 'Buster Keaton, Malcolm St. Clair', 'Buster Keaton, Malcolm St. Clair', 'Buster Keaton, Virginia Fox, Joe Roberts, Edward F. Cline, Malcolm St. Clair, Billy Franey', null, 'Buster clowns around in a blacksmith''s shop until he and the smithy get in a fight which sends the smithy to jail. Buster helps several customers with horses, then destroys a Rolls Royce while fixing the car parked next to it.', 'Buster clowns around in a blacksmith''s shop until he and the smithy get in a fight which sends the smithy to jail. Buster helps several customers with horses, then destroys a Rolls Royce while fixing the car parked next to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHE7msaYiGhJr0VWhngM3Tz1b5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37360'),
  ('727460710621836784', 'The Blacksmiths', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'While his aide continuously turns the handle of the bellows, keeping hot a small furnace in front of him, a blacksmith is pounding a piece of metal on an anvil, then plunges the shaft into a tub of water, causing a cloud of vapor in the process.', 'While his aide continuously turns the handle of the bellows, keeping hot a small furnace in front of him, a blacksmith is pounding a piece of metal on an anvil, then plunges the shaft into a tub of water, causing a cloud of vapor in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3HjgD9Qs8aEX93Uqc9OOq44sf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127777'),
  ('958984647606374958', 'The Blackwell Ghost', 2017, 'Horror', 'Turner Clay', 'Turner Clay', 'Turner Clay, Terri Czapleski, Sonny Burnette', 'NR', 'A filmmaker tries to prove that ghosts are real but soon regrets his intentions after he finds himself being terrorized in a haunted house by a ghost with a dark past. An authentic documentary that shows actual ghost footage that was captured on camera.', 'A filmmaker tries to prove that ghosts are real but soon regrets his intentions after he finds himself being terrorized in a haunted house by a ghost with a dark past. An authentic documentary that shows actual ghost footage that was captured on camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqpbsZYPPULdZcErDtGKld6QJws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470528'),
  ('460628251553072169', 'The Blackwell Ghost 4', 2020, 'Horror', 'Turner Clay', 'Turner Clay', 'Turner Clay', 'NR', 'Turner returns to the light foot house to continue his investigation. This time he researched into the first victim Susan. He finds out from the detective there was a note left when light foot committed suicide. It ended up being a map to the first victim (Susan) body. The map is encrypted and turner has to find a way to decode it. While crazy things happen at the light foot house.', 'Turner returns to the light foot house to continue his investigation. This time he researched into the first victim Susan. He finds out from the detective there was a note left when light foot committed suicide. It ended up being a map to the first victim (Susan) body. The map is encrypted and turner has to find a way to decode it. While crazy things happen at the light foot house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6rVPcRWDkJmTAlJoanrXHIn6UH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659716'),
  ('387089881635080665', 'The Blackwell Ghost 5', 2020, 'Horror, Documentary', 'Turner Clay', 'Turner Clay', 'Turner Clay', 'NR', 'In this 5th installment of "The Blackwell Ghost" series, the ghost hunting filmmaker returns to the "Lightfoot House" where he hopes to solve a newly discovered puzzle which may lead to the location of more undiscovered victims.', 'In this 5th installment of "The Blackwell Ghost" series, the ghost hunting filmmaker returns to the "Lightfoot House" where he hopes to solve a newly discovered puzzle which may lead to the location of more undiscovered victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTd93ANETCrQboKTkdPnxoCriti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749305'),
  ('138646817427516961', 'The Blackwell Ghost 6', 2022, 'Horror, Drama', 'Turner Clay', 'Turner Clay', 'Turner Clay', null, 'A filmmaker attempts to capture paranormal events on camera all while trying to protect his children from the ghost that haunts their house. This is the 6th installment of "The Blackwell Ghost" series.', 'A filmmaker attempts to capture paranormal events on camera all while trying to protect his children from the ghost that haunts their house. This is the 6th installment of "The Blackwell Ghost" series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBYSoL1JnA53QRhvUKhMoxTTWp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977994'),
  ('362090251386674130', 'The Blackwell Ghost 7', 2022, 'Horror', 'Turner Clay', null, 'Turner Clay', null, 'A filmmaker attempts to continue his paranormal adventure but finds himself stalked and tormented by a dangerous person who follows his every move. This is the 7th installment of "The Blackwell Ghost" series.', 'A filmmaker attempts to continue his paranormal adventure but finds himself stalked and tormented by a dangerous person who follows his every move. This is the 7th installment of "The Blackwell Ghost" series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2D9dwwHIOYdns5u6KdZB6uLFhZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1041446'),
  ('866396702987207230', 'The Blackwell Ghost 8', 2024, 'Horror', 'Turner Clay', null, 'Turner Clay', null, 'A filmmaker continues his quest to uncover the truth behind a series of unsolved murders from years ago. This is the 8th installment of "The Blackwell Ghost" series.', 'A filmmaker continues his quest to uncover the truth behind a series of unsolved murders from years ago. This is the 8th installment of "The Blackwell Ghost" series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PlS5c6OgmPBlA4xKxinLMXRLQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244657'),
  ('182966686466520820', 'The Blade', 1995, 'Action', 'Tsui Hark, Venus Keung, Sherman Ting Hin-Pun', 'Tsui Hark, So Man-Sing, Koan Hui', 'Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Xiong Xinxin, Sonny Song, Austin Wai Tin-Chi, Moses Chan Ho, Chung Bik-Ha, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Jason Chu Wing-Tong', null, 'Adopted by a renowned swordsmith, a young man discovers that his biological father was killed by a powerful bandit called Lung. Leaving to seek revenge, he runs afoul of vicious desert scum, losing his right arm in the process. After being nursed back to health, he learns to compensate for his loss and returns to confront Lung.', 'Adopted by a renowned swordsmith, a young man discovers that his biological father was killed by a powerful bandit called Lung. Leaving to seek revenge, he runs afoul of vicious desert scum, losing his right arm in the process. After being nursed back to health, he learns to compensate for his loss and returns to confront Lung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7i92qvq7o443pGbmK6zIl7kVU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42845'),
  ('145596063617464771', 'The Blade Master', 1983, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato, Sam Stone', 'Joe D''Amato', 'Miles O''Keeffe, Lisa Foster, David Brandon, Charles Borromel, Nello Pazzafini, Osiride Pevarello, Donald Hodson, Kiro Wehara', 'PG', 'Muscle-bound Ator and his mute Asian sidekick travel from the ends of the Earth to save his aged mentor from the evil mustachioed Zor.', 'Muscle-bound Ator and his mute Asian sidekick travel from the ends of the Earth to save his aged mentor from the evil mustachioed Zor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86xqVycd3h2MzTsXNcFu3P1Ucl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31264'),
  ('586550389523088251', 'The Blade Spares None', 1971, 'Drama, Action', 'Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, Chih Yao-Chang, Cheng Hui-Jan', 'David Lo Tai-Wai', 'Nora Miao, Patrick Tse Yin, James Tien Chun, David Lo Tai-Wai, Paul Chang Chung, Fung Ngai, Lee Wan-Chung, Leung Lung', null, 'Ho Li-Chun, a pretty but ruthless swordswoman, and three challengers are participating in an open tournament at Prince Kuei''s Palace. A knight, Chen Jo-Yu, is defeated in the tournament. He flees and later returns with knight Tang Ching-Yun who wields a strange sword. They get trapped but Ho deliberately sets both free after seeing Tang''s weapon which she recognizes as the same weapon once used by Sun Tien-Chen, a foe of the Ho family. She decides to investigate. She finds out Prince Kuei actually is Sun, who killed the real prince years ago and assumed his identity. Ho joins forces with Chen and Tang. The trio slays Sun in a desperate confrontation at the palace.', 'Ho Li-Chun, a pretty but ruthless swordswoman, and three challengers are participating in an open tournament at Prince Kuei''s Palace. A knight, Chen Jo-Yu, is defeated in the tournament. He flees and later returns with knight Tang Ching-Yun who wields a strange sword. They get trapped but Ho deliberately sets both free after seeing Tang''s weapon which she recognizes as the same weapon once used by Sun Tien-Chen, a foe of the Ho family. She decides to investigate. She finds out Prince Kuei actually is Sun, who killed the real prince years ago and assumed his identity. Ho joins forces with Chen and Tang. The trio slays Sun in a desperate confrontation at the palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qk9b4belX71BbShSlh1mu3xP93Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74266'),
  ('46147597086493095', 'The Blair Bitch Project', 1999, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Scott LaRose', 'Allan Murray', 'Linda Blair, Scott LaRose, Allan Murray, Carey Eidel', null, 'Three student filmmakers run into trouble in the woods as they set out to make a documentary about the Blair Witch. This is a short parody of "The Blair Witch Project".', 'Three student filmmakers run into trouble in the woods as they set out to make a documentary about the Blair Witch. This is a short parody of "The Blair Witch Project".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVvKMT8a3FikYc1zwMTE4GOOlfC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276150'),
  ('905776511079029360', 'The Blair Witch Project', 1999, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Daniel Myrick, Eduardo Sánchez, Neal Fredericks', 'Daniel Myrick, Eduardo Sánchez', 'Heather Donahue, Joshua Leonard, Michael C. Williams, Bob Griffin, Jim King, Sandra Sánchez, Ed Swanson, Patricia DeCou', 'R', 'In October of 1994 three student filmmakers disappeared in the woods near Burkittsville, Maryland, while shooting a documentary. A year later their footage was found.', 'In October of 1994 three student filmmakers disappeared in the woods near Burkittsville, Maryland, while shooting a documentary. A year later their footage was found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9050VGrYjYrEjpOvDZVAngLbg1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2667'),
  ('447836637629035745', 'The Blancheville Monster', 1963, 'Horror', 'Alberto De Martino, Alejandro Ulloa', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giovanni Grimaldi, Sergio Corbucci', 'Gérard Tichy, Leo Anchóriz, Ombretta Colli, Helga Liné, Irán Eory, Vanni Materassi, Paco Morán, Emilia Wolkowicz', null, 'The beautiful young daughter of a crazed count fears that she will fall victim to the family curse - to be sacrificed to fulfill an ancient family legend.', 'The beautiful young daughter of a crazed count fears that she will fall victim to the family curse - to be sacrificed to fulfill an ancient family legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7MNu0IkuW7czFyDgbrvY2ne4Yb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28536'),
  ('411506282694889793', 'The Blank Generation', 1976, 'Documentary, Music', 'Amos Poe, Ivan Král', null, 'David Byrne, Jayne County, Jay Dee Daugherty, Chris Frantz, Debbie Harry, Richard Hell, Lenny Kaye, Ivan Král', null, 'The cream of the New York new wave/punk crop, filmed live at CBGB when the scene was just beginning. Includes performances by Patti Smith, Blondie, Television, the Ramones, Talking Heads, the Heartbreakers, the Shirts, Wayne County, the Marbles, the Dolls, Miamis, Harry Toledo, and the Tuff Darts (w/Robert Gordon).', 'The cream of the New York new wave/punk crop, filmed live at CBGB when the scene was just beginning. Includes performances by Patti Smith, Blondie, Television, the Ramones, Talking Heads, the Heartbreakers, the Shirts, Wayne County, the Marbles, the Dolls, Miamis, Harry Toledo, and the Tuff Darts (w/Robert Gordon).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DgKLfM2reO3DCMoQPdL9F0K81E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46136'),
  ('1007871050201162311', 'The Blaze', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Quentin Reynaud, June-Claire Baury, Vincent Mathias', 'Quentin Reynaud', 'Alex Lutz, André Dussollier, Sophie Parel, Laura Sépul, Vallier Vaudin, Suzanne Queau Picard, Jules Marchand, Christophe Sardain', null, 'Simon lives with his aging father Joseph in the south of France. When a massive wildfire devastates their tree-covered coastal region and as the warning siren reaches their home, the two must leave everything behind to escape. But the wind intensifies and the air fills with smoke as they get caught in a massive traffic jam with other evacuees while the fire is getting closer and closer. With ash soon falling like snow, the temperature rising and a menacing fire approaching, Simon must quickly find a way out to save himself and his weakened father.', 'Simon lives with his aging father Joseph in the south of France. When a massive wildfire devastates their tree-covered coastal region and as the warning siren reaches their home, the two must leave everything behind to escape. But the wind intensifies and the air fills with smoke as they get caught in a massive traffic jam with other evacuees while the fire is getting closer and closer. With ash soon falling like snow, the temperature rising and a menacing fire approaching, Simon must quickly find a way out to save himself and his weakened father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDUmVcEHjbPOJlj3ZVldluHCISy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944306'),
  ('877933850558930649', 'The Blazing Sun', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Youssef Chahine, Ahmed Khorshed, Mohamed Abu Youssef', 'Ali El Zorkani', 'Faten Hamama, Omar Sharif, Zaki Rostom, Farid Shawqy, Abdel Warith Assir, Hamdy Ghaith, Zaki Ibrahim, Abdel Ghani El Nagdi', null, 'A wealthy landlord floods and destroys a village on purpose to prevent the people living there from making a profit off their crops. What he doesn''t know is that his own daughter, Amal, is in love with Ahmed, a young man from the village.', 'A wealthy landlord floods and destroys a village on purpose to prevent the people living there from making a profit off their crops. What he doesn''t know is that his own daughter, Amal, is in love with Ahmed, a young man from the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2LEsBwFOajHK80K8gxq9cv9dfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199456'),
  ('1022899214238205799', 'The Blazing World', 2021, 'Horror, Fantasy, Adventure, Drama', 'Shane F. Kelly, Carlson Young', 'Carlson Young, Pierce Brown', 'Carlson Young, Udo Kier, Dermot Mulroney, Vinessa Shaw, John Karna, Soko, Bailey Alexander Lewis', 'NR', 'Ever since Margaret was six years old, she has been haunted by the memory of watching her sister drown during an explosive fight between her parents. As a young woman, she slides further into her twisted inner life, ultimately finding herself on the brink of suicide. Through an epic journey down the smokiest and scariest corridors of her imagination, she tries to exorcise the demons pushing her closer and closer to the edge.', 'Ever since Margaret was six years old, she has been haunted by the memory of watching her sister drown during an explosive fight between her parents. As a young woman, she slides further into her twisted inner life, ultimately finding herself on the brink of suicide. Through an epic journey down the smokiest and scariest corridors of her imagination, she tries to exorcise the demons pushing her closer and closer to the edge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyRVm2a9k7XDbmuBvmv84gbCRqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776506'),
  ('89898381075604481', 'The Bleeding', 2009, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Charlie Picerni, Tom Priestley Jr., James L. Bills', 'Lance Lane', 'Michael Madsen, Vinnie Jones, Armand Assante, Kat Von D, DMX, William McNamara, Krista Ayne, Terence J. Rotolo', 'R', 'Surrounded by carnage, slaughter, brutal crashes and total mayhem, Shawn Black is in a race to save the world from pure evil.', 'Surrounded by carnage, slaughter, brutal crashes and total mayhem, Shawn Black is in a race to save the world from pure evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6PrZnwNswHwlabGgsEvBgDESo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45273'),
  ('829306550337662324', 'The Bleeding Edge', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Kirby Dick', 'Kirby Dick', 'Robert Bridges, Angie Firmalino, Rita Redberg, Stephen Tower', null, 'Each year in the United States, unparalleled innovations in medical diagnostics, treatment, and technology hit the market. But when the same devices designed to save patients end up harming them, who is accountable?', 'Each year in the United States, unparalleled innovations in medical diagnostics, treatment, and technology hit the market. But when the same devices designed to save patients end up harming them, who is accountable?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weWAoaNOWi5VBnnGF5wEDI14LYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511815'),
  ('940171942255241284', 'The Blessed', 2017, 'Drama', 'Pierre Aïm, Sofia Djama', 'Sofia Djama', 'Sami Bouajila, Nadia Kaci, Amine Lansari, Lyna Khoudri, Adam Bessa, Faouzi Bensaïdi', null, 'Algiers, a few years after the civil war. Amal and Samir have decided to celebrate their twentieth wedding anniversary in a restaurant. While on their way, their share their views on Algeria: Amal talks about lost illusions and Samir about the necessity to cope with them. At the same time, their son Fahim and his friends Feriel and Reda are wandering about in a hostile Algiers about to steal their youth.', 'Algiers, a few years after the civil war. Amal and Samir have decided to celebrate their twentieth wedding anniversary in a restaurant. While on their way, their share their views on Algeria: Amal talks about lost illusions and Samir about the necessity to cope with them. At the same time, their son Fahim and his friends Feriel and Reda are wandering about in a hostile Algiers about to steal their youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tv6C2SwoTX2sfqNWaaPgO7cyk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474353'),
  ('331681056599271599', 'The Blessed Ones', 1986, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Per Norén, Ingmar Bergman', 'Ulla Isaksson', 'Harriet Andersson, Per Myrberg, Christina Schollin, Lasse Pöysti, Irma Christenson, Björn Gustafson, Majlis Granlund, Kristina Adolphson', null, 'Middle-aged schoolteacher Viveka and her husband Sune enter a marriage marked by devotion and increasing strain. As Viveka’s jealousy and religious anxiety intensify into paranoid delusions, Sune becomes progressively entangled in her condition, transforming their relationship into a shared psychological collapse.', 'Middle-aged schoolteacher Viveka and her husband Sune enter a marriage marked by devotion and increasing strain. As Viveka’s jealousy and religious anxiety intensify into paranoid delusions, Sune becomes progressively entangled in her condition, transforming their relationship into a shared psychological collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7g1087aq9IffSbL1qcMtgKFy63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108524'),
  ('339119254178626699', 'The Blind', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Andrew Hyatt', 'Stephanie Katz, Andrew Hyatt', 'Aron von Andrian, Amelia Eve, Scarlett Abinante, Matthew Erick White, Ronan Carroll, Brielle Robillard, Aaron Dalla Villa, Brasher Russell', 'PG-13', 'Long before Duck Dynasty''s Phil Robertson became a reality TV star, he fell in love with Miss Kay and started a family, but his demons threatened to tear their lives apart. Set in the backwoods swamps of 1960s Louisiana, ''The Blind'' shares never-before-revealed moments in Phil''s life as he seeks to conquer the shame of his past, ultimately finding redemption in an unlikely place. This stunning cinematic journey chronicles the love story that launched a dynasty, the turmoil that nearly brought it crashing down, and the hope that rose from the ashes to create a foundation for generations to come.', 'Long before Duck Dynasty''s Phil Robertson became a reality TV star, he fell in love with Miss Kay and started a family, but his demons threatened to tear their lives apart. Set in the backwoods swamps of 1960s Louisiana, ''The Blind'' shares never-before-revealed moments in Phil''s life as he seeks to conquer the shame of his past, ultimately finding redemption in an unlikely place. This stunning cinematic journey chronicles the love story that launched a dynasty, the turmoil that nearly brought it crashing down, and the hope that rose from the ashes to create a foundation for generations to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVdPgnzj83Rqx5pbTFEjcKMv6BB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032194'),
  ('787389492330514788', 'The Blind Christ', 2016, 'Drama', 'Christopher Murray, Inti Briones', 'Christopher Murray', 'Michael Silva, Bastian Inostroza, Pedro Godoy, Ana María Henríquez, Mauricio Pinto', null, 'Michael believes he experienced a divine revelation in the desert when he was a child. His neighbors are incredulous and take him for the town fool ever since. One evening, he gets news that a childhood friend was badly hurt in an accident in a remote village. Michael decides to drop everything to go on a barefoot pilgrimage through the Chilean desert in order to cure his friend with a miracle, a voyage that will traverse the blind desperation of a society in need of faith.', 'Michael believes he experienced a divine revelation in the desert when he was a child. His neighbors are incredulous and take him for the town fool ever since. One evening, he gets news that a childhood friend was badly hurt in an accident in a remote village. Michael decides to drop everything to go on a barefoot pilgrimage through the Chilean desert in order to cure his friend with a miracle, a voyage that will traverse the blind desperation of a society in need of faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTStBp3xLZmZKstSfQcBxLpRwgp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408544'),
  ('844996566647443546', 'The Blind Man Who Did Not Want to See Titanic', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Sari Aaltonen, Teemu Nikki', 'Teemu Nikki', 'Petri Poikolainen, Marjaana Maijala, Hannamaija Nikander, Matti Onnismaa, Samuli Jaskio, Rami Rusinen, Lassi Poikolainen, Kimmo Vehviläinen', null, 'Jaakko and Sirpa have never met face to face, but talk on the phone every day. When Jaakko hears news about Sirpa''s declining health, he decides to go meet her in another city. It''s not the easiest decision, because he''s blind and paralyzed from the chest down - and he has to make the journey alone. To get there, Jaakko must rely on the help of five strangers. What could go wrong?', 'Jaakko and Sirpa have never met face to face, but talk on the phone every day. When Jaakko hears news about Sirpa''s declining health, he decides to go meet her in another city. It''s not the easiest decision, because he''s blind and paralyzed from the chest down - and he has to make the journey alone. To get there, Jaakko must rely on the help of five strangers. What could go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYuZ8yvVuUJsISKY75yt6FIzJFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716855'),
  ('415757632701540808', 'The Blind Side', 2009, 'Drama', 'John Lee Hancock, Alar Kivilo, K.C. Hodenfield', 'John Lee Hancock', 'Sandra Bullock, Tim McGraw, Quinton Aaron, Jae Head, Lily Collins, Ray McKinnon, Kim Dickens, Adriane Lenox', 'PG-13', 'The story of Michael Oher, a homeless and traumatized boy who became an All American football player and first round NFL draft pick with the help of a caring woman and her family.', 'The story of Michael Oher, a homeless and traumatized boy who became an All American football player and first round NFL draft pick with the help of a caring woman and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMgq7VBriuBFknXEe9E9pVBYGZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22881'),
  ('552726248919949582', 'The Blind Spot', 2013, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Daniel Harrich', 'Ulrich Chaussy, Daniel Harrich', 'Benno Fürmann, Nicolette Krebitz, Heiner Lauterbach, Jörg Hartmann, August Zirner, Udo Wachtveitl, Miroslav Nemec, Isolde Barth', null, 'The true story of a journalist who investigates the backgrounds of the Oktoberfest terror attack of 1980.', 'The true story of a journalist who investigates the backgrounds of the Oktoberfest terror attack of 1980.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRXomMYawdTdm5nfn3aEd5eATZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246053'),
  ('283725430057160812', 'The Blind Sunflowers', 2008, 'Drama', 'José Luis Cuerda, Hans Burmann, Ignacio Gutiérrez-Solana', 'Rafael Azcona', 'Maribel Verdú, Javier Cámara, Raúl Arévalo, Roger Príncep, José Ángel Egido, Martiño Rivas, Irene Escolar, Juan Antonio Quintana', null, 'Orense, Spain, 1940, just after the end of the Civil War. Every time Elena locks the door of her home, she and her children become the faithful guardians of a sacred secret: Ricardo, her husband, their father, hides in the house, trying to avoid the brutal political persecution of the victors, who hunt, as if they were wild animals, and imprison or execute, those who have lost the bloody and tragic struggle…', 'Orense, Spain, 1940, just after the end of the Civil War. Every time Elena locks the door of her home, she and her children become the faithful guardians of a sacred secret: Ricardo, her husband, their father, hides in the house, trying to avoid the brutal political persecution of the victors, who hunt, as if they were wild animals, and imprison or execute, those who have lost the bloody and tragic struggle…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ga2602pzYW2e34JoDyNyhieNcbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56810'),
  ('1021865297718021289', 'The Bling Ring', 2011, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Michael Lembeck, Ousama Rawi, Dennis Crow', 'Shelley Evans', 'Austin Butler, Yin Chang, Jennifer Grey, Spencer Locke, Tom Irwin, Sebastian Sozzi, Tracey Fairaway, Wendy Makkena', 'PG-13', 'At the center of one of Hollywood''s most notorious burglary rings in 2009 was a group of average, middle-class teens from a quiet suburb. This is the behind-the-scenes story of how Nick, a shy, awkward boy, lured by the promise of popularity and acceptance, found himself following his glamorous, charismatic best friend Rachel into breaking into celebrities'' houses and robbing them of millions of dollars in clothes and jewelry.', 'At the center of one of Hollywood''s most notorious burglary rings in 2009 was a group of average, middle-class teens from a quiet suburb. This is the behind-the-scenes story of how Nick, a shy, awkward boy, lured by the promise of popularity and acceptance, found himself following his glamorous, charismatic best friend Rachel into breaking into celebrities'' houses and robbing them of millions of dollars in clothes and jewelry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3WmMVULbz2IZ75J3n5wWaatRml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116853'),
  ('266970612407501754', 'The Bling Ring', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sofia Coppola, Christopher Blauvelt, Harris Savides', 'Sofia Coppola', 'Katie Chang, Emma Watson, Taissa Farmiga, Claire Julien, Israel Broussard, Leslie Mann, Georgia Rock, Carlos Miranda', 'R', 'Inspired by actual events, a group of fame-obsessed teenagers use the Internet to track celebrities'' whereabouts in order to rob their homes.', 'Inspired by actual events, a group of fame-obsessed teenagers use the Internet to track celebrities'' whereabouts in order to rob their homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yh55qCcdgPRJweDWM2CiEubJCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96936'),
  ('672186990662022795', 'The Blinkins: The Bear and the Blizzard', 1986, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Sunao Katabuchi, Keiko Namba, Masayuki Ozeki', 'Charles Swenson', 'Burgess Meredith, Henry Gibson, Hamilton Camp, Louise Chamis, Jennifer Darling, Daryl Wood, Alan Young, Missy Gold', 'G', 'A little girl, Molly, loses her doll, Belinda, in the Blinkin wood and the Blinkins find it and make it their mission to return her to the owner. In the process, Flashy gets kidnapped by Mr Bear and the Blinkins are given a ransom from Mr Bear and Mr Grogg in the form of food from their winter store in exchange for Flashy''s safe return.', 'A little girl, Molly, loses her doll, Belinda, in the Blinkin wood and the Blinkins find it and make it their mission to return her to the owner. In the process, Flashy gets kidnapped by Mr Bear and the Blinkins are given a ransom from Mr Bear and Mr Grogg in the form of food from their winter store in exchange for Flashy''s safe return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBCKANftlT0v7FT3g8Z2uTofdEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325589'),
  ('297208392013924575', 'The Bliss of Mrs. Blossom', 1968, 'Comedy', 'David Besgrove, Michael Guest, Stuart Black', 'Denis Norden, Alec Coppel', 'Shirley MacLaine, Richard Attenborough, James Booth, Freddie Jones, William Rushton, Bob Monkhouse, Patricia Routledge, John Bluthal', null, 'Harriet Blossom is married to Robert Blossom, a businessman who''d rather spend the night at his bra factory than at home with her. One day, Harriet''s sewing machine breaks, so Robert sends a repairman, Ambrose, to fix it. It''s lust at first sight for Harriet, who convinces Ambrose to hide out in the attic for a tryst. When her new beau shows no desire to leave, the pair begin a years-long love affair right under Robert''s nose.', 'Harriet Blossom is married to Robert Blossom, a businessman who''d rather spend the night at his bra factory than at home with her. One day, Harriet''s sewing machine breaks, so Robert sends a repairman, Ambrose, to fix it. It''s lust at first sight for Harriet, who convinces Ambrose to hide out in the attic for a tryst. When her new beau shows no desire to leave, the pair begin a years-long love affair right under Robert''s nose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhIgwEdxnLAec9TLgukZaXAHvGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46776'),
  ('705736550652002564', 'The Blob', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Irvin S. Yeaworth Jr., Thomas E. Spalding, Bert Smith', 'Theodore Simonson, Kay Linaker', 'Steve McQueen, Aneta Corsaut, Earl Rowe, John Benson, Robert Fields, James Bonnet, Olin Howland, George Karas', null, 'A drive-in favorite, this sci-fi classic follows teenagers Steve and his best girl, Jane, as they try to protect their hometown from a gelatinous alien life form that engulfs everything it touches. The first to discover the substance and live to tell about it, Steve and Jane witness the blob destroying an elderly man, then it growing to a terrifying size. But no one else has seen the goo, and policeman Dave refuses to believe the kids without proof.', 'A drive-in favorite, this sci-fi classic follows teenagers Steve and his best girl, Jane, as they try to protect their hometown from a gelatinous alien life form that engulfs everything it touches. The first to discover the substance and live to tell about it, Steve and Jane witness the blob destroying an elderly man, then it growing to a terrifying size. But no one else has seen the goo, and policeman Dave refuses to believe the kids without proof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctOwn1Ibg3SjDG4WulvFvSH0PRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8851'),
  ('993769081548765605', 'The Blob', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Mark Irwin, Chuck Russell, Josh McLaglen', 'Chuck Russell, Frank Darabont', 'Kevin Dillon, Shawnee Smith, Donovan Leitch, Jeffrey DeMunn, Candy Clark, Joe Seneca, Del Close, Paul McCrane', 'R', 'In Arborville, California, three high school students try to protect their hometown from a gelatinous alien life form that engulfs everything it touches.', 'In Arborville, California, three high school students try to protect their hometown from a gelatinous alien life form that engulfs everything it touches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXXDmz5cPuSo9LveCNjZ1j16szC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9599'),
  ('274009430119784550', 'The Block Island Sound', 2021, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Matthew McManus, Kevin McManus, Alan Gwizdowski', 'Matthew McManus, Kevin McManus', 'Chris Sheffield, Michaela McManus, Neville Archambault, Matilda Lawler, Ryan O''Flanagan, Jim Cummings, Heidi Niedermeyer, Jeremy Holm', 'NR', 'Something lurks off the coast of Block Island, silently influencing the behavior of fisherman, Tom Lynch. After suffering a series of violent outbursts, he unknowingly puts his family in grave danger.', 'Something lurks off the coast of Block Island, silently influencing the behavior of fisherman, Tom Lynch. After suffering a series of violent outbursts, he unknowingly puts his family in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2y3zjc5yMtPjU2vLfhgOX90uO4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731740'),
  ('917321382703378742', 'The Blockhouse', 1973, 'Drama, War', 'Clive Rees, Keith Goddard', 'John Gould, Clive Rees', 'Peter Sellers, Charles Aznavour, Jeremy Kemp, Peter Vaughan, Per Oscarsson, Nicholas Jones, Leon Lissek, Alfred Lynch', null, 'A group of Slave workers, drafted by the Nazis to help construct their coastal defences in 1944, are trapped in an underground bunker when the Allies land at Normandy on D-Day. They find huge stores of food, but not enough candles. The slow dying of the light parallels their increasing boredom, illness, and jealousy during their entrapment. Based on the Novel ''Le Blockhaus'' by Jean Paul Clebert', 'A group of Slave workers, drafted by the Nazis to help construct their coastal defences in 1944, are trapped in an underground bunker when the Allies land at Normandy on D-Day. They find huge stores of food, but not enough candles. The slow dying of the light parallels their increasing boredom, illness, and jealousy during their entrapment. Based on the Novel ''Le Blockhaus'' by Jean Paul Clebert', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQ4Ckndo4c2Zi6pwYkTARbxyDYL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71840'),
  ('854080555913191073', 'The Blond Boy from the Casbah', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Alexandre Arcady, Alexandre Aja, Houcem Slouli', 'Alexandre Arcady', 'Léo Campion, Marie Gillain, Pascal Elbé, Jean Benguigui, Christian Berkel, Michel Boujenah, Olivier Sitruk, Smaïn', null, 'The childhood of the movie director Antoine Lisner, who left Algeria in 1962. In order to present his new movie, he comes back to Algiers with his son.', 'The childhood of the movie director Antoine Lisner, who left Algeria in 1962. In order to present his new movie, he comes back to Algiers with his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPpHwbpXwhu4k7JgE0fpki75lmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000108'),
  ('282923058506502836', 'The Blonde Around the Corner', 1984, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Vladimir Bortko, Ivan Bagaev, Valentin Komarov', 'Aleksandr Chervinsky', 'Andrey Mironov, Tatyana Dogileva, Yelena Solovey, Yevgeniya Khanayeva, Mark Prudkin, Anatoliy Ravikovich, Pavel Kadochnikov, Baadur Tsuladze', null, 'An unemployed astrophysicist finds a job of a docker at a grocery store, where he falls in love with a street-wise saleswoman in the produce department. But the groom runs away at the wedding reception.', 'An unemployed astrophysicist finds a job of a docker at a grocery store, where he falls in love with a street-wise saleswoman in the produce department. But the groom runs away at the wedding reception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzVbLUduECqmDw8GcaPizV6e48O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63299'),
  ('925453914216911007', 'The Blonde from Peking', 1967, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Nicolas Gessner, Claude Vital, Jean Mylonas', 'Nicolas Gessner, Marc Behm', 'Mireille Darc, Claudio Brook, Edward G. Robinson, Giorgia Moll, Pascale Roberts, Anne-Marie Blanc, Hellmut Lange, Werner Schwier', null, 'Spies from several countries try to find out what secrets are hidden in the mind of a young amnesiac girl who has appeared in Paris.', 'Spies from several countries try to find out what secrets are hidden in the mind of a young amnesiac girl who has appeared in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y9qbOii5Bg4xMP9WXzgruNOQF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118150'),
  ('686631907249864064', 'The Blonde One', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marco Berger, Sergei Nikiforov, Daniela Castillo Mejía', 'Marco Berger', 'Gaston Re, Alfonso Barón, Malena Irusta, Ailín Salas, Franco Heiler, Fred Raposo, Charly Velasco, Antonia De Michelis', 'NR', 'Gabriel rents a room in Juan’s House. They work together in a Woodwork place. Gabriel is a very quiet guy and has a little daughter. Juan is a party boy who has a lots of girls around. Inadvertently the sexual tension starts to grow between them. It opens a new hidden forbidden world they have to deal with.', 'Gabriel rents a room in Juan’s House. They work together in a Woodwork place. Gabriel is a very quiet guy and has a little daughter. Juan is a party boy who has a lots of girls around. Inadvertently the sexual tension starts to grow between them. It opens a new hidden forbidden world they have to deal with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QiRL7YWh2FDbUcT9N3q7zg6U7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581791'),
  ('1085989018563328226', 'The Blonde Pick-Up', 1951, 'Drama', 'Robert C. Dertano, William C. Thompson', 'Robert C. Dertano', 'Timothy Farrell, Peaches Page, Clara Mortensen, Rita Martínez, Muriel Gardner, Don Ferrara, Matt Douglas, Paul Merton', 'PG', 'Scalli is a gangster who manages women wrestlers as a front for his bookmaking, drug, and prostitution rackets. He trusts the wrong people and ends up trying to run away from both the police and mysterious mob boss Mr. Big, to whom he owes $35,000.', 'Scalli is a gangster who manages women wrestlers as a front for his bookmaking, drug, and prostitution rackets. He trusts the wrong people and ends up trying to run away from both the police and mysterious mob boss Mr. Big, to whom he owes $35,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1ZjNLzX9vedsvxUzS4zKqje8I8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89993'),
  ('1095806444910854332', 'The Blonde with Bare Breasts', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Adventure', 'Manuel Pradal', 'Manuel Pradal', 'Vahina Giocante, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Steve Le Roi, Paul Schmidt, Brendan Backmann, Jacques Spiesser, Christian Bouillette, Mireille Franchino', null, 'Julian, 25, and Louis, 12, are two brothers who work and live on a barge in the centre of Paris. They transport gravel and resort to petty crime to make ends meet. They have grown up alone and now they are inseparable, wedded to a life on the river. A receiver of stolen goods offers them the opportunity of a lifetime, to steal a painting by Manet from the Musée d''Orsay. Louis takes charge of the theft and, against the odds, he succeeds in removing it from the gallery and taking it aboard his barge. Rosalie, a museum guard, follows Louis to his home and confronts him. After a fight, the two brothers secure Rosalie in the hold of their boat and make a quick getaway. Later, Rosalie emerges from her hidey hole and makes the brothers an unexpected offer...', 'Julian, 25, and Louis, 12, are two brothers who work and live on a barge in the centre of Paris. They transport gravel and resort to petty crime to make ends meet. They have grown up alone and now they are inseparable, wedded to a life on the river. A receiver of stolen goods offers them the opportunity of a lifetime, to steal a painting by Manet from the Musée d''Orsay. Louis takes charge of the theft and, against the odds, he succeeds in removing it from the gallery and taking it aboard his barge. Rosalie, a museum guard, follows Louis to his home and confronts him. After a fight, the two brothers secure Rosalie in the hold of their boat and make a quick getaway. Later, Rosalie emerges from her hidey hole and makes the brothers an unexpected offer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTKv6OZGAjx8YagACkMc1P4aHrL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59914'),
  ('662149380141400080', 'The Blood Beast Terror', 1968, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Vernon Sewell, Stanley A. Long, George Pollard', 'Peter Bryan', 'Peter Cushing, Robert Flemyng, Wanda Ventham, Glynn Edwards, Kevin Stoney, Vanessa Howard, David Griffin, Roy Hudd', 'G', 'A scientist working with genetics creates a horrifying flying creature that feeds on human blood. Following a gruesome trail of dead bodies, Scotland Yard investigators must scramble to halt its ravenous rampage.', 'A scientist working with genetics creates a horrifying flying creature that feeds on human blood. Following a gruesome trail of dead bodies, Scotland Yard investigators must scramble to halt its ravenous rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPf7ZhBthvAa0kBzVgNqKx0mLRo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77173'),
  ('288798897484152214', 'The Blood Drinkers', 1964, 'Horror', 'Gerardo de Leon, Felipe Sacdalan', 'Cesar Amigo', 'Ronald Remy, Amalia Fuentes, Eddie Fernandez, Celia Rodriguez, Renato Robles, Mary Walter, Eva Montes, Paquito Salcedo', 'NR', 'Dr. Marco''s most beloved Katrina has died. As a vampire, Marco has devised a plan to bring her back from the dead. It requires large amounts of human blood and will eventually necessitate the transplantation of a human heart.', 'Dr. Marco''s most beloved Katrina has died. As a vampire, Marco has devised a plan to bring her back from the dead. It requires large amounts of human blood and will eventually necessitate the transplantation of a human heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rW5HTKWm5KEMuYH3vVo2I43HAWZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126693'),
  ('573296615618151437', 'The Blood of a Poet', 1932, 'Fantasy', 'Jean Cocteau, Georges Périnal', 'Jean Cocteau', 'Enrique Rivero, Elizabeth Lee Miller, Pauline Carton, Odette Talazac, Jean Desbordes, Fernand Dichamps, Lucien Jager, Féral Benga', null, 'In a poet’s room, an armless statue abruptly comes to life. It invites the poet to step through a mirror and to discover another world. Strange places and characters present themselves to him. The poet tears himself away from these twisted fascinations and returns, with some difficulty, to his room.', 'In a poet’s room, an armless statue abruptly comes to life. It invites the poet to step through a mirror and to discover another world. Strange places and characters present themselves to him. The poet tears himself away from these twisted fascinations and returns, with some difficulty, to his room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paHmfMrtQVT2cUTeteni3iDgRym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36877'),
  ('91229458146247610', 'The Blood of Fu Manchu', 1968, 'Adventure, Crime', 'Jesús Franco, Manuel Merino', 'Harry Alan Towers, Manfred R. Köhler, Jesús Franco', 'Christopher Lee, Richard Greene, Howard Marion-Crawford, Tsai Chin, Maria Rohm, Götz George, Ricardo Palacios, Loni von Friedl', null, 'In his remote jungle hideout, the evil Fu Manchu and his sadistic daughter Lin Tang have discovered a deadly venom that affects only men. Using mind control Fu Manchu recruits six women to become carriers of the ''kiss of death'' targeting key people of political influence. This will prevent them from interfering with his own ambition to spread his venomous death around the World''s major cities in a plan to gain World domination.', 'In his remote jungle hideout, the evil Fu Manchu and his sadistic daughter Lin Tang have discovered a deadly venom that affects only men. Using mind control Fu Manchu recruits six women to become carriers of the ''kiss of death'' targeting key people of political influence. This will prevent them from interfering with his own ambition to spread his venomous death around the World''s major cities in a plan to gain World domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nCcZ1MkF9EsNs5tQ74msUNXVul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3483'),
  ('1003856118798435396', 'The Blood of Heroes', 1989, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'David Webb Peoples, Frank Hammond, David Eggby', 'David Webb Peoples', 'Rutger Hauer, Anna Katarina, Delroy Lindo, Joan Chen, Gandhi MacIntyre, Vincent D''Onofrio, Justin Monjo, Casey Huang', 'R', 'Set in a futuristic world where the only sport that has survived in a wasted society is the brutal game known as jugging. Sallow, the leader of a rag-tag team, has played in the main Leagues before, but was cast out because of indiscretions with a lady. Now joined by a talented newcomer, Kidda, an ambitious young peasant girl, he and his team find they have one last chance for glory.', 'Set in a futuristic world where the only sport that has survived in a wasted society is the brutal game known as jugging. Sallow, the leader of a rag-tag team, has played in the main Leagues before, but was cast out because of indiscretions with a lady. Now joined by a talented newcomer, Kidda, an ambitious young peasant girl, he and his team find they have one last chance for glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykdEyq2GCKRr8TsUBuVkRWuWkLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21512'),
  ('757543238618678641', 'The Blood of Jesus', 1941, 'Music, Drama, Fantasy', 'Spencer Williams', 'Spencer Williams', 'Cathryn Caviness, Spencer Williams, Juanita Riley, Reather Hardeman, Rogenia Goldthwaite, James B. Jones, Frank H. McClennan', null, 'Razz accidentally shoots his wife Martha when his hunting rifle drops on the floor and discharges. The church congregation gathers at Martha’s bedside to pray for her recovery, and during this period an angel arrives to take Martha’s spirit from her body, but she is tempted by the slick Judas Green, who is an agent for Satan.', 'Razz accidentally shoots his wife Martha when his hunting rifle drops on the floor and discharges. The church congregation gathers at Martha’s bedside to pray for her recovery, and during this period an angel arrives to take Martha’s spirit from her body, but she is tempted by the slick Judas Green, who is an agent for Satan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TnOgDaakX6cuoNAsijDGnU0LP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22750'),
  ('463503173809311239', 'The Blood of Others', 1984, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama, War, History', 'Richard Ciupka, Claude Chabrol, Philippe Delarbre', 'Brian Moore', 'Jodie Foster, Michael Ontkean, Sam Neill, Lambert Wilson, Stéphane Audran, Alexandra Stewart, Roger Miremont, Marie Bunel', null, 'In the German-occupied Paris, Helene is torn between the love for her boyfriend Jean, working for the resistance and the German administrator Bergmann, who will do anything to gain her affection.', 'In the German-occupied Paris, Helene is torn between the love for her boyfriend Jean, working for the resistance and the German administrator Bergmann, who will do anything to gain her affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1xtkJzKQjTeOkaZ16hTlxSITuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4841'),
  ('573342187636121047', 'The Blood of Wolves', 2018, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Kazuya Shiraishi, Takahiro Haibara, Ryo Yamamoto', 'Junya Ikegami', 'Koji Yakusho, Tori Matsuzaka, Yoko Maki, Kenichi Takitoh, Takuma Otoo, Joey Iwanaga, Junko Abe, Yosuke Eguchi', null, 'Set in 1988 in Hiroshima, Japan, prior to the enactment of the anti-organized crime law. A rumor exists that Detective Shogo Ogami has ties with the yakuza. He is partnered with Detective Shuichi Hioka and they investigate a missing person case involving a financial company employee. Conflicts between opposing yakuza groups become more serious.', 'Set in 1988 in Hiroshima, Japan, prior to the enactment of the anti-organized crime law. A rumor exists that Detective Shogo Ogami has ties with the yakuza. He is partnered with Detective Shuichi Hioka and they investigate a missing person case involving a financial company employee. Conflicts between opposing yakuza groups become more serious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpMqk6o8mT3bQSRez1Y04bd6dua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474538'),
  ('669939404464133217', 'The Blood on Satan''s Claw', 1971, 'Horror', 'Piers Haggard, Dick Bush, Bill Westley', 'Robert Wynne-Simmons', 'Patrick Wymark, Linda Hayden, Barry Andrews, Michele Dotrice, Wendy Padbury, Anthony Ainley, Charlotte Mitchell, Tamara Ustinov', 'R', 'After a landsman in 18th century England discovers a corpse covered in fur buried in a field, the town becomes infected by "the devil''s skin," leading the local children to engage in demonic rituals and criminal behavior.', 'After a landsman in 18th century England discovers a corpse covered in fur buried in a field, the town becomes infected by "the devil''s skin," leading the local children to engage in demonic rituals and criminal behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shUG4L8iKu9g4bhZVI3SNsIOvD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26774'),
  ('722613081788765517', 'The Blood Oranges', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philip Haas, Bernard Zitzermann, Ignacio Decerega', 'Belinda Haas, Philip Haas', 'Charles Dance, Sheryl Lee, Colin Lane, Laila Robins, Rachael Bella, Aida López, Oona Haas, Vita Haas', 'R', 'Cyril and Fiona, a free-wheeling married couple, travel to a tropical coastal town to follow their sexual fantasies. Cyril is a manipulator. There, they meet another couple, Catherine and Hugh, and their three children. Hugh is a one-armed photographer who specializes in nude photographs of peasant women. Soon, they decide to live together and an erotic atmosphere develops between them.', 'Cyril and Fiona, a free-wheeling married couple, travel to a tropical coastal town to follow their sexual fantasies. Cyril is a manipulator. There, they meet another couple, Catherine and Hugh, and their three children. Hugh is a one-armed photographer who specializes in nude photographs of peasant women. Soon, they decide to live together and an erotic atmosphere develops between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0jhxfoctatYYYpIQzFyKS98w9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125958'),
  ('840566039033731796', 'The Blood Rose', 1970, 'Horror', 'Claude Mulot, Roger Fellous', 'Edgar Oppenheimer, Jean Larriaga, Claude Mulot', 'Philippe Lemaire, Anny Duperey, Elizabeth Teissier, Olivia Robin, Michèle Perello, Valérie Boisgel, Jean-Pierre Honoré, Gérard-Antoine Huart', 'R', 'Frédéric Lansac, an artist and botanist, has a wild affair with party girl Moira, but throws her over when he meets the lovely Anne. Frédéric and Anne marry, but tragedy strikes when Moira shows up at the wedding party and makes a scene, causing Anne to fall into a bonfire. Frédéric and Anne lock themselves up in his mansion with his servants, a pair of mute dwarves. Anne, needless to say, becomes bitter and demanding. Frédéric tells everyone Anne has died, then on the sly, hires a nurse to look after her.', 'Frédéric Lansac, an artist and botanist, has a wild affair with party girl Moira, but throws her over when he meets the lovely Anne. Frédéric and Anne marry, but tragedy strikes when Moira shows up at the wedding party and makes a scene, causing Anne to fall into a bonfire. Frédéric and Anne lock themselves up in his mansion with his servants, a pair of mute dwarves. Anne, needless to say, becomes bitter and demanding. Frédéric tells everyone Anne has died, then on the sly, hires a nurse to look after her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9O1mUhhV8maig4k1hjgAR2KsSlI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90887'),
  ('614530946263991076', 'The Blood Spattered Bride', 1972, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Carlos Durán, José López Moreno, Vicente Aranda', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Simón Andreu, Maribel Martín, Alexandra Bastedo, Dean Selmier, Ángel Lombarte, Montserrat Julió, Rosa M. Rodríguez', 'R', 'A young newlywed woman begins to have disturbing nightmares just after settling into the old mansion that has belonged to her husband''s family for centuries. When her sinister dreams come true, the innocent bride is caught in a maddening maze of unspeakable horrors.', 'A young newlywed woman begins to have disturbing nightmares just after settling into the old mansion that has belonged to her husband''s family for centuries. When her sinister dreams come true, the innocent bride is caught in a maddening maze of unspeakable horrors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cdm9lZgePnKb0LUC4t7su1z8S5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40365'),
  ('1055751837219758727', 'The Blood Stain', 1943, 'Drama', 'Adolfo Best-Maugard, Ross Fisher, Agustín Jiménez', 'Adolfo Best-Maugard, Miguel Ruiz Moncada', 'Estela Inda, José Casal, Heribergo G. Batemberg, Manuel Dondé, Chico Mabarak, Kyra, Lorenzo Diaz Gonzalez, Elvira Gosti', null, 'Camelia, a prostitute who works in a low-class cabaret in Mexico City (called "The Blood Stain'') meets Guillermo, a young man from the country who just arrived in the city looking for a better life. She offers to take care of him until he gets set up, and the initial friendship soon turns romantic. This inevitably causes problems with Gastón, Camelia''s pimp.', 'Camelia, a prostitute who works in a low-class cabaret in Mexico City (called "The Blood Stain'') meets Guillermo, a young man from the country who just arrived in the city looking for a better life. She offers to take care of him until he gets set up, and the initial friendship soon turns romantic. This inevitably causes problems with Gastón, Camelia''s pimp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5i4ruOs8Cs0rjK1GeaP6RwdnNRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261418'),
  ('388551305912140856', 'The Bloodhound', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Patrick Picard, Jake Magee', 'Patrick Picard', 'Liam Aiken, Joe Adler, Annalise Basso, McNally Sagal, Kimleigh Smith, Gaby Santinelli, Dylan Gentile', null, 'A visit to a wealthy and reclusive friend lands a young man in a world of fear and despair.', 'A visit to a wealthy and reclusive friend lands a young man in a world of fear and despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNot4c5dTY7L2Mc9Q3Nk1fbKdKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548511'),
  ('213929266179191865', 'The Bloodiest', 2005, 'Thriller, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Jean-Pierre Bekolo, Robert Humphreys', 'Jean-Pierre Bekolo', 'Adèle Ado, Dorylia Calmel, Emile Abossolo M''bo, Josephine Ndagnou, Essindi Mindja, Alain Dzukam Simo, Véronique Mendouga, Doualla Toto', null, 'Best friends Majolie and Chouchou are two beautiful young women trying to get ahead in a near-future Cameroon. After accidentally killing a powerful politician during sex, the two come up with a plot to dispose of the body, and get into the glamorous wakes that have taken over the local nightlife.', 'Best friends Majolie and Chouchou are two beautiful young women trying to get ahead in a near-future Cameroon. After accidentally killing a powerful politician during sex, the two come up with a plot to dispose of the body, and get into the glamorous wakes that have taken over the local nightlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gErbNLwgjGmskHqhfOgU7f2Yv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242493'),
  ('1066545058991641709', 'The Bloodstained Butterfly', 1971, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Duccio Tessari, Carlo Carlini', 'Gianfranco Clerici, Duccio Tessari', 'Helmut Berger, Giancarlo Sbragia, Ida Galli, Wendy D''Olive, Günther Stoll, Carole André, Wolfgang Preiss, Lorella De Luca', null, 'When a young female student is savagely killed in a park during a thunderstorm, the culprit seems obvious: TV sports personality Alessandro Marchi, seen fleeing the scene of the crime by numerous eyewitnesses. The evidence against him is damning... but is it all too convenient? And when the killer strikes again while Marchi is in custody, it quickly becomes apparent that there''s more to the case than meets the eye...', 'When a young female student is savagely killed in a park during a thunderstorm, the culprit seems obvious: TV sports personality Alessandro Marchi, seen fleeing the scene of the crime by numerous eyewitnesses. The evidence against him is damning... but is it all too convenient? And when the killer strikes again while Marchi is in custody, it quickly becomes apparent that there''s more to the case than meets the eye...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaZ0rYLbTfBVW7ESgdufbb5cmlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29482'),
  ('142559608471044147', 'The Bloodstained Lawn', 1973, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Riccardo Ghione, Romolo Garroni, Luciano Palermo', 'Riccardo Ghione', 'Marina Malfatti, Enzo Tarascio, George Willing, Daniela Caroli, Claudio Biava, Dominique Boschero, Lucio Dalla, Nino Castelnuovo', null, 'Various undesirables and hippie drifters are invited to the luxury, ultra-modern country home of Dr. Antonio and his wife; when they begin to vanish, it becomes clear that something sinister — and deadly — is afoot.', 'Various undesirables and hippie drifters are invited to the luxury, ultra-modern country home of Dr. Antonio and his wife; when they begin to vanish, it becomes clear that something sinister — and deadly — is afoot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paDl0SRBH5QCoomnXS1gwEWLmaz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153755'),
