  ('719180097105163864', 'The Bloody Fists', 1972, 'Action', 'Ng See-Yuen, William Chang Kee', 'Ng See-Yuen', 'Chan Sing, Chen Kuan-Tai, Henry Yu Yang, Fong Yau, San Kuai, Lau Tai-Chuen, Hon Kwok-Choi, Sau Sun Ho', null, 'Yuen Woo Ping, who would in time become one of the world''s leading martial arts choreographers, blocked the fight scenes for this Kung Fu action extravaganza. A small Chinese town is being torn apart by a conflict between local farmers and Japanese soldiers of fortune, who have been brought to town to liberate supplies of a rare Chinese herb. A martial arts expert gifted in both Chinese and Japanese fighting disciplines passes through town, and takes it upon himself to settle the feud.', 'Yuen Woo Ping, who would in time become one of the world''s leading martial arts choreographers, blocked the fight scenes for this Kung Fu action extravaganza. A small Chinese town is being torn apart by a conflict between local farmers and Japanese soldiers of fortune, who have been brought to town to liberate supplies of a rare Chinese herb. A martial arts expert gifted in both Chinese and Japanese fighting disciplines passes through town, and takes it upon himself to settle the feud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGcK2mhpJHfXt6TP1fHkkwdwM6u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82980'),
