  ('443412989340995123', 'The Bloom of Yesterday', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Sonja Rom, Chris Kraus', 'Chris Kraus', 'Lars Eidinger, Adèle Haenel, Hannah Herzsprung, Jan Josef Liefers, Rolf Hoppe, Bibiana Zeller, Eva Löbau, Hans-Jochen Wagner', null, 'An almost romantic comedy on the edge: Holocaust researcher Toto is having a major life crisis. Just when things at home and work could not get worse, he unwantedly gets a new assistent assigned to himself. Zazie is french, jewish, slightly germanophobe and supposed to help Toto to prepare a major congress. As the star of the congress suddenly wants to pull out, the problems are piling up and the two have to fix it.', 'An almost romantic comedy on the edge: Holocaust researcher Toto is having a major life crisis. Just when things at home and work could not get worse, he unwantedly gets a new assistent assigned to himself. Zazie is french, jewish, slightly germanophobe and supposed to help Toto to prepare a major congress. As the star of the congress suddenly wants to pull out, the problems are piling up and the two have to fix it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovELHPGci5SlyKg8gquAnRGR0w4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417617'),
  ('838641995281597511', 'The Blossoming of Maximo Oliveros', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kanakan-Balintagos', 'Michiko Yamamoto', 'Nathan Lopez, Soliman Cruz, Neil Ryan Sese, Ping Medina, JR Valentin, Bodjie Pascua, Elmo Redrico, Ivan Camacho', null, 'Maxi, a boy on the cusp of his teens, is already comfortable with his homosexual feelings, with acceptance from his family. When Maxi is assaulted one evening, Victor, a police officer, comes to his aid. Maxi soon develops a crush on Victor, who shows a platonic affection for the young lad.', 'Maxi, a boy on the cusp of his teens, is already comfortable with his homosexual feelings, with acceptance from his family. When Maxi is assaulted one evening, Victor, a police officer, comes to his aid. Maxi soon develops a crush on Victor, who shows a platonic affection for the young lad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxJBhrigfC2j30CiZuL49AOaQdM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46773'),
  ('582558249837093185', 'The Blot', 1921, 'Drama', 'Lois Weber, Philip R. Du Bois, Gordon Jennings', 'Marion Orth, Lois Weber', 'Philip Hubbard, Margaret McWade, Claire Windsor, Louis Calhern, Marie Walcamp, William H. O''Brien, Gertrude Short, Larry Steers', null, 'Professor Griggs, teaching at the college, doesn''t get paid a living wage; his next door neighbor, successful shoemaker Olsen, has money and plentiful food, while the Griggses have hardly any. When the professor''s rich student Phil West falls for beautiful Griggs daughter Amelia and also befriends the poor Reverend Gates (a young man who is also in love with Amelia), he observes the difference in his life and theirs and tries to help make a difference.', 'Professor Griggs, teaching at the college, doesn''t get paid a living wage; his next door neighbor, successful shoemaker Olsen, has money and plentiful food, while the Griggses have hardly any. When the professor''s rich student Phil West falls for beautiful Griggs daughter Amelia and also befriends the poor Reverend Gates (a young man who is also in love with Amelia), he observes the difference in his life and theirs and tries to help make a difference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Gc7H1jmZM69TbGA8DSZx3WkQA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155953'),
  ('956576047766738584', 'The Blow Out', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Joe Dougherty, Lucille La Verne', null, 'A crazed bomber is terrorizing the city. Meanwhile, a young Porky Pig is a few cents shy of buying an ice cream soda; he starts earning it by picking up items people drop and handing them back to them.', 'A crazed bomber is terrorizing the city. Meanwhile, a young Porky Pig is a few cents shy of buying an ice cream soda; he starts earning it by picking up items people drop and handing them back to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WzM4fe8cHPUwOmRrLfp2ZsfzE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201983'),
  ('439009062779192328', 'The Blue Angel', 1930, 'Drama', 'Josef von Sternberg, Hans Schneeberger, Günther Rittau', 'Carl Winston, Robert Liebmann, Karl Vollmöller', 'Emil Jannings, Marlene Dietrich, Kurt Gerron, Rosa Valetti, Hans Albers, Reinhold Bernt, Károly Huszár, Eduard von Winterstein', 'NR', 'Prim professor Immanuel Rath finds some of his students ogling racy photos of cabaret performer Lola Lola and visits a local club, The Blue Angel, in an attempt to catch them there. Seeing Lola perform, the teacher is filled with lust, eventually resigning his position at the school to marry the young woman. However, his marriage to a coquette -- whose job is to entice men -- proves to be more difficult than Rath imagined.', 'Prim professor Immanuel Rath finds some of his students ogling racy photos of cabaret performer Lola Lola and visits a local club, The Blue Angel, in an attempt to catch them there. Seeing Lola perform, the teacher is filled with lust, eventually resigning his position at the school to marry the young woman. However, his marriage to a coquette -- whose job is to entice men -- proves to be more difficult than Rath imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khz2rKLAPDVu9auJt1sR1HO9SCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228'),
