  ('247185031929147421', 'The Blue Elephant', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Kompin Kemgumnird, Tod Polson', 'Aummaraporn Phandintong, Charoonporn Parapakpralai', 'Triwarat Chutiwatkajornchai, Pongsuk Hiranprueck, Nanthana Bunlong, Juree Ohsiri, Aekachai Pongsamai, Rittideth Rittichu, Wiyada Jitmahima, Jaroenporn Onlamai', 'G', 'A young elephant goes on an extraordinary adventure and learns important lessons along the way about friendship, love and courage.', 'A young elephant goes on an extraordinary adventure and learns important lessons along the way about friendship, love and courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dN0CPv7SVySolf7QkkUwaq1H5uL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16285'),
  ('270571113504830325', 'The Blue Elephant', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Marwan Hamed, Ahmad Al Morsy, Tamer Ashry', 'Ahmed Mourad', 'Karim Abdel Aziz, Khaled El Sawy, Nelly Karim, Lebleba, Sherine Reda, Dareen Haddad, Mohamed Mamdouh, Mohamed Shaheen', null, 'After a five-year hiatus, psychiatrist Yehia returns to work at Abbasiya Hospital. He’s assigned to evaluate a patient who turns out to be his old friend. As events unfold, Yehia uncovers dark secrets that challenge his understanding of reality.', 'After a five-year hiatus, psychiatrist Yehia returns to work at Abbasiya Hospital. He’s assigned to evaluate a patient who turns out to be his old friend. As events unfold, Yehia uncovers dark secrets that challenge his understanding of reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPirLy8UKj2V6SyaWC8zXm5xeUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289510'),
  ('472287264370269968', 'The Blue Flower of Novalis', 2018, 'Documentary, Fantasy', 'Gustavo Vinagre, Rodrigo Carneiro, Beatriz Pomar', 'Marcelo Diorio, Gustavo Vinagre', 'Marcelo Diorio, Majeca Angelucci, Marcos Hermanson, Thaís de Almeida Prado, Estela Lapponi, Beatriz Pomar, Rafael Rudolf', null, 'Marcelo, a 40-year-old dandy, has a memory like no other. Monologuing between coffee and gay hookups, he holds court on a wide range of topics: his status, his Catholic grandmother, and his unusual sexual fantasies. At times, he takes himself for Genghis Khan or poet-philosopher Novalis.', 'Marcelo, a 40-year-old dandy, has a memory like no other. Monologuing between coffee and gay hookups, he holds court on a wide range of topics: his status, his Catholic grandmother, and his unusual sexual fantasies. At times, he takes himself for Genghis Khan or poet-philosopher Novalis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z31cD3W2vt3kE2hGpQq2IqdXviM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544486'),
  ('1104788036557453824', 'The Blue Gardenia', 1953, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Fritz Lang, Nicholas Musuraca, Emmett Emerson', 'Charles Hoffman', 'Anne Baxter, Richard Conte, Ann Sothern, Raymond Burr, Jeff Donnell, Richard Erdman, George Reeves, Ruth Storey', 'NR', 'Upon waking up to the news that the man she’d gone on a date with the previous night has been murdered, a young woman with only a faint memory of the night’s events begins to suspect that she murdered him while attempting to resist his advances.', 'Upon waking up to the news that the man she’d gone on a date with the previous night has been murdered, a young woman with only a faint memory of the night’s events begins to suspect that she murdered him while attempting to resist his advances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RwM1jUx5XV4Q9DxcOVubmk5laH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21594'),
