  ('679146164738208205', 'The Blue Knight', 1973, 'Action, TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Robert Butler, Ronald L. Schwary, Michael D. Margulies', null, 'William Holden, Lee Remick, Joe Santos, Sam Elliott, Eileen Brennan, Vic Tayback, Anne Archer, Lucille Benson', null, 'Bumper Morgan is a veteran Los Angeles Police Department street cop. He is due to retire after 20 years on the job, but is not letting up on the criminal element on his beat.', 'Bumper Morgan is a veteran Los Angeles Police Department street cop. He is due to retire after 20 years on the job, but is not letting up on the criminal element on his beat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NY1TQhwxRveGPhiST2mI0u2u14.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137738'),
  ('478081090233053089', 'The Blue Lagoon', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Launder, Parry Jones Jr.', 'John Baines, Frank Launder', 'Jean Simmons, Donald Houston, Noel Purcell, James Hayter, Cyril Cusack, Maurice Denham, Philip Stainton, Patrick Barr', 'NR', 'In the Victorian period, two British children survive a shipwreck in the South Pacific. After days afloat, they are marooned on a lush tropical island in the company of kindly old sailor. Together they survive solely on their resourcefulness and the bounty of their remote paradise.', 'In the Victorian period, two British children survive a shipwreck in the South Pacific. After days afloat, they are marooned on a lush tropical island in the company of kindly old sailor. Together they survive solely on their resourcefulness and the bounty of their remote paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgdWIKhE9T3Dqr0D78YJzx2L97k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228074'),
  ('1055203474283617935', 'The Blue Lagoon', 1980, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Randal Kleiser, Néstor Almendros, Mark Piper', 'Douglas Day Stewart', 'Brooke Shields, Christopher Atkins, Leo McKern, William Daniels, Jeffrey Kleiser, Gus Mercurio, Elva Josephson, Glenn Kohan', 'R', 'Two small children and a ship''s cook survive a shipwreck and find safety on an idyllic tropical island. Soon, however, the cook dies and the young boy and girl are left on their own. Days become years and Emmeline and Richard make a home for themselves surrounded by exotic creatures and nature''s beauty. But will they ever see civilization again?', 'Two small children and a ship''s cook survive a shipwreck and find safety on an idyllic tropical island. Soon, however, the cook dies and the young boy and girl are left on their own. Days become years and Emmeline and Richard make a home for themselves surrounded by exotic creatures and nature''s beauty. But will they ever see civilization again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6KsThCeoxxHDbVnlHLdTlf5wsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5689'),
  ('900641385239234556', 'The Blue Lamp', 1950, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Gordon Dines, Basil Dearden, Ernest Irving', 'Jan Read, Ted Willis', 'Jack Warner, Jimmy Hanley, Dirk Bogarde, Robert Flemyng, Bernard Lee, Peggy Evans, Patric Doonan, Bruce Seton', null, 'P.C. George Dixon is a long-serving traditional copper who is due to retire shortly. He takes a new recruit under his aegis and introduces him to the easy-going night beat. Dixon is a classic ordinary hero but also anachronistic, unprepared and unable to answer the violence of the 1950s.', 'P.C. George Dixon is a long-serving traditional copper who is due to retire shortly. He takes a new recruit under his aegis and introduces him to the easy-going night beat. Dixon is a classic ordinary hero but also anachronistic, unprepared and unable to answer the violence of the 1950s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8ekJGjiFaPNIvANSgN46oVmbmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54392'),
  ('380043268534534843', 'The Blue Light', 1932, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Leni Riefenstahl, Heinz von Jaworsky, Hans Schneeberger', 'Carl Mayer, Béla Balázs', 'Leni Riefenstahl, Mathias Wieman, Beni Führer, Max Holzboer, Martha Mair, Franz Maldacea', 'PG', 'As sole female Junta is the only one who can climb a dangerous mountain, villagers deem her as a witch.', 'As sole female Junta is the only one who can climb a dangerous mountain, villagers deem her as a witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3rEqnaZxL7gR44g5N9khdcgzCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72495'),
  ('347977679003324674', 'The Blue Light', 2003, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Yukio Ninagawa, Osamu Fujiishi', 'Yukio Ninagawa, Takuya Miyawaki', 'Kazunari Ninomiya, Aya Matsuura, Anne Suzuki, Kansai Yamamoto, Baijaku Nakamura, Naomasa Musaka, Naoto Takenaka, Kumiko Akiyoshi', null, 'Shuichi Kushimori is a 17 year old high school student who lives happily with his mother and stepsister. One day, without warning, his estranged stepfather returns home from a long absence. He quickly falls into a circle of drinking and starts abusing his ex-wife and daughter. When he begins making sexual advances towards Shuichi’s stepsister, Shuichi is compelled to take matters into his own hands.', 'Shuichi Kushimori is a 17 year old high school student who lives happily with his mother and stepsister. One day, without warning, his estranged stepfather returns home from a long absence. He quickly falls into a circle of drinking and starts abusing his ex-wife and daughter. When he begins making sexual advances towards Shuichi’s stepsister, Shuichi is compelled to take matters into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTyRbYNfN0qhmWO5KbeEFrPIwtr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55706'),
  ('1056509485901327299', 'The Blue Lotus', 1991, 'Animation, Adventure, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie, Action, Comedy, Family', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Robert Réa, Laurel L. Russwurm', 'Thierry Wermuth, Susan Roman, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin', null, 'Tintin is visited in India by a Chinese gentleman who brings him a message. Then, an unseen marksman throws a poisonous dart right into his neck. The only clue Tintin receives from the now mad messenger is that there are problems in Shanghai related to a man named Mitsuhirato.', 'Tintin is visited in India by a Chinese gentleman who brings him a message. Then, an unseen marksman throws a poisonous dart right into his neck. The only clue Tintin receives from the now mad messenger is that there are problems in Shanghai related to a man named Mitsuhirato.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKYTKlAPNa6oycaha8iQCp58a1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441120'),
  ('615713032679389201', 'The Blue Max', 1966, 'War, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'John Guillermin, Douglas Slocombe, Tony Curtis', 'David Pursall, Gerald Hanley, Jack Seddon', 'George Peppard, James Mason, Ursula Andress, Jeremy Kemp, Karl Michael Vogler, Anton Diffring, Harry Townes, Peter Woodthorpe', 'PG', 'A young pilot in the German air force of 1918, disliked as lower-class and unchivalrous, tries ambitiously to earn the medal offered for 20 kills.', 'A young pilot in the German air force of 1918, disliked as lower-class and unchivalrous, tries ambitiously to earn the medal offered for 20 kills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9FVlRLaB9uoZm6UoFe7Z4p84b4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19728'),
