  ('522245582490599262', 'The Blue Panther', 1965, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'René Demoulin, Claude Bakka, Lucio D''Attino', 'Claude Chabrol, Yves Christian Fournier, Claude Chabrol', 'Marie Laforêt, Francisco Rabal, Serge Reggiani, Charles Denner, Stéphane Audran, Akim Tamiroff, Roger Hanin, Antonio Passalia', null, 'Marie-Chantal travels by train to her cousin''s place to spend a winter holiday, when a stranger entrusts her with false jewels that contain a virus powerful enough to destroy all humankind.', 'Marie-Chantal travels by train to her cousin''s place to spend a winter holiday, when a stranger entrusts her with false jewels that contain a virus powerful enough to destroy all humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rq7f9JYNkavuFf8CQtVDFfr8aKf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55977'),
  ('1150733870840994238', 'The Blue Planet', 1982, 'Documentary', 'Franco Piavoli, Franco Piavoli, Neria Poli', 'Franco Piavoli, Neria Poli', null, null, 'A look at the passage of time through the changing seasons, human evolution and everyday life.', 'A look at the passage of time through the changing seasons, human evolution and everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvlbS3bPm4nEVsBUvIUAaGO32ar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96300'),
  ('104518623328864870', 'The Blue Room', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Walter Doehner', 'Vicente Leñero, Walter Doehner', 'Juan Manuel Bernal, Patricia Llaca, Elena Anaya, Mario Iván Martínez, Margarita Sanz, José María Yázpik, Carolina Politi, Emma Dib', null, 'A couple meet each other often in a motel room.', 'A couple meet each other often in a motel room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHagWA3tKiDzLBMdthUB2xQRLqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154200'),
  ('932616237276600979', 'The Blue Room', 2014, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Mathieu Amalric, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Stéphanie Cléau, Mathieu Amalric', 'Mathieu Amalric, Léa Drucker, Stéphanie Cléau, Laurent Poitrenaux, Serge Bozon, Blutch, Mona Jaffart, Véronique Alain', 'R', 'In their blue hotel room, a clandestine couple of two married lovers plan an impossible future, as death shutters their already frail tranquillity. Now, the noose tightens more and more around innocents and sinners; but, was there a crime?', 'In their blue hotel room, a clandestine couple of two married lovers plan an impossible future, as death shutters their already frail tranquillity. Now, the noose tightens more and more around innocents and sinners; but, was there a crime?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYHOfbx9Xuxbu6LJBJA9EPom70Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266034'),
  ('515574098376533427', 'The Blue Skies at Your Feet', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yuki Saito, Yasushi Hanamura', 'Keiko Kanome', 'Riko Fukumoto, Genta Matsuda, Mizuki Itagaki, Mayuu Yokota, Riko, Toshihiro Yashiba, Wakana Matsumoto, Kohei Yamashita', null, 'Miyu and Shuya are high school students. They have dated for 2 years. Miyu and Shuya have a promise that no matter what, they will watch a movie together on the first day of each new month. When Miyu and Shuya are on their way to the movie theater, Shuya suddenly cancels their date. Shuya seems like he is hiding something and he acts nervous. Later, Miyu goes to the place where she is supposed to meet Shuya, but she witnesses Shuya getting into a car accident. She panics, but when she wakes up she finds herself on the morning of the accident. Miyu keeps waking up on the day when Shuya got into an accident.', 'Miyu and Shuya are high school students. They have dated for 2 years. Miyu and Shuya have a promise that no matter what, they will watch a movie together on the first day of each new month. When Miyu and Shuya are on their way to the movie theater, Shuya suddenly cancels their date. Shuya seems like he is hiding something and he acts nervous. Later, Miyu goes to the place where she is supposed to meet Shuya, but she witnesses Shuya getting into a car accident. She panics, but when she wakes up she finds herself on the morning of the accident. Miyu keeps waking up on the day when Shuya got into an accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrbZtISTQGpKz9MxAXJiJlK3Prz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:896945'),
  ('138722316503720872', 'The Blue Sky Maiden', 1957, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Michio Takahashi', 'Yoshio Shirasaka', 'Ayako Wakao, Keizō Kawasaki, Kenji Sugawara, Ryūji Shinagawa, Yuko Yashio, Yoshiko Fujita, Hiroko Yajima, Noriko Hodaka', null, 'Yuko is sent to the coastal regions to be raised away from the rest of her sophisticated family where she finds out from her ill grandmother that she is not who she thought she was.', 'Yuko is sent to the coastal regions to be raised away from the rest of her sophisticated family where she finds out from her ill grandmother that she is not who she thought she was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Kl1RJh1pYz0psAPdCUtarkiHkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188981'),
  ('449032245790318060', 'The Blue Star', 2024, 'Music, Drama', 'Javier Macipe, Álvaro Medina', 'Javier Macipe', 'Pepe Lorente, Cuti Carabajal, Mariela Carabajal, Noelia Verenice López, Demi Carabajal, Marc Rodríguez, Bruna Cusí, Catalina Sopelana', null, 'The 90s. A famous Spanish rock star travels around Latin America in the endeavour to reconnect with his vocation. There he meets an old musician down on his luck, prompting the birth of an unlikely duo with every chance of becoming an epic commercial failure.', 'The 90s. A famous Spanish rock star travels around Latin America in the endeavour to reconnect with his vocation. There he meets an old musician down on his luck, prompting the birth of an unlikely duo with every chance of becoming an epic commercial failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiOJMisF5bXFuygrHayEYYrPZRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160878'),
  ('824657015498453790', 'The Blue Trail', 2025, 'Drama, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Gabriel Mascaro, Guillermo Garza, Marcela Prado Alvarenga', 'Murilo Hauser, Heitor Lorega', 'Denise Weinberg, Rodrigo Santoro, Miriam Socarrás, Adanilo, Rosa Malagueta, Clarissa Pinheiro, Dimas Mendonça, Daniel Ferrat', null, 'In the name of economic recovery, the Brazilian Government created a perennial system of compulsory vertical isolation for seniors over 80 to be confined in a colony. Teca is 77 and lives in the village of Muriti, in the Amazon, when she is surprised by the announcement of the age reduction, including her age group. Cornered, Teca makes an intriguing journey hidden from the officers amidst rivers, boats and the underworld to clandestinely try to fulfill her last dream, to take a plane ride.', 'In the name of economic recovery, the Brazilian Government created a perennial system of compulsory vertical isolation for seniors over 80 to be confined in a colony. Teca is 77 and lives in the village of Muriti, in the Amazon, when she is surprised by the announcement of the age reduction, including her age group. Cornered, Teca makes an intriguing journey hidden from the officers amidst rivers, boats and the underworld to clandestinely try to fulfill her last dream, to take a plane ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ua8XnJ450rhBTxkY2wpD2ITw7BJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172265'),
  ('268062886529677293', 'The Blue Umbrella', 2007, 'Drama, Family', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Sachin K. Krishn', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Abhishek Chaubey', 'Shreya Sharma, Pankaj Kapur, Deepak Dobriyal, Rahul Kumar, Paramjit Singh Kakran, Piu Dutt, Aasmaan Bhardwaj, Samrat Mukherji', null, 'Young Biniya lives a poor lifestyle in a small village in the mountainous and snowy region of Himachal Pradesh in India along with her widowed mom and wrestler brother. She entertains various tourists, and while doing so with some tourists from Japan, trades in her bear-tooth amulet with a blue umbrella...', 'Young Biniya lives a poor lifestyle in a small village in the mountainous and snowy region of Himachal Pradesh in India along with her widowed mom and wrestler brother. She entertains various tourists, and while doing so with some tourists from Japan, trades in her bear-tooth amulet with a blue umbrella...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyfyLg2pGzSsrim0pFijDL8bNl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46379'),
  ('193922688431105417', 'The Blue Umbrella', 2013, 'Animation, Romance', 'Saschka Unseld, Christopher M. Burrows', 'Saschka Unseld', 'Sarah Jaffe', 'G', 'It is just another evening commute until the rain starts to fall, and the city comes alive to the sound of dripping rain pipes, whistling awnings and gurgling gutters.', 'It is just another evening commute until the rain starts to fall, and the city comes alive to the sound of dripping rain pipes, whistling awnings and gurgling gutters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSWV7ra8HJ3gYnZFMMrPe8CBbrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200481'),
  ('1135818183555892322', 'The Blue Villa', 1995, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Dimitri de Clercq, Alain Robbe-Grillet', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet, Dimitri de Clercq', 'Fred Ward, Arielle Dombasle, Charles Tordjman, Sandrine Le Berre, Dimitris Poulikakos, Christian Maillet, Muriel Jacobs, Michalis Maniatis', null, 'The Blue Villa is a seedy bordello on a Mediterranean island where the villages are frightened by the ghost-like return of a young man, who mysteriously disappeared after the killing of a young Eurasian woman.', 'The Blue Villa is a seedy bordello on a Mediterranean island where the villages are frightened by the ghost-like return of a young man, who mysteriously disappeared after the killing of a young Eurasian woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUEuwgNGgXd9iWBAAqkYYwLfuFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124607'),
  ('79966316665150888', 'The Blue Years', 2017, 'Drama', 'Sofía Gómez Córdova, Odín Acosta, Ernesto Trujillo', 'Samuel Kishi', 'Paloma Domínguez, Luis Velázquez, Natalia Gómez Vázquez, Juan Carlos Huguenin, Ilse Orozco', null, 'An old cat and a deteriorating urban villa are witnesses to the drama of five youths living together, who are drastically transformed into a close-knit family by the arrival of a flamboyant housemate.', 'An old cat and a deteriorating urban villa are witnesses to the drama of five youths living together, who are drastically transformed into a close-knit family by the arrival of a flamboyant housemate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8ixMOIEmXqW0sI8Gcp9H9EO8Ft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423617'),
  ('798462072343026856', 'The Blue Yonder', 1985, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Mark Rosman, Hiro Narita', 'Mark Rosman', 'Peter Coyote, Huckleberry Fox, Art Carney, Dennis Lipscomb, Joe Flood, Mittie Smith, Frank Simons, Stu Klitsner', null, 'A young boy, who dreams of meeting the grandfather he never knew gets his chance, when an inventor friend constructs a time machine. After arriving in the past, it soon becomes apparent that his knowledge of the future could change the course of history.', 'A young boy, who dreams of meeting the grandfather he never knew gets his chance, when an inventor friend constructs a time machine. After arriving in the past, it soon becomes apparent that his knowledge of the future could change the course of history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goLmUrzB6LZflRgSt3zIBXs72Go.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56106'),
  ('718822713944448508', 'The Blues Accordin'' to Lightnin'' Hopkins', 1968, 'Documentary, Music', 'Les Blank, Skip Gerson, Les Blank', null, 'Lightnin'' Hopkins, Billy Bizor, Mance Lipscomb, Ruth Ames', null, 'Les Blank''s portrait of the great Texas bluesman, ''Lightnin'' Hopkins. The film includes interviews and a performance by Hopkins. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2002.', 'Les Blank''s portrait of the great Texas bluesman, ''Lightnin'' Hopkins. The film includes interviews and a performance by Hopkins. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2002.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSNQSkxWNS9Kur5U7VkxBOYHjpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185181'),
  ('736590501196412933', 'The Blues Brothers', 1980, 'Music, Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Stephen M. Katz, John Landis', 'Dan Aykroyd, John Landis', 'Dan Aykroyd, John Belushi, James Brown, Cab Calloway, Ray Charles, Aretha Franklin, Steve Cropper, Donald ''Duck'' Dunn', 'R', 'Jake Blues, just released from prison, puts his old band back together to save the Catholic home where he and his brother Elwood were raised.', 'Jake Blues, just released from prison, puts his old band back together to save the Catholic home where he and his brother Elwood were raised.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhYJKOt6UrQq7JQgLyQcSWW5R86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525'),
  ('303211067975841421', 'The Blues: Another Story of France', 2016, 'Documentary', 'David Dietz, Sonia Dauger', 'Sonia Dauger, Pascal Blanchard', 'Raymond Domenech, Lilian Thuram, Youri Djorkaeff, Robert Pirès, Olivier Giroud, François Hollande, Rama Yade, Omar Sy', null, 'This documentary charts 20 years of the French national soccer team, Les Bleus, whose ups and downs have mirrored those of French society.', 'This documentary charts 20 years of the French national soccer team, Les Bleus, whose ups and downs have mirrored those of French society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpO6bXX9MEMxgcRdm6nGLhzfacE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414711'),
  ('1045664975911005179', 'The Bluff', 2026, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Brian Nickless, Kate Rawlins, Rachel van Baarle', 'Frank E. Flowers, Joe Ballarini', 'Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Karl Urban, Safia Oakley-Green, Ismael Cruz Cordova, Temuera Morrison, Vedanten Naidoo, David Field, Greg Hatton', 'R', 'When her tranquil life on a remote island is shattered by the return of her vengeful former captain, a skilled ex-pirate must confront her bloody past and unleash her deadly talents to save her family from a ruthless siege.', 'When her tranquil life on a remote island is shattered by the return of her vengeful former captain, a skilled ex-pirate must confront her bloody past and unleash her deadly talents to save her family from a ruthless siege.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dl1cA7wdwePc9QU2Rc24EPqlcyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799882'),
  ('371562387416858193', 'The Boarder', 1954, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mario Craveri, Jean Blondel, Aldo Buzzi', 'Charles Spaak, Rodolfo Sonego, Alberto Lattuada', 'Martine Carol, Raf Vallone, Mario Carotenuto, Zina d''Harcourt, Carlo Romano, Clelia Matania, Carlo Bianco, Nico Pepe', null, 'A prostitute goes on vacation to a beach resort with her young daughter (who''s being schooled by nuns). Everything is cheerful and pleasant at the seashore; the customers at the hotel think she''s a poor widow - she always wears black - and treat her like a lady. But when one of her former clients arrives, her carefree days on the beach are numbered.', 'A prostitute goes on vacation to a beach resort with her young daughter (who''s being schooled by nuns). Everything is cheerful and pleasant at the seashore; the customers at the hotel think she''s a poor widow - she always wears black - and treat her like a lady. But when one of her former clients arrives, her carefree days on the beach are numbered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSnJAp4wxFI8xOHreyCIHv6RimQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276518'),
  ('844060899389844036', 'The Boat', 1921, 'Comedy', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline, Sybil Seely', null, 'A boat builder and his family attempt to set sail in his handmade boat, ''The Damfino''.', 'A boat builder and his family attempt to set sail in his handmade boat, ''The Damfino''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWkhrQ1MbSPEGWKa6Z18NyDhQ4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50704'),
  ('471987691570828557', 'The Boat', 2019, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Winston Azzopardi, Marek Traskowski, Colin Azzopardi', 'Joe Azzopardi, Winston Azzopardi', 'Joe Azzopardi', null, 'A lone fisherman on his daily run finds himself lost in a thick fog which proves impossible to navigate. The worst is yet to come when his encounter with a seemingly abandoned sailboat becomes a fight for survival against an enemy unknown.', 'A lone fisherman on his daily run finds himself lost in a thick fog which proves impossible to navigate. The worst is yet to come when his encounter with a seemingly abandoned sailboat becomes a fight for survival against an enemy unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccDmzCsv5JWSkl0qygYPIIMcc8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543915'),
  ('574396528060515693', 'The Boat', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Alessio Liguori, Mirco Sgarzi, Armando Pizzuti', 'Ciro Zecca, Gianluca Ansanelli, Nicola Salerno', 'Marco Bocci, Diane Fleri, Filippo Nigro, Marina Rocco, Caterina Shulha, Alessandro Tiberi, Eduardo Valdarnini, Leonardo Orsolini', null, 'The trip aboard a luxury yacht of three couples that will turn from an exciting experience to a terrible nightmare.', 'The trip aboard a luxury yacht of three couples that will turn from an exciting experience to a terrible nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYkjQ5mTWXyHt2JFsu7sX5AjeMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052939'),
  ('333604537960273100', 'The Boat Is Full', 1981, 'Drama, History, War', 'Markus Imhoof, Hans Liechti', 'Markus Imhoof', 'Tina Engel, Hans Diehl, Mathias Gnädinger, Curt Bois, Martin Walz, Ilse Bahrs, Gerd David, Simone', null, 'During World War II, Switzerland severely limited refugees: "Our boat is full." A train from Germany halts briefly in an isolated corner of Switzerland. Six people jump off seeking asylum: four Jews, a French child, and a German soldier. They seek temporary refuge with a couple who run a village inn. They pose as a family: the deserter as husband, Judith as his wife, an old man from Vienna as her father, his granddaughter and the French lad, whom they beg to keep silent, as their children. Judith''s teenage brother poses as a soldier. The fabrication unravels through chance and the local constable''s exact investigation. Whom will the Swiss allow to stay? Who gets deported?', 'During World War II, Switzerland severely limited refugees: "Our boat is full." A train from Germany halts briefly in an isolated corner of Switzerland. Six people jump off seeking asylum: four Jews, a French child, and a German soldier. They seek temporary refuge with a couple who run a village inn. They pose as a family: the deserter as husband, Judith as his wife, an old man from Vienna as her father, his granddaughter and the French lad, whom they beg to keep silent, as their children. Judith''s teenage brother poses as a soldier. The fabrication unravels through chance and the local constable''s exact investigation. Whom will the Swiss allow to stay? Who gets deported?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohOOHH4O3Uu5qj7QVuOQAmWYkCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42140'),
  ('360729122989318579', 'The Boat That Rocked', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Richard Curtis, Danny Cohen, Jeremy Braben', 'Richard Curtis', 'Tom Sturridge, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Rhys Ifans, Bill Nighy, Emma Thompson, Nick Frost, Kenneth Branagh, January Jones', 'R', 'When a group of rebellious deejays decides to defy the ban on government-censored music, they take to the seas to broadcast music and mayhem to millions of adoring fans.', 'When a group of rebellious deejays decides to defy the ban on government-censored music, they take to the seas to broadcast music and mayhem to millions of adoring fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7CBRLAXUnHi0kp2krhLtlJvtWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18947'),
  ('747977844318597876', 'The Boatniks', 1970, 'Comedy, Family', 'Norman Tokar, William E. Snyder', 'Arthur Julian', 'Robert Morse, Stefanie Powers, Phil Silvers, Norman Fell, Mickey Shaughnessy, Wally Cox, Don Ameche, Joey Forman', null, 'Young and awkward, The Coast-Guard''s ensign Thomas Garland suffers from the comparison with his late father, a war hero. Which does not prevent him from falling for pretty Kate Fairchild, a young woman who runs a sailing school. Of course the way he expresses his deep sympathy for the lady leaves to be desired. And the situation does not improve when a trio of bumbling jewel thieves interferes.', 'Young and awkward, The Coast-Guard''s ensign Thomas Garland suffers from the comparison with his late father, a war hero. Which does not prevent him from falling for pretty Kate Fairchild, a young woman who runs a sailing school. Of course the way he expresses his deep sympathy for the lady leaves to be desired. And the situation does not improve when a trio of bumbling jewel thieves interferes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcLnRdk7BtdTSKGJPjzIYQRANs8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42596'),
  ('968729343957441524', 'The Bob''s Burgers Movie', 2022, 'Animation, Music, Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Bernard Derriman, Darrin Drew, Loren Bouchard', 'Nora Smith, Loren Bouchard', 'H. Jon Benjamin, Kristen Schaal, John Roberts, Dan Mintz, Eugene Mirman, Larry Murphy, Kevin Kline, Zach Galifianakis', 'PG-13', 'When a ruptured water main creates an enormous sinkhole right in front of Bob''s Burgers, it blocks the entrance indefinitely and ruins the Belchers’ plans for a successful summer. While Bob and Linda struggle to keep the business afloat, the kids try to solve a mystery that could save their family''s restaurant. As the dangers mount, these underdogs help each other find hope and fight to get back behind the counter, where they belong.', 'When a ruptured water main creates an enormous sinkhole right in front of Bob''s Burgers, it blocks the entrance indefinitely and ruins the Belchers’ plans for a successful summer. While Bob and Linda struggle to keep the business afloat, the kids try to solve a mystery that could save their family''s restaurant. As the dangers mount, these underdogs help each other find hope and fight to get back behind the counter, where they belong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvV2nHEDQMWuRqAUrpcx2fB97CB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504827'),
  ('408258160225205711', 'The Bod Squad', 1974, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ernst Hofbauer, Kuei Chih-Hung, Yau Kei', 'Cheng Yi-Hsun', 'Elliot Ngok Wah, Lau Wai-Ling, Wang Hsieh, Helen Ko Ti-Hua, Li Min-Lang, Chiang Yang, Sonja Jeannine, Diana Drube', 'R', 'Five Western girls are kidnapped by Chinese pirates and sold to a brothel. While they are being trained to become prostitutes, a couple of local citizens take mercy on them and plots their escape by teaching them kung-fu. The five scantily-clad girls, using their newfound martial arts skills then fight their way to freedom.', 'Five Western girls are kidnapped by Chinese pirates and sold to a brothel. While they are being trained to become prostitutes, a couple of local citizens take mercy on them and plots their escape by teaching them kung-fu. The five scantily-clad girls, using their newfound martial arts skills then fight their way to freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Fpj2anoQuFhOMzimVSEWTASItY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107010'),
  ('1082364475061350167', 'The Bodin’s in Thailand', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Forestier', 'Jean-Christian Fraiscinet, Vincent Dubois, Frédéric Forestier', 'Vincent Dubois, Jean-Christian Fraiscinet, Thanutphon Boonsang, Nicolas Marié, Fanny Dubois, Alexandre Rokhamm, Lucas Fraiscinet, Camille Dubois', null, 'Christian Bodin and his mother Maria Bodin are set on an adventure for the Land of Smiles. They meet many zany characters and face several obstacles along their journey in Thailand.', 'Christian Bodin and his mother Maria Bodin are set on an adventure for the Land of Smiles. They meet many zany characters and face several obstacles along their journey in Thailand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rpDCiHqnDmFy74gSVGG4lLZSic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874294'),
  ('55618324652995332', 'The Bodin’s Investigate in Corsica', 2024, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Gueniche, Thierry Binisti, Pierre Witzand', 'Jean-Christian Fraiscinet, Vincent Dubois', 'Vincent Dubois, Jean-Christian Fraiscinet, Jean-François Perrone, Michel Ferracci, Nathanaël Maïni, Ambre Pietri, Didier Ferrari, Anto Mela', null, 'From Pouziou les Trois Galoches to the Isle of Beauty, it’s just a step… Invested with a supernatural power transmitted by the ghost of his father, Christian foresees a future murder in a premonitory dream. A certain Pasqualini, a clementine producer in the Aléria region, will be assassinated in seven days. But how to apprehend the murderer of a dead man who is not dead? Thanks to the legendary common sense and tyrannical nature of Maria, ready to annoy all the Corsicans to save one, and the rare flashes of genius from her big oaf of a son Christian. It’s just as well if, in the process, they have to immerse themselves in local customs, disguise themselves as bandits, try Corsican polyphonies, or force Christian to eat brocciu.', 'From Pouziou les Trois Galoches to the Isle of Beauty, it’s just a step… Invested with a supernatural power transmitted by the ghost of his father, Christian foresees a future murder in a premonitory dream. A certain Pasqualini, a clementine producer in the Aléria region, will be assassinated in seven days. But how to apprehend the murderer of a dead man who is not dead? Thanks to the legendary common sense and tyrannical nature of Maria, ready to annoy all the Corsicans to save one, and the rare flashes of genius from her big oaf of a son Christian. It’s just as well if, in the process, they have to immerse themselves in local customs, disguise themselves as bandits, try Corsican polyphonies, or force Christian to eat brocciu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hz8T6MurtvGYC1uzkw3Ufozb7Ya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146263'),
  ('762961845035925341', 'The Body', 1974, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Luigi Scattini', 'Luigi Scattini, Fabio Pittorru, Massimo Felisatti', 'Enrico Maria Salerno, Zeudi Araya, Leonard Mann, Carroll Baker, Luigi Antonio Guerra', null, 'A beautiful woman who lives on an island with her abusive husband, entices a young man into a murder-for-money plot.', 'A beautiful woman who lives on an island with her abusive husband, entices a young man into a murder-for-money plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHKumgZiJVLTfH9FwIzEE4wiTdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155128'),
  ('866677723427746661', 'The Body', 2001, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Jonas McCord, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Jonas McCord', 'Antonio Banderas, Olivia Williams, Jason Flemyng, John Shrapnel, Derek Jacobi, Lillian Lux, John Wood, Makram J. Khoury', 'PG-13', 'An ancient skeleton has been discovered in Jerusalem in a rich man''s tomb. Colouration of the wrist and leg bones indicates the cause of death was crucifiction. other signs, include a gold coin bearing the marks of Pontius Pilate and faint markings around the skull, lead authorities to suspect that these could be the bones of Jesus Christ. Politicians, clerics, religious extremists and those using terror as a means to an end, find their beliefs and identities tested while risking their lives to unearth the truth.....', 'An ancient skeleton has been discovered in Jerusalem in a rich man''s tomb. Colouration of the wrist and leg bones indicates the cause of death was crucifiction. other signs, include a gold coin bearing the marks of Pontius Pilate and faint markings around the skull, lead authorities to suspect that these could be the bones of Jesus Christ. Politicians, clerics, religious extremists and those using terror as a means to an end, find their beliefs and identities tested while risking their lives to unearth the truth.....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCTA1B2oFev0bcXVZZuh93qDjix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28308'),
  ('784463540637670845', 'The Body', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Tomasz Konecki, Andrzej Saramonowicz, Tomasz Madejski', 'Andrzej Saramonowicz', 'Rafał Królikowski, Tomasz Karolak, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Robert Więckiewicz, Cezary Kosiński, Bronisław Wrocławski, Edyta Olszówka, Maja Hirsch', null, 'One day a commuter, who happens to be a burglar, finds a dead body on a train. As he was just returning from a burglary and not wanting to draw attention to himself, he decides to get rid of the corpse himself. Little does he know that the body is about to embark on one hell of a journey...', 'One day a commuter, who happens to be a burglar, finds a dead body on a train. As he was just returning from a burglary and not wanting to draw attention to himself, he decides to get rid of the corpse himself. Little does he know that the body is about to embark on one hell of a journey...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w749zu7OGl95FZJ5GSp7Lihj8so.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39331'),
  ('1134125347390637950', 'The Body', 2012, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Oriol Paulo, Óscar Faura, Víctor Cuadrado', 'Oriol Paulo, Lara Sendim', 'Jose Coronado, Hugo Silva, Belén Rueda, Aura Garrido, Cristina Plazas, Montse Guallar, Nausicaa Bonnín, Miquel Gelabert', null, 'A woman’s body disappears mysteriously from the morgue without a trace. Police inspector Jaime Peña investigates the strange occurrence with the help of Álex Ulloa, the widower of the missing woman.', 'A woman’s body disappears mysteriously from the morgue without a trace. Police inspector Jaime Peña investigates the strange occurrence with the help of Álex Ulloa, the widower of the missing woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/du9zczcShf4WIuljDR0Aib7AYtX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111083'),
  ('1115148029378457935', 'The Body', 2018, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Paul Davis, Scott Winig', 'Paul Davis, Paul Fisher', 'Tom Bateman, Rebecca Rittenhouse, Aurora Perrineau, David Hull, Ray Santiago, Harvey Guillén, Max Adler, Alex Winter', 'NR', 'In Los Angeles, on Halloween night, a hitman tries to transport a corpse in plain sight, but people he stumbles upon on the street, believing that his sophisticated appearance is a magnificent disguise, constantly stand in his way to congratulate him.', 'In Los Angeles, on Halloween night, a hitman tries to transport a corpse in plain sight, but people he stumbles upon on the street, believing that his sophisticated appearance is a magnificent disguise, constantly stand in his way to congratulate him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZJkoWMPGpFqdVplXivjQOYEp4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550148'),
  ('641544353169006801', 'The Body', 2019, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Sachin Pathak, Nikita Katakwar, Jeethu Joseph', 'Lara Sendim, Oriol Paulo', 'Emraan Hashmi, Sobhita Dhulipala, Rishi Kapoor, Rukhsar Rehman, Vedhika, Anupam Bhattacharya, Natašha Stanković, Scarlett Mellish Wilson', null, 'When the body of a powerful businesswoman goes missing from the morgue, the inspector-in-charge hunts for the truth. When he questions her husband he realizes that there is much more to the case than meets the eye.', 'When the body of a powerful businesswoman goes missing from the morgue, the inspector-in-charge hunts for the truth. When he questions her husband he realizes that there is much more to the case than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceEmtlyvbJh1khLpSkPUKAmpPA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648316'),
  ('442527742130546880', 'The Body', 2024, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Andrea Reitano, Vincenzo Alfieri, Anthony Steven Visciglia', 'Oriol Paulo, Lara Sendim', 'Giuseppe Battiston, Claudia Gerini, Andrea Di Luigi, Amanda Campana, Andrea Sartoretti, Rebecca Sisti, Maria Catia Lamperini, Anastassia Bianchi', null, 'Rich entrepreneur Rebecca Zuin has died from an alleged heart attack, raising suspicions on the part of a police inspector after her body disappears from the morgue. When her handsome young husband becomes a suspect, he starts thinking she may have faked her death to sadistically torment him.', 'Rich entrepreneur Rebecca Zuin has died from an alleged heart attack, raising suspicions on the part of a police inspector after her body disappears from the morgue. When her handsome young husband becomes a suspect, he starts thinking she may have faked her death to sadistically torment him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdimvmZwDiItYRzMerSiSakX0q4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1198877'),
  ('1042449191908121188', 'The Body Beautiful', 1991, 'Drama', 'Ngozi Onwurah, Peter Collis, Kanayo Onwurah', 'Ngozi Onwurah', 'Madge Onwurah, Rosie Rowell, Sian Ejiwunmi-Le Berre, Brian Bovell, Maureen Douglass, Valentine Nonyela, Louis Altinson, Linda Dobson', null, 'This bold, stunning exploration of a white mother who undergoes a radical mastectomy and her Black daughter who embarks on a modeling career reveals the profound effects of body image and the strain of racial and sexual identity on their charged, intensely loving bond. At the heart of Onwurah’s brave excursion into her mother’s scorned sexuality is a provocative interweaving of memory and fantasy. The filmmaker plumbs the depths of maternal strength and daughterly devotion in an unforgettable tribute starring her real-life mother, Madge Onwurah.', 'This bold, stunning exploration of a white mother who undergoes a radical mastectomy and her Black daughter who embarks on a modeling career reveals the profound effects of body image and the strain of racial and sexual identity on their charged, intensely loving bond. At the heart of Onwurah’s brave excursion into her mother’s scorned sexuality is a provocative interweaving of memory and fantasy. The filmmaker plumbs the depths of maternal strength and daughterly devotion in an unforgettable tribute starring her real-life mother, Madge Onwurah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsgqU0vJsvMQNWZaoyyUjYfVEEw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163349'),
  ('183324899405965804', 'The Body Beautiful', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Rolfe Kanefsky, Nils Erickson, Todd Barron', 'Rolfe Kanefsky', 'Gabriella Hall, David Chielens, Robert Donavan, Jacqueline Lovell, Nina Leichtling, Rick Jordan, Taylor St. Claire, Jennifer Burton', 'NR', 'The "Clicker," based upon the comic book of Milo Manara, falls (literally) into the hands of Linda and Ben who use it to save the Spa at which they work.', 'The "Clicker," based upon the comic book of Milo Manara, falls (literally) into the hands of Linda and Ben who use it to save the Spa at which they work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXFhz7DGvaI3O0ORPE76swxZGWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143873'),
  ('486429241938821815', 'The Body Beneath', 1970, 'Horror', 'Jim Vale, Andy Milligan, Andy Milligan', 'Andy Milligan', 'Gavin Reed, Jackie Skarvellis, Berwick Kaler, Susan Heard, Richmond Ross, Emma Jones, Colin Gordon, Judith Heard', 'R', 'A family of vampires takes over an estate known as Carfax Abbey. Since inbreeding is destroying the family line, they need new blood to keep the family going, so they set out to find new sources.', 'A family of vampires takes over an estate known as Carfax Abbey. Since inbreeding is destroying the family line, they need new blood to keep the family going, so they set out to find new sources.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFRec5bSr72WPbMMcQ0xjgplo4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85557'),
  ('642876611004782607', 'The Body of My Enemy', 1976, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Henri Verneuil, Jean Penzer, Claude Clément', 'Michel Audiard, Henri Verneuil', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Bernard Blier, Marie-France Pisier, René Lefèvre, François Perrot, Daniel Ivernel, Claude Brosset, Yvonne Gaudeau', null, 'A man accused of murder discovers a trail of corruption leading to the powerful family of his former love. Going underground, he seeks allies in a town where trust is scarce.', 'A man accused of murder discovers a trail of corruption leading to the powerful family of his former love. Going underground, he seeks allies in a town where trust is scarce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igEtq4fniKy6mExSTRlvSJdEaKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51213'),
  ('996456032355968986', 'The Body Snatcher', 1945, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Robert De Grasse, Robert Wise, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Val Lewton, Philip MacDonald', 'Boris Karloff, Bela Lugosi, Henry Daniell, Edith Atwater, Russell Wade, Rita Corday, Sharyn Moffett, Donna Lee', 'NR', 'Edinburgh, 1831. Among those who undertake the illegal trade of grave robbery is Gray, ostensibly a cab driver. Formerly a medical student convicted of grave robbery, Gray holds a grudge against Dr. MacFarlane who had escaped detection and punishment.', 'Edinburgh, 1831. Among those who undertake the illegal trade of grave robbery is Gray, ostensibly a cab driver. Formerly a medical student convicted of grave robbery, Gray holds a grudge against Dr. MacFarlane who had escaped detection and punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dOCP2ahMVlA95SivxhEdVvcXZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30346'),
  ('142167522589283150', 'The Body Snatcher', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Fernando Méndez, Américo Fernández, Víctor Herrera', 'Fernando Méndez, Alejandro Verbitzky', 'Wolf Ruvinskis, Carlos Riquelme, Crox Alvarado, Columba Domínguez, Eduardo Alcaraz, Yerye Beirute, Ignacio Navarro, Arturo Martínez', null, 'A detective and his cowboy friend team up to stop a mad scientist who is stealing the bodies of murdered wrestlers, and bringing them back to life while electronically replacing their minds with those of animals to make them stronger and live longer. Posing as a successful masked wrestler, the cowboy quickly attracts the attention of the scientist and his henchmen as their next experimental subject...', 'A detective and his cowboy friend team up to stop a mad scientist who is stealing the bodies of murdered wrestlers, and bringing them back to life while electronically replacing their minds with those of animals to make them stronger and live longer. Posing as a successful masked wrestler, the cowboy quickly attracts the attention of the scientist and his henchmen as their next experimental subject...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlAxRZceGsRiYDZuggt3qOXzuMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194166'),
  ('515962115791336910', 'The Body Stealers', 1969, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Horror', 'John Coquillon, John Workman, Gerry Levy', 'Michael St. Clair', 'George Sanders, Maurice Evans, Patrick Allen, Neil Connery, Robert Flemyng, Pamela Conway, Allan Cuthbertson, Michael Culver', 'NR', 'In Britain, bodies of NATO paratroopers are being snatched during routine jumps by a mysterious red-beam of otherworldly origin.', 'In Britain, bodies of NATO paratroopers are being snatched during routine jumps by a mysterious red-beam of otherworldly origin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpRVxK9GLtUqmO6XiReauVYcCb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142305'),
  ('69107840138380424', 'The Bodyguard', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Spike the bulldog, grateful to Jerry for getting him out of the dogcatcher''s van, offers to help the little mouse any time he whistles. Tom, Jerry''s feline tormentor, seeks to overcome this new disadvantage.', 'Spike the bulldog, grateful to Jerry for getting him out of the dogcatcher''s van, offers to help the little mouse any time he whistles. Tom, Jerry''s feline tormentor, seeks to overcome this new disadvantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Q1CqIY3jtvZcvuPwbfb9In9Knx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39888'),
  ('283836723796385765', 'The Bodyguard', 1973, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ryuichi Takamori', 'Ryuzo Nakanishi', 'Sonny Chiba, Mari Atsumi, Rinichi Yamamoto, Eiji Gō, Ryōhei Uchida, Masutatsu Oyama, Hideo Murota, Yayoi Watanabe', 'R', 'Karate master and anti-drug vigilante Chiba returns to his home in Japan, where he holds a press conference announcing his intention to wipe out the nation''s drug industry. He also offers his services as a bodyguard to anyone who is willing to come forward and provide information about the drug lords'' activities. He is soon approached by a mysterious woman claiming to have important information and asking for Chiba''s protection. She seems to be legitimate, but is she really what she appears to be?', 'Karate master and anti-drug vigilante Chiba returns to his home in Japan, where he holds a press conference announcing his intention to wipe out the nation''s drug industry. He also offers his services as a bodyguard to anyone who is willing to come forward and provide information about the drug lords'' activities. He is soon approached by a mysterious woman claiming to have important information and asking for Chiba''s protection. She seems to be legitimate, but is she really what she appears to be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eprqxNgZY19WKRWvnsHhkuEZAj0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54860'),
  ('825542963664731423', 'The Bodyguard', 1984, 'Comedy', 'François Leterrier, Eduardo Serra', 'Didier Kaminka, François Leterrier, Gérard Jugnot', 'Gérard Jugnot, Elisa Servier, Jane Birkin, Sami Frey, Didier Kaminka, Nicole Jamet, Evelyne Didi, Daniel Langlet', null, 'Barbara marries Julien a charming and sexy man. Barbara''s old flame Paul is highly suspicious of Julien. It seems Julien''s previous two wives died under dubious circumstances and he collected a wad of insurance money as a result. Paul cannot ignore his misgivings, and so he follows Barbara and Julien to Morocco on their honeymoon, intent on preventing any harm to the woman he still loves.', 'Barbara marries Julien a charming and sexy man. Barbara''s old flame Paul is highly suspicious of Julien. It seems Julien''s previous two wives died under dubious circumstances and he collected a wad of insurance money as a result. Paul cannot ignore his misgivings, and so he follows Barbara and Julien to Morocco on their honeymoon, intent on preventing any harm to the woman he still loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yigILNta3rwYvsnXkn0sDzkTdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50215'),
  ('279964799892136308', 'The Bodyguard', 1992, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Andrew Dunn, Mick Jackson, Albert M. Shapiro', 'Lawrence Kasdan', 'Kevin Costner, Whitney Houston, Gary Kemp, Bill Cobbs, Ralph Waite, Tomas Arana, Michele Lamar Richards, Mike Starr', 'R', 'A former Secret Service agent grudgingly takes an assignment to protect a pop idol who''s threatened by a crazed fan. At first, the safety-obsessed bodyguard and the self-indulgent diva totally clash. But before long, all that tension sparks fireworks of another sort, and the love-averse tough guy is torn between duty and romance.', 'A former Secret Service agent grudgingly takes an assignment to protect a pop idol who''s threatened by a crazed fan. At first, the safety-obsessed bodyguard and the self-indulgent diva totally clash. But before long, all that tension sparks fireworks of another sort, and the love-averse tough guy is torn between duty and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihWF0uY1xnKqw9YK7ZHNLUZOhcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619'),
  ('736104922825983457', 'The Bodyguard', 2004, 'Action, Comedy', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Nattawut Kittikhun, Kanchanaphan Meesuwan', 'Thanapat Taweesuk, Petchtai Wongkamlao', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Patrarin Punyanutatam, Piphat Apiraktanakorn, Surachai Juntimatorn, Aranya Namwong, Suthep Prayoonpitak, Wachara Pan-iam, Yingyong Yodbuangam', null, 'Wong, bodyguard to a tycoon, is fired by his boss''s son after he fails to save his boss. Now, the assassins are after the son, who takes refuge in a slum. Wong, meanwhile, tackles the villain''s goons.', 'Wong, bodyguard to a tycoon, is fired by his boss''s son after he fails to save his boss. Now, the assassins are after the son, who takes refuge in a slum. Wong, meanwhile, tackles the villain''s goons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4Rjt0slnaWmptbHKrUoKWIxmmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20256'),
  ('832771481299924874', 'The Bodyguard', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Andy Lam Kwok-Wah, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'Jiang Jun', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Andy Lau, Zhu Yuchen, Li Qinqin, Feng Jiayi, Jacqueline Chan, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, William Feng', null, 'A retired bodyguard who has settled into a corner of the world where China, Russia and North Korea meet as he suffers from early dementia finds a new friend in a young girl. When her life is threatened by her father''s connection with a local crime lord, the bodyguard must call upon his long forgotten skills to save her.', 'A retired bodyguard who has settled into a corner of the world where China, Russia and North Korea meet as he suffers from early dementia finds a new friend in a young girl. When her life is threatened by her father''s connection with a local crime lord, the bodyguard must call upon his long forgotten skills to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kF4myFLIDxqsuce5swGLWP6XKze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315669'),
  ('981973635099765900', 'The Bodyguard', 2025, 'Action, Crime', 'Qin Pengfei', 'Kong Lizhi', 'Qu Jingjing, Yuan Fufu, Yang Xing, Chunyu Shanshan, Ashton Chen, Tan Kai, Liu Fengchao, Yang Si', null, 'Retired special forces officer Zhong Xiaonan is assigned to protect Lin Zihao, the son of a renowned Chinese-American scientist, as he returns to China. With their groundbreaking research targeted by a powerful international syndicate, Lin Zihao becomes the focus of a dangerous kidnapping plot. Teaming up with Chinese-American cop Peter, Zhong Xiaonan faces a series of fierce confrontations with the criminal group, working to prevent their scheme and ensure Lin Zihao’s safe return home.', 'Retired special forces officer Zhong Xiaonan is assigned to protect Lin Zihao, the son of a renowned Chinese-American scientist, as he returns to China. With their groundbreaking research targeted by a powerful international syndicate, Lin Zihao becomes the focus of a dangerous kidnapping plot. Teaming up with Chinese-American cop Peter, Zhong Xiaonan faces a series of fierce confrontations with the criminal group, working to prevent their scheme and ensure Lin Zihao’s safe return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbMFxU9EeAmOFAByonIGFYD9szx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1370939'),
  ('666908915128720828', 'The Bodyguard 2', 2007, 'Action, Comedy', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Pipat Jomkoh, Jiradech Samniangsanor', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Pakphum Wongjinda', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Janet Khiew, Jacqueline Apitananon, Surachai Sombatchareon, Sushin Kuan-saghaun, Pitoon Kuntong, Sirmwate Chuangyanyong, Manaswin Nuntasane', null, 'The best agent of Vieng, the country near the boundary of Thailand received the important mission that he had to catch two armed dealers who could be the dangerous for his country.', 'The best agent of Vieng, the country near the boundary of Thailand received the important mission that he had to catch two armed dealers who could be the dangerous for his country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5Ldoa9WhvN6Uz4RHYk7hBUPAB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20264'),
  ('998697617434286035', 'The Bodyguard from Beijing', 1994, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Tom Lau Moon-Tong, Corey Yuen', 'Gordon Chan, John Chan Kin-Chung', 'Jet Li, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Collin Chou, Joey Leung Wing-Chung, Ng Wai-Kwok, William Chu Wai-Lim, Wong Kam-Kong', 'R', 'A corrupt businessman commits a murder and the only witness is the girlfriend of another businessman with close connections to the Chinese government, so a bodyguard from Beijing is dispatched to help two Hong Kong cops protect the witness.', 'A corrupt businessman commits a murder and the only witness is the girlfriend of another businessman with close connections to the Chinese government, so a bodyguard from Beijing is dispatched to help two Hong Kong cops protect the witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xd4X6YIssIJWYXnPiZHTgy0EzWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18674'),
  ('139000248310980533', 'The Bohemian', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Petr Václav, Diego Romero', 'Petr Václav', 'Vojtěch Dyk, Barbara Ronchi, Elena Radonicich, Lana Vlady, Dario Lubatti, Antonio De Matteo, Diego Pagotto, Alberto Cracco', null, 'The year is 1764. For over a year, Josef has been leading a precarious life in Venice. He hopes to become an opera composer. The city, full of talented and already-established composers, seems closed to him. Looking for work as a violinist, he comes into the orbit of a rich young woman. Thanks to her, he gets the opportunity to play at salons. But his real opportunity arises when he becomes the lover of a libertine marquise. She teaches him worldly manners, rids him of signs of a provincial upbringing and introduces him to a hedonistic existence free from religious intolerance. Thus transformed, Josef gets an incan incredible commission: to write an opera for the San Carlo, Europe''s largest theatre.', 'The year is 1764. For over a year, Josef has been leading a precarious life in Venice. He hopes to become an opera composer. The city, full of talented and already-established composers, seems closed to him. Looking for work as a violinist, he comes into the orbit of a rich young woman. Thanks to her, he gets the opportunity to play at salons. But his real opportunity arises when he becomes the lover of a libertine marquise. She teaches him worldly manners, rids him of signs of a provincial upbringing and introduces him to a hedonistic existence free from religious intolerance. Thus transformed, Josef gets an incan incredible commission: to write an opera for the San Carlo, Europe''s largest theatre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWsbVXIgQCA4oLIyxbJ2iIaihyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669653'),
  ('984694956004653930', 'The Bohemian Girl', 1936, 'Comedy, Music', 'James W. Horne, Charley Rogers, Chet Brandenburg', 'Frank Butler', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Thelma Todd, Antonio Moreno, Darla Hood, Julie Bishop, James Finlayson, Eddie Borden', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie travel with a band of 18th-century Gypsies holding a nobleman''s daughter.', 'Stan and Ollie travel with a band of 18th-century Gypsies holding a nobleman''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32ChJDhgwlETT1od2nr4dKdRT3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82036'),
  ('163990564999259648', 'The Bold Caballero', 1936, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Western', 'Wells Root', 'Wells Root', 'Robert Livingston, Heather Angel, Sig Ruman, Ian Wolfe, Robert Warwick, Emily Fitzroy, Charles Stevens, Walter Long', 'PG-13', 'The Commandant is making life rough for the colonials in Spanish California. While trying to help, Zorro is charged with the murder of the new Governor, but in the end he triumphs over the evil Commandant.', 'The Commandant is making life rough for the colonials in Spanish California. While trying to help, Zorro is charged with the murder of the new Governor, but in the end he triumphs over the evil Commandant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHiY7rVGoKpf3eN0XVQ3zGIrPGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215486'),
  ('1011997959093189304', 'The Bold, the Corrupt and the Beautiful', 2017, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Yang Ya-che, Chen Ko-chin, Jill Hu', 'Yang Ya-che', 'Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Wu Ke-xi, Wen Qi, Sha-Li Chen, Ko Chia-Yen, Maya Showlen, Moon Wang, Carolyn Chen', null, 'Madame Tang colludes and mediates between the government and the private businesses for the benefits of her all-female family. One case does not go according to plan, and an entire family close to Madame Tang fall victim to a gruesome murder. Ambition, desire and lust eventually change Tang''s relationships with her own family forever.', 'Madame Tang colludes and mediates between the government and the private businesses for the benefits of her all-female family. One case does not go according to plan, and an entire family close to Madame Tang fall victim to a gruesome murder. Ambition, desire and lust eventually change Tang''s relationships with her own family forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlhZfsmfNWKjp9yOsHV0TPUhDWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478804'),
  ('800556688106243383', 'The Bolero', 1973, 'Documentary, Music', 'Allan Miller, William Fertik', null, 'Zubin Mehta', null, 'The first part of this Academy Award-winning short consists of a behind-the-scenes look at the Los Angeles Philharmonic Orchestra as it prepares to perform Ravel''s "Bolero." Individual musicians offer their thoughts as workers set up chairs and music stands; there are also comments by conductor Zubin Mehta and scenes of Mehta and the orchestra rehearsing. The rest of the film features a complete performance of "Bolero" with striking images of the orchestra as the music relentlessly approaches its climax.', 'The first part of this Academy Award-winning short consists of a behind-the-scenes look at the Los Angeles Philharmonic Orchestra as it prepares to perform Ravel''s "Bolero." Individual musicians offer their thoughts as workers set up chairs and music stands; there are also comments by conductor Zubin Mehta and scenes of Mehta and the orchestra rehearsing. The rest of the film features a complete performance of "Bolero" with striking images of the orchestra as the music relentlessly approaches its climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f99y4mRTdBHSlvDTvJzFOpeIUne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243375'),
  ('94871440811975710', 'The Bone Breakers', 2022, 'Drama', 'Vincenzo Pirrotta, Daniele Ciprì, Mirko Genduso', 'Vincenzo Pirrotta, Ignazio Rosato, Salvatore Ficarra', 'Vincenzo Pirrotta, Selene Caramazza, Antonino Bruschetta, Giovanni Calcagno, Luigi Lo Cascio, Filippo Luna, Aurora Quattrocchi, Maziar Firouzi', null, 'Inside a warehouse in Palermo, a group of people smashes a man’s arm to pieces with a wheelie bag packed with weights. This is the method used by an amateur criminal organization that fractures the limbs of its willing victims before staging fake accidents and raking in the insurance payouts. Vincenzo recruits the individuals from among the down-and-outs that haunt the city streets, where Luisa is a habitué, since she gets her crack there. Vincenzo’s problems suddenly get worse, though, after a series of mistakes shut him out of the gang, and Luisa is now his only chance: he convinces her to have her bones broken.', 'Inside a warehouse in Palermo, a group of people smashes a man’s arm to pieces with a wheelie bag packed with weights. This is the method used by an amateur criminal organization that fractures the limbs of its willing victims before staging fake accidents and raking in the insurance payouts. Vincenzo recruits the individuals from among the down-and-outs that haunt the city streets, where Luisa is a habitué, since she gets her crack there. Vincenzo’s problems suddenly get worse, though, after a series of mistakes shut him out of the gang, and Luisa is now his only chance: he convinces her to have her bones broken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKO1f92mY2ckADAhlCaanvqNIQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938858'),
  ('104051860906502148', 'The Bone Collector', 1999, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Dean Semler, Phillip Noyce, Jon Billington', 'Jeremy Iacone', 'Denzel Washington, Angelina Jolie, Queen Latifah, Michael Rooker, Michael McGlone, Luis Guzmán, Leland Orser, John Benjamin Hickey', 'R', 'Lincoln Rhyme was the department''s top homicide detective and leading expert in criminal forensics until an injury left him paralyzed, depressed, and incapable of working. But when a gruesome murder in Manhattan leaves detectives baffled, they call on Rhyme to help solve the mystery. Amelia Donaghy, a rookie cop whose quick thinking preserved a gruesome murder scene, is enlisted by Rhyme to be his on-the-scene forensics expert. With Amelia reluctantly acting as Rhyme''s able-bodied go-between, the pair piece together cryptic clues the killer leaves behind at the scene of the crime, hoping to catch the grisly serial killer.', 'Lincoln Rhyme was the department''s top homicide detective and leading expert in criminal forensics until an injury left him paralyzed, depressed, and incapable of working. But when a gruesome murder in Manhattan leaves detectives baffled, they call on Rhyme to help solve the mystery. Amelia Donaghy, a rookie cop whose quick thinking preserved a gruesome murder scene, is enlisted by Rhyme to be his on-the-scene forensics expert. With Amelia reluctantly acting as Rhyme''s able-bodied go-between, the pair piece together cryptic clues the killer leaves behind at the scene of the crime, hoping to catch the grisly serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7atMCqRaDpAOnGsteTRm17zmvN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9481'),
  ('803432620832522723', 'The Bone Man', 2009, 'Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Wolfgang Murnberger, Peter von Haller', 'Wolf Haas', 'Josef Hader, Josef Bierbichler, Birgit Minichmayr, Christoph Luser, Pia Hierzegger, Simon Schwarz, Dorka Gryllus, Stipe Erceg', null, 'Set in a sleepy Austrian mountain village, ex-detective Simon Brenner has grown weary of his job repossessing cars and embarks on an extended getaway to the countryside. But before long he becomes embroiled in the convoluted world of the locals of a supposedly quiet town.', 'Set in a sleepy Austrian mountain village, ex-detective Simon Brenner has grown weary of his job repossessing cars and embarks on an extended getaway to the countryside. But before long he becomes embroiled in the convoluted world of the locals of a supposedly quiet town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o17Qj2gT4HkU83kU6IlCH2k6jVU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21467'),
  ('587075821086994037', 'The Bone Snatcher', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jason Wulfsohn, Andreas Poulsson, Gabriel Williams', 'Malcolm Kohll, Gordon Render', 'Scott Bairstow, Rachel Shelley, Warrick Grier, Patrick Shai, Andre Weideman, Adrienne Pearce, Patrick Lyster, Brian Claxton Payne', 'R', 'After miners disappear in the Namib Desert, some scientists find their remains and the demonic creature that killed them.', 'After miners disappear in the Namib Desert, some scientists find their remains and the demonic creature that killed them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kceAJpK27zaE2IdXU1iIzUHZcIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22451'),
  ('57915296019686140', 'The Bones', 2023, 'Animation, Horror', 'Cristóbal León, Joaquín Cociña, Joaquín Cociña', 'Cristóbal León, Joaquín Cociña', null, null, 'Using human corpses and invoking the spirits of two damned Secretaries of State, a girl performs a ritual to free the kingdom of Chile from its feudal heritage.', 'Using human corpses and invoking the spirits of two damned Secretaries of State, a girl performs a ritual to free the kingdom of Chile from its feudal heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZxkv8aMaC6B6XeqYWXMXM5HojF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848553'),
  ('1045193320903859798', 'The Boneyard', 1991, 'Horror, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Phil Smoot, Mike Allen, Karen F. Hoyson', 'James Cummins', 'Ed Nelson, Deborah Rose, Norman Fell, James Eustermann, Denise Young, Willie Stratford, Phyllis Diller, Robert Yun Ju Ahn', 'R', 'Children turned into zombies wreak havoc in a coroner''s building with just a burned-out psychic, an experienced cop and two coroners to stop the madness.', 'Children turned into zombies wreak havoc in a coroner''s building with just a burned-out psychic, an experienced cop and two coroners to stop the madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WlAP1kenMpYFjlushv17kJGpGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58864'),
  ('424423157935508378', 'The Bonfire of the Vanities', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vilmos Zsigmond, Brian De Palma, Eric Schwab', 'Michael Cristofer', 'Tom Hanks, Bruce Willis, Melanie Griffith, Kim Cattrall, Saul Rubinek, Morgan Freeman, John Hancock, Kevin Dunn', 'R', 'After his mistress runs over a black teen, a Wall Street hotshot sees his life unravel in the spotlight; A down-and-out reporter breaks the story and opportunists clamber to use it to their advantage.', 'After his mistress runs over a black teen, a Wall Street hotshot sees his life unravel in the spotlight; A down-and-out reporter breaks the story and opportunists clamber to use it to their advantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdrPrygZ5dVKi8UxrUXMmq1k2iO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9586'),
  ('120912834026562264', 'The Bonus', 1974, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Sergey Mikaelyan, Vladimir Chumak, V. Tomakh', 'Aleksandr Gelman', 'Evgeni Leonov, Vladimir Samoylov, Oleg Yankovskiy, Mikhail Gluzskiy, Nina Urgant, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Viktor Sergachyov, Leonid Dyachkov', null, 'A small construction team led by Potapov suddenly refuses to receive a bonus payment from their company for exceeding performance targets. The team accuses its construction company HQ with artificially reducing the targets, so they can be easily exceeded. It makes the management looks good, yet leads to frequent downtime reducing earnings for common construction workers even with fake bonuses. On a hastily organized meeting the management tries to subdue the "unruly" gang leader charging that he cannot know all details. It turned out that Potapov and his team prepared a detailed business analysis, which proved their point. Managers, who had different interests and positions, have to decide how to deal with the real problem leading to unexpected results.', 'A small construction team led by Potapov suddenly refuses to receive a bonus payment from their company for exceeding performance targets. The team accuses its construction company HQ with artificially reducing the targets, so they can be easily exceeded. It makes the management looks good, yet leads to frequent downtime reducing earnings for common construction workers even with fake bonuses. On a hastily organized meeting the management tries to subdue the "unruly" gang leader charging that he cannot know all details. It turned out that Potapov and his team prepared a detailed business analysis, which proved their point. Managers, who had different interests and positions, have to decide how to deal with the real problem leading to unexpected results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQsAzLkzYfoAsvNYZ4UsEsBcKoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275054'),
  ('230507493735326018', 'The Boob', 1926, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, William H. Daniels', 'Kenneth B. Clarke', 'George K. Arthur, Gertrude Olmstead, Joan Crawford, Charles Murray, Tony D''Algy, Hank Mann, Edythe Chapman, Babe London', null, 'To impress the girl he loves, a naive country boy tries to capture a group of local bootleggers.', 'To impress the girl he loves, a naive country boy tries to capture a group of local bootleggers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggwiNvHR4hLjyCXPh8tV18WsTx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172913'),
  ('880807698244380272', 'The Boogens', 1981, 'Horror', 'James L. Conway, Paul Hipp', 'David O''Malley, Jim Kouf', 'Rebecca Balding, Fred McCarren, Anne-Marie Martin, Jeff Harlan, John Crawford, Med Flory, Jon Lormer, Peg Stewart', 'R', 'Otherworldly creatures inhabit the bootlegging tunnels underneath a small town mining community, and they kill any of the townsfolk who invade their home.', 'Otherworldly creatures inhabit the bootlegging tunnels underneath a small town mining community, and they kill any of the townsfolk who invade their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWjxVVDBOm6WiOO7cmYChwHdl0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33721'),
  ('830489484669034078', 'The Boogey Man', 1980, 'Horror', 'Ulli Lommel, Jochen Breitenstein, David Sperling', 'Ulli Lommel', 'Suzanna Love, Ron James, John Carradine, Nicholas Love, Raymond Boyden, Felicite Morgan, Bill Rayburn, Llewelyn Thomas', 'R', 'A young girl witnesses the brutal murder of her stepfather at the hands of her brother, by mirror reflection. Years later, when the mirror is accidentally shattered, a dark and vengeful curse is unleashed on the family, and anyone unlucky enough to come into contact with its shards falls victim to heinous murder.', 'A young girl witnesses the brutal murder of her stepfather at the hands of her brother, by mirror reflection. Years later, when the mirror is accidentally shattered, a dark and vengeful curse is unleashed on the family, and anyone unlucky enough to come into contact with its shards falls victim to heinous murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRX5TYYtwrMYWhKLFPQAIxzx8lb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40220'),
  ('679649484248738782', 'The Boogeyman', 1982, 'Horror', 'Jeff Schiro, Douglas Meltzer', 'Jeff Schiro', 'Michael Earl Reid, Bert Linder, Terence Brady, Mindy Silverman, Jerome Bynder, Bobby Perichetti, Michael D''Agostino, Nancy Lindeberg', null, 'Lester Billing''s children are dying one by one. Prepare for a nightmarish journey into the dark side of one man''s psyche; the side where fear can take over, reason can be lost and sanity can crumble.', 'Lester Billing''s children are dying one by one. Prepare for a nightmarish journey into the dark side of one man''s psyche; the side where fear can take over, reason can be lost and sanity can crumble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdhhVFFPpNyj1vM1T4K2XAcTORb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129295'),
  ('169059067765109268', 'The Boogeyman', 2023, 'Horror', 'Rob Savage, Eli Born, Colin MacLellan', 'Mark Heyman, Scott Beck, Bryan Woods', 'Sophie Thatcher, Vivien Lyra Blair, Chris Messina, David Dastmalchian, Marin Ireland, Madison Hu, Maddie Nichols, Mabel Tyler', 'PG-13', 'Still reeling from the tragic death of their mother, a teenage girl and her younger sister find themselves plagued by a sadistic presence in their house and struggle to get their grieving father to pay attention before it’s too late.', 'Still reeling from the tragic death of their mother, a teenage girl and her younger sister find themselves plagued by a sadistic presence in their house and struggle to get their grieving father to pay attention before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYwZdnXVnVxAr7dx4MEK7tTK9gI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532408'),
  ('838580854531635938', 'The Boogeyman: Origins', 2023, 'Horror, Adventure', 'Ángel Gómez Hernández, Javier Salmones, Eduardo Esquide', 'Juma Fodde', 'Javier Botet, Macarena Gómez, Lucas Blas, Manolo Solo, Iván Renedo, Claudia Placer, Lorca Gutiérrez Prada, Carla Tous', null, 'Explores the Spanish origins of the character''s story, where he is a tuberculosis patient from Almeria who will do anything to get well, even consuming the blood of the kids he kidnaps in a sack.', 'Explores the Spanish origins of the character''s story, where he is a tuberculosis patient from Almeria who will do anything to get well, even consuming the blood of the kids he kidnaps in a sack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiDAMciJ9BmBwNBvAsZPHyzEtGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145851'),
  ('605577146277385075', 'The Boogie Man Will Get You', 1942, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Lew Landers, Morris Stoloff, Henry Freulich', 'Edwin Blum', 'Boris Karloff, Peter Lorre, Maxie Rosenbloom, Jeff Donnell, Larry Parks, Maude Eburne, Don Beddoe, George McKay', 'NR', 'A young divorcee tries to convert a historic house into a hotel despite its oddball inhabitants and dead bodies in the cellar.', 'A young divorcee tries to convert a historic house into a hotel despite its oddball inhabitants and dead bodies in the cellar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iu3YiWGa9pYYBun3VukwyvYdSQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30342'),
  ('245233056033358089', 'The Book', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bernardo Hernández, Gerardo Diego García', 'Fran J. Marber', 'Nahia Laiz, Abdelatif Hwidar, Miguel Ramiro, Celina Ruiz, Moncha Molina', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlOWxBek4G7Jw52ZBuCKzy4RlKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1380998'),
  ('599684602846227259', 'The Book of Clarence', 2024, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Jeymes Samuel, Laura Garetti, Paolo Giacomo Marino', 'Jeymes Samuel', 'LaKeith Stanfield, Omar Sy, RJ Cyler, David Oyelowo, Alfre Woodard, Teyana Taylor, Caleb McLaughlin, James McAvoy', 'PG-13', 'Streetwise but down-on-his-luck, Clarence is struggling to find a better life for his family, while fighting to free himself of debt. Captivated by the power and glory of the rising Messiah and His apostles, he risks everything to carve his own path to a divine life, and ultimately discovers that the redemptive power of belief may be his only way out.', 'Streetwise but down-on-his-luck, Clarence is struggling to find a better life for his family, while fighting to free himself of debt. Captivated by the power and glory of the rising Messiah and His apostles, he risks everything to carve his own path to a divine life, and ultimately discovers that the redemptive power of belief may be his only way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZuq34U1dWuIIWgTa6wZNPeDinS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976584'),
  ('77452973667818743', 'The Book of Daniel', 2013, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Anna Zielinski, Ricardo Jacques Gale', 'Chuck Konzelman, Cary Solomon', 'Robert Miano, Andrew Bongiorno, Lance Henriksen, Kevin McCorkle, Rolf Saxon, Peter Kluge, Liam Matthews, Ben Maccabee', 'G', 'Taken into slavery after the fall of Jerusalem in 605 B.C., Daniel is forced to serve the most powerful king in the world, King Nebuchadnezzar. Faced with imminent death, Daniel proves himself a trusted Advisor and is placed among the king''s wise men. Threatened by death at every turn Daniel never ceases to serve the king until he is forced to choose between serving the king or honoring God. With his life at stake, Daniel has nothing but his faith to stand between him and the lions'' den.', 'Taken into slavery after the fall of Jerusalem in 605 B.C., Daniel is forced to serve the most powerful king in the world, King Nebuchadnezzar. Faced with imminent death, Daniel proves himself a trusted Advisor and is placed among the king''s wise men. Threatened by death at every turn Daniel never ceases to serve the king until he is forced to choose between serving the king or honoring God. With his life at stake, Daniel has nothing but his faith to stand between him and the lions'' den.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yk8xDUbvnJIElgnkW3YZ3eAwiLO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227859'),
  ('485249796013827509', 'The Book of Eli', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Paul Schneider, Allen Hughes, Don Burgess', 'Gary Whitta', 'Denzel Washington, Gary Oldman, Mila Kunis, Ray Stevenson, Jennifer Beals, Michael Gambon, Tom Waits, Frances de la Tour', 'R', 'A post-apocalyptic tale, in which a lone man fights his way across America in order to protect a sacred book that holds the secrets to saving humankind.', 'A post-apocalyptic tale, in which a lone man fights his way across America in order to protect a sacred book that holds the secrets to saving humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1H1y9ZiqNFaLgQiRDDZLA55PviW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20504'),
  ('593824618518238447', 'The Book of Fish', 2021, 'History, Drama', 'Lee Joon-ik, Lee Eui-tae, Yoo Huck-jun', 'Kim Se-gyeom', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Byun Yo-han, Lee Jung-eun, Min Do-hee, Cha Soon-bae, Kang Ki-young, Ryu Seung-ryong, Jo Woo-jin', null, 'When the scholar Jeong Yak-jeon is exiled to Heuksando Island during the Catholic Persecution of 1801, he decides to write a fish-based encyclopaedia.', 'When the scholar Jeong Yak-jeon is exiled to Heuksando Island during the Catholic Persecution of 1801, he decides to write a fish-based encyclopaedia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTIULfN1xR0j7weyTD35kIy3RMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581390'),
