  ('191336285479081623', 'The Book of Henry', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Colin Trevorrow, John Schwartzman, Peter Thorell', 'Gregg Hurwitz', 'Naomi Watts, Jaeden Martell, Jacob Tremblay, Sarah Silverman, Lee Pace, Maddie Ziegler, Dean Norris, Bobby Moynihan', 'PG-13', 'Susan, a single mother of two, works as a waitress in a small town. Her son, Henry, is an 11-year-old genius who not only manages the family finances but acts as emotional support for his mother and younger brother. When Henry discovers that the girl next door has a terrible secret, he implores Susan to take matters into her own hands.', 'Susan, a single mother of two, works as a waitress in a small town. Her son, Henry, is an 11-year-old genius who not only manages the family finances but acts as emotional support for his mother and younger brother. When Henry discovers that the girl next door has a terrible secret, he implores Susan to take matters into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suLFg4UjvM5BoDipg2Wu3gZ802T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382614'),
  ('602558103270999488', 'The Book of Life', 1998, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Hal Hartley, Jim Denault, Richard Greenberg', 'Hal Hartley', 'Martin Donovan, PJ Harvey, Dave Simonds, Thomas Jay Ryan, Miho Nikaido, D.J. Mendel, Katreen Hardt, James Urbaniak', null, 'New Year''s Eve takes on new meaning when the Devil, Jesus Christ, and Christ''s assistant Magdalena discuss and debate the End of the World.', 'New Year''s Eve takes on new meaning when the Devil, Jesus Christ, and Christ''s assistant Magdalena discuss and debate the End of the World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/802XKT8qeUP4QLQgrbixgF9qLai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23522'),
  ('965292805563231159', 'The Book of Life', 2014, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Jorge R. Gutierrez', 'Jorge R. Gutierrez, Doug Langdale', 'Diego Luna, Channing Tatum, Zoe Saldaña, Christina Applegate, Eugenio Derbez, Cheech Marin, Gabriel Iglesias, Ron Perlman', 'PG', 'The journey of Manolo, a young man who is torn between fulfilling the expectations of his family and following his heart. Before choosing which path to follow, he embarks on an incredible adventure that spans fantastical worlds where he must face his greatest fears.', 'The journey of Manolo, a young man who is torn between fulfilling the expectations of his family and following his heart. Before choosing which path to follow, he embarks on an incredible adventure that spans fantastical worlds where he must face his greatest fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aotTZos5KswgCryEzx2rlOjFsm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228326'),
  ('569975033398623410', 'The Book of Love', 2017, 'Drama', 'Bill Purple, J. Michael Muro', 'Robbie Pickering, Bill Purple', 'Jason Sudeikis, Maisie Williams, Jessica Biel, Mary Steenburgen, Orlando Jones, Paul Reiser, Joshua Mikel, Jayson Warner Smith', 'PG-13', 'After tragedy strikes Henry and Penny, he befriends a tenacious young girl and discovers she is constructing a raft to sail across the Atlantic to find her lost father. Together, along with some unlikely friends, they set forth to construct the vessel and subsequently rebuild their lives.', 'After tragedy strikes Henry and Penny, he befriends a tenacious young girl and discovers she is constructing a raft to sail across the Atlantic to find her lost father. Together, along with some unlikely friends, they set forth to construct the vessel and subsequently rebuild their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TnGRaxeNPA82FGOEwunZTUivu0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352885'),
  ('588200153557545737', 'The Book of Mary', 1985, 'Drama', 'Anne-Marie Miéville, Jean-Bernard Menoud, Marie-Christine Barrière', 'Anne-Marie Miéville', 'Bruno Cremer, Aurore Clément, Rebecca Hampton, Copi, Valentine Mercier, Cléa Rédalier', null, 'Anne-Marie Miéville, frequent collaborator of Jean-Luc Godard, made this partner piece to Godard''s own ''Je vous salue, Marie''. Marie, eleven years old, is experiencing difficult times. Her parents will separate. The perception of her universe is profoundly disturbed. This exacting portrait of a child immersed in her books, music and dancing casts a dispassionate yet touching eye on the girl''s reaction to the new upheaval in her life.', 'Anne-Marie Miéville, frequent collaborator of Jean-Luc Godard, made this partner piece to Godard''s own ''Je vous salue, Marie''. Marie, eleven years old, is experiencing difficult times. Her parents will separate. The perception of her universe is profoundly disturbed. This exacting portrait of a child immersed in her books, music and dancing casts a dispassionate yet touching eye on the girl''s reaction to the new upheaval in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbKivIYJUNko3bezlQoYUULH3vk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213115'),
  ('732087581498818291', 'The Book of Masters', 2009, 'Fantasy', 'Vadim Sokolovsky, Vitaliy Kruglikov, Natalya Krimenskaya', 'Vadim Sokolovsky, Anna Starobinets', 'Mariya Andreeva, Maksim Loktionov, Liya Akhedzhakova, Leonid Kuravlyov, Artur Smolyaninov, Irina Apeksimova, Olga Aroseva, Valentin Gaft', null, 'A beautiful and kind girl, daughter of Baba Yaga, finds a magical stone Alatyr while walking in a field. It transforms her heart into a stone and puts her under a queer curse. She is to be the evil Countess of Stones and live in a stone tower. If the greatest gem-cutter in the world brings the stone of Alatyr to life, though, she''ll become the ruler of the world. The Stone Countess, now cruel and selfish, is fascinated with the idea. She starts searching for the best gem-cutters and forces them to work with Alatyr, so the magical stone would become a living thing. Neither of the gem-cutters succeeds, so she kills them. While being imprisoned in her tower, they work on a large book about the secrets of gem-cutting. Each of them edits the book, so it''s later named "the Book of Masters".', 'A beautiful and kind girl, daughter of Baba Yaga, finds a magical stone Alatyr while walking in a field. It transforms her heart into a stone and puts her under a queer curse. She is to be the evil Countess of Stones and live in a stone tower. If the greatest gem-cutter in the world brings the stone of Alatyr to life, though, she''ll become the ruler of the world. The Stone Countess, now cruel and selfish, is fascinated with the idea. She starts searching for the best gem-cutters and forces them to work with Alatyr, so the magical stone would become a living thing. Neither of the gem-cutters succeeds, so she kills them. While being imprisoned in her tower, they work on a large book about the secrets of gem-cutting. Each of them edits the book, so it''s later named "the Book of Masters".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXJQeTE7sevnJ0OnLxiOVI8kAe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25805'),
  ('190337607525256347', 'The Book of Revelation', 2006, 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Ana Kokkinos, Tristan Milani, Phil Jones', 'Andrew Bovell', 'Tom Long, Greta Scacchi, Colin Friels, Anna Torv, Deborah Mailman, Zoe Coyle, Zoe Naylor, Odette Joannidis', 'NR', 'An erotic mystery about power and sex, the entanglement of victim and perpetrator, and a man''s struggle to regain his lost self.', 'An erotic mystery about power and sex, the entanglement of victim and perpetrator, and a man''s struggle to regain his lost self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aE0ZjITXuqjn02JfRVS2J6tfgKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44440'),
  ('801710308105040797', 'The Book of Solutions', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Laurent Brunet, Michel Gondry, Basile Jullien', 'Michel Gondry', 'Pierre Niney, Blanche Gardin, Françoise Lebrun, Frankie Wallach, Camille Rutherford, Mourad Boudaoud, Vincent Elbaz, Dominique Valadié', null, 'Marc, a bipolar and paranoid filmmaker, cannot tolerate seeing his current project picked apart by his producers. The clips he’s been able to sneak a look at lead him to fear the worst. With his editor as an accomplice, he manages to spirit away the rushes to his aunt’s place in the Cévennes, to finish the film as he envisions it. Instead, its completion is constantly postponed, as he creates endless diversions and impasses, which alternate between the comic and the downright disturbing.', 'Marc, a bipolar and paranoid filmmaker, cannot tolerate seeing his current project picked apart by his producers. The clips he’s been able to sneak a look at lead him to fear the worst. With his editor as an accomplice, he manages to spirit away the rushes to his aunt’s place in the Cévennes, to finish the film as he envisions it. Instead, its completion is constantly postponed, as he creates endless diversions and impasses, which alternate between the comic and the downright disturbing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ljGxJuIB7PVnvtEFiNSVRnfXch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888003'),
  ('881700426407414698', 'The Book of Stars', 1999, 'Drama', 'Michael Miner, James Whitaker', 'Tasca Shadix', 'Mary Stuart Masterson, Jena Malone, Karl Geary, Delroy Lindo, John Considine, Bob Morrisey, D. B. Sweeney', 'PG-13', 'An emotionally crippled woman (Mary Stuart Masterson) turns to prostitution to help care for her sister (Jena Malone), who has cystic fibrosis.', 'An emotionally crippled woman (Mary Stuart Masterson) turns to prostitution to help care for her sister (Jena Malone), who has cystic fibrosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFENT62A46UcwmzxT6rYd3CXn7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113137'),
  ('1034875334139130694', 'The Book of Stone', 1969, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada, Ignacio Torres', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada', 'Marga López, Joaquín Cordero, Norma Lazareno, Aldo Monti, Lucy Buj, Rafael Llamas, Ada Carrasco, Lilia Castillo', null, 'Julia, a governess, comes to work for a bourgeois family that lives in a forested property they have recently bought. Julia is to take care of a little girl named Silvia, whose unusual demeanor may find its roots in the family garden.', 'Julia, a governess, comes to work for a bourgeois family that lives in a forested property they have recently bought. Julia is to take care of a little girl named Silvia, whose unusual demeanor may find its roots in the family garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfx0gPzmECyZg1z39wl6MR74Ke1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68632'),
  ('545889028105390645', 'The Book of Stone', 2009, 'Horror', 'Julio César Estrada', 'Gustavo Moheno', 'Ludwika Paleta, Evangelina Sosa, Miguel Couturier, Plutarco Haza, Marta Aura', null, 'Julieta is a young child psychologist hired by millionaire Eugenio Ruvalcaba, to work with his only daughter, Sylvia, who has severe emotional problems, while staying in their isolated island mansion. Once there, she finds out there''s much more to Sylvia''s imaginary friend than what everybody knows... and the results can be horrifying... Remake of Carlos Enrique Taboada''s classic film from 1969.', 'Julieta is a young child psychologist hired by millionaire Eugenio Ruvalcaba, to work with his only daughter, Sylvia, who has severe emotional problems, while staying in their isolated island mansion. Once there, she finds out there''s much more to Sylvia''s imaginary friend than what everybody knows... and the results can be horrifying... Remake of Carlos Enrique Taboada''s classic film from 1969.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7at1BvpGMX54oBMgAADUmRrO5IP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154209'),
  ('303511099861914314', 'The Book of Sun', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Amr Ammari, Faris Godus', 'Hani Kadour, Sohayb Godus, Faris Godus', 'Baraa Alem, Sohayb Godus, Nadia Malaika, Faris Godus, Ismail Alhassan, Ahmed Al-Saddam, Nawaf Alshubaili', null, 'In 2010, at the peak of the Saudi YouTube movement, high school senior Husam finds himself drawn into the world of video production. He’s joined in his pursuit by his best friend Maan, their one-time foe Ibrahim, and Orabi a teacher with a passion for filmmaking. In the middle of their senior year, they set out to produce a no-budget horror movie – a wild adventure that will put their futures at risk.', 'In 2010, at the peak of the Saudi YouTube movement, high school senior Husam finds himself drawn into the world of video production. He’s joined in his pursuit by his best friend Maan, their one-time foe Ibrahim, and Orabi a teacher with a passion for filmmaking. In the middle of their senior year, they set out to produce a no-budget horror movie – a wild adventure that will put their futures at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMKYcZ9HT3Lvkm26uqHBfY3zi4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674642'),
  ('918126502900836945', 'The Book Of Vision', 2021, 'Drama, History, Mystery', 'Carlo Shalom Hintermann, Paola Bonsembiante, Kevin Dardenne', 'Carlo Shalom Hintermann, Marco Saura', 'Lotte Verbeek, Charles Dance, Sverrir Gudnason, Isolda Dychauk-Ott, Filippo Nigro, Vera Filatova, Giselda Volodi, Marco Quaglia', null, 'Eva, a mysterious doctor, searches for an answer to her urgent dilemma as she unravels Dr. Anmuth''s Book of Vision. Henry gets involved in her life and is forced to confront his own nature, as Eva faces the biggest decision of her life.', 'Eva, a mysterious doctor, searches for an answer to her urgent dilemma as she unravels Dr. Anmuth''s Book of Vision. Henry gets involved in her life and is forced to confront his own nature, as Eva faces the biggest decision of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wK3utfBLqkKV7rS0tssOw8xwZvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498587'),
  ('254037949961429456', 'The Book of Wonders', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lucie Wagner, Michaël Ben Hammouda, Lisa Azuelos', 'Juliette Sales, Fabien Suarez, Fabien Suarez', 'Alexandra Lamy, Muriel Robin, Hugo Questel, Xavier Lacaille, Martine Schambacher, Hiroki Hasegawa, Carima Amarouche, Eye Haïdara', null, 'This is the crazy bet of a mother ready to do anything to help her 12-year-old son, Louis, wake up from his coma. After Louis'' accident, Thelma decides to do for him the "10 things to do before the end of the world" that he had written in his diary. By listening to these adventures, Louis will see how beautiful life is and that he must come back! By fulfilling a teenager''s dreams at the age of forty, Thelma will experience an incredible journey that will take her farther than she ever imagined.', 'This is the crazy bet of a mother ready to do anything to help her 12-year-old son, Louis, wake up from his coma. After Louis'' accident, Thelma decides to do for him the "10 things to do before the end of the world" that he had written in his diary. By listening to these adventures, Louis will see how beautiful life is and that he must come back! By fulfilling a teenager''s dreams at the age of forty, Thelma will experience an incredible journey that will take her farther than she ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SaKR9IeVbRjahq6WtoyYmB8hAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890203'),
  ('26192821242840982', 'The Book Thief', 2013, 'Drama', 'Brian Percival, Florian Ballhaus, Esther Schreiner', 'Michael Petroni', 'Geoffrey Rush, Sophie Nélisse, Emily Watson, Nico Liersch, Ben Schnetzer, Heike Makatsch, Barbara Auer, Roger Allam', 'PG-13', 'While subjected to the horrors of WWII Germany, young Liesel finds solace by stealing books and sharing them with others. Under the stairs in her home, a Jewish refugee is being sheltered by her adoptive parents.', 'While subjected to the horrors of WWII Germany, young Liesel finds solace by stealing books and sharing them with others. Under the stairs in her home, a Jewish refugee is being sheltered by her adoptive parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wj4U5sMLcJMa3WR9CpRR9e2sdgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203833'),
  ('707372648131816964', 'The Booksellers', 2020, 'Documentary', 'D.W. Young, Peter Bolte', null, 'Parker Posey, Fran Lebowitz, Gay Talese, Susan Benne, David Bergman', 'PG', 'What once seemed like an esoteric world now seems essential to our culture: the community of rare book dealers and collectors who, in their love of the delicacy and tactility of books, are helping to keep the printed word alive. D.W. Young’s elegant and entertaining documentary, executive produced by Parker Posey, is a lively tour of New York’s book world, past and present, from the Park Avenue Armory’s annual Antiquarian Book Fair, where original editions can fetch hundreds of thousands of dollars; to the Strand and Argosy book stores, still standing against all odds; to the beautifully crammed apartments of collectors and buyers. The film features a litany of special guests, including Fran Lebowitz, Susan Orlean, Gay Talese, and a community of dedicated book dealers who strongly believe in the wonder of the object and the everlasting importance of what’s inside.', 'What once seemed like an esoteric world now seems essential to our culture: the community of rare book dealers and collectors who, in their love of the delicacy and tactility of books, are helping to keep the printed word alive. D.W. Young’s elegant and entertaining documentary, executive produced by Parker Posey, is a lively tour of New York’s book world, past and present, from the Park Avenue Armory’s annual Antiquarian Book Fair, where original editions can fetch hundreds of thousands of dollars; to the Strand and Argosy book stores, still standing against all odds; to the beautifully crammed apartments of collectors and buyers. The film features a litany of special guests, including Fran Lebowitz, Susan Orlean, Gay Talese, and a community of dedicated book dealers who strongly believe in the wonder of the object and the everlasting importance of what’s inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGi8ZCxoy0z7yO4ByT5hAksmErK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629704'),
  ('764903945912224882', 'The Bookshop', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jean-Claude Larrieu, Isabel Coixet', 'Isabel Coixet', 'Emily Mortimer, Bill Nighy, Patricia Clarkson, James Lance, Hunter Tremayne, Honor Kneafsey, Frances Barber, Reg Wilson', null, 'Set in a small English town in 1959, a woman decides, against polite but ruthless local opposition, to open a bookshop, a decision which becomes a political minefield.', 'Set in a small English town in 1959, a woman decides, against polite but ruthless local opposition, to open a bookshop, a decision which becomes a political minefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nh2ZpwuTKjY0tTGcsGu7TwOpT4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444539'),
  ('624021258574308560', 'The Boom', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Vittorio De Sica, Beppe Menegatti, Luisa Alessandri', 'Cesare Zavattini', 'Alberto Sordi, Gianna Maria Canale, Ettore Geri, Elena Nicolai, Mariolina Bovo, Gloria Cervi, Sandra Verani, Sandro Merli', null, 'Sweet-sour comedy on Italy''s 1950s rage to get rich as fast as possible! The businessman wants to satisfy his wife''s craving for luxury and a "respectable life" so he becomes heavily indebted. In desperation he agrees to sell a precious part of his body for a large sum of money. But just before the crucial operation he panics...', 'Sweet-sour comedy on Italy''s 1950s rage to get rich as fast as possible! The businessman wants to satisfy his wife''s craving for luxury and a "respectable life" so he becomes heavily indebted. In desperation he agrees to sell a precious part of his body for a large sum of money. But just before the crucial operation he panics...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osvbQlIPhIEAVT7kHy1govIZEH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81831'),
  ('67659516821784749', 'The Boondock Saints', 1999, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Anthony Tedesco, Rose Tedesco, Adam Kane', 'Troy Duffy', 'Willem Dafoe, Sean Patrick Flanery, Norman Reedus, David Della Rocco, Billy Connolly, Bob Marley, Brian Mahoney, Gerard Parkes', 'R', 'Tired of the crime overrunning the streets of Boston, Irish Catholic twin brothers Conner and Murphy are inspired by their faith to cleanse their hometown of evil with their own brand of zealous vigilante justice. As they hunt down and kill one notorious gangster after another, they become controversial folk heroes in the community. But Paul Smecker, an eccentric FBI agent, is fast closing in on their blood-soaked trail.', 'Tired of the crime overrunning the streets of Boston, Irish Catholic twin brothers Conner and Murphy are inspired by their faith to cleanse their hometown of evil with their own brand of zealous vigilante justice. As they hunt down and kill one notorious gangster after another, they become controversial folk heroes in the community. But Paul Smecker, an eccentric FBI agent, is fast closing in on their blood-soaked trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtLUmkWg41xFLpvmUWAN1mm65f6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8374'),
  ('955912157296395323', 'The Boondock Saints II: All Saints Day', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Troy Duffy, Mirosław Baszak', 'Troy Duffy', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Norman Reedus, Clifton Collins Jr., Julie Benz, Judd Nelson, Bob Marley, Brian Mahoney, David Ferry', 'R', 'Skillfully framed by an unknown enemy for the murder of a priest, wanted vigilante MacManus brothers Murphy and Connor must come out of hiding on a sheep farm in Ireland to fight for justice in Boston.', 'Skillfully framed by an unknown enemy for the murder of a priest, wanted vigilante MacManus brothers Murphy and Connor must come out of hiding on a sheep farm in Ireland to fight for justice in Boston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFHtFInp3tYIBxkwWMfNJf1RBZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22821'),
  ('977809471166375203', 'The Boost', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harold Becker, Howard Atherton', 'Darryl Ponicsan', 'James Woods, Sean Young, John Kapelos, Steven Hill, Kelle Kerr, John Rothman, Amanda Blake, Grace Zabriskie', 'R', 'Lenny Brown moves to California to find his fortune in tax shelter investments. When the federal government changes the tax laws, poor Lenny finds himself $700,000 in hock with nowhere to turn. His friend, Joel, introduces him to cocaine to give Lenny that needed "boost". What ensues next is a descent into drug addiction and insanity as Lenny tries to regain control of his life, all the while needing that extra "boost".', 'Lenny Brown moves to California to find his fortune in tax shelter investments. When the federal government changes the tax laws, poor Lenny finds himself $700,000 in hock with nowhere to turn. His friend, Joel, introduces him to cocaine to give Lenny that needed "boost". What ensues next is a descent into drug addiction and insanity as Lenny tries to regain control of his life, all the while needing that extra "boost".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZnPXPXBEcW4sKOqjNuDs1PemUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94440'),
  ('811561899024297556', 'The Booth', 2005, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Nouaki Sasaki, Akihiro Kawamura, Yoshihiro Nakamura', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura', 'Ryuta Sato, Hijiri Kojima, Mansaku Ikeuchi, Makoto Ashikawa, Maiko Asano, Masaki Miura, Seiko Iwaido, Matomu Onda', null, 'Shogo, the arrogant and condescending star of a popular call-in radio-show must temporarily broadcast out of Studio 6, a creepy and dilapidated booth abandoned since its last DJ committed suicide several years ago. Suddenly, Shogo begins receiving disturbing calls, the voice on the line whispers "Liar" over and over. Is the joke on him, has someone discovered the truth about his sinister past, or has the curse of Studio 6 been unleashed again? In this Booth, all sins will be atoned for.', 'Shogo, the arrogant and condescending star of a popular call-in radio-show must temporarily broadcast out of Studio 6, a creepy and dilapidated booth abandoned since its last DJ committed suicide several years ago. Suddenly, Shogo begins receiving disturbing calls, the voice on the line whispers "Liar" over and over. Is the joke on him, has someone discovered the truth about his sinister past, or has the curse of Studio 6 been unleashed again? In this Booth, all sins will be atoned for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3B168t6NaokwoHUuS8hCz9LQYib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85393'),
