  ('1138474438557265617', 'The Border', 1980, 'Action', 'Christopher Leitch, José Luis Ortega, John Peter Kousakis', 'Michael Allin', 'Telly Savalas, Danny De La Paz, Eddie Albert, Michael V. Gazzo, Cecilia Camacho, Mary McCusker, Robin Clarke, Herman Blood', null, 'Frank Cooper, a senior immigration police, remains a daily struggle against mafias operating between Mexico and the United States. Although it has a good standing with the poorest of Mexican towns near the border. Two are Leina and Benny, a couple of young boys who have decided to marry and have chosen Frank as best man. The problems are not slow to appear when Suarez, a mobster local forces Benny to work for him in their dirty business. Now, for Frank, the job becomes personal.', 'Frank Cooper, a senior immigration police, remains a daily struggle against mafias operating between Mexico and the United States. Although it has a good standing with the poorest of Mexican towns near the border. Two are Leina and Benny, a couple of young boys who have decided to marry and have chosen Frank as best man. The problems are not slow to appear when Suarez, a mobster local forces Benny to work for him in their dirty business. Now, for Frank, the job becomes personal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAfi5fLGZJLwhlcEwVrW0QnlapS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142960'),
  ('794193405402172522', 'The Border', 1982, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tony Richardson, Ric Waite', 'Walon Green, Deric Washburn, David Freeman', 'Jack Nicholson, Harvey Keitel, Valerie Perrine, Warren Oates, Elpidia Carrillo, Shannon Wilcox, Manuel Viescas, Jeff Morris', 'R', 'A corrupted border agent decides to clean up his act when an impoverished woman''s baby is put up for sale on the black market.', 'A corrupted border agent decides to clean up his act when an impoverished woman''s baby is put up for sale on the black market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73yotjKSU8QCxlhoPm1hATrFHvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22023'),
  ('1001632548655992219', 'The Border', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Lauri Törhönen, Mark Lwoff, Risto Tuominen', 'Aleksi Bardy, Lauri Törhönen', 'Martin Bahne, Tommi Korpela, Minna Haapkylä, Hannu-Pekka Björkman, Leonid Mozgovoy, Pauli Poranen, Roman Schatz, Hannu Kahakorpi', null, 'The young man must set up a clear border between Finland and Russia, white and red, enemy and friend, us and them. While the task seems clear he finds out the execution of his command in concrete situations is very difficult. Right choices turn out to be wrong ones and correcting them make things worse.', 'The young man must set up a clear border between Finland and Russia, white and red, enemy and friend, us and them. While the task seems clear he finds out the execution of his command in concrete situations is very difficult. Right choices turn out to be wrong ones and correcting them make things worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GnqpbNBRunz5kUWbpZtiq97K2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41141'),
  ('90623757151204547', 'The Border Post', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rajko Grlić, Slobodan Trninić', 'Ante Tomić, Rajko Grlić', 'Sergej Trifunović, Toni Gojanović, Verica Nedeska, Bogdan Diklić, Miodrag Fišeković, Emir Hadžihafizbegović, Franjo Dijak, Petar Arsovski', null, 'At a small border-post on the Yugoslav-Albanian border, yet another generation of soldiers suffering the usual amount of boredom awaits the end of their service, counting days to the moment when they should take their uniforms off for good. It is the spring of 1987 and the thought never even crosses their mind that they would, in fact, put them back on quite soon and go to war.', 'At a small border-post on the Yugoslav-Albanian border, yet another generation of soldiers suffering the usual amount of boredom awaits the end of their service, counting days to the moment when they should take their uniforms off for good. It is the spring of 1987 and the thought never even crosses their mind that they would, in fact, put them back on quite soon and go to war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfJ5rIiS8HRSZTJJ2lC2oKsOgSs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33591'),
