  ('605806367856293119', 'The Borgia', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Antonio Hernández, Javier Salmones', 'Piero Bodrato, Antonio Hernández', 'Lluís Homar, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, María Valverde, Paz Vega, Ángela Molina, Katy Louise Saunders, Linda Batista, Francesca Della Ragione', null, 'A portrait of the bloody dynasty that spawned a pope, Alexander VI, as well as the role model for Machiavelli''s “The Prince,” his son Cesare Borgia, and a legend of femme duplicity, daughter Lucrezia Borgia.', 'A portrait of the bloody dynasty that spawned a pope, Alexander VI, as well as the role model for Machiavelli''s “The Prince,” his son Cesare Borgia, and a legend of femme duplicity, daughter Lucrezia Borgia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tutRE6NaS01f5PVCvbiaUygY4va.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15941'),
