  ('764135157810588993', 'The Boss Baby', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Corban Gossett, Ashish Dantu, Jeff Wang', 'Michael McCullers', 'Alec Baldwin, Steve Buscemi, Miles Bakshi, Jimmy Kimmel, Lisa Kudrow, Tobey Maguire, Conrad Vernon, James McGrath', 'PG', 'A story about how a new baby''s arrival impacts a family, told from the point of view of a delightfully unreliable narrator, a wildly imaginative 7 year old named Tim.', 'A story about how a new baby''s arrival impacts a family, told from the point of view of a delightfully unreliable narrator, a wildly imaginative 7 year old named Tim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unPB1iyEeTBcKiLg8W083rlViFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295693'),
  ('1129315899003817969', 'The Boss Baby: Christmas Bonus', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Matt Engstrom, Christo Stamboliev', 'J.D. Ryznar, Tanner Tananbaum, Megan Atkinson', 'JP Karliak, Pierce Gagnon, Amaryllis Aubel, Jodi Benson, Alex Cazares, Kalen Chase, Ray Chase, David W. Collins', 'PG', 'Christmas Eve takes a twisty turn when the Boss Baby accidentally swaps places with one of Santa''s elves and gets stranded at the North Pole.', 'Christmas Eve takes a twisty turn when the Boss Baby accidentally swaps places with one of Santa''s elves and gets stranded at the North Pole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMmMxF6f2OonUrXrHKBLSYAhXly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045944'),
